has it.":"Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hour, once every region has it.","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hours, once every region has it.":"Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hours, once every region has it.","Certificate verifier information":"Certificate verifier information","Certificates ({{total}})":"Certificates ({{total}})","Certificates: {{reason}}":"Certificates: {{reason}}","Change the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. A workload already holding a session keeps it until the session expires.":"Change the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. A workload already holding a session keeps it until the session expires.","Change the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.":"Change the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.","Check again":"Check again","Checking what is attached to this provider":"Checking what is attached to this provider","Choose a condition key":"Choose a condition key","Choose a fact":"Choose a fact","Choose a path and pattern for the names. Start from a default or customize your own.":"Choose a path and pattern for the names. Start from a default or customize your own.","Choose a specific name up front so you can grant it access or match an existing naming convention before the workload runs.":"Choose a specific name up front so you can grant it access or match an existing naming convention before the workload runs.","Choose a stable, unique name that identifies one environment or group of agent