ady expects.":"banana","For mutual TLS, attach a certificate authority":"banana","For token-based services, issue a JWT":"banana",Format:nTt,"from provider":"banana","Generating its key":"banana","Get started":"banana","Getting started":"banana","Give AI agents and workloads their own identities. Know which of them made each call. Scope its access with the IAM policies you already use.":"banana","Give an agent or workload a unique identity, so you can grant it access and audit what it did rather than sharing one role.":"banana","Give your workloads an identity":"banana","Go to the providers list":"banana","Govern who can create resources":"banana","Govern who can create templates referring to this provider":"banana","Grant access":"banana","Grant this name access to resources in IAM policies.":"banana","Greater than":"banana","Greater than or equal":"banana","hour(s)":"banana","How it works":"banana","IAM for agents and workloads":"banana","IAM for agents and workloads (opens in a new tab)":"banana",Identifier:iTt,"Identities ({{total}})":"banana","Identities are issued at runtime from facts the agent or workload proves, rather than from what an admin assigns.":"banana","Identities for agents":"banana","Identities: {{reason}}":"banana",'Identity "{{identityId}}" not found.':"banana","Identity {{name}}: {{reason}}":"banana","Identity format and scope":"banana","Identity name":"banana","Identity path":"banana","Identity selection":"banana","If anything is still attached, deleting the provider fails.":"banana","In transition":"banana","In transition certificate authority ID":"banana","In transition: incoming, not yet signing":"banana",Inactive:rTt,"Inactive: retired, no longer trusted":"banana","Incoming CA":"banana",Info:oTt,"Invalid key. Keys can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"banana","Invalid provider name. Use alphanumeric and '-_.' characters.":"banana","Invalid request":"banana","Invalid template name. Use a