 in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"banana","This tag will be removed upon saving changes":"banana","This template issues no identities":"banana","This usually takes a few minutes. Keep this page open until it finishes.":"banana",Today:WTt,"Too many requests":"banana","Trust bundle":"banana","trust domain":"banana","Trust domain":"banana","Trust domain is the root of trust for the SPIFFE naming scheme. It is a logical name that follows DNS naming style, for example prod.acme.com, but does not need to match a real DNS record.":"banana","Trust domain must be 64 characters or less.":"banana","Try again. If the problem continues, contact AWS Support.":"banana","Unable to load templates":"banana",Undo:qTt,"Up to 128 characters. Must be unique per provider.":"banana","Up to 128 characters. Use alphanumeric and '-_.' characters. Must be unique in your organization. Can't be changed after the provider is created.":"banana","Up to 128 characters. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters. Must be unique per provider.":"banana",Update:UTt,"Update certificate signer":"banana",'Use "{{key}}"':"banana",'Use "{{value}}"':"banana","Use case":"banana","Use cases":"banana","Use default templates":"banana","Use letters, digits, and . - _ characters, with a single / between parts. No / at the start or end, and a part can't be . or ..":"banana","Use one from another account":"banana","Use only Latin letters, numbers, spaces, tabs, line breaks, and standard keyboard symbols.":"banana","Use only letters, digits, - and _ characters.":"banana","Use only letters, digits, . - and _ characters. The path can't be . or ..":"banana","Use only letters, digits, periods (.), hyphens (-), and underscores (_).":"banana","Use the agent or workload identity in trust policies, resource policies, or SCPs. CloudTrail records its calls with that identity.":"banana",'Use: "{{text}}"':"banana","Used as the common name in the certificate authority's subject.":"banana",Validating:VTt,"Validating: stopped signing, still trusted":"banana",Value:HTt,"Value must be 256 characters or less.":"banana",Values:KTt,"View all":"banana","View all notifications":"banana","View JSON":"banana",Visual:GTt,Warning:YTt,Warnings:JTt,"What conditions should the agent or workload match?":"banana","What gets created":"banana","Where is the agent or workload hosted?":"banana","Which EKS clusters is this provider for?":"banana",'Wildcard "*" is only allowed with the StringLike, StringNotLike, ArnLike, or ArnNotLike operators.':"banana","Without a policy, no other account can create templates under this provider, though delegated administrators can already create both. Add a statement for each account, organizational unit, or IAM principal that should be able to, and limit each one to a path prefix.":"banana","Workload identity {{workloadIdentifier}} deleted.":"banana","Wrap lines":"banana","Write a policy to let another account create templates, or to stop a delegated administrator from part of the name space. Each statement names an organizational unit, specific accounts, or individual IAM principals, allows or denies, and can be limited to a path prefix.":"banana","Yes by default":"banana","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tag.":"banana","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tags.":"banana","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"banana","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"banana","You have more keys than can be displayed":"banana","You have more values than can be displayed":"banana","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"banana","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"banana","You have unsaved tag changes. Leave this page and discard them?":"banana","You must enter a name":"banana","You must enter a path":"banana","You must specify a condition key":"banana","You must specify a tag key":"banana","You must specify a unique tag key.":"banana","You must specify a value":"banana","Your administrator decides which prefixes this account can use. This is checked when you create.":"banana","Your identities will be <code>{{prefix}}<em>{{placeholder}}</em></code>":"banana","Your organization already has an agent and workload identity provider. Add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads — each named under your account's path prefix.":"banana","Your organization has agent and workload identity providers you can use. Pick one and add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads.":"banana","YYYY/MM/DD":"banana"},XTt=Object.freeze(Object.defineProperty({__proto__:null,ARN:OCt,Actions:PCt,Active:NCt,Add:RCt,Apply:zCt,Attestation:BCt,Cancel:FCt,Clear:$Ct,Close:jCt,Configured:WCt,Confirm:qCt,Contains:UCt,Created:VCt,Delete:HCt,Description:KCt,Details:GCt,Disable:YCt,Dismiss:JCt,Edit:ZCt,Editing:XCt,Enable:QCt,Equals:tTt,Errors:aTt,Format:nTt,Identifier:iTt,Inactive:rTt,Info:oTt,JWKS:sTt,Key:lTt,Name:cTt,New:dTt,None:uTt,Notifications:pTt,Operator:hTt,Operators:mTt,Path:yTt,Preferences:bTt,Preview:wTt,Properties:kTt,Property:STt,Provided:_Tt,Provider:xTt,Providers:ATt,Ready:ETt,Recommended:CTt,Refresh:TTt,Remove:ITt,Retry:DTt,Save:LTt,Scheme:NTt,Scope:RTt,Status:MTt,Subject:zTt,Success:OTt,Tags:BTt,Template:FTt,Templates:$Tt,Theme:jTt,Today:WTt,Undo:qTt,Update:UTt,Validating:VTt,Value:HTt,Values:KTt,Visual:GTt,Warning:YTt,Warnings:JTt,and:MCt,default:ZTt,equals:eTt,optional:gTt,or:vTt,path:fTt,scheme:PTt},Symbol.toStringTag,{value:"Module"})),QTt="Aktionen",eIt="Aktiv",tIt="Hinzufügen",aIt="Anwenden",nIt="Bescheinigung",iIt="Abbrechen",rIt="Löschen",oIt="Schließen",sIt="Konfiguriert",lIt="Bestätigen",cIt="Enthält",dIt="Erstellt",uIt="Löschen",pIt="Beschreibung",hIt="Details",mIt="Deaktivieren",gIt="Verwerfen",vIt="Bearbeiten",fIt="Bearbeiten",yIt="Aktivieren",bIt="entspricht",wIt="Ist gleich",kIt="Fehler",SIt="Format",_It="Inaktiv",xIt="Info",AIt="JWKS",EIt="Schlüssel",CIt="Name",TIt="Keine",IIt="Benachrichtigungen",DIt="Operator",LIt="Bedienende",PIt="optional",NIt="oder",RIt="Pfad",MIt="Pfad",zIt="Einstellungen",OIt="Vorschau",BIt="Eigenschaften",FIt="Eigenschaft",$It="Bereitgestellt",jIt="Anbieter",WIt="Anbieter",qIt="Bereit",UIt="Empfohlen",VIt="Aktualisieren",HIt="Entfernen",KIt="Erneut versuchen",GIt="Speichern",YIt="Schema",JIt="Schema",ZIt="Geltungsbereich",XIt="Status",QIt="Betreff",eDt="Erfolg",tDt="Tags",aDt="Vorlage",nDt="Vorlagen",iDt="Thema",rDt="Heute",oDt="Rückgängig machen",sDt="Aktualisieren",lDt="Wird validiert",cDt="Wert",dDt="Werte",uDt="Visuell",pDt="Warnung",hDt="Warnungen",mDt="Identifier",gDt={"'{{providerName}}' does not exist in your account":"„{{providerName}}“ ist in Ihrem Konto nicht vorhanden.","(earliest)":"(früheste)","{{addedCount}} tag added or changed":"{{addedCount}} Tag hinzugefügt oder geändert","{{addedCount}} tags added or changed":"{{addedCount}} Tags hinzugefügt oder geändert","{{createdCount}} templates created: {{templateNames}}.":"{{createdCount}} Vorlagen erstellt: {{templateNames}}.","{{failed}} of {{total}} certificates could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}} von {{total}} Zertifikaten konnten nicht gelöscht werden, daher wurde der Anbieter nicht gelöscht. Beheben Sie die Fehler und versuchen Sie es erneut.","{{failed}} of {{total}} could not be deleted.":"{{failed}} von {{total}} konnten nicht gelöscht werden.","{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and workload identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}} von {{total}} Vorlagen und Workload-Identitäten konnten nicht gelöscht werden, daher wurde der Anbieter nicht gelöscht. Beheben Sie die Fehler und versuchen Sie es erneut.","{{failedCount}} template could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.":"{{failedCount}} Vorlage konnte nicht erstellt werden. Überprüfen Sie die folgenden Fehler und versuchen Sie es erneut.","{{failedCount}} templates could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.":"{{failedCount}} Vorlagen konnten nicht erstellt werden. Überprüfen Sie die folgenden Fehler und versuchen Sie es erneut.","{{identityCount}} identities":"{{identityCount}} Identitäten","{{identityCount}} identity":"{{identityCount}} Identität","{{label}} (service mesh)":"{{label}} (Service-Mesh)","{{label}} copied":"{{label}} kopiert","{{label}} failed to copy":"Fehler beim Kopieren von {{label}}","{{label}} template":"{{label}} Vorlage","{{label}} template {{index}}":"{{label}} Vorlage {{index}}","{{label}}:":"{{label}}:","{{matchCount}} match":"{{matchCount}} Übereinstimmung","{{matchCount}} matches":"{{matchCount}} Übereinstimmungen","{{name}} has been successfully created.":"{{name}} wurde erfolgreich erstellt.","{{name}} has been successfully created. However, the following operations failed:":"{{name}} wurde erfolgreich erstellt. Die folgenden Vorgänge sind jedoch fehlgeschlagen:","{{providerName}} still has these resources:":"{{providerName}} hat immer noch diese Ressourcen:","{{removedCount}} tag removed":"{{removedCount}} Tag entfernt","{{removedCount}} tags removed":"{{removedCount}} Tags wurden entfernt","{{scope}} · {{domain}}":"{{scope}} · {{domain}}","{{settled}} of {{total}}":"{{settled}} von {{total}}","{{subject}}. Does not match this signer's {{algorithm}} algorithm.":"{{subject}}. Stimmt nicht mit dem Algorithmus {{algorithm}} dieses Unterzeichners überein.","{{tagCount}} tag":"{{tagCount}} Tag","{{tagCount}} tags":"{{tagCount}} Tags","{{templateCount}} template":"{{templateCount}} Vorlage","{{templateCount}} templates":"{{templateCount}} Vorlagen","{{templateName}} template failed to create. To try again, <link>add templates</link>. Error details: {{reason}}":"Die Vorlage {{templateName}} wurde nicht erstellt. Um es erneut zu versuchen, müssen Sie <link>Vorlagen hinzufügen</link>. Fehlerdetails: {{reason}}","{{workload}} fact":"{{workload}} Fakt","{defined by template}":"{defined by template}","<term>Support:</term> Amazon EKS, Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Runtime, and Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Gateway.":"<term>Unterstützung:</term> Amazon EKS, Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Runtime und Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Gateway.","1 EKS cluster":"1 EKS-Cluster","1 provider and 1 trust domain per EKS cluster. Each namespace and service account in this cluster gets its own identity, trusted only within this cluster.":"1 Anbieter und 1 Trust-Domain pro EKS-Cluster. Jeder Namespace und jedes Dienstkonto in diesem Cluster erhält seine eigene Identität, der nur innerhalb dieses Clusters vertraut wird.","1 provider and 1 trust domain shared by every EKS cluster in the mesh. A workload with the same namespace and service account in any of these clusters shares one identity.":"1 Anbieter und 1 Trust-Domain, die von jedem EKS-Cluster im Mesh gemeinsam genutzt werden. Ein Workload mit demselben Namespace und demselben Dienstkonto in einem dieser Cluster teilt sich eine Identität.","1 to 48 hours, in whole hours. Publishing is usually much faster, but can take up to 24 hours.":"1 bis 48 Stunden, in ganzen Stunden. Die Veröffentlichung ist in der Regel viel schneller, kann aber bis zu 24 Stunden dauern.","1. Select all the check boxes to confirm what deleting {{providerName}} will do.":"1. Wählen Sie alle Kontrollkästchen aus, um zu bestätigen, was das Löschen von {{providerName}} bewirkt.","2. Confirm that you want to delete this provider by typing {{providerName}} below.":"2. Bestätigen Sie, dass Sie diesen Anbieter löschen möchten, indem Sie unten {{providerName}} eingeben.","A declared identity has a fixed path you define. Use one when you need an exact path, for example to match a value another system already expects.":"Eine deklarierte Identität hat einen festen Pfad, den Sie definieren. Verwenden Sie eine, wenn Sie einen exakten Pfad benötigen, z. B. um einem Wert zu entsprechen, den ein anderes System bereits erwartet.","A deny, and only for delegated administrators":"Eine Ablehnung, und zwar nur für delegierte Administratoren","A fact {{workload}} checks when the workload starts.":"Ein Fakt {{workload}} prüft, wann die Workload beginnt.","A fixed label, such as an environment name.":"Eine feste Bezeichnung, z. B. ein Umgebungsname.","A name to identify this identity.":"Ein Name zur Identifizierung dieser Identität.","A provider with this name already exists.":"Ein Provider mit diesem Namen ist bereits vorhanden.","A tag is a label you assign to an AWS resource. Each tag has a key and an optional value. Use tags to search and filter this provider, or to track your AWS costs.":"Ein Tag ist eine Beschriftung, die Sie einer AWS-Ressource zuweisen. Jedes Tag besteht aus einem Schlüssel und einem optionalen Wert. Verwenden Sie Tags, um diesen Anbieter zu durchsuchen und zu filtern oder Ihre AWS-Kosten zu verfolgen.","A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts a workload must prove before an identity is issued. Decide how this provider issues identities - starting from the <link>default templates</link> for common use cases, or skipping them. You can add and name identities manually at any time - templates are optional and can be added later.":"Eine Vorlage definiert das Pfadmuster, das zur eindeutigen Benennung von Identitäten verwendet wird, sowie die Fakten, die ein Workload nachweisen muss, bevor eine Identität ausgestellt wird. Entscheiden Sie, wie dieser Anbieter Identitäten ausstellt – ausgehend von <link>Standardvorlagen</link> für allgemeine Anwendungsfälle oder deren Überspringen. Sie können Identitäten jederzeit manuell hinzufügen und benennen – Vorlagen sind optional und können später hinzugefügt werden.","A template with this name already exists.":"Eine Vorlage mit diesem Namen ist bereits vorhanden.","A template's path pattern, built from facts like cluster, namespace, and service account, names each workload automatically when it starts. You don't create identities ahead of time.":"Das Pfadmuster einer Vorlage, das auf Fakten wie Cluster, Namespace und Dienstkonto basiert, benennt jeden Workload automatisch, wenn er gestartet wird. Sie erstellen Identitäten nicht im Voraus.","A workload identity provider issues secure, verifiable identities to your workloads, like Kubernetes pods or AI agents. Workloads use them to access AWS and third-party services without long-lived credentials.":"Ein Workload-Identitätsanbieter stellt sichere, überprüfbare Identitäten für Ihre Workloads aus, z. B. Kubernetes-Pods oder KI-Agenten. Workloads verwenden sie, um ohne langlebige Anmeldeinformationen auf AWS- und Drittanbieterdienste zuzugreifen.","A workload, including an AI agent or sub-agent created on demand, gets its own identity. No workload shares or inherits another's.":"Ein Workload, einschließlich eines KI-Agenten oder Subagenten, der bei Bedarf erstellt wird, erhält seine eigene Identität. Kein Workload teilt oder erbt die Identität eines anderen.","Access a partner API, a SaaS endpoint, or an OIDC service. No setup needed.":"Greifen Sie auf eine Partner-API, einen SaaS-Endpunkt oder einen OIDC-Dienst zu. Keine Einrichtung erforderlich.","Access a service mesh, a database, or an on-premises system.":"Greifen Sie auf ein Service Mesh, eine Datenbank oder ein On-Premises-System zu.","Access denied":"Zugriff verweigert","Access you granted to these identities will stop working":"Der Zugriff, den Sie diesen Identitäten gewährt haben, funktioniert nicht mehr","Account scoped":"Auf das Konto beschränkt",Actions:QTt,"Activating it":"Es wird aktiviert",Active:eIt,"Active certificate authority ID":"ID der aktiven Zertifizierungsstelle","Active: currently signing":"Aktiv: signiert gerade",Add:tIt,"Add {{label}} template":"Vorlage {{label}} hinzufügen","Add a fact or condition key. A path of only custom text would give every workload the same name.":"Fügen Sie einen Fakt oder einen Bedingungsschlüssel hinzu. Ein Pfad, der nur aus benutzerdefiniertem Text besteht, würde jedem Workload den gleichen Namen geben.","Add an {{conditionKey}} condition, so only workloads in these clusters get an identity.":"Fügen Sie eine {{conditionKey}} Bedingung hinzu, sodass nur Workloads in diesen Clustern eine Identität erhalten.","Add at least 1 path segment.":"Fügen Sie mindestens 1 Pfadsegment hinzu.","Add at least 1 template to continue.":"Fügen Sie mindestens eine Vorlage hinzu, um fortzufahren.","Add at least 2 clusters.":"Fügen Sie mindestens 2 Cluster hinzu.","Add attestation rules":"Attestierungsregeln hinzufügen","Add cluster ARN":"Cluster-ARN hinzufügen","Add condition":"Bedingung hinzufügen","Add default templates for Amazon EKS, AgentCore Runtime, and AgentCore Gateway.":"Fügen Sie Standardvorlagen für Amazon EKS, AgentCore Runtime und AgentCore Gateway hinzu.","Add new tag":"Neues Tag hinzufügen","Add policy":"Richtlinie hinzufügen","Add request-context values like account, Region, or organization.":"Fügen Sie Werte für den Anforderungskontext wie Konto, Region oder Organisation hinzu.","Add tags":"Tags hinzufügen","Add tags to this provider for cost management and access control.":"Fügen Sie diesem Anbieter Tags für Kostenmanagement und Zugriffskontrolle hinzu.","Add tags to this template for cost management and access control.":"Fügen Sie dieser Vorlage Tags für Kostenmanagement und Zugriffskontrolle hinzu.","Add tags to this workload identity for cost management and access control.":"Fügen Sie dieser Workload-Identität Tags für Kostenmanagement und Zugriffskontrolle hinzu.","Add template":"Vorlage hinzufügen","Add templates":"Vorlagen hinzufügen","Add templates after the provider is created, or create and name identities by hand.":"Fügen Sie Vorlagen hinzu, nachdem der Anbieter erstellt wurde, oder erstellen und benennen Sie Identitäten manuell.","Add to the path pattern":"Zum Pfadmuster hinzufügen","Added or changed tags were not saved":"Hinzugefügte oder geänderte Tags wurden nicht gespeichert","Adding permissions to govern who can create templates referring to this provider failed. To try again, <link>add policy</link>. Error details: {{reason}}":"Das Hinzufügen von Berechtigungen zur Festlegung, wer Vorlagen erstellen darf, die auf diesen Anbieter verweisen, ist fehlgeschlagen. Um es erneut zu versuchen, müssen Sie eine <link>Richtlinie hinzufügen</link>. Fehlerdetails: {{reason}}","All outbound signers under this provider will be deleted":"Alle ausgehenden Unterzeichner unter diesem Anbieter werden gelöscht","All properties":"Alle Eigenschaften","All templates and workload identities under this provider will be deleted":"Alle Vorlagen und Workload-Identitäten unter diesem Anbieter werden gelöscht","Allow member accounts to add their own templates, namespaced by account ID":"Erlauben Sie Mitgliedskonten, ihre eigenen Vorlagen hinzuzufügen, die nach Konto-ID als Namespace organisiert sind","An identity for agent or workload":"Eine Identität für einen Agenten oder Workload",and:"und","Any value":"Beliebiger Wert",Apply:aIt,ARN:"ARN","ARN copied":"ARN kopiert","arn:aws:eks:{Region}:{account ID}:cluster/{cluster name}":"arn:aws:eks:{Region}:{account ID}:cluster/{cluster name}","At runtime the platform attests these facts about the workload. Any workload whose attestation carries them issues an identity from this template.":"Zur Laufzeit bestätigt die Plattform diese Fakten über den Workload. Jeder Workload, dessen Attestierung diese Fakten enthält, erhält eine Identität aus dieser Vorlage.",Attestation:nIt,"Attestation policy":"Attestierungsrichtlinie","Auto generated identity name":"Automatisch generierter Identitätsname","Automatically generate from a template":"Automatisch aus einer Vorlage generieren","Available to every account in your organization ({{organizationId}})":"Verfügbar für jedes Konto in Ihrer Organisation ({{organizationId}})","Available to this account ({{accountId}})":"Verfügbar für dieses Konto ({{accountId}})","AWS account ID":"AWS-Konto-ID","AWS API calls in CloudTrail resolve to the specific workload that made them. Scope trust policies, resource policies, and SCPs to it, using the IAM policies you already know.":"AWS-API-Aufrufe in CloudTrail werden dem spezifischen Workload zugeordnet, der sie ausgelöst hat. Beschränken Sie Vertrauensrichtlinien, Ressourcenrichtlinien und SCPs auf diesen Workload, indem Sie die IAM-Richtlinien verwenden, die Sie bereits kennen.","AWS creates a subordinate CA in every region this provider signs in, and returns an ID for it.":"AWS erstellt in jeder Region, in der dieser Anbieter signiert, eine untergeordnete Zertifizierungsstelle und gibt eine ID für diese zurück.","AWS IAM Workload Identity":"AWS IAM Workload Identity","AWS IAM Workload Identity (opens in a new tab)":"AWS IAM Workload Identity (wird auf einer neuen Registerkarte geöffnet)","AWS Private CA couldn't set up this certificate authority. Delete it in the AWS Private CA console and try again.":"AWS Private CA konnte diese Zertifizierungsstelle nicht einrichten. Löschen Sie sie in der AWS Private CA-Konsole und versuchen Sie es erneut.","By default, each account's templates require an account ID path prefix to avoid name collisions. You can customize this after creating the provider, under provider settings.":"Standardmäßig benötigen die Vorlagen jedes Kontos ein Konto-ID-Pfadpräfix, um Namenskollisionen zu vermeiden. Sie können dies nach der Erstellung des Providers in den Anbietereinstellungen anpassen.","Can't be changed after the provider is created.":"Kann nach der Erstellung des Providers nicht mehr geändert werden.","Can't be changed later.":"Kann später nicht geändert werden.",Cancel:iIt,"Cannot be changed later.":"Kann später nicht geändert werden.","Cannot start with aws:":"Man kann nicht mit aws starten:","Certificate {{name}} (account {{accountId}}): {{reason}}":"Zertifikat {{name}} (Konto {{accountId}}): {{reason}}","Certificate authority":"Zertifizierungsstelle","Certificate authority created":"Zertifizierungsstelle erstellt","Certificate authority ID":"ID der Zertifizierungsstelle","Certificate authority name":"Name der Zertifizierungsstelle","Certificate authority updated. The current one keeps signing for about {{hours}} more hour, until the replacement has published everywhere.":"Die Zertifizierungsstelle wurde aktualisiert. Die aktuelle signiert noch ungefähr {{hours}} Stunde, bis der Ersatz überall veröffentlicht ist.","Certificate authority updated. The current one keeps signing for about {{hours}} more hours, until the replacement has published everywhere.":"Die Zertifizierungsstelle wurde aktualisiert. Die jetzige signiert noch ungefähr {{hours}} Stunden weiter, bis der Nachfolger überall veröffentlicht ist.","Certificate deleted. Its chain had already left the trust bundle, so nothing that was verifying has changed.":"Das Zertifikat wurde gelöscht. Die Kette hatte das Vertrauenspaket bereits verlassen, sodass sich nichts an der Verifizierung geändert hat.","Certificate deleted. Its chain has been pulled from the trust bundle, so certificates issued under it no longer verify.":"Das Zertifikat wurde gelöscht. Seine Kette wurde aus dem Vertrauenspaket entfernt, sodass die unter diesem Zertifikat ausgestellten Zertifikate nicht mehr verifiziert werden können.","Certificate signer":"Unterzeichner des Zertifikats","Certificate signer disabled, and the update in progress was stopped with it. Both authorities stay configured, and Enable resumes signing.":"Der Zertifikatsunterzeichner wurde deaktiviert, und das laufende Update wurde damit gestoppt. Beide Autoritäten bleiben konfiguriert, und „Aktivieren“ nimmt die Signierung wieder auf.","Certificate signer disabled. It stops signing now, its configuration is kept, and Enable resumes signing.":"Der Zertifikatsunterzeichner ist deaktiviert. Das Signieren wird jetzt beendet, seine Konfiguration wird beibehalten und „Aktivieren“ setzt das Signieren fort.","Certificate signer enabled. Its certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle again first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hour, after every region has it.":"Zertifikatsunterzeichner aktiviert. Seine Zertifikatskette wird erneut zunächst im Vertrauenspaket veröffentlicht. Die Signierung beginnt nach etwa {{hours}} Stunde, sobald sie in allen Regionen verfügbar ist.","Certificate signer enabled. Its certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle again first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hours, after every region has it.":"Zertifikatsunterzeichner aktiviert. Seine Zertifikatskette wird erneut zunächst im Vertrauenspaket veröffentlicht. Die Signierung beginnt nach etwa {{hours}} Stunden, sobald sie in allen Regionen verfügbar ist.","Certificate signer enabled. Its material was still published, so signing resumed immediately.":"Der Unterzeichner des Zertifikats ist aktiviert. Das Material war noch veröffentlicht, sodass die Signierung sofort wieder aufgenommen wurde.","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hour, once every region has it.":"Zertifikatssignierung aktiviert. Die Zertifikatskette wird zunächst im Vertrauenspaket veröffentlicht. Die Signierung beginnt nach etwa {{hours}} Stunde, sobald sie in allen Regionen verfügbar ist.","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hours, once every region has it.":"Das Signieren von Zertifikaten ist aktiviert. Die Zertifikatskette wird zuerst im Vertrauensspeicher veröffentlicht, und das Signieren beginnt in etwa {{hours}} Stunden, sobald es in jeder Region verfügbar ist.","Certificate verifier information":"Informationen zum Zertifikatsprüfer","Certificates ({{total}})":"Zertifikate ({{total}})","Certificates: {{reason}}":"Zertifikate: {{reason}}","Change the facts a workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.":"Ändern Sie die Fakten, die ein Workload bestätigt haben muss, um eine Identität aus dieser Vorlage zu erhalten. Identitäten, die diese Vorlage bereits generiert hat, sind davon nicht betroffen.","Change the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. A workload already holding a session keeps it until the session expires.":"Ändern Sie die Fakten, die eine Workload bestätigt haben muss, um als diese Identität ausgeführt zu werden. Eine Workload, die bereits eine Sitzung hält, behält diese, bis die Sitzung abläuft.","Check again":"Erneut prüfen","Checking what is attached to this provider":"Es wird überprüft, was an diesen Anbieter angehängt ist","Choose a condition key":"Einen Bedingungsschlüssel auswählen","Choose a fact":"Fakt auswählen","Choose a path and pattern for the names. Start from a default or customize your own.":"Wählen Sie einen Pfad und ein Muster für die Namen. Beginnen Sie mit einer Standardeinstellung oder passen Sie Pfad und Muster nach Ihren Wünschen an.","Choose a specific name up front so you can grant it access or match an existing naming convention before the workload runs.":"Wählen Sie vorab einen bestimmten Namen aus, damit Sie ihm Zugriff gewähren oder eine bestehende Namenskonvention einhalten können, bevor der Workload ausgeführt wird.","Choose a stable, unique name that identifies one environment or group of workloads, for example prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal.":"Wählen Sie einen stabilen, eindeutigen Namen, der eine Umgebung oder eine Gruppe von Workloads identifiziert, z. B. prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal.","Choose a use case above to add a template.":"Wählen Sie oben einen Anwendungsfall aus, um eine Vorlage hinzuzufügen.","Choose from this account":"Wählen Sie aus diesem Konto","Choose templates to add, and customize or keep their defaults":"Vorlagen auswählen, die Sie hinzufügen möchten, und die Standardeinstellungen anpassen oder sie beibehalten","Choose the certificate authority this signer should sign with instead. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. The current authority keeps signing until the replacement has been published long enough for verifiers to pick it up.":"Wählen Sie stattdessen die Zertifizierungsstelle aus, mit der dieser Unterzeichner signieren soll. Es wird eine <link>Zertifizierungsstelle</link> mit einer untergeordneten CA in jeder Region benötigt, in der Sie signieren. Die aktuelle Zertifizierungsstelle signiert so lange weiter, bis der Ersatz lange genug veröffentlicht wurde, damit die Prüfer ihn übernehmen können.","Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for a workload.":"Wählen Sie die Bedingungsschlüssel aus, die als Attestierungsfakten verwendet werden sollen. Die Plattform muss sie alle attestieren, bevor diese Vorlage eine Identität für einen Workload generiert.","Choose the facts a workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.":"Wählen Sie die Fakten aus, die ein Workload bestätigt haben muss, um eine Identität aus dieser Vorlage zu erhalten. Es wird nichts daraus generiert, bis Sie dies tun.","Choose the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. Nothing can be issued for it until you do.":"Wählen Sie die Merkmale aus, deren Vorliegen für eine Workload bestätigt sein muss, damit sie unter dieser Identität ausgeführt werden kann. Bis dahin kann nichts für sie ausgestellt werden.","Choose the provider to create the identity in":"Wählen Sie den Anbieter aus, in dem die Identität erstellt werden soll","Choose which templates to add by use case, and customize each one or keep its defaults.":"Wählen Sie je nach Anwendungsfall aus, welche Vorlagen hinzugefügt werden sollen, und passen Sie jede Vorlage an oder behalten Sie ihre Standardeinstellungen bei.",Clear:rIt,"Clear filters":"Filter löschen",Close:oIt,"Close modal":"Modal schließen","Cluster ARN":"Cluster-ARN","Cluster ARNs":"Cluster-ARNs","Code editor":"Code Editor","Complete the confirmation to delete.":"Füllen Sie die Bestätigung zum Löschen aus.","Condition key":"Bedingungsschlüssel","Configure identity templates for your workload use cases. Each template defines a path pattern used to issue identities uniquely and the facts a workload must prove before an identity is issued.":"Konfigurieren Sie Identitätsvorlagen für Ihre Workload-Anwendungsfälle. Jede Vorlage definiert ein Pfadmuster, das zur eindeutigen Ausstellung von Identitäten verwendet wird, sowie die Fakten, die ein Workload nachweisen muss, bevor eine Identität ausgestellt wird.","Configure later":"Später konfigurieren",Configured:sIt,Confirm:lIt,Contains:cIt,"Continue setup":"Einrichtung fortsetzen","Copy {{label}}":"{{label}} kopieren","Copy ARN":"ARN kopieren","Copy JSON":"JSON kopieren","Could not check everything attached to this provider":"Es konnte nicht alles überprüft werden, was mit diesem Anbieter verbunden ist","Create a provider":"Einen Anbieter erstellen","Create a provider for this account":"Erstellen Sie einen Anbieter für dieses Konto","Create a provider for your organization":"Erstellen Sie einen Anbieter für Ihre Organisation","Create a provider to get started":"Erstellen Sie einen Anbieter, um zu beginnen","Create a template to automate identity generation":"Erstellen Sie eine Vorlage, um die Identitätsgenerierung zu automatisieren","Create declared identity in {{providerName}}":"Erstellen Sie eine deklarierte Identität in {{providerName}}","Create identity":"Identität erstellen","Create new":"Neu erstellen","Create provider":"Anbieter erstellen","Create provider and templates":"Anbieter und Vorlagen erstellen","Create service mesh provider":"Service-Mesh-Anbieter erstellen","Create templates":"Vorlagen erstellen","Create the certificate authority first.":"Erstellen Sie zuerst die Zertifizierungsstelle.","Create workload identities":"Workload-Identitäten erstellen",Created:dIt,"Created through":"Erstellt durch","Created time":"Zeitpunkt der Erstellung","Created values":"Erstellte Werte","Creates a workload identity provider and template for workloads running in one or more EKS clusters under a service mesh, such as Istio.":"Erstellt einen Workload-Identitätsanbieter und eine Vorlage für Workloads, die in einem oder mehreren EKS-Clustern unter einem Service-Mesh wie Istio ausgeführt werden.","Creating certificate authority":"Zertifizierungsstelle wird erstellt","Creating the certificate authority":"Die Zertifizierungsstelle wird erstellt","Creating this provider sets up these 2 resources.":"Durch das Erstellen dieses Anbieters werden diese 2 Ressourcen eingerichtet.","Current CA":"Aktuelle Zertifizierungsstelle","Current provider":"Derzeitiger Anbieter","Custom tag key":"Benutzerdefinierter Tag-Schlüssel","Custom tag value":"Benutzerdefinierter Tag-Wert","Custom text":"Benutzerdefinierter Text","Custom text can't be a single period (.) or two periods (..).":"Benutzerdefinierter Text darf nicht aus einem einzelnen Punkt (.) oder aus zwei Punkten (..) bestehen.","Customize templates":"Vorlagen anpassen","Dark themes":"Dunkle Designs","Declared identity: {{name}}":"Deklarierte Identität: {{name}}","Default permissions without a policy":"Standardberechtigungen ohne Richtlinie","Defaults to {provider name}.{account ID}.aws.internal. This must match the trust domain set in your service mesh, or the mesh rejects the identities.":"Die Standardeinstellung ist {provider name}.{account ID}.aws.internal. Diese muss mit der in Ihrem Service-Mesh festgelegten Trust-Domain übereinstimmen, andernfalls lehnt das Mesh die Identitäten ab.","Define an optional path prefix for identities under this template. Lets you filter by prefix when authoring IAM permissions.":"Definieren Sie ein optionales Pfadpräfix für Identitäten unter dieser Vorlage. Ermöglicht es Ihnen, bei der Erstellung von IAM-Berechtigungen nach Präfix zu filtern.","Define an optional path prefix for this identity. You can filter by this prefix when authoring IAM permissions.":"Definieren Sie ein optionales Pfadpräfix für diese Identität. Sie können bei der Erstellung von IAM-Berechtigungen nach Präfix filtern.","Define an optional prefix for identities under this template. You can filter by this prefix when authoring IAM permissions. The path prefixes this account can use are set by the provider's policy, for example your account ID, and they are checked when you choose Create. If you're not sure which are permitted, ask your organization administrator.":"Definieren Sie ein optionales Präfix für Identitäten unter dieser Vorlage. Sie können bei der Erstellung von IAM-Berechtigungen nach diesem Präfix filtern. Die Pfadpräfixe, die dieses Konto verwenden kann, werden durch die Richtlinie des Anbieters festgelegt, z. B. Ihre Konto-ID, und sie werden überprüft, wenn Sie Erstellen wählen. Wenn Sie sich nicht sicher sind, welche zulässig sind, fragen Sie Ihren Unternehmensadministrator.","Define an optional prefix for this identity. You can filter by this prefix when authoring IAM permissions. The path prefixes this account can use are set by the provider's policy, for example your account ID, and they are checked when you choose Create. If you're not sure which are permitted, ask your organization administrator.":"Definieren Sie ein optionales Präfix für diese Identität. Sie können bei der Erstellung von IAM-Berechtigungen nach diesem Präfix filtern. Die Pfadpräfixe, die dieses Konto verwenden kann, werden durch die Richtlinie des Anbieters festgelegt, z. B. Ihre Konto-ID, und sie werden überprüft, wenn Sie Erstellen wählen. Wenn Sie sich nicht sicher sind, welche zulässig sind, fragen Sie Ihren Unternehmensadministrator.","Define which workloads are allowed to use this template.":"Definieren Sie, welche Workloads diese Vorlage verwenden dürfen.",Delete:uIt,"Delete certificate?":"Zertifikat löschen?","Delete provider":"Anbieter löschen","Delete provider and resources":"Anbieter und Ressourcen löschen","Delete provider?":"Anbieter löschen?","Delete template":"Vorlage löschen","Delete template?":"Vorlage löschen?","Delete the templates under <b>{{providerName}}</b> before deleting the provider. Once deleted, workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials and fail on their next request, and access that you granted to these identities will stop working.":"Löschen Sie die Vorlagen unter <b>{{providerName}}</b>, bevor Sie den Anbieter löschen. Nach dem Löschen erhalten Workloads, die diese Identitäten verwenden, keine Anmeldeinformationen mehr und sie schlagen bei ihrer nächsten Anfrage fehl. Der Zugriff, den Sie diesen Identitäten gewährt haben, funktioniert nicht mehr.","Delete workload identity?":"Workload-Identität löschen?","Deleting <b>{{templateName}}</b> will:":"Das Löschen von <b>{{templateName}}</b> bewirkt Folgendes:","Deleting <b>{{workloadIdentifier}}</b> will:":"Das Löschen von <b>{{workloadIdentifier}}</b> bewirkt Folgendes:","Deleting certificates":"Zertifikate werden gelöscht","Deleting provider":"Anbieter wird gelöscht","Deleting templates and workload identities":"Vorlagen und Workload-Identitäten werden gelöscht","Deleting the provider is taking longer than expected":"Das Löschen des Anbieters dauert länger als erwartet",Description:pIt,"Description can't include line breaks or tabs.":"Die Beschreibung darf keine Zeilenumbrüche oder Tabulatoren enthalten.","Description must be 1,000 characters or less.":"Die Beschreibung darf maximal 1.000 Zeichen lang sein.","Description must be 255 characters or less.":"Die Beschreibung darf maximal 255 Zeichen lang sein.",Details:hIt,Disable:mIt,"Disable certificate signer?":"Zertifikatsignierer deaktivieren?","Discovery expiration time":"Ablaufzeit der Erkennung",Dismiss:gIt,"Does not contain":"Enthält nicht","Does not equal":"Ist nicht gleich","Drag or select to resize":"Ziehen oder auswählen, um die Größe zu ändern","Each identity is fully the template path, or whatever string you enter when you create the identity.":"Jede Identität ist vollständig der Vorlagenpfad oder eine beliebige Zeichenfolge, die Sie beim Erstellen der Identität eingeben.",Edit:vIt,"Edit attestation policy":"Attestierungsrichtlinie bearbeiten","Edit filter":"Filter bearbeiten","Edit identity format and scope":"Identitätsformat und Geltungsbereich bearbeiten","Edit identity path":"Identitätspfad bearbeiten",Editing:fIt,Enable:yIt,"Enable certificate signer":"Zertifikatsignierer aktivieren","Enable certificate signer?":"Zertifikatsignierer aktivieren?","End signing time":"Ende der Signierzeit","Enter a 12-digit AWS account ID.":"Geben Sie eine 12-stellige AWS-Konto-ID ein.","Enter a certificate authority ID.":"Geben Sie eine Zertifizierungsstellen-ID ein.","Enter a cluster ARN.":"Cluster-ARN eingeben","Enter a name":"Namen eingeben","Enter a name for the certificate authority.":"Geben Sie einen Namen für die Zertifizierungsstelle ein.","Enter a name.":"Geben Sie einen Namen ein.","Enter a path":"Geben Sie einen Pfad ein.","Enter a path prefix value":"Geben Sie einen Wert für das Pfadpräfix ein","Enter a trust domain.":"Geben Sie eine Vertrauens-Domain ein.","Enter a value":"Einen Wert eingeben","Enter a whole number of hours from 1 to 48.":"Geben Sie eine ganze Zahl von Stunden zwischen 1 und 48 ein.","Enter key":"Schlüssel eingeben","Enter prefix":"Präfix eingeben","Enter the ID of a certificate authority or choose from below":"Geben Sie die ID einer Zertifizierungsstelle ein oder wählen Sie eine der folgenden Optionen aus","Enter the policy as valid JSON.":"Geben Sie die Richtlinie als gültiges JSON ein.","Enter value":"Wert eingeben",equals:bIt,Equals:wIt,Error:"Fehler","Error fetching the details":"Fehler beim Abrufen der Details",Errors:kIt,"Every account in this organization ({{organizationId}})":"Jedes Konto in dieser Organisation ({{organizationId}})","Every X.509-SVID this provider issues right now is signed by this certificate. It stops in {{hours}} hour, at {{at}}, when the incoming certificate takes over.":"Jede X.509-SVID, die dieser Anbieter derzeit ausstellt, ist mit diesem Zertifikat signiert. Es hört in {{hours}} Stunde um {{at}} auf zu signieren, wenn das eingehende Zertifikat übernimmt.","Every X.509-SVID this provider issues right now is signed by this certificate. It stops in {{hours}} hours, at {{at}}, when the incoming certificate takes over.":"Jede X.509-SVID, die dieser Anbieter derzeit ausstellt, ist mit diesem Zertifikat signiert. Es hört in {{hours}} Stunden, um {{at}}, auf zu signieren, wenn das eingehende Zertifikat übernimmt.","Every X.509-SVID this provider issues right now is signed by this certificate. No replacement is scheduled, so it keeps signing until you update or disable the signer.":"Jede X.509-SVID, die dieser Anbieter gerade ausstellt, ist mit diesem Zertifikat signiert. Es ist kein Austausch geplant. Es wird also so lange signiert, bis Sie den Unterzeichner aktualisieren oder deaktivieren.","Failed to copy":"Fehler beim Kopieren","Failed to copy JSON":"JSON konnte nicht kopiert werden","Failed to load attestation policy.":"Die Attestierungsrichtlinie konnte nicht geladen werden.","Failed to load templates.":"Vorlagen konnten nicht geladen werden.","Failed to remove attestation policy.":"Die Nachweisrichtlinie konnte nicht entfernt werden.","Filter providers":"Anbieter filtern","Filter templates":"Vorlagen filtern","Filter themes":"Designs filtern","Find providers":"Anbieter finden","Find templates":"Vorlagen suchen","Find theme":"Thema suchen","For example, prod":"Zum Beispiel prod","For mutual TLS, attach a certificate authority":"Fügen Sie für gegenseitiges TLS eine Zertifizierungsstelle hinzu","For token-based services, issue a JWT":"Für Token-basierte Dienste geben Sie ein JWT aus",Format:SIt,"Generating its key":"Generiert ihren Schlüssel","Get started":"Erste Schritte","Getting started":"Erste Schritte","Give an agent or workload its own identity - <em>Preview</em>":"Geben Sie einem Agenten oder einer Workload eine eigene Identität – <em>Vorschau</em>","Give each workload a unique identity, so you can grant it access and audit what it did rather than sharing one role.":"Weisen Sie jedem Workload eine eindeutige Identität zu, sodass Sie ihm Zugriff gewähren und überprüfen können, was er getan hat, anstatt eine Rolle zu teilen.","Give your workloads an identity":"Geben Sie Ihren Workloads eine Identität","Go to the providers list":"Zur Anbieterliste wechseln","Govern who can create resources":"Legen Sie fest, wer Ressourcen erstellen kann","Govern who can create templates referring to this provider":"Legen Sie fest, wer Vorlagen erstellen kann, die auf diesen Anbieter verweisen","Greater than":"Größer als","Greater than or equal":"Größer als oder gleich","hour(s)":"Stunde(n)","How it works":"So funktioniert es","IAM roles define what a workload can do. Workload Identity tells you which workload is doing it.":"IAM-Rollen definieren, was ein Workload tun kann. Workload Identity sagt Ihnen, welcher Workload es ausführt.","Identities are issued at runtime from facts the workload proves, not just from what an admin assigns.":"Identitäten werden zur Laufzeit anhand von Fakten ausgestellt, die der Workload nachweist, und nicht nur aufgrund der Zuweisung durch einen Administrator.",'Identity "{{identityId}}" not found.':"Identität „{{identityId}}“ wurde nicht gefunden.","Identity format and scope":"Identitätsformat und Geltungsbereich","Identity name":"Identitätsname","Identity path":"Identitätspfad","Identity selection":"Identitätsauswahl","If anything is still attached, deleting the provider fails.":"Wenn noch etwas angehängt ist, schlägt das Löschen des Anbieters fehl.","In transition":"Im Übergang","In transition certificate authority ID":"Im Übergang: ID der Zertifizierungsstelle","In transition: incoming, not yet signing":"Im Übergang: eingehend, noch nicht signierend",Inactive:_It,"Inactive: retired, no longer trusted":"Inaktiv: außer Betrieb, nicht mehr vertrauenswürdig","Incoming CA":"Eingehende Zertifizierungsstelle",Info:xIt,"Invalid key. Keys can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"Ungültiger Schlüssel. Schlüssel dürfen nur Unicode-Buchstaben, Ziffern, Leerzeichen und Folgendes enthalten: _.:/=+@-","Invalid provider name. Use alphanumeric and '-_.' characters.":"Ungültiger Providername. Verwenden Sie nur alphanumerische Zeichen sowie „-_.“ und „_“.","Invalid request":"Ungültige Anfrage","Invalid template name. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters.":'Ungültiger Vorlagenname. Verwenden Sie nur alphanumerische Zeichen sowie "-_"-Zeichen.',"Invalid value. Values can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"Ungültiger Wert. Werte dürfen nur Unicode-Buchstaben, Ziffern, Leerzeichen und Folgendes enthalten: _.:/=+@-","Issued after the workload proves itself":"Wird ausgegeben, nachdem der Workload seine Identität nachgewiesen hat","Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. Standard pricing applies to the creation and use of AWS Private CA.":"Stellt die X.509-SVIDs aus, die die Workloads dieses Anbieters als Clientzertifikate für Systeme außerhalb von AWS präsentieren. Dafür wird eine <link>Zertifizierungsstelle</link> mit einer untergeordneten CA in jeder Region benötigt, in der Sie signieren. Für die Erstellung und Nutzung von AWS Private CA gelten Standardpreise.","Issues X.509-SVIDs, for mTLS peers that verify a client certificate.":"Gibt X.509-SVIDs für mTLS-Peers aus, die ein Client-Zertifikat verifizieren.","Issuing its CA certificate":"CA-Zertifikat wird ausgestellt","It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. Leave it alone and it becomes inactive on its own, after which deleting it changes nothing.":"Er signiert nicht mehr. Seine Kette ist jedoch immer noch veröffentlicht, sodass Workloads darauf angewiesen sind, dass er die zuvor ausgegebenen Anmeldeinformationen überprüft. Wenn Sie ihn jetzt löschen, wird die Kette sofort entfernt und diese Anmeldeinformationen beginnen zu versagen. Wenn Sie ihn in Ruhe lassen, wird er von selbst inaktiv. Danach ändert das Löschen nichts mehr.","Item moved from position {{initialPosition}} to position {{finalPosition}} of {{total}}":"Das Element wurde von Position {{initialPosition}} zu Position {{finalPosition}} von {{total}} verschoben","JSON copied":"JSON kopiert",JWKS:AIt,"JWKS popover":"Jeder aktive Signaturschlüssel, ausgewählt nach kid. AWS veröffentlicht hier einen neuen Schlüssel, bevor das Signieren zu diesem wechselt.","JWT Outbound signers column Signing algorithm":"Signaturalgorithmus","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key":"Schlüsselalgorithmen","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key issue time":"Aktuelle Schlüsselsignierung seit","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key popover":"AWS generiert die Schlüssel und rotiert sie nach seinem eigenen Zeitplan, wobei jeder neue Schlüssel im JWKS veröffentlicht wird, bevor mit der Signierung begonnen wird. Die Algorithmen bleiben während einer Rotation gleich, sodass ein Verifier, der das JWKS liest, keine Änderungen auf Ihrer Seite benötigt.","JWT Outbound signers desc":"Signiert JWT-SVIDs für Systeme, die ein signiertes Token verifizieren.","JWT Outbound signers label oidc discovery":"OIDC-Discovery","JWT Outbound signers label oidc discovery popover":"Das Standard-Discovery-Dokument. Die meisten Verifizierer benötigen nur diese URL, weil sie die Schlüssel daraus finden.","JWT Outbound signers label oidc issuer":"OIDC-Ausgeber","JWT Outbound signers label oidc issuer popover":"Der iss-Anspruch jedes hier signierten JWT-SVID. Ein Verifizierer, der einen Ausgeber pinnt, pinnt diesen Wert.","JWT Outbound signers section title":"Informationen zum Token-Verifizierer","JWT Outbound signers status":"Standardmäßig von AWS bereitgestellt","JWT Outbound signers title":"JWT-Signierer",Key:EIt,"Learn about organization providers":"Mehr über Organisationsanbieter erfahren","Learn about organization providers (opens in a new tab)":"Erfahren Sie mehr über Organisationsanbieter (wird auf einer neuen Registerkarte geöffnet)","Learn more":"Weitere Informationen","Learn more about deleting a provider (opens in a new tab)":"Mehr über das Löschen eines Anbieters erfahren (wird auf einer neuen Registerkarte geöffnet)","Learn more:":"Weitere Informationen:","Less than":"Weniger als","Less than or equal":"Kleiner oder gleich","Let other accounts or principals in your organization create templates and identities under this provider, within the path prefixes you choose.":"Lassen Sie andere Konten oder Prinzipale in Ihrer Organisation Vorlagen und Identitäten unter diesem Anbieter innerhalb der von Ihnen ausgewählten Pfadpräfixe erstellen.","Let workloads reach non-AWS resources":"Ermöglichen Sie Workloads den Zugriff auf Nicht-AWS-Ressourcen","Letters, digits, . - _ with a single / between parts. No / at the start or end.":"Buchstaben, Ziffern, . - _ mit einem einzelnen / zwischen den Teilen. Kein / am Anfang oder Ende.","Letters, digits, . - _ with a single / between parts. No / at the start or end. Cannot be changed later.":"Buchstaben, Ziffern, . - _ mit einem einzelnen / zwischen den Teilen. Kein / am Anfang oder Ende. Kann später nicht geändert werden.","Light themes":"Helle Designs","Ln {{row}}, Col {{column}}":"Zeile {{row}}, Spalte {{column}}","Loading certificate authorities":"Zertifizierungsstellen werden geladen","Loading code editor":"Code Editor wird geladen","Loading tag keys":"Tag-Schlüssel laden","Loading tag values":"Tag-Werte werden geladen","Loading tags that are associated with this resource":"Tags, die dieser Ressource zugeordnet sind, werden geladen","Loading your organization's providers":"Die Anbieter Ihrer Organisation werden geladen","Make sure the new certificate authority uses the same algorithm as the current signer, {{algorithm}}. If you choose a different algorithm, you need to disable this signer, delete its certificates, then enable it again with the new authority.":"Vergewissern Sie sich, dass die neue Zertifizierungsstelle den gleichen Algorithmus wie der aktuelle Unterzeichner verwendet: {{algorithm}}. Wenn Sie einen anderen Algorithmus auswählen, müssen Sie diesen Unterzeichner deaktivieren, seine Zertifikate löschen und ihn dann mit der neuen Zertifizierungsstelle erneut aktivieren.","Manage CAs and replication in the AWS Private CA console":"Verwalten Sie Zertifizierungsstellen und Replikation in der AWS-Private-CA-Konsole","Manage tags":"Tags verwalten","Manage the provider":"Den Anbieter verwalten","Manual creation":"Manuelle Erstellung","Manually create":"Manuell erstellen","Matching workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.":"Passende Workloads erhalten in dem Moment, in dem sie gestartet werden, ihren eigenen Identitätsnamen – und zwar in jeder Größenordnung.","Maximum 1,000 characters.":"Maximal 1 000 Zeichen.","Maximum 255 characters.":"Maximal 255 Zeichen.","Member accounts":"Mitgliedskonten","Member accounts can add their own templates, namespaced by account ID.":"Mitgliedskonten können eigene Vorlagen hinzufügen, die anhand der Konto-ID eindeutig gekennzeichnet werden.","Member accounts cannot add their own templates.":"Mitgliedskonten können keine eigenen Vorlagen hinzufügen.","Minimum signing delay":"Minimale Signierverzögerung","Moving item to position {{currentPosition}} of {{total}}":"Artikel wird an Position {{currentPosition}} von {{total}} verschoben","Multiple EKS clusters":"Mehrere EKS-Cluster",Name:CIt,"Name must be 128 characters or less.":"Der Name darf 128 Zeichen nicht überschreiten.","Name this identity":"Nennen Sie diese Identität","Name this provider":"Nennen Sie diesen Anbieter","Name values":"Namenswerte","Names identities automatically as workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.":"Benennt Identitäten automatisch, wenn Workloads gestartet werden, sodass Sie sie nicht einzeln erstellen oder verwalten müssen.","Naming scheme":"Benennungsschema",New:"Neu","Next month":"Nächster Monat","Next page":"Nächste Seite","Next step":"Nächster Schritt","No attestation policy set. Define one so a workload can run as this identity.":"Es wurde keine Attestierungsrichtlinie festgelegt. Definieren Sie eine, damit eine Workload mit dieser Identität ausgeführt werden kann.","No attestation policy. No workload will be issued workload identities from this template until you add one.":"Keine Nachweisrichtlinie. Diesem Vorlagen-Element werden keine Workload-Identitäten für Workloads ausgestellt, bis Sie eine hinzufügen.","No by default, but can add a policy":"Standardmäßig Nein, aber es kann eine Richtlinie hinzugefügt werden","No certificate authorities in this account":"In diesem Konto gibt es keine Zertifizierungsstellen","no domain":"Keine Domain","No long-lived secrets":"Keine langlebigen Secrets","No match found":"Keine Übereinstimmung gefunden","No matches":"Keine Übereinstimmungen","No path segments. Add a fact, condition key, or custom text.":"Keine Pfadsegmente. Fügen Sie einen Fakt, einen Bedingungsschlüssel oder einen benutzerdefinierten Text hinzu.","No tags associated with the resource.":"Es sind keine Tags mit der Ressource verknüpft.","No templates added yet":"Es wurden noch keine Vorlagen hinzugefügt","No workload identity providers":"Keine Anbieter für Workload-Identitäten","No workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.":"Kein Workload entspricht dieser Vorlage, daher werden keine Identitäten generiert.","No, and cannot be granted":"Nein, und kann nicht gewährt werden",None:TIt,"None – names are defined by templates or declared individually":"Keine – Namen werden über Vorlagen definiert oder einzeln deklariert","Not saved: {{keys}}.":"Nicht gespeichert: {{keys}}.","Not set":"Nicht festgelegt",Notifications:IIt,"Once the attestation policy is removed, matching workloads will not be issued workload identities until you add a policy again.":"Sobald die Nachweisrichtlinie entfernt wurde, werden übereinstimmenden Workloads keine Workload-Identitäten mehr ausgestellt, bis Sie erneut eine Richtlinie hinzufügen.","One bundle per provider, and one URL. It carries every authority the provider publishes: both outbound signers, and during an update both the current and incoming certificate authority, which is what lets verifiers accept either one through the handover. Your own AWS workloads get these keys automatically; send this to systems outside AWS.":"Ein Paket pro Anbieter und eine URL. Es enthält alle Autoritäten, die der Anbieter veröffentlicht: beide ausgehenden Unterzeichner und bei einem Update sowohl die aktuelle als auch die eingehende Zertifizierungsstelle, sodass Prüfer beide bei der Übergabe akzeptieren können. Ihre eigenen AWS-Workloads erhalten diese Schlüssel automatisch. Senden Sie dieses Paket an Systeme außerhalb von AWS.","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level providers.":"Nur das Verwaltungskonto oder ein delegierter Administrator kann Anbieter auf Organisationsebene löschen.","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level templates.":"Nur das Verwaltungskonto oder ein delegierter Administrator kann Vorlagen auf Organisationsebene löschen.","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level workload identities.":"Nur das Verwaltungskonto oder ein delegierter Administrator kann Workload-Identitäten auf Organisationsebene löschen.","Opens in a new tab":"Wird in einer neuen Registerkarte geöffnet",Operator:DIt,Operators:LIt,optional:PIt,or:NIt,"Organization provider":"Organisationsanbieter","Organization scoped":"Auf die Organisation beschränkt","Organize the provider and track its cost with tags.":"Organisieren Sie den Anbieter und verfolgen Sie seine Kosten mit Tags.","Other accounts in your organization":"Andere Konten in Ihrer Organisation","Other condition keys":"Andere Bedingungsschlüssel","Outbound signer":"Ausgehender Unterzeichner","Outbound signers page desc":"Lassen Sie Ihre Workloads gegenüber Services außerhalb von AWS nachweisen, wer sie sind. Dieser Anbieter signiert die von ihnen vorgelegten Token und Zertifikate.","Outbound signers page title":"Ausgehender Unterzeichner","Owning account":"Kontoinhaber","Page {{pageNumber}} of all pages":"Seite {{pageNumber}} von allen Seiten",path:RIt,Path:MIt,"path from templates":"Pfad aus Vorlagen","Path is the per-workload part of an identity name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts a workload proves.":"Pfad ist der Teil eines Identitätsnamens pro Workload. Er wird zur Laufzeit anhand der Fakten ausgefüllt, die ein Workload belegt.","Path must be 255 characters or less.":"Der Pfad darf 255 Zeichen nicht überschreiten.","Path pattern":"Pfadmuster","Path prefix":"Pfadpräfix","Path prefix must be 64 characters or less.":"Das Pfadpräfix darf höchstens 64 Zeichen lang sein.","Path values":"Pfadwerte","Picked up item at position {{position}} of {{total}}":"Element an Position {{position}} von {{total}} aufgenommen","Policy details":"Richtliniendetails","Policy: Define how a workload attests to get the identity":"Richtlinie: Definieren Sie, wie ein Workload attestiert, um die Identität zu erhalten",Preferences:zIt,"Press space or enter to activate drag, use arrow keys to move, then press space or enter to confirm":"Drücken Sie die Leertaste oder die Eingabetaste, um das Ziehen zu aktivieren, verwenden Sie die Pfeiltasten zum Verschieben und drücken Sie anschließend die Leertaste oder die Eingabetaste, um zu bestätigen.",Preview:OIt,"Previous CA":"Vorherige Zertifizierungsstelle","Previous certificates ({{certificateCount}})":"Frühere Zertifikate ({{certificateCount}})","Previous month":"Vorheriger Monat","Previous page":"Vorherige Seite",Properties:BIt,Property:FIt,Provided:$It,Provider:jIt,"Provider {{providerName}} deleted.":"Anbieter {{providerName}} gelöscht.","Provider name":"Anbietername","Provider name must be 128 characters or less.":"Der Anbietername darf 128 Zeichen nicht überschreiten.","Provider not deleted":"Anbieter wurde nicht gelöscht","Provider not found":"Anbieter nicht gefunden","Provider overview":"Anbieterüberblick","Provider selection":"Auswahl des Anbieters","Provider settings":"Anbietereinstellungen","Provider values":"Werte des Anbieters",Providers:WIt,"Providers to issue workload identities":"Anbieter zur Ausstellung von Workload-Identitäten","Quick create":"Schnellerstellung","Quick create makes an RSA 2048 certificate authority in AWS Private CA in your account, which has its own charges. The algorithm is fixed and cannot be changed later without setting the signer up again.":"Quick Create erstellt eine RSA-2048-Zertifizierungsstelle in AWS Private CA in Ihrem Konto, für die eigene Gebühren anfallen. Der Algorithmus ist fest und kann später nicht geändert werden, ohne den Unterzeichner erneut einzurichten.",Ready:qIt,Recommended:UIt,"Recommended for most workloads":"Für die meisten Workloads empfohlen",Refresh:VIt,"Refresh certificate authorities":"Zertifizierungsstellen aktualisieren","Refresh certificate signer status":"Status des Zertifikatsunterzeichners aktualisieren",Remove:HIt,"Remove {{name}}":"{{name}} entfernen","Remove attestation policy":"Nachweisrichtlinie entfernen","Remove cluster ARN":"Cluster-ARN entfernen","Remove condition":"Bedingung entfernen","Remove filter {{filter}}":"Filter {{filter}} entfernen","Remove governance policy?":"Verwaltungsrichtlinie entfernen?","Remove tag {{key}}":"Tag {{key}} entfernen","Removed tags were not saved":"Entfernte Tags wurden nicht gespeichert","Reorder {{name}}":"{{name}} neu anordnen","Reordering canceled":"Neuanordnung abgebrochen","Required for service mesh providers.":"Erforderlich für Service-Mesh-Anbieter.","Required for service mesh providers. A service mesh provider is scoped to the account that runs the EKS cluster.":"Erforderlich für Service-Mesh-Anbieter. Ein Service-Mesh-Anbieter ist auf das Konto beschränkt, auf dem der EKS-Cluster ausgeführt wird.","Reset to default":"Auf Standard zurücksetzen","Resize handle":"Größenänderung der Leiste","Resolved example:":"Aufgelöstes Beispiel:","Restricted by":"Eingeschränkt durch",Retry:KIt,"Review the tags and save again.":"Überprüfen Sie die Tags und speichern Sie sie erneut.","Running a service mesh, such as Istio? It needs its own provider, one per cluster.":"Betreiben Sie ein Service Mesh wie Istio? Dafür ist ein eigener Provider erforderlich, jeweils einer pro Cluster.",Save:GIt,"Save changes":"Änderungen speichern","Save or cancel your edits before creating templates.":"Speichern oder brechen Sie Ihre Änderungen ab, bevor Sie Vorlagen erstellen.","Save or cancel your edits before creating the provider.":"Speichern oder brechen Sie Ihre Änderungen ab, bevor Sie den Provider erstellen.","Save or cancel your template edits to change the scope.":"Speichern oder verwerfen Sie Ihre Vorlagenänderungen, um den Bereich zu ändern.",scheme:YIt,Scheme:JIt,"scheme and trust domain":"Schema und Vertrauensdomain","Scheme sets the format this provider uses to name identities.":"Schema legt das Format fest, das dieser Anbieter zur Benennung von Identitäten verwendet.",Scope:ZIt,"Scope sets which accounts are allowed to use this provider.":"Der Umfang legt fest, welche Konten diesen Anbieter verwenden dürfen.","Scope values":"Geltungsbereichswerte","Search tags":"Tags suchen","Segment that partitions identities.":"Segment, das Identitäten unterteilt.","Select {{name}}":"{{name}} auswählen","Select a row to delete.":"Wählen Sie eine Zeile zum Löschen aus.",Set:"Satz","Set a naming pattern":"Legen Sie ein Benennungsmuster fest","Set an attestation rule":"Legen Sie eine Attestierungsregel fest","Set by your provider.":"Von Ihrem Anbieter festgelegt.","Set the naming format and usage scope that every workload identity from this provider inherits.":"Legen Sie das Benennungsformat und den Verwendungsbereich fest, die jede Workload-Identität von diesem Provider erbt.","Set the unique path pattern that every workload identity generated by this template follows. Cannot be changed later.":"Legen Sie das eindeutige Pfadmuster fest, dem jede von dieser Vorlage generierte Workload-Identität folgt. Kann später nicht geändert werden.","Set up a provider to hold the templates that generate identity names, the identities you declare directly, and the signers that sign credentials for systems outside AWS.":"Richten Sie einen Anbieter ein, der die Vorlagen speichert, die Identitätsnamen generieren, die Identitäten, die Sie direkt deklarieren, und die Unterzeichner, die Anmeldeinformationen für Systeme außerhalb von AWS signieren.","Set up a service mesh provider for this account":"Richten Sie einen Service-Mesh-Provider für dieses Konto ein","Set up a way to issue workload identities":"Richten Sie eine Möglichkeit ein, Workload-Identitäten auszustellen","Set up for your use cases":"Richten Sie es für Ihre Anwendungsfälle ein","Sets your trust domain, the start of every identity name.":"Legt Ihre Vertrauensdomain fest, die den Anfang jedes Identitätsnamens darstellt.","Setting up the certificate authority stopped. You can continue from where it left off.":"Die Einrichtung der Zertifizierungsstelle wurde unterbrochen. Sie können dort weitermachen, wo Sie aufgehört haben.","Settings from your provider {{providerName}}":"Einstellungen von Ihrem Anbieter {{providerName}}","Short-lived credentials renew automatically and follow the SPIFFE standard, so they work with service meshes like Istio and with SaaS applications.":"Kurzlebige Anmeldeinformationen werden automatisch erneuert und entsprechen dem SPIFFE-Standard, sodass sie mit Service Meshes wie Istio und mit SaaS-Anwendungen funktionieren.","Show all {{errorCount}} errors":"Alle {{errorCount}} Fehler anzeigen","Show fewer":"Weniger anzeigen","Show more":"Mehr anzeigen","Signing algorithm":"Signaturalgorithmus","Signing resumes immediately, because this certificate is still published in the trust bundle.":"Die Signierung wird sofort wieder aufgenommen, da dieses Zertifikat noch im Vertrauensspeicher veröffentlicht ist.","Signing start time":"Signierungsstartzeit","Some templates could not be loaded":"Einige Vorlagen konnten nicht geladen werden","Something went wrong":"Es ist ein Fehler aufgetreten.","Sortable path segment":"Sortierbares Pfadsegment",Status:XIt,"Status bar":"Statusleiste","Stop access you granted to this identity name from working":"Sicherstellen, dass der Zugriff, den Sie diesem Identitätsnamen gewährt haben, nicht mehr funktioniert","Stop access you granted to those identity names from working":"Sicherstellen, dass der Zugriff, den Sie diesen Identitätsnamen gewährt haben, nicht mehr funktioniert","Stop matching workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request":"Sicherstellen, dass passende Workloads keine Identität mehr erhalten, sodass sie bei ihrer nächsten Anfrage fehlschlagen","Stop the identities it generated from resolving":"Die Auflösung der generierten Identitäten verhindern","Stop the workload running as this identity, so it fails on its next request":"Den Workload anhalten, der unter dieser Identität ausgeführt wird, sodass er bei der nächsten Anfrage fehlschlägt","Stopped signing and no longer in the trust bundle, so nothing verifies against them. Deleting one is safe.":"Das Signieren wurde eingestellt, und das Zertifikat ist nicht mehr im Vertrauensspeicher enthalten. Daher kann nichts mehr anhand dieses Zertifikats verifiziert werden. Es kann bedenkenlos gelöscht werden.",Subject:QIt,Success:eDt,"Tag keys could not be retrieved":"Tag-Schlüssel konnten nicht abgerufen werden","Tag values could not be retrieved":"Tag-Werte konnten nicht abgerufen werden",Tags:tDt,"Tags could not be loaded":"Tags konnten nicht geladen werden","Tags for {{name}} have been updated.":"Tags für {{name}} wurden aktualisiert.","Tags not saved":"Tags nicht gespeichert",Template:aDt,'Template "{{templateId}}" not found.':"Vorlage „{{templateId}}“ wurde nicht gefunden.","Template {{name}}: {{reason}}":"Vorlage {{name}}: {{reason}}","Template {{templateName}} deleted.":"Vorlage {{templateName}} wurde gelöscht.","Template {{templateNames}} created.":"Vorlage „{{templateNames}}“ erstellt.","Template name":"Name der Vorlage","Template name must be 128 characters or less.":"Der Vorlagenname darf maximal 128 Zeichen lang sein.","Template name values":"Werte für den Vorlagennamen","Template: {{name}}":"Vorlage: {{name}}",Templates:nDt,"Templates ({{total}})":"Vorlagen ({{total}})","Templates are being created. Wait for the request to finish.":"Vorlagen werden erstellt. Warten Sie, bis die Anfrage abgeschlossen ist.","Templates give matching workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.":"Vorlagen geben passenden Workloads automatisch ihren eigenen Identitätsnamen. Jede verwendet das Namenspräfix dieses Anbieters sowie einen Pfad und ein Muster.","Templates that member accounts created under this provider are not visible here and cannot be deleted from this account. If any exist, deleting the provider fails.":"Vorlagen, die Mitgliedskonten unter diesem Anbieter erstellt haben, sind hier nicht sichtbar und können nicht aus diesem Konto gelöscht werden. Falls welche vorhanden sind, schlägt das Löschen des Anbieters fehl.","Templates: {{reason}}":"Vorlagen: {{reason}}","The account that owns the certificate authority.":"Das Konto, dem die Zertifizierungsstelle gehört.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it.":"Die Attestierungsrichtlinie legt fest, wie Identitäten von diesem Anbieter ausgestellt werden. Eine Workload muss alle Bedingungen erfüllen – beispielsweise hinsichtlich des Typs, der Details und des Ausführungsorts –, wie sie vom Service, der sie hostet, bestätigt werden.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.":"Die Attestierungsrichtlinie legt fest, wie Identitäten von diesem Anbieter ausgestellt werden. Eine Workload muss alle Bedingungen erfüllen – beispielsweise hinsichtlich des Typs, der Details und des Ausführungsorts –, wie sie vom Service, der sie hostet, bestätigt werden. Kann später bearbeitet werden.","The attestation policy controls which workloads get an identity from this provider. A workload must meet every condition, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. It's generated from the EKS clusters you entered. You can edit it later.":"Die Attestierungsrichtlinie steuert, welche Workloads eine Identität von diesem Anbieter erhalten. Ein Workload muss alle Bedingungen erfüllen, für die der Dienst, der ihn hostet, bürgt. Sie wird aus den EKS-Clustern generiert, die Sie eingegeben haben. Sie können sie später bearbeiten.","The attestation policy lists the facts a workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so a workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.":"Die Bescheinigungsrichtlinie listet die Fakten auf, die ein Workload nachweisen muss, bevor dieser Anbieter ihm eine Identität ausstellt. Die Rechenplattform bürgt für sie, sodass ein Workload keine Identität beanspruchen kann, die nicht seine eigene ist.","The attester vouches for the workload, and it must match every condition to run as this identity.":"Der Attester bürgt für die Workload, und sie muss jede Bedingung erfüllen, um als diese Identität ausgeführt zu werden.","The certificate authority is still being set up.":"Die Zertifizierungsstelle befindet sich noch im Aufbau.","The ID at the end of the certificate authority's ARN in AWS Private CA.":"Die ID am Ende des ARN der Zertifizierungsstelle in AWS Private CA.","The identity name is the provider's naming scheme, a path prefix, and a path pattern.":"Der Identitätsname ist das Benennungsschema des Anbieters, ein Pfadpräfix und ein Pfadmuster.","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag key is 128.":"Die maximale Anzahl von Zeichen, die Sie in einem Tag-Schlüssel verwenden können, beträgt 128.","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag value is 256.":"Die maximale Anzahl von Zeichen, die Sie in einem Tag-Wert verwenden können, beträgt 256.","The path can be up to {{maxLength}} characters.":"Der Pfad kann bis zu {{maxLength}} Zeichen lang sein.","The path doesn't support these segments: {{segments}}. Remove them, and add what you need from the following cards.":"Der Pfad unterstützt diese Segmente nicht: {{segments}}. Entfernen Sie sie und fügen Sie hinzu, was Sie von den folgenden Karten benötigen.","The path is already the default.":"Der Pfad ist bereits der Standardpfad.","The path is the per-workload part of each identity's name. Keep the Region in front so names stay unique across accounts and Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.":"Der Pfad ist der Teil des Namens jeder Identität pro Workload. Halten Sie die Region vorne, damit die Namen in allen Konten und Regionen eindeutig bleiben, oder ordnen Sie die Segmente neu an, um sie an die Namenskonvention Ihres Teams anzupassen.","The path prefixes your policy allows":"Die Pfadpräfixe, die Ihre Richtlinie zulässt","The permissions defined in this policy for <b>{{providerName}}</b> stop applying.":"Die in dieser Richtlinie für <b>{{providerName}}</b> definierten Berechtigungen gelten nicht mehr.","The provider could not be deleted. Try again.":"Der Anbieter konnte nicht gelöscht werden. Versuchen Sie es erneut.","The provider is being created. Wait for the request to finish.":"Der Provider wird gerade erstellt. Warten Sie, bis die Anforderung abgeschlossen ist.","The provider might still be deleted. Check the providers list later.":"Der Anbieter wurde möglicherweise dennoch gelöscht. Überprüfen Sie später die Anbieterliste.","The resource policy on this provider controls who can associate templates with it.":"Die Ressourcenrichtlinie dieses Anbieters legt fest, wer ihm Vorlagen zuordnen kann.","The soonest the new certificate can take over. It publishes to the trust bundle first, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. Signing may start later than this, never sooner.":"Der frühestmögliche Zeitpunkt, zu dem das neue Zertifikat übernehmen kann. Es wird zunächst im Vertrauenspaket veröffentlicht, damit alle Verifizierer es überprüfen können, bevor damit etwas signiert wird. Die Signierung kann später beginnen, aber niemals früher.","The soonest this certificate can start signing. It publishes to the trust bundle first, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. Signing may start later than this, never sooner.":"Der frühestmögliche Zeitpunkt, zu dem dieses Zertifikat mit dem Signieren beginnen kann. Es wird zunächst im Vertrauensspeicher veröffentlicht, damit alle Verifizierer es überprüfen können, bevor damit etwas signiert wird. Die Signierung kann später beginnen, aber niemals früher.",Theme:iDt,"There was an error loading the code editor.":"Beim Laden des Code Editors ist ein Fehler aufgetreten.","These clusters set the template's <policyLink>attestation policy</policyLink>.":"Diese Cluster legen die <policyLink>Attestierungsrichtlinie</policyLink> der Vorlage fest.","These resources need to be deleted before deleting the provider.":"Diese Ressourcen müssen gelöscht werden, bevor der Anbieter gelöscht wird.","This account ({{accountId}})":"Dieses Konto ({{accountId}})","This action deletes the workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.":"Diese Aktion löscht den Workload-Identitätsanbieter <b>{{providerName}}</b>.","This cannot be undone, and creating a provider with the same name later does not restore anything. To proceed, complete the steps below.":"Dies kann nicht rückgängig gemacht werden, und wenn Sie später einen Anbieter mit demselben Namen erstellen, wird nichts wiederhergestellt. Gehen Sie wie folgt vor, um fortzufahren.","This cannot be undone, and the path this template reserved stays reserved. No future template can generate identities under it.":"Dieser Vorgang kann nicht rückgängig gemacht werden, und der Pfad, den diese Vorlage reserviert hat, bleibt reserviert. Keine zukünftige Vorlage kann darunter Identitäten generieren.","This cannot be undone, and this name stays reserved. It is never issued again, so you cannot recreate this identity under the same name.":"Dieser Vorgang kann nicht rückgängig gemacht werden, und dieser Name bleibt reserviert. Er wird nie wieder ausgestellt, daher können Sie diese Identität nicht unter demselben Namen neu erstellen.","This certificate authority uses {{caAlgorithm}}. Rotation keeps the signer's {{signerAlgorithm}} algorithm, so choose a {{signerAlgorithm}} certificate authority instead.":"Diese Zertifizierungsstelle verwendet {{caAlgorithm}}. Die Rotation behält den {{signerAlgorithm}}-Algorithmus des Unterzeichners bei. Wählen Sie daher stattdessen eine {{signerAlgorithm}}-Zertifizierungsstelle aus.","This certificate has left the trust bundle, so it publishes again first. Signing starts after about {{hours}} hour, once every region has it.":"Dieses Zertifikat hat das Vertrauenspaket verlassen und wird daher zuerst erneut veröffentlicht. Die Signierung beginnt nach ca. {{hours}} Stunde, sobald das Zertifikat in allen Regionen verfügbar ist.","This certificate has left the trust bundle, so it publishes again first. Signing starts after about {{hours}} hours, once every region has it.":"Dieses Zertifikat hat das Vertrauenspaket verlassen und wird daher zuerst erneut veröffentlicht. Die Signierung beginnt nach ca. {{hours}} Stunden, sobald das Zertifikat in allen Regionen verfügbar ist.","This certificate is validating, so deleting it stops verification immediately":"Dieses Zertifikat ist gültig, daher wird die Überprüfung sofort beendet, wenn Sie es löschen.","This certificate stopped signing and its chain has left the trust bundle, so nothing verifies against it. It stays listed as history until you delete it, and deleting it is safe: no credential depends on it, and the certificate signer keeps signing.":"Dieses Zertifikat hat die Signierung eingestellt, und seine Kette hat das Vertrauenspaket verlassen, sodass nichts dagegen verifiziert werden kann. Es bleibt so lange im Verlauf aufgeführt, bis Sie es löschen. Das Löschen ist sicher: Es hängen keine Anmeldeinformationen davon ab, und der Unterzeichner signiert weiter.","This cluster is already listed.":"Dieser Cluster ist bereits aufgeführt.","This condition key and operator combination already exists":"Eine Bedingung mit dieser Schlüssel- und Operatorkombination ist bereits vorhanden","This doesn't look like a valid EKS cluster ARN. An invalid ARN will leave workloads in that cluster without an identity.":"Das sieht nicht nach einem gültigen EKS-Cluster-ARN aus. Ein ungültiger ARN führt dazu, dass Workloads in diesem Cluster keine Identität mehr haben.","This management account and delegated administrators":"Dieses Verwaltungskonto und delegierte Administratoren","This organization ({{organizationId}})":"Diese Organisation ({{organizationId}})","This policy's cluster ARNs don't match the clusters you entered. Changing the clusters won't update this policy. Continue only if that's intended.":"Die Cluster-ARNs dieser Richtlinie stimmen nicht mit den Clustern überein, die Sie eingegeben haben. Durch eine Änderung der Cluster wird diese Richtlinie nicht aktualisiert. Fahren Sie nur fort, wenn dies beabsichtigt ist.","This provider has no naming scheme, so the path you enter is the full identity name.":"Dieser Anbieter hat kein Benennungsschema, daher ist der von Ihnen eingegebene Pfad der vollständige Identitätsname.","This provider names every identity using the open standard.":"Dieser Anbieter benennt jede Identität unter Verwendung des offenen Standards.","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. Both certificates below stop, including the one still in transition, so the update does not complete. Both stay configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"Dieser Anbieter stellt ab sofort keine X.509-SVIDs mehr aus. Workloads, die ein Clientzertifikat benötigen, schlagen bei ihrer nächsten Anfrage fehl. Beide nachstehenden Zertifikate werden gestoppt, einschließlich des noch in der Übergangsphase befindlichen, sodass die Aktualisierung nicht abgeschlossen wird. Beide bleiben konfiguriert. Bereits ausgestellte Zertifikate bleiben etwa 12 Stunden lang verifizierbar. Mit „Aktivieren“ wird die Signierung fortgesetzt.","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"Dieser Anbieter stellt ab sofort keine X.509-SVIDs mehr aus. Workloads, die ein Clientzertifikat benötigen, schlagen bei ihrer nächsten Anfrage fehl. Das nachstehende Zertifikat bleibt konfiguriert. Bereits ausgestellte Zertifikate bleiben etwa 12 Stunden lang verifizierbar. Mit „Aktivieren“ wird die Signierung fortgesetzt.","This provider's policy doesn't allow this path prefix \"{{pathPrefix}}\" for your account. Ask your organization administrator which path prefixes are permitted.":"Die Richtlinie dieses Anbieters erlaubt dieses Pfadpräfix „{{pathPrefix}}“ nicht für Ihr Konto. Fragen Sie Ihren Unternehmensadministrator, welche Pfadpräfixe zulässig sind.","This removes the certificate from the provider and pulls its chain from the trust bundle immediately. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"Dadurch wird das Zertifikat vom Anbieter entfernt und die zugehörige Kette wird sofort aus dem Vertrauenspaket entfernt. Die Zertifizierungsstelle selbst verbleibt unverändert in AWS Private CA.","This removes the certificate from the provider. Its chain already left the trust bundle, so nothing that is verifying today changes. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"Dadurch wird das Zertifikat vom Anbieter entfernt. Seine Kette hat das Vertrauenspaket bereits verlassen, sodass sich nichts, was heute verifiziert wird, ändert. Die Zertifizierungsstelle selbst verbleibt unverändert in AWS Private CA.","This tag will be removed upon saving changes":"Dieses Tag wird beim Speichern der Änderungen entfernt","This usually takes a few minutes. Keep this page open until it finishes.":"Dies dauert in der Regel ein paar Minuten. Lassen Sie diese Seite geöffnet, bis es fertig ist.",Today:rDt,"Too many requests":"Zu viele Anfragen","Trace and control access per workload":"Verfolgen und kontrollieren Sie den Zugriff pro Workload","Trust bundle":"Vertrauenspaket","trust domain":"Vertrauensdomain","Trust domain":"Vertrauensdomain","Trust domain is the root of trust for the SPIFFE naming scheme. It is a logical name that follows DNS naming style, for example prod.acme.com, but does not need to match a real DNS record.":"Die Vertrauensdomain ist die Vertrauensbasis für das SPIFFE-Benennungsschema. Es ist ein logischer Name, der dem DNS-Benennungsstil folgt, z. B. prod.acme.com, der jedoch nicht mit einem echten DNS-Eintrag übereinstimmen muss.","Try again. If the problem continues, contact AWS Support.":"Versuchen Sie es erneut. Wenn das Problem weiterhin besteht, wenden Sie sich an den AWS Support.","Unable to load templates":"Vorlagen können nicht geladen werden",Undo:oDt,"Up to 128 characters. Must be unique per provider.":"Bis zu 128 Zeichen. Muss pro Anbieter eindeutig sein.","Up to 128 characters. Use alphanumeric and '-_.' characters. Must be unique in your organization. Can't be changed after the provider is created.":"Bis zu 128 Zeichen. Verwenden Sie alphanumerische Zeichen und „-_.“-Zeichen. Muss in Ihrer Organisation eindeutig sein. Kann nicht geändert werden, nachdem der Provider erstellt wurde.","Up to 128 characters. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters. Must be unique per provider.":'Bis zu 128 Zeichen. Verwenden Sie alphanumerische Zeichen und "-_"-Zeichen. Muss pro Anbieter eindeutig sein.',Update:sDt,"Update certificate signer":"Unterzeichner des Zertifikats aktualisieren",'Use "{{key}}"':"„{{key}}“ verwenden",'Use "{{value}}"':"„{{value}}“ verwenden","Use case":"Anwendungsfall","Use cases":"Anwendungsfälle","Use default templates":"Standardvorlagen verwenden","Use letters, digits, and . - _ characters, with a single / between parts. No / at the start or end, and a part can't be . or ..":"Verwenden Sie Buchstaben, Zahlen und die Zeichen . - _, mit einem einzelnen / zwischen den Teilen. Kein / am Anfang oder Ende, und ein Teil darf nicht . oder .. sein.","Use one from another account":"Verwenden Sie eines von einem anderen Konto","Use only Latin letters, numbers, spaces, tabs, line breaks, and standard keyboard symbols.":"Verwenden Sie nur lateinische Buchstaben, Zahlen, Leerzeichen, Tabulatoren, Zeilenumbrüche und Standardtastatursymbole.","Use only letters, digits, - and _ characters.":"Verwenden Sie nur Buchstaben, Ziffern sowie die Zeichen - und _.","Use only letters, digits, . - and _ characters. The path can't be . or ..":"Verwenden Sie nur Buchstaben, Ziffern und die Zeichen ., - und _. Der Pfad kann nicht . oder .. sein.","Use only letters, digits, periods (.), hyphens (-), and underscores (_).":"Verwenden Sie nur Buchstaben, Ziffern, Punkte (.), Bindestriche (-) und Unterstriche (_).","Use the workload identity in trust policies, resource policies, or SCPs. Each call is recorded in CloudTrail with the workload's identity.":"Verwenden Sie die Workload-Identität in Vertrauensrichtlinien, Ressourcenrichtlinien oder SCPs. Jeder Aufruf wird in CloudTrail mit der Identität des Workloads aufgezeichnet.",'Use: "{{text}}"':"„{{text}}“ verwenden","Used as the common name in the certificate authority's subject.":"Wird als allgemeiner Name im Betreff der Zertifizierungsstelle verwendet.",Validating:lDt,"Validating: stopped signing, still trusted":"Validierung: signiert nicht mehr, ist immer noch vertrauenswürdig",Value:cDt,"Value must be 256 characters or less.":"Der Wert darf maximal 256 Zeichen lang sein.",Values:dDt,"View all":"Alles anzeigen","View all notifications":"Alle Benachrichtigungen anzeigen","View JSON":"JSON anzeigen",Visual:uDt,Warning:pDt,Warnings:hDt,"What gets created":"Was wird erstellt?","Which EKS clusters is this provider for?":"Für welche EKS-Cluster ist dieser Anbieter geeignet?",'Wildcard "*" is only allowed with the StringLike, StringNotLike, ArnLike, or ArnNotLike operators.':"Der Platzhalter „*“ ist nur bei den Operatoren StringLike, StringNotLike, ArnLike oder ArnNotLike zulässig.","Without a policy, no other account can create templates under this provider, though delegated administrators can already create both. Add a statement for each account, organizational unit, or IAM principal that should be able to, and limit each one to a path prefix.":"Ohne eine Richtlinie kann kein anderes Konto Vorlagen unter diesem Anbieter erstellen, obwohl delegierte Administratoren bereits Vorlagen und Workload-Identitäten erstellen können. Fügen Sie für jedes Konto, jede Organisationseinheit oder jeden IAM-Prinzipal, der das können sollte, eine Anweisung hinzu, und beschränken Sie jede Anweisung auf ein Pfadpräfix.","Workload identities ({{total}})":"Workload-Identitäten ({{total}})","Workload identities in the IAM User Guide":"Workload-Identitäten im IAM-Benutzerhandbuch","Workload identities in the IAM User Guide (opens in a new tab)":"Workload-Identitäten im IAM-Benutzerhandbuch (wird auf einer neuen Registerkarte geöffnet)","Workload identities: {{reason}}":"Workload-Identitäten: {{reason}}","Workload identity":"Workload-Identität","Workload Identity":"Workload-Identität","Workload identity {{name}}: {{reason}}":"Workload-Identität {{name}}: {{reason}}","Workload identity {{workloadIdentifier}} deleted.":"Die Workload-Identität {{workloadIdentifier}} wurde gelöscht.","Workloads get named automatically":"Workloads werden automatisch benannt","Workloads in these EKS clusters can get an identity from this provider, when all of these are true:":"Workloads in diesen EKS-Clustern können von diesem Anbieter eine Identität erhalten, wenn alle diese Bedingungen zutreffen:","Workloads running in these clusters can get an identity from this provider. Add 2 or more.":"Workloads, die in diesen Clustern ausgeführt werden, können von diesem Anbieter eine Identität erhalten. Fügen Sie 2 oder mehr hinzu.","Workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Workloads, die in diesem Konto ausgeführt werden, können Identitäten verwenden, die von dieser Vorlage anhand von Informationen, die von {{workloadLabel}} verifiziert wurden, generiert wurden.","Workloads running in this cluster can get an identity from this provider.":"Workloads, die in diesem Cluster ausgeführt werden, können von diesem Anbieter eine Identität erhalten.","Workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Workloads, die in Ihrer Organisation ausgeführt werden, können Identitäten verwenden, die von dieser Vorlage anhand von Informationen, die von {{workloadLabel}} verifiziert wurden, generiert wurden.","Workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request":"Workloads, die diese Identitäten verwenden, erhalten keine Anmeldeinformationen mehr und schlagen bei ihrer nächsten Anfrage fehl","Workloads, such as agents, pods, and jobs, are verified at runtime and get a workload identity, one per workload, generated by a template. The identity gets fine-grained access to AWS resources through IAM policies and CloudTrail, and signed JWT and X.509 credentials for meshes and SaaS apps.":"Workloads wie Agenten, Pods und Jobs werden zur Laufzeit verifiziert und erhalten eine Workload-Identität, eine pro Workload, die anhand einer Vorlage generiert wird. Die Identität erhält über IAM-Richtlinien und CloudTrail einen fein abgestuften Zugriff auf AWS-Ressourcen sowie signierte JWT- und X.509-Anmeldeinformationen für Meshes und SaaS-Apps.","Wrap lines":"Zeilen umbrechen","Write a policy to let another account create templates, or to stop a delegated administrator from part of the name space. Each statement names an organizational unit, specific accounts, or individual IAM principals, allows or denies, and can be limited to a path prefix.":"Schreiben Sie eine Richtlinie, die es einem anderen Konto ermöglicht, Vorlagen zu erstellen, oder um einen delegierten Administrator daran zu hindern, einen Teil des Namespaces zu nutzen. Jede Anweisung benennt eine Organisationseinheit, bestimmte Konten oder einzelne IAM-Prinzipale, erlaubt oder verweigert und kann auf ein Pfadpräfix beschränkt werden.","Yes by default":"Standardmäßig Ja","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tag.":"Sie können bis zu {{availableTags}} weiteres Tag hinzufügen.","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tags.":"Sie können bis zu {{availableTags}} weitere Tags hinzufügen.","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"Das Limit von {{tagLimit}} Tag ist überschritten.","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"Sie haben das Limit von {{tagLimit}} Tags überschritten.","You have more keys than can be displayed":"Sie haben mehr Schlüssel, als angezeigt werden können","You have more values than can be displayed":"Sie haben mehr Werte, als angezeigt werden können","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"Das Limit von {{tagLimit}} Tag ist erreicht.","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"Sie haben das Limit von {{tagLimit}} Tags erreicht.","You have unsaved tag changes. Leave this page and discard them?":"Sie haben ungespeicherte Tag-Änderungen. Diese Seite verlassen und die Änderungen verwerfen?","You must enter a path":"Sie müssen einen Pfad eingeben.","You must specify a condition key":"Sie müssen einen Bedingungsschlüssel angeben","You must specify a tag key":"Sie müssen einen Tag-Schlüssel angeben","You must specify a unique tag key.":"Sie müssen einen eindeutigen Tag-Schlüssel angeben.","You must specify a value":"Sie müssen einen Wert angeben","Your administrator decides which prefixes this account can use. This is checked when you create.":"Ihr Administrator entscheidet, welche Präfixe dieses Konto verwenden kann. Dies wird bei der Erstellung überprüft.","Your identities will be <code>{{prefix}}<em>{{placeholder}}</em></code>":"Ihre Identitäten lauten <code>{{prefix}}<em>{{placeholder}}</em></code>","Your organization already has a workload identity provider. Add templates under it to start issuing identities to your workloads — each named under your account's path prefix.":"Ihre Organisation hat bereits einen Workload-Identitätsanbieter. Fügen Sie Vorlagen darunter hinzu, um mit der Vergabe von Identitäten für Ihre Workloads zu beginnen. Diese sind jeweils unter dem Pfadpräfix Ihres Kontos benannt.","Your organization has workload identity providers you can use. Pick one and add templates under it to start issuing identities to your workloads.":"Ihre Organisation verfügt über Workload-Identitätsanbieter, die Sie verwenden können. Wählen Sie einen aus und fügen Sie Vorlagen darunter hinzu, um mit der Vergabe von Identitäten für Ihre Workloads zu beginnen.","YYYY/MM/DD":"JJJJ/MM/TT","{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.","A declared identity has a fixed name you define. Use one when you need an exact name, for example to match a name another system already expects.":"A declared identity has a fixed name you define. Use one when you need an exact name, for example to match a name another system already expects.","A fact {{workload}} checks when the agent or workload starts.":"A fact {{workload}} checks when the agent or workload starts.","A provider issues secure, verifiable identities to your agents and workloads, like your Kubernetes pods or AI agents, to access AWS and third-party services without long-lived credentials.":"A provider issues secure, verifiable identities to your agents and workloads, like your Kubernetes pods or AI agents, to access AWS and third-party services without long-lived credentials.","A template automatically generates an identity for each matching agent or workload under {{providerName}}.":"A template automatically generates an identity for each matching agent or workload under {{providerName}}.","A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued.":"A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued.","A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued. Decide how this provider issues identities - starting from the <link>default templates</link> for common use cases, or skipping them. Templates are optional and can be added later.":"A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued. Decide how this provider issues identities - starting from the <link>default templates</link> for common use cases, or skipping them. Templates are optional and can be added later.","A template names identities automatically as matching agents and workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.":"A template names identities automatically as matching agents and workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.","A template with no attestation policy matches no agent or workload, so nothing is ever issued from it. Set a policy to define which agents and workloads qualify.":"A template with no attestation policy matches no agent or workload, so nothing is ever issued from it. Set a policy to define which agents and workloads qualify.","A template's path pattern, built from facts like cluster, namespace, and service account, names each agent or workload automatically when it starts. You don't create identities ahead of time.":"A template's path pattern, built from facts like cluster, namespace, and service account, names each agent or workload automatically when it starts. You don't create identities ahead of time.","Add a fact or condition key. A path of only custom text would give every agent or workload the same name.":"Add a fact or condition key. A path of only custom text would give every agent or workload the same name.","Add an {{conditionKey}} condition, so only agents or workloads in these clusters get an identity.":"Add an {{conditionKey}} condition, so only agents or workloads in these clusters get an identity.","Add attestation policy":"Add attestation policy","Add templates after the provider is created.":"Add templates after the provider is created.","Agent and workload identity":"Agent and workload identity","Agent and workload identity - <em>Preview</em>":"Agent and workload identity - <em>Preview</em>","Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide":"Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide","Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide (opens in a new tab)":"Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide (opens in a new tab)","Agents and workloads get named automatically":"Agents and workloads get named automatically","Agents and workloads get short-lived credentials that renew automatically and follow the SPIFFE standard, so they work with service meshes such as Istio and with business applications.":"Agents and workloads get short-lived credentials that renew automatically and follow the SPIFFE standard, so they work with service meshes such as Istio and with business applications.","Agents and workloads in these EKS clusters can get an identity from this provider, when all of these are true:":"Agents and workloads in these EKS clusters can get an identity from this provider, when all of these are true:","Agents and workloads running in these clusters can get an identity from this provider. Add two or more.":"Agents and workloads running in these clusters can get an identity from this provider. Add two or more.","Agents and workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Agents and workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.","Agents and workloads running in this cluster can get an identity from this provider.":"Agents and workloads running in this cluster can get an identity from this provider.","Agents and workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Agents and workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.","Agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request":"Agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request","Agents and workloads, such as AI agents and pods, are verified at runtime and each gets its own identity, generated by a template. The identity gets fine-grained access to AWS resources through IAM policies and CloudTrail, and signed JWT and X.509 credentials for meshes and apps.":"Agents and workloads, such as AI agents and pods, are verified at runtime and each gets its own identity, generated by a template. The identity gets fine-grained access to AWS resources through IAM policies and CloudTrail, and signed JWT and X.509 credentials for meshes and apps.","All templates and identities under this provider will be deleted":"All templates and identities under this provider will be deleted","An AI agent or workload gets an identity that is unique.":"An AI agent or workload gets an identity that is unique.","An identity with no attestation policy admits no workload, so nothing can run as it. Set a policy to define which workload qualifies.":"An identity with no attestation policy admits no workload, so nothing can run as it. Set a policy to define which workload qualifies.","An identity with this name already exists.":"An identity with this name already exists.","At runtime the platform attests these facts about the agent or workload. Any agent or workload whose attestation carries them gets an identity issued from this template.":"At runtime the platform attests these facts about the agent or workload. Any agent or workload whose attestation carries them gets an identity issued from this template.","Attestation policy for {{name}} has been removed.":"Attestation policy for {{name}} has been removed.","Attestation policy for {{name}} has been updated.":"Attestation policy for {{name}} has been updated.","By continuing, you also enable organization level resource creation, which is needed to create the organization scoped provider. You can disable it later in Settings.":"By continuing, you also enable organization level resource creation, which is needed to create the organization scoped provider. You can disable it later in Settings.","Change the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.":"Change the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.","Choose a stable, unique name that identifies one environment or group of agents and workloads, for example prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal.":"Choose a stable, unique name that identifies one environment or group of agents and workloads, for example prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal.","Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for an agent or workload.":"Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for an agent or workload.","Choose the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.":"Choose the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.","Choose where the workload is hosted":"Choose where the workload is hosted","Choose who can use it":"Choose who can use it","Control what an agent or workload can reach with familiar IAM policies and see its AWS calls in CloudTrail.":"Control what an agent or workload can reach with familiar IAM policies and see its AWS calls in CloudTrail.","Create declared identity":"Create declared identity","Creates an agent and workload identity provider and template for agents and workloads running in one or more EKS clusters under a service mesh, such as Istio.":"Creates an agent and workload identity provider and template for agents and workloads running in one or more EKS clusters under a service mesh, such as Istio.","Creating the identity":"Creating the identity","Declare an identity with the exact name you need":"Declare an identity with the exact name you need","Declared identities":"Declared identities","Declared identity":"Declared identity","Declared identity {{name}} created.":"Declared identity {{name}} created.","Define which agents and workloads are allowed to use this template.":"Define which agents and workloads are allowed to use this template.","Delete the templates under <b>{{providerName}}</b> before deleting the provider. Once deleted, agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials and fail on their next request, and access that you granted to these identities will stop working.":"Delete the templates under <b>{{providerName}}</b> before deleting the provider. Once deleted, agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials and fail on their next request, and access that you granted to these identities will stop working.","Deleting templates and identities":"Deleting templates and identities","Each identity is fully the template path.":"Each identity is fully the template path.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.","Enter a description":"Enter a description","Failed to create the declared identity.":"Failed to create the declared identity.","Failed to save attestation policy.":"Failed to save attestation policy.","Filter declared identities":"Filter declared identities","For example, to match a name another system already expects.":"For example, to match a name another system already expects.","from provider":"from provider","Give AI agents and workloads their own identities. Know which of them made each call. Scope its access with the IAM policies you already use.":"Give AI agents and workloads their own identities. Know which of them made each call. Scope its access with the IAM policies you already use.","Give an agent or workload a unique identity, so you can grant it access and audit what it did rather than sharing one role.":"Give an agent or workload a unique identity, so you can grant it access and audit what it did rather than sharing one role.","Grant access":"Grant access","Grant this name access to resources in IAM policies.":"Grant this name access to resources in IAM policies.","IAM for agents and workloads":"IAM for agents and workloads","IAM for agents and workloads (opens in a new tab)":"IAM for agents and workloads (opens in a new tab)",Identifier:mDt,"Identities ({{total}})":"Identities ({{total}})","Identities are issued at runtime from facts the agent or workload proves, rather than from what an admin assigns.":"Identities are issued at runtime from facts the agent or workload proves, rather than from what an admin assigns.","Identities for agents":"Identities for agents","Identities: {{reason}}":"Identities: {{reason}}","Identity {{name}}: {{reason}}":"Identity {{name}}: {{reason}}","Invalid trust domain. Use lowercase alphanumeric and '-.' characters.":"Invalid trust domain. Use lowercase alphanumeric and '-.' characters.","Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's agents and workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. Standard pricing applies to the creation and use of AWS Private CA.":"Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's agents and workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. Standard pricing applies to the creation and use of AWS Private CA.","It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so agents and workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. To avoid this, wait until it becomes inactive on its own. Deleting it then has no effect on verification.":"It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so agents and workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. To avoid this, wait until it becomes inactive on its own. Deleting it then has no effect on verification.","Let agents and workloads reach non-AWS resources":"Let agents and workloads reach non-AWS resources","Loading declared identities":"Loading declared identities","Matching agents and workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.":"Matching agents and workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.","No agent and workload identity providers":"No agent and workload identity providers","No agent or workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.":"No agent or workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.","No attestation policy attached.":"No attestation policy attached.","No attestation policy. No agent or workload will be issued an identity from this template until you add one.":"No attestation policy. No agent or workload will be issued an identity from this template until you add one.","No conditions. This policy matches every agent or workload of its service.":"No conditions. This policy matches every agent or workload of its service.","No segments yet. Add at least one, or every agent or workload this template matches resolves to the same name.":"No segments yet. Add at least one, or every agent or workload this template matches resolves to the same name.","None – names are defined by templates":"None – names are defined by templates","Nothing can run as this identity":"Nothing can run as this identity","Once the attestation policy is removed, matching agents and workloads will not be issued agent and workload identities until you add a policy again.":"Once the attestation policy is removed, matching agents and workloads will not be issued agent and workload identities until you add a policy again.","One bundle per provider, and one URL. It carries every authority the provider publishes: both outbound signers, and during an update both the current and incoming certificate authority, which is what lets verifiers accept either one through the handover. Your own AWS agents and workloads get these keys automatically; send this to systems outside AWS.":"One bundle per provider, and one URL. It carries every authority the provider publishes: both outbound signers, and during an update both the current and incoming certificate authority, which is what lets verifiers accept either one through the handover. Your own AWS agents and workloads get these keys automatically; send this to systems outside AWS.","One provider and one trust domain shared by every EKS cluster in the mesh. An agent or workload with the same namespace and service account in any of these clusters shares one identity.":"One provider and one trust domain shared by every EKS cluster in the mesh. An agent or workload with the same namespace and service account in any of these clusters shares one identity.","Path is the unique part of each identity's name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts an agent or workload proves.":"Path is the unique part of each identity's name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts an agent or workload proves.","path prefix":"path prefix","Policy: Define how an agent or workload attests to get the identity":"Policy: Define how an agent or workload attests to get the identity","Proven at runtime":"Proven at runtime","Providers to issue agent and workload identities":"Providers to issue agent and workload identities","Scoped, auditable access":"Scoped, auditable access","Search by name":"Search by name","Set the exact name":"Set the exact name","Set the naming format and usage scope that every agent and workload identity from this provider inherits.":"Set the naming format and usage scope that every agent and workload identity from this provider inherits.","Set the unique path pattern that every identity generated by this template follows. Cannot be changed later.":"Set the unique path pattern that every identity generated by this template follows. Cannot be changed later.","Set up a provider to hold the templates that generate identity names and the signers that sign credentials for systems outside AWS.":"Set up a provider to hold the templates that generate identity names and the signers that sign credentials for systems outside AWS.","Set up a way to issue agent and workload identities":"Set up a way to issue agent and workload identities","Set which workloads can use this identity and where they must run.":"Set which workloads can use this identity and where they must run.","Stop matching agents and workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request":"Stop matching agents and workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request","Templates give matching agents and workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.":"Templates give matching agents and workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it.":"The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.":"The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Generated from the EKS clusters above. Can be edited later.":"The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Generated from the EKS clusters above. Can be edited later.","The attestation policy controls how this identity is issued. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.":"The attestation policy controls how this identity is issued. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.","The attestation policy is the set of facts an agent or workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so an agent or workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.":"The attestation policy is the set of facts an agent or workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so an agent or workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.","The certificate chain is distributing to every Region, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. It starts signing at {{at}}. That is the minimum signing delay you set, so signing may start later than this. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.":"The certificate chain is distributing to every Region, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. It starts signing at {{at}}. That is the minimum signing delay you set, so signing may start later than this. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.","The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Account ID and Region in front so names stay unique across accounts and Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.":"The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Account ID and Region in front so names stay unique across accounts and Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.","The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Region in front so names stay unique across Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.":"The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Region in front so names stay unique across Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.","This action deletes the agent and workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.":"This action deletes the agent and workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.","This certificate has stopped signing, but its chain stays in the trust bundle so certificates already issued under it keep verifying. It becomes inactive at {{at}}. Until then, Enable resumes signing with no wait. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.":"This certificate has stopped signing, but its chain stays in the trust bundle so certificates already issued under it keep verifying. It becomes inactive at {{at}}. Until then, Enable resumes signing with no wait. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.","This doesn't look like a valid EKS cluster ARN. An invalid ARN will leave agents or workloads in that cluster without an identity.":"This doesn't look like a valid EKS cluster ARN. An invalid ARN will leave agents or workloads in that cluster without an identity.","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. Both certificates below stop, including the one still in transition, so the update does not complete. Both stay configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. Both certificates below stop, including the one still in transition, so the update does not complete. Both stay configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.","This template issues no identities":"This template issues no identities","Trust domain must be 64 characters or less.":"Trust domain must be 64 characters or less.","Use the agent or workload identity in trust policies, resource policies, or SCPs. CloudTrail records its calls with that identity.":"Use the agent or workload identity in trust policies, resource policies, or SCPs. CloudTrail records its calls with that identity.","What conditions should the agent or workload match?":"What conditions should the agent or workload match?","Where is the agent or workload hosted?":"Where is the agent or workload hosted?","You must enter a name":"You must enter a name","Your organization already has an agent and workload identity provider. Add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads — each named under your account's path prefix.":"Your organization already has an agent and workload identity provider. Add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads — each named under your account's path prefix.","Your organization has agent and workload identity providers you can use. Pick one and add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads.":"Your organization has agent and workload identity providers you can use. Pick one and add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads."},vDt=Object.freeze(Object.defineProperty({__proto__:null,ARN:"ARN",Actions:QTt,Active:eIt,Add:tIt,Apply:aIt,Attestation:nIt,Cancel:iIt,Clear:rIt,Close:oIt,Configured:sIt,Confirm:lIt,Contains:cIt,Created:dIt,Delete:uIt,Description:pIt,Details:hIt,Disable:mIt,Dismiss:gIt,Edit:vIt,Editing:fIt,Enable:yIt,Equals:wIt,Errors:kIt,Format:SIt,Identifier:mDt,Inactive:_It,Info:xIt,JWKS:AIt,Key:EIt,Name:CIt,New:"Neu",None:TIt,Notifications:IIt,Operator:DIt,Operators:LIt,Path:MIt,Preferences:zIt,Preview:OIt,Properties:BIt,Property:FIt,Provided:$It,Provider:jIt,Providers:WIt,Ready:qIt,Recommended:UIt,Refresh:VIt,Remove:HIt,Retry:KIt,Save:GIt,Scheme:JIt,Scope:ZIt,Status:XIt,Subject:QIt,Success:eDt,Tags:tDt,Template:aDt,Templates:nDt,Theme:iDt,Today:rDt,Undo:oDt,Update:sDt,Validating:lDt,Value:cDt,Values:dDt,Visual:uDt,Warning:pDt,Warnings:hDt,and:"und",default:gDt,equals:bIt,optional:PIt,or:NIt,path:RIt,scheme:YIt},Symbol.toStringTag,{value:"Module"})),fDt="Acciones",yDt="Activo",bDt="Agregar",wDt="Aplicar",kDt="Verificación",SDt="Cancelar",_Dt="Borrar",xDt="Cerrar",ADt="Configurado",EDt="Confirmar",CDt="Contiene",TDt="Creado",IDt="Eliminar",DDt="Descripción",LDt="Detalles",PDt="Desactivar",NDt="Descartar",RDt="Editar",MDt="Editando",zDt="Habilitar",ODt="es igual a",BDt="Igual a",FDt="Errores",$Dt="Formato",jDt="Inactivo",WDt="Información",qDt="JWKS",UDt="Clave",VDt="Nombre",HDt="Nuevo",KDt="Sin esquema",GDt="Notificaciones",YDt="Operador",JDt="Operadores",ZDt="opcional",XDt="Ruta",QDt="Ruta",eLt="Preferencias",tLt="Vista previa",aLt="Propiedades",nLt="Propiedad",iLt="Proporcionado",rLt="Proveedor",oLt="Proveedores",sLt="Listo",lLt="Recomendado",cLt="Actualizar",dLt="Eliminar",uLt="Reintentar",pLt="Guardar",hLt="Esquema",mLt="Esquema",gLt="Alcance",vLt="Estado",fLt="Asunto",yLt="Éxito",bLt="Etiquetas",wLt="Plantilla",kLt="Plantillas",SLt="Tema",_Lt="Deshacer",xLt="Actualizar",ALt="Validando",ELt="Valor",CLt="Valores",TLt="Visual",ILt="Advertencia",DLt="Advertencias",LLt="Identifier",PLt={"'{{providerName}}' does not exist in your account":"“{{providerName}}” no existe en su cuenta","(earliest)":"(más temprano)","{{addedCount}} tag added or changed":"Se agregó o se cambió {{addedCount}} etiqueta","{{addedCount}} tags added or changed":"Se agregaron o se cambiaron {{addedCount}} etiquetas","{{createdCount}} templates created: {{templateNames}}.":"Se crearon {{createdCount}} plantillas: {{templateNames}}.","{{failed}} of {{total}} certificates could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}} de {{total}} certificados no se pudieron eliminar, por lo que no se eliminó el proveedor. Resuelva los errores e inténtelo de nuevo.","{{failed}} of {{total}} could not be deleted.":"No se pudieron eliminar {{failed}} de {{total}}.","{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and workload identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}} de {{total}} plantillas e identidades de carga de trabajo no se pudieron eliminar, por lo que no se eliminó el proveedor. Resuelva los errores e inténtelo de nuevo.","{{failedCount}} template could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.":"No se pudo crear {{failedCount}} plantilla(s). Revise los siguientes errores e inténtelo de nuevo.","{{failedCount}} templates could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.":"No se pudo crear {{failedCount}} plantilla(s). Revise los siguientes errores e inténtelo de nuevo.","{{identityCount}} identities":"{{identityCount}} identidades","{{identityCount}} identity":"{{identityCount}} identidad","{{label}} (service mesh)":"{{label}} (malla de servicios)","{{label}} copied":"{{label}} copiado","{{label}} failed to copy":"No se pudo copiar {{label}}","{{label}} template":"{{label}} plantilla","{{label}} template {{index}}":"Plantilla de {{label}} {{index}}","{{label}}:":"{{label}}:","{{matchCount}} match":"{{matchCount}} coincidencia","{{matchCount}} matches":"{{matchCount}} coincidencias","{{name}} has been successfully created.":"{{name}} se ha creado correctamente.","{{name}} has been successfully created. However, the following operations failed:":"{{name}} se creó correctamente. Sin embargo, fallaron las siguientes operaciones:","{{providerName}} still has these resources:":"{{providerName}} todavía tiene estos recursos:","{{removedCount}} tag removed":"Se eliminó {{removedCount}} etiqueta","{{removedCount}} tags removed":"Se eliminaron {{removedCount}} etiquetas","{{scope}} · {{domain}}":"{{scope}} · {{domain}}","{{settled}} of {{total}}":"{{settled}} de {{total}}","{{subject}}. Does not match this signer's {{algorithm}} algorithm.":"{{subject}}. No coincide con el algoritmo {{algorithm}} de este firmante.","{{tagCount}} tag":"{{tagCount}} etiqueta","{{tagCount}} tags":"{{tagCount}} etiquetas","{{templateCount}} template":"{{templateCount}} plantilla","{{templateCount}} templates":"{{templateCount}} plantillas","{{templateName}} template failed to create. To try again, <link>add templates</link>. Error details: {{reason}}":"No se pudo crear la plantilla {{templateName}}. Para volver a intentarlo, <link>agregue plantillas</link>. Detalles del error: {{reason}}","{{workload}} fact":"{{workload}} hecho","{defined by template}":"{defined by template}","<term>Support:</term> Amazon EKS, Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Runtime, and Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Gateway.":"<term>Compatibilidad:</term> Amazon EKS, Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Runtime y Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Gateway.","1 EKS cluster":"1 clúster de EKS","1 provider and 1 trust domain per EKS cluster. Each namespace and service account in this cluster gets its own identity, trusted only within this cluster.":"1 proveedor y 1 dominio de confianza por clúster de EKS. Cada espacio de nombres y cuenta de servicio de este clúster obtiene su propia identidad, en la que solo se puede confiar dentro de este clúster.","1 provider and 1 trust domain shared by every EKS cluster in the mesh. A workload with the same namespace and service account in any of these clusters shares one identity.":"Cada clúster de EKS de la malla comparte 1 proveedor y 1 dominio de confianza. Una carga de trabajo con el mismo espacio de nombres y cuenta de servicio en cualquiera de estos clústeres comparte una identidad.","1 to 48 hours, in whole hours. Publishing is usually much faster, but can take up to 24 hours.":"De 1 a 48 horas, sin decimales. La publicación suele tardar mucho menos, pero puede demorar hasta 24 horas.","1. Select all the check boxes to confirm what deleting {{providerName}} will do.":"1. Seleccione todas las casillas de verificación para confirmar lo que hará la eliminación de {{providerName}}.","2. Confirm that you want to delete this provider by typing {{providerName}} below.":"2. Confirme que desea eliminar este proveedor escribiendo {{providerName}} a continuación.","A declared identity has a fixed path you define. Use one when you need an exact path, for example to match a value another system already expects.":"Una identidad declarada tiene una ruta fija que usted define. Utilice una cuando necesite una ruta exacta, por ejemplo, para que coincida con un valor que otro sistema ya espera.","A deny, and only for delegated administrators":"Una denegación, y solo para administradores delegados","A fact {{workload}} checks when the workload starts.":"Un hecho {{workload}} comprueba cuándo comienza la carga de trabajo.","A fixed label, such as an environment name.":"Una etiqueta fija, como el nombre de un entorno.","A name to identify this identity.":"Un nombre para identificar esta identidad.","A provider with this name already exists.":"Ya existe un proveedor con este nombre.","A tag is a label you assign to an AWS resource. Each tag has a key and an optional value. Use tags to search and filter this provider, or to track your AWS costs.":"Una etiqueta es una marca que se asigna a un recurso de AWS. Cada etiqueta consta de una clave y un valor opcional. Puede usar etiquetas para buscar y filtrar este proveedor o hacer un seguimiento de los costes de AWS.","A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts a workload must prove before an identity is issued. Decide how this provider issues identities - starting from the <link>default templates</link> for common use cases, or skipping them. You can add and name identities manually at any time - templates are optional and can be added later.":"Una plantilla define el patrón de rutas que se utiliza para asignar nombres únicos a las identidades y los datos que debe demostrar una carga de trabajo antes de emitir una identidad. Decida cómo emite las identidades este proveedor, empezando por las <link>plantillas predeterminadas</link> para casos de uso comunes o bien omitiéndolas. Puede agregar identidades y asignarles nombres manualmente en cualquier momento; las plantillas son opcionales y se pueden agregar más adelante.","A template with this name already exists.":"Ya existe una plantilla con este nombre.","A template's path pattern, built from facts like cluster, namespace, and service account, names each workload automatically when it starts. You don't create identities ahead of time.":"El patrón de rutas de una plantilla, creado a partir de datos como el clúster, el espacio de nombres y la cuenta de servicio, asigna un nombre a cada carga de trabajo automáticamente cuando se inicia. Las identidades no se crean con antelación.","A workload identity provider issues secure, verifiable identities to your workloads, like Kubernetes pods or AI agents. Workloads use them to access AWS and third-party services without long-lived credentials.":"Un proveedor de identidades para cargas de trabajo emite identidades seguras y verificables para sus cargas de trabajo, como los pods de Kubernetes o los agentes de IA. Las cargas de trabajo las utilizan para acceder a los servicios de AWS y de terceros sin necesidad de contar con credenciales de larga duración.","A workload, including an AI agent or sub-agent created on demand, gets its own identity. No workload shares or inherits another's.":"Una carga de trabajo, como un agente o subagente de IA creado bajo demanda, obtiene su propia identidad. Ninguna carga de trabajo comparte ni hereda la de otra.","Access a partner API, a SaaS endpoint, or an OIDC service. No setup needed.":"Acceda a una API de un socio, a un punto de conexión de SaaS o a un servicio de OIDC. No se requiere configuración.","Access a service mesh, a database, or an on-premises system.":"Acceda a una malla de servicios, una base de datos o un sistema en las instalaciones.","Access denied":"Acceso denegado","Access you granted to these identities will stop working":"El acceso que haya otorgado a estas identidades dejará de funcionar","Account scoped":"Con alcance de cuenta",Actions:fDt,"Activating it":"Activándola",Active:yDt,"Active certificate authority ID":"ID de autoridad de certificación activa","Active: currently signing":"Activo: firmando actualmente",Add:bDt,"Add {{label}} template":"Agregar plantilla {{label}}","Add a fact or condition key. A path of only custom text would give every workload the same name.":"Agregue un hecho o una clave de condición. Una ruta de solo texto personalizado daría a cada carga de trabajo el mismo nombre.","Add an {{conditionKey}} condition, so only workloads in these clusters get an identity.":"Agregue una condición {{conditionKey}}, de modo que solo las cargas de trabajo de estos clústeres obtengan una identidad.","Add at least 1 path segment.":"Agregue al menos un segmento de ruta.","Add at least 1 template to continue.":"Agregue al menos una plantilla para continuar.","Add at least 2 clusters.":"Agregue al menos 2 clústeres.","Add attestation rules":"Agregar reglas de atestación","Add cluster ARN":"Agregue el ARN del clúster","Add condition":"Agregar condición","Add default templates for Amazon EKS, AgentCore Runtime, and AgentCore Gateway.":"Agregue plantillas predeterminadas para Amazon EKS, AgentCore Runtime y AgentCore Gateway.","Add new tag":"Agregar nueva etiqueta","Add policy":"Agregar política","Add request-context values like account, Region, or organization.":"Agregue valores de contexto de solicitud, como cuenta, región u organización.","Add tags":"Agregar etiquetas","Add tags to this provider for cost management and access control.":"Agregue etiquetas a este proveedor para administrar los costos y controlar el acceso.","Add tags to this template for cost management and access control.":"Agregue etiquetas a esta plantilla para administrar los costos y controlar el acceso.","Add tags to this workload identity for cost management and access control.":"Agregue etiquetas a esta identidad de carga de trabajo para administrar los costos y controlar el acceso.","Add template":"Agregar plantilla","Add templates":"Agregar plantillas","Add templates after the provider is created, or create and name identities by hand.":"Agregue plantillas después de crear el proveedor, o cree identidades y asigne nombres manualmente.","Add to the path pattern":"Agregar al patrón de rutas","Added or changed tags were not saved":"Las etiquetas agregadas o modificadas no se guardaron","Adding permissions to govern who can create templates referring to this provider failed. To try again, <link>add policy</link>. Error details: {{reason}}":"No se pudieron agregar permisos para determinar quién puede crear plantillas que hagan referencia a este proveedor. Para volver a intentarlo, <link>agregue una política</link>. Detalles del error: {{reason}}","All outbound signers under this provider will be deleted":"Se eliminarán todos los firmantes salientes de este proveedor","All properties":"Todas las propiedades","All templates and workload identities under this provider will be deleted":"Se eliminarán todas las plantillas e identidades de carga de trabajo de este proveedor","Allow member accounts to add their own templates, namespaced by account ID":"Permita que las cuentas de miembro agreguen sus propias plantillas, con espacio de nombres por ID de cuenta","An identity for agent or workload":"Una identidad para el agente o la carga de trabajo",and:"y","Any value":"Cualquier valor",Apply:wDt,ARN:"ARN","ARN copied":"ARN copiado","arn:aws:eks:{Region}:{account ID}:cluster/{cluster name}":"arn:aws:eks:{Region}:{account ID}:cluster/{cluster name}","At runtime the platform attests these facts about the workload. Any workload whose attestation carries them issues an identity from this template.":"Durante el tiempo de ejecución, la plataforma atestigua estos hechos sobre la carga de trabajo. Cualquier carga de trabajo cuya atestación contenga estos hechos emite una identidad a partir de esta plantilla.",Attestation:kDt,"Attestation policy":"Política de verificación","Auto generated identity name":"Nombre de identidad generado automáticamente","Automatically generate from a template":"Genere automáticamente a partir de una plantilla","Available to every account in your organization ({{organizationId}})":"Disponible para todas las cuentas de tu organización ({{organizationId}})","Available to this account ({{accountId}})":"Disponible para esta cuenta ({{accountId}})","AWS account ID":"ID de cuenta de AWS","AWS API calls in CloudTrail resolve to the specific workload that made them. Scope trust policies, resource policies, and SCPs to it, using the IAM policies you already know.":"Las llamadas a las API de AWS en CloudTrail se asocian con la carga de trabajo específica que las generó. Limite las políticas de confianza, las políticas de recursos y los SCP a esa carga de trabajo, utilizando las políticas de IAM que ya conoce.","AWS creates a subordinate CA in every region this provider signs in, and returns an ID for it.":"AWS crea una CA subordinada en cada región en la que este proveedor firma certificados y devuelve un ID para identificarla.","AWS IAM Workload Identity":"AWS IAM Workload Identity","AWS IAM Workload Identity (opens in a new tab)":"AWS IAM Workload Identity (se abre en una pestaña nueva)","AWS Private CA couldn't set up this certificate authority. Delete it in the AWS Private CA console and try again.":"AWS Private CA no pudo configurar esta autoridad de certificación. Elimínela de la consola de AWS Private CA e inténtelo de nuevo.","By default, each account's templates require an account ID path prefix to avoid name collisions. You can customize this after creating the provider, under provider settings.":"De forma predeterminada, las plantillas de cada cuenta requieren un prefijo de ruta de ID de cuenta para evitar colisiones de nombres. Puede personalizarlo después de crear el proveedor, en la configuración del proveedor.","Can't be changed after the provider is created.":"No se puede cambiar una vez que se crea el proveedor.","Can't be changed later.":"No se puede cambiar más adelante.",Cancel:SDt,"Cannot be changed later.":"No se puede cambiar más adelante.","Cannot start with aws:":"No puede comenzar con aws:","Certificate {{name}} (account {{accountId}}): {{reason}}":"Certificado {{name}} (cuenta {{accountId}}): {{reason}}","Certificate authority":"Autoridad de certificación","Certificate authority created":"Se creó la autoridad de certificación","Certificate authority ID":"ID de autoridad de certificación","Certificate authority name":"Nombre de la autoridad de certificación","Certificate authority updated. The current one keeps signing for about {{hours}} more hour, until the replacement has published everywhere.":"Autoridad de certificación actualizada. La actual sigue firmando durante aproximadamente {{hours}} hora más, hasta que el reemplazo se haya publicado en todas partes.","Certificate authority updated. The current one keeps signing for about {{hours}} more hours, until the replacement has published everywhere.":"Autoridad de certificación actualizada. La actual sigue firmando durante aproximadamente {{hours}} horas más, hasta que el reemplazo se haya publicado en todas partes.","Certificate deleted. Its chain had already left the trust bundle, so nothing that was verifying has changed.":"Certificado eliminado. Su cadena ya había abandonado el paquete de confianza, por lo que nada de lo que se estaba verificando ha cambiado.","Certificate deleted. Its chain has been pulled from the trust bundle, so certificates issued under it no longer verify.":"Certificado eliminado. Su cadena se ha retirado del paquete de confianza, por lo que los certificados emitidos en virtud de ella ya no se verifican.","Certificate signer":"Firmante de certificados","Certificate signer disabled, and the update in progress was stopped with it. Both authorities stay configured, and Enable resumes signing.":"El firmante del certificado está deshabilitado y la actualización en curso se detuvo con él. Ambas autoridades permanecen configuradas y la opción Habilitar reanuda la firma.","Certificate signer disabled. It stops signing now, its configuration is kept, and Enable resumes signing.":"El firmante del certificado está desactivado. Deja de firmar ahora; su configuración se mantiene y la opción Habilitar reanuda la firma.","Certificate signer enabled. Its certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle again first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hour, after every region has it.":"Se habilitó el firmante del certificado. La cadena de certificados se vuelve a publicar primero en el paquete de confianza. La firma comienza en aproximadamente {{hours}} hora, una vez que la cadena está disponible en todas las regiones.","Certificate signer enabled. Its certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle again first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hours, after every region has it.":"Se habilitó el firmante del certificado. Primero se vuelve a publicar la cadena de certificados en el paquete de confianza. La firma comienza en aproximadamente {{hours}} horas, una vez que la cadena está disponible en todas las regiones.","Certificate signer enabled. Its material was still published, so signing resumed immediately.":"El firmante del certificado está habilitado. Su material aún estaba publicado, por lo que la firma se reanudó de inmediato.","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hour, once every region has it.":"Se habilitó la firma de certificados. Primero se publica la cadena de certificados en el paquete de confianza. La firma comienza en aproximadamente {{hours}} hora, una vez que la cadena está disponible en todas las regiones.","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hours, once every region has it.":"Se habilitó la firma de certificados. La cadena de certificados se publica primero en el paquete de confianza. La firma comienza en aproximadamente {{hours}} horas, una vez que la cadena está disponible en todas las regiones.","Certificate verifier information":"Información del verificador de certificados","Certificates ({{total}})":"Certificados ({{total}})","Certificates: {{reason}}":"Certificados: {{reason}}","Change the facts a workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.":"Cambie los hechos que deben constar en la atestación de una carga de trabajo para que se le asigne una identidad a partir de esta plantilla. Las identidades que esta plantilla ya ha generado no se verán afectadas.","Change the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. A workload already holding a session keeps it until the session expires.":"Cambie los datos que una carga de trabajo debe haber certificado para ejecutarse con esta identidad. Una carga de trabajo que ya tenga una sesión la conservará hasta que la sesión caduque.","Check again":"Comprobar de nuevo","Checking what is attached to this provider":"Comprobando lo que está asociado a este proveedor","Choose a condition key":"Elija una clave de condición","Choose a fact":"Elija un hecho","Choose a path and pattern for the names. Start from a default or customize your own.":"Elija una ruta y un patrón para los nombres. Empiece con un valor predeterminado o personalice el suyo propio.","Choose a specific name up front so you can grant it access or match an existing naming convention before the workload runs.":"Elija un nombre específico de antemano para poder concederle acceso o ajustarlo a una convención de nomenclatura existente antes de que se ejecute la carga de trabajo.","Choose a stable, unique name that identifies one environment or group of workloads, for example prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal.":"Elija un nombre único y estable que identifique un entorno o grupo de cargas de trabajo, por ejemplo, prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com o payments.internal.","Choose a use case above to add a template.":"Elige uno de los casos de uso anteriores para agregar una plantilla.","Choose from this account":"Seleccionar una CA de esta cuenta","Choose templates to add, and customize or keep their defaults":"Elija plantillas para agregar y personalice o mantenga sus valores predeterminados","Choose the certificate authority this signer should sign with instead. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. The current authority keeps signing until the replacement has been published long enough for verifiers to pick it up.":"En su lugar, elija la autoridad de certificación con la que este firmante debe firmar. Necesita una <link>autoridad de certificación</link> con una CA subordinada en cada región en la que firme. La autoridad actual sigue firmando hasta que el reemplazo haya estado publicado el tiempo suficiente para que los verificadores puedan recogerlo.","Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for a workload.":"Elija las claves de condición que se utilizarán como hechos de atestación. La plataforma debe atestiguar todos estos hechos antes de que esta plantilla emita una identidad para una carga de trabajo.","Choose the facts a workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.":"Elija los hechos que deben constar en la atestación de una carga de trabajo para que se le asigne una identidad a partir de esta plantilla. No se generará nada a partir de ella hasta que lo haga.","Choose the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. Nothing can be issued for it until you do.":"Elija los hechos que deben constar en la certificación de una carga de trabajo para que se ejecute como esta identidad. No se podrá emitir nada para ella hasta que lo haga.","Choose the provider to create the identity in":"Elija el proveedor en el que desea crear la identidad","Choose which templates to add by use case, and customize each one or keep its defaults.":"Elija qué plantillas desea agregar según el caso de uso y personalice cada una de ellas o mantenga sus valores predeterminados.",Clear:_Dt,"Clear filters":"Quitar filtros",Close:xDt,"Close modal":"Cerrar modal","Cluster ARN":"ARN del clúster","Cluster ARNs":"ARN de los clústeres","Code editor":"Editor de código","Complete the confirmation to delete.":"Complete la confirmación para eliminar.","Condition key":"Clave de condición","Configure identity templates for your workload use cases. Each template defines a path pattern used to issue identities uniquely and the facts a workload must prove before an identity is issued.":"Configure plantillas de identidad para sus casos de uso de carga de trabajo. Cada plantilla define un patrón de rutas que se utiliza para emitir identidades de forma exclusiva y los datos que una carga de trabajo debe demostrar antes de emitir una identidad.","Configure later":"Configurar más tarde",Configured:ADt,Confirm:EDt,Contains:CDt,"Continue setup":"Continuar con la configuración","Copy {{label}}":"Copiar {{label}}","Copy ARN":"Copiar ARN","Copy JSON":"Copiar JSON","Could not check everything attached to this provider":"No se pudo comprobar todo lo relacionado con este proveedor","Create a provider":"Cree un proveedor","Create a provider for this account":"Cree un proveedor para esta cuenta","Create a provider for your organization":"Cree un proveedor para su organización","Create a provider to get started":"Cree un proveedor para empezar.","Create a template to automate identity generation":"Cree una plantilla para automatizar la generación de identidades","Create declared identity in {{providerName}}":"Crear identidad declarada en {{providerName}}","Create identity":"Crear una identidad","Create new":"Crear nuevo","Create provider":"Crear proveedor","Create provider and templates":"Crear proveedor y plantillas","Create service mesh provider":"Crear proveedor de malla de servicios","Create templates":"Crear plantillas","Create the certificate authority first.":"Cree primero la autoridad de certificación.","Create workload identities":"Crear identidades de carga de trabajo",Created:TDt,"Created through":"Creado a través de","Created time":"Hora de creación","Created values":"Valores creados","Creates a workload identity provider and template for workloads running in one or more EKS clusters under a service mesh, such as Istio.":"Crea un proveedor de identidades de carga de trabajo y una plantilla para las cargas de trabajo que se ejecutan en uno o más clústeres de EKS en una malla de servicios, como Istio.","Creating certificate authority":"Creando la autoridad de certificación","Creating the certificate authority":"Creando la autoridad de certificación","Creating this provider sets up these 2 resources.":"Al crear este proveedor, se configuran estos 2 recursos.","Current CA":"CA actual","Current provider":"Proveedor actual","Custom tag key":"Clave de etiqueta personalizada","Custom tag value":"Valor de etiqueta personalizado","Custom text":"Texto personalizado","Custom text can't be a single period (.) or two periods (..).":"El texto personalizado no puede ser un solo punto (.) o dos puntos (..).","Customize templates":"Personalizar plantillas","Dark themes":"Temas oscuros","Declared identity: {{name}}":"Identidad declarada: {{name}}","Default permissions without a policy":"Permisos predeterminados sin una política","Defaults to {provider name}.{account ID}.aws.internal. This must match the trust domain set in your service mesh, or the mesh rejects the identities.":"El valor predeterminado es {provider name}.{account ID}.aws.internal. Debe coincidir con el dominio de confianza establecido en su malla de servicios o la malla rechazará las identidades.","Define an optional path prefix for identities under this template. Lets you filter by prefix when authoring IAM permissions.":"Defina un prefijo de ruta opcional para las identidades en esta plantilla. Le permite filtrar por prefijo al crear los permisos de IAM.","Define an optional path prefix for this identity. You can filter by this prefix when authoring IAM permissions.":"Defina un prefijo de ruta opcional para esta identidad. Puede filtrar por este prefijo al crear los permisos de IAM.","Define an optional prefix for identities under this template. You can filter by this prefix when authoring IAM permissions. The path prefixes this account can use are set by the provider's policy, for example your account ID, and they are checked when you choose Create. If you're not sure which are permitted, ask your organization administrator.":"Defina un prefijo opcional para las identidades en esta plantilla. Puede filtrar por este prefijo al crear los permisos de IAM. Los prefijos de ruta que puede usar esta cuenta los establece la política del proveedor (por ejemplo, el identificador de la cuenta) y se comprueban al elegir Crear. Si no está seguro de cuáles están permitidos, consulte al administrador de su organización.","Define an optional prefix for this identity. You can filter by this prefix when authoring IAM permissions. The path prefixes this account can use are set by the provider's policy, for example your account ID, and they are checked when you choose Create. If you're not sure which are permitted, ask your organization administrator.":"Defina un prefijo opcional para esta identidad. Puede filtrar por este prefijo al crear los permisos de IAM. Los prefijos de ruta que puede usar esta cuenta los establece la política del proveedor (por ejemplo, el identificador de la cuenta) y se comprueban al elegir Crear. Si no está seguro de cuáles están permitidos, consulte al administrador de su organización.","Define which workloads are allowed to use this template.":"Defina qué cargas de trabajo pueden usar esta plantilla.",Delete:IDt,"Delete certificate?":"¿Desea eliminar el certificado?","Delete provider":"Eliminar proveedor","Delete provider and resources":"Eliminar proveedor y recursos","Delete provider?":"¿Eliminar proveedor?","Delete template":"Eliminar plantilla","Delete template?":"¿Desea eliminar la plantilla?","Delete the templates under <b>{{providerName}}</b> before deleting the provider. Once deleted, workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials and fail on their next request, and access that you granted to these identities will stop working.":"Elimine las plantillas de <b>{{providerName}}</b> antes de eliminar el proveedor. Una vez eliminado el proveedor, las cargas de trabajo que utilicen estas identidades dejarán de recibir credenciales y fallarán en su próxima solicitud, y el acceso que haya otorgado a estas identidades dejará de funcionar.","Delete workload identity?":"¿Desea eliminar la identidad de carga de trabajo?","Deleting <b>{{templateName}}</b> will:":"La eliminación de <b>{{templateName}}</b> tendrá las siguientes consecuencias:","Deleting <b>{{workloadIdentifier}}</b> will:":"La eliminación de <b>{{workloadIdentifier}}</b> tendrá las siguientes consecuencias:","Deleting certificates":"Eliminando certificados","Deleting provider":"Eliminando el proveedor","Deleting templates and workload identities":"Eliminando plantillas e identidades de la carga de trabajo","Deleting the provider is taking longer than expected":"La eliminación del proveedor está tardando más de lo esperado",Description:DDt,"Description can't include line breaks or tabs.":"La descripción no puede incluir saltos de línea ni tabulaciones.","Description must be 1,000 characters or less.":"La descripción debe tener 1000 caracteres o menos.","Description must be 255 characters or less.":"La descripción debe tener 255 caracteres o menos.",Details:LDt,Disable:PDt,"Disable certificate signer?":"¿Desea desactivar el firmante de certificados?","Discovery expiration time":"Fecha y hora de vencimiento del descubrimiento",Dismiss:NDt,"Does not contain":"No contiene","Does not equal":"No es igual a","Drag or select to resize":"Arrastre o seleccione para cambiar el tamaño","Each identity is fully the template path, or whatever string you enter when you create the identity.":"Cada identidad es la ruta completa de la plantilla o cualquier cadena que introduzca al crear la identidad.",Edit:RDt,"Edit attestation policy":"Editar política de verificación","Edit filter":"Editar filtro","Edit identity format and scope":"Editar formato y alcance de la identidad","Edit identity path":"Editar ruta de identidad",Editing:MDt,Enable:zDt,"Enable certificate signer":"Habilitar el firmante de certificados","Enable certificate signer?":"¿Desea habilitar el firmante de certificados?","End signing time":"Fecha y hora de finalización de la firma","Enter a 12-digit AWS account ID.":"Ingrese un ID de cuenta de AWS de 12 dígitos.","Enter a certificate authority ID.":"Ingrese el ID de una autoridad de certificación.","Enter a cluster ARN.":"Ingrese el ARN del clúster.","Enter a name":"Introduzca un nombre","Enter a name for the certificate authority.":"Ingrese un nombre para la autoridad de certificación.","Enter a name.":"Ingrese un nombre.","Enter a path":"Ingrese una ruta","Enter a path prefix value":"Introduzca un valor de prefijo de ruta","Enter a trust domain.":"Ingrese un dominio de confianza.","Enter a value":"Ingrese un valor","Enter a whole number of hours from 1 to 48.":"Ingrese un número entero de horas entre 1 y 48.","Enter key":"Ingresar clave","Enter prefix":"Ingrese un prefijo","Enter the ID of a certificate authority or choose from below":"Ingrese el ID de una autoridad de certificación o seleccione una de las siguientes opciones","Enter the policy as valid JSON.":"Ingrese la política como un JSON válido.","Enter value":"Ingresar valor",equals:ODt,Equals:BDt,Error:"Error","Error fetching the details":"Se produjo un error al obtener los detalles",Errors:FDt,"Every account in this organization ({{organizationId}})":"Todas las cuentas de esta organización ({{organizationId}})","Every X.509-SVID this provider issues right now is signed by this certificate. It stops in {{hours}} hour, at {{at}}, when the incoming certificate takes over.":"Todos los X.509-SVID que emite este proveedor en este momento están firmados por este certificado. Se detiene en {{hours}} hora, a las {{at}}, cuando el certificado entrante asuma el control.","Every X.509-SVID this provider issues right now is signed by this certificate. It stops in {{hours}} hours, at {{at}}, when the incoming certificate takes over.":"Cada X.509-SVID que emite este proveedor en este momento está firmado por este certificado. Se detiene en {{hours}} horas, a las {{at}}, cuando el certificado entrante asuma el control.","Every X.509-SVID this provider issues right now is signed by this certificate. No replacement is scheduled, so it keeps signing until you update or disable the signer.":"Cada X.509-SVID que emite este proveedor en este momento está firmado por este certificado. No está programado ningún reemplazo, por lo que seguirá firmando hasta que actualice o deshabilite al firmante.","Failed to copy":"No se pudo copiar","Failed to copy JSON":"No se pudo copiar JSON","Failed to load attestation policy.":"No se pudo cargar la política de atestación.","Failed to load templates.":"No se pudieron cargar las plantillas.","Failed to remove attestation policy.":"No se pudo eliminar la política de atestación.","Filter providers":"Filtrar proveedores","Filter templates":"Filtrar plantillas","Filter themes":"Filtrar temas","Find providers":"Buscar proveedores","Find templates":"Buscar plantillas","Find theme":"Buscar tema","For example, prod":"Por ejemplo, prod","For mutual TLS, attach a certificate authority":"Para TLS mutuo, asocie una autoridad de certificación","For token-based services, issue a JWT":"Para los servicios basados en tokens, emita un JWT",Format:$Dt,"Generating its key":"Generando su clave","Get started":"Comenzar","Getting started":"Introducción","Give an agent or workload its own identity - <em>Preview</em>":"Asigne a un agente o carga de trabajo su propia identidad - <em>Vista previa</em>","Give each workload a unique identity, so you can grant it access and audit what it did rather than sharing one role.":"Asigne a cada carga de trabajo una identidad única, de modo que pueda concederle acceso y auditar lo que hizo en lugar de compartir un rol.","Give your workloads an identity":"Otorgue una identidad a las cargas de trabajo","Go to the providers list":"Ir a la lista de proveedores","Govern who can create resources":"Controle quién puede crear recursos","Govern who can create templates referring to this provider":"Determine quién puede crear plantillas que hagan referencia a este proveedor","Greater than":"Mayor que","Greater than or equal":"Mayor o igual","hour(s)":"horas","How it works":"Cómo funciona","IAM roles define what a workload can do. Workload Identity tells you which workload is doing it.":"Los roles de IAM definen lo que puede hacer una carga de trabajo. Workload Identity le indica qué carga de trabajo lo está haciendo.","Identities are issued at runtime from facts the workload proves, not just from what an admin assigns.":"Las identidades se emiten en tiempo de ejecución a partir de los datos que demuestra la carga de trabajo, no solo de lo que asigna un administrador.",'Identity "{{identityId}}" not found.':"No se encontró la identidad “{{identityId}}”.","Identity format and scope":"Formato y alcance de la identidad","Identity name":"Nombre de identidad","Identity path":"Ruta de identidad","Identity selection":"Selección de identidad","If anything is still attached, deleting the provider fails.":"Si aún queda algo adjunto, se produce un error al eliminar el proveedor.","In transition":"En transición","In transition certificate authority ID":"ID de la autoridad de certificación en transición","In transition: incoming, not yet signing":"En transición: entrante, aún no firmado",Inactive:jDt,"Inactive: retired, no longer trusted":"Inactivo: retirado, ya no es de confianza","Incoming CA":"CA entrante",Info:WDt,"Invalid key. Keys can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"Clave no válida. Las claves solo pueden contener letras Unicode, dígitos, espacios en blanco y cualquiera de los siguientes elementos: _.:/=+@-","Invalid provider name. Use alphanumeric and '-_.' characters.":'Nombre de proveedor no válido. Use caracteres alfanuméricos y "-_.".',"Invalid request":"Solicitud no válida","Invalid template name. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters.":'Nombre de plantilla no válido. Use caracteres alfanuméricos y "-_".',"Invalid value. Values can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"El valor no es válido. Los valores solo pueden contener letras Unicode, dígitos, espacios en blanco y cualquiera de los siguientes elementos: _.:/=+@-","Issued after the workload proves itself":"Se emite una vez que la carga de trabajo demuestra su identidad","Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. Standard pricing applies to the creation and use of AWS Private CA.":"Emite los X.509-SVID que las cargas de trabajo de este proveedor presentan como certificados de cliente ante sistemas externos a AWS. Requiere una <link>autoridad de certificación</link> con una CA subordinada en cada región en la que se firmen certificados. Se aplican precios estándar a la creación y el uso de AWS Private CA.","Issues X.509-SVIDs, for mTLS peers that verify a client certificate.":"Emite X.509-SVID para su uso con pares de mTLS que verifican certificados de cliente.","Issuing its CA certificate":"Emitiendo su certificado CA","It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. Leave it alone and it becomes inactive on its own, after which deleting it changes nothing.":"Ya ha dejado de firmar, pero su cadena sigue publicada, por lo que las cargas de trabajo dependen de esta para verificar las credenciales emitidas anteriormente. Si se elimina ahora, la cadena se retirará de inmediato y esas credenciales dejarán de funcionar. Si no se elimina, quedará inactivo por sí solo y, a partir de ese momento, eliminarlo no tendrá ningún efecto.","Item moved from position {{initialPosition}} to position {{finalPosition}} of {{total}}":"Se movió el elemento de la posición {{initialPosition}} a la posición {{finalPosition}} de {{total}}","JSON copied":"JSON copiado",JWKS:qDt,"JWKS popover":"Cada clave de firma activa, seleccionada por kid. AWS publica aquí una nueva clave antes de empezar a usarla para firmar.","JWT Outbound signers column Signing algorithm":"Algoritmo de firma","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key":"Algoritmos de clave","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key issue time":"Clave actual utilizada para firmar desde","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key popover":"AWS genera las claves y las rota según su propia programación. Publica cada clave nueva en el JWKS antes de empezar a usarla para firmar. Los algoritmos no cambian durante la rotación, por lo que no es necesario realizar ningún cambio en el verificador que lee el JWKS.","JWT Outbound signers desc":"Firma JWT-SVID para sistemas que verifican tokens firmados.","JWT Outbound signers label oidc discovery":"Detección de OIDC","JWT Outbound signers label oidc discovery popover":"El documento de detección estándar. La mayoría de los verificadores solo necesitan esta URL, ya que encuentran las claves en ella.","JWT Outbound signers label oidc issuer":"Emisor de OIDC","JWT Outbound signers label oidc issuer popover":"La afirmación iss de cada JWT-SVID firmado aquí. Si un verificador fija un emisor, fija este valor.","JWT Outbound signers section title":"Información del verificador de tokens","JWT Outbound signers status":"Proporcionada por AWS de forma predeterminada","JWT Outbound signers title":"Firmante de JWT",Key:UDt,"Learn about organization providers":"Más información sobre los proveedores de la organización","Learn about organization providers (opens in a new tab)":"Más información sobre los proveedores de la organización (se abre en una pestaña nueva)","Learn more":"Más información","Learn more about deleting a provider (opens in a new tab)":"Más información sobre cómo eliminar un proveedor (se abre en una pestaña nueva)","Learn more:":"Más información:","Less than":"Menor que","Less than or equal":"Menor o igual","Let other accounts or principals in your organization create templates and identities under this provider, within the path prefixes you choose.":"Permita que otras cuentas o entidades principales de la organización creen plantillas e identidades asociadas a este proveedor dentro de los prefijos de ruta que elija.","Let workloads reach non-AWS resources":"Permita que las cargas de trabajo accedan a recursos que no son de AWS","Letters, digits, . - _ with a single / between parts. No / at the start or end.":"Letras, dígitos, . - _ con una sola / entre las partes. Sin / al principio o al final.","Letters, digits, . - _ with a single / between parts. No / at the start or end. Cannot be changed later.":"Letras, dígitos, . - _ con una sola / entre las partes. Sin / al principio o al final. No se puede cambiar posteriormente.","Light themes":"Temas claros","Ln {{row}}, Col {{column}}":"Ln {{row}}, Col {{column}}","Loading certificate authorities":"Cargando las autoridades de certificación","Loading code editor":"Cargando el editor de código","Loading tag keys":"Cargando claves de etiqueta","Loading tag values":"Cargando valores de etiqueta","Loading tags that are associated with this resource":"Cargando etiquetas asociadas a este recurso","Loading your organization's providers":"Cargando los proveedores de su organización","Make sure the new certificate authority uses the same algorithm as the current signer, {{algorithm}}. If you choose a different algorithm, you need to disable this signer, delete its certificates, then enable it again with the new authority.":"Asegúrese de que la nueva autoridad de certificación utilice el mismo algoritmo que el firmante actual, {{algorithm}}. Si elige un algoritmo diferente, debe deshabilitar este firmante, eliminar sus certificados y volver a habilitarlo con la nueva autoridad.","Manage CAs and replication in the AWS Private CA console":"Administre las CA y la replicación en la consola de CA privada de AWS","Manage tags":"Administrar etiquetas","Manage the provider":"Administrar el proveedor","Manual creation":"Creación manual","Manually create":"Cree manualmente","Matching workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.":"Las cargas de trabajo coincidentes reciben su propio nombre de identidad en el momento en que comienzan, a cualquier escala.","Maximum 1,000 characters.":"Máximo de 1000 caracteres.","Maximum 255 characters.":"Máximo 255 caracteres.","Member accounts":"Cuentas de miembros","Member accounts can add their own templates, namespaced by account ID.":"Las cuentas de miembro pueden agregar sus propias plantillas, con espacio de nombres por ID de cuenta.","Member accounts cannot add their own templates.":"Las cuentas de miembros no pueden agregar sus propias plantillas.","Minimum signing delay":"Tiempo mínimo de espera para iniciar la firma","Moving item to position {{currentPosition}} of {{total}}":"Se mueve el elemento a la posición {{currentPosition}} de {{total}}","Multiple EKS clusters":"Varios clústeres de EKS",Name:VDt,"Name must be 128 characters or less.":"El nombre debe tener 128 caracteres o menos.","Name this identity":"Asigne un nombre a esta identidad","Name this provider":"Asigne un nombre a este proveedor","Name values":"Valores de nombres","Names identities automatically as workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.":"Las identidades reciben un nombre automáticamente cuando se inician las cargas de trabajo, por lo que no es necesario crearlas ni administrarlas una por una.","Naming scheme":"Esquema de nomenclatura",New:HDt,"Next month":"Siguiente mes","Next page":"Página siguiente","Next step":"Próximo paso","No attestation policy set. Define one so a workload can run as this identity.":"No se estableció ninguna política de certificación. Defina una para que la carga de trabajo pueda ejecutarse como esta identidad.","No attestation policy. No workload will be issued workload identities from this template until you add one.":"Sin política de atestación. No se emitirán identidades de carga de trabajo a partir de esta plantilla hasta que agregue una.","No by default, but can add a policy":"No de forma predeterminada, pero puede agregar una política","No certificate authorities in this account":"No hay autoridades de certificación en esta cuenta","no domain":"no hay dominios","No long-lived secrets":"Sin secretos de larga duración","No match found":"No se encontró ninguna coincidencia","No matches":"No hay coincidencias","No path segments. Add a fact, condition key, or custom text.":"No hay segmentos de ruta. Agregue un hecho, una clave de condición o un texto personalizado.","No tags associated with the resource.":"No hay etiquetas asociadas al recurso.","No templates added yet":"Aún no se han agregado plantillas","No workload identity providers":"Sin proveedores de identidad de cargas de trabajo","No workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.":"Ninguna carga de trabajo coincide con esta plantilla, por lo que no genera identidades.","No, and cannot be granted":"No, y no se puede conceder",None:KDt,"None – names are defined by templates or declared individually":"Ninguno: los nombres se definen por plantillas o se declaran individualmente","Not saved: {{keys}}.":"No guardadas: {{keys}}.","Not set":"Sin establecer",Notifications:GDt,"Once the attestation policy is removed, matching workloads will not be issued workload identities until you add a policy again.":"Una vez que se elimine la política de atestación, las cargas de trabajo coincidentes no recibirán identidades de carga de trabajo hasta que vuelva a agregar una política.","One bundle per provider, and one URL. It carries every authority the provider publishes: both outbound signers, and during an update both the current and incoming certificate authority, which is what lets verifiers accept either one through the handover. Your own AWS workloads get these keys automatically; send this to systems outside AWS.":"Un paquete por proveedor y una URL. Incluye todas las autoridades que publica el proveedor: tanto los firmantes salientes como, durante una actualización, las autoridades certificadoras actual y entrante. Así, los verificadores pueden aceptar cualquiera de las dos durante la transferencia. Sus propias cargas de trabajo de AWS obtienen estas claves automáticamente; envíe esto a los sistemas ajenos a AWS.","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level providers.":"Solo la cuenta de administración o un administrador delegado pueden eliminar los proveedores a nivel de organización.","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level templates.":"Solo la cuenta de administración o un administrador delegado pueden eliminar las plantillas a nivel de organización.","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level workload identities.":"Solo la cuenta de administración o un administrador delegado pueden eliminar las identidades de carga de trabajo a nivel de organización.","Opens in a new tab":"Se abre en una pestaña nueva",Operator:YDt,Operators:JDt,optional:ZDt,or:"o","Organization provider":"Proveedor de la organización","Organization scoped":"Con alcance de organización","Organize the provider and track its cost with tags.":"Organice el proveedor y haga un seguimiento de su costo mediante etiquetas.","Other accounts in your organization":"Otras cuentas en su organización","Other condition keys":"Otras claves de condición","Outbound signer":"Firmante saliente","Outbound signers page desc":"Permita que sus cargas de trabajo demuestren quiénes son ante los servicios ajenos a AWS. Este proveedor firma los tokens y certificados que presentan.","Outbound signers page title":"Firmante saliente","Owning account":"Cuenta propietaria","Page {{pageNumber}} of all pages":"Página {{pageNumber}} de todas las páginas",path:XDt,Path:QDt,"path from templates":"ruta desde plantillas","Path is the per-workload part of an identity name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts a workload proves.":"La ruta es la parte de un nombre de identidad correspondiente a cada carga de trabajo. Se rellena en tiempo de ejecución a partir de los datos que demuestra una carga de trabajo.","Path must be 255 characters or less.":"La ruta debe tener 255 caracteres o menos.","Path pattern":"Patrón de ruta","Path prefix":"Prefijo de ruta","Path prefix must be 64 characters or less.":"El prefijo de ruta debe tener 64 caracteres o menos.","Path values":"Valores de ruta","Picked up item at position {{position}} of {{total}}":"Se recogió el elemento en la posición {{position}} de {{total}}","Policy details":"Detalles de la política","Policy: Define how a workload attests to get the identity":"Política: defina cómo debe atestiguar una carga de trabajo para obtener la identidad",Preferences:eLt,"Press space or enter to activate drag, use arrow keys to move, then press space or enter to confirm":"Presione la barra espaciadora o Intro para activar el arrastre, use las teclas de flecha para mover el elemento y, a continuación, presione la barra espaciadora o Intro para confirmar",Preview:tLt,"Previous CA":"CA anterior","Previous certificates ({{certificateCount}})":"Certificados anteriores ({{certificateCount}})","Previous month":"Mes anterior","Previous page":"Página anterior",Properties:aLt,Property:nLt,Provided:iLt,Provider:rLt,"Provider {{providerName}} deleted.":"Proveedor {{providerName}} eliminado.","Provider name":"Nombre del proveedor","Provider name must be 128 characters or less.":"El nombre del proveedor debe tener 128 caracteres o menos.","Provider not deleted":"El proveedor no se eliminó","Provider not found":"No se encontró el proveedor","Provider overview":"Descripción general del proveedor","Provider selection":"Selección de proveedores","Provider settings":"Configuración del proveedor","Provider values":"Valores de proveedores",Providers:oLt,"Providers to issue workload identities":"Proveedores para emitir identidades de carga de trabajo","Quick create":"Creación rápida","Quick create makes an RSA 2048 certificate authority in AWS Private CA in your account, which has its own charges. The algorithm is fixed and cannot be changed later without setting the signer up again.":"La creación rápida crea en su cuenta una autoridad de certificación RSA 2048 en AWS Private CA, la cual tiene sus propios cargos. El algoritmo es fijo y no se puede cambiar más adelante sin volver a configurar el firmante.",Ready:sLt,Recommended:lLt,"Recommended for most workloads":"Recomendado para la mayoría de las cargas de trabajo",Refresh:cLt,"Refresh certificate authorities":"Volver a cargar las autoridades de certificación","Refresh certificate signer status":"Actualizar el estado del firmante de certificados",Remove:dLt,"Remove {{name}}":"Eliminar {{name}}","Remove attestation policy":"Eliminar la política de atestación","Remove cluster ARN":"Eliminar el ARN del clúster","Remove condition":"Eliminar condición","Remove filter {{filter}}":"Eliminar filtro {{filter}}","Remove governance policy?":"¿Eliminar la política de gobierno?","Remove tag {{key}}":"Eliminar etiqueta {{key}}","Removed tags were not saved":"Las etiquetas eliminadas no se guardaron","Reorder {{name}}":"Reordenar {{name}}","Reordering canceled":"Se canceló la reordenación","Required for service mesh providers.":"Necesario para los proveedores de malla de servicios.","Required for service mesh providers. A service mesh provider is scoped to the account that runs the EKS cluster.":"Necesario para los proveedores de malla de servicios. Un proveedor de malla de servicios tiene como alcance la cuenta que ejecuta el clúster de EKS.","Reset to default":"Restablecer los valores predeterminados","Resize handle":"Control de redimensionamiento","Resolved example:":"Ejemplo resuelto:","Restricted by":"Restringido por",Retry:uLt,"Review the tags and save again.":"Revise las etiquetas y vuelva a guardarlas.","Running a service mesh, such as Istio? It needs its own provider, one per cluster.":"¿Tiene una malla de servicios, como Istio? Necesita su propio proveedor, uno por clúster.",Save:pLt,"Save changes":"Guardar cambios","Save or cancel your edits before creating templates.":"Guarde o cancele las modificaciones antes de crear las plantillas.","Save or cancel your edits before creating the provider.":"Guarde o cancele las modificaciones antes de crear el proveedor.","Save or cancel your template edits to change the scope.":"Guarde o cancele las modificaciones de la plantilla para cambiar el alcance.",scheme:hLt,Scheme:mLt,"scheme and trust domain":"esquema y dominio de confianza","Scheme sets the format this provider uses to name identities.":"El esquema establece el formato que usa este proveedor para nombrar las identidades.",Scope:gLt,"Scope sets which accounts are allowed to use this provider.":"El alcance establece qué cuentas pueden usar este proveedor.","Scope values":"Valores de alcance","Search tags":"Buscar etiquetas","Segment that partitions identities.":"Segmento que divide las identidades.","Select {{name}}":"Seleccionar {{name}}","Select a row to delete.":"Seleccione una fila para eliminarla.",Set:"Conjunto","Set a naming pattern":"Establecer un patrón de nomenclatura","Set an attestation rule":"Establezca una regla de atestación","Set by your provider.":"Establecido por el proveedor.","Set the naming format and usage scope that every workload identity from this provider inherits.":"Establezca el formato de nomenclatura y el ámbito de uso que hereda cada identidad de carga de trabajo de este proveedor.","Set the unique path pattern that every workload identity generated by this template follows. Cannot be changed later.":"Establezca el patrón de ruta único que sigue cada identidad de carga de trabajo generada por esta plantilla. No se puede cambiar más adelante.","Set up a provider to hold the templates that generate identity names, the identities you declare directly, and the signers that sign credentials for systems outside AWS.":"Configure un proveedor para que contenga las plantillas que generan los nombres de identidad, las identidades que declara directamente y los firmantes que firman las credenciales para sistemas ajenos a AWS.","Set up a service mesh provider for this account":"Configure un proveedor de malla de servicios para esta cuenta","Set up a way to issue workload identities":"Configure una forma de emitir identidades de carga de trabajo","Set up for your use cases":"Configure según sus casos de uso","Sets your trust domain, the start of every identity name.":"Establece su dominio de confianza, el inicio de cada nombre de identidad.","Setting up the certificate authority stopped. You can continue from where it left off.":"Se detuvo la configuración de la autoridad de certificación. Puede continuar desde donde se interrumpió.","Settings from your provider {{providerName}}":"Configuración de su proveedor {{providerName}}","Short-lived credentials renew automatically and follow the SPIFFE standard, so they work with service meshes like Istio and with SaaS applications.":"Las credenciales de corta duración se renuevan automáticamente y siguen el estándar SPIFFE, por lo que funcionan con mallas de servicios como Istio y con aplicaciones SaaS.","Show all {{errorCount}} errors":"Mostrar todos los {{errorCount}} errores","Show fewer":"Mostrar menos","Show more":"Mostrar más","Signing algorithm":"Algoritmo de firma","Signing resumes immediately, because this certificate is still published in the trust bundle.":"La firma se reanuda de inmediato porque este certificado sigue publicado en el paquete de confianza.","Signing start time":"Fecha y hora de inicio de la firma","Some templates could not be loaded":"No se pudieron cargar algunas plantillas","Something went wrong":"Se produjo un problema","Sortable path segment":"Segmento de ruta clasificable",Status:vLt,"Status bar":"Barra de estado","Stop access you granted to this identity name from working":"Impedir que siga funcionando el acceso concedido a este nombre de identidad","Stop access you granted to those identity names from working":"Impedir que siga funcionando el acceso concedido a esos nombres de identidad","Stop matching workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request":"Impedir que las cargas de trabajo que cumplan los criterios obtengan una identidad, de modo que fallen cuando realicen su próxima solicitud","Stop the identities it generated from resolving":"Impedir que se resuelvan las identidades que generó","Stop the workload running as this identity, so it fails on its next request":"Impedir que la carga de trabajo siga ejecutándose con esta identidad, de modo que falle cuando realice su próxima solicitud","Stopped signing and no longer in the trust bundle, so nothing verifies against them. Deleting one is safe.":"Ya no firman ni forman parte del paquete de confianza, por lo que ya no se utilizan para verificar certificados. Es seguro eliminar cualquiera de estos firmantes.",Subject:fLt,Success:yLt,"Tag keys could not be retrieved":"No se pudieron recuperar las claves de etiqueta","Tag values could not be retrieved":"No se pudieron recuperar los valores de etiqueta",Tags:bLt,"Tags could not be loaded":"No se pudieron cargar las etiquetas","Tags for {{name}} have been updated.":"Se han actualizado las etiquetas de {{name}}.","Tags not saved":"Las etiquetas no se guardaron",Template:wLt,'Template "{{templateId}}" not found.':"No se encontró la plantilla “{{templateId}}”.","Template {{name}}: {{reason}}":"Plantilla {{name}}: {{reason}}","Template {{templateName}} deleted.":"Se eliminó la plantilla {{templateName}}.","Template {{templateNames}} created.":"Se creó la plantilla {{templateNames}}.","Template name":"Nombre de la plantilla","Template name must be 128 characters or less.":"El nombre de la plantilla debe tener 128 caracteres o menos.","Template name values":"Valores de nombres de plantillas","Template: {{name}}":"Plantilla: {{name}}",Templates:kLt,"Templates ({{total}})":"Plantillas ({{total}})","Templates are being created. Wait for the request to finish.":"Se están creando plantillas. Espere a que finalice la solicitud.","Templates give matching workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.":"Las plantillas asignan automáticamente su propio nombre de identidad a las cargas de trabajo coincidentes. Cada una usa el prefijo del nombre de este proveedor, además de una ruta y un patrón.","Templates that member accounts created under this provider are not visible here and cannot be deleted from this account. If any exist, deleting the provider fails.":"Las plantillas creadas por las cuentas de miembro con este proveedor no están visibles aquí y no se pueden eliminar de esta cuenta. Si existe alguna, se produce un error al eliminar el proveedor.","Templates: {{reason}}":"Plantillas: {{reason}}","The account that owns the certificate authority.":"La cuenta propietaria de la autoridad de certificación.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it.":"La política de atestación controla la forma en que este proveedor emite las identidades. Una carga de trabajo debe cumplir todas las condiciones, como su tipo, detalles y dónde se ejecuta, según lo acredite el servicio que la aloja.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.":"La política de atestación controla la forma en que este proveedor emite las identidades. Una carga de trabajo debe cumplir todas las condiciones, como su tipo, detalles y dónde se ejecuta, según lo acredite el servicio que la aloja. Se puede editar más adelante.","The attestation policy controls which workloads get an identity from this provider. A workload must meet every condition, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. It's generated from the EKS clusters you entered. You can edit it later.":"La política de atestación controla qué cargas de trabajo obtienen una identidad de este proveedor. Una carga de trabajo debe cumplir con todas las condiciones, como lo avala el servicio que la aloja. Se genera a partir de los clústeres de EKS que ingresó. Puede editarla más adelante.","The attestation policy lists the facts a workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so a workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.":"La política de atestación enumera los datos que una carga de trabajo debe probar antes de que este proveedor le emita una identidad. La plataforma de cómputo los avala, por lo que una carga de trabajo no puede reclamar una identidad que no sea la suya.","The attester vouches for the workload, and it must match every condition to run as this identity.":"El certificador avala la carga de trabajo, que debe cumplir todas las condiciones para que se ejecute como esta identidad.","The certificate authority is still being set up.":"La autoridad de certificación aún se está configurando.","The ID at the end of the certificate authority's ARN in AWS Private CA.":"El ID que aparece al final del ARN de la autoridad de certificación en AWS Private CA.","The identity name is the provider's naming scheme, a path prefix, and a path pattern.":"El nombre de la identidad consta del esquema de nomenclatura del proveedor, un prefijo de ruta y un patrón de ruta.","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag key is 128.":"El número máximo de caracteres que puede utilizar en una clave de etiqueta es 128.","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag value is 256.":"El número máximo de caracteres que puede utilizar en un valor de etiqueta es 256.","The path can be up to {{maxLength}} characters.":"La ruta puede tener hasta {{maxLength}} caracteres.","The path doesn't support these segments: {{segments}}. Remove them, and add what you need from the following cards.":"La ruta no admite estos segmentos: {{segments}}. Quítelos y añada lo que necesite de las siguientes tarjetas.","The path is already the default.":"La ruta ya es la predeterminada.","The path is the per-workload part of each identity's name. Keep the Region in front so names stay unique across accounts and Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.":"La ruta es la parte por carga de trabajo del nombre de cada identidad. Mantenga la región al principio para que los nombres sigan siendo únicos en todas las cuentas y regiones, o reorganice los segmentos para que coincidan con la convención de nomenclatura de su equipo.","The path prefixes your policy allows":"Los prefijos de ruta que permite su política","The permissions defined in this policy for <b>{{providerName}}</b> stop applying.":"Los permisos definidos en esta política para <b>{{providerName}}</b> dejan de aplicarse.","The provider could not be deleted. Try again.":"No se pudo eliminar el proveedor. Inténtelo de nuevo.","The provider is being created. Wait for the request to finish.":"Se está creando el proveedor. Espere a que finalice la solicitud.","The provider might still be deleted. Check the providers list later.":"Es posible que el proveedor aún se haya eliminado. Consulte la lista de proveedores más adelante.","The resource policy on this provider controls who can associate templates with it.":"La política de recursos de este proveedor controla quién puede asociarle plantillas.","The soonest the new certificate can take over. It publishes to the trust bundle first, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. Signing may start later than this, never sooner.":"El momento más temprano en que se puede empezar a firmar con este nuevo certificado. El certificado se publica primero en el paquete de confianza para que todos los verificadores puedan comprobarlo antes de que se use para firmar. La firma puede comenzar más tarde, pero nunca antes de ese momento.","The soonest this certificate can start signing. It publishes to the trust bundle first, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. Signing may start later than this, never sooner.":"El momento más temprano en que se puede empezar a firmar con este certificado. El certificado se publica primero en el paquete de confianza para que todos los verificadores puedan comprobarlo antes de que se use para firmar. La firma puede comenzar más tarde, pero nunca antes de ese momento.",Theme:SLt,"There was an error loading the code editor.":"Se produjo un error al cargar el editor de código.","These clusters set the template's <policyLink>attestation policy</policyLink>.":"Estos clústeres configuran la <policyLink>política de atestación</policyLink> de la plantilla.","These resources need to be deleted before deleting the provider.":"Estos recursos deben eliminarse antes de eliminar el proveedor.","This account ({{accountId}})":"Esta cuenta ({{accountId}})","This action deletes the workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.":"Esta acción elimina el proveedor de identidades de la carga de trabajo <b>{{providerName}}</b>.","This cannot be undone, and creating a provider with the same name later does not restore anything. To proceed, complete the steps below.":"Esto no se puede deshacer y la creación posterior de un proveedor con el mismo nombre no restaura nada. Para continuar, complete los pasos que se indican a continuación.","This cannot be undone, and the path this template reserved stays reserved. No future template can generate identities under it.":"Esta acción no se puede deshacer y la ruta reservada por esta plantilla permanecerá reservada. Ninguna plantilla futura podrá generar identidades en esa ruta.","This cannot be undone, and this name stays reserved. It is never issued again, so you cannot recreate this identity under the same name.":"Esta acción no se puede deshacer y el nombre permanecerá reservado. No volverá a asignarse, por lo que no podrá volver a crear esta identidad con el mismo nombre.","This certificate authority uses {{caAlgorithm}}. Rotation keeps the signer's {{signerAlgorithm}} algorithm, so choose a {{signerAlgorithm}} certificate authority instead.":"Esta autoridad de certificación utiliza {{caAlgorithm}}. La rotación mantiene el algoritmo {{signerAlgorithm}} del firmante, así que elija una autoridad de certificación {{signerAlgorithm}} en su lugar.","This certificate has left the trust bundle, so it publishes again first. Signing starts after about {{hours}} hour, once every region has it.":"Este certificado ha abandonado el paquete de confianza, por lo que se vuelve a publicar primero. La firma comienza después de aproximadamente {{hours}} hora, una vez que cada región lo tenga.","This certificate has left the trust bundle, so it publishes again first. Signing starts after about {{hours}} hours, once every region has it.":"Este certificado ha abandonado el paquete de confianza, por lo que se vuelve a publicar primero. La firma comienza después de aproximadamente {{hours}} horas, una vez que cada región lo tenga.","This certificate is validating, so deleting it stops verification immediately":"Este certificado se utiliza actualmente para validar, por lo que eliminarlo detendrá la verificación de inmediato","This certificate stopped signing and its chain has left the trust bundle, so nothing verifies against it. It stays listed as history until you delete it, and deleting it is safe: no credential depends on it, and the certificate signer keeps signing.":"Este certificado dejó de firmar y su cadena ha abandonado el paquete de confianza, por lo que nada se verifica con él. Permanece en el historial hasta que lo elimine, y eliminarlo es seguro: ninguna credencial depende de él y el firmante del certificado sigue firmando.","This cluster is already listed.":"Este clúster ya está en la lista.","This condition key and operator combination already exists":"Esta combinación de clave de condición y operador ya existe","This doesn't look like a valid EKS cluster ARN. An invalid ARN will leave workloads in that cluster without an identity.":"No parece un ARN de clúster de EKS válido. Un ARN no válido dejará sin identidad las cargas de trabajo de ese clúster.","This management account and delegated administrators":"Esta cuenta de administración y los administradores delegados","This organization ({{organizationId}})":"Esta organización ({{organizationId}})","This policy's cluster ARNs don't match the clusters you entered. Changing the clusters won't update this policy. Continue only if that's intended.":"Los ARN de los clústeres de esta política no coinciden con los clústeres que ingresó. Si cambia los clústeres, esta política no se actualizará. Continúe solo si esa es la intención.","This provider has no naming scheme, so the path you enter is the full identity name.":"Este proveedor no tiene un esquema de nombres, por lo que la ruta que debe introducir es el nombre completo de la identidad.","This provider names every identity using the open standard.":"Este proveedor nombra cada identidad utilizando el estándar abierto.","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. Both certificates below stop, including the one still in transition, so the update does not complete. Both stay configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"Este proveedor deja de emitir X.509-SVID de inmediato y las cargas de trabajo que necesitan un certificado de cliente comenzarán a fallar a partir de su próxima solicitud. Ambos certificados que aparecen a continuación se detienen, incluido el que aún está en transición, por lo que la actualización no se completa. Ambos permanecen configurados. Los certificados ya emitidos aún se pueden verificar durante unas 12 horas y, al seleccionar Habilitar, se reanuda la firma.","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"Este proveedor deja de emitir X.509-SVID de inmediato y las cargas de trabajo que necesitan un certificado de cliente comenzarán a fallar a partir de su próxima solicitud. El certificado que aparece a continuación permanece configurado. Los certificados ya emitidos aún se pueden verificar durante unas 12 horas. Al seleccionar Habilitar, se reanuda la firma.","This provider's policy doesn't allow this path prefix \"{{pathPrefix}}\" for your account. Ask your organization administrator which path prefixes are permitted.":"La política de este proveedor no permite el prefijo de ruta “{{pathPrefix}}” para su cuenta. Consulte al administrador de su organización qué prefijos de ruta están permitidos.","This removes the certificate from the provider and pulls its chain from the trust bundle immediately. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"De este modo, se elimina el certificado del proveedor y se retira inmediatamente su cadena del paquete de confianza. La propia autoridad de certificación permanece en AWS Private CA sin cambios.","This removes the certificate from the provider. Its chain already left the trust bundle, so nothing that is verifying today changes. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"De este modo, se elimina el certificado del proveedor. Su cadena de certificados ya se retiró del paquete de confianza, por lo que las verificaciones que se realizan actualmente no se verán afectadas. La propia autoridad de certificación permanecerá en AWS Private CA sin cambios.","This tag will be removed upon saving changes":"Esta etiqueta se eliminará al guardar los cambios","This usually takes a few minutes. Keep this page open until it finishes.":"Esto suele tardar unos minutos. Mantenga esta página abierta hasta que termine.",Today:"Hoy","Too many requests":"Demasiadas solicitudes","Trace and control access per workload":"Rastree y controle el acceso por carga de trabajo","Trust bundle":"Paquete de confianza","trust domain":"dominio de confianza","Trust domain":"Dominio de confianza","Trust domain is the root of trust for the SPIFFE naming scheme. It is a logical name that follows DNS naming style, for example prod.acme.com, but does not need to match a real DNS record.":"El dominio de confianza es la raíz de la confianza del esquema de nomenclatura de SPIFFE. Es un nombre lógico que sigue el estilo de nomenclatura de DNS, por ejemplo prod.acme.com, pero no necesita coincidir con un registro de DNS real.","Try again. If the problem continues, contact AWS Support.":"Inténtelo de nuevo. Si el problema persiste, contacte con AWS Support.","Unable to load templates":"No se pueden cargar las plantillas",Undo:_Lt,"Up to 128 characters. Must be unique per provider.":"Hasta 128 caracteres. Debe ser único por proveedor.","Up to 128 characters. Use alphanumeric and '-_.' characters. Must be unique in your organization. Can't be changed after the provider is created.":'Hasta 128 caracteres. Utilice caracteres alfanuméricos y "-_.". Debe ser único en su organización. No se puede cambiar una vez que se crea el proveedor.',"Up to 128 characters. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters. Must be unique per provider.":'Hasta 128 caracteres. Utilice caracteres alfanuméricos y "-_". Debe ser único por proveedor.',Update:xLt,"Update certificate signer":"Actualizar el firmante de certificados",'Use "{{key}}"':"Utilice “{{key}}”",'Use "{{value}}"':"Utilice “{{value}}”","Use case":"Caso de uso","Use cases":"Casos de uso","Use default templates":"Usar las plantillas predeterminadas","Use letters, digits, and . - _ characters, with a single / between parts. No / at the start or end, and a part can't be . or ..":"Utilice letras, dígitos y los caracteres . - _, con una sola / entre las partes. Sin / al inicio ni al final, y una parte no puede ser . ni ..","Use one from another account":"Usar una CA de otra cuenta","Use only Latin letters, numbers, spaces, tabs, line breaks, and standard keyboard symbols.":"Utilice únicamente letras latinas, números, espacios, tabulaciones, saltos de línea y símbolos de teclado estándar.","Use only letters, digits, - and _ characters.":"Utilice solo letras, dígitos y los caracteres - y _.","Use only letters, digits, . - and _ characters. The path can't be . or ..":"Utilice únicamente letras, dígitos y los caracteres . - y _. La ruta no puede ser . o ..","Use only letters, digits, periods (.), hyphens (-), and underscores (_).":"Utilice únicamente letras, dígitos, puntos (.), guiones (-) y guiones bajos (_).","Use the workload identity in trust policies, resource policies, or SCPs. Each call is recorded in CloudTrail with the workload's identity.":"Utilice la identidad de la carga de trabajo en las políticas de confianza, las políticas de recursos o los SCP. Cada llamada se registra en CloudTrail con la identidad de la carga de trabajo.",'Use: "{{text}}"':"Usar: “{{text}}”","Used as the common name in the certificate authority's subject.":"Se utiliza como nombre común en el asunto de la autoridad de certificación.",Validating:ALt,"Validating: stopped signing, still trusted":"Validando: dejó de firmar, sigue siendo de confianza",Value:ELt,"Value must be 256 characters or less.":"El valor debe tener 256 caracteres o menos.",Values:CLt,"View all":"Ver todo","View all notifications":"Ver todas las notificaciones","View JSON":"Ver JSON",Visual:TLt,Warning:ILt,Warnings:DLt,"What gets created":"¿Qué se crea?","Which EKS clusters is this provider for?":"¿Para qué clústeres de EKS es este proveedor?",'Wildcard "*" is only allowed with the StringLike, StringNotLike, ArnLike, or ArnNotLike operators.':"El comodín «*» solo se permite con los operadores StringLike, StringNotLike, ArnLike o ArnNotLike.","Without a policy, no other account can create templates under this provider, though delegated administrators can already create both. Add a statement for each account, organizational unit, or IAM principal that should be able to, and limit each one to a path prefix.":"Sin una política, ninguna otra cuenta puede crear plantillas bajo este proveedor, aunque los administradores delegados ya pueden crear ambas. Agregue una instrucción para cada cuenta, unidad organizativa o entidad principal de IAM que debería poder hacerlo, y limite cada una a un prefijo de ruta.","Workload identities ({{total}})":"Identidades de la carga de trabajo ({{total}})","Workload identities in the IAM User Guide":"Las identidades de las cargas de trabajo en la guía del usuario de IAM","Workload identities in the IAM User Guide (opens in a new tab)":"Las identidades de las cargas de trabajo en la guía del usuario de IAM (se abre en una pestaña nueva)","Workload identities: {{reason}}":"Identidades de la carga de trabajo: {{reason}}","Workload identity":"Identidad de carga de trabajo","Workload Identity":"Identidad de carga de trabajo","Workload identity {{name}}: {{reason}}":"Identidad de carga de trabajo {{name}}: {{reason}}","Workload identity {{workloadIdentifier}} deleted.":"Se eliminó la identidad de la carga de trabajo {{workloadIdentifier}}.","Workloads get named automatically":"Las cargas de trabajo reciben un nombre automáticamente","Workloads in these EKS clusters can get an identity from this provider, when all of these are true:":"Las cargas de trabajo de estos clústeres de EKS pueden obtener una identidad de este proveedor cuando se cumplen todas las siguientes condiciones:","Workloads running in these clusters can get an identity from this provider. Add 2 or more.":"Las cargas de trabajo que se ejecutan en estos clústeres pueden obtener una identidad de este proveedor. Agregue 2 o más.","Workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Las cargas de trabajo que se ejecutan en esta cuenta pueden usar las identidades generadas por esta plantilla con información verificada por {{workloadLabel}}.","Workloads running in this cluster can get an identity from this provider.":"Las cargas de trabajo que se ejecutan en este clúster pueden obtener una identidad de este proveedor.","Workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Las cargas de trabajo que se ejecutan en su organización pueden usar las identidades generadas por esta plantilla con información verificada por {{workloadLabel}}.","Workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request":"Las cargas de trabajo que utilicen estas identidades dejarán de recibir credenciales y fallarán en su próxima solicitud","Workloads, such as agents, pods, and jobs, are verified at runtime and get a workload identity, one per workload, generated by a template. The identity gets fine-grained access to AWS resources through IAM policies and CloudTrail, and signed JWT and X.509 credentials for meshes and SaaS apps.":"Las cargas de trabajo, como los agentes, los pods y los trabajos, se verifican en tiempo de ejecución y obtienen una identidad de carga de trabajo, una por carga de trabajo, generada por una plantilla. La identidad obtiene acceso granular a los recursos de AWS a través de las políticas de IAM y CloudTrail, y credenciales JWT y X.509 firmadas para mallas y aplicaciones SaaS.","Wrap lines":"Ajustar líneas","Write a policy to let another account create templates, or to stop a delegated administrator from part of the name space. Each statement names an organizational unit, specific accounts, or individual IAM principals, allows or denies, and can be limited to a path prefix.":"Escriba una política para permitir que otra cuenta cree plantillas o para impedir que un administrador delegado ocupe parte del espacio de nombres. Cada instrucción designa una unidad organizativa, cuentas específicas o entidades principales de IAM concretas, permite o deniega el acceso y se puede limitar a un prefijo de ruta.","Yes by default":"Sí de forma predeterminada","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tag.":"Puede agregar hasta {{availableTags}} etiqueta más.","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tags.":"Puede agregar hasta {{availableTags}} etiquetas más.","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"Ha superado el límite de {{tagLimit}} etiqueta.","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"Ha superado el límite de {{tagLimit}} etiquetas.","You have more keys than can be displayed":"Tiene más claves de las que se pueden mostrar","You have more values than can be displayed":"Tiene más valores de los que se pueden mostrar","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"Ha alcanzado el límite de {{tagLimit}} etiqueta.","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"Ha alcanzado el límite de {{tagLimit}} etiquetas.","You have unsaved tag changes. Leave this page and discard them?":"Tiene cambios de etiqueta sin guardar. ¿Desea abandonar esta página y descartarlos?","You must enter a path":"Debe ingresar una ruta","You must specify a condition key":"Debe especificar una clave de condición","You must specify a tag key":"Debe especificar una clave de etiqueta","You must specify a unique tag key.":"Debe especificar una clave de etiqueta única.","You must specify a value":"Debe especificar un valor","Your administrator decides which prefixes this account can use. This is checked when you create.":"El administrador decide qué prefijos puede usar esta cuenta. Esto se comprueba al crearla.","Your identities will be <code>{{prefix}}<em>{{placeholder}}</em></code>":"Sus identidades serán <code>{{prefix}}<em>{{placeholder}}</em></code>","Your organization already has a workload identity provider. Add templates under it to start issuing identities to your workloads — each named under your account's path prefix.":"Su organización ya cuenta con un proveedor de identidades de carga de trabajo. Agregue plantillas para empezar a asignar identidades a sus cargas de trabajo; cada una de ellas se nombra con el prefijo de ruta de su cuenta.","Your organization has workload identity providers you can use. Pick one and add templates under it to start issuing identities to your workloads.":"Su organización tiene proveedores de identidades para cargas de trabajo que puede usar. Elija uno y agréguele plantillas para empezar a asignar identidades a sus cargas de trabajo.","YYYY/MM/DD":"AAAA/MM/DD","{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.","A declared identity has a fixed name you define. Use one when you need an exact name, for example to match a name another system already expects.":"A declared identity has a fixed name you define. Use one when you need an exact name, for example to match a name another system already expects.","A fact {{workload}} checks when the agent or workload starts.":"A fact {{workload}} checks when the agent or workload starts.","A provider issues secure, verifiable identities to your agents and workloads, like your Kubernetes pods or AI agents, to access AWS and third-party services without long-lived credentials.":"A provider issues secure, verifiable identities to your agents and workloads, like your Kubernetes pods or AI agents, to access AWS and third-party services without long-lived credentials.","A template automatically generates an identity for each matching agent or workload under {{providerName}}.":"A template automatically generates an identity for each matching agent or workload under {{providerName}}.","A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued.":"A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued.","A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued. Decide how this provider issues identities - starting from the <link>default templates</link> for common use cases, or skipping them. Templates are optional and can be added later.":"A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued. Decide how this provider issues identities - starting from the <link>default templates</link> for common use cases, or skipping them. Templates are optional and can be added later.","A template names identities automatically as matching agents and workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.":"A template names identities automatically as matching agents and workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.","A template with no attestation policy matches no agent or workload, so nothing is ever issued from it. Set a policy to define which agents and workloads qualify.":"A template with no attestation policy matches no agent or workload, so nothing is ever issued from it. Set a policy to define which agents and workloads qualify.","A template's path pattern, built from facts like cluster, namespace, and service account, names each agent or workload automatically when it starts. You don't create identities ahead of time.":"A template's path pattern, built from facts like cluster, namespace, and service account, names each agent or workload automatically when it starts. You don't create identities ahead of time.","Add a fact or condition key. A path of only custom text would give every agent or workload the same name.":"Add a fact or condition key. A path of only custom text would give every agent or workload the same name.","Add an {{conditionKey}} condition, so only agents or workloads in these clusters get an identity.":"Add an {{conditionKey}} condition, so only agents or workloads in these clusters get an identity.","Add attestation policy":"Add attestation policy","Add templates after the provider is created.":"Add templates after the provider is created.","Agent and workload identity":"Agent and workload identity","Agent and workload identity - <em>Preview</em>":"Agent and workload identity - <em>Preview</em>","Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide":"Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide","Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide (opens in a new tab)":"Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide (opens in a new tab)","Agents and workloads get named automatically":"Agents and workloads get named automatically","Agents and workloads get short-lived credentials that renew automatically and follow the SPIFFE standard, so they work with service meshes such as Istio and with business applications.":"Agents and workloads get short-lived credentials that renew automatically and follow the SPIFFE standard, so they work with service meshes such as Istio and with business applications.","Agents and workloads in these EKS clusters can get an identity from this provider, when all of these are true:":"Agents and workloads in these EKS clusters can get an identity from this provider, when all of these are true:","Agents and workloads running in these clusters can get an identity from this provider. Add two or more.":"Agents and workloads running in these clusters can get an identity from this provider. Add two or more.","Agents and workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Agents and workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.","Agents and workloads running in this cluster can get an identity from this provider.":"Agents and workloads running in this cluster can get an identity from this provider.","Agents and workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Agents and workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.","Agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request":"Agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request","Agents and workloads, such as AI agents and pods, are verified at runtime and each gets its own identity, generated by a template. The identity gets fine-grained access to AWS resources through IAM policies and CloudTrail, and signed JWT and X.509 credentials for meshes and apps.":"Agents and workloads, such as AI agents and pods, are verified at runtime and each gets its own identity, generated by a template. The identity gets fine-grained access to AWS resources through IAM policies and CloudTrail, and signed JWT and X.509 credentials for meshes and apps.","All templates and identities under this provider will be deleted":"All templates and identities under this provider will be deleted","An AI agent or workload gets an identity that is unique.":"An AI agent or workload gets an identity that is unique.","An identity with no attestation policy admits no workload, so nothing can run as it. Set a policy to define which workload qualifies.":"An identity with no attestation policy admits no workload, so nothing can run as it. Set a policy to define which workload qualifies.","An identity with this name already exists.":"An identity with this name already exists.","At runtime the platform attests these facts about the agent or workload. Any agent or workload whose attestation carries them gets an identity issued from this template.":"At runtime the platform attests these facts about the agent or workload. Any agent or workload whose attestation carries them gets an identity issued from this template.","Attestation policy for {{name}} has been removed.":"Attestation policy for {{name}} has been removed.","Attestation policy for {{name}} has been updated.":"Attestation policy for {{name}} has been updated.","By continuing, you also enable organization level resource creation, which is needed to create the organization scoped provider. You can disable it later in Settings.":"By continuing, you also enable organization level resource creation, which is needed to create the organization scoped provider. You can disable it later in Settings.","Change the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.":"Change the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.","Choose a stable, unique name that identifies one environment or group of agents and workloads, for example prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal.":"Choose a stable, unique name that identifies one environment or group of agents and workloads, for example prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal.","Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for an agent or workload.":"Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for an agent or workload.","Choose the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.":"Choose the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.","Choose where the workload is hosted":"Choose where the workload is hosted","Choose who can use it":"Choose who can use it","Control what an agent or workload can reach with familiar IAM policies and see its AWS calls in CloudTrail.":"Control what an agent or workload can reach with familiar IAM policies and see its AWS calls in CloudTrail.","Create declared identity":"Create declared identity","Creates an agent and workload identity provider and template for agents and workloads running in one or more EKS clusters under a service mesh, such as Istio.":"Creates an agent and workload identity provider and template for agents and workloads running in one or more EKS clusters under a service mesh, such as Istio.","Creating the identity":"Creating the identity","Declare an identity with the exact name you need":"Declare an identity with the exact name you need","Declared identities":"Declared identities","Declared identity":"Declared identity","Declared identity {{name}} created.":"Declared identity {{name}} created.","Define which agents and workloads are allowed to use this template.":"Define which agents and workloads are allowed to use this template.","Delete the templates under <b>{{providerName}}</b> before deleting the provider. Once deleted, agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials and fail on their next request, and access that you granted to these identities will stop working.":"Delete the templates under <b>{{providerName}}</b> before deleting the provider. Once deleted, agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials and fail on their next request, and access that you granted to these identities will stop working.","Deleting templates and identities":"Deleting templates and identities","Each identity is fully the template path.":"Each identity is fully the template path.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.","Enter a description":"Enter a description","Failed to create the declared identity.":"Failed to create the declared identity.","Failed to save attestation policy.":"Failed to save attestation policy.","Filter declared identities":"Filter declared identities","For example, to match a name another system already expects.":"For example, to match a name another system already expects.","from provider":"from provider","Give AI agents and workloads their own identities. Know which of them made each call. Scope its access with the IAM policies you already use.":"Give AI agents and workloads their own identities. Know which of them made each call. Scope its access with the IAM policies you already use.","Give an agent or workload a unique identity, so you can grant it access and audit what it did rather than sharing one role.":"Give an agent or workload a unique identity, so you can grant it access and audit what it did rather than sharing one role.","Grant access":"Grant access","Grant this name access to resources in IAM policies.":"Grant this name access to resources in IAM policies.","IAM for agents and workloads":"IAM for agents and workloads","IAM for agents and workloads (opens in a new tab)":"IAM for agents and workloads (opens in a new tab)",Identifier:LLt,"Identities ({{total}})":"Identities ({{total}})","Identities are issued at runtime from facts the agent or workload proves, rather than from what an admin assigns.":"Identities are issued at runtime from facts the agent or workload proves, rather than from what an admin assigns.","Identities for agents":"Identities for agents","Identities: {{reason}}":"Identities: {{reason}}","Identity {{name}}: {{reason}}":"Identity {{name}}: {{reason}}","Invalid trust domain. Use lowercase alphanumeric and '-.' characters.":"Invalid trust domain. Use lowercase alphanumeric and '-.' characters.","Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's agents and workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. Standard pricing applies to the creation and use of AWS Private CA.":"Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's agents and workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. Standard pricing applies to the creation and use of AWS Private CA.","It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so agents and workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. To avoid this, wait until it becomes inactive on its own. Deleting it then has no effect on verification.":"It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so agents and workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. To avoid this, wait until it becomes inactive on its own. Deleting it then has no effect on verification.","Let agents and workloads reach non-AWS resources":"Let agents and workloads reach non-AWS resources","Loading declared identities":"Loading declared identities","Matching agents and workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.":"Matching agents and workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.","No agent and workload identity providers":"No agent and workload identity providers","No agent or workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.":"No agent or workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.","No attestation policy attached.":"No attestation policy attached.","No attestation policy. No agent or workload will be issued an identity from this template until you add one.":"No attestation policy. No agent or workload will be issued an identity from this template until you add one.","No conditions. This policy matches every agent or workload of its service.":"No conditions. This policy matches every agent or workload of its service.","No segments yet. Add at least one, or every agent or workload this template matches resolves to the same name.":"No segments yet. Add at least one, or every agent or workload this template matches resolves to the same name.","None – names are defined by templates":"None – names are defined by templates","Nothing can run as this identity":"Nothing can run as this identity","Once the attestation policy is removed, matching agents and workloads will not be issued agent and workload identities until you add a policy again.":"Once the attestation policy is removed, matching agents and workloads will not be issued agent and workload identities until you add a policy again.","One bundle per provider, and one URL. It carries every authority the provider publishes: both outbound signers, and during an update both the current and incoming certificate authority, which is what lets verifiers accept either one through the handover. Your own AWS agents and workloads get these keys automatically; send this to systems outside AWS.":"One bundle per provider, and one URL. It carries every authority the provider publishes: both outbound signers, and during an update both the current and incoming certificate authority, which is what lets verifiers accept either one through the handover. Your own AWS agents and workloads get these keys automatically; send this to systems outside AWS.","One provider and one trust domain shared by every EKS cluster in the mesh. An agent or workload with the same namespace and service account in any of these clusters shares one identity.":"One provider and one trust domain shared by every EKS cluster in the mesh. An agent or workload with the same namespace and service account in any of these clusters shares one identity.","Path is the unique part of each identity's name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts an agent or workload proves.":"Path is the unique part of each identity's name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts an agent or workload proves.","path prefix":"path prefix","Policy: Define how an agent or workload attests to get the identity":"Policy: Define how an agent or workload attests to get the identity","Proven at runtime":"Proven at runtime","Providers to issue agent and workload identities":"Providers to issue agent and workload identities","Scoped, auditable access":"Scoped, auditable access","Search by name":"Search by name","Set the exact name":"Set the exact name","Set the naming format and usage scope that every agent and workload identity from this provider inherits.":"Set the naming format and usage scope that every agent and workload identity from this provider inherits.","Set the unique path pattern that every identity generated by this template follows. Cannot be changed later.":"Set the unique path pattern that every identity generated by this template follows. Cannot be changed later.","Set up a provider to hold the templates that generate identity names and the signers that sign credentials for systems outside AWS.":"Set up a provider to hold the templates that generate identity names and the signers that sign credentials for systems outside AWS.","Set up a way to issue agent and workload identities":"Set up a way to issue agent and workload identities","Set which workloads can use this identity and where they must run.":"Set which workloads can use this identity and where they must run.","Stop matching agents and workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request":"Stop matching agents and workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request","Templates give matching agents and workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.":"Templates give matching agents and workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it.":"The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.":"The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Generated from the EKS clusters above. Can be edited later.":"The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Generated from the EKS clusters above. Can be edited later.","The attestation policy controls how this identity is issued. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.":"The attestation policy controls how this identity is issued. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.","The attestation policy is the set of facts an agent or workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so an agent or workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.":"The attestation policy is the set of facts an agent or workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so an agent or workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.","The certificate chain is distributing to every Region, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. It starts signing at {{at}}. That is the minimum signing delay you set, so signing may start later than this. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.":"The certificate chain is distributing to every Region, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. It starts signing at {{at}}. That is the minimum signing delay you set, so signing may start later than this. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.","The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Account ID and Region in front so names stay unique across accounts and Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.":"The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Account ID and Region in front so names stay unique across accounts and Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.","The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Region in front so names stay unique across Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.":"The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Region in front so names stay unique across Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.","This action deletes the agent and workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.":"This action deletes the agent and workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.","This certificate has stopped signing, but its chain stays in the trust bundle so certificates already issued under it keep verifying. It becomes inactive at {{at}}. Until then, Enable resumes signing with no wait. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.":"This certificate has stopped signing, but its chain stays in the trust bundle so certificates already issued under it keep verifying. It becomes inactive at {{at}}. Until then, Enable resumes signing with no wait. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.","This doesn't look like a valid EKS cluster ARN. An invalid ARN will leave agents or workloads in that cluster without an identity.":"This doesn't look like a valid EKS cluster ARN. An invalid ARN will leave agents or workloads in that cluster without an identity.","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. Both certificates below stop, including the one still in transition, so the update does not complete. Both stay configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. Both certificates below stop, including the one still in transition, so the update does not complete. Both stay configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.","This template issues no identities":"This template issues no identities","Trust domain must be 64 characters or less.":"Trust domain must be 64 characters or less.","Use the agent or workload identity in trust policies, resource policies, or SCPs. CloudTrail records its calls with that identity.":"Use the agent or workload identity in trust policies, resource policies, or SCPs. CloudTrail records its calls with that identity.","What conditions should the agent or workload match?":"What conditions should the agent or workload match?","Where is the agent or workload hosted?":"Where is the agent or workload hosted?","You must enter a name":"You must enter a name","Your organization already has an agent and workload identity provider. Add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads — each named under your account's path prefix.":"Your organization already has an agent and workload identity provider. Add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads — each named under your account's path prefix.","Your organization has agent and workload identity providers you can use. Pick one and add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads.":"Your organization has agent and workload identity providers you can use. Pick one and add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads."},NLt=Object.freeze(Object.defineProperty({__proto__:null,ARN:"ARN",Actions:fDt,Active:yDt,Add:bDt,Apply:wDt,Attestation:kDt,Cancel:SDt,Clear:_Dt,Close:xDt,Configured:ADt,Confirm:EDt,Contains:CDt,Created:TDt,Delete:IDt,Description:DDt,Details:LDt,Disable:PDt,Dismiss:NDt,Edit:RDt,Editing:MDt,Enable:zDt,Equals:BDt,Errors:FDt,Format:$Dt,Identifier:LLt,Inactive:jDt,Info:WDt,JWKS:qDt,Key:UDt,Name:VDt,New:HDt,None:KDt,Notifications:GDt,Operator:YDt,Operators:JDt,Path:QDt,Preferences:eLt,Preview:tLt,Properties:aLt,Property:nLt,Provided:iLt,Provider:rLt,Providers:oLt,Ready:sLt,Recommended:lLt,Refresh:cLt,Remove:dLt,Retry:uLt,Save:pLt,Scheme:mLt,Scope:gLt,Status:vLt,Subject:fLt,Success:yLt,Tags:bLt,Template:wLt,Templates:kLt,Theme:SLt,Today:"Hoy",Undo:_Lt,Update:xLt,Validating:ALt,Value:ELt,Values:CLt,Visual:TLt,Warning:ILt,Warnings:DLt,and:"y",default:PLt,equals:ODt,optional:ZDt,or:"o",path:XDt,scheme:hLt},Symbol.toStringTag,{value:"Module"})),RLt="Actions",MLt="Actif",zLt="Ajouter",OLt="Appliquer",BLt="Attestation",FLt="Annuler",$Lt="Effacer",jLt="Fermer",WLt="Configuré",qLt="Confirmer",ULt="Contient",VLt="Créé",HLt="Supprimer",KLt="Description",GLt="Détails",YLt="Désactiver",JLt="Ignorer",ZLt="Modifier",XLt="Modification",QLt="Activer",ePt="est égal à",tPt="Est égal à",aPt="Erreurs",nPt="Format",iPt="Inactif",rPt="Informations",oPt="JWKS",sPt="Nouveau",lPt="Aucun",cPt="Notifications",dPt="Opérateur",uPt="Opérateurs",pPt="facultatif",hPt="Chemin",mPt="Chemin",gPt="Préférences",vPt="Aperçu",fPt="Propriétés",yPt="Propriété",bPt="Fourni",wPt="Fournisseur",kPt="Fournisseurs",SPt="Prêt",_Pt="Recommandé",xPt="Actualiser",APt="Supprimer",EPt="Réessayer",CPt="Enregistrer",TPt="Schéma",IPt="Schéma",DPt="Portée",LPt="Statut",PPt="Objet",NPt="Réussite",RPt="Balises",MPt="Modèle",zPt="Modèles",OPt="Thème",BPt="Aujourd’hui",FPt="Annuler",$Pt="Mettre à jour",jPt="Validation en cours",WPt="Valeur",qPt="Valeurs",UPt="Visuel",VPt="Avertissement",HPt="Avertissements",KPt="Identifier",GPt={"'{{providerName}}' does not exist in your account":"« {{providerName}} » n’existe pas dans votre compte","(earliest)":"(le plus tôt)","{{addedCount}} tag added or changed":"{{addedCount}} balise ajoutée ou modifiée","{{addedCount}} tags added or changed":"{{addedCount}} balises ajoutées ou modifiées","{{createdCount}} templates created: {{templateNames}}.":"{{createdCount}} modèles créés : {{templateNames}}.","{{failed}} of {{total}} certificates could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}} de {{total}} certificats n’ont pas pu être supprimés, donc le fournisseur n’a pas été supprimé. Corrigez les erreurs, puis réessayez.","{{failed}} of {{total}} could not be deleted.":"{{failed}} de {{total}} n’ont pas pu être supprimés.","{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and workload identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}} de {{total}} modèles et identités de charge de travail n’ont pas pu être supprimés, le fournisseur n’a donc pas été supprimé. Corrigez les erreurs, puis réessayez.","{{failedCount}} template could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.":"{{failedCount}} modèle n’a pas pu être créé. Vérifiez les erreurs suivantes et réessayez.","{{failedCount}} templates could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.":"{{failedCount}} modèles n’ont pas pu être créés. Vérifiez les erreurs suivantes et réessayez.","{{identityCount}} identities":"{{identityCount}} identités","{{identityCount}} identity":"{{identityCount}} identité","{{label}} (service mesh)":"{{label}} (maillage de services)","{{label}} copied":"{{label}} copié","{{label}} failed to copy":"Échec de la copie de {{label}}","{{label}} template":"{{label}} modèle","{{label}} template {{index}}":"{{label}} modèle {{index}}","{{label}}:":"{{label}}:","{{matchCount}} match":"{{matchCount}} correspondance","{{matchCount}} matches":"{{matchCount}} correspondances","{{name}} has been successfully created.":"{{name}} a bien été créé.","{{name}} has been successfully created. However, the following operations failed:":"{{name}} a été créé avec succès. Cependant, les opérations suivantes ont échoué :","{{providerName}} still has these resources:":"{{providerName}} dispose toujours des ressources suivantes :","{{removedCount}} tag removed":"Balise {{removedCount}} supprimée","{{removedCount}} tags removed":"{{removedCount}} balises supprimées","{{scope}} · {{domain}}":"{{scope}} · {{domain}}","{{settled}} of {{total}}":"{{settled}} sur {{total}}","{{subject}}. Does not match this signer's {{algorithm}} algorithm.":"{{subject}}. Ne correspond pas à l’algorithme {{algorithm}} de ce signataire.","{{tagCount}} tag":"{{tagCount}} balise","{{tagCount}} tags":"{{tagCount}} balises","{{templateCount}} template":"{{templateCount}} modèle","{{templateCount}} templates":"{{templateCount}} modèles","{{templateName}} template failed to create. To try again, <link>add templates</link>. Error details: {{reason}}":"{{templateName}} Échec de la création du modèle. Pour réessayer, <link>ajoutez des modèles</link>. Détails de l’erreur : {{reason}}","{{workload}} fact":"Fait {{workload}}","{defined by template}":"{defined by template}","<term>Support:</term> Amazon EKS, Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Runtime, and Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Gateway.":"<term>Assistance :</term> Amazon EKS, Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Runtime et Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Gateway.","1 EKS cluster":"1 cluster EKS","1 provider and 1 trust domain per EKS cluster. Each namespace and service account in this cluster gets its own identity, trusted only within this cluster.":"1 fournisseur et 1 domaine de confiance par cluster EKS. Chaque espace de noms et compte de service de ce cluster obtient sa propre identité, considérée comme fiable uniquement dans ce cluster.","1 provider and 1 trust domain shared by every EKS cluster in the mesh. A workload with the same namespace and service account in any of these clusters shares one identity.":"1 fournisseur et 1 domaine de confiance communs à tous les clusters EKS du maillage. Une charge de travail utilisant le même espace de noms et le même compte de service dans n’importe lequel de ces clusters partage une même identité.","1 to 48 hours, in whole hours. Publishing is usually much faster, but can take up to 24 hours.":"1 à 48 heures, en heures entières. La publication est généralement beaucoup plus rapide, mais peut prendre jusqu’à 24 heures.","1. Select all the check boxes to confirm what deleting {{providerName}} will do.":"1. Cochez toutes les cases pour confirmer ce qu’entraînera la suppression de {{providerName}}.","2. Confirm that you want to delete this provider by typing {{providerName}} below.":"2. Pour confirmer la suppression de ce fournisseur, saisissez {{providerName}} ci-dessous.","A declared identity has a fixed path you define. Use one when you need an exact path, for example to match a value another system already expects.":"Une identité déclarée possède un chemin fixe que vous définissez. Utilisez-en une lorsque vous avez besoin d’un chemin exact, par exemple pour qu’il corresponde à une valeur déjà attendue par un autre système.","A deny, and only for delegated administrators":"Un refus, et uniquement pour les administrateurs délégués","A fact {{workload}} checks when the workload starts.":"Un fait {{workload}} vérifie à quel moment la charge de travail commence.","A fixed label, such as an environment name.":"Une étiquette fixe, telle qu’un nom d’environnement.","A name to identify this identity.":"Un nom pour identifier cette identité.","A provider with this name already exists.":"Un fournisseur portant ce nom existe déjà.","A tag is a label you assign to an AWS resource. Each tag has a key and an optional value. Use tags to search and filter this provider, or to track your AWS costs.":"Une balise est une étiquette que vous affectez à une ressource AWS. Chaque balise comprend une clé et une valeur facultative. Utilisez des balises pour rechercher et filtrer ce fournisseur, ou pour suivre vos coûts AWS.","A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts a workload must prove before an identity is issued. Decide how this provider issues identities - starting from the <link>default templates</link> for common use cases, or skipping them. You can add and name identities manually at any time - templates are optional and can be added later.":"Un modèle définit le schéma de chemin d’accès utilisé pour attribuer un nom unique aux identités, ainsi que les conditions qu’une charge de travail doit remplir avant qu’une identité ne soit délivrée. Déterminez comment ce fournisseur délivre les identités : en partant des <link>modèles par défaut</link> pour les cas d’utilisation courants, ou en les ignorant. Vous pouvez ajouter et nommer des identités manuellement à tout moment ; les modèles sont facultatifs et peuvent être ajoutés ultérieurement.","A template with this name already exists.":"Un modèle portant ce nom existe déjà.","A template's path pattern, built from facts like cluster, namespace, and service account, names each workload automatically when it starts. You don't create identities ahead of time.":"Le modèle de chemin d’un modèle, construit à partir de données telles que le cluster, l’espace de noms et le compte de service, nomme automatiquement chaque charge de travail au démarrage. Vous ne créez pas d’identités à l’avance.","A workload identity provider issues secure, verifiable identities to your workloads, like Kubernetes pods or AI agents. Workloads use them to access AWS and third-party services without long-lived credentials.":"Un fournisseur d’identités de charges de travail délivre des identités sécurisées et vérifiables à vos charges de travail, comme les pods Kubernetes ou les agents d’IA. Ces charges de travail les utilisent pour accéder à AWS et à des services tiers sans informations d’identification à longue durée de vie.","A workload, including an AI agent or sub-agent created on demand, gets its own identity. No workload shares or inherits another's.":"Une charge de travail, y compris un agent IA ou un sous-agent IA créé à la demande, acquiert sa propre identité. Aucune charge de travail ne partage ni n’hérite de celle d’une autre.","Access a partner API, a SaaS endpoint, or an OIDC service. No setup needed.":"Accédez à une API partenaire, à un point de terminaison SaaS ou à un service OIDC. Aucune configuration n’est nécessaire.","Access a service mesh, a database, or an on-premises system.":"Accédez à un maillage de services, à une base de données ou à un système sur site.","Access denied":"Accès refusé","Access you granted to these identities will stop working":"Les accès que vous avez accordés à ces identités ne fonctionneront plus","Account scoped":"Portée du compte",Actions:RLt,"Activating it":"Son activation",Active:MLt,"Active certificate authority ID":"ID de l’autorité de certification active","Active: currently signing":"Actif : signe actuellement",Add:zLt,"Add {{label}} template":"Ajouter un modèle {{label}}","Add a fact or condition key. A path of only custom text would give every workload the same name.":"Ajoutez un fait ou une clé de condition. Un chemin contenant uniquement du texte personnalisé donnerait le même nom à chaque charge de travail.","Add an {{conditionKey}} condition, so only workloads in these clusters get an identity.":"Ajoutez une condition {{conditionKey}} afin que seules les charges de travail de ces clusters obtiennent une identité.","Add at least 1 path segment.":"Ajoutez au moins un segment de chemin.","Add at least 1 template to continue.":"Ajoutez au moins un modèle pour continuer.","Add at least 2 clusters.":"Ajoutez au moins 2 clusters.","Add attestation rules":"Ajouter des règles d’attestation","Add cluster ARN":"Ajouter l’ARN d’un cluster","Add condition":"Ajouter une condition","Add default templates for Amazon EKS, AgentCore Runtime, and AgentCore Gateway.":"Ajoutez des modèles par défaut pour Amazon EKS, le service d’exécution AgentCore et la passerelle AgentCore.","Add new tag":"Ajouter une nouvelle balise","Add policy":"Ajouter une politique","Add request-context values like account, Region, or organization.":"Ajoutez des valeurs de contexte de la demande telles que le compte, la région ou l’organisation.","Add tags":"Ajouter des balises","Add tags to this provider for cost management and access control.":"Ajoutez des balises à ce fournisseur pour la gestion des coûts et le contrôle d’accès.","Add tags to this template for cost management and access control.":"Ajoutez des balises à ce modèle pour la gestion des coûts et le contrôle d’accès.","Add tags to this workload identity for cost management and access control.":"Ajoutez des balises à cette identité de charge de travail pour la gestion des coûts et le contrôle d’accès.","Add template":"Ajouter un modèle","Add templates":"Ajouter des modèles","Add templates after the provider is created, or create and name identities by hand.":"Ajoutez des modèles une fois le fournisseur créé, ou créez et nommez des identités à la main.","Add to the path pattern":"Ajouter au modèle de chemin","Added or changed tags were not saved":"Les balises ajoutées ou modifiées n’ont pas été enregistrées","Adding permissions to govern who can create templates referring to this provider failed. To try again, <link>add policy</link>. Error details: {{reason}}":"Échec de l’ajout des autorisations permettant de définir qui peut créer des modèles faisant référence à ce fournisseur. Pour réessayer, <link>ajoutez une politique</link>. Détails de l’erreur : {{reason}}","All outbound signers under this provider will be deleted":"Tous les signataires sortants associés à ce fournisseur seront supprimés","All properties":"Toutes les propriétés","All templates and workload identities under this provider will be deleted":"Tous les modèles et toutes les identités de charge de travail liés à ce fournisseur seront supprimés","Allow member accounts to add their own templates, namespaced by account ID":"Autoriser les comptes membres à ajouter leurs propres modèles, avec un espace de noms propre à chaque ID de compte","An identity for agent or workload":"Une identité pour l’agent ou la charge de travail",and:"et","Any value":"N’importe quelle valeur",Apply:OLt,ARN:"ARN","ARN copied":"ARN copié","arn:aws:eks:{Region}:{account ID}:cluster/{cluster name}":"arn:aws:eks:{Region}:{account ID}:cluster/{cluster name}","At runtime the platform attests these facts about the workload. Any workload whose attestation carries them issues an identity from this template.":"Au moment de l’exécution, la plateforme certifie ces informations relatives à la charge de travail. Toute charge de travail dont l’attestation contient ces informations génère une identité à partir de ce modèle.",Attestation:BLt,"Attestation policy":"Politique d’attestation","Auto generated identity name":"Nom d’identité généré automatiquement","Automatically generate from a template":"Générez automatiquement à partir d’un modèle","Available to every account in your organization ({{organizationId}})":"Disponible pour tous les comptes de votre organisation ({{organizationId}})","Available to this account ({{accountId}})":"Disponible pour ce compte ({{accountId}})","AWS account ID":"ID de compte AWS","AWS API calls in CloudTrail resolve to the specific workload that made them. Scope trust policies, resource policies, and SCPs to it, using the IAM policies you already know.":"Les appels d’API AWS dans CloudTrail sont attribués à la charge de travail spécifique qui les a générés. Étendez-y les politiques de confiance, les politiques de ressources et les SCP, en utilisant les politiques IAM que vous connaissez déjà.","AWS creates a subordinate CA in every region this provider signs in, and returns an ID for it.":"AWS crée une autorité de certification subordonnée dans chaque région dans laquelle ce fournisseur signe et renvoie un ID pour celle-ci.","AWS IAM Workload Identity":"Identité de charge de travail AWS IAM","AWS IAM Workload Identity (opens in a new tab)":"AWS IAM Workload Identity (s’ouvre dans un nouvel onglet)","AWS Private CA couldn't set up this certificate authority. Delete it in the AWS Private CA console and try again.":"L’autorité de certification privée AWS n’a pas pu configurer cette autorité de certification. Supprimez-la dans la console de l’autorité de certification privée AWS et réessayez.","By default, each account's templates require an account ID path prefix to avoid name collisions. You can customize this after creating the provider, under provider settings.":"Par défaut, les modèles de chaque compte nécessitent un préfixe de chemin contenant l’ID du compte pour éviter les conflits de noms. Vous pouvez personnaliser ce paramètre après la création du fournisseur, dans ses paramètres.","Can't be changed after the provider is created.":"Impossible de modifier cette valeur après la création du fournisseur.","Can't be changed later.":"Impossible à modifier ultérieurement.",Cancel:FLt,"Cannot be changed later.":"Ne peut pas être modifié ultérieurement.","Cannot start with aws:":"Ne peut pas commencer par aws:","Certificate {{name}} (account {{accountId}}): {{reason}}":"Certificat {{name}} (compte {{accountId}}) : {{reason}}","Certificate authority":"Autorité de certification","Certificate authority created":"Autorité de certification créée","Certificate authority ID":"ID de l’autorité de certification","Certificate authority name":"Nom de l’autorité de certification","Certificate authority updated. The current one keeps signing for about {{hours}} more hour, until the replacement has published everywhere.":"Autorité de certification mise à jour. L’actuelle continue de signer pendant encore environ {{hours}} heure, jusqu’à ce que le remplacement soit publié partout.","Certificate authority updated. The current one keeps signing for about {{hours}} more hours, until the replacement has published everywhere.":"Autorité de certification mise à jour. L’actuelle continue de signer pendant encore environ {{hours}} heures, jusqu’à ce que le remplacement soit publié partout.","Certificate deleted. Its chain had already left the trust bundle, so nothing that was verifying has changed.":"Certificat supprimé. Sa chaîne avait déjà quitté le paquet de confiance, donc rien de ce qui était vérifié n’a changé.","Certificate deleted. Its chain has been pulled from the trust bundle, so certificates issued under it no longer verify.":"Certificat supprimé. Sa chaîne a été retirée du paquet de confiance, de sorte que les certificats émis dans le cadre de cette chaîne ne peuvent plus être vérifiés.","Certificate signer":"Signataire du certificat","Certificate signer disabled, and the update in progress was stopped with it. Both authorities stay configured, and Enable resumes signing.":"Signataire de certificat désactivé et la mise à jour en cours a été arrêtée avec lui. Les deux autorités restent configurées et Activer reprend la signature.","Certificate signer disabled. It stops signing now, its configuration is kept, and Enable resumes signing.":"Signataire de certificat désactivé. Il arrête de signer maintenant, sa configuration est conservée et Activer reprend la signature.","Certificate signer enabled. Its certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle again first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hour, after every region has it.":"Signataire de certificat activé. Sa chaîne de certificats est d’abord publiée à nouveau dans le paquet de confiance, et la signature commence dans environ {{hours}} heure, une fois que chaque région en dispose.","Certificate signer enabled. Its certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle again first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hours, after every region has it.":"Signataire de certificat activé. Sa chaîne de certificats est d’abord publiée à nouveau dans le paquet de confiance, et la signature commence dans environ {{hours}} heures, une fois que chaque région en dispose.","Certificate signer enabled. Its material was still published, so signing resumed immediately.":"Signataire de certificat activé. Son matériel cryptographique était toujours publié, les signatures ont donc repris immédiatement.","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hour, once every region has it.":"Signature de certificat activée. La chaîne de certificats est d’abord publiée dans le bundle de confiance, et la signature commence dans environ {{hours}} heure, une fois que chaque région en dispose.","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hours, once every region has it.":"Signature de certificat activée. La chaîne de certificats est d’abord publiée dans le bundle de confiance, et la signature commence dans environ {{hours}} heures, une fois que chaque région en dispose.","Certificate verifier information":"Informations sur le vérificateur de certificats","Certificates ({{total}})":"Certificats ({{total}})","Certificates: {{reason}}":"Certificats : {{reason}}","Change the facts a workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.":"Modifiez les faits qu’une charge de travail doit avoir certifiés pour se voir attribuer une identité à partir de ce modèle. Les identités que ce modèle a déjà générées ne sont pas affectées.","Change the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. A workload already holding a session keeps it until the session expires.":"Changez les faits qu’une charge de travail doit avoir attestés pour fonctionner sous cette identité. Une charge de travail contenant déjà une session la conserve jusqu’à son expiration.","Check again":"Vérifiez à nouveau","Checking what is attached to this provider":"Vérification de ce qui est associé à ce fournisseur","Choose a condition key":"Choisir une clé de condition","Choose a fact":"Choisir un fait","Choose a path and pattern for the names. Start from a default or customize your own.":"Choisissez un chemin d’accès et un modèle pour les noms. Commencez par un modèle par défaut ou personnalisez-le à votre guise.","Choose a specific name up front so you can grant it access or match an existing naming convention before the workload runs.":"Choisissez un nom spécifique dès le départ afin de lui accorder l’accès ou de respecter une convention de dénomination existante avant l’exécution de la charge de travail.","Choose a stable, unique name that identifies one environment or group of workloads, for example prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal.":"Choisissez un nom stable et unique qui identifie un environnement ou un groupe de charges de travail, par exemple prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal.","Choose a use case above to add a template.":"Choisissez un cas d’utilisation ci-dessus pour ajouter un modèle.","Choose from this account":"Choisissez depuis ce compte","Choose templates to add, and customize or keep their defaults":"Choisissez les modèles à ajouter et personnalisez ou conservez leurs valeurs par défaut","Choose the certificate authority this signer should sign with instead. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. The current authority keeps signing until the replacement has been published long enough for verifiers to pick it up.":"Choisissez plutôt l’autorité de certification avec laquelle ce signataire doit signer. Il nécessite une <link>autorité de certification</link> avec une autorité de certification subordonnée dans chaque région où vous signez. L’autorité actuelle continue à signer jusqu’à ce que le remplacement soit publié depuis suffisamment longtemps pour que les vérificateurs puissent le prendre en compte.","Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for a workload.":"Choisissez les clés de condition à utiliser comme faits d’attestation. La plateforme doit tous les certifier avant que ce modèle ne crée une identité pour une charge de travail.","Choose the facts a workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.":"Choisissez les faits qu’une charge de travail doit avoir certifiés pour obtenir une identité à partir de ce modèle. Rien n’est généré à partir de celui-ci tant que vous ne l’avez pas fait.","Choose the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. Nothing can be issued for it until you do.":"Choisissez les faits qu’une charge de travail doit avoir attestés pour s’exécuter avec cette identité. Rien ne peut être émis pour celle-ci tant que vous ne l’avez pas fait.","Choose the provider to create the identity in":"Choisissez le fournisseur dans lequel créer l’identité","Choose which templates to add by use case, and customize each one or keep its defaults.":"Choisissez les modèles à ajouter par cas d’utilisation et personnalisez chacun d’entre eux ou conservez ses valeurs par défaut.",Clear:$Lt,"Clear filters":"Effacer les filtres",Close:jLt,"Close modal":"Fermer la fenêtre modale","Cluster ARN":"ARN du cluster","Cluster ARNs":"ARN des clusters","Code editor":"Éditeur de code","Complete the confirmation to delete.":"Complétez la confirmation pour supprimer.","Condition key":"Clé de condition","Configure identity templates for your workload use cases. Each template defines a path pattern used to issue identities uniquely and the facts a workload must prove before an identity is issued.":"Configurez des modèles d’identité pour les cas d’utilisation de votre charge de travail. Chaque modèle définit un modèle de chemin utilisé pour émettre des identités de manière unique et les faits qu’une charge de travail doit prouver avant qu’une identité ne soit émise.","Configure later":"Configurer plus tard",Configured:WLt,Confirm:qLt,Contains:ULt,"Continue setup":"Poursuivre la configuration","Copy {{label}}":"Copier {{label}}","Copy ARN":"Copier l’ARN","Copy JSON":"Copier JSON","Could not check everything attached to this provider":"Impossible de vérifier tous les éléments associés à ce fournisseur","Create a provider":"Créer un fournisseur","Create a provider for this account":"Créer un fournisseur pour ce compte","Create a provider for your organization":"Créer un fournisseur pour votre organisation","Create a provider to get started":"Créer un fournisseur pour commencer","Create a template to automate identity generation":"Créer un modèle pour automatiser la génération d’identités","Create declared identity in {{providerName}}":"Créer une identité déclarée dans {{providerName}}","Create identity":"Créer une identité","Create new":"Créer","Create provider":"Créer un fournisseur","Create provider and templates":"Créer un fournisseur et des modèles","Create service mesh provider":"Créer un fournisseur de maillage de services","Create templates":"Créer les modèles","Create the certificate authority first.":"Créez d’abord l’autorité de certification.","Create workload identities":"Créer des identités de charge de travail",Created:VLt,"Created through":"Créé via","Created time":"Heure de création","Created values":"Valeurs créées","Creates a workload identity provider and template for workloads running in one or more EKS clusters under a service mesh, such as Istio.":"Crée un fournisseur d’identités de charges de travail et un modèle pour les charges de travail exécutées dans un ou plusieurs clusters EKS au sein d’un maillage de services, comme Istio.","Creating certificate authority":"Création de l’autorité de certification","Creating the certificate authority":"Création de l’autorité de certification","Creating this provider sets up these 2 resources.":"La création de ce fournisseur configure ces 2 ressources.","Current CA":"CA actuelle","Current provider":"Fournisseur actuel","Custom tag key":"Clé de balise personnalisée","Custom tag value":"Valeur de balise personnalisée","Custom text":"Texte personnalisé","Custom text can't be a single period (.) or two periods (..).":"Le texte personnalisé ne peut pas être composé d’un seul point (.) ou de deux points (..).","Customize templates":"Personnaliser les modèles","Dark themes":"Thèmes sombres","Declared identity: {{name}}":"Identité déclarée : {{name}}","Default permissions without a policy":"Autorisations par défaut sans politique","Defaults to {provider name}.{account ID}.aws.internal. This must match the trust domain set in your service mesh, or the mesh rejects the identities.":"Valeur par défaut : {provider name}.{account ID}.aws.internal. Celle-ci doit correspondre au domaine de confiance défini dans votre maillage de services, faute de quoi le maillage rejette les identités.","Define an optional path prefix for identities under this template. Lets you filter by prefix when authoring IAM permissions.":"Définissez un préfixe du chemin facultatif pour les identités sous ce modèle. Vous permet de filtrer par préfixe lors de la création d’autorisations IAM.","Define an optional path prefix for this identity. You can filter by this prefix when authoring IAM permissions.":"Définissez un préfixe de chemin facultatif pour cette identité. Vous pouvez filtrer par ce préfixe lorsque vous définissez des autorisations IAM.","Define an optional prefix for identities under this template. You can filter by this prefix when authoring IAM permissions. The path prefixes this account can use are set by the provider's policy, for example your account ID, and they are checked when you choose Create. If you're not sure which are permitted, ask your organization administrator.":"Définissez un préfixe facultatif pour les identités dans ce modèle. Vous pouvez filtrer selon ce préfixe lorsque vous créez des autorisations IAM. Les préfixes de chemin que ce compte peut utiliser sont définis par la politique du fournisseur, par exemple votre identifiant de compte, et ils sont vérifiés lorsque vous choisissez Créer. Si vous ne savez pas lesquels sont autorisés, demandez à l’administrateur de votre organisation.","Define an optional prefix for this identity. You can filter by this prefix when authoring IAM permissions. The path prefixes this account can use are set by the provider's policy, for example your account ID, and they are checked when you choose Create. If you're not sure which are permitted, ask your organization administrator.":"Définissez un préfixe facultatif pour cette identité. Vous pouvez filtrer selon ce préfixe lorsque vous créez des autorisations IAM. Les préfixes de chemin que ce compte peut utiliser sont définis par la politique du fournisseur, par exemple votre identifiant de compte, et ils sont vérifiés lorsque vous choisissez Créer. Si vous ne savez pas lesquels sont autorisés, demandez à l’administrateur de votre organisation.","Define which workloads are allowed to use this template.":"Définissez les charges de travail autorisées à utiliser ce modèle.",Delete:HLt,"Delete certificate?":"Supprimer le certificat ?","Delete provider":"Supprimer le fournisseur","Delete provider and resources":"Supprimer le fournisseur et les ressources","Delete provider?":"Supprimer le fournisseur ?","Delete template":"Supprimer le modèle","Delete template?":"Supprimer le modèle ?","Delete the templates under <b>{{providerName}}</b> before deleting the provider. Once deleted, workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials and fail on their next request, and access that you granted to these identities will stop working.":"Supprimez les modèles sous <b>{{providerName}}</b> avant de supprimer le fournisseur. Une fois le fournisseur supprimé, les charges de travail utilisant ces identités cesseront de recevoir des informations d’identification et échoueront lors de leur prochaine demande, et l’accès que vous avez accordé à ces identités cessera de fonctionner.","Delete workload identity?":"Supprimer l’identité de charge de travail ?","Deleting <b>{{templateName}}</b> will:":"La suppression de <b>{{templateName}}</b> aura pour effet de :","Deleting <b>{{workloadIdentifier}}</b> will:":"La suppression de <b>{{workloadIdentifier}}</b> aura pour effet de :","Deleting certificates":"Suppression de certificats","Deleting provider":"Suppression d’un fournisseur","Deleting templates and workload identities":"Suppression de modèles et d’identités de charge de travail","Deleting the provider is taking longer than expected":"La suppression du fournisseur prend plus de temps que prévu",Description:KLt,"Description can't include line breaks or tabs.":"La description ne peut pas inclure de sauts de ligne ni de tabulations.","Description must be 1,000 characters or less.":"La description doit comporter 1 000 caractères ou moins.","Description must be 255 characters or less.":"La description doit comporter 255 caractères ou moins.",Details:GLt,Disable:YLt,"Disable certificate signer?":"Désactiver le signataire du certificat ?","Discovery expiration time":"Délai d’expiration de la découverte",Dismiss:JLt,"Does not contain":"Ne contient pas","Does not equal":"N’est pas égal à","Drag or select to resize":"Faire glisser ou sélectionner pour redimensionner","Each identity is fully the template path, or whatever string you enter when you create the identity.":"Chaque identité correspond à l’intégralité du chemin du modèle ou à la chaîne que vous saisissez lors de sa création.",Edit:ZLt,"Edit attestation policy":"Modifier la politique d’attestation","Edit filter":"Modifier le filtre","Edit identity format and scope":"Modifier le format et la portée des identités","Edit identity path":"Modifier le chemin d’identité",Editing:XLt,Enable:QLt,"Enable certificate signer":"Activer le signataire du certificat","Enable certificate signer?":"Activer le signataire du certificat ?","End signing time":"Heure de fin de signature","Enter a 12-digit AWS account ID.":"Saisissez un ID de compte AWS à 12 chiffres.","Enter a certificate authority ID.":"Saisissez un ID d’autorité de certification.","Enter a cluster ARN.":"Saisissez l’ARN d’un cluster.","Enter a name":"Saisir un nom","Enter a name for the certificate authority.":"Entrez le nom de l’autorité de certification.","Enter a name.":"Saisissez un nom.","Enter a path":"Saisissez un chemin.","Enter a path prefix value":"Entrez une valeur de préfixe de chemin","Enter a trust domain.":"Saisissez un domaine de confiance.","Enter a value":"Saisir une valeur","Enter a whole number of hours from 1 to 48.":"Saisissez un nombre entier d’heures compris entre 1 et 48.","Enter key":"Saisissez une clé","Enter prefix":"Saisir le préfixe","Enter the ID of a certificate authority or choose from below":"Entrez l’ID d’une autorité de certification ou choisissez l’une des options ci-dessous","Enter the policy as valid JSON.":"Saisissez la politique au format JSON valide.","Enter value":"Saisissez une valeur",equals:ePt,Equals:tPt,Error:"Erreur","Error fetching the details":"Erreur lors de l’extraction des détails",Errors:aPt,"Every account in this organization ({{organizationId}})":"Tous les comptes de cette organisation ({{organizationId}})","Every X.509-SVID this provider issues right now is signed by this certificate. It stops in {{hours}} hour, at {{at}}, when the incoming certificate takes over.":"Chaque SVID X.509 que ce fournisseur émet actuellement est signé par ce certificat. Il s’arrête dans {{hours}} heure, à {{at}}, lorsque le certificat entrant prend le relais.","Every X.509-SVID this provider issues right now is signed by this certificate. It stops in {{hours}} hours, at {{at}}, when the incoming certificate takes over.":"Chaque SVID X.509 que ce fournisseur émet actuellement est signé par ce certificat. Il s’arrête dans {{hours}} heures, à {{at}}, lorsque le certificat entrant prend le relais.","Every X.509-SVID this provider issues right now is signed by this certificate. No replacement is scheduled, so it keeps signing until you update or disable the signer.":"Chaque SVID X.509 que ce fournisseur émet actuellement est signé par ce certificat. Aucun remplacement n’est prévu, il continue donc à signer jusqu’à ce que vous mettiez à jour ou désactiviez le signataire.","Failed to copy":"Échec de la copie","Failed to copy JSON":"Impossible de copier le JSON","Failed to load attestation policy.":"Impossible de charger la politique d’attestation.","Failed to load templates.":"Échec du chargement des modèles.","Failed to remove attestation policy.":"Impossible de supprimer la politique d’attestation.","Filter providers":"Filtrer les fournisseurs","Filter templates":"Filtrer des modèles","Filter themes":"Filtrer les thèmes","Find providers":"Rechercher des fournisseurs","Find templates":"Rechercher des modèles","Find theme":"Rechercher un thème","For example, prod":"Par exemple, prod","For mutual TLS, attach a certificate authority":"Pour un TLS mutuel, associez une autorité de certification","For token-based services, issue a JWT":"Pour les services basés sur des jetons, émettez un JWT",Format:nPt,"Generating its key":"Génération de sa clé","Get started":"Commencer","Getting started":"Premiers pas","Give an agent or workload its own identity - <em>Preview</em>":"Donnez à un agent ou à une charge de travail sa propre identité - <em>Aperçu</em>","Give each workload a unique identity, so you can grant it access and audit what it did rather than sharing one role.":"Attribuez à chaque charge de travail une identité unique, afin de lui accorder des autorisations d’accès et d’auditer ses activités, plutôt que de partager un seul rôle.","Give your workloads an identity":"Donnez une identité à vos charges de travail","Go to the providers list":"Accédez à la liste des fournisseurs","Govern who can create resources":"Déterminez qui peut créer des ressources","Govern who can create templates referring to this provider":"Déterminer qui peut créer des modèles faisant référence à ce fournisseur","Greater than":"Supérieur à","Greater than or equal":"Supérieur ou égal à","hour(s)":"heure(s)","How it works":"Fonctionnement","IAM roles define what a workload can do. Workload Identity tells you which workload is doing it.":"Les rôles IAM définissent ce qu’une charge de travail peut faire. Workload Identity vous indique quelle charge de travail effectue cette action.","Identities are issued at runtime from facts the workload proves, not just from what an admin assigns.":"Les identités sont émises au moment de l’exécution à partir de faits établis par la charge de travail, et non seulement à partir de ce qu’un administrateur attribue.",'Identity "{{identityId}}" not found.':"Identité « {{identityId}} » introuvable.","Identity format and scope":"Format et portée des identités","Identity name":"Nom d’identité","Identity path":"Chemin d’identité","Identity selection":"Sélection de l’identité","If anything is still attached, deleting the provider fails.":"Si un élément est encore associé, la suppression du fournisseur échoue.","In transition":"En transition","In transition certificate authority ID":"ID d’autorité de certification en transition","In transition: incoming, not yet signing":"En transition : entrant, ne signe pas encore",Inactive:iPt,"Inactive: retired, no longer trusted":"Inactif : mis hors service, n’est plus approuvé","Incoming CA":"CA entrante",Info:rPt,"Invalid key. Keys can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"Clé non valide. Les clés ne peuvent contenir que des lettres Unicode, des chiffres, des espaces et les caractères suivants : _.:/=+@-","Invalid provider name. Use alphanumeric and '-_.' characters.":"Nom de fournisseur non valide. Utilisez des caractères alphanumériques et les caractères « -_. ».","Invalid request":"Demande non valide","Invalid template name. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters.":"Nom de modèle non valide. Utilisez des caractères alphanumériques et les caractères « -_ ».","Invalid value. Values can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"Valeur non valide. Les valeurs ne peuvent contenir que des lettres Unicode, des chiffres, des espaces et les caractères suivants : _.:/=+@-","Issued after the workload proves itself":"Émis une fois que la charge de travail a fait ses preuves","Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. Standard pricing applies to the creation and use of AWS Private CA.":"Émet les SVID X.509 que les charges de travail de ce fournisseur présentent sous forme de certificats clients à des systèmes extérieurs à AWS. Il a besoin d’une <link>autorité de certification</link> avec une autorité de certification subordonnée dans chaque région où vous signez. La tarification standard s’applique à la création et à l’utilisation d’AWS Private CA.","Issues X.509-SVIDs, for mTLS peers that verify a client certificate.":"Émet des SVID X.509 pour les pairs mTLS qui vérifient un certificat client.","Issuing its CA certificate":"Délivrance de son certificat CA","It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. Leave it alone and it becomes inactive on its own, after which deleting it changes nothing.":"Il a cessé de signer, mais sa chaîne est toujours publiée. Les charges de travail s’appuient donc sur elle pour vérifier les informations d’identification émises précédemment. Sa suppression entraîne la suppression immédiate de la chaîne et ces informations d’identification commencent à échouer. Laissez-le tranquille et il deviendra inactif tout seul, après quoi sa suppression ne changera rien.","Item moved from position {{initialPosition}} to position {{finalPosition}} of {{total}}":"Objet déplacé de la position {{initialPosition}} à la position {{finalPosition}} sur {{total}}","JSON copied":"JSON copié",JWKS:oPt,"JWKS popover":"Chaque clé de signature active, sélectionnée par kid. AWS publie une nouvelle clé ici avant que la signature ne bascule vers celle-ci.","JWT Outbound signers column Signing algorithm":"Algorithme de signature","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key":"Algorithmes de clés","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key issue time":"Clé de signature actuelle depuis","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key popover":"AWS génère les clés et les fait pivoter selon son propre calendrier, en publiant chaque nouvelle clé dans le JWKS avant qu’il ne commence à signer. Les algorithmes restent les mêmes tout au long d’une rotation, de sorte qu’un vérificateur lisant le JWKS n’a besoin d’aucune modification de votre part.","JWT Outbound signers desc":"Signe les JWT-SVID, pour les systèmes qui vérifient un jeton signé.","JWT Outbound signers label oidc discovery":"Découverte OIDC","JWT Outbound signers label oidc discovery popover":"Le document de découverte standard. La plupart des vérificateurs n’ont besoin que de cette URL, car ils y trouvent les clés.","JWT Outbound signers label oidc issuer":"Émetteur OIDC","JWT Outbound signers label oidc issuer popover":"La revendication iss de chaque JWT-SVID signé ici. Un vérificateur qui épingle un émetteur épingle cette valeur.","JWT Outbound signers section title":"Informations sur le vérificateur de jetons","JWT Outbound signers status":"Valeur par défaut fournie par AWS","JWT Outbound signers title":"Signataire JWT",Key:"Clé","Learn about organization providers":"En savoir plus sur les fournisseurs à l’échelle de l’organisation","Learn about organization providers (opens in a new tab)":"En savoir plus sur les fournisseurs à l’échelle de l’organisation (s’ouvre dans un nouvel onglet)","Learn more":"En savoir plus","Learn more about deleting a provider (opens in a new tab)":"En savoir plus sur la suppression d’un fournisseur (s’ouvre dans un nouvel onglet)","Learn more:":"En savoir plus :","Less than":"Inférieur à","Less than or equal":"Inférieur ou égal à","Let other accounts or principals in your organization create templates and identities under this provider, within the path prefixes you choose.":"Permettez à d’autres comptes ou principaux de votre organisation de créer des modèles et des identités sous ce fournisseur, en utilisant les préfixes de chemin que vous choisissez.","Let workloads reach non-AWS resources":"Laissez les charges de travail d’accéder à des ressources hors AWS","Letters, digits, . - _ with a single / between parts. No / at the start or end.":"Lettres, chiffres, . - _ avec un seul / entre les parties. Pas de / au début ou à la fin.","Letters, digits, . - _ with a single / between parts. No / at the start or end. Cannot be changed later.":"Lettres, chiffres, . - _ avec un seul / entre les parties. Pas de / au début ou à la fin. Ne peut pas être modifié ultérieurement.","Light themes":"Thèmes clairs","Ln {{row}}, Col {{column}}":"Lig {{row}}, Col {{column}}","Loading certificate authorities":"Chargement des autorités de certification","Loading code editor":"Chargement de l’éditeur de code","Loading tag keys":"Chargement des clés de balises en cours","Loading tag values":"Chargement des valeurs de balise en cours","Loading tags that are associated with this resource":"Chargement des balises associées à cette ressource","Loading your organization's providers":"Chargement des fournisseurs de votre organisation","Make sure the new certificate authority uses the same algorithm as the current signer, {{algorithm}}. If you choose a different algorithm, you need to disable this signer, delete its certificates, then enable it again with the new authority.":"Assurez-vous que la nouvelle autorité de certification utilise le même algorithme que le signataire actuel, {{algorithm}}. Si vous choisissez un autre algorithme, vous devez désactiver ce signataire, supprimer ses certificats, puis le réactiver avec la nouvelle autorité.","Manage CAs and replication in the AWS Private CA console":"Gérez les autorités de certification et la réplication dans la console AWS Private CA","Manage tags":"Gérer les balises","Manage the provider":"Gérez le fournisseur","Manual creation":"Création manuelle","Manually create":"Créez manuellement","Matching workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.":"Les charges de travail correspondantes reçoivent leur propre nom d’identité dès leur lancement, quelle que soit l’échelle.","Maximum 1,000 characters.":"1 000 caractères maximum.","Maximum 255 characters.":"255 caractères au maximum.","Member accounts":"Comptes membres","Member accounts can add their own templates, namespaced by account ID.":"Les comptes membres peuvent ajouter leurs propres modèles, avec un espace de noms propre à chaque ID de compte.","Member accounts cannot add their own templates.":"Les comptes membres ne peuvent pas ajouter leurs propres modèles.","Minimum signing delay":"Délai de signature minimum","Moving item to position {{currentPosition}} of {{total}}":"Déplacement de l’élément vers la position {{currentPosition}} de {{total}}","Multiple EKS clusters":"Plusieurs clusters EKS",Name:"Nom","Name must be 128 characters or less.":"Le nom ne doit pas dépasser 128 caractères.","Name this identity":"Donnez un nom à cette identité","Name this provider":"Nommer ce fournisseur","Name values":"Valeurs de nom","Names identities automatically as workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.":"Nomme les identités automatiquement au fur et à mesure que les charges de travail démarrent, afin que vous n’ayez pas à les créer ni à les gérer une par une.","Naming scheme":"Schéma de dénomination",New:sPt,"Next month":"Mois suivant","Next page":"Page suivante","Next step":"Étape suivante","No attestation policy set. Define one so a workload can run as this identity.":"Aucune politique d’attestation n’a été définie. Définissez-en une pour qu’une charge de travail puisse s’exécuter sous cette identité.","No attestation policy. No workload will be issued workload identities from this template until you add one.":"Aucune politique d’attestation. Aucune identité de charge de travail ne sera émise à partir de ce modèle tant que vous n’en aurez pas ajouté une.","No by default, but can add a policy":"Non par défaut, mais vous pouvez ajouter une politique","No certificate authorities in this account":"Aucune autorité de certification dans ce compte","no domain":"Aucun domaine","No long-lived secrets":"Pas de secrets de longue durée","No match found":"Aucune correspondance trouvée","No matches":"Aucune correspondance","No path segments. Add a fact, condition key, or custom text.":"Aucun segment de chemin. Ajoutez un fait, une clé de condition ou un texte personnalisé.","No tags associated with the resource.":"Aucune balise n’est associée à la ressource.","No templates added yet":"Aucun modèle n’a encore été ajouté","No workload identity providers":"Aucun fournisseur d’identité de charge de travail","No workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.":"Aucune charge de travail ne correspond à ce modèle, il ne génère donc aucune identité.","No, and cannot be granted":"Non, et cela ne peut pas être accordé",None:lPt,"None – names are defined by templates or declared individually":"Aucun, les noms sont définis par des modèles ou déclarés individuellement","Not saved: {{keys}}.":"Non enregistré : {{keys}}.","Not set":"Non défini",Notifications:cPt,"Once the attestation policy is removed, matching workloads will not be issued workload identities until you add a policy again.":"Une fois la politique d’attestation supprimée, aucune identité de charge de travail ne sera attribuée aux charges de travail correspondantes tant que vous n’aurez pas ajouté à nouveau une politique.","One bundle per provider, and one URL. It carries every authority the provider publishes: both outbound signers, and during an update both the current and incoming certificate authority, which is what lets verifiers accept either one through the handover. Your own AWS workloads get these keys automatically; send this to systems outside AWS.":"Un paquet par fournisseur et une URL. Il contient toutes les autorités publiées par le fournisseur : les deux signataires sortants et, lors d’une mise à jour, les autorités de certification actuelle et entrante, ce qui permet aux vérificateurs d’accepter l’une ou l’autre lors du transfert. Vos propres charges de travail AWS obtiennent ces clés automatiquement ; envoyez ce paquet à des systèmes extérieurs à AWS.","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level providers.":"Seul le compte de gestion ou un administrateur délégué peut supprimer les fournisseurs au niveau de l’organisation.","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level templates.":"Seul le compte de gestion ou un administrateur délégué peut supprimer les modèles au niveau de l’organisation.","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level workload identities.":"Seul le compte de gestion ou un administrateur délégué peut supprimer les identités de charge de travail au niveau de l’organisation.","Opens in a new tab":"S’ouvre dans un nouvel onglet",Operator:dPt,Operators:uPt,optional:pPt,or:"ou","Organization provider":"Fournisseur à l’échelle de l’organisation","Organization scoped":"Portée de l’organisation","Organize the provider and track its cost with tags.":"Organisez le fournisseur de services et suivez ses coûts à l’aide de balises.","Other accounts in your organization":"Autres comptes de votre organisation","Other condition keys":"Autres clés de condition","Outbound signer":"Signataire sortant","Outbound signers page desc":"Laissez vos charges de travail prouver leur identité à des services extérieurs à AWS. Ce fournisseur signe les jetons et les certificats qu’elles présentent.","Outbound signers page title":"Signataire sortant","Owning account":"Compte propriétaire","Page {{pageNumber}} of all pages":"Page {{pageNumber}} sur l’ensemble des pages",path:hPt,Path:mPt,"path from templates":"chemin à partir de modèles","Path is the per-workload part of an identity name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts a workload proves.":"Le chemin est la partie du nom d’identité spécifique à chaque charge de travail. Il est rempli au moment de l’exécution à partir des faits prouvés par une charge de travail.","Path must be 255 characters or less.":"Le chemin ne doit pas dépasser 255 caractères.","Path pattern":"Modèle de chemin","Path prefix":"Préfixe du chemin","Path prefix must be 64 characters or less.":"Le préfixe de chemin doit comporter 64 caractères au maximum.","Path values":"Valeurs du chemin","Picked up item at position {{position}} of {{total}}":"Élément pris à la position {{position}} de {{total}}","Policy details":"Détails de la politique","Policy: Define how a workload attests to get the identity":"Politique : définir comment une charge de travail se fait attester pour obtenir l’identité",Preferences:gPt,"Press space or enter to activate drag, use arrow keys to move, then press space or enter to confirm":"Utilisez la barre d’espace ou Entrée pour activer le glissement, puis utilisez les touches fléchées pour vous déplacer et utilisez la barre d’espace ou Entrée pour confirmer.",Preview:vPt,"Previous CA":"CA précédente","Previous certificates ({{certificateCount}})":"Certificats précédents ({{certificateCount}})","Previous month":"Mois précédent","Previous page":"Page précédente",Properties:fPt,Property:yPt,Provided:bPt,Provider:wPt,"Provider {{providerName}} deleted.":"Fournisseur {{providerName}} supprimé.","Provider name":"Nom du fournisseur","Provider name must be 128 characters or less.":"Le nom du fournisseur ne doit pas dépasser 128 caractères.","Provider not deleted":"Le fournisseur n’a pas été supprimé","Provider not found":"Fournisseur introuvable","Provider overview":"Vue d’ensemble du fournisseur","Provider selection":"Sélection du fournisseur","Provider settings":"Paramètres du fournisseur","Provider values":"Valeurs du fournisseur",Providers:kPt,"Providers to issue workload identities":"Fournisseurs pour émettre des identités de charge de travail","Quick create":"Création rapide","Quick create makes an RSA 2048 certificate authority in AWS Private CA in your account, which has its own charges. The algorithm is fixed and cannot be changed later without setting the signer up again.":"La création rapide crée une autorité de certification RSA 2048 dans AWS Private CA sur votre compte, ce qui entraîne des frais supplémentaires. L’algorithme est fixe et ne pourra pas être modifié ultérieurement sans reconfigurer le signataire.",Ready:SPt,Recommended:_Pt,"Recommended for most workloads":"Recommandé pour la plupart des charges de travail",Refresh:xPt,"Refresh certificate authorities":"Actualiser les autorités de certification","Refresh certificate signer status":"Actualiser le statut du signataire du certificat",Remove:APt,"Remove {{name}}":"Supprimer {{name}}","Remove attestation policy":"Supprimer la politique d’attestation","Remove cluster ARN":"Supprimer l’ARN du cluster","Remove condition":"Supprimer la condition","Remove filter {{filter}}":"Supprimer le filtre {{filter}}","Remove governance policy?":"Supprimer la politique de gouvernance ?","Remove tag {{key}}":"Supprimer la balise {{key}}","Removed tags were not saved":"Les balises supprimées n’ont pas été enregistrées","Reorder {{name}}":"Réorganiser {{name}}","Reordering canceled":"Réorganisation annulée","Required for service mesh providers.":"Obligatoire pour les fournisseurs de maillage de services.","Required for service mesh providers. A service mesh provider is scoped to the account that runs the EKS cluster.":"Obligatoire pour les fournisseurs de maillage de services. Un fournisseur de maillage de services est limité au compte qui exécute le cluster EKS.","Reset to default":"Rétablir les valeurs par défaut","Resize handle":"Poignée de redimensionnement","Resolved example:":"Exemple résolu :","Restricted by":"Restreint par",Retry:EPt,"Review the tags and save again.":"Vérifiez les balises et enregistrez à nouveau.","Running a service mesh, such as Istio? It needs its own provider, one per cluster.":"Vous gérez un maillage de services, tel qu’Istio ? Il a besoin de son propre fournisseur, un par cluster.",Save:CPt,"Save changes":"Enregistrer les modifications","Save or cancel your edits before creating templates.":"Enregistrez ou annulez vos modifications avant de créer des modèles.","Save or cancel your edits before creating the provider.":"Enregistrez ou annulez vos modifications avant de créer le fournisseur.","Save or cancel your template edits to change the scope.":"Enregistrez ou annulez vos modifications des modèles pour changer la portée.",scheme:TPt,Scheme:IPt,"scheme and trust domain":"schéma et domaine de confiance","Scheme sets the format this provider uses to name identities.":"Le schéma définit le format utilisé par ce fournisseur pour nommer les identités.",Scope:DPt,"Scope sets which accounts are allowed to use this provider.":"La portée définit les comptes autorisés à utiliser ce fournisseur.","Scope values":"Valeurs de portée","Search tags":"Rechercher des balises","Segment that partitions identities.":"Segment qui partitionne les identités.","Select {{name}}":"Sélectionner {{name}}","Select a row to delete.":"Sélectionnez une ligne à supprimer.",Set:"Définir","Set a naming pattern":"Définir un modèle de dénomination","Set an attestation rule":"Définir une règle d’attestation","Set by your provider.":"Défini par votre fournisseur.","Set the naming format and usage scope that every workload identity from this provider inherits.":"Définissez le format de nommage et la portée d’utilisation dont hérite chaque identité de charge de travail émise par ce fournisseur.","Set the unique path pattern that every workload identity generated by this template follows. Cannot be changed later.":"Définissez le modèle de chemin unique que suit chaque identité de charge de travail générée par ce modèle. Ce paramètre ne pourra plus être modifié ultérieurement.","Set up a provider to hold the templates that generate identity names, the identities you declare directly, and the signers that sign credentials for systems outside AWS.":"Configurez un fournisseur qui regroupe les modèles utilisés pour générer des noms d’identité, les identités que vous déclarez directement et les signataires chargés de signer les informations d’identification pour les systèmes extérieurs à AWS.","Set up a service mesh provider for this account":"Configurer un fournisseur de maillage de services pour ce compte","Set up a way to issue workload identities":"Configurez un moyen d’émettre des identités de charge de travail","Set up for your use cases":"Configuration adaptée à vos cas d’utilisation","Sets your trust domain, the start of every identity name.":"Définit votre domaine de confiance, le début de chaque nom d’identité.","Setting up the certificate authority stopped. You can continue from where it left off.":"La configuration de l’autorité de certification s’est arrêtée. Vous pouvez reprendre là où elle s’est arrêtée.","Settings from your provider {{providerName}}":"Paramètres de votre fournisseur {{providerName}}","Short-lived credentials renew automatically and follow the SPIFFE standard, so they work with service meshes like Istio and with SaaS applications.":"Les informations d’identification à courte durée de vie sont renouvelées automatiquement et suivent la norme SPIFFE. Elles fonctionnent donc avec des maillages de services tels qu’Istio et des applications SaaS.","Show all {{errorCount}} errors":"Afficher toutes les {{errorCount}} erreurs","Show fewer":"Afficher moins","Show more":"Afficher plus","Signing algorithm":"Algorithme de signature","Signing resumes immediately, because this certificate is still published in the trust bundle.":"La signature reprend immédiatement, car ce certificat est toujours publié dans le bundle de confiance.","Signing start time":"Heure de début de signature","Some templates could not be loaded":"Certains modèles n’ont pas pu être chargés","Something went wrong":"Un problème est survenu","Sortable path segment":"Segment de chemin triable",Status:LPt,"Status bar":"Barre d’état","Stop access you granted to this identity name from working":"Empêcher l’accès que vous avez accordé à ce nom d’identité de fonctionner","Stop access you granted to those identity names from working":"Empêcher l’accès que vous avez accordé à ces noms d’identité de fonctionner","Stop matching workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request":"Empêcher les charges de travail correspondantes d’obtenir une identité, afin qu’elles échouent à leur prochaine demande","Stop the identities it generated from resolving":"Empêcher la résolution des identités qu’il a générées","Stop the workload running as this identity, so it fails on its next request":"Arrêter l’exécution de la charge de travail sous cette identité, afin qu’elle échoue lors de sa prochaine demande","Stopped signing and no longer in the trust bundle, so nothing verifies against them. Deleting one is safe.":"La signature est arrêtée et n’est plus dans le bundle de confiance, donc rien ne s’y vérifie. La suppression d’un élément est sans risque.",Subject:PPt,Success:NPt,"Tag keys could not be retrieved":"Les clés de balise n’ont pas pu être récupérées","Tag values could not be retrieved":"Les valeurs de balise n’ont pas pu être récupérées",Tags:RPt,"Tags could not be loaded":"Les balises n’ont pas pu être chargées","Tags for {{name}} have been updated.":"Les balises pour {{name}} ont été mises à jour.","Tags not saved":"Balises non enregistrées",Template:MPt,'Template "{{templateId}}" not found.':"Modèle « {{templateId}} » introuvable.","Template {{name}}: {{reason}}":"Modèle {{name}} : {{reason}}","Template {{templateName}} deleted.":"Le modèle {{templateName}} a été supprimé.","Template {{templateNames}} created.":"Le modèle « {{templateNames}} » a été créé.","Template name":"Nom du modèle","Template name must be 128 characters or less.":"Le nom du modèle ne doit pas dépasser 128 caractères.","Template name values":"Valeurs du nom de modèle","Template: {{name}}":"Modèle : {{name}}",Templates:zPt,"Templates ({{total}})":"Modèles ({{total}})","Templates are being created. Wait for the request to finish.":"Des modèles sont en cours de création. Attendez que la requête soit terminée.","Templates give matching workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.":"Les modèles attribuent automatiquement un nom d’identité propre aux charges de travail correspondantes. Chacune utilise le préfixe du nom de ce fournisseur, suivi d’un chemin d’accès et d’un modèle.","Templates that member accounts created under this provider are not visible here and cannot be deleted from this account. If any exist, deleting the provider fails.":"Les modèles créés par les comptes membres sous ce fournisseur ne sont pas visibles ici et ne peuvent pas être supprimés depuis ce compte. S’il en existe, la suppression du fournisseur échoue.","Templates: {{reason}}":"Modèles : {{reason}}","The account that owns the certificate authority.":"Le compte propriétaire de l’autorité de certification.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it.":"La politique d’attestation contrôle la manière dont les identités sont émises par ce fournisseur. Une charge de travail doit remplir toutes les conditions, notamment celles relatives à son type, à ses caractéristiques et à son environnement d’exécution, comme en atteste le service qui l’héberge.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.":"La politique d’attestation contrôle la manière dont les identités sont émises par ce fournisseur. Une charge de travail doit remplir toutes les conditions, notamment celles relatives à son type, à ses caractéristiques et à son environnement d’exécution, comme en atteste le service qui l’héberge. Cette politique peut être modifiée ultérieurement.","The attestation policy controls which workloads get an identity from this provider. A workload must meet every condition, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. It's generated from the EKS clusters you entered. You can edit it later.":"La politique d’attestation détermine quelles charges de travail peuvent obtenir une identité de ce fournisseur. Une charge de travail doit remplir toutes les conditions, dont le respect est attesté par le service qui l’héberge. Cette politique est générée à partir des clusters EKS que vous avez saisis. Vous pouvez la modifier ultérieurement.","The attestation policy lists the facts a workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so a workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.":"La politique d’attestation répertorie les faits qu’une charge de travail doit prouver avant que ce fournisseur ne lui délivre une identité. La plateforme de calcul s’en porte garante, de sorte qu’une charge de travail ne peut pas revendiquer une identité qui n’est pas la sienne.","The attester vouches for the workload, and it must match every condition to run as this identity.":"L’attestateur garantit la charge de travail, et celle-ci doit satisfaire à toutes les conditions pour s’exécuter avec cette identité.","The certificate authority is still being set up.":"L’autorité de certification est toujours en cours de configuration.","The ID at the end of the certificate authority's ARN in AWS Private CA.":"L’ID à la fin de l’ARN de l’autorité de certification dans AWS Private CA.","The identity name is the provider's naming scheme, a path prefix, and a path pattern.":"Le nom d’identité est le schéma de dénomination du fournisseur, un préfixe de chemin et un modèle de chemin.","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag key is 128.":"Une clé de balise peut comporter au maximum 128 caractères.","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag value is 256.":"Une valeur de balise peut comporter jusqu’à 256 caractères.","The path can be up to {{maxLength}} characters.":"Le chemin peut comporter jusqu’à {{maxLength}} caractères.","The path doesn't support these segments: {{segments}}. Remove them, and add what you need from the following cards.":"Le chemin ne prend pas en charge les segments suivants : {{segments}}. Retirez-les et ajoutez ce dont vous avez besoin à partir des fiches suivantes.","The path is already the default.":"Le chemin est déjà le chemin par défaut.","The path is the per-workload part of each identity's name. Keep the Region in front so names stay unique across accounts and Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.":"Le chemin est la partie du nom de chaque identité propre à sa charge de travail. Placez la région au début pour que les noms restent uniques d’un compte à l’autre et d’une région à l’autre, ou réorganisez les segments pour qu’ils correspondent à la convention de dénomination de votre équipe.","The path prefixes your policy allows":"Les préfixes de chemin autorisés par votre politique","The permissions defined in this policy for <b>{{providerName}}</b> stop applying.":"Les autorisations définies dans cette politique pour <b>{{providerName}}</b> cessent de s’appliquer.","The provider could not be deleted. Try again.":"Le fournisseur n’a pas pu être supprimé. Réessayez.","The provider is being created. Wait for the request to finish.":"Création du fournisseur en cours. Attendez la fin de l’opération.","The provider might still be deleted. Check the providers list later.":"Le fournisseur pourrait tout de même être supprimé. Consultez la liste des fournisseurs plus tard.","The resource policy on this provider controls who can associate templates with it.":"La politique de ressources de ce fournisseur détermine qui peut lui associer des modèles.","The soonest the new certificate can take over. It publishes to the trust bundle first, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. Signing may start later than this, never sooner.":"Date la plus proche à laquelle le nouveau certificat peut prendre le relais. Il est d’abord publié dans le paquet de confiance, afin que chaque vérificateur puisse le vérifier avant que quoi que ce soit ne soit signé sous son autorité. La signature peut commencer après cette date, mais jamais avant.","The soonest this certificate can start signing. It publishes to the trust bundle first, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. Signing may start later than this, never sooner.":"C’est la date la plus proche à laquelle ce certificat peut commencer à signer. Il est d’abord publié dans le bundle de confiance, afin que chaque vérificateur puisse le vérifier avant que quoi que ce soit ne soit signé sous celui-ci. La signature peut commencer plus tard, jamais plus tôt.",Theme:OPt,"There was an error loading the code editor.":"Une erreur s’est produite lors du chargement de l’éditeur de code.","These clusters set the template's <policyLink>attestation policy</policyLink>.":"Pour ce modèle, ces clusters définissent la <policyLink>politique d’attestation</policyLink>.","These resources need to be deleted before deleting the provider.":"Ces ressources doivent être supprimées avant de supprimer le fournisseur.","This account ({{accountId}})":"Ce compte ({{accountId}})","This action deletes the workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.":"Cette action supprime le fournisseur d’identité de la charge de travail <b>{{providerName}}</b>.","This cannot be undone, and creating a provider with the same name later does not restore anything. To proceed, complete the steps below.":"Cette action est irréversible, et la création ultérieure d’un fournisseur portant le même nom ne restaure aucun élément. Pour continuer, effectuez les étapes ci-dessous.","This cannot be undone, and the path this template reserved stays reserved. No future template can generate identities under it.":"Cette action ne peut pas être annulée et le chemin réservé par ce modèle reste réservé. Aucun modèle futur ne pourra générer d’identités sous ce chemin.","This cannot be undone, and this name stays reserved. It is never issued again, so you cannot recreate this identity under the same name.":"Cette opération ne peut pas être annulée et ce nom reste réservé. Il n’est plus jamais émis, vous ne pouvez donc pas recréer cette identité sous le même nom.","This certificate authority uses {{caAlgorithm}}. Rotation keeps the signer's {{signerAlgorithm}} algorithm, so choose a {{signerAlgorithm}} certificate authority instead.":"Cette autorité de certification utilise {{caAlgorithm}}. La rotation conserve l’algorithme {{signerAlgorithm}} du signataire, alors choisissez plutôt une autorité de certification {{signerAlgorithm}}.","This certificate has left the trust bundle, so it publishes again first. Signing starts after about {{hours}} hour, once every region has it.":"Ce certificat a quitté le paquet de confiance, il est donc d’abord republié. La signature commence après environ {{hours}} heure, une fois que chaque région en dispose.","This certificate has left the trust bundle, so it publishes again first. Signing starts after about {{hours}} hours, once every region has it.":"Ce certificat a quitté le paquet de confiance, il est donc d’abord republié. La signature commence après environ {{hours}} heures, une fois que chaque région en dispose.","This certificate is validating, so deleting it stops verification immediately":"Ce certificat est en cours de validation, donc sa suppression interrompt immédiatement la vérification","This certificate stopped signing and its chain has left the trust bundle, so nothing verifies against it. It stays listed as history until you delete it, and deleting it is safe: no credential depends on it, and the certificate signer keeps signing.":"Ce certificat a cessé de signer et sa chaîne a quitté le paquet de confiance, donc rien ne peut être vérifié par rapport à lui. Il reste répertorié dans l’historique jusqu’à ce que vous le supprimiez, et sa suppression est sûre : les informations d’identification n’en dépendent pas et le signataire de certificat continue de signer.","This cluster is already listed.":"Ce cluster figure déjà dans la liste.","This condition key and operator combination already exists":"Cette combinaison de clé de condition et d’opérateur existe déjà","This doesn't look like a valid EKS cluster ARN. An invalid ARN will leave workloads in that cluster without an identity.":"Cet ARN ne semble pas correspondre à un ARN de cluster EKS valide. Un ARN non valide empêchera les charges de travail de ce cluster d’obtenir une identité.","This management account and delegated administrators":"Ce compte de gestion et les administrateurs délégués","This organization ({{organizationId}})":"Cette organisation ({{organizationId}})","This policy's cluster ARNs don't match the clusters you entered. Changing the clusters won't update this policy. Continue only if that's intended.":"Les ARN des clusters de cette politique ne correspondent pas aux clusters saisis. La modification des clusters ne mettra pas cette politique à jour. Ne continuez que si cela est intentionnel.","This provider has no naming scheme, so the path you enter is the full identity name.":"Ce fournisseur n’a pas de schéma de dénomination ; le chemin que vous entrez est donc le nom complet de l’identité.","This provider names every identity using the open standard.":"Ce fournisseur nomme chaque identité à l’aide de la norme ouverte.","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. Both certificates below stop, including the one still in transition, so the update does not complete. Both stay configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"Ce fournisseur arrête immédiatement d’émettre des SVID X.509, et les charges de travail nécessitant un certificat client commenceront à échouer lors de leur prochaine demande. Les deux certificats ci-dessous s’arrêtent, y compris celui encore en transition, de sorte que la mise à jour ne se termine pas. Les deux restent configurés. Les certificats déjà émis restent vérifiables pendant environ 12 heures, et Activer reprend la signature.","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"Ce fournisseur arrête immédiatement d’émettre des SVID X.509, et les charges de travail nécessitant un certificat client commenceront à échouer lors de leur prochaine demande. Le certificat ci-dessous reste configuré. Les certificats déjà émis continuent à être vérifiés pendant environ 12 heures, et Activer reprend la signature.","This provider's policy doesn't allow this path prefix \"{{pathPrefix}}\" for your account. Ask your organization administrator which path prefixes are permitted.":"La politique de ce fournisseur n’autorise pas le préfixe de chemin « {{pathPrefix}} » pour votre compte. Demandez à l’administrateur de votre organisation quels préfixes de chemin sont autorisés.","This removes the certificate from the provider and pulls its chain from the trust bundle immediately. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"Cela supprime le certificat du fournisseur et retire immédiatement sa chaîne du bundle de confiance. L’autorité de certification elle-même reste inchangée dans la CA privée AWS.","This removes the certificate from the provider. Its chain already left the trust bundle, so nothing that is verifying today changes. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"Cela supprime le certificat du fournisseur. Sa chaîne a déjà quitté le bundle de confiance, donc rien de ce qui est vérifié aujourd’hui ne change. L’autorité de certification elle-même reste inchangée dans la CA privée AWS.","This tag will be removed upon saving changes":"Cette balise sera supprimée lors de l’enregistrement des modifications","This usually takes a few minutes. Keep this page open until it finishes.":"Cela prend généralement quelques minutes. Gardez cette page ouverte jusqu’à la fin.",Today:BPt,"Too many requests":"Trop de requêtes","Trace and control access per workload":"Suivez et contrôlez l’accès par charge de travail","Trust bundle":"Paquet de confiance","trust domain":"domaine de confiance","Trust domain":"Domaine de confiance","Trust domain is the root of trust for the SPIFFE naming scheme. It is a logical name that follows DNS naming style, for example prod.acme.com, but does not need to match a real DNS record.":"Le domaine de confiance est la racine de confiance du schéma de dénomination SPIFFE. Il s’agit d’un nom logique qui suit le style de dénomination DNS, par exemple prod.acme.com, mais qui n’a pas besoin de correspondre à un enregistrement DNS réel.","Try again. If the problem continues, contact AWS Support.":"Essayez de nouveau. Si le problème persiste, veuillez contacter AWS Support.","Unable to load templates":"Impossible de charger les modèles",Undo:FPt,"Up to 128 characters. Must be unique per provider.":"Jusqu’à 128 caractères. Doit être unique par fournisseur.","Up to 128 characters. Use alphanumeric and '-_.' characters. Must be unique in your organization. Can't be changed after the provider is created.":"128 caractères maximum. Utilisez des caractères alphanumériques et les caractères « -_. ». Ce nom doit être unique au sein de votre organisation. Il ne peut plus être modifié une fois le fournisseur créé.","Up to 128 characters. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters. Must be unique per provider.":"Jusqu’à 128 caractères. Utilisez des caractères alphanumériques et les caractères « -_ ». Doit être unique par fournisseur.",Update:$Pt,"Update certificate signer":"Mettre à jour le signataire du certificat",'Use "{{key}}"':"Utiliser « {{key}} »",'Use "{{value}}"':"Utiliser « {{value}} »","Use case":"Cas d’utilisation","Use cases":"Cas d’utilisation","Use default templates":"Utiliser les modèles par défaut","Use letters, digits, and . - _ characters, with a single / between parts. No / at the start or end, and a part can't be . or ..":"Utilisez des lettres, des chiffres et les caractères . - _, avec un seul / entre les parties. Pas de / au début ou à la fin, et une partie ne peut pas être . ou ..","Use one from another account":"Utilisez-en un depuis un autre compte","Use only Latin letters, numbers, spaces, tabs, line breaks, and standard keyboard symbols.":"Utilisez uniquement des lettres latines, des chiffres, des espaces, des tabulations, des sauts de ligne et des symboles de clavier standard.","Use only letters, digits, - and _ characters.":"Utilisez uniquement des lettres, des chiffres et les caractères - et _.","Use only letters, digits, . - and _ characters. The path can't be . or ..":"Utilisez uniquement des lettres, des chiffres et les caractères . - et _. Le chemin ne peut pas être . ou ..","Use only letters, digits, periods (.), hyphens (-), and underscores (_).":"Utilisez uniquement des lettres, des chiffres, des points (.), des traits d’union (-) et des traits de soulignement (_).","Use the workload identity in trust policies, resource policies, or SCPs. Each call is recorded in CloudTrail with the workload's identity.":"Utilisez l’identité de la charge de travail dans les politiques de confiance, les politiques de ressources ou les SCP. Chaque appel est enregistré dans CloudTrail avec l’identité de la charge de travail.",'Use: "{{text}}"':"Utiliser : « {{text}} »","Used as the common name in the certificate authority's subject.":"Utilisé comme nom commun dans l’objet de l’autorité de certification.",Validating:jPt,"Validating: stopped signing, still trusted":"Validation : signature arrêtée, toujours approuvé",Value:WPt,"Value must be 256 characters or less.":"La valeur doit comporter 256 caractères maximum.",Values:qPt,"View all":"Voir tout","View all notifications":"Afficher toutes les notifications","View JSON":"Voir le JSON",Visual:UPt,Warning:VPt,Warnings:HPt,"What gets created":"Éléments créés","Which EKS clusters is this provider for?":"À quels clusters EKS ce fournisseur est-il destiné ?",'Wildcard "*" is only allowed with the StringLike, StringNotLike, ArnLike, or ArnNotLike operators.':"Le caractère générique « * » n’est autorisé qu’avec les opérateurs StringLike, StringNotLike, ArnLike ou ArnNotLike.","Without a policy, no other account can create templates under this provider, though delegated administrators can already create both. Add a statement for each account, organizational unit, or IAM principal that should be able to, and limit each one to a path prefix.":"En l’absence de politique, aucun autre compte ne peut créer de modèles sous ce fournisseur, bien que les administrateurs délégués puissent déjà créer les deux. Ajoutez une déclaration pour chaque compte, unité organisationnelle ou principal IAM autorisé à le faire, et limitez chacun à un préfixe de chemin.","Workload identities ({{total}})":"Identités de charge de travail ({{total}})","Workload identities in the IAM User Guide":"Identités des charges de travail dans le guide de l’utilisateur IAM","Workload identities in the IAM User Guide (opens in a new tab)":"Identités des charges de travail dans le guide de l’utilisateur IAM (s’ouvre dans un nouvel onglet)","Workload identities: {{reason}}":"Identités de charge de travail : {{reason}}","Workload identity":"Identité de charge de travail","Workload Identity":"Identité de charge de travail","Workload identity {{name}}: {{reason}}":"Identité de la charge de travail {{name}} : {{reason}}","Workload identity {{workloadIdentifier}} deleted.":"Identité de charge de travail {{workloadIdentifier}} supprimée.","Workloads get named automatically":"Les charges de travail sont nommées automatiquement","Workloads in these EKS clusters can get an identity from this provider, when all of these are true:":"Les charges de travail de ces clusters EKS peuvent obtenir une identité de ce fournisseur lorsque toutes les conditions suivantes sont remplies :","Workloads running in these clusters can get an identity from this provider. Add 2 or more.":"Les charges de travail de ces clusters peuvent obtenir une identité de ce fournisseur. Ajoutez au moins 2 clusters.","Workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Les charges de travail s’exécutant dans ce compte peuvent utiliser les identités générées par ce modèle à l’aide d’informations vérifiées par {{workloadLabel}}.","Workloads running in this cluster can get an identity from this provider.":"Les charges de travail exécutées dans ce cluster peuvent obtenir une identité de ce fournisseur.","Workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Les charges de travail s’exécutant dans votre organisation peuvent utiliser les identités générées par ce modèle à l’aide d’informations vérifiées par {{workloadLabel}}.","Workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request":"Les charges de travail qui utilisent ces identités ne recevront plus d’informations d’identification et échoueront lors de leur prochaine requête","Workloads, such as agents, pods, and jobs, are verified at runtime and get a workload identity, one per workload, generated by a template. The identity gets fine-grained access to AWS resources through IAM policies and CloudTrail, and signed JWT and X.509 credentials for meshes and SaaS apps.":"Les charges de travail, telles que les agents, les pods et les tâches, sont vérifiées lors de l’exécution et se voient attribuer une identité de charge de travail, une par charge de travail, générée par un modèle. L’identité bénéficie d’un accès précis aux ressources AWS via les politiques IAM et CloudTrail, ainsi que d’informations d’identification JWT et X.509 signées pour les maillages et les applications SaaS.","Wrap lines":"Renvoyer à la ligne","Write a policy to let another account create templates, or to stop a delegated administrator from part of the name space. Each statement names an organizational unit, specific accounts, or individual IAM principals, allows or denies, and can be limited to a path prefix.":"Écrivez une politique pour permettre à un autre compte de créer des modèles ou pour empêcher un administrateur délégué d’accéder à une partie de l’espace de noms. Chaque instruction nomme une unité organisationnelle, des comptes spécifiques ou des principaux IAM individuels, autorise ou refuse, et peut être limitée à un préfixe de chemin.","Yes by default":"Oui par défaut","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tag.":"Vous pouvez ajouter jusqu’à {{availableTags}} balise supplémentaire.","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tags.":"Vous pouvez ajouter jusqu’à {{availableTags}} balises supplémentaires.","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"Vous avez dépassé la limite de {{tagLimit}} balise.","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"Vous avez dépassé la limite de {{tagLimit}} balises.","You have more keys than can be displayed":"Vous avez plus de clés qu’il n’est possible d’en afficher","You have more values than can be displayed":"Vous avez plus de valeurs qu’il n’est possible d’en afficher","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"Vous avez atteint la limite de {{tagLimit}} balise.","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"Vous avez atteint la limite de {{tagLimit}} balises.","You have unsaved tag changes. Leave this page and discard them?":"Vous avez des modifications de balises non enregistrées. Quitter cette page et les ignorer ?","You must enter a path":"Vous devez saisir un chemin.","You must specify a condition key":"Vous devez spécifier une clé de condition","You must specify a tag key":"Vous devez spécifier une clé de balise","You must specify a unique tag key.":"Vous devez spécifier une clé de balise unique.","You must specify a value":"Vous devez spécifier une valeur","Your administrator decides which prefixes this account can use. This is checked when you create.":"C’est votre administrateur qui décide des préfixes que ce compte peut utiliser. Cela est vérifié lors de la création.","Your identities will be <code>{{prefix}}<em>{{placeholder}}</em></code>":"Vos identités seront <code>{{prefix}}<em>{{placeholder}}</em></code>","Your organization already has a workload identity provider. Add templates under it to start issuing identities to your workloads — each named under your account's path prefix.":"Votre organisation dispose déjà d’un fournisseur d’identités de charges de travail. Ajoutez-y des modèles pour commencer à attribuer des identités à vos charges de travail. Chaque identité est nommée sous le préfixe de chemin de votre compte.","Your organization has workload identity providers you can use. Pick one and add templates under it to start issuing identities to your workloads.":"Votre organisation dispose de fournisseurs d’identités de charges de travail que vous pouvez utiliser. Choisissez-en un et ajoutez-y des modèles pour commencer à attribuer des identités à vos charges de travail.","YYYY/MM/DD":"AAAA/MM/JJ","{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.","A declared identity has a fixed name you define. Use one when you need an exact name, for example to match a name another system already expects.":"A declared identity has a fixed name you define. Use one when you need an exact name, for example to match a name another system already expects.","A fact {{workload}} checks when the agent or workload starts.":"A fact {{workload}} checks when the agent or workload starts.","A provider issues secure, verifiable identities to your agents and workloads, like your Kubernetes pods or AI agents, to access AWS and third-party services without long-lived credentials.":"A provider issues secure, verifiable identities to your agents and workloads, like your Kubernetes pods or AI agents, to access AWS and third-party services without long-lived credentials.","A template automatically generates an identity for each matching agent or workload under {{providerName}}.":"A template automatically generates an identity for each matching agent or workload under {{providerName}}.","A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued.":"A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued.","A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued. Decide how this provider issues identities - starting from the <link>default templates</link> for common use cases, or skipping them. Templates are optional and can be added later.":"A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued. Decide how this provider issues identities - starting from the <link>default templates</link> for common use cases, or skipping them. Templates are optional and can be added later.","A template names identities automatically as matching agents and workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.":"A template names identities automatically as matching agents and workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.","A template with no attestation policy matches no agent or workload, so nothing is ever issued from it. Set a policy to define which agents and workloads qualify.":"A template with no attestation policy matches no agent or workload, so nothing is ever issued from it. Set a policy to define which agents and workloads qualify.","A template's path pattern, built from facts like cluster, namespace, and service account, names each agent or workload automatically when it starts. You don't create identities ahead of time.":"A template's path pattern, built from facts like cluster, namespace, and service account, names each agent or workload automatically when it starts. You don't create identities ahead of time.","Add a fact or condition key. A path of only custom text would give every agent or workload the same name.":"Add a fact or condition key. A path of only custom text would give every agent or workload the same name.","Add an {{conditionKey}} condition, so only agents or workloads in these clusters get an identity.":"Add an {{conditionKey}} condition, so only agents or workloads in these clusters get an identity.","Add attestation policy":"Add attestation policy","Add templates after the provider is created.":"Add templates after the provider is created.","Agent and workload identity":"Agent and workload identity","Agent and workload identity - <em>Preview</em>":"Agent and workload identity - <em>Preview</em>","Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide":"Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide","Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide (opens in a new tab)":"Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide (opens in a new tab)","Agents and workloads get named automatically":"Agents and workloads get named automatically","Agents and workloads get short-lived credentials that renew automatically and follow the SPIFFE standard, so they work with service meshes such as Istio and with business applications.":"Agents and workloads get short-lived credentials that renew automatically and follow the SPIFFE standard, so they work with service meshes such as Istio and with business applications.","Agents and workloads in these EKS clusters can get an identity from this provider, when all of these are true:":"Agents and workloads in these EKS clusters can get an identity from this provider, when all of these are true:","Agents and workloads running in these clusters can get an identity from this provider. Add two or more.":"Agents and workloads running in these clusters can get an identity from this provider. Add two or more.","Agents and workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Agents and workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.","Agents and workloads running in this cluster can get an identity from this provider.":"Agents and workloads running in this cluster can get an identity from this provider.","Agents and workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Agents and workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.","Agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request":"Agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request","Agents and workloads, such as AI agents and pods, are verified at runtime and each gets its own identity, generated by a template. The identity gets fine-grained access to AWS resources through IAM policies and CloudTrail, and signed JWT and X.509 credentials for meshes and apps.":"Agents and workloads, such as AI agents and pods, are verified at runtime and each gets its own identity, generated by a template. The identity gets fine-grained access to AWS resources through IAM policies and CloudTrail, and signed JWT and X.509 credentials for meshes and apps.","All templates and identities under this provider will be deleted":"All templates and identities under this provider will be deleted","An AI agent or workload gets an identity that is unique.":"An AI agent or workload gets an identity that is unique.","An identity with no attestation policy admits no workload, so nothing can run as it. Set a policy to define which workload qualifies.":"An identity with no attestation policy admits no workload, so nothing can run as it. Set a policy to define which workload qualifies.","An identity with this name already exists.":"An identity with this name already exists.","At runtime the platform attests these facts about the agent or workload. Any agent or workload whose attestation carries them gets an identity issued from this template.":"At runtime the platform attests these facts about the agent or workload. Any agent or workload whose attestation carries them gets an identity issued from this template.","Attestation policy for {{name}} has been removed.":"Attestation policy for {{name}} has been removed.","Attestation policy for {{name}} has been updated.":"Attestation policy for {{name}} has been updated.","By continuing, you also enable organization level resource creation, which is needed to create the organization scoped provider. You can disable it later in Settings.":"By continuing, you also enable organization level resource creation, which is needed to create the organization scoped provider. You can disable it later in Settings.","Change the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.":"Change the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.","Choose a stable, unique name that identifies one environment or group of agents and workloads, for example prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal.":"Choose a stable, unique name that identifies one environment or group of agents and workloads, for example prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal.","Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for an agent or workload.":"Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for an agent or workload.","Choose the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.":"Choose the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.","Choose where the workload is hosted":"Choose where the workload is hosted","Choose who can use it":"Choose who can use it","Control what an agent or workload can reach with familiar IAM policies and see its AWS calls in CloudTrail.":"Control what an agent or workload can reach with familiar IAM policies and see its AWS calls in CloudTrail.","Create declared identity":"Create declared identity","Creates an agent and workload identity provider and template for agents and workloads running in one or more EKS clusters under a service mesh, such as Istio.":"Creates an agent and workload identity provider and template for agents and workloads running in one or more EKS clusters under a service mesh, such as Istio.","Creating the identity":"Creating the identity","Declare an identity with the exact name you need":"Declare an identity with the exact name you need","Declared identities":"Declared identities","Declared identity":"Declared identity","Declared identity {{name}} created.":"Declared identity {{name}} created.","Define which agents and workloads are allowed to use this template.":"Define which agents and workloads are allowed to use this template.","Delete the templates under <b>{{providerName}}</b> before deleting the provider. Once deleted, agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials and fail on their next request, and access that you granted to these identities will stop working.":"Delete the templates under <b>{{providerName}}</b> before deleting the provider. Once deleted, agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials and fail on their next request, and access that you granted to these identities will stop working.","Deleting templates and identities":"Deleting templates and identities","Each identity is fully the template path.":"Each identity is fully the template path.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.","Enter a description":"Enter a description","Failed to create the declared identity.":"Failed to create the declared identity.","Failed to save attestation policy.":"Failed to save attestation policy.","Filter declared identities":"Filter declared identities","For example, to match a name another system already expects.":"For example, to match a name another system already expects.","from provider":"from provider","Give AI agents and workloads their own identities. Know which of them made each call. Scope its access with the IAM policies you already use.":"Give AI agents and workloads their own identities. Know which of them made each call. Scope its access with the IAM policies you already use.","Give an agent or workload a unique identity, so you can grant it access and audit what it did rather than sharing one role.":"Give an agent or workload a unique identity, so you can grant it access and audit what it did rather than sharing one role.","Grant access":"Grant access","Grant this name access to resources in IAM policies.":"Grant this name access to resources in IAM policies.","IAM for agents and workloads":"IAM for agents and workloads","IAM for agents and workloads (opens in a new tab)":"IAM for agents and workloads (opens in a new tab)",Identifier:KPt,"Identities ({{total}})":"Identities ({{total}})","Identities are issued at runtime from facts the agent or workload proves, rather than from what an admin assigns.":"Identities are issued at runtime from facts the agent or workload proves, rather than from what an admin assigns.","Identities for agents":"Identities for agents","Identities: {{reason}}":"Identities: {{reason}}","Identity {{name}}: {{reason}}":"Identity {{name}}: {{reason}}","Invalid trust domain. Use lowercase alphanumeric and '-.' characters.":"Invalid trust domain. Use lowercase alphanumeric and '-.' characters.","Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's agents and workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. Standard pricing applies to the creation and use of AWS Private CA.":"Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's agents and workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. Standard pricing applies to the creation and use of AWS Private CA.","It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so agents and workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. To avoid this, wait until it becomes inactive on its own. Deleting it then has no effect on verification.":"It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so agents and workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. To avoid this, wait until it becomes inactive on its own. Deleting it then has no effect on verification.","Let agents and workloads reach non-AWS resources":"Let agents and workloads reach non-AWS resources","Loading declared identities":"Loading declared identities","Matching agents and workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.":"Matching agents and workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.","No agent and workload identity providers":"No agent and workload identity providers","No agent or workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.":"No agent or workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.","No attestation policy attached.":"No attestation policy attached.","No attestation policy. No agent or workload will be issued an identity from this template until you add one.":"No attestation policy. No agent or workload will be issued an identity from this template until you add one.","No conditions. This policy matches every agent or workload of its service.":"No conditions. This policy matches every agent or workload of its service.","No segments yet. Add at least one, or every agent or workload this template matches resolves to the same name.":"No segments yet. Add at least one, or every agent or workload this template matches resolves to the same name.","None – names are defined by templates":"None – names are defined by templates","Nothing can run as this identity":"Nothing can run as this identity","Once the attestation policy is removed, matching agents and workloads will not be issued agent and workload identities until you add a policy again.":"Once the attestation policy is removed, matching agents and workloads will not be issued agent and workload identities until you add a policy again.","One bundle per provider, and one URL. It carries every authority the provider publishes: both outbound signers, and during an update both the current and incoming certificate authority, which is what lets verifiers accept either one through the handover. Your own AWS agents and workloads get these keys automatically; send this to systems outside AWS.":"One bundle per provider, and one URL. It carries every authority the provider publishes: both outbound signers, and during an update both the current and incoming certificate authority, which is what lets verifiers accept either one through the handover. Your own AWS agents and workloads get these keys automatically; send this to systems outside AWS.","One provider and one trust domain shared by every EKS cluster in the mesh. An agent or workload with the same namespace and service account in any of these clusters shares one identity.":"One provider and one trust domain shared by every EKS cluster in the mesh. An agent or workload with the same namespace and service account in any of these clusters shares one identity.","Path is the unique part of each identity's name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts an agent or workload proves.":"Path is the unique part of each identity's name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts an agent or workload proves.","path prefix":"path prefix","Policy: Define how an agent or workload attests to get the identity":"Policy: Define how an agent or workload attests to get the identity","Proven at runtime":"Proven at runtime","Providers to issue agent and workload identities":"Providers to issue agent and workload identities","Scoped, auditable access":"Scoped, auditable access","Search by name":"Search by name","Set the exact name":"Set the exact name","Set the naming format and usage scope that every agent and workload identity from this provider inherits.":"Set the naming format and usage scope that every agent and workload identity from this provider inherits.","Set the unique path pattern that every identity generated by this template follows. Cannot be changed later.":"Set the unique path pattern that every identity generated by this template follows. Cannot be changed later.","Set up a provider to hold the templates that generate identity names and the signers that sign credentials for systems outside AWS.":"Set up a provider to hold the templates that generate identity names and the signers that sign credentials for systems outside AWS.","Set up a way to issue agent and workload identities":"Set up a way to issue agent and workload identities","Set which workloads can use this identity and where they must run.":"Set which workloads can use this identity and where they must run.","Stop matching agents and workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request":"Stop matching agents and workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request","Templates give matching agents and workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.":"Templates give matching agents and workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it.":"The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.":"The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Generated from the EKS clusters above. Can be edited later.":"The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Generated from the EKS clusters above. Can be edited later.","The attestation policy controls how this identity is issued. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.":"The attestation policy controls how this identity is issued. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.","The attestation policy is the set of facts an agent or workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so an agent or workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.":"The attestation policy is the set of facts an agent or workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so an agent or workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.","The certificate chain is distributing to every Region, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. It starts signing at {{at}}. That is the minimum signing delay you set, so signing may start later than this. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.":"The certificate chain is distributing to every Region, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. It starts signing at {{at}}. That is the minimum signing delay you set, so signing may start later than this. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.","The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Account ID and Region in front so names stay unique across accounts and Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.":"The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Account ID and Region in front so names stay unique across accounts and Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.","The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Region in front so names stay unique across Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.":"The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Region in front so names stay unique across Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.","This action deletes the agent and workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.":"This action deletes the agent and workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.","This certificate has stopped signing, but its chain stays in the trust bundle so certificates already issued under it keep verifying. It becomes inactive at {{at}}. Until then, Enable resumes signing with no wait. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.":"This certificate has stopped signing, but its chain stays in the trust bundle so certificates already issued under it keep verifying. It becomes inactive at {{at}}. Until then, Enable resumes signing with no wait. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.","This doesn't look like a valid EKS cluster ARN. An invalid ARN will leave agents or workloads in that cluster without an identity.":"This doesn't look like a valid EKS cluster ARN. An invalid ARN will leave agents or workloads in that cluster without an identity.","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. Both certificates below stop, including the one still in transition, so the update does not complete. Both stay configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. Both certificates below stop, including the one still in transition, so the update does not complete. Both stay configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.","This template issues no identities":"This template issues no identities","Trust domain must be 64 characters or less.":"Trust domain must be 64 characters or less.","Use the agent or workload identity in trust policies, resource policies, or SCPs. CloudTrail records its calls with that identity.":"Use the agent or workload identity in trust policies, resource policies, or SCPs. CloudTrail records its calls with that identity.","What conditions should the agent or workload match?":"What conditions should the agent or workload match?","Where is the agent or workload hosted?":"Where is the agent or workload hosted?","You must enter a name":"You must enter a name","Your organization already has an agent and workload identity provider. Add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads — each named under your account's path prefix.":"Your organization already has an agent and workload identity provider. Add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads — each named under your account's path prefix.","Your organization has agent and workload identity providers you can use. Pick one and add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads.":"Your organization has agent and workload identity providers you can use. Pick one and add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads."},YPt=Object.freeze(Object.defineProperty({__proto__:null,ARN:"ARN",Actions:RLt,Active:MLt,Add:zLt,Apply:OLt,Attestation:BLt,Cancel:FLt,Clear:$Lt,Close:jLt,Configured:WLt,Confirm:qLt,Contains:ULt,Created:VLt,Delete:HLt,Description:KLt,Details:GLt,Disable:YLt,Dismiss:JLt,Edit:ZLt,Editing:XLt,Enable:QLt,Equals:tPt,Errors:aPt,Format:nPt,Identifier:KPt,Inactive:iPt,Info:rPt,JWKS:oPt,Key:"Clé",Name:"Nom",New:sPt,None:lPt,Notifications:cPt,Operator:dPt,Operators:uPt,Path:mPt,Preferences:gPt,Preview:vPt,Properties:fPt,Property:yPt,Provided:bPt,Provider:wPt,Providers:kPt,Ready:SPt,Recommended:_Pt,Refresh:xPt,Remove:APt,Retry:EPt,Save:CPt,Scheme:IPt,Scope:DPt,Status:LPt,Subject:PPt,Success:NPt,Tags:RPt,Template:MPt,Templates:zPt,Theme:OPt,Today:BPt,Undo:FPt,Update:$Pt,Validating:jPt,Value:WPt,Values:qPt,Visual:UPt,Warning:VPt,Warnings:HPt,and:"et",default:GPt,equals:ePt,optional:pPt,or:"ou",path:hPt,scheme:TPt},Symbol.toStringTag,{value:"Module"})),JPt="Tindakan",ZPt="Aktif",XPt="Tambahkan",QPt="Terapkan",eNt="Verifikasi",tNt="Batalkan",aNt="Hapus",nNt="Tutup",iNt="Dikonfigurasi",rNt="Konfirmasikan",oNt="Berisi",sNt="Dibuat",lNt="Hapus",cNt="Deskripsi",dNt="Detail",uNt="Nonaktifkan",pNt="Abaikan",hNt="Edit",mNt="Pengeditan",gNt="Aktifkan",vNt="sama dengan",fNt="Sama dengan",yNt="Kesalahan",bNt="Format",wNt="Tidak aktif",kNt="Info",SNt="JWKS",_Nt="Kunci",xNt="Nama",ANt="Baru",ENt="Tidak ada",CNt="Notifikasi",TNt="Operator",INt="Operator",DNt="opsional",LNt="atau",PNt="jalur",NNt="Jalur",RNt="Preferensi",MNt="Pratinjau",zNt="Properti",ONt="Properti",BNt="Disediakan",FNt="Penyedia",$Nt="Penyedia",jNt="Siap",WNt="Direkomendasikan",qNt="Segarkan",UNt="Hapus",VNt="Coba lagi",HNt="Simpan",KNt="skema",GNt="Skema",YNt="Lingkup",JNt="Status",ZNt="Subjek",XNt="Berhasil",QNt="Templat",eRt="Templat",tRt="Tema",aRt="Hari ini",nRt="Batalkan",iRt="Perbarui",rRt="Memvalidasi",oRt="Nilai",sRt="Nilai",lRt="Visual",cRt="Peringatan",dRt="Peringatan",uRt="Identifier",pRt={"'{{providerName}}' does not exist in your account":"'{{providerName}}' tidak ada di akun Anda","(earliest)":"(terawal)","{{addedCount}} tag added or changed":"{{addedCount}} tag ditambahkan atau diubah","{{addedCount}} tags added or changed":"{{addedCount}} tag ditambahkan atau diubah","{{createdCount}} templates created: {{templateNames}}.":"{{createdCount}} templat dibuat: {{templateNames}}.","{{failed}} of {{total}} certificates could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}} dari {{total}} sertifikat tidak dapat dihapus sehingga penyedia tidak dihapus. Selesaikan kesalahan, lalu coba lagi.","{{failed}} of {{total}} could not be deleted.":"{{failed}} dari {{total}} tidak dapat dihapus.","{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and workload identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}} dari {{total}} templat dan identitas beban kerja tidak dapat dihapus sehingga penyedia tidak dihapus. Selesaikan kesalahan, lalu coba lagi.","{{failedCount}} template could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.":"{{failedCount}} templat tidak dapat dibuat. Tinjau kesalahan berikut dan coba lagi.","{{failedCount}} templates could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.":"{{failedCount}} templat tidak dapat dibuat. Tinjau kesalahan berikut dan coba lagi.","{{identityCount}} identities":"{{identityCount}} identitas","{{identityCount}} identity":"{{identityCount}} identitas","{{label}} (service mesh)":"{{label}} (jala layanan)","{{label}} copied":"{{label}} disalin","{{label}} failed to copy":"{{label}} gagal disalin","{{label}} template":"Templat {{label}}","{{label}} template {{index}}":"Templat {{label}} {{index}}","{{label}}:":"{{label}}:","{{matchCount}} match":"{{matchCount}} kecocokan","{{matchCount}} matches":"{{matchCount}} kecocokan","{{name}} has been successfully created.":"{{name}} telah berhasil dibuat.","{{name}} has been successfully created. However, the following operations failed:":"{{name}} telah berhasil dibuat. Namun, operasi berikut gagal:","{{providerName}} still has these resources:":"{{providerName}} masih memiliki sumber daya ini:","{{removedCount}} tag removed":"{{removedCount}} tag dihapus","{{removedCount}} tags removed":"{{removedCount}} tag dihapus","{{scope}} · {{domain}}":"{{scope}} · {{domain}}","{{settled}} of {{total}}":"{{settled}} dari {{total}}","{{subject}}. Does not match this signer's {{algorithm}} algorithm.":"{{subject}}. Tidak cocok dengan algoritma {{algorithm}} penanda tangan ini.","{{tagCount}} tag":"{{tagCount}} tag","{{tagCount}} tags":"{{tagCount}} tag","{{templateCount}} template":"{{templateCount}} templat","{{templateCount}} templates":"{{templateCount}} templat","{{templateName}} template failed to create. To try again, <link>add templates</link>. Error details: {{reason}}":"{{templateName}} templat gagal dibuat. Untuk mencoba lagi, <link>tambahkan templat</link>. Rincian kesalahan: {{reason}}","{{workload}} fact":"Fakta {{workload}}","{defined by template}":"{defined by template}","<term>Support:</term> Amazon EKS, Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Runtime, and Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Gateway.":"<term>Dukungan:</term> Amazon EKS, Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Runtime, dan Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Gateway.","1 EKS cluster":"1 Klaster EKS","1 provider and 1 trust domain per EKS cluster. Each namespace and service account in this cluster gets its own identity, trusted only within this cluster.":"1 penyedia dan 1 domain kepercayaan per klaster EKS. Setiap namespace dan akun layanan di klaster ini mendapatkan identitasnya sendiri, yang hanya dipercaya dalam kluster ini.","1 provider and 1 trust domain shared by every EKS cluster in the mesh. A workload with the same namespace and service account in any of these clusters shares one identity.":"1 penyedia dan 1 domain kepercayaan yang dibagikan oleh setiap klaster EKS di jala layanan. Beban kerja dengan namespace dan akun layanan yang sama di salah satu klaster ini berbagi satu identitas.","1 to 48 hours, in whole hours. Publishing is usually much faster, but can take up to 24 hours.":"1 hingga 48 jam, dalam jam penuh. Penerbitan biasanya jauh lebih cepat, tetapi dapat memerlukan waktu hingga 24 jam.","1. Select all the check boxes to confirm what deleting {{providerName}} will do.":"1. Pilih semua kotak centang untuk mengonfirmasi dampak dari penghapusan {{providerName}}.","2. Confirm that you want to delete this provider by typing {{providerName}} below.":"2. Konfirmasikan bahwa Anda ingin menghapus penyedia ini dengan mengetik {{providerName}} di bawah ini.","A declared identity has a fixed path you define. Use one when you need an exact path, for example to match a value another system already expects.":"Identitas yang dideklarasikan memiliki jalur tetap yang Anda tentukan. Gunakan identitas ini ketika Anda membutuhkan jalur yang tepat, misalnya untuk mencocokkan nilai yang sudah diharapkan oleh sistem lain.","A deny, and only for delegated administrators":"Penolakan, dan hanya untuk administrator terdelegasi","A fact {{workload}} checks when the workload starts.":"Fakta {{workload}} memeriksa kapan beban kerja dimulai.","A fixed label, such as an environment name.":"Label tetap, seperti nama lingkungan.","A name to identify this identity.":"Nama untuk mengidentifikasi identitas ini.","A provider with this name already exists.":"Penyedia dengan nama ini sudah ada.","A tag is a label you assign to an AWS resource. Each tag has a key and an optional value. Use tags to search and filter this provider, or to track your AWS costs.":"Tag adalah label yang Anda berikan pada sumber daya AWS. Setiap tag terdiri dari kunci dan nilai opsional. Gunakan tag untuk mencari dan memfilter penyedia ini, atau untuk melacak biaya AWS Anda.","A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts a workload must prove before an identity is issued. Decide how this provider issues identities - starting from the <link>default templates</link> for common use cases, or skipping them. You can add and name identities manually at any time - templates are optional and can be added later.":"Templat mendefinisikan pola jalur yang digunakan untuk memberi nama identitas secara unik dan fakta yang harus dibuktikan oleh beban kerja sebelum identitas dikeluarkan. Putuskan cara penyedia ini mengeluarkan identitas—mulai dari <link>templat default</link> untuk kasus penggunaan umum, atau melewatkannya. Anda dapat menambahkan dan memberi nama identitas secara manual kapan saja—templat bersifat opsional dan dapat ditambahkan nanti.","A template with this name already exists.":"Templat dengan nama ini sudah ada.","A template's path pattern, built from facts like cluster, namespace, and service account, names each workload automatically when it starts. You don't create identities ahead of time.":"Pola jalur templat, dibangun dari fakta-fakta seperti klaster, namespace, dan akun layanan, memberi nama setiap beban kerja secara otomatis saat dimulai. Anda tidak perlu membuat identitas terlebih dahulu.","A workload identity provider issues secure, verifiable identities to your workloads, like Kubernetes pods or AI agents. Workloads use them to access AWS and third-party services without long-lived credentials.":"Penyedia identitas beban kerja mengeluarkan identitas yang aman dan dapat diverifikasi ke beban kerja Anda, seperti pod Kubernetes atau agen AI. Beban kerja menggunakannya untuk mengakses AWS dan layanan pihak ketiga tanpa kredensial yang berlaku dalam jangka panjang.","A workload, including an AI agent or sub-agent created on demand, gets its own identity. No workload shares or inherits another's.":"Beban kerja, termasuk agen AI atau subagen yang dibuat sesuai permintaan, memiliki identitasnya sendiri. Tidak ada beban kerja yang berbagi atau mewarisi identitas beban kerja lainnya.","Access a partner API, a SaaS endpoint, or an OIDC service. No setup needed.":"Akses API partner, titik akhir SaaS, atau layanan OIDC. Tidak perlu pengaturan.","Access a service mesh, a database, or an on-premises system.":"Akses jala layanan, basis data, atau sistem on-premise.","Access denied":"Akses ditolak","Access you granted to these identities will stop working":"Akses yang Anda berikan ke identitas-identitas ini akan berhenti berfungsi","Account scoped":"Lingkup akun",Actions:JPt,"Activating it":"Mengaktifkannya",Active:ZPt,"Active certificate authority ID":"ID otoritas sertifikasi aktif","Active: currently signing":"Aktif: sedang digunakan untuk penandatanganan",Add:XPt,"Add {{label}} template":"Tambahkan templat {{label}}","Add a fact or condition key. A path of only custom text would give every workload the same name.":"Tambahkan fakta atau kunci kondisi. Jalur yang hanya berisi teks kustom akan memberikan nama yang sama untuk setiap beban kerja.","Add an {{conditionKey}} condition, so only workloads in these clusters get an identity.":"Tambahkan kondisi {{conditionKey}} sehingga hanya beban kerja di klaster ini yang mendapatkan identitas.","Add at least 1 path segment.":"Tambahkan setidaknya 1 segmen jalur.","Add at least 1 template to continue.":"Tambahkan setidaknya 1 templat untuk melanjutkan.","Add at least 2 clusters.":"Tambahkan setidaknya 2 klaster.","Add attestation rules":"Tambahkan aturan verifikasi","Add cluster ARN":"Tambahkan ARN klaster","Add condition":"Tambahkan kondisi","Add default templates for Amazon EKS, AgentCore Runtime, and AgentCore Gateway.":"Tambahkan templat default untuk Amazon EKS, Runtime AgentCore, dan AgentCore Gateway.","Add new tag":"Tambahkan tag baru","Add policy":"Tambahkan kebijakan","Add request-context values like account, Region, or organization.":"Tambahkan nilai konteks permintaan seperti akun, Region, atau organisasi.","Add tags":"Tambahkan tag","Add tags to this provider for cost management and access control.":"Tambahkan tag ke penyedia ini untuk manajemen biaya dan kontrol akses.","Add tags to this template for cost management and access control.":"Tambahkan tag ke templat ini untuk manajemen biaya dan kontrol akses.","Add tags to this workload identity for cost management and access control.":"Tambahkan tag ke identitas beban kerja ini untuk manajemen biaya dan kontrol akses.","Add template":"Tambahkan templat","Add templates":"Tambahkan templat","Add templates after the provider is created, or create and name identities by hand.":"Tambahkan templat setelah penyedia dibuat, atau buat dan beri nama identitas secara manual.","Add to the path pattern":"Tambahkan ke pola jalur","Added or changed tags were not saved":"Tag yang ditambahkan atau diubah tidak disimpan","Adding permissions to govern who can create templates referring to this provider failed. To try again, <link>add policy</link>. Error details: {{reason}}":"Menambahkan izin untuk mengatur siapa yang dapat membuat templat yang merujuk ke penyedia ini gagal. Untuk mencoba lagi, <link>tambahkan kebijakan</link>. Rincian kesalahan: {{reason}}","All outbound signers under this provider will be deleted":"Semua penandatangan keluar di bawah penyedia ini akan dihapus","All properties":"Semua properti","All templates and workload identities under this provider will be deleted":"Semua templat dan identitas beban kerja di bawah penyedia ini akan dihapus","Allow member accounts to add their own templates, namespaced by account ID":"Izinkan akun anggota untuk menambahkan templat mereka sendiri, dengan namespace berdasarkan ID akun","An identity for agent or workload":"Identitas untuk agen atau beban kerja",and:"dan","Any value":"Nilai apa pun",Apply:QPt,ARN:"ARN","ARN copied":"ARN disalin","arn:aws:eks:{Region}:{account ID}:cluster/{cluster name}":"arn:aws:eks:{Region}:{account ID}:cluster/{cluster name}","At runtime the platform attests these facts about the workload. Any workload whose attestation carries them issues an identity from this template.":"Saat runtime, platform mengesahkan fakta-fakta ini tentang beban kerja. Setiap beban kerja yang pengesahannya memuat fakta-fakta tersebut akan menghasilkan identitas dari templat ini.",Attestation:eNt,"Attestation policy":"Kebijakan pengesahan","Auto generated identity name":"Nama identitas yang dihasilkan secara otomatis","Automatically generate from a template":"Hasilkan secara otomatis dari templat","Available to every account in your organization ({{organizationId}})":"Tersedia untuk setiap akun di organisasi Anda ({{organizationId}})","Available to this account ({{accountId}})":"Tersedia untuk akun ini ({{accountId}})","AWS account ID":"ID akun AWS","AWS API calls in CloudTrail resolve to the specific workload that made them. Scope trust policies, resource policies, and SCPs to it, using the IAM policies you already know.":"Panggilan API AWS di CloudTrail dapat dilacak ke beban kerja spesifik yang membuatnya. Cakupkan kebijakan kepercayaan, kebijakan sumber daya, dan SCP ke beban kerja tersebut, menggunakan kebijakan IAM yang sudah Anda ketahui.","AWS creates a subordinate CA in every region this provider signs in, and returns an ID for it.":"AWS membuat CA subordinat di setiap wilayah tempat penyedia ini masuk, dan mengembalikan ID untuk hal tersebut.","AWS IAM Workload Identity":"Identitas Beban Kerja AWS IAM","AWS IAM Workload Identity (opens in a new tab)":"Identitas Beban Kerja AWS IAM (terbuka di tab baru)","AWS Private CA couldn't set up this certificate authority. Delete it in the AWS Private CA console and try again.":"AWS Private CA tidak dapat menyiapkan otoritas sertifikat ini. Hapus otoritas sertifikat tersebut di konsol AWS Private CA, lalu coba lagi.","By default, each account's templates require an account ID path prefix to avoid name collisions. You can customize this after creating the provider, under provider settings.":"Secara default, setiap templat akun memerlukan prefiks jalur ID akun untuk menghindari konflik terkait nama. Anda dapat menyesuaikan pengaturan ini setelah membuat penyedia, di bawah pengaturan penyedia.","Can't be changed after the provider is created.":"Tidak dapat diubah setelah penyedia dibuat.","Can't be changed later.":"Tidak bisa diubah nanti.",Cancel:tNt,"Cannot be changed later.":"Tidak dapat diubah nanti.","Cannot start with aws:":"Tidak dapat diawali dengan aws:","Certificate {{name}} (account {{accountId}}): {{reason}}":"Sertifikat {{name}} (akun {{accountId}}): {{reason}}","Certificate authority":"Otoritas sertifikat","Certificate authority created":"Otoritas sertifikat dibuat","Certificate authority ID":"ID otoritas sertifikasi","Certificate authority name":"Nama otoritas sertifikat","Certificate authority updated. The current one keeps signing for about {{hours}} more hour, until the replacement has published everywhere.":"Otoritas sertifikat diperbarui. Sertifikat yang saat ini digunakan akan terus melakukan penandatanganan selama sekitar {{hours}} jam lagi, hingga sertifikat pengganti berhasil diterbitkan di seluruh region.","Certificate authority updated. The current one keeps signing for about {{hours}} more hours, until the replacement has published everywhere.":"Otoritas sertifikat diperbarui. Sertifikat yang saat ini digunakan akan terus melakukan penandatanganan selama sekitar {{hours}} jam lagi, hingga sertifikat pengganti berhasil diterbitkan di seluruh region.","Certificate deleted. Its chain had already left the trust bundle, so nothing that was verifying has changed.":"Sertifikat dihapus. Rantai sertifikatnya telah dihapus dari paket kepercayaan sehingga tidak ada perubahan pada proses verifikasi.","Certificate deleted. Its chain has been pulled from the trust bundle, so certificates issued under it no longer verify.":"Sertifikat dihapus. Rantainya telah ditarik dari paket kepercayaan sehingga sertifikat yang diterbitkan menggunakan sertifikat tersebut tidak lagi dapat diverifikasi.","Certificate signer":"Penanda tangan sertifikat","Certificate signer disabled, and the update in progress was stopped with it. Both authorities stay configured, and Enable resumes signing.":"Penanda tangan sertifikat dinonaktifkan, dan pembaruan yang sedang berlangsung juga dihentikan. Kedua otoritas tetap  tersimpan dalam konfigurasi, dan pilih Aktifkan untuk melanjutkan penandatanganan.","Certificate signer disabled. It stops signing now, its configuration is kept, and Enable resumes signing.":"Penanda tangan sertifikat dinonaktifkan. Proses penandatanganan dihentikan sekarang, tetapi konfigurasinya tetap disimpan. Pilih Aktifkan untuk melanjutkan proses penandatanganan.","Certificate signer enabled. Its certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle again first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hour, after every region has it.":"Penanda tangan sertifikat diaktifkan. Rantai sertifikatnya diterbitkan kembali ke paket kepercayaan terlebih dahulu, dan penandatanganan dimulai dalam waktu sekitar {{hours}} jam, setelah sertifikat tersedia di seluruh region.","Certificate signer enabled. Its certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle again first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hours, after every region has it.":"Penanda tangan sertifikat diaktifkan. Rantai sertifikatnya diterbitkan kembali ke paket kepercayaan terlebih dahulu, dan penandatanganan dimulai sekitar {{hours}} jam, setelah sertifikat tersedia di seluruh region.","Certificate signer enabled. Its material was still published, so signing resumed immediately.":"Penanda tangan sertifikat diaktifkan. Materinya masih diterbitkan sehingga proses penandatanganan langsung dilanjutkan kembali.","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hour, once every region has it.":"Penandatanganan sertifikat diaktifkan. Rantai sertifikat diterbitkan ke paket kepercayaan terlebih dahulu, dan penandatanganan dimulai dalam sekitar {{hours}} jam, setelah setiap wilayah memilikinya.","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hours, once every region has it.":"Penandatanganan sertifikat diaktifkan. Rantai sertifikat diterbitkan ke paket kepercayaan terlebih dahulu, dan penandatanganan dimulai dalam waktu sekitar {{hours}} jam, setelah setiap wilayah memilikinya.","Certificate verifier information":"Informasi pemverifikasi sertifikat","Certificates ({{total}})":"Sertifikat ({{total}})","Certificates: {{reason}}":"Sertifikat: {{reason}}","Change the facts a workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.":"Ubah fakta yang harus diverifikasi oleh beban kerja untuk diberi identitas dari templat ini. Identitas yang sudah dihasilkan oleh templat ini tidak terpengaruh.","Change the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. A workload already holding a session keeps it until the session expires.":"Ubah fakta yang harus diverifikasi oleh beban kerja untuk dijalankan sebagai identitas ini. Beban kerja yang sudah memegang sesi menyimpannya sampai sesi berakhir.","Check again":"Periksa lagi","Checking what is attached to this provider":"Memeriksa apa pun yang terlampir pada penyedia ini","Choose a condition key":"Pilih kunci kondisi","Choose a fact":"Pilih fakta","Choose a path and pattern for the names. Start from a default or customize your own.":"Pilih jalur dan pola untuk nama. Mulai dari default atau sesuaikan sendiri.","Choose a specific name up front so you can grant it access or match an existing naming convention before the workload runs.":"Pilih nama tertentu di awal agar Anda dapat memberinya akses atau mencocokkan konvensi penamaan yang ada sebelum beban kerja berjalan.","Choose a stable, unique name that identifies one environment or group of workloads, for example prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal.":"Pilih nama unik yang stabil yang mengidentifikasi satu lingkungan atau grup beban kerja, misalnya prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal.","Choose a use case above to add a template.":"Pilih kasus penggunaan di atas untuk menambahkan templat.","Choose from this account":"Pilih dari akun ini","Choose templates to add, and customize or keep their defaults":"Pilih templat untuk ditambahkan, dan sesuaikan atau pertahankan default-nya","Choose the certificate authority this signer should sign with instead. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. The current authority keeps signing until the replacement has been published long enough for verifiers to pick it up.":"Pilih otoritas sertifikat yang harus digunakan penanda tangan ini sebagai gantinya. Dibutuhkan <link>otoritas sertifikat</link> dengan CA subordinat di setiap region tempat Anda melakukan penandatanganan. Otoritas yang saat ini digunakan akan terus melakukan penandatanganan hingga sertifikat pengganti telah diterbitkan dalam waktu yang cukup agar dapat dikenali oleh verifikator.","Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for a workload.":"Pilih kunci kondisi untuk digunakan sebagai fakta pengesahan. Platform harus mengesahkan semuanya sebelum templat ini menghasilkan identitas untuk beban kerja.","Choose the facts a workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.":"Pilih fakta yang harus diverifikasi oleh beban kerja untuk diberi identitas dari templat ini. Tidak ada yang dihasilkan darinya sampai Anda melakukannya.","Choose the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. Nothing can be issued for it until you do.":"Pilih fakta yang harus diverifikasi oleh beban kerja untuk berjalan sebagai identitas ini. Tidak ada yang dapat dikeluarkan untuknya sampai Anda melakukannya.","Choose the provider to create the identity in":"Pilih penyedia tempat identitas akan dibuat.","Choose which templates to add by use case, and customize each one or keep its defaults.":"Pilih templat mana yang akan ditambahkan berdasarkan kasus penggunaan, dan sesuaikan masing-masing atau pertahankan default-nya.",Clear:aNt,"Clear filters":"Hapus filter",Close:nNt,"Close modal":"Tutup modal","Cluster ARN":"ARN klaster","Cluster ARNs":"ARN Klaster","Code editor":"Editor kode","Complete the confirmation to delete.":"Lengkapi konfirmasi untuk menghapus.","Condition key":"Kunci kondisi","Configure identity templates for your workload use cases. Each template defines a path pattern used to issue identities uniquely and the facts a workload must prove before an identity is issued.":"Konfigurasikan templat identitas untuk kasus penggunaan beban kerja Anda. Setiap templat menentukan pola jalur yang digunakan untuk menerbitkan identitas secara unik dan fakta yang harus dibuktikan oleh beban kerja sebelum identitas diterbitkan.","Configure later":"Konfigurasikan nanti",Configured:iNt,Confirm:rNt,Contains:oNt,"Continue setup":"Lanjutkan penyiapan","Copy {{label}}":"Salin {{label}}","Copy ARN":"Salin ARN","Copy JSON":"Salin JSON","Could not check everything attached to this provider":"Tidak dapat memeriksa semua yang terlampir pada penyedia ini","Create a provider":"Buat penyedia","Create a provider for this account":"Buat penyedia untuk akun ini","Create a provider for your organization":"Buat penyedia untuk organisasi Anda","Create a provider to get started":"Buat penyedia untuk memulai","Create a template to automate identity generation":"Buat templat untuk mengotomatiskan pembuatan identitas","Create declared identity in {{providerName}}":"Buat identitas yang dideklarasikan di {{providerName}}","Create identity":"Buat identitas","Create new":"Buat baru","Create provider":"Buat penyedia","Create provider and templates":"Buat penyedia dan templat","Create service mesh provider":"Buat penyedia jala layanan","Create templates":"Buat templat","Create the certificate authority first.":"Buat otoritas sertifikat terlebih dahulu.","Create workload identities":"Buat identitas beban kerja",Created:sNt,"Created through":"Dibuat melalui","Created time":"Waktu yang dibuat","Created values":"Nilai yang dibuat","Creates a workload identity provider and template for workloads running in one or more EKS clusters under a service mesh, such as Istio.":"Membuat penyedia identitas beban kerja dan templat untuk beban kerja yang berjalan di satu atau lebih klaster EKS di bawah jala layanan, seperti Istio.","Creating certificate authority":"Membuat otoritas sertifikat","Creating the certificate authority":"Membuat otoritas sertifikat","Creating this provider sets up these 2 resources.":"Membuat penyedia ini akan menyiapkan 2 sumber daya berikut.","Current CA":"CA saat ini","Current provider":"Penyedia saat ini","Custom tag key":"Kunci tag kustom","Custom tag value":"Nilai tag kustom","Custom text":"Teks kustom","Custom text can't be a single period (.) or two periods (..).":"Teks kustom tidak boleh hanya berupa satu titik (.) atau dua titik (..).","Customize templates":"Sesuaikan templat","Dark themes":"Tema gelap","Declared identity: {{name}}":"Identitas yang dinyatakan: {{name}}","Default permissions without a policy":"Izin default tanpa kebijakan","Defaults to {provider name}.{account ID}.aws.internal. This must match the trust domain set in your service mesh, or the mesh rejects the identities.":"Default {provider name}.{account ID}.aws.internal. Nilai ini harus sesuai dengan domain kepercayaan yang ditetapkan di jala layanan Anda, atau jala layanan tersebut akan menolak identitas.","Define an optional path prefix for identities under this template. Lets you filter by prefix when authoring IAM permissions.":"Tentukan prefiks jalur opsional untuk identitas dalam templat ini. Dengan demikian, Anda dapat memfilter berdasarkan prefiks saat menyusun izin IAM.","Define an optional path prefix for this identity. You can filter by this prefix when authoring IAM permissions.":"Tentukan prefiks jalur opsional untuk identitas ini. Anda dapat memfilter berdasarkan prefiks ini saat menyusun izin IAM.","Define an optional prefix for identities under this template. You can filter by this prefix when authoring IAM permissions. The path prefixes this account can use are set by the provider's policy, for example your account ID, and they are checked when you choose Create. If you're not sure which are permitted, ask your organization administrator.":"Tentukan prefiks opsional untuk identitas di bawah templat ini. Anda dapat memfilter berdasarkan prefiks ini saat membuat izin IAM. Prefiks jalur yang dapat digunakan akun ini ditetapkan oleh kebijakan penyedia, misalnya ID akun Anda, dan akan diperiksa saat Anda memilih Buat. Jika Anda tidak yakin mana yang diizinkan, tanyakan kepada administrator organisasi Anda.","Define an optional prefix for this identity. You can filter by this prefix when authoring IAM permissions. The path prefixes this account can use are set by the provider's policy, for example your account ID, and they are checked when you choose Create. If you're not sure which are permitted, ask your organization administrator.":"Tentukan prefiks opsional untuk identitas ini. Anda dapat memfilter berdasarkan prefiks ini saat membuat izin IAM. Prefiks jalur yang dapat digunakan akun ini ditetapkan oleh kebijakan penyedia, misalnya ID akun Anda, dan akan diperiksa saat Anda memilih Buat. Jika Anda tidak yakin mana yang diizinkan, tanyakan kepada administrator organisasi Anda.","Define which workloads are allowed to use this template.":"Tentukan beban kerja mana yang diizinkan untuk menggunakan templat ini.",Delete:lNt,"Delete certificate?":"Hapus sertifikat?","Delete provider":"Hapus penyedia","Delete provider and resources":"Hapus penyedia dan sumber daya","Delete provider?":"Hapus penyedia?","Delete template":"Hapus templat","Delete template?":"Hapus templat?","Delete the templates under <b>{{providerName}}</b> before deleting the provider. Once deleted, workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials and fail on their next request, and access that you granted to these identities will stop working.":"Hapus templat di bawah <b>{{providerName}}</b> sebelum menghapus penyedia. Setelah dihapus, beban kerja yang menggunakan identitas ini tidak akan lagi menerima kredensial dan akan gagal saat mengirimkan permintaan berikutnya. Akses yang Anda berikan ke identitas ini akan berhenti berfungsi.","Delete workload identity?":"Hapus identitas beban kerja?","Deleting <b>{{templateName}}</b> will:":"Menghapus <b>{{templateName}}</b> akan:","Deleting <b>{{workloadIdentifier}}</b> will:":"Menghapus <b>{{workloadIdentifier}}</b> akan:","Deleting certificates":"Menghapus sertifikat","Deleting provider":"Menghapus penyedia","Deleting templates and workload identities":"Menghapus templat dan identitas beban kerja","Deleting the provider is taking longer than expected":"Menghapus penyedia membutuhkan waktu lebih lama dari yang diperkirakan",Description:cNt,"Description can't include line breaks or tabs.":"Deskripsi tidak boleh berisi jeda baris atau tab.","Description must be 1,000 characters or less.":"Deskripsi harus terdiri dari 1.000 karakter atau kurang.","Description must be 255 characters or less.":"Deskripsi harus terdiri dari 255 karakter atau kurang.",Details:dNt,Disable:uNt,"Disable certificate signer?":"Nonaktifkan penanda tangan sertifikat?","Discovery expiration time":"Waktu kedaluwarsa penemuan",Dismiss:pNt,"Does not contain":"Tidak berisi","Does not equal":"Tidak sama dengan","Drag or select to resize":"Seret atau pilih untuk mengubah ukuran","Each identity is fully the template path, or whatever string you enter when you create the identity.":"Setiap identitas sepenuhnya adalah jalur templat, atau string apa pun yang Anda masukkan saat membuat identitas.",Edit:hNt,"Edit attestation policy":"Edit kebijakan pengesahan","Edit filter":"Edit filter","Edit identity format and scope":"Edit format dan cakupan identitas","Edit identity path":"Edit jalur identitas",Editing:mNt,Enable:gNt,"Enable certificate signer":"Aktifkan penanda tangan sertifikat","Enable certificate signer?":"Aktifkan penanda tangan sertifikat?","End signing time":"Akhir waktu penandatanganan","Enter a 12-digit AWS account ID.":"Masukkan ID akun AWS 12 digit.","Enter a certificate authority ID.":"Masukkan ID otoritas sertifikat.","Enter a cluster ARN.":"Masukkan ARN klaster.","Enter a name":"Masukkan nama","Enter a name for the certificate authority.":"Masukkan nama untuk otoritas sertifikat.","Enter a name.":"Masukkan nama.","Enter a path":"Masukkan jalur","Enter a path prefix value":"Masukkan nilai prefiks jalur","Enter a trust domain.":"Masukkan domain kepercayaan.","Enter a value":"Masukkan nilai","Enter a whole number of hours from 1 to 48.":"Masukkan bilangan bulat jumlah jam dari 1 hingga 48.","Enter key":"Masukkan kunci","Enter prefix":"Masukkan prefiks","Enter the ID of a certificate authority or choose from below":"Masukkan ID otoritas sertifikat atau pilih dari bawah","Enter the policy as valid JSON.":"Masukkan kebijakan sebagai JSON yang valid.","Enter value":"Masukkan nilai",equals:vNt,Equals:fNt,Error:"Kesalahan","Error fetching the details":"Terjadi kesalahan saat mengambil detail",Errors:yNt,"Every account in this organization ({{organizationId}})":"Setiap akun di organisasi ini ({{organizationId}})","Every X.509-SVID this provider issues right now is signed by this certificate. It stops in {{hours}} hour, at {{at}}, when the incoming certificate takes over.":"Setiap X.509-SVID yang diterbitkan penyedia ini sekarang ditandatangani oleh sertifikat ini. Penandatanganan berhenti dalam {{hours}} jam, pada {{at}}, ketika sertifikat yang masuk mengambil alih.","Every X.509-SVID this provider issues right now is signed by this certificate. It stops in {{hours}} hours, at {{at}}, when the incoming certificate takes over.":"Setiap X.509-SVID yang diterbitkan penyedia ini sekarang ditandatangani oleh sertifikat ini. Penandatanganan berhenti dalam {{hours}} jam, pada {{at}}, ketika sertifikat yang masuk mengambil alih.","Every X.509-SVID this provider issues right now is signed by this certificate. No replacement is scheduled, so it keeps signing until you update or disable the signer.":"Setiap X.509-SVID yang diterbitkan penyedia ini sekarang ditandatangani menggunakan sertifikat ini. Tidak ada penggantian yang dijadwalkan sehingga sertifikat ini akan terus digunakan untuk menandatangani hingga Anda memperbarui atau menonaktifkan penanda tangan.","Failed to copy":"Gagal disalin","Failed to copy JSON":"Gagal menyalin JSON","Failed to load attestation policy.":"Gagal memuat kebijakan verifikasi.","Failed to load templates.":"Gagal memuat templat.","Failed to remove attestation policy.":"Gagal menghapus kebijakan pengesahan.","Filter providers":"Filter penyedia","Filter templates":"Filter templat","Filter themes":"Filter tema","Find providers":"Temukan penyedia","Find templates":"Temukan templat","Find theme":"Temukan tema","For example, prod":"Misalnya, prod","For mutual TLS, attach a certificate authority":"Untuk TLS bersama, lampirkan otoritas sertifikat","For token-based services, issue a JWT":"Untuk layanan berbasis token, keluarkan JWT",Format:bNt,"Generating its key":"Membuat kunci","Get started":"Mulai","Getting started":"Memulai","Give an agent or workload its own identity - <em>Preview</em>":"Berikan identitas sendiri kepada agen atau beban kerja - <em>Pratinjau</em>","Give each workload a unique identity, so you can grant it access and audit what it did rather than sharing one role.":"Berikan identitas unik pada setiap beban kerja agar Anda dapat memberikan akses dan mengaudit aktivitasnya tanpa berbagi satu peran yang sama.","Give your workloads an identity":"Berikan identitas pada beban kerja Anda","Go to the providers list":"Buka daftar penyedia","Govern who can create resources":"Atur siapa yang dapat membuat sumber daya","Govern who can create templates referring to this provider":"Atur siapa yang dapat membuat templat yang merujuk ke penyedia ini","Greater than":"Lebih besar dari","Greater than or equal":"Lebih besar dari atau sama dengan","hour(s)":"jam","How it works":"Cara kerja","IAM roles define what a workload can do. Workload Identity tells you which workload is doing it.":"Peran IAM menentukan apa yang dapat dilakukan beban kerja. Identitas Beban Kerja menunjukkan beban kerja mana yang melakukan tindakan tersebut.","Identities are issued at runtime from facts the workload proves, not just from what an admin assigns.":"Identitas dikeluarkan saat runtime dari fakta yang dibuktikan beban kerja, bukan hanya dari apa yang ditetapkan admin.",'Identity "{{identityId}}" not found.':'Identitas "{{identityId}}" tidak ditemukan.',"Identity format and scope":"Format dan cakupan identitas","Identity name":"Nama identitas","Identity path":"Jalur identitas","Identity selection":"Pemilihan identitas","If anything is still attached, deleting the provider fails.":"Jika ada yang masih terlampir, penghapusan penyedia akan gagal.","In transition":"Dalam transisi","In transition certificate authority ID":"ID otoritas sertifikat sedang dalam proses transisi","In transition: incoming, not yet signing":"Dalam proses transisi: sertifikat pengganti telah diterima, tetapi belum digunakan untuk penandatanganan",Inactive:wNt,"Inactive: retired, no longer trusted":"Tidak aktif: dihentikan, tidak lagi dipercaya","Incoming CA":"CA masuk",Info:kNt,"Invalid key. Keys can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"Kunci tidak valid. Kunci hanya boleh berisi huruf Unicode, digit, spasi, dan salah satu dari karakter berikut ini: _.:/=+@-","Invalid provider name. Use alphanumeric and '-_.' characters.":"Nama penyedia tidak valid. Gunakan karakter alfanumerik dan '-_.'.","Invalid request":"Permintaan tidak valid","Invalid template name. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters.":"Nama templat tidak valid. Gunakan karakter alfanumerik dan '-_'.","Invalid value. Values can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"Nilai tidak valid. Nilai hanya dapat berisi huruf Unicode, digit, spasi, dan salah satu dari karakter berikut ini: _.:/=+@-","Issued after the workload proves itself":"Diterbitkan setelah beban kerja membuktikan identitasnya","Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. Standard pricing applies to the creation and use of AWS Private CA.":"Menerbitkan X.509-SVID yang digunakan oleh beban kerja penyedia ini sebagai sertifikat klien untuk sistem di luar AWS. Dibutuhkan <link>otoritas sertifikat</link> dengan CA subordinat di setiap region tempat Anda masuk. Harga standar berlaku untuk pembuatan dan penggunaan AWS Private CA.","Issues X.509-SVIDs, for mTLS peers that verify a client certificate.":"Menerbitkan X.509-SVID, untuk peer mTLS yang memverifikasi sertifikat klien.","Issuing its CA certificate":"Menerbitkan sertifikat CA","It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. Leave it alone and it becomes inactive on its own, after which deleting it changes nothing.":"Proses penandatanganan sudah berhenti, tetapi rantainya masih dipublikasikan, jadi beban kerja mengandalkannya untuk memverifikasi kredensial yang dikeluarkan sebelumnya. Menghapusnya sekarang akan menarik rantai sekaligus dan kredensial tersebut mulai gagal. Biarkan saja dan hal tersebut akan menjadi tidak aktif dengan sendirinya, setelah itu menghapusnya tidak mengubah apa pun.","Item moved from position {{initialPosition}} to position {{finalPosition}} of {{total}}":"Item dipindahkan dari posisi {{initialPosition}} ke posisi {{finalPosition}} dari {{total}}","JSON copied":"JSON disalin",JWKS:SNt,"JWKS popover":"Setiap kunci penandatanganan aktif, dipilih oleh kid. AWS memublikasikan kunci baru di sini sebelum penandatanganan beralih ke kunci tersebut.","JWT Outbound signers column Signing algorithm":"Algoritma penandatanganan","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key":"Algoritma utama","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key issue time":"Penandatanganan kunci saat ini sejak","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key popover":"AWS menghasilkan kunci dan merotasinya sesuai jadwalnya sendiri, memublikasikan setiap kunci baru ke JWKS sebelum mulai menandatangani. Algoritma tetap sama di seluruh rotasi, agar pemverifikasi yang membaca JWKS tidak membutuhkan perubahan di pihak Anda.","JWT Outbound signers desc":"Menandatangani JWT-SVID, untuk sistem yang memverifikasi token yang ditandatangani.","JWT Outbound signers label oidc discovery":"Penemuan OIDC","JWT Outbound signers label oidc discovery popover":"Dokumen penemuan standar. Sebagian besar pemverifikasi hanya membutuhkan URL ini, karena mereka menemukan kunci darinya.","JWT Outbound signers label oidc issuer":"Penerbit OIDC","JWT Outbound signers label oidc issuer popover":"Klaim iss dari setiap JWT-SVID yang ditandatangani di sini. Pemverifikasi yang menyematkan penerbit akan menyematkan nilai ini.","JWT Outbound signers section title":"Informasi pemverifikasi token","JWT Outbound signers status":"Default yang disediakan oleh AWS","JWT Outbound signers title":"Penanda tangan JWT",Key:_Nt,"Learn about organization providers":"Pelajari tentang penyedia organisasi","Learn about organization providers (opens in a new tab)":"Pelajari tentang penyedia organisasi (terbuka di tab baru)","Learn more":"Pelajari selengkapnya","Learn more about deleting a provider (opens in a new tab)":"Pelajari selengkapnya tentang menghapus penyedia (buka di tab baru)","Learn more:":"Pelajari selengkapnya:","Less than":"Kurang dari","Less than or equal":"Kurang dari atau sama dengan","Let other accounts or principals in your organization create templates and identities under this provider, within the path prefixes you choose.":"Biarkan akun atau principal lain di organisasi Anda membuat templat dan identitas di bawah penyedia ini, dalam prefiks jalur yang Anda pilih.","Let workloads reach non-AWS resources":"Biarkan beban kerja menjangkau sumber daya non-AWS","Letters, digits, . - _ with a single / between parts. No / at the start or end.":"Huruf, digit, . - _ dengan satu / di antara bagian. Tidak ada / di awal atau akhir.","Letters, digits, . - _ with a single / between parts. No / at the start or end. Cannot be changed later.":"Huruf, digit, . - _ dengan satu / di antara bagian. Tidak ada / di awal atau akhir. Tidak dapat diubah nanti.","Light themes":"Tema terang","Ln {{row}}, Col {{column}}":"Baris {{row}}, Kolom {{column}}","Loading certificate authorities":"Memuat otoritas sertifikat","Loading code editor":"Memuat editor kode","Loading tag keys":"Memuat kunci tag","Loading tag values":"Memuat nilai tag","Loading tags that are associated with this resource":"Memuat tag yang terkait dengan sumber daya ini","Loading your organization's providers":"Memuat penyedia organisasi Anda","Make sure the new certificate authority uses the same algorithm as the current signer, {{algorithm}}. If you choose a different algorithm, you need to disable this signer, delete its certificates, then enable it again with the new authority.":"Pastikan otoritas sertifikat baru menggunakan algoritma yang sama dengan penanda tangan saat ini, {{algorithm}}. Jika Anda memilih algoritma yang berbeda, Anda perlu menonaktifkan penanda tangan ini, menghapus sertifikatnya, lalu mengaktifkannya lagi dengan otoritas baru.","Manage CAs and replication in the AWS Private CA console":"Kelola CA dan replikasi di konsol AWS Private CA","Manage tags":"Kelola tag","Manage the provider":"Kelola penyedia","Manual creation":"Pembuatan secara manual","Manually create":"Buat secara manual","Matching workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.":"Beban kerja yang sesuai mendapatkan nama identitasnya sendiri saat dimulai, pada skala apa pun.","Maximum 1,000 characters.":"Maksimum 1.000 karakter.","Maximum 255 characters.":"Maksimum 255 karakter.","Member accounts":"Akun anggota","Member accounts can add their own templates, namespaced by account ID.":"Akun anggota dapat menambahkan templat mereka sendiri, dengan namespace berdasarkan ID akun.","Member accounts cannot add their own templates.":"Akun anggota tidak dapat menambahkan templat mereka sendiri.","Minimum signing delay":"Penundaan penandatanganan minimum","Moving item to position {{currentPosition}} of {{total}}":"Memindahkan item ke posisi {{currentPosition}} dari {{total}}","Multiple EKS clusters":"Beberapa klaster EKS",Name:xNt,"Name must be 128 characters or less.":"Nama harus terdiri dari 128 karakter atau kurang.","Name this identity":"Beri nama identitas ini","Name this provider":"Beri nama penyedia ini","Name values":"Nilai nama","Names identities automatically as workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.":"Menamai identitas secara otomatis saat beban kerja dimulai, jadi Anda tidak perlu membuat atau mengelolanya satu per satu.","Naming scheme":"Skema penamaan",New:ANt,"Next month":"Bulan berikutnya","Next page":"Halaman berikutnya","Next step":"Langkah berikutnya","No attestation policy set. Define one so a workload can run as this identity.":"Tidak ada kebijakan pengesahan yang diatur. Tentukan satu agar beban kerja dapat berjalan sebagai identitas ini.","No attestation policy. No workload will be issued workload identities from this template until you add one.":"Tidak ada kebijakan pengesahan. Tidak ada beban kerja yang akan diberikan identitas beban kerja dari templat ini sampai Anda menambahkannya.","No by default, but can add a policy":"Tidak secara default, tetapi dapat menambahkan kebijakan","No certificate authorities in this account":"Tidak ada otoritas sertifikat di akun ini","no domain":"tidak ada domain","No long-lived secrets":"Tidak ada rahasia jangka panjang","No match found":"Tidak ada kecocokan yang ditemukan","No matches":"Tidak ada kecocokan","No path segments. Add a fact, condition key, or custom text.":"Tidak ada segmen jalur. Tambahkan fakta, kunci kondisi, atau teks kustom.","No tags associated with the resource.":"Tidak ada tag yang terkait dengan sumber daya.","No templates added yet":"Belum ada templat yang ditambahkan","No workload identity providers":"Tidak ada penyedia identitas beban kerja","No workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.":"Tidak ada beban kerja yang cocok dengan templat ini, jadi tidak ada identitas yang dihasilkan.","No, and cannot be granted":"Tidak, dan tidak dapat diberikan",None:ENt,"None – names are defined by templates or declared individually":"Tidak ada—nama ditentukan oleh templat atau dideklarasikan secara individual","Not saved: {{keys}}.":"Tidak disimpan: {{keys}}.","Not set":"Tidak diatur",Notifications:CNt,"Once the attestation policy is removed, matching workloads will not be issued workload identities until you add a policy again.":"Setelah kebijakan pengesahan dihapus, beban kerja yang cocok tidak akan diberikan identitas beban kerja sampai Anda menambahkan kebijakan lagi.","One bundle per provider, and one URL. It carries every authority the provider publishes: both outbound signers, and during an update both the current and incoming certificate authority, which is what lets verifiers accept either one through the handover. Your own AWS workloads get these keys automatically; send this to systems outside AWS.":"Satu paket per penyedia, dan satu URL. Paket ini memuat setiap otoritas yang diterbitkan penyedia: baik penanda tangan keluar, maupun selama pembaruan baik otoritas sertifikat saat ini maupun yang masuk, yang memungkinkan verifikator menerima salah satunya melalui proses penyerahan. Beban kerja AWS Anda mendapatkan kunci ini secara otomatis; kirim URL ini ke sistem di luar AWS.","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level providers.":"Hanya akun manajemen atau administrator terdelegasi yang dapat menghapus penyedia tingkat organisasi.","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level templates.":"Hanya akun manajemen atau administrator terdelegasi yang dapat menghapus templat tingkat organisasi.","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level workload identities.":"Hanya akun manajemen atau administrator terdelegasi yang dapat menghapus identitas beban kerja tingkat organisasi.","Opens in a new tab":"Terbuka di tab baru",Operator:TNt,Operators:INt,optional:DNt,or:LNt,"Organization provider":"Penyedia organisasi","Organization scoped":"Lingkup organisasi","Organize the provider and track its cost with tags.":"Atur penyedia dan lacak biayanya dengan tag.","Other accounts in your organization":"Akun lain di organisasi Anda","Other condition keys":"Kunci kondisi lainnya","Outbound signer":"Penanda tangan keluar","Outbound signers page desc":"Memungkinkan beban kerja Anda membuktikan identitasnya ke layanan di luar AWS. Penyedia ini menandatangani token dan sertifikat yang mereka tunjukkan.","Outbound signers page title":"Penanda tangan keluar","Owning account":"Akun pemilik","Page {{pageNumber}} of all pages":"Halaman {{pageNumber}} dari semua halaman",path:PNt,Path:NNt,"path from templates":"jalur dari templat","Path is the per-workload part of an identity name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts a workload proves.":"Jalur adalah bagian nama identitas khusus untuk setiap beban kerja. Jalur ini diisi saat runtime berdasarkan fakta yang dibuktikan oleh beban kerja.","Path must be 255 characters or less.":"Jalur harus terdiri dari 255 karakter atau kurang.","Path pattern":"Pola jalur","Path prefix":"Prefiks jalur","Path prefix must be 64 characters or less.":"Prefiks jalur harus terdiri dari 64 karakter atau kurang.","Path values":"Nilai jalur","Picked up item at position {{position}} of {{total}}":"Item yang diambil pada posisi {{position}} dari {{total}}","Policy details":"Detail kebijakan","Policy: Define how a workload attests to get the identity":"Kebijakan: Tentukan bagaimana beban kerja memverifikasi untuk mendapatkan identitas",Preferences:RNt,"Press space or enter to activate drag, use arrow keys to move, then press space or enter to confirm":"Gunakan spasi atau enter untuk mengaktifkan seret, gunakan tombol panah untuk berpindah, lalu tekan spasi atau enter untuk mengonfirmasi",Preview:MNt,"Previous CA":"CA sebelumnya","Previous certificates ({{certificateCount}})":"Sertifikat sebelumnya ({{certificateCount}})","Previous month":"Bulan sebelumnya","Previous page":"Halaman sebelumnya",Properties:zNt,Property:ONt,Provided:BNt,Provider:FNt,"Provider {{providerName}} deleted.":"Penyedia {{providerName}} dihapus.","Provider name":"Nama penyedia","Provider name must be 128 characters or less.":"Nama penyedia harus terdiri dari 128 karakter atau kurang.","Provider not deleted":"Penyedia tidak dihapus","Provider not found":"Penyedia tidak ditemukan","Provider overview":"Gambaran umum penyedia","Provider selection":"Pemilihan penyedia","Provider settings":"Pengaturan penyedia","Provider values":"Nilai penyedia",Providers:$Nt,"Providers to issue workload identities":"Penyedia yang menerbitkan identitas beban kerja","Quick create":"Buat cepat","Quick create makes an RSA 2048 certificate authority in AWS Private CA in your account, which has its own charges. The algorithm is fixed and cannot be changed later without setting the signer up again.":"Fitur Buat cepat akan membuat otoritas sertifikat RSA 2048 di AWS Private CA di akun Anda, yang akan dikenai biaya tersendiri. Algoritma yang digunakan telah ditetapkan dan tidak dapat diubah nanti tanpa menyiapkan penanda tangan lagi.",Ready:jNt,Recommended:WNt,"Recommended for most workloads":"Direkomendasikan untuk sebagian besar beban kerja",Refresh:qNt,"Refresh certificate authorities":"Segarkan otoritas sertifikat","Refresh certificate signer status":"Segarkan status penanda tangan sertifikat",Remove:UNt,"Remove {{name}}":"Hapus {{name}}","Remove attestation policy":"Hapus kebijakan pengesahan","Remove cluster ARN":"Hapus ARN klaster","Remove condition":"Hapus kondisi","Remove filter {{filter}}":"Hapus filter {{filter}}","Remove governance policy?":"Hapus kebijakan tata kelola?","Remove tag {{key}}":"Hapus tag {{key}}","Removed tags were not saved":"Tag yang dihapus tidak disimpan","Reorder {{name}}":"Ubah urutan {{name}}","Reordering canceled":"Pengurutan ulang dibatalkan","Required for service mesh providers.":"Diperlukan untuk penyedia jala layanan.","Required for service mesh providers. A service mesh provider is scoped to the account that runs the EKS cluster.":"Diperlukan untuk penyedia jala layanan. Penyedia jala layanan dibatasi pada ke akun yang menjalankan klaster EKS.","Reset to default":"Reset ke default","Resize handle":"Handel ubah ukuran","Resolved example:":"Contoh hasil resolusi:","Restricted by":"Dibatasi oleh",Retry:VNt,"Review the tags and save again.":"Tinjau tag dan simpan lagi.","Running a service mesh, such as Istio? It needs its own provider, one per cluster.":"Menjalankan service mesh, seperti Istio? Ini memerlukan penyedia tersendiri, satu per kluster.",Save:HNt,"Save changes":"Simpan perubahan","Save or cancel your edits before creating templates.":"Simpan atau batalkan pengeditan Anda sebelum membuat templat.","Save or cancel your edits before creating the provider.":"Simpan atau batalkan pengeditan Anda sebelum membuat penyedia.","Save or cancel your template edits to change the scope.":"Simpan atau batalkan pengeditan templat Anda untuk mengubah cakupan.",scheme:KNt,Scheme:GNt,"scheme and trust domain":"skema dan domain kepercayaan","Scheme sets the format this provider uses to name identities.":"Skema menentukan format yang digunakan penyedia ini untuk memberi nama identitas.",Scope:YNt,"Scope sets which accounts are allowed to use this provider.":"Cakupan menentukan akun mana yang diizinkan untuk menggunakan penyedia ini.","Scope values":"Nilai lingkup","Search tags":"Cari tag","Segment that partitions identities.":"Segmen yang melakukan partisi identitas.","Select {{name}}":"Pilih {{name}}","Select a row to delete.":"Pilih baris yang akan dihapus.",Set:"Atur","Set a naming pattern":"Atur pola penamaan","Set an attestation rule":"Atur aturan verifikasi","Set by your provider.":"Diatur oleh penyedia Anda.","Set the naming format and usage scope that every workload identity from this provider inherits.":"Tetapkan format penamaan dan cakupan penggunaan yang diwarisi oleh setiap identitas beban kerja dari penyedia ini.","Set the unique path pattern that every workload identity generated by this template follows. Cannot be changed later.":"Tetapkan pola jalur unik yang akan digunakan oleh setiap identitas beban kerja yang dihasilkan oleh templat ini. Pengaturan ini tidak dapat diubah nanti.","Set up a provider to hold the templates that generate identity names, the identities you declare directly, and the signers that sign credentials for systems outside AWS.":"Siapkan penyedia untuk menyimpan templat yang menghasilkan nama identitas, identitas yang Anda nyatakan secara langsung, dan penandatangan yang menandatangani kredensial untuk sistem di luar AWS.","Set up a service mesh provider for this account":"Siapkan penyedia service mesh untuk akun ini","Set up a way to issue workload identities":"Siapkan cara untuk mengeluarkan identitas beban kerja","Set up for your use cases":"Siapkan untuk kasus penggunaan Anda","Sets your trust domain, the start of every identity name.":"Menetapkan domain kepercayaan Anda yang menjadi awal dari setiap nama identitas.","Setting up the certificate authority stopped. You can continue from where it left off.":"Penyiapan otoritas sertifikat dihentikan. Anda dapat melanjutkan dari bagian terakhir.","Settings from your provider {{providerName}}":"Pengaturan dari penyedia Anda {{providerName}}","Short-lived credentials renew automatically and follow the SPIFFE standard, so they work with service meshes like Istio and with SaaS applications.":"Kredensial yang berlaku jangka pendek diperbarui secara otomatis dan mengikuti standar SPIFFE sehingga dapat digunakan dengan service mesh seperti Istio dan dengan aplikasi SaaS.","Show all {{errorCount}} errors":"Tampilkan semua {{errorCount}} kesalahan","Show fewer":"Tampilkan lebih sedikit","Show more":"Tampilkan lebih banyak","Signing algorithm":"Algoritma penandatanganan","Signing resumes immediately, because this certificate is still published in the trust bundle.":"Penandatanganan dilanjutkan segera, karena sertifikat ini masih diterbitkan dalam paket kepercayaan.","Signing start time":"Waktu mulai penandatanganan","Some templates could not be loaded":"Beberapa templat tidak dapat dimuat","Something went wrong":"Terjadi kesalahan","Sortable path segment":"Segmen jalur yang dapat diurutkan",Status:JNt,"Status bar":"Bilah status","Stop access you granted to this identity name from working":"Hentikan akses yang Anda berikan ke nama identitas ini agar tidak berfungsi","Stop access you granted to those identity names from working":"Hentikan akses yang Anda berikan ke nama-nama identitas tersebut agar tidak berfungsi","Stop matching workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request":"Hentikan pencocokan beban kerja untuk mendapatkan identitas, agar gagal pada permintaan berikutnya","Stop the identities it generated from resolving":"Hentikan identitas yang dihasilkannya agar tidak dapat diselesaikan","Stop the workload running as this identity, so it fails on its next request":"Hentikan beban kerja yang berjalan sebagai identitas ini, agar gagal pada permintaan berikutnya","Stopped signing and no longer in the trust bundle, so nothing verifies against them. Deleting one is safe.":"Berhenti menandatangani dan tidak ada lagi dalam paket kepercayaan, jadi tidak ada yang memverifikasi terhadapnya. Menghapusnya merupakan tindakan yang aman.",Subject:ZNt,Success:XNt,"Tag keys could not be retrieved":"Kunci tag tidak dapat diambil","Tag values could not be retrieved":"Nilai tag tidak dapat diambil",Tags:"Tag","Tags could not be loaded":"Tag tidak dapat dimuat","Tags for {{name}} have been updated.":"Tag untuk {{name}} telah diperbarui.","Tags not saved":"Tag tidak disimpan",Template:QNt,'Template "{{templateId}}" not found.':'Templat "{{templateId}}" tidak ditemukan.',"Template {{name}}: {{reason}}":"Templat {{name}}: {{reason}}","Template {{templateName}} deleted.":"Templat {{templateName}} dihapus.","Template {{templateNames}} created.":"Templat {{templateNames}} dibuat.","Template name":"Nama templat","Template name must be 128 characters or less.":"Nama templat harus terdiri dari maksimal 128 karakter.","Template name values":"Nilai nama templat","Template: {{name}}":"Templat: {{name}}",Templates:eRt,"Templates ({{total}})":"Templat ({{total}})","Templates are being created. Wait for the request to finish.":"Templat sedang dibuat. Tunggu hingga permintaan selesai.","Templates give matching workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.":"Templat secara otomatis memberikan nama identitas tersendiri bagi beban kerja yang sesuai. Setiap templat menggunakan prefiks nama penyedia ini, ditambah jalur dan pola.","Templates that member accounts created under this provider are not visible here and cannot be deleted from this account. If any exist, deleting the provider fails.":"Templat yang dibuat oleh akun anggota di bawah penyedia ini tidak terlihat di sini dan tidak dapat dihapus dari akun ini. Jika ada, penghapusan penyedia akan gagal.","Templates: {{reason}}":"Templat: {{reason}}","The account that owns the certificate authority.":"Akun yang memiliki otoritas sertifikat.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it.":"Kebijakan pengesahan mengontrol bagaimana identitas dikeluarkan oleh penyedia ini. Beban kerja harus memenuhi setiap kondisi, seperti jenis, detail, dan di mana ia berjalan, seperti yang dijamin oleh layanan yang menghostingnya.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.":"Kebijakan pengesahan mengontrol bagaimana identitas dikeluarkan oleh penyedia ini. Beban kerja harus memenuhi setiap kondisi, seperti jenis, detail, dan di mana ia berjalan, seperti yang dijamin oleh layanan yang menghostingnya. Dapat diedit nanti.","The attestation policy controls which workloads get an identity from this provider. A workload must meet every condition, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. It's generated from the EKS clusters you entered. You can edit it later.":"Kebijakan pengesahan mengontrol beban kerja mana yang mendapatkan identitas dari penyedia ini. Beban kerja harus memenuhi setiap kondisi, seperti yang dijamin oleh layanan yang menyelenggarakannya. Kebijakan ini dihasilkan dari klaster EKS yang Anda masukkan. Anda dapat mengeditnya nanti.","The attestation policy lists the facts a workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so a workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.":"Kebijakan atestasi mencantumkan fakta-fakta yang harus dibuktikan oleh suatu beban kerja sebelum penyedia ini menerbitkan identitas untuknya. Platform komputasi menjamin kebenaran fakta-fakta tersebut sehingga beban kerja tidak dapat mengeklaim identitas yang bukan miliknya.","The attester vouches for the workload, and it must match every condition to run as this identity.":"Attester menjamin beban kerja, dan beban kerja tersebut harus memenuhi setiap kondisi agar dapat berjalan sebagai identitas ini.","The certificate authority is still being set up.":"Otoritas sertifikat masih disiapkan.","The ID at the end of the certificate authority's ARN in AWS Private CA.":"ID di akhir ARN otoritas sertifikat di AWS Private CA.","The identity name is the provider's naming scheme, a path prefix, and a path pattern.":"Nama identitas terdiri dari skema penamaan penyedia, prefiks jalur, dan pola jalur.","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag key is 128.":"Jumlah maksimum karakter yang dapat Anda gunakan dalam kunci tag adalah 128.","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag value is 256.":"Jumlah maksimum karakter yang dapat Anda gunakan dalam nilai tag adalah 256.","The path can be up to {{maxLength}} characters.":"Jalur dapat berisi hingga {{maxLength}} karakter.","The path doesn't support these segments: {{segments}}. Remove them, and add what you need from the following cards.":"Jalur tidak mendukung segmen berikut: {{segments}}. Hapus segmen tersebut, lalu tambahkan yang Anda perlukan dari kartu berikut.","The path is already the default.":"Jalur tersebut sudah merupakan jalur default.","The path is the per-workload part of each identity's name. Keep the Region in front so names stay unique across accounts and Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.":"Jalur adalah bagian per beban kerja dari nama setiap identitas. Pertahankan Wilayah di bagian depan agar nama tetap unik di seluruh akun dan Wilayah, atau susun ulang segmen agar sesuai dengan konvensi penamaan tim Anda.","The path prefixes your policy allows":"Prefiks jalur yang diizinkan oleh kebijakan Anda","The permissions defined in this policy for <b>{{providerName}}</b> stop applying.":"Izin yang ditentukan dalam kebijakan ini untuk <b>{{providerName}}</b> berhenti diterapkan.","The provider could not be deleted. Try again.":"Penyedia tidak dapat dihapus. Coba lagi.","The provider is being created. Wait for the request to finish.":"Penyedia sedang dibuat. Tunggu permintaan selesai.","The provider might still be deleted. Check the providers list later.":"Penyedia mungkin masih dihapus. Periksa daftar penyedia nanti.","The resource policy on this provider controls who can associate templates with it.":"Kebijakan sumber daya pada penyedia ini mengontrol siapa yang dapat mengaitkan templat dengan penyedia tersebut.","The soonest the new certificate can take over. It publishes to the trust bundle first, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. Signing may start later than this, never sooner.":"Waktu paling cepat sertifikat baru dapat mengambil alih. Sertifikat tersebut diterbitkan ke paket kepercayaan terlebih dahulu, agar setiap verifikator dapat memeriksanya sebelum digunakan untuk penandatanganan. Penandatanganan mungkin dimulai lebih lambat dari waktu ini, tetapi tidak akan dimulai lebih cepat.","The soonest this certificate can start signing. It publishes to the trust bundle first, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. Signing may start later than this, never sooner.":"Paling cepat sertifikat ini dapat mulai menandatangani. Rantai sertifikat tersebut diterbitkan ke paket kepercayaan terlebih dahulu, agar setiap pemverifikasi dapat memeriksanya sebelum ada yang ditandatangani di bawahnya. Penandatanganan mungkin dimulai lebih lambat dari ini, tidak lebih cepat.",Theme:tRt,"There was an error loading the code editor.":"Terjadi kesalahan saat memuat editor kode.","These clusters set the template's <policyLink>attestation policy</policyLink>.":"Klaster ini mengatur <policyLink>kebijakan pengesahan</policyLink> templat.","These resources need to be deleted before deleting the provider.":"Sumber daya ini perlu dihapus sebelum menghapus penyedia.","This account ({{accountId}})":"Akun ini ({{accountId}})","This action deletes the workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.":"Tindakan ini menghapus penyedia identitas beban kerja <b>{{providerName}}</b>.","This cannot be undone, and creating a provider with the same name later does not restore anything. To proceed, complete the steps below.":"Ini tidak dapat dibatalkan, dan membuat penyedia dengan nama yang sama nanti tidak mengembalikan apa pun. Untuk melanjutkan, selesaikan langkah-langkah di bawah ini.","This cannot be undone, and the path this template reserved stays reserved. No future template can generate identities under it.":"Ini tidak dapat dibatalkan, dan jalur yang dipesan templat ini tetap terpesan. Tidak ada templat masa mendatang yang dapat menghasilkan identitas di bawahnya.","This cannot be undone, and this name stays reserved. It is never issued again, so you cannot recreate this identity under the same name.":"Ini tidak dapat dibatalkan, dan nama ini tetap terpesan. Nama tersebut tidak akan pernah diterbitkan lagi, jadi Anda tidak dapat membuat ulang identitas ini dengan nama yang sama.","This certificate authority uses {{caAlgorithm}}. Rotation keeps the signer's {{signerAlgorithm}} algorithm, so choose a {{signerAlgorithm}} certificate authority instead.":"Otoritas sertifikat ini menggunakan {{caAlgorithm}}. Rotasi mempertahankan algoritma {{signerAlgorithm}} penanda tangan, jadi pilih otoritas sertifikat {{signerAlgorithm}} sebagai gantinya.","This certificate has left the trust bundle, so it publishes again first. Signing starts after about {{hours}} hour, once every region has it.":"Sertifikat ini telah dihapus dari paket kepercayaan sehingga diterbitkan lagi terlebih dahulu. Penandatanganan dimulai setelah sekitar {{hours}} jam, setelah sertifikat tersedia di seluruh region.","This certificate has left the trust bundle, so it publishes again first. Signing starts after about {{hours}} hours, once every region has it.":"Sertifikat ini telah dihapus dari paket kepercayaan sehingga diterbitkan lagi terlebih dahulu. Penandatanganan dimulai setelah sekitar {{hours}} jam, setelah sertifikat tersedia di seluruh region.","This certificate is validating, so deleting it stops verification immediately":"Sertifikat ini sedang divalidasi, jadi menghapusnya akan segera menghentikan verifikasi","This certificate stopped signing and its chain has left the trust bundle, so nothing verifies against it. It stays listed as history until you delete it, and deleting it is safe: no credential depends on it, and the certificate signer keeps signing.":"Sertifikat ini berhenti digunakan untuk penandatanganan dan rantai sertifikatnya telah dihapus dari paket kepercayaan sehingga tidak ada lagi yang dapat diverifikasi menggunakan sertifikat ini. Sertifikat ini tetap tercantum dalam riwayat hingga Anda menghapusnya. Penghapusan aman: tidak ada kredensial yang bergantung pada sertifikat ini, dan penanda tangan sertifikat tetap dapat melakukan penandatanganan.","This cluster is already listed.":"Klaster ini sudah terdaftar.","This condition key and operator combination already exists":"Kombinasi kunci kondisi dan operator ini sudah ada","This doesn't look like a valid EKS cluster ARN. An invalid ARN will leave workloads in that cluster without an identity.":"Ini tidak terlihat seperti ARN klaster EKS yang valid. ARN yang tidak valid akan membuat beban kerja di klaster tersebut tidak memiliki identitas.","This management account and delegated administrators":"Akun manajemen ini dan administrator terdelegasi","This organization ({{organizationId}})":"Organisasi ini ({{organizationId}})","This policy's cluster ARNs don't match the clusters you entered. Changing the clusters won't update this policy. Continue only if that's intended.":"ARN klaster kebijakan ini tidak cocok dengan klaster yang Anda masukkan. Mengubah klaster tidak akan memperbarui kebijakan ini. Lanjutkan hanya jika hal tersebut memang disengaja.","This provider has no naming scheme, so the path you enter is the full identity name.":"Penyedia ini tidak memiliki skema penamaan sehingga jalur yang Anda masukkan menjadi nama identitas lengkap.","This provider names every identity using the open standard.":"Penyedia ini memberi nama setiap identitas menggunakan standar terbuka.","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. Both certificates below stop, including the one still in transition, so the update does not complete. Both stay configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"Penyedia ini akan segera berhenti menerbitkan X.509-SVID, dan beban kerja yang membutuhkan sertifikat klien akan mulai gagal pada permintaan berikutnya. Kedua sertifikat di bawah ini berhenti, termasuk yang masih dalam transisi sehingga pembaruan tidak selesai. Keduanya tetap dikonfigurasi. Sertifikat yang sudah diterbitkan masih dapat diverifikasi selama sekitar 12 jam, dan Aktifkan untuk melanjutkan penandatanganan.","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"Penyedia ini berhenti menerbitkan X.509-SVID segera, dan beban kerja yang membutuhkan sertifikat klien akan mulai gagal pada permintaan berikutnya. Sertifikat di bawah ini tetap dikonfigurasi. Sertifikat yang sudah diterbitkan masih dapat diverifikasi selama sekitar 12 jam, dan Aktifkan melanjutkan penandatanganan.","This provider's policy doesn't allow this path prefix \"{{pathPrefix}}\" for your account. Ask your organization administrator which path prefixes are permitted.":'Kebijakan penyedia ini tidak mengizinkan prefiks jalur "{{pathPrefix}}" ini untuk akun Anda. Tanyakan kepada administrator organisasi Anda prefiks jalur mana yang diizinkan.',"This removes the certificate from the provider and pulls its chain from the trust bundle immediately. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"Ini menghapus sertifikat dari penyedia dan segera menarik rantainya dari paket kepercayaan. Otoritas sertifikat itu sendiri tetap berada di AWS Private CA, tidak berubah.","This removes the certificate from the provider. Its chain already left the trust bundle, so nothing that is verifying today changes. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"Ini menghapus sertifikat dari penyedia. Rantainya sudah tidak ada dalam paket kepercayaan, jadi tidak ada perubahan pada proses verifikasi yang berlangsung saat ini. Otoritas sertifikat itu sendiri tetap berada di AWS Private CA, tidak berubah.","This tag will be removed upon saving changes":"Tag ini akan dihapus setelah perubahan disimpan","This usually takes a few minutes. Keep this page open until it finishes.":"Proses ini biasanya memerlukan waktu beberapa menit. Biarkan halaman ini tetap terbuka hingga proses selesai.",Today:aRt,"Too many requests":"Terlalu banyak permintaan","Trace and control access per workload":"Melacak dan mengontrol akses per beban kerja","Trust bundle":"Paket kepercayaan","trust domain":"domain kepercayaan","Trust domain":"Domain kepercayaan","Trust domain is the root of trust for the SPIFFE naming scheme. It is a logical name that follows DNS naming style, for example prod.acme.com, but does not need to match a real DNS record.":"Domain kepercayaan adalah akar kepercayaan untuk skema penamaan SPIFFE. Domain ini merupakan nama logis yang mengikuti gaya penamaan DNS, misalnya prod.acme.com, tetapi tidak harus cocok dengan catatan DNS yang sebenarnya.","Try again. If the problem continues, contact AWS Support.":"Coba lagi. Jika masalah berlanjut, hubungi Dukungan AWS.","Unable to load templates":"Tidak dapat memuat templat",Undo:nRt,"Up to 128 characters. Must be unique per provider.":"Hingga 128 karakter. Harus unik per penyedia.","Up to 128 characters. Use alphanumeric and '-_.' characters. Must be unique in your organization. Can't be changed after the provider is created.":"Hingga 128 karakter. Gunakan karakter alfanumerik dan '-_.'. Harus unik dalam organisasi Anda. Tidak dapat diubah setelah penyedia dibuat.","Up to 128 characters. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters. Must be unique per provider.":"Hingga 128 karakter. Gunakan karakter alfanumerik dan '-_'. Harus unik per penyedia.",Update:iRt,"Update certificate signer":"Perbarui penanda tangan sertifikat",'Use "{{key}}"':'Gunakan "{{key}}"','Use "{{value}}"':'Gunakan "{{value}}"',"Use case":"Kasus penggunaan","Use cases":"Kasus penggunaan","Use default templates":"Gunakan templat default","Use letters, digits, and . - _ characters, with a single / between parts. No / at the start or end, and a part can't be . or ..":"Gunakan huruf, digit, dan karakter . - _, dengan satu / di antara bagian. Tidak boleh ada / di awal atau akhir, dan sebuah bagian tidak boleh berupa . atau ..","Use one from another account":"Gunakan satu dari akun lain","Use only Latin letters, numbers, spaces, tabs, line breaks, and standard keyboard symbols.":"Gunakan hanya huruf Latin, angka, spasi, tab, jeda baris, dan simbol {i>keyboard<i} standar.","Use only letters, digits, - and _ characters.":"Gunakan hanya huruf, digit, - dan karakter _.","Use only letters, digits, . - and _ characters. The path can't be . or ..":"Hanya gunakan karakter huruf, angka, . -, dan _. Jalur tidak boleh berupa . atau ..","Use only letters, digits, periods (.), hyphens (-), and underscores (_).":"Gunakan hanya huruf, angka, titik (.), tanda hubung (-), dan garis bawah (_).","Use the workload identity in trust policies, resource policies, or SCPs. Each call is recorded in CloudTrail with the workload's identity.":"Gunakan identitas beban kerja dalam kebijakan kepercayaan, kebijakan sumber daya, atau SCP. Setiap panggilan direkam di CloudTrail dengan identitas beban kerja.",'Use: "{{text}}"':'Gunakan: "{{text}}"',"Used as the common name in the certificate authority's subject.":"Digunakan sebagai nama umum dalam subjek otoritas sertifikat.",Validating:rRt,"Validating: stopped signing, still trusted":"Memvalidasi: penandatanganan telah dihentikan, tetapi sertifikat masih dipercaya",Value:oRt,"Value must be 256 characters or less.":"Nilai harus terdiri dari 256 karakter atau kurang.",Values:sRt,"View all":"Lihat semua","View all notifications":"Lihat semua notifikasi","View JSON":"Lihat JSON",Visual:lRt,Warning:cRt,Warnings:dRt,"What gets created":"Apa yang dibuat?","Which EKS clusters is this provider for?":"Untuk klaster EKS mana penyedia ini digunakan?",'Wildcard "*" is only allowed with the StringLike, StringNotLike, ArnLike, or ArnNotLike operators.':'Karakter wildcard "*" hanya diizinkan dengan operator StringLike, StringNotLike, ArnLike, atau ArnNotLike.',"Without a policy, no other account can create templates under this provider, though delegated administrators can already create both. Add a statement for each account, organizational unit, or IAM principal that should be able to, and limit each one to a path prefix.":"Tanpa kebijakan, tidak ada akun lain yang dapat membuat templat di bawah penyedia ini, meskipun administrator terdelegasi sudah dapat membuat keduanya. Tambahkan pernyataan untuk setiap akun, unit organisasi, atau principal IAM yang seharusnya dapat melakukannya, dan batasi masing-masing ke prefiks jalur.","Workload identities ({{total}})":"Identitas beban kerja ({{total}})","Workload identities in the IAM User Guide":"Identitas beban kerja di Panduan Pengguna IAM","Workload identities in the IAM User Guide (opens in a new tab)":"Identitas beban kerja di Panduan Pengguna IAM (terbuka di tab baru)","Workload identities: {{reason}}":"Identitas beban kerja: {{reason}}","Workload identity":"Identitas beban kerja","Workload Identity":"Identitas beban kerja","Workload identity {{name}}: {{reason}}":"Identitas beban kerja {{name}}: {{reason}}","Workload identity {{workloadIdentifier}} deleted.":"Identitas beban kerja {{workloadIdentifier}} dihapus.","Workloads get named automatically":"Beban kerja diberi nama secara otomatis","Workloads in these EKS clusters can get an identity from this provider, when all of these are true:":"Beban kerja di klaster EKS ini dapat memperoleh identitas dari penyedia ini, jika semua kondisi berikut terpenuhi:","Workloads running in these clusters can get an identity from this provider. Add 2 or more.":"Beban kerja yang berjalan di klaster ini bisa mendapatkan identitas dari penyedia ini. Tambahkan 2 atau lebih.","Workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Beban kerja yang berjalan di akun ini dapat menggunakan identitas yang dihasilkan oleh templat ini menggunakan informasi yang diverifikasi oleh {{workloadLabel}}.","Workloads running in this cluster can get an identity from this provider.":"Beban kerja yang berjalan di klaster ini bisa mendapatkan identitas dari penyedia ini.","Workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Beban kerja yang berjalan di organisasi Anda dapat menggunakan identitas yang dihasilkan oleh templat ini menggunakan informasi yang diverifikasi oleh {{workloadLabel}}.","Workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request":"Beban kerja yang menggunakan identitas ini akan berhenti diberikan kredensial, dan gagal pada permintaan berikutnya","Workloads, such as agents, pods, and jobs, are verified at runtime and get a workload identity, one per workload, generated by a template. The identity gets fine-grained access to AWS resources through IAM policies and CloudTrail, and signed JWT and X.509 credentials for meshes and SaaS apps.":"Beban kerja, seperti agen, pod, dan tugas, diverifikasi saat runtime dan mendapatkan identitas beban kerja, satu per beban kerja, yang dihasilkan oleh templat. Identitas mendapatkan akses mendetail ke sumber daya AWS melalui kebijakan IAM dan CloudTrail, serta kredensial JWT dan X.509 yang ditandatangani untuk mesh dan aplikasi SaaS.","Wrap lines":"Bungkus baris","Write a policy to let another account create templates, or to stop a delegated administrator from part of the name space. Each statement names an organizational unit, specific accounts, or individual IAM principals, allows or denies, and can be limited to a path prefix.":"Tulis kebijakan untuk mengizinkan akun lain membuat templat, atau untuk menghentikan administrator terdelegasi dari bagian ruang nama. Setiap pernyataan memberi nama unit organisasi, akun tertentu, atau principal IAM individu, mengizinkan atau menolak, dan dapat dibatasi pada prefiks jalur.","Yes by default":"Ya secara default","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tag.":"Anda dapat menambahkan hingga {{availableTags}} tag lagi.","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tags.":"Anda dapat menambahkan hingga {{availableTags}} tag lagi.","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"Anda telah melampaui batas {{tagLimit}} tag.","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"Anda telah melampaui batas {{tagLimit}} tag.","You have more keys than can be displayed":"Kunci yang Anda miliki lebih banyak dari yang dapat ditampilkan","You have more values than can be displayed":"Nilai yang Anda miliki lebih banyak dari yang dapat ditampilkan","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"Anda telah mencapai batas {{tagLimit}} tag.","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"Anda telah mencapai batas {{tagLimit}} tag.","You have unsaved tag changes. Leave this page and discard them?":"Anda memiliki perubahan tag yang belum disimpan. Tinggalkan halaman ini dan buang perubahan tersebut?","You must enter a path":"Anda harus memasukkan jalur","You must specify a condition key":"Anda harus menentukan kunci kondisi","You must specify a tag key":"Anda harus menentukan kunci tag","You must specify a unique tag key.":"Anda harus menentukan kunci tag unik.","You must specify a value":"Anda harus menentukan nilai","Your administrator decides which prefixes this account can use. This is checked when you create.":"Administrator Anda menentukan prefiks mana yang dapat digunakan akun ini. Ini diperiksa saat Anda membuat.","Your identities will be <code>{{prefix}}<em>{{placeholder}}</em></code>":"Identitas Anda akan menjadi <code>{{prefix}}<em>{{placeholder}}</em></code>","Your organization already has a workload identity provider. Add templates under it to start issuing identities to your workloads — each named under your account's path prefix.":"Organisasi Anda sudah memiliki penyedia identitas beban kerja. Tambahkan templat di bawahnya untuk mulai menerbitkan identitas ke beban kerja Anda—masing-masing diberi nama di bawah prefiks jalur akun Anda.","Your organization has workload identity providers you can use. Pick one and add templates under it to start issuing identities to your workloads.":"Organisasi Anda memiliki penyedia identitas beban kerja yang dapat Anda gunakan. Pilih satu dan tambahkan templat di bawahnya untuk mulai menerbitkan identitas ke beban kerja Anda.","YYYY/MM/DD":"HH/BB/TTTT","{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.","A declared identity has a fixed name you define. Use one when you need an exact name, for example to match a name another system already expects.":"A declared identity has a fixed name you define. Use one when you need an exact name, for example to match a name another system already expects.","A fact {{workload}} checks when the agent or workload starts.":"A fact {{workload}} checks when the agent or workload starts.","A provider issues secure, verifiable identities to your agents and workloads, like your Kubernetes pods or AI agents, to access AWS and third-party services without long-lived credentials.":"A provider issues secure, verifiable identities to your agents and workloads, like your Kubernetes pods or AI agents, to access AWS and third-party services without long-lived credentials.","A template automatically generates an identity for each matching agent or workload under {{providerName}}.":"A template automatically generates an identity for each matching agent or workload under {{providerName}}.","A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued.":"A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued.","A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued. Decide how this provider issues identities - starting from the <link>default templates</link> for common use cases, or skipping them. Templates are optional and can be added later.":"A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued. Decide how this provider issues identities - starting from the <link>default templates</link> for common use cases, or skipping them. Templates are optional and can be added later.","A template names identities automatically as matching agents and workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.":"A template names identities automatically as matching agents and workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.","A template with no attestation policy matches no agent or workload, so nothing is ever issued from it. Set a policy to define which agents and workloads qualify.":"A template with no attestation policy matches no agent or workload, so nothing is ever issued from it. Set a policy to define which agents and workloads qualify.","A template's path pattern, built from facts like cluster, namespace, and service account, names each agent or workload automatically when it starts. You don't create identities ahead of time.":"A template's path pattern, built from facts like cluster, namespace, and service account, names each agent or workload automatically when it starts. You don't create identities ahead of time.","Add a fact or condition key. A path of only custom text would give every agent or workload the same name.":"Add a fact or condition key. A path of only custom text would give every agent or workload the same name.","Add an {{conditionKey}} condition, so only agents or workloads in these clusters get an identity.":"Add an {{conditionKey}} condition, so only agents or workloads in these clusters get an identity.","Add attestation policy":"Add attestation policy","Add templates after the provider is created.":"Add templates after the provider is created.","Agent and workload identity":"Agent and workload identity","Agent and workload identity - <em>Preview</em>":"Agent and workload identity - <em>Preview</em>","Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide":"Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide","Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide (opens in a new tab)":"Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide (opens in a new tab)","Agents and workloads get named automatically":"Agents and workloads get named automatically","Agents and workloads get short-lived credentials that renew automatically and follow the SPIFFE standard, so they work with service meshes such as Istio and with business applications.":"Agents and workloads get short-lived credentials that renew automatically and follow the SPIFFE standard, so they work with service meshes such as Istio and with business applications.","Agents and workloads in these EKS clusters can get an identity from this provider, when all of these are true:":"Agents and workloads in these EKS clusters can get an identity from this provider, when all of these are true:","Agents and workloads running in these clusters can get an identity from this provider. Add two or more.":"Agents and workloads running in these clusters can get an identity from this provider. Add two or more.","Agents and workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Agents and workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.","Agents and workloads running in this cluster can get an identity from this provider.":"Agents and workloads running in this cluster can get an identity from this provider.","Agents and workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Agents and workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.","Agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request":"Agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request","Agents and workloads, such as AI agents and pods, are verified at runtime and each gets its own identity, generated by a template. The identity gets fine-grained access to AWS resources through IAM policies and CloudTrail, and signed JWT and X.509 credentials for meshes and apps.":"Agents and workloads, such as AI agents and pods, are verified at runtime and each gets its own identity, generated by a template. The identity gets fine-grained access to AWS resources through IAM policies and CloudTrail, and signed JWT and X.509 credentials for meshes and apps.","All templates and identities under this provider will be deleted":"All templates and identities under this provider will be deleted","An AI agent or workload gets an identity that is unique.":"An AI agent or workload gets an identity that is unique.","An identity with no attestation policy admits no workload, so nothing can run as it. Set a policy to define which workload qualifies.":"An identity with no attestation policy admits no workload, so nothing can run as it. Set a policy to define which workload qualifies.","An identity with this name already exists.":"An identity with this name already exists.","At runtime the platform attests these facts about the agent or workload. Any agent or workload whose attestation carries them gets an identity issued from this template.":"At runtime the platform attests these facts about the agent or workload. Any agent or workload whose attestation carries them gets an identity issued from this template.","Attestation policy for {{name}} has been removed.":"Attestation policy for {{name}} has been removed.","Attestation policy for {{name}} has been updated.":"Attestation policy for {{name}} has been updated.","By continuing, you also enable organization level resource creation, which is needed to create the organization scoped provider. You can disable it later in Settings.":"By continuing, you also enable organization level resource creation, which is needed to create the organization scoped provider. You can disable it later in Settings.","Change the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.":"Change the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.","Choose a stable, unique name that identifies one environment or group of agents and workloads, for example prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal.":"Choose a stable, unique name that identifies one environment or group of agents and workloads, for example prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal.","Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for an agent or workload.":"Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for an agent or workload.","Choose the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.":"Choose the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.","Choose where the workload is hosted":"Choose where the workload is hosted","Choose who can use it":"Choose who can use it","Control what an agent or workload can reach with familiar IAM policies and see its AWS calls in CloudTrail.":"Control what an agent or workload can reach with familiar IAM policies and see its AWS calls in CloudTrail.","Create declared identity":"Create declared identity","Creates an agent and workload identity provider and template for agents and workloads running in one or more EKS clusters under a service mesh, such as Istio.":"Creates an agent and workload identity provider and template for agents and workloads running in one or more EKS clusters under a service mesh, such as Istio.","Creating the identity":"Creating the identity","Declare an identity with the exact name you need":"Declare an identity with the exact name you need","Declared identities":"Declared identities","Declared identity":"Declared identity","Declared identity {{name}} created.":"Declared identity {{name}} created.","Define which agents and workloads are allowed to use this template.":"Define which agents and workloads are allowed to use this template.","Delete the templates under <b>{{providerName}}</b> before deleting the provider. Once deleted, agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials and fail on their next request, and access that you granted to these identities will stop working.":"Delete the templates under <b>{{providerName}}</b> before deleting the provider. Once deleted, agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials and fail on their next request, and access that you granted to these identities will stop working.","Deleting templates and identities":"Deleting templates and identities","Each identity is fully the template path.":"Each identity is fully the template path.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.","Enter a description":"Enter a description","Failed to create the declared identity.":"Failed to create the declared identity.","Failed to save attestation policy.":"Failed to save attestation policy.","Filter declared identities":"Filter declared identities","For example, to match a name another system already expects.":"For example, to match a name another system already expects.","from provider":"from provider","Give AI agents and workloads their own identities. Know which of them made each call. Scope its access with the IAM policies you already use.":"Give AI agents and workloads their own identities. Know which of them made each call. Scope its access with the IAM policies you already use.","Give an agent or workload a unique identity, so you can grant it access and audit what it did rather than sharing one role.":"Give an agent or workload a unique identity, so you can grant it access and audit what it did rather than sharing one role.","Grant access":"Grant access","Grant this name access to resources in IAM policies.":"Grant this name access to resources in IAM policies.","IAM for agents and workloads":"IAM for agents and workloads","IAM for agents and workloads (opens in a new tab)":"IAM for agents and workloads (opens in a new tab)",Identifier:uRt,"Identities ({{total}})":"Identities ({{total}})","Identities are issued at runtime from facts the agent or workload proves, rather than from what an admin assigns.":"Identities are issued at runtime from facts the agent or workload proves, rather than from what an admin assigns.","Identities for agents":"Identities for agents","Identities: {{reason}}":"Identities: {{reason}}","Identity {{name}}: {{reason}}":"Identity {{name}}: {{reason}}","Invalid trust domain. Use lowercase alphanumeric and '-.' characters.":"Invalid trust domain. Use lowercase alphanumeric and '-.' characters.","Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's agents and workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. Standard pricing applies to the creation and use of AWS Private CA.":"Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's agents and workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. Standard pricing applies to the creation and use of AWS Private CA.","It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so agents and workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. To avoid this, wait until it becomes inactive on its own. Deleting it then has no effect on verification.":"It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so agents and workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. To avoid this, wait until it becomes inactive on its own. Deleting it then has no effect on verification.","Let agents and workloads reach non-AWS resources":"Let agents and workloads reach non-AWS resources","Loading declared identities":"Loading declared identities","Matching agents and workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.":"Matching agents and workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.","No agent and workload identity providers":"No agent and workload identity providers","No agent or workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.":"No agent or workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.","No attestation policy attached.":"No attestation policy attached.","No attestation policy. No agent or workload will be issued an identity from this template until you add one.":"No attestation policy. No agent or workload will be issued an identity from this template until you add one.","No conditions. This policy matches every agent or workload of its service.":"No conditions. This policy matches every agent or workload of its service.","No segments yet. Add at least one, or every agent or workload this template matches resolves to the same name.":"No segments yet. Add at least one, or every agent or workload this template matches resolves to the same name.","None – names are defined by templates":"None – names are defined by templates","Nothing can run as this identity":"Nothing can run as this identity","Once the attestation policy is removed, matching agents and workloads will not be issued agent and workload identities until you add a policy again.":"Once the attestation policy is removed, matching agents and workloads will not be issued agent and workload identities until you add a policy again.","One bundle per provider, and one URL. It carries every authority the provider publishes: both outbound signers, and during an update both the current and incoming certificate authority, which is what lets verifiers accept either one through the handover. Your own AWS agents and workloads get these keys automatically; send this to systems outside AWS.":"One bundle per provider, and one URL. It carries every authority the provider publishes: both outbound signers, and during an update both the current and incoming certificate authority, which is what lets verifiers accept either one through the handover. Your own AWS agents and workloads get these keys automatically; send this to systems outside AWS.","One provider and one trust domain shared by every EKS cluster in the mesh. An agent or workload with the same namespace and service account in any of these clusters shares one identity.":"One provider and one trust domain shared by every EKS cluster in the mesh. An agent or workload with the same namespace and service account in any of these clusters shares one identity.","Path is the unique part of each identity's name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts an agent or workload proves.":"Path is the unique part of each identity's name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts an agent or workload proves.","path prefix":"path prefix","Policy: Define how an agent or workload attests to get the identity":"Policy: Define how an agent or workload attests to get the identity","Proven at runtime":"Proven at runtime","Providers to issue agent and workload identities":"Providers to issue agent and workload identities","Scoped, auditable access":"Scoped, auditable access","Search by name":"Search by name","Set the exact name":"Set the exact name","Set the naming format and usage scope that every agent and workload identity from this provider inherits.":"Set the naming format and usage scope that every agent and workload identity from this provider inherits.","Set the unique path pattern that every identity generated by this template follows. Cannot be changed later.":"Set the unique path pattern that every identity generated by this template follows. Cannot be changed later.","Set up a provider to hold the templates that generate identity names and the signers that sign credentials for systems outside AWS.":"Set up a provider to hold the templates that generate identity names and the signers that sign credentials for systems outside AWS.","Set up a way to issue agent and workload identities":"Set up a way to issue agent and workload identities","Set which workloads can use this identity and where they must run.":"Set which workloads can use this identity and where they must run.","Stop matching agents and workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request":"Stop matching agents and workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request","Templates give matching agents and workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.":"Templates give matching agents and workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it.":"The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.":"The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Generated from the EKS clusters above. Can be edited later.":"The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Generated from the EKS clusters above. Can be edited later.","The attestation policy controls how this identity is issued. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.":"The attestation policy controls how this identity is issued. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.","The attestation policy is the set of facts an agent or workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so an agent or workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.":"The attestation policy is the set of facts an agent or workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so an agent or workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.","The certificate chain is distributing to every Region, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. It starts signing at {{at}}. That is the minimum signing delay you set, so signing may start later than this. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.":"The certificate chain is distributing to every Region, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. It starts signing at {{at}}. That is the minimum signing delay you set, so signing may start later than this. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.","The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Account ID and Region in front so names stay unique across accounts and Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.":"The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Account ID and Region in front so names stay unique across accounts and Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.","The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Region in front so names stay unique across Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.":"The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Region in front so names stay unique across Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.","This action deletes the agent and workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.":"This action deletes the agent and workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.","This certificate has stopped signing, but its chain stays in the trust bundle so certificates already issued under it keep verifying. It becomes inactive at {{at}}. Until then, Enable resumes signing with no wait. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.":"This certificate has stopped signing, but its chain stays in the trust bundle so certificates already issued under it keep verifying. It becomes inactive at {{at}}. Until then, Enable resumes signing with no wait. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.","This doesn't look like a valid EKS cluster ARN. An invalid ARN will leave agents or workloads in that cluster without an identity.":"This doesn't look like a valid EKS cluster ARN. An invalid ARN will leave agents or workloads in that cluster without an identity.","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. Both certificates below stop, including the one still in transition, so the update does not complete. Both stay configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. Both certificates below stop, including the one still in transition, so the update does not complete. Both stay configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.","This template issues no identities":"This template issues no identities","Trust domain must be 64 characters or less.":"Trust domain must be 64 characters or less.","Use the agent or workload identity in trust policies, resource policies, or SCPs. CloudTrail records its calls with that identity.":"Use the agent or workload identity in trust policies, resource policies, or SCPs. CloudTrail records its calls with that identity.","What conditions should the agent or workload match?":"What conditions should the agent or workload match?","Where is the agent or workload hosted?":"Where is the agent or workload hosted?","You must enter a name":"You must enter a name","Your organization already has an agent and workload identity provider. Add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads — each named under your account's path prefix.":"Your organization already has an agent and workload identity provider. Add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads — each named under your account's path prefix.","Your organization has agent and workload identity providers you can use. Pick one and add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads.":"Your organization has agent and workload identity providers you can use. Pick one and add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads."},hRt=Object.freeze(Object.defineProperty({__proto__:null,ARN:"ARN",Actions:JPt,Active:ZPt,Add:XPt,Apply:QPt,Attestation:eNt,Cancel:tNt,Clear:aNt,Close:nNt,Configured:iNt,Confirm:rNt,Contains:oNt,Created:sNt,Delete:lNt,Description:cNt,Details:dNt,Disable:uNt,Dismiss:pNt,Edit:hNt,Editing:mNt,Enable:gNt,Equals:fNt,Errors:yNt,Format:bNt,Identifier:uRt,Inactive:wNt,Info:kNt,JWKS:SNt,Key:_Nt,Name:xNt,New:ANt,None:ENt,Notifications:CNt,Operator:TNt,Operators:INt,Path:NNt,Preferences:RNt,Preview:MNt,Properties:zNt,Property:ONt,Provided:BNt,Provider:FNt,Providers:$Nt,Ready:jNt,Recommended:WNt,Refresh:qNt,Remove:UNt,Retry:VNt,Save:HNt,Scheme:GNt,Scope:YNt,Status:JNt,Subject:ZNt,Success:XNt,Tags:"Tag",Template:QNt,Templates:eRt,Theme:tRt,Today:aRt,Undo:nRt,Update:iRt,Validating:rRt,Value:oRt,Values:sRt,Visual:lRt,Warning:cRt,Warnings:dRt,and:"dan",default:pRt,equals:vNt,optional:DNt,or:LNt,path:PNt,scheme:KNt},Symbol.toStringTag,{value:"Module"})),mRt="Operazioni",gRt="Attivo",vRt="Aggiungi",fRt="Applica",yRt="Attestazione",bRt="Annulla",wRt="Cancella",kRt="Chiudi",SRt="Configurato",_Rt="Conferma",xRt="Contiene",ARt="Creato",ERt="Elimina",CRt="Descrizione",TRt="Dettagli",IRt="Disabilita",DRt="Ignora",LRt="Modifica",PRt="Modifica in corso",NRt="Attiva",RRt="è uguale",MRt="Uguale a",zRt="Errori",ORt="Formato",BRt="Inattivo",FRt="Informazioni",$Rt="JWKS",jRt="Chiave",WRt="Nome",qRt="Novità",URt="Nessuno",VRt="Notifiche",HRt="Operatore",KRt="Operatori",GRt="facoltativo",YRt="percorso",JRt="Percorso",ZRt="Preferenze",XRt="Anteprima",QRt="Proprietà",eMt="Proprietà",tMt="Fornito",aMt="Provider",nMt="Fornitori",iMt="Pronto",rMt="Consigliato",oMt="Aggiorna",sMt="Rimuovi",lMt="Riprova",cMt="Salva",dMt="Schema",uMt="Schema",pMt="Ambito",hMt="Stato",mMt="Oggetto",gMt="Completato correttamente",vMt="Modello",fMt="Modelli",yMt="Tema",bMt="Oggi",wMt="Annulla",kMt="Aggiorna",SMt="Convalida in corso",_Mt="Valore",xMt="Valori",AMt="Visivo",EMt="Avviso",CMt="Avvisi",TMt="Identifier",IMt={"'{{providerName}}' does not exist in your account":"“{{providerName}}” non esiste nel tuo account","(earliest)":"(il più vecchio)","{{addedCount}} tag added or changed":"{{addedCount}} tag aggiunto o modificato","{{addedCount}} tags added or changed":"{{addedCount}} tags aggiunti o modificati","{{createdCount}} templates created: {{templateNames}}.":"{{createdCount}} modelli creati: {{templateNames}}.","{{failed}} of {{total}} certificates could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}} di {{total}} certificati non possono essere eliminati, quindi il provider non è stato eliminato. Risolvi gli errori, quindi riprova.","{{failed}} of {{total}} could not be deleted.":"Non è stato possibile eliminare {{failed}} di {{total}}","{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and workload identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"Non è stato possibile eliminare {{failed}} di {{total}} modelli e identità dei carichi di lavoro, quindi il provider non è stato eliminato. Risolvi gli errori, quindi riprova.","{{failedCount}} template could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.":"Non è stato possibile creare {{failedCount}} modello. Controlla i seguenti errori e riprova.","{{failedCount}} templates could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.":"Non è stato possibile creare {{failedCount}} modelli. Controlla i seguenti errori e riprova.","{{identityCount}} identities":"{{identityCount}} identità","{{identityCount}} identity":"{{identityCount}} identità","{{label}} (service mesh)":"{{label}} (mesh di servizi)","{{label}} copied":"{{label}} copiato","{{label}} failed to copy":"Impossibile copiare {{label}}","{{label}} template":"{{label}} modello","{{label}} template {{index}}":"{{label}} modello {{index}}","{{label}}:":"{{label}}:","{{matchCount}} match":"{{matchCount}} corrispondenza","{{matchCount}} matches":"{{matchCount}} corrispondenze","{{name}} has been successfully created.":"{{name}} è stata creata correttamente.","{{name}} has been successfully created. However, the following operations failed:":"{{name}} è stato creato correttamente. Tuttavia, le seguenti operazioni non sono riuscite:","{{providerName}} still has these resources:":"{{providerName}} dispone ancora delle seguenti risorse:","{{removedCount}} tag removed":"{{removedCount}} tag rimosso","{{removedCount}} tags removed":"{{removedCount}} tags rimossi","{{scope}} · {{domain}}":"{{scope}} · {{domain}}","{{settled}} of {{total}}":"{{settled}} di {{total}}","{{subject}}. Does not match this signer's {{algorithm}} algorithm.":"{{subject}}. Non corrisponde all’algoritmo {{algorithm}} di questo firmatario.","{{tagCount}} tag":"{{tagCount}} tag","{{tagCount}} tags":"{{tagCount}} tag","{{templateCount}} template":"{{templateCount}} modello","{{templateCount}} templates":"{{templateCount}} modelli","{{templateName}} template failed to create. To try again, <link>add templates</link>. Error details: {{reason}}":"Creazione del modello {{templateName}} non riuscita. Per riprovare, <link>aggiungi modelli</link>. Dettagli dell’errore: {{reason}}","{{workload}} fact":"{{workload}} fatto","{defined by template}":"{defined by template}","<term>Support:</term> Amazon EKS, Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Runtime, and Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Gateway.":"<term>Supporto:</term> Amazon EKS, Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Runtime e Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Gateway.","1 EKS cluster":"1 cluster EKS","1 provider and 1 trust domain per EKS cluster. Each namespace and service account in this cluster gets its own identity, trusted only within this cluster.":"1 provider e 1 dominio di attendibilità per cluster EKS. Ogni namespace e account di servizio in questo cluster ha una propria identità, considerata attendibile solo all’interno di questo cluster.","1 provider and 1 trust domain shared by every EKS cluster in the mesh. A workload with the same namespace and service account in any of these clusters shares one identity.":"1 provider e 1 dominio di attendibilità condivisi da ogni cluster EKS della mesh. Un carico di lavoro con lo stesso namespace e lo stesso account di servizio in uno di questi cluster condivide un’identità.","1 to 48 hours, in whole hours. Publishing is usually much faster, but can take up to 24 hours.":"Da 1 a 48 ore, in ore intere. La pubblicazione è in genere molto più veloce, ma può richiedere fino a 24 ore.","1. Select all the check boxes to confirm what deleting {{providerName}} will do.":"1. Seleziona tutte le caselle di controllo per confermare le conseguenze dell'eliminazione di {{providerName}}.","2. Confirm that you want to delete this provider by typing {{providerName}} below.":"2. Conferma di voler eliminare questo provider digitando {{providerName}} qui sotto.","A declared identity has a fixed path you define. Use one when you need an exact path, for example to match a value another system already expects.":"Un’identità dichiarata ha un percorso fisso definito dall’utente. Usane una quando hai bisogno di un percorso esatto, ad esempio per far corrispondere un valore già previsto da un altro sistema.","A deny, and only for delegated administrators":"Un rifiuto, e solo per gli amministratori delegati","A fact {{workload}} checks when the workload starts.":"Un fatto {{workload}} viene verificato all’avvio del carico di lavoro.","A fixed label, such as an environment name.":"Un'etichetta fissa, come il nome di un ambiente.","A name to identify this identity.":"Un nome per identificare questa identità.","A provider with this name already exists.":"Esiste già un provider con questo nome.","A tag is a label you assign to an AWS resource. Each tag has a key and an optional value. Use tags to search and filter this provider, or to track your AWS costs.":"Un tag è un’etichetta che viene assegnata a una risorsa AWS. Ogni tag è composto da una chiave e da un valore facoltativo. È possibile utilizzare i tag per cercare e filtrare questo provider o per monitorare i costi di AWS.","A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts a workload must prove before an identity is issued. Decide how this provider issues identities - starting from the <link>default templates</link> for common use cases, or skipping them. You can add and name identities manually at any time - templates are optional and can be added later.":"Un modello definisce lo schema di percorso utilizzato per denominare le identità in modo univoco e i fatti che un carico di lavoro deve dimostrare prima che venga emessa un’identità. Decidi in che modo questo provider emette le identità: iniziando dai <link>modelli predefiniti</link> per i casi d’uso più comuni, oppure ignorandoli. Puoi aggiungere e denominare le identità manualmente in qualsiasi momento: i modelli sono facoltativi e possono essere aggiunti in un secondo momento.","A template with this name already exists.":"Esiste già un modello con questo nome.","A template's path pattern, built from facts like cluster, namespace, and service account, names each workload automatically when it starts. You don't create identities ahead of time.":"Lo schema di percorso di un modello, basato su elementi quali cluster, namespace e account di servizio, assegna automaticamente un nome a ogni carico di lavoro all’avvio. Non è necessario creare identità in anticipo.","A workload identity provider issues secure, verifiable identities to your workloads, like Kubernetes pods or AI agents. Workloads use them to access AWS and third-party services without long-lived credentials.":"Un provider di identità per carichi di lavoro rilascia identità sicure e verificabili ai tuoi carichi di lavoro, come i pod Kubernetes o gli agenti di intelligenza artificiale. I carichi di lavoro le utilizzano per accedere ad AWS e ai servizi di terze parti senza credenziali di lunga durata.","A workload, including an AI agent or sub-agent created on demand, gets its own identity. No workload shares or inherits another's.":"Un carico di lavoro, incluso un agente o un sottoagente IA creato su richiesta, ottiene una propria identità. Nessun carico di lavoro condivide o eredita quella di un altro.","Access a partner API, a SaaS endpoint, or an OIDC service. No setup needed.":"Accedi a un’API partner, a un endpoint SaaS o a un servizio OIDC. Non è necessaria alcuna configurazione.","Access a service mesh, a database, or an on-premises system.":"Accedi a una mesh di servizi, a un database o a un sistema on-premises.","Access denied":"Accesso negato","Access you granted to these identities will stop working":"L’accesso che hai concesso a queste identità smetterà di funzionare","Account scoped":"Con ambito a livello di account",Actions:mRt,"Activating it":"Attivazione in corso",Active:gRt,"Active certificate authority ID":"ID autorità di certificazione attiva","Active: currently signing":"Attivo: firma attualmente in corso",Add:vRt,"Add {{label}} template":"Aggiungi {{label}} modello","Add a fact or condition key. A path of only custom text would give every workload the same name.":"Aggiungi un fatto o una chiave di condizione. Un percorso composto solo da testo personalizzato assegnerebbe lo stesso nome a tutti i carichi di lavoro.","Add an {{conditionKey}} condition, so only workloads in these clusters get an identity.":"Aggiungi una condizione {{conditionKey}}, in modo che solo i carichi di lavoro in questi cluster ottengano un’identità.","Add at least 1 path segment.":"Aggiungi almeno 1 segmento di percorso.","Add at least 1 template to continue.":"Aggiungi almeno 1 modello per continuare.","Add at least 2 clusters.":"Aggiungi almeno 2 cluster.","Add attestation rules":"Aggiungi regole di attestazione","Add cluster ARN":"Aggiungi l’ARN del cluster","Add condition":"Aggiungi condizione","Add default templates for Amazon EKS, AgentCore Runtime, and AgentCore Gateway.":"Aggiungi modelli predefiniti per Amazon EKS, AgentCore Runtime e AgentCore Gateway.","Add new tag":"Aggiungi nuovo tag","Add policy":"Aggiungi policy","Add request-context values like account, Region, or organization.":"Aggiungi valori del contesto della richiesta, come account, regione oppure organizzazione.","Add tags":"Aggiungi tag","Add tags to this provider for cost management and access control.":"Aggiungi tag a questo provider per la gestione dei costi e il controllo degli accessi.","Add tags to this template for cost management and access control.":"Aggiungi tag a questo modello per la gestione dei costi e il controllo degli accessi.","Add tags to this workload identity for cost management and access control.":"Aggiungi tag a questa identità del carico di lavoro per la gestione dei costi e il controllo degli accessi.","Add template":"Aggiungi modello","Add templates":"Aggiungi modelli","Add templates after the provider is created, or create and name identities by hand.":"Aggiungi i modelli dopo la creazione del provider oppure crea e assegna un nome alle identità manualmente.","Add to the path pattern":"Aggiungi al modello del percorso","Added or changed tags were not saved":"I tag aggiunti o modificati non sono stati salvati","Adding permissions to govern who can create templates referring to this provider failed. To try again, <link>add policy</link>. Error details: {{reason}}":"L’aggiunta delle autorizzazioni per stabilire chi può creare modelli riferiti a questo provider non è riuscita. Per riprovare, <link>aggiungi una policy</link>. Dettagli dell’errore: {{reason}}","All outbound signers under this provider will be deleted":"Tutti i firmatari in uscita con questo provider verranno eliminati","All properties":"Tutte le proprietà","All templates and workload identities under this provider will be deleted":"Tutti i modelli e le identità dei carichi di lavoro di questo provider verranno eliminati","Allow member accounts to add their own templates, namespaced by account ID":"Consenti agli account membri di aggiungere i propri modelli, con spazio dei nomi basato sull’ID dell’account","An identity for agent or workload":"Un’identità per l’agente o il carico di lavoro",and:"e","Any value":"Qualsiasi valore",Apply:fRt,ARN:"ARN","ARN copied":"ARN copiato","arn:aws:eks:{Region}:{account ID}:cluster/{cluster name}":"arn:aws:eks:{Region}:{account ID}:cluster/{cluster name}","At runtime the platform attests these facts about the workload. Any workload whose attestation carries them issues an identity from this template.":"In fase di runtime, la piattaforma attesta questi fatti relativi al carico di lavoro. Qualsiasi carico di lavoro la cui attestazione li comporta genera un’identità da questo modello.",Attestation:yRt,"Attestation policy":"Policy di attestazione","Auto generated identity name":"Nome di identità generato automaticamente","Automatically generate from a template":"Genera automaticamente da un modello","Available to every account in your organization ({{organizationId}})":"Disponibile per tutti gli account della tua organizzazione ({{organizationId}})","Available to this account ({{accountId}})":"Disponibile per questo account ({{accountId}})","AWS account ID":"ID account AWS","AWS API calls in CloudTrail resolve to the specific workload that made them. Scope trust policies, resource policies, and SCPs to it, using the IAM policies you already know.":"Le chiamate API AWS in CloudTrail vengono ricondotte allo specifico carico di lavoro che le ha generate. Definisci l’ambito delle policy di attendibilità, delle policy sulle risorse e degli SCP per tale carico di lavoro, utilizzando le policy IAM che già conosci.","AWS creates a subordinate CA in every region this provider signs in, and returns an ID for it.":"AWS crea una CA subordinata in ogni regione in cui questo provider firma e ne restituisce un ID.","AWS IAM Workload Identity":"AWS IAM Workload Identity","AWS IAM Workload Identity (opens in a new tab)":"AWS IAM Workload Identity (si apre in una nuova scheda)","AWS Private CA couldn't set up this certificate authority. Delete it in the AWS Private CA console and try again.":"AWS Private CA non è riuscita a configurare questa autorità di certificazione. Eliminala nella console AWS Private CA e riprova.","By default, each account's templates require an account ID path prefix to avoid name collisions. You can customize this after creating the provider, under provider settings.":"Per impostazione predefinita, i modelli di ogni account richiedono un prefisso del percorso dell’ID account per evitare conflitti di nomi. È possibile personalizzarlo dopo aver creato il provider, nelle impostazioni del provider.","Can't be changed after the provider is created.":"Non potranno essere modificate dopo la creazione del provider.","Can't be changed later.":"Non può essere modificato in seguito.",Cancel:bRt,"Cannot be changed later.":"Non può essere modificato in seguito.","Cannot start with aws:":"Non può iniziare con aws:","Certificate {{name}} (account {{accountId}}): {{reason}}":"Certificato {{name}} (account {{accountId}}): {{reason}}","Certificate authority":"Autorità del certificato","Certificate authority created":"Autorità di certificazione creata","Certificate authority ID":"ID autorità di certificazione","Certificate authority name":"Nome autorità di certificazione","Certificate authority updated. The current one keeps signing for about {{hours}} more hour, until the replacement has published everywhere.":"Autorità di certificazione aggiornata. Quella attuale continua a firmare per circa {{hours}} ora ancora, fino a quando il sostituto non sarà pubblicato ovunque.","Certificate authority updated. The current one keeps signing for about {{hours}} more hours, until the replacement has published everywhere.":"Autorità di certificazione aggiornata. Quella attuale continua a firmare per circa {{hours}} ore, finché quella sostitutiva non è stata pubblicata ovunque.","Certificate deleted. Its chain had already left the trust bundle, so nothing that was verifying has changed.":"Certificato eliminato. La relativa catena era già stata rimossa dal trust bundle, quindi non è cambiato nulla nelle verifiche.","Certificate deleted. Its chain has been pulled from the trust bundle, so certificates issued under it no longer verify.":"Certificato eliminato. La relativa catena è stata rimossa dal trust bundle, quindi i certificati emessi con questo certificato non possono più essere verificati.","Certificate signer":"Firmatario del certificato","Certificate signer disabled, and the update in progress was stopped with it. Both authorities stay configured, and Enable resumes signing.":"Firmatario del certificato disabilitato e aggiornamento in corso interrotto. Entrambe le autorità rimangono configurate e l'opzione Abilita riprende la firma.","Certificate signer disabled. It stops signing now, its configuration is kept, and Enable resumes signing.":"Firmatario del certificato disabilitato. La firma viene interrotta immediatamente, la configurazione viene mantenuta e l'opzione Abilita riprende la firma.","Certificate signer enabled. Its certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle again first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hour, after every region has it.":"Firmatario del certificato abilitato. La relativa catena di certificati viene pubblicata nuovamente nel trust bundle prima che la firma inizi tra circa {{hours}} ora, una volta che tutte le Regioni l'hanno ricevuta.","Certificate signer enabled. Its certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle again first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hours, after every region has it.":"Firmatario del certificato abilitato. La relativa catena di certificati viene pubblicata nuovamente nel trust bundle prima che la firma inizi tra circa {{hours}} ore, una volta che tutte le Regioni l'hanno ricevuta.","Certificate signer enabled. Its material was still published, so signing resumed immediately.":"Firmatario del certificato abilitato. Il relativo materiale era ancora pubblicato, quindi la firma è ripresa immediatamente.","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hour, once every region has it.":"Firma del certificato abilitata. La catena di certificati viene prima pubblicata nel trust bundle e la firma inizia dopo circa {{hours}} ora, una volta disponibile in ogni regione.","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hours, once every region has it.":"Firma del certificato abilitata. La catena di certificati effettua prima la pubblicazione nel trust bundle e la firma inizia dopo circa {{hours}} ore, una volta disponibile in ogni regione.","Certificate verifier information":"Informazioni sul verificatore del certificato","Certificates ({{total}})":"Certificati ({{total}})","Certificates: {{reason}}":"Certificati: {{reason}}","Change the facts a workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.":"Modifica i fatti che un carico di lavoro deve aver attestato per ricevere un’identità da questo modello. Le identità che questo modello ha già generato non vengono modificate.","Change the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. A workload already holding a session keeps it until the session expires.":"Modifica le informazioni che un carico di lavoro deve aver attestato per operare con questa identità. Un carico di lavoro che dispone già di una sessione la mantiene fino alla scadenza della sessione.","Check again":"Ricontrolla","Checking what is attached to this provider":"Verifica della presenza di elementi collegati a questo provider","Choose a condition key":"Scegli una chiave condizionale","Choose a fact":"Scegli un fatto","Choose a path and pattern for the names. Start from a default or customize your own.":"Scegli un percorso e uno schema per i nomi. Inizia da un'impostazione predefinita o personalizza la tua.","Choose a specific name up front so you can grant it access or match an existing naming convention before the workload runs.":"Scegli un nome specifico in anticipo in modo da potergli concedere l’accesso o abbinare una convenzione di denominazione esistente prima dell’esecuzione del carico di lavoro.","Choose a stable, unique name that identifies one environment or group of workloads, for example prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal.":"Scegli un nome stabile e univoco che identifichi un ambiente o un gruppo di carichi di lavoro, ad esempio prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal.","Choose a use case above to add a template.":"Scegli un caso d’uso qui sopra per aggiungere un modello.","Choose from this account":"Scegli da questo account","Choose templates to add, and customize or keep their defaults":"Scegli i modelli da aggiungere, poi personalizza o mantieni i valori predefiniti","Choose the certificate authority this signer should sign with instead. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. The current authority keeps signing until the replacement has been published long enough for verifiers to pick it up.":"Scegli invece l’autorità di certificazione con cui il firmatario deve firmare. Necessita di un’<link>autorità di certificazione</link> con una CA subordinata in ogni regione in cui effettui la firma. L’autorità attuale continua a firmare fino alla pubblicazione del sostituto, per un tempo sufficiente a consentire ai verificatori di recuperarlo.","Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for a workload.":"Scegli le chiavi di condizione da utilizzare come fatti di attestazione. La piattaforma deve attestarli tutti prima che questo modello crei un’identità per un carico di lavoro.","Choose the facts a workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.":"Scegli i fatti che un carico di lavoro deve aver attestato per ottenere l’identità da questo modello. Non verrà generato nulla da esso finché non lo avrai fatto.","Choose the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. Nothing can be issued for it until you do.":"Scegli le informazioni che un carico di lavoro deve aver attestato per operare con questa identità. Non è possibile emettere alcun elemento finché non lo fai.","Choose the provider to create the identity in":"Scegli il provider in cui creare l’identità","Choose which templates to add by use case, and customize each one or keep its defaults.":"Scegli quali modelli aggiungere in base al caso d’uso e personalizza ciascuno di essi o mantieni i valori predefiniti.",Clear:wRt,"Clear filters":"Cancella filtri",Close:kRt,"Close modal":"Chiudi modale","Cluster ARN":"ARN del cluster","Cluster ARNs":"ARN del cluster","Code editor":"Editor di codice","Complete the confirmation to delete.":"Completa la conferma per l’eliminazione.","Condition key":"Chiave di condizione","Configure identity templates for your workload use cases. Each template defines a path pattern used to issue identities uniquely and the facts a workload must prove before an identity is issued.":"Configura i modelli di identità per i casi d’uso del tuo carico di lavoro. Ogni modello definisce un modello di percorso utilizzato per emettere identità in modo univoco e i fatti che un carico di lavoro deve dimostrare prima che venga emessa un’identità.","Configure later":"Configura in un secondo momento",Configured:SRt,Confirm:_Rt,Contains:xRt,"Continue setup":"Continua la configurazione","Copy {{label}}":"Copia {{label}}","Copy ARN":"Copia ARN","Copy JSON":"Copia JSON","Could not check everything attached to this provider":"Impossibile controllare tutto ciò che è collegato a questo provider","Create a provider":"Crea un provider","Create a provider for this account":"Crea un provider per questo account","Create a provider for your organization":"Crea un provider per l’organizzazione","Create a provider to get started":"Crea un provider per iniziare","Create a template to automate identity generation":"Crea un modello per automatizzare la generazione di identità","Create declared identity in {{providerName}}":"Crea un’identità dichiarata in {{providerName}}","Create identity":"Crea identità","Create new":"Crea nuovo","Create provider":"Crea un provider","Create provider and templates":"Crea provider e modelli","Create service mesh provider":"Crea un provider di mesh di servizi","Create templates":"Crea modelli","Create the certificate authority first.":"Crea prima l’autorità di certificazione.","Create workload identities":"Crea identità per i carichi di lavoro",Created:ARt,"Created through":"Creato tramite","Created time":"Ora di creazione","Created values":"Valori creati","Creates a workload identity provider and template for workloads running in one or more EKS clusters under a service mesh, such as Istio.":"Crea un provider di identità del carico di lavoro e un modello per i carichi di lavoro in esecuzione in uno o più cluster EKS in una mesh di servizi, come Istio.","Creating certificate authority":"Creazione dell’autorità di certificazione","Creating the certificate authority":"Creazione dell’autorità di certificazione in corso","Creating this provider sets up these 2 resources.":"La creazione di questo provider configura queste 2 risorse.","Current CA":"CA corrente","Current provider":"Provider attuale","Custom tag key":"Chiave di tag personalizzata","Custom tag value":"Valore di tag personalizzato","Custom text":"Testo personalizzato","Custom text can't be a single period (.) or two periods (..).":"Il testo personalizzato non può essere composto da un solo punto (.) o da due punti (..).","Customize templates":"Personalizza modelli","Dark themes":"Temi scuri","Declared identity: {{name}}":"Identità dichiarata: {{name}}","Default permissions without a policy":"Autorizzazioni predefinite senza una policy","Defaults to {provider name}.{account ID}.aws.internal. This must match the trust domain set in your service mesh, or the mesh rejects the identities.":"Il valore predefinito è {provider name}.{account ID}.aws.internal. Questo deve corrispondere al dominio di attendibilità impostato nella mesh di servizi, altrimenti la mesh rifiuterà le identità.","Define an optional path prefix for identities under this template. Lets you filter by prefix when authoring IAM permissions.":"Definisci un prefisso di percorso opzionale per le identità in questo modello. Consente di filtrare per prefisso durante la creazione delle autorizzazioni IAM.","Define an optional path prefix for this identity. You can filter by this prefix when authoring IAM permissions.":"Definisci un prefisso di percorso opzionale per questa identità. Consente di filtrare per prefisso durante la creazione delle autorizzazioni IAM.","Define an optional prefix for identities under this template. You can filter by this prefix when authoring IAM permissions. The path prefixes this account can use are set by the provider's policy, for example your account ID, and they are checked when you choose Create. If you're not sure which are permitted, ask your organization administrator.":"Definisci un prefisso opzionale per questo modello. Puoi filtrare in base a questo prefisso durante la creazione delle autorizzazioni IAM. I prefissi di percorso che questo account può utilizzare sono impostati dalla policy del provider, ad esempio l'ID dell'account e vengono verificati quando si sceglie Crea. Se non sai con certezza quali siano consentiti, chiedi all'amministratore dell'organizzazione.","Define an optional prefix for this identity. You can filter by this prefix when authoring IAM permissions. The path prefixes this account can use are set by the provider's policy, for example your account ID, and they are checked when you choose Create. If you're not sure which are permitted, ask your organization administrator.":"Definisci un prefisso opzionale per questa identità. Puoi filtrare in base a questo prefisso durante la creazione delle autorizzazioni IAM. I prefissi di percorso che questo account può utilizzare sono impostati dalla policy del provider, ad esempio l'ID dell'account e vengono verificati quando si sceglie Crea. Se non sai con certezza quali siano consentiti, chiedi all'amministratore dell'organizzazione.","Define which workloads are allowed to use this template.":"Definisci quali carichi di lavoro sono autorizzati a utilizzare questo modello.",Delete:ERt,"Delete certificate?":"Eliminare il certificato?","Delete provider":"Elimina il provider","Delete provider and resources":"Elimina provider e risorse","Delete provider?":"Eliminare il provider?","Delete template":"Elimina modello","Delete template?":"Eliminare il modello?","Delete the templates under <b>{{providerName}}</b> before deleting the provider. Once deleted, workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials and fail on their next request, and access that you granted to these identities will stop working.":"Elimina i modelli in <b>{{providerName}}</b> prima di eliminare il provider. Una volta eliminati, i carichi di lavoro che utilizzano queste identità smetteranno di ricevere credenziali e non riusciranno a completare la richiesta successiva, e l’accesso che hai concesso a queste identità smetterà di funzionare.","Delete workload identity?":"Eliminare l’identità del carico di lavoro?","Deleting <b>{{templateName}}</b> will:":"L’eliminazione di <b>{{templateName}}</b> comporterà:","Deleting <b>{{workloadIdentifier}}</b> will:":"L’eliminazione di <b>{{workloadIdentifier}}</b> comporterà:","Deleting certificates":"Eliminazione dei certificati","Deleting provider":"Eliminazione del provider","Deleting templates and workload identities":"Eliminazione dei modelli e delle identità dei carichi di lavoro","Deleting the provider is taking longer than expected":"L’eliminazione del provider sta richiedendo più tempo del previsto",Description:CRt,"Description can't include line breaks or tabs.":"La descrizione non può includere interruzioni di riga o tabulazioni.","Description must be 1,000 characters or less.":"La descrizione deve contenere al massimo 1.000 caratteri.","Description must be 255 characters or less.":"La descrizione deve contenere al massimo 255 caratteri.",Details:TRt,Disable:IRt,"Disable certificate signer?":"Disabilitare il firmatario del certificato?","Discovery expiration time":"Ora di scadenza di Discovery",Dismiss:DRt,"Does not contain":"Non contiene","Does not equal":"Non è uguale","Drag or select to resize":"Trascina o seleziona per ridimensionare","Each identity is fully the template path, or whatever string you enter when you create the identity.":"Ogni identità è interamente il percorso del modello o qualsiasi stringa inserita quando si crea l’identità.",Edit:LRt,"Edit attestation policy":"Modifica policy di attestazione","Edit filter":"Modifica filtro","Edit identity format and scope":"Modifica il formato e l’ambito dell’identità","Edit identity path":"Modifica il percorso di identità",Editing:PRt,Enable:NRt,"Enable certificate signer":"Abilita il firmatario del certificato","Enable certificate signer?":"Abilitare il firmatario del certificato?","End signing time":"Ora di fine della firma","Enter a 12-digit AWS account ID.":"Inserisci un ID account AWS di 12 cifre.","Enter a certificate authority ID.":"Inserisci un ID autorità di certificazione.","Enter a cluster ARN.":"Inserisci un ARN del cluster.","Enter a name":"Inserisci un nome","Enter a name for the certificate authority.":"Inserisci un nome per l’autorità di certificazione.","Enter a name.":"Inserisci un nome.","Enter a path":"Inserisci un percorso","Enter a path prefix value":"Inserisci un valore di prefisso del percorso","Enter a trust domain.":"Inserisci un dominio di attendibilità.","Enter a value":"Inserisci un valore","Enter a whole number of hours from 1 to 48.":"Inserisci un numero intero di ore compreso tra 1 e 48.","Enter key":"Inserisci la chiave","Enter prefix":"Inserisci il prefisso","Enter the ID of a certificate authority or choose from below":"Inserisci l’ID di un’autorità di certificazione o scegli una delle seguenti opzioni","Enter the policy as valid JSON.":"Inserisci la policy come JSON valido.","Enter value":"Inserisci un valore",equals:RRt,Equals:MRt,Error:"Errore","Error fetching the details":"Errore durante il recupero dei dettagli",Errors:zRt,"Every account in this organization ({{organizationId}})":"Tutti gli account di questa organizzazione ({{organizationId}})","Every X.509-SVID this provider issues right now is signed by this certificate. It stops in {{hours}} hour, at {{at}}, when the incoming certificate takes over.":"Ogni X.509-SVID attualmente emesso da questo provider è firmato da questo certificato. La firma viene interrotta tra {{hours}} ora, alle {{at}}, quando subentra il certificato in entrata.","Every X.509-SVID this provider issues right now is signed by this certificate. It stops in {{hours}} hours, at {{at}}, when the incoming certificate takes over.":"Ogni X.509-SVID attualmente emesso da questo provider è firmato da questo certificato. La firma viene interrotta tra {{hours}} ore, alle {{at}}, quando subentra il certificato in entrata.","Every X.509-SVID this provider issues right now is signed by this certificate. No replacement is scheduled, so it keeps signing until you update or disable the signer.":"Ogni X.509-SVID attualmente emesso da questo provider è firmato da questo certificato. Non è prevista alcuna sostituzione, quindi il certificato continuerà a firmare finché non aggiorni o disabiliti il firmatario.","Failed to copy":"Copia non riuscita","Failed to copy JSON":"Impossibile copiare JSON","Failed to load attestation policy.":"Impossibile caricare la policy di attestazione.","Failed to load templates.":"Impossibile caricare i modelli.","Failed to remove attestation policy.":"Impossibile rimuovere la policy di attestazione.","Filter providers":"Filtra i provider","Filter templates":"Filtra i modelli","Filter themes":"Filtra temi","Find providers":"Trova i provider","Find templates":"Trova modelli","Find theme":"Trova il tema","For example, prod":"Ad esempio, prod","For mutual TLS, attach a certificate authority":"Per il TLS reciproco, collega un’autorità di certificazione","For token-based services, issue a JWT":"Per i servizi basati su token, emetti un JWT",Format:ORt,"Generating its key":"Generazione della relativa chiave in corso","Get started":"Inizia","Getting started":"Nozioni di base","Give an agent or workload its own identity - <em>Preview</em>":"Assegna a un agente o a un carico di lavoro la propria identità - <em>Anteprima</em>","Give each workload a unique identity, so you can grant it access and audit what it did rather than sharing one role.":"Assegna a ciascun carico di lavoro un'identità univoca, in modo da potergli concedere l'accesso e verificare ciò che ha svolto anziché condividere un ruolo.","Give your workloads an identity":"Assegna un’identità ai tuoi carichi di lavoro","Go to the providers list":"Vai all’elenco dei provider","Govern who can create resources":"Stabilisci chi può creare risorse","Govern who can create templates referring to this provider":"Stabilisci chi può creare modelli riferiti a questo provider","Greater than":"Maggiore di","Greater than or equal":"Maggiore o uguale","hour(s)":"ora/e","How it works":"Come funziona","IAM roles define what a workload can do. Workload Identity tells you which workload is doing it.":"I ruoli IAM definiscono cosa può fare un carico di lavoro. Workload Identity indica quale carico di lavoro lo sta eseguendo.","Identities are issued at runtime from facts the workload proves, not just from what an admin assigns.":"Le identità vengono emesse in fase di esecuzione in base a fatti comprovati dal carico di lavoro, non solo in base a ciò che un amministratore assegna.",'Identity "{{identityId}}" not found.':"Identità “{{identityId}}” non trovata.","Identity format and scope":"Formato e ambito dell’identità","Identity name":"Nome dell'identità","Identity path":"Percorso di identità","Identity selection":"Selezione dell’identità","If anything is still attached, deleting the provider fails.":"Se qualcosa è ancora collegato, l’eliminazione del provider non riesce.","In transition":"In transizione","In transition certificate authority ID":"ID dell'autorità di certificazione in transizione","In transition: incoming, not yet signing":"In transizione: in entrata, non ancora utilizzato per la firma",Inactive:BRt,"Inactive: retired, no longer trusted":"Inattivo: ritirato, non più affidabile","Incoming CA":"CA in arrivo",Info:FRt,"Invalid key. Keys can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"Chiave non valida. Le chiavi possono contenere solo lettere Unicode, cifre, spazi bianchi e uno dei seguenti simboli: _.:/=+@-","Invalid provider name. Use alphanumeric and '-_.' characters.":"Nome provider non valido. Utilizza i caratteri alfanumerici e “-_.”.","Invalid request":"Richiesta non valida","Invalid template name. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters.":'Nome modello non valido. Utilizza i caratteri alfanumerici e "-_".',"Invalid value. Values can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"Valore non valido. I valori possono contenere solo lettere Unicode, cifre, spazi bianchi e uno dei seguenti simboli: _.:/=+@-","Issued after the workload proves itself":"Emessa dopo che il carico di lavoro si è dimostrato valido","Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. Standard pricing applies to the creation and use of AWS Private CA.":"Emette gli X.509-SVID che i carichi di lavoro di questo provider presentano come certificati client ai sistemi esterni ad AWS. Richiede un'<link>autorità di certificazione</link> con una CA subordinata in ogni Regione in cui effettui la firma. Si applicano i prezzi standard per la creazione e l'utilizzo di qualsiasi CA AWS Private CA.","Issues X.509-SVIDs, for mTLS peers that verify a client certificate.":"Emette X.509-SVID, per i peer mTLS che verificano un certificato client.","Issuing its CA certificate":"Emissione del relativo certificato CA in corso","It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. Leave it alone and it becomes inactive on its own, after which deleting it changes nothing.":"Ha smesso di firmare, ma la sua catena è ancora pubblicata, quindi i carichi di lavoro si affidano a essa per verificare le credenziali rilasciate in precedenza. Eliminarla ora rimuove subito la catena e quelle credenziali iniziano a non funzionare. Se invece la si lascia stare, diventa inattiva da sola; a quel punto, eliminarla non cambia nulla.","Item moved from position {{initialPosition}} to position {{finalPosition}} of {{total}}":"Elemento spostato dalla posizione {{initialPosition}} alla posizione {{finalPosition}} di {{total}}","JSON copied":"JSON copiato",JWKS:$Rt,"JWKS popover":"Ogni chiave di firma attiva, selezionata tramite kid. AWS pubblica qui una nuova chiave prima che la firma passi a essa.","JWT Outbound signers column Signing algorithm":"Algoritmo di firma","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key":"Algoritmi chiave","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key issue time":"Firma chiave attuale dal","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key popover":"AWS genera le chiavi e le ruota secondo una propria pianificazione, pubblicando ogni nuova chiave nel JWKS prima che inizi la firma. Gli algoritmi rimangono invariati durante una rotazione, quindi un verificatore che legge il JWKS non richiede alcuna modifica da parte tua.","JWT Outbound signers desc":"Firma JWT-SVID, per i sistemi che verificano token firmati.","JWT Outbound signers label oidc discovery":"Scoperta OIDC","JWT Outbound signers label oidc discovery popover":"Il documento di individuazione standard. La maggior parte dei verificatori ha bisogno solo di questo URL, perché ne trovano le chiavi.","JWT Outbound signers label oidc issuer":"Emittente OIDC","JWT Outbound signers label oidc issuer popover":"Il claim iss di ogni JWT-SVID firmato qui. Un verificatore che fissa un emittente fissa questo valore.","JWT Outbound signers section title":"Informazioni sul verificatore del token","JWT Outbound signers status":"Predefinito fornito da AWS","JWT Outbound signers title":"Firmatario JWT",Key:jRt,"Learn about organization providers":"Scopri di più sui provider dell’organizzazione","Learn about organization providers (opens in a new tab)":"Scopri di più sui provider dell’organizzazione (si apre in una nuova scheda)","Learn more":"Scopri di più","Learn more about deleting a provider (opens in a new tab)":"Scopri di più sull’eliminazione di un provider (si apre in una nuova scheda)","Learn more:":"Ulteriori informazioni:","Less than":"Minore di","Less than or equal":"Minore o uguale","Let other accounts or principals in your organization create templates and identities under this provider, within the path prefixes you choose.":"Consenti ad altri account o principali della tua organizzazione di creare modelli e identità con questo provider, all’interno dei prefissi di percorso scelti.","Let workloads reach non-AWS resources":"Consenti ai carichi di lavoro di raggiungere risorse non AWS","Letters, digits, . - _ with a single / between parts. No / at the start or end.":"Lettere, cifre, . - _ con una singola / tra le parti. Nessuna / all'inizio o alla fine.","Letters, digits, . - _ with a single / between parts. No / at the start or end. Cannot be changed later.":"Lettere, cifre, . - _ con una singola / tra le parti. Nessuna / all'inizio o alla fine. Non può essere modificato in seguito.","Light themes":"Temi chiari","Ln {{row}}, Col {{column}}":"Riga {{row}}, Colonna {{column}}\n        ","Loading certificate authorities":"Caricamento delle autorità di certificazione","Loading code editor":"Caricamento dell’editor di codice in corso","Loading tag keys":"Caricamento delle chiavi di tag in corso","Loading tag values":"Caricamento dei valori di tag in corso","Loading tags that are associated with this resource":"Caricamento dei tag associati a questa risorsa","Loading your organization's providers":"Caricamento dei provider dell’organizzazione","Make sure the new certificate authority uses the same algorithm as the current signer, {{algorithm}}. If you choose a different algorithm, you need to disable this signer, delete its certificates, then enable it again with the new authority.":"Assicurati che la nuova autorità di certificazione utilizzi lo stesso algoritmo del firmatario attuale, {{algorithm}}. Se scegli un algoritmo diverso, devi disabilitare questo firmatario, eliminarne i certificati e quindi abilitarlo nuovamente con la nuova autorità.","Manage CAs and replication in the AWS Private CA console":"Gestisci le CA e la replica nella console AWS Private CA","Manage tags":"Gestisci i tag","Manage the provider":"Gestisci il provider","Manual creation":"Creazione manuale","Manually create":"Crea manualmente","Matching workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.":"I carichi di lavoro corrispondenti ottengono il proprio nome identificativo nel momento in cui iniziano, su qualsiasi scala.","Maximum 1,000 characters.":"Massimo 1.000 caratteri.","Maximum 255 characters.":"Massimo 255 caratteri.","Member accounts":"Account membri","Member accounts can add their own templates, namespaced by account ID.":"Gli account membri possono aggiungere i propri modelli, con spazio dei nomi basato sull’ID account.","Member accounts cannot add their own templates.":"Gli account dei membri non possono aggiungere i propri modelli.","Minimum signing delay":"Ritardo minimo per la firma","Moving item to position {{currentPosition}} of {{total}}":"Spostamento dell'elemento nella posizione {{currentPosition}} di {{total}}","Multiple EKS clusters":"Più cluster EKS",Name:WRt,"Name must be 128 characters or less.":"Il nome deve contenere al massimo 128 caratteri.","Name this identity":"Assegna un nome a questa identità","Name this provider":"Assegna un nome a questo provider","Name values":"Valori dei nomi","Names identities automatically as workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.":"Assegna un nome alle identità automaticamente all’avvio dei carichi di lavoro in modo da non doverle creare o gestire una per una.","Naming scheme":"Schema di denominazione",New:qRt,"Next month":"Mese successivo","Next page":"Pagina successiva","Next step":"Fase successiva","No attestation policy set. Define one so a workload can run as this identity.":"Nessuna policy di attestazione impostata. Definiscine una affinché un carico di lavoro possa operare con questa identità.","No attestation policy. No workload will be issued workload identities from this template until you add one.":"Nessuna policy di attestazione. A nessun carico di lavoro verranno assegnate identità di carico di lavoro da questo modello finché non ne aggiungerai una.","No by default, but can add a policy":"No per impostazione predefinita, ma puoi aggiungere una policy","No certificate authorities in this account":"Nessuna autorità di certificazione in questo account","no domain":"nessun dominio","No long-lived secrets":"Nessun segreto duraturo","No match found":"Nessuna corrispondenza trovata","No matches":"Nessuna corrispondenza","No path segments. Add a fact, condition key, or custom text.":"Nessun segmento di percorso. Aggiungi un fatto, una chiave di condizione o un testo personalizzato.","No tags associated with the resource.":"Nessun tag associato alla risorsa.","No templates added yet":"Nessun modello aggiunto","No workload identity providers":"Nessun provider di identità del carico di lavoro","No workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.":"Nessun carico di lavoro corrisponde a questo modello, quindi non genera identità.","No, and cannot be granted":"No e non può essere concesso",None:URt,"None – names are defined by templates or declared individually":"Nessuno: i nomi sono definiti da modelli o sono dichiarati singolarmente","Not saved: {{keys}}.":"Non salvato: {{keys}}.","Not set":"Non impostato",Notifications:VRt,"Once the attestation policy is removed, matching workloads will not be issued workload identities until you add a policy again.":"Una volta rimossa la policy di attestazione, ai carichi di lavoro corrispondenti non verranno assegnate identità di carico di lavoro finché non aggiungerai nuovamente una policy.","One bundle per provider, and one URL. It carries every authority the provider publishes: both outbound signers, and during an update both the current and incoming certificate authority, which is what lets verifiers accept either one through the handover. Your own AWS workloads get these keys automatically; send this to systems outside AWS.":"Un bundle per provider e un unico URL. Contiene tutte le autorità pubblicate dal provider: entrambi i firmatari in uscita e, durante un aggiornamento, sia l'autorità di certificazione attuale sia quella in entrata. È questo che consente ai verificatori di accettare entrambe durante il passaggio. I tuoi carichi di lavoro AWS ricevono automaticamente le chiavi; invia questo bundle ai sistemi esterni ad AWS.","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level providers.":"Solo l’account di gestione o un amministratore delegato può eliminare i provider a livello di organizzazione.","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level templates.":"Solo l’account di gestione o un amministratore delegato può eliminare i modelli a livello di organizzazione.","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level workload identities.":"Solo l’account di gestione o un amministratore delegato può eliminare le identità dei carichi di lavoro a livello di organizzazione.","Opens in a new tab":"Si apre in una nuova scheda",Operator:HRt,Operators:KRt,optional:GRt,or:"o","Organization provider":"Provider dell’organizzazione","Organization scoped":"Con ambito a livello di organizzazione","Organize the provider and track its cost with tags.":"Organizza il provider e monitora i suoi costi con i tag.","Other accounts in your organization":"Altri account nella tua organizzazione","Other condition keys":"Altre chiavi di condizione","Outbound signer":"Firmatario in uscita","Outbound signers page desc":"Consenti ai tuoi carichi di lavoro di dimostrare la propria identità ai servizi esterni ad AWS. Questo provider firma i token e i certificati che presentano.","Outbound signers page title":"Firmatario in uscita","Owning account":"Account proprietario","Page {{pageNumber}} of all pages":"Pagina {{pageNumber}} di tutte le pagine",path:YRt,Path:JRt,"path from templates":"percorso dai modelli","Path is the per-workload part of an identity name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts a workload proves.":"Il percorso è la parte relativa al carico di lavoro di un nome di identità. Viene compilato in fase di runtime in base ai fatti dimostrati da un carico di lavoro.","Path must be 255 characters or less.":"Il percorso deve contenere al massimo 255 caratteri.","Path pattern":"Modello di percorso","Path prefix":"Prefisso del percorso","Path prefix must be 64 characters or less.":"Il prefisso del percorso deve contenere al massimo 64 caratteri.","Path values":"Valori del percorso","Picked up item at position {{position}} of {{total}}":"Oggetto prelevato nella posizione {{position}} di {{total}}","Policy details":"Dettagli della policy","Policy: Define how a workload attests to get the identity":"Policy: definisci in che modo un carico di lavoro attesta l’ottenimento dell’identità",Preferences:ZRt,"Press space or enter to activate drag, use arrow keys to move, then press space or enter to confirm":"Usa Spazio o Invio per attivare il trascinamento, quindi usa i tasti freccia per spostarti e Spazio o Invio per confermare",Preview:XRt,"Previous CA":"CA precedente","Previous certificates ({{certificateCount}})":"Certificati precedenti ({{certificateCount}})","Previous month":"Mese precedente","Previous page":"Pagina precedente",Properties:QRt,Property:eMt,Provided:tMt,Provider:aMt,"Provider {{providerName}} deleted.":"Provider {{providerName}} eliminato.","Provider name":"Nome del provider","Provider name must be 128 characters or less.":"Il nome del provider deve contenere al massimo 128 caratteri.","Provider not deleted":"Provider non eliminato","Provider not found":"Provider non trovato","Provider overview":"Panoramica del provider","Provider selection":"Selezione del provider","Provider settings":"Impostazioni del provider","Provider values":"Valori del provider",Providers:nMt,"Providers to issue workload identities":"Provider per emettere le identità dei carichi di lavoro","Quick create":"Creazione rapida","Quick create makes an RSA 2048 certificate authority in AWS Private CA in your account, which has its own charges. The algorithm is fixed and cannot be changed later without setting the signer up again.":"La creazione rapida crea un'autorità di certificazione RSA 2048 in AWS Private CA nel tuo account, che comporta costi propri. L'algoritmo è fisso e non può essere modificato in seguito senza configurare nuovamente il firmatario.",Ready:iMt,Recommended:rMt,"Recommended for most workloads":"Consigliato per la maggior parte dei carichi di lavoro",Refresh:oMt,"Refresh certificate authorities":"Aggiorna le autorità di certificazione","Refresh certificate signer status":"Aggiorna lo stato del firmatario del certificato",Remove:sMt,"Remove {{name}}":"Rimuovi {{name}}","Remove attestation policy":"Rimuovi la policy di attestazione","Remove cluster ARN":"Rimuovi l’ARN del cluster","Remove condition":"Rimuovi condizione","Remove filter {{filter}}":"Rimuovi il filtro {{filter}}","Remove governance policy?":"Rimuovere la policy di governance?","Remove tag {{key}}":"Rimuovi tag {{key}}","Removed tags were not saved":"I tag rimossi non sono stati salvati","Reorder {{name}}":"Riordina {{name}}","Reordering canceled":"Riordino annullato","Required for service mesh providers.":"Obbligatorio per i provider di mesh di servizi.","Required for service mesh providers. A service mesh provider is scoped to the account that runs the EKS cluster.":"Obbligatorio per i provider di mesh di servizi. Un provider di mesh di servizi è associato all’account che esegue il cluster EKS.","Reset to default":"Ripristina i valori predefiniti","Resize handle":"Handle di ridimensionamento","Resolved example:":"Esempio risolto:","Restricted by":"Limitato da",Retry:lMt,"Review the tags and save again.":"Esamina i tag e salva di nuovo.","Running a service mesh, such as Istio? It needs its own provider, one per cluster.":"Stai utilizzando una mesh di servizi, come Istio? Ha bisogno di un proprio provider, uno per cluster.",Save:cMt,"Save changes":"Salva le modifiche","Save or cancel your edits before creating templates.":"Salva o annulla le modifiche prima di creare i modelli.","Save or cancel your edits before creating the provider.":"Salva o annulla le modifiche prima di creare il provider.","Save or cancel your template edits to change the scope.":"Salva o annulla le modifiche al modello per cambiare l’ambito.",scheme:dMt,Scheme:uMt,"scheme and trust domain":"schema e dominio di attendibilità","Scheme sets the format this provider uses to name identities.":"Lo schema imposta il formato utilizzato da questo provider per denominare le identità.",Scope:pMt,"Scope sets which accounts are allowed to use this provider.":"L’ambito stabilisce quali account sono autorizzati a utilizzare questo provider.","Scope values":"Valori dell’ambito","Search tags":"Cerca tag","Segment that partitions identities.":"Segmento che suddivide le identità.","Select {{name}}":"Seleziona {{name}}","Select a row to delete.":"Seleziona una riga da eliminare.",Set:"Imposta","Set a naming pattern":"Imposta uno schema di denominazione","Set an attestation rule":"Imposta una regola di attestazione","Set by your provider.":"Impostato dal tuo provider.","Set the naming format and usage scope that every workload identity from this provider inherits.":"Imposta il formato di denominazione e l’ambito di utilizzo che ogni identità del carico di lavoro eredita da questo provider.","Set the unique path pattern that every workload identity generated by this template follows. Cannot be changed later.":"Imposta il modello di percorso univoco seguito da ogni identità del carico di lavoro generata da questo modello. Non può essere modificato in seguito.","Set up a provider to hold the templates that generate identity names, the identities you declare directly, and the signers that sign credentials for systems outside AWS.":"Configura un provider per contenere i modelli che generano i nomi di identità, le identità dichiarate direttamente e i firmatari che firmano le credenziali per i sistemi esterni ad AWS.","Set up a service mesh provider for this account":"Configura un provider di mesh di servizi per questo account","Set up a way to issue workload identities":"Configura un modo per emettere le identità dei carichi di lavoro","Set up for your use cases":"Configura in base ai tuoi casi d’uso","Sets your trust domain, the start of every identity name.":"Imposta il dominio di attendibilità, l’inizio di ogni nome di identità.","Setting up the certificate authority stopped. You can continue from where it left off.":"La configurazione dell’autorità di certificazione è stata interrotta. Puoi continuare dal punto in cui era stata interrotta.","Settings from your provider {{providerName}}":"Impostazioni del tuo provider {{providerName}}","Short-lived credentials renew automatically and follow the SPIFFE standard, so they work with service meshes like Istio and with SaaS applications.":"Le credenziali di breve durata si rinnovano automaticamente e seguono lo standard SPIFFE, quindi funzionano con service mesh come Istio e con applicazioni SaaS.","Show all {{errorCount}} errors":"Mostra tutti i {{errorCount}} errori","Show fewer":"Mostra meno","Show more":"Mostra altro","Signing algorithm":"Algoritmo di firma","Signing resumes immediately, because this certificate is still published in the trust bundle.":"La firma riprende immediatamente, poiché questo certificato è ancora pubblicato nel trust bundle.","Signing start time":"Ora di inizio della firma","Some templates could not be loaded":"Non è stato possibile caricare alcuni modelli","Something went wrong":"Qualcosa è andato storto","Sortable path segment":"Segmento di percorso ordinabile",Status:hMt,"Status bar":"Barra di stato","Stop access you granted to this identity name from working":"Interrompi l’accesso concesso a questo nome di identità","Stop access you granted to those identity names from working":"Interrompi l’accesso concesso a quei nomi di identità","Stop matching workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request":"Interrompi l’assegnazione di un’identità ai carichi di lavoro corrispondenti in modo che falliscano alla richiesta successiva","Stop the identities it generated from resolving":"Interrompi la risoluzione delle identità che ha generato","Stop the workload running as this identity, so it fails on its next request":"Interrompi l’esecuzione del carico di lavoro con questa identità, in modo che fallisca alla richiesta successiva","Stopped signing and no longer in the trust bundle, so nothing verifies against them. Deleting one is safe.":"La firma è stata interrotta e non è più presente nel trust bundle, pertanto nulla viene verificato tramite di essi. Eliminarne uno è un’operazione sicura.",Subject:mMt,Success:gMt,"Tag keys could not be retrieved":"Impossibile recuperare le chiavi di tag","Tag values could not be retrieved":"Impossibile recuperare i valori di tag",Tags:"Tag","Tags could not be loaded":"Non è stato possibile caricare i tag","Tags for {{name}} have been updated.":"I tag per {{name}} sono stati aggiornati.","Tags not saved":"Tag non salvati",Template:vMt,'Template "{{templateId}}" not found.':"Modello “{{templateId}}” non trovato.","Template {{name}}: {{reason}}":"Modello {{name}}: {{reason}}","Template {{templateName}} deleted.":"Modello {{templateName}} eliminato.","Template {{templateNames}} created.":"Il modello {{templateNames}} è stato creato.","Template name":"Nome del modello","Template name must be 128 characters or less.":"Il nome del modello deve contenere al massimo 128 caratteri.","Template name values":"Valori dei nomi dei modelli","Template: {{name}}":"Modello: {{name}}",Templates:fMt,"Templates ({{total}})":"Modelli ({{total}})","Templates are being created. Wait for the request to finish.":"I modelli sono in fase di creazione. Attendi il completamento della richiesta.","Templates give matching workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.":"I modelli assegnano automaticamente ai carichi di lavoro corrispondenti il proprio nome di identità. Ognuno di essi utilizza il prefisso del nome di questo fornitore, oltre a un percorso e uno schema.","Templates that member accounts created under this provider are not visible here and cannot be deleted from this account. If any exist, deleting the provider fails.":"I modelli creati dagli account membri con questo provider non sono visibili qui e non possono essere eliminati da questo account. Se ne esistono, l’eliminazione del provider non riesce.","Templates: {{reason}}":"Modelli: {{reason}}","The account that owns the certificate authority.":"L’account proprietario dell’autorità di certificazione.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it.":"La policy di attestazione controlla il modo in cui le identità vengono emesse da questo provider. Un carico di lavoro deve soddisfare tutte le condizioni, ad esempio il tipo, i dettagli e il luogo in cui viene eseguito, come garantito dal servizio che lo ospita.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.":"La policy di attestazione controlla il modo in cui le identità vengono emesse da questo provider. Un carico di lavoro deve soddisfare tutte le condizioni, ad esempio il tipo, i dettagli e il luogo in cui viene eseguito, come garantito dal servizio che lo ospita. Può essere modificata in un secondo momento.","The attestation policy controls which workloads get an identity from this provider. A workload must meet every condition, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. It's generated from the EKS clusters you entered. You can edit it later.":"La policy di attestazione controlla quali carichi di lavoro ottengono un’identità da questo provider. Un carico di lavoro deve soddisfare tutte le condizioni, come garantito dal servizio che lo ospita. Viene generata dai cluster EKS che hai inserito. Puoi modificarla in un secondo momento.","The attestation policy lists the facts a workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so a workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.":"La policy di attestazione elenca i fatti che un carico di lavoro deve dimostrare prima che questo provider gli conferisca un’identità. La piattaforma di calcolo ne garantisce la veridicità, quindi un carico di lavoro non può rivendicare un’identità che non sia la sua.","The attester vouches for the workload, and it must match every condition to run as this identity.":"L'attestatore garantisce per il carico di lavoro, che deve soddisfare ogni condizione per operare con questa identità.","The certificate authority is still being set up.":"L’autorità di certificazione è ancora in fase di configurazione.","The ID at the end of the certificate authority's ARN in AWS Private CA.":"L’ID alla fine dell’ARN dell’autorità di certificazione in AWS Private CA.","The identity name is the provider's naming scheme, a path prefix, and a path pattern.":"Il nome di identità è lo schema di denominazione del provider, un prefisso di percorso e un modello di percorso.","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag key is 128.":"Il numero massimo di caratteri che è possibile utilizzare in una chiave di tag è 128.","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag value is 256.":"Il numero massimo di caratteri che è possibile utilizzare in un valore di tag è 256.","The path can be up to {{maxLength}} characters.":"Il percorso può contenere un massimo di {{maxLength}} caratteri.","The path doesn't support these segments: {{segments}}. Remove them, and add what you need from the following cards.":"Il percorso non supporta questi segmenti: {{segments}}. Rimuovili e aggiungi gli elementi necessari dalle schede seguenti.","The path is already the default.":"Il percorso è già l’opzione predefinita.","The path is the per-workload part of each identity's name. Keep the Region in front so names stay unique across accounts and Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.":"Il percorso è la parte relativa al carico di lavoro del nome di ciascuna identità. Tieni la regione all'inizio in modo che i nomi rimangano univoci tra account e regioni, oppure riorganizza i segmenti in modo che corrispondano alla convenzione di denominazione del team.","The path prefixes your policy allows":"I prefissi di percorso consentiti dalla tua policy","The permissions defined in this policy for <b>{{providerName}}</b> stop applying.":"Le autorizzazioni definite in questa policy per <b>{{providerName}}</b> non vengono più applicate.","The provider could not be deleted. Try again.":"Non è stato possibile eliminare il provider. Riprova.","The provider is being created. Wait for the request to finish.":"Il provider è in fase di creazione. Attendi il completamento della richiesta.","The provider might still be deleted. Check the providers list later.":"Il provider potrebbe essere ancora eliminato. Controlla l’elenco dei provider in un secondo momento.","The resource policy on this provider controls who can associate templates with it.":"La policy delle risorse di questo provider controlla chi può associarvi i modelli.","The soonest the new certificate can take over. It publishes to the trust bundle first, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. Signing may start later than this, never sooner.":"Il certificato in entrata viene pubblicato nel trust bundle prima di iniziare a firmare, in modo che ogni verificatore possa controllarlo. La firma potrebbe iniziare dopo questo momento, ma mai prima.","The soonest this certificate can start signing. It publishes to the trust bundle first, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. Signing may start later than this, never sooner.":"È il momento più ravvicinato in cui questo certificato può iniziare a effettuare firme. Esso viene innanzitutto pubblicato nel bundle di attendibilità (trust bundle), in modo che ogni verificatore possa controllarlo prima che venga utilizzato per firmare alcunché. Le operazioni di firma possono avere inizio in un momento successivo, ma mai prima.",Theme:yMt,"There was an error loading the code editor.":"Si è verificato un errore durante il caricamento dell’editor di codice.","These clusters set the template's <policyLink>attestation policy</policyLink>.":"Questi cluster impostano la <policyLink>policy di attestazione</policyLink> del modello.","These resources need to be deleted before deleting the provider.":"Queste risorse devono essere eliminate prima di eliminare il provider.","This account ({{accountId}})":"Questo account ({{accountId}})","This action deletes the workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.":"Questa azione elimina il provider di identità del carico di lavoro <b>{{providerName}}</b>.","This cannot be undone, and creating a provider with the same name later does not restore anything. To proceed, complete the steps below.":"Questa operazione non potrà essere annullata e la creazione di un provider con lo stesso nome in un secondo momento non ripristinerà nulla. Per procedere, completa i passaggi seguenti.","This cannot be undone, and the path this template reserved stays reserved. No future template can generate identities under it.":"Questa operazione non può essere annullata e il percorso riservato da questo modello rimane riservato. Nessun modello futuro può generare identità al suo interno.","This cannot be undone, and this name stays reserved. It is never issued again, so you cannot recreate this identity under the same name.":"Questa operazione non potrà essere annullata e questo nome rimarrà riservato. Non sarà mai più emesso, quindi non potrai creare nuovamente questa identità con lo stesso nome.","This certificate authority uses {{caAlgorithm}}. Rotation keeps the signer's {{signerAlgorithm}} algorithm, so choose a {{signerAlgorithm}} certificate authority instead.":"Questa autorità di certificazione utilizza {{caAlgorithm}}. La rotazione mantiene l'algoritmo {{signerAlgorithm}} del firmatario, quindi scegli un'autorità di certificazione {{signerAlgorithm}}.","This certificate has left the trust bundle, so it publishes again first. Signing starts after about {{hours}} hour, once every region has it.":"Questo certificato è stato rimosso dal trust bundle, quindi viene pubblicato nuovamente prima di iniziare a firmare. La firma inizia dopo circa {{hours}} ore, una volta che tutte le Regioni lo hanno ricevuto.","This certificate has left the trust bundle, so it publishes again first. Signing starts after about {{hours}} hours, once every region has it.":"Questo certificato è stato rimosso dal trust bundle, quindi viene pubblicato nuovamente prima di iniziare a firmare. La firma inizia dopo circa {{hours}} ore, una volta che tutte le Regioni lo hanno ricevuto.","This certificate is validating, so deleting it stops verification immediately":"Questo certificato viene usato per la convalida, quindi eliminarlo interrompe immediatamente la verifica","This certificate stopped signing and its chain has left the trust bundle, so nothing verifies against it. It stays listed as history until you delete it, and deleting it is safe: no credential depends on it, and the certificate signer keeps signing.":"Questo certificato ha smesso di firmare e la relativa catena è stata rimossa dal trust bundle, quindi non è più possibile verificare nulla con esso. Rimane elencato nella cronologia finché non lo elimini e la sua eliminazione è sicura: nessuna credenziale dipende da esso e il firmatario del certificato continua a firmare.","This cluster is already listed.":"Questo cluster è già elencato.","This condition key and operator combination already exists":"Esiste già una condizione con questa combinazione chiave e operatore","This doesn't look like a valid EKS cluster ARN. An invalid ARN will leave workloads in that cluster without an identity.":"Questo non sembra un ARN valido del cluster EKS. Un ARN non valido lascerà i carichi di lavoro in quel cluster senza un’identità.","This management account and delegated administrators":"Questo account di gestione e gli amministratori delegati","This organization ({{organizationId}})":"Questa organizzazione ({{organizationId}})","This policy's cluster ARNs don't match the clusters you entered. Changing the clusters won't update this policy. Continue only if that's intended.":"Gli ARN del cluster di questa policy non corrispondono ai cluster che hai inserito. La modifica dei cluster non aggiornerà questa policy. Continua solo se è previsto.","This provider has no naming scheme, so the path you enter is the full identity name.":"Questo provider non ha uno schema di denominazione, quindi il percorso che inserisci è il nome completo dell’identità.","This provider names every identity using the open standard.":"Questo provider assegna un nome a ogni identità utilizzando lo standard aperto.","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. Both certificates below stop, including the one still in transition, so the update does not complete. Both stay configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"Questo provider interrompe immediatamente l'emissione di X.509-SVID e i carichi di lavoro che richiedono un certificato client inizieranno a riscontrare errori alla richiesta successiva. Entrambi i certificati riportati di seguito smettono di firmare, incluso quello ancora in fase di transizione, quindi l'aggiornamento non viene completato. Entrambi rimangono configurati. I certificati già emessi continuano a essere verificabili per circa 12 ore e l'opzione Abilita riprende la firma.","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":" Questo provider interrompe immediatamente l’emissione di X.509-SVID e i carichi di lavoro che richiedono un certificato client inizieranno a non riuscire alla richiesta successiva. Il certificato riportato di seguito rimane configurato. I certificati già emessi continuano a essere verificati per circa 12 ore e Abilita riprende la firma.","This provider's policy doesn't allow this path prefix \"{{pathPrefix}}\" for your account. Ask your organization administrator which path prefixes are permitted.":"La policy di questo provider non consente il prefisso di percorso “{{pathPrefix}}” per l’account. Chiedi all’amministratore dell’organizzazione quali prefissi di percorso sono consentiti.","This removes the certificate from the provider and pulls its chain from the trust bundle immediately. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"Questa operazione rimuove il certificato dal provider e ne estrae immediatamente la catena dal trust bundle. L’autorità di certificazione stessa rimane in AWS Private CA, invariata.","This removes the certificate from the provider. Its chain already left the trust bundle, so nothing that is verifying today changes. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"Questa operazione rimuove il certificato dal provider. Poiché la sua catena è già stata rimossa dal trust bundle, non vi sono cambiamenti per i processi di verifica attualmente in corso. L’autorità di certificazione stessa rimane in AWS Private CA, invariata.","This tag will be removed upon saving changes":"Questo tag verrà rimosso al momento del salvataggio delle modifiche","This usually takes a few minutes. Keep this page open until it finishes.":"Questa operazione richiede in genere alcuni minuti. Tieni aperta questa pagina fino al termine.",Today:bMt,"Too many requests":"Troppe richieste","Trace and control access per workload":"Traccia e controlla l’accesso per carico di lavoro","Trust bundle":"Trust bundle","trust domain":"dominio di attendibilità","Trust domain":"Dominio di attendibilità","Trust domain is the root of trust for the SPIFFE naming scheme. It is a logical name that follows DNS naming style, for example prod.acme.com, but does not need to match a real DNS record.":"Il dominio di fiducia è la radice dell’attendibilità per lo schema di denominazione SPIFFE. È un nome logico che segue lo stile di denominazione DNS, ad esempio prod.acme.com, ma non deve necessariamente corrispondere a un record DNS reale.","Try again. If the problem continues, contact AWS Support.":"Riprova. Se il problema persiste, contatta il supporto AWS.","Unable to load templates":"Impossibile caricare i modelli",Undo:wMt,"Up to 128 characters. Must be unique per provider.":"Fino a 128 caratteri. Deve essere univoco per provider.","Up to 128 characters. Use alphanumeric and '-_.' characters. Must be unique in your organization. Can't be changed after the provider is created.":"Fino a 128 caratteri. Usa caratteri alfanumerici e “-_.”. Deve essere univoco nella tua organizzazione. Non può essere modificato dopo la creazione del provider.","Up to 128 characters. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters. Must be unique per provider.":'Massimo 128 caratteri. Usa caratteri alfanumerici e "-_". Deve essere univoco per fornitore.',Update:kMt,"Update certificate signer":"Aggiorna il firmatario del certificato",'Use "{{key}}"':"Usa “{{key}}”",'Use "{{value}}"':"Usa “{{value}}”","Use case":"Caso d’uso","Use cases":"Casi d’uso","Use default templates":"Usa modelli predefiniti","Use letters, digits, and . - _ characters, with a single / between parts. No / at the start or end, and a part can't be . or ..":"Usa lettere, cifre e i caratteri . - _, con una sola / tra le parti. Nessuna / all'inizio o alla fine e una parte non può essere . o ..","Use one from another account":"Usane uno di un altro account","Use only Latin letters, numbers, spaces, tabs, line breaks, and standard keyboard symbols.":"Usa solo lettere latine, numeri, spazi, tabulazioni, interruzioni di riga e simboli standard della tastiera.","Use only letters, digits, - and _ characters.":"Utilizzare solo lettere, numeri e i caratteri - e _.","Use only letters, digits, . - and _ characters. The path can't be . or ..":"Usa solo lettere, cifre, caratteri . - e _. Il percorso non può essere . o ..","Use only letters, digits, periods (.), hyphens (-), and underscores (_).":"Utilizza solo lettere, cifre, punti (.), trattini (-) e trattini bassi (_).","Use the workload identity in trust policies, resource policies, or SCPs. Each call is recorded in CloudTrail with the workload's identity.":"Utilizza l’identità del carico di lavoro nelle policy di attendibilità, nelle policy sulle risorse o negli SCP. Ogni chiamata viene registrata in CloudTrail con l’identità del carico di lavoro.",'Use: "{{text}}"':"Usa: “{{text}}”","Used as the common name in the certificate authority's subject.":"Utilizzato come nome comune nell’oggetto dell’autorità di certificazione.",Validating:SMt,"Validating: stopped signing, still trusted":"In fase di convalida: firma interrotta, ancora attendibile",Value:_Mt,"Value must be 256 characters or less.":"Il valore deve contenere massimo 256 caratteri.",Values:xMt,"View all":"Visualizza tutto","View all notifications":"Visualizza tutte le notifiche","View JSON":"Visualizza JSON",Visual:AMt,Warning:EMt,Warnings:CMt,"What gets created":"Cosa viene creato","Which EKS clusters is this provider for?":"A quali cluster EKS è destinato questo provider?",'Wildcard "*" is only allowed with the StringLike, StringNotLike, ArnLike, or ArnNotLike operators.':"Il carattere jolly “*” è consentito solo con gli operatori StringLike, StringNotLike, ArnLike o ArnNotLike.","Without a policy, no other account can create templates under this provider, though delegated administrators can already create both. Add a statement for each account, organizational unit, or IAM principal that should be able to, and limit each one to a path prefix.":"Senza una policy, nessun altro account può creare modelli in questo provider, sebbene gli amministratori delegati possano già crearli entrambi. Aggiungi un'istruzione per ogni account, unità organizzativa o principale IAM che dovrebbe essere in grado di farlo e limita ciascuna istruzione a un prefisso di percorso.","Workload identities ({{total}})":"Identità del carico di lavoro ({{total}})","Workload identities in the IAM User Guide":"Identità dei carichi di lavoro nella Guida per l’utente IAM","Workload identities in the IAM User Guide (opens in a new tab)":"Identità dei carichi di lavoro nella Guida per l’utente IAM (si apre in una nuova scheda)","Workload identities: {{reason}}":"Identità del carico di lavoro: {{reason}}","Workload identity":"Identità del carico di lavoro","Workload Identity":"Identità del carico di lavoro","Workload identity {{name}}: {{reason}}":"Identità del carico di lavoro {{name}}: {{reason}}","Workload identity {{workloadIdentifier}} deleted.":"Identità del carico di lavoro {{workloadIdentifier}} eliminata.","Workloads get named automatically":"I carichi di lavoro vengono denominati automaticamente","Workloads in these EKS clusters can get an identity from this provider, when all of these are true:":"I carichi di lavoro in questi cluster EKS possono ottenere un’identità da questo provider, quando tutte queste condizioni sono vere:","Workloads running in these clusters can get an identity from this provider. Add 2 or more.":"I carichi di lavoro in esecuzione in questi cluster possono ottenere un’identità da questo provider. Aggiungine 2 o più.","Workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"I carichi di lavoro in esecuzione in questo account possono utilizzare le identità generate da questo modello utilizzando informazioni verificate da {{workloadLabel}}.","Workloads running in this cluster can get an identity from this provider.":"I carichi di lavoro in esecuzione in questo cluster possono ottenere un’identità da questo provider.","Workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"I carichi di lavoro in esecuzione nella tua organizzazione possono utilizzare le identità generate da questo modello utilizzando informazioni verificate da {{workloadLabel}}.","Workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request":"Ai carichi di lavoro che utilizzano queste identità non verranno più rilasciate credenziali e falliranno alla richiesta successiva","Workloads, such as agents, pods, and jobs, are verified at runtime and get a workload identity, one per workload, generated by a template. The identity gets fine-grained access to AWS resources through IAM policies and CloudTrail, and signed JWT and X.509 credentials for meshes and SaaS apps.":"I carichi di lavoro, come agenti, pod e processi, vengono verificati al runtime e ottengono un’identità del carico di lavoro, una per carico di lavoro, generata da un modello. L’identità ottiene un accesso granulare alle risorse AWS tramite policy IAM e CloudTrail e credenziali JWT e X.509 firmate per mesh e app SaaS.","Wrap lines":"Righe a capo","Write a policy to let another account create templates, or to stop a delegated administrator from part of the name space. Each statement names an organizational unit, specific accounts, or individual IAM principals, allows or denies, and can be limited to a path prefix.":"Scrivi una policy per consentire a un altro account di creare modelli o per impedire a un amministratore delegato di utilizzare parte dello spazio dei nomi. Ogni istruzione specifica un’unità organizzativa, account specifici o singoli principali IAM, consente o nega e può essere limitata a un prefisso di percorso.","Yes by default":"Sì per impostazione predefinita","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tag.":"Puoi aggiungere fino a {{availableTags}} altro tag.","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tags.":"Puoi aggiungere fino a {{availableTags}} altri tag.","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"Hai superato il limite di {{tagLimit}} tag.","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"Hai superato il limite di {{tagLimit}} tag.","You have more keys than can be displayed":"Sono presenti più chiavi di quelle che possono essere visualizzate","You have more values than can be displayed":"Sono presenti più valori di quelli che possono essere visualizzati","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"Hai raggiunto il limite di {{tagLimit}} tag.","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"Hai raggiunto il limite di {{tagLimit}} tag.","You have unsaved tag changes. Leave this page and discard them?":"Sono state apportate modifiche ai tag non salvate. Uscire da questa pagina e scartarle?","You must enter a path":"È necessario inserire un percorso","You must specify a condition key":"È necessario specificare una chiave di condizione","You must specify a tag key":"È necessario specificare una chiave di tag","You must specify a unique tag key.":"È necessario specificare una chiave di tag univoca.","You must specify a value":"È necessario specificare un valore","Your administrator decides which prefixes this account can use. This is checked when you create.":"L’amministratore decide quali prefissi può utilizzare questo account. Questo viene verificato al momento della creazione.","Your identities will be <code>{{prefix}}<em>{{placeholder}}</em></code>":"Le identità saranno <code>{{prefix}}<em>{{placeholder}}</em></code>","Your organization already has a workload identity provider. Add templates under it to start issuing identities to your workloads — each named under your account's path prefix.":"L’organizzazione dispone già di un gestore dell’identità digitale per i carichi di lavoro. Aggiungi modelli al suo interno per iniziare ad assegnare identità ai carichi di lavoro, ognuna denominata con il prefisso del percorso dell’account.","Your organization has workload identity providers you can use. Pick one and add templates under it to start issuing identities to your workloads.":"L’organizzazione dispone di gestori dell’identità digitale per i carichi di lavoro che puoi utilizzare. Scegline uno e aggiungi modelli al suo interno per iniziare ad assegnare identità ai carichi di lavoro.","YYYY/MM/DD":"GG/MM/AAAA","{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.","A declared identity has a fixed name you define. Use one when you need an exact name, for example to match a name another system already expects.":"A declared identity has a fixed name you define. Use one when you need an exact name, for example to match a name another system already expects.","A fact {{workload}} checks when the agent or workload starts.":"A fact {{workload}} checks when the agent or workload starts.","A provider issues secure, verifiable identities to your agents and workloads, like your Kubernetes pods or AI agents, to access AWS and third-party services without long-lived credentials.":"A provider issues secure, verifiable identities to your agents and workloads, like your Kubernetes pods or AI agents, to access AWS and third-party services without long-lived credentials.","A template automatically generates an identity for each matching agent or workload under {{providerName}}.":"A template automatically generates an identity for each matching agent or workload under {{providerName}}.","A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued.":"A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued.","A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued. Decide how this provider issues identities - starting from the <link>default templates</link> for common use cases, or skipping them. Templates are optional and can be added later.":"A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued. Decide how this provider issues identities - starting from the <link>default templates</link> for common use cases, or skipping them. Templates are optional and can be added later.","A template names identities automatically as matching agents and workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.":"A template names identities automatically as matching agents and workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.","A template with no attestation policy matches no agent or workload, so nothing is ever issued from it. Set a policy to define which agents and workloads qualify.":"A template with no attestation policy matches no agent or workload, so nothing is ever issued from it. Set a policy to define which agents and workloads qualify.","A template's path pattern, built from facts like cluster, namespace, and service account, names each agent or workload automatically when it starts. You don't create identities ahead of time.":"A template's path pattern, built from facts like cluster, namespace, and service account, names each agent or workload automatically when it starts. You don't create identities ahead of time.","Add a fact or condition key. A path of only custom text would give every agent or workload the same name.":"Add a fact or condition key. A path of only custom text would give every agent or workload the same name.","Add an {{conditionKey}} condition, so only agents or workloads in these clusters get an identity.":"Add an {{conditionKey}} condition, so only agents or workloads in these clusters get an identity.","Add attestation policy":"Add attestation policy","Add templates after the provider is created.":"Add templates after the provider is created.","Agent and workload identity":"Agent and workload identity","Agent and workload identity - <em>Preview</em>":"Agent and workload identity - <em>Preview</em>","Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide":"Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide","Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide (opens in a new tab)":"Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide (opens in a new tab)","Agents and workloads get named automatically":"Agents and workloads get named automatically","Agents and workloads get short-lived credentials that renew automatically and follow the SPIFFE standard, so they work with service meshes such as Istio and with business applications.":"Agents and workloads get short-lived credentials that renew automatically and follow the SPIFFE standard, so they work with service meshes such as Istio and with business applications.","Agents and workloads in these EKS clusters can get an identity from this provider, when all of these are true:":"Agents and workloads in these EKS clusters can get an identity from this provider, when all of these are true:","Agents and workloads running in these clusters can get an identity from this provider. Add two or more.":"Agents and workloads running in these clusters can get an identity from this provider. Add two or more.","Agents and workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Agents and workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.","Agents and workloads running in this cluster can get an identity from this provider.":"Agents and workloads running in this cluster can get an identity from this provider.","Agents and workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Agents and workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.","Agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request":"Agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request","Agents and workloads, such as AI agents and pods, are verified at runtime and each gets its own identity, generated by a template. The identity gets fine-grained access to AWS resources through IAM policies and CloudTrail, and signed JWT and X.509 credentials for meshes and apps.":"Agents and workloads, such as AI agents and pods, are verified at runtime and each gets its own identity, generated by a template. The identity gets fine-grained access to AWS resources through IAM policies and CloudTrail, and signed JWT and X.509 credentials for meshes and apps.","All templates and identities under this provider will be deleted":"All templates and identities under this provider will be deleted","An AI agent or workload gets an identity that is unique.":"An AI agent or workload gets an identity that is unique.","An identity with no attestation policy admits no workload, so nothing can run as it. Set a policy to define which workload qualifies.":"An identity with no attestation policy admits no workload, so nothing can run as it. Set a policy to define which workload qualifies.","An identity with this name already exists.":"An identity with this name already exists.","At runtime the platform attests these facts about the agent or workload. Any agent or workload whose attestation carries them gets an identity issued from this template.":"At runtime the platform attests these facts about the agent or workload. Any agent or workload whose attestation carries them gets an identity issued from this template.","Attestation policy for {{name}} has been removed.":"Attestation policy for {{name}} has been removed.","Attestation policy for {{name}} has been updated.":"Attestation policy for {{name}} has been updated.","By continuing, you also enable organization level resource creation, which is needed to create the organization scoped provider. You can disable it later in Settings.":"By continuing, you also enable organization level resource creation, which is needed to create the organization scoped provider. You can disable it later in Settings.","Change the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.":"Change the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.","Choose a stable, unique name that identifies one environment or group of agents and workloads, for example prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal.":"Choose a stable, unique name that identifies one environment or group of agents and workloads, for example prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal.","Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for an agent or workload.":"Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for an agent or workload.","Choose the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.":"Choose the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.","Choose where the workload is hosted":"Choose where the workload is hosted","Choose who can use it":"Choose who can use it","Control what an agent or workload can reach with familiar IAM policies and see its AWS calls in CloudTrail.":"Control what an agent or workload can reach with familiar IAM policies and see its AWS calls in CloudTrail.","Create declared identity":"Create declared identity","Creates an agent and workload identity provider and template for agents and workloads running in one or more EKS clusters under a service mesh, such as Istio.":"Creates an agent and workload identity provider and template for agents and workloads running in one or more EKS clusters under a service mesh, such as Istio.","Creating the identity":"Creating the identity","Declare an identity with the exact name you need":"Declare an identity with the exact name you need","Declared identities":"Declared identities","Declared identity":"Declared identity","Declared identity {{name}} created.":"Declared identity {{name}} created.","Define which agents and workloads are allowed to use this template.":"Define which agents and workloads are allowed to use this template.","Delete the templates under <b>{{providerName}}</b> before deleting the provider. Once deleted, agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials and fail on their next request, and access that you granted to these identities will stop working.":"Delete the templates under <b>{{providerName}}</b> before deleting the provider. Once deleted, agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials and fail on their next request, and access that you granted to these identities will stop working.","Deleting templates and identities":"Deleting templates and identities","Each identity is fully the template path.":"Each identity is fully the template path.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.","Enter a description":"Enter a description","Failed to create the declared identity.":"Failed to create the declared identity.","Failed to save attestation policy.":"Failed to save attestation policy.","Filter declared identities":"Filter declared identities","For example, to match a name another system already expects.":"For example, to match a name another system already expects.","from provider":"from provider","Give AI agents and workloads their own identities. Know which of them made each call. Scope its access with the IAM policies you already use.":"Give AI agents and workloads their own identities. Know which of them made each call. Scope its access with the IAM policies you already use.","Give an agent or workload a unique identity, so you can grant it access and audit what it did rather than sharing one role.":"Give an agent or workload a unique identity, so you can grant it access and audit what it did rather than sharing one role.","Grant access":"Grant access","Grant this name access to resources in IAM policies.":"Grant this name access to resources in IAM policies.","IAM for agents and workloads":"IAM for agents and workloads","IAM for agents and workloads (opens in a new tab)":"IAM for agents and workloads (opens in a new tab)",Identifier:TMt,"Identities ({{total}})":"Identities ({{total}})","Identities are issued at runtime from facts the agent or workload proves, rather than from what an admin assigns.":"Identities are issued at runtime from facts the agent or workload proves, rather than from what an admin assigns.","Identities for agents":"Identities for agents","Identities: {{reason}}":"Identities: {{reason}}","Identity {{name}}: {{reason}}":"Identity {{name}}: {{reason}}","Invalid trust domain. Use lowercase alphanumeric and '-.' characters.":"Invalid trust domain. Use lowercase alphanumeric and '-.' characters.","Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's agents and workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. Standard pricing applies to the creation and use of AWS Private CA.":"Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's agents and workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. Standard pricing applies to the creation and use of AWS Private CA.","It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so agents and workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. To avoid this, wait until it becomes inactive on its own. Deleting it then has no effect on verification.":"It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so agents and workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. To avoid this, wait until it becomes inactive on its own. Deleting it then has no effect on verification.","Let agents and workloads reach non-AWS resources":"Let agents and workloads reach non-AWS resources","Loading declared identities":"Loading declared identities","Matching agents and workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.":"Matching agents and workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.","No agent and workload identity providers":"No agent and workload identity providers","No agent or workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.":"No agent or workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.","No attestation policy attached.":"No attestation policy attached.","No attestation policy. No agent or workload will be issued an identity from this template until you add one.":"No attestation policy. No agent or workload will be issued an identity from this template until you add one.","No conditions. This policy matches every agent or workload of its service.":"No conditions. This policy matches every agent or workload of its service.","No segments yet. Add at least one, or every agent or workload this template matches resolves to the same name.":"No segments yet. Add at least one, or every agent or workload this template matches resolves to the same name.","None – names are defined by templates":"None – names are defined by templates","Nothing can run as this identity":"Nothing can run as this identity","Once the attestation policy is removed, matching agents and workloads will not be issued agent and workload identities until you add a policy again.":"Once the attestation policy is removed, matching agents and workloads will not be issued agent and workload identities until you add a policy again.","One bundle per provider, and one URL. It carries every authority the provider publishes: both outbound signers, and during an update both the current and incoming certificate authority, which is what lets verifiers accept either one through the handover. Your own AWS agents and workloads get these keys automatically; send this to systems outside AWS.":"One bundle per provider, and one URL. It carries every authority the provider publishes: both outbound signers, and during an update both the current and incoming certificate authority, which is what lets verifiers accept either one through the handover. Your own AWS agents and workloads get these keys automatically; send this to systems outside AWS.","One provider and one trust domain shared by every EKS cluster in the mesh. An agent or workload with the same namespace and service account in any of these clusters shares one identity.":"One provider and one trust domain shared by every EKS cluster in the mesh. An agent or workload with the same namespace and service account in any of these clusters shares one identity.","Path is the unique part of each identity's name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts an agent or workload proves.":"Path is the unique part of each identity's name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts an agent or workload proves.","path prefix":"path prefix","Policy: Define how an agent or workload attests to get the identity":"Policy: Define how an agent or workload attests to get the identity","Proven at runtime":"Proven at runtime","Providers to issue agent and workload identities":"Providers to issue agent and workload identities","Scoped, auditable access":"Scoped, auditable access","Search by name":"Search by name","Set the exact name":"Set the exact name","Set the naming format and usage scope that every agent and workload identity from this provider inherits.":"Set the naming format and usage scope that every agent and workload identity from this provider inherits.","Set the unique path pattern that every identity generated by this template follows. Cannot be changed later.":"Set the unique path pattern that every identity generated by this template follows. Cannot be changed later.","Set up a provider to hold the templates that generate identity names and the signers that sign credentials for systems outside AWS.":"Set up a provider to hold the templates that generate identity names and the signers that sign credentials for systems outside AWS.","Set up a way to issue agent and workload identities":"Set up a way to issue agent and workload identities","Set which workloads can use this identity and where they must run.":"Set which workloads can use this identity and where they must run.","Stop matching agents and workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request":"Stop matching agents and workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request","Templates give matching agents and workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.":"Templates give matching agents and workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it.":"The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.":"The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Generated from the EKS clusters above. Can be edited later.":"The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Generated from the EKS clusters above. Can be edited later.","The attestation policy controls how this identity is issued. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.":"The attestation policy controls how this identity is issued. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.","The attestation policy is the set of facts an agent or workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so an agent or workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.":"The attestation policy is the set of facts an agent or workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so an agent or workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.","The certificate chain is distributing to every Region, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. It starts signing at {{at}}. That is the minimum signing delay you set, so signing may start later than this. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.":"The certificate chain is distributing to every Region, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. It starts signing at {{at}}. That is the minimum signing delay you set, so signing may start later than this. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.","The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Account ID and Region in front so names stay unique across accounts and Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.":"The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Account ID and Region in front so names stay unique across accounts and Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.","The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Region in front so names stay unique across Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.":"The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Region in front so names stay unique across Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.","This action deletes the agent and workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.":"This action deletes the agent and workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.","This certificate has stopped signing, but its chain stays in the trust bundle so certificates already issued under it keep verifying. It becomes inactive at {{at}}. Until then, Enable resumes signing with no wait. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.":"This certificate has stopped signing, but its chain stays in the trust bundle so certificates already issued under it keep verifying. It becomes inactive at {{at}}. Until then, Enable resumes signing with no wait. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.","This doesn't look like a valid EKS cluster ARN. An invalid ARN will leave agents or workloads in that cluster without an identity.":"This doesn't look like a valid EKS cluster ARN. An invalid ARN will leave agents or workloads in that cluster without an identity.","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. Both certificates below stop, including the one still in transition, so the update does not complete. Both stay configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. Both certificates below stop, including the one still in transition, so the update does not complete. Both stay configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.","This template issues no identities":"This template issues no identities","Trust domain must be 64 characters or less.":"Trust domain must be 64 characters or less.","Use the agent or workload identity in trust policies, resource policies, or SCPs. CloudTrail records its calls with that identity.":"Use the agent or workload identity in trust policies, resource policies, or SCPs. CloudTrail records its calls with that identity.","What conditions should the agent or workload match?":"What conditions should the agent or workload match?","Where is the agent or workload hosted?":"Where is the agent or workload hosted?","You must enter a name":"You must enter a name","Your organization already has an agent and workload identity provider. Add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads — each named under your account's path prefix.":"Your organization already has an agent and workload identity provider. Add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads — each named under your account's path prefix.","Your organization has agent and workload identity providers you can use. Pick one and add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads.":"Your organization has agent and workload identity providers you can use. Pick one and add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads."},DMt=Object.freeze(Object.defineProperty({__proto__:null,ARN:"ARN",Actions:mRt,Active:gRt,Add:vRt,Apply:fRt,Attestation:yRt,Cancel:bRt,Clear:wRt,Close:kRt,Configured:SRt,Confirm:_Rt,Contains:xRt,Created:ARt,Delete:ERt,Description:CRt,Details:TRt,Disable:IRt,Dismiss:DRt,Edit:LRt,Editing:PRt,Enable:NRt,Equals:MRt,Errors:zRt,Format:ORt,Identifier:TMt,Inactive:BRt,Info:FRt,JWKS:$Rt,Key:jRt,Name:WRt,New:qRt,None:URt,Notifications:VRt,Operator:HRt,Operators:KRt,Path:JRt,Preferences:ZRt,Preview:XRt,Properties:QRt,Property:eMt,Provided:tMt,Provider:aMt,Providers:nMt,Ready:iMt,Recommended:rMt,Refresh:oMt,Remove:sMt,Retry:lMt,Save:cMt,Scheme:uMt,Scope:pMt,Status:hMt,Subject:mMt,Success:gMt,Tags:"Tag",Template:vMt,Templates:fMt,Theme:yMt,Today:bMt,Undo:wMt,Update:kMt,Validating:SMt,Value:_Mt,Values:xMt,Visual:AMt,Warning:EMt,Warnings:CMt,and:"e",default:IMt,equals:RRt,optional:GRt,or:"o",path:YRt,scheme:dMt},Symbol.toStringTag,{value:"Module"})),LMt="アクション",PMt="アクティブ",NMt="アテステーション",RMt="キャンセル",MMt="設定済み",zMt="次を含む",OMt="作成済み",BMt="次に等しい",FMt="フォーマット",$Mt="非アクティブ",jMt="JWKS",WMt="オプション",qMt="詳細設定",UMt="プレビュー",VMt="プロパティ",HMt="プロパティ",KMt="指定済み",GMt="プロバイダー",YMt="プロバイダー",JMt="準備完了",ZMt="スキーム",XMt="スキーム",QMt="スコープ",ezt="ステータス",tzt="テンプレート",azt="テンプレート",nzt="元に戻す",izt="ビジュアル",rzt="Identifier",ozt={"'{{providerName}}' does not exist in your account":"'{{providerName}}' はアカウントに存在しません","(earliest)":"(最も早い)","{{addedCount}} tag added or changed":"{{addedCount}} 個のタグが追加または変更されました","{{addedCount}} tags added or changed":"{{addedCount}} 個のタグが追加または変更されました","{{createdCount}} templates created: {{templateNames}}.":"{{createdCount}} 個のテンプレートが作成されました: {{templateNames}}。","{{failed}} of {{total}} certificates could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}}/{{total}} 件の証明書を削除できなかったため、プロバイダーは削除されませんでした。エラーを解決してから、もう一度試してください。","{{failed}} of {{total}} could not be deleted.":"{{failed}} 件 / {{total}} 件を削除できませんでした。","{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and workload identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}} 件中 {{total}} 件のテンプレートとワークロード ID を削除できなかったため、プロバイダーは削除されませんでした。エラーを解決してから、もう一度試してください。","{{failedCount}} template could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.":"{{failedCount}} 個のテンプレートを作成できませんでした。次のエラーを確認して、もう一度試してください。","{{failedCount}} templates could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.":"{{failedCount}} 個のテンプレートを作成できませんでした。次のエラーを確認して、もう一度試してください。","{{identityCount}} identities":"{{identityCount}} 件の ID","{{identityCount}} identity":"{{identityCount}} 件の ID","{{label}} (service mesh)":"{{label}} (サービスメッシュ)","{{label}} copied":"{{label}} がコピーされました","{{label}} failed to copy":"{{label}} のコピーに失敗しました","{{label}} template":"{{label}} 件のテンプレート","{{label}} template {{index}}":"{{label}} テンプレート {{index}}","{{label}}:":"{{label}}:","{{matchCount}} match":"{{matchCount}} 件の一致","{{matchCount}} matches":"{{matchCount}} 件の一致","{{name}} has been successfully created.":"{{name}} が正常に作成されました。","{{name}} has been successfully created. However, the following operations failed:":"{{name}} は正常に作成されました。ただし、次のオペレーションは失敗しました。","{{providerName}} still has these resources:":"{{providerName}} にはまだ次のリソースがあります。","{{removedCount}} tag removed":"{{removedCount}} 個のタグが削除されました","{{removedCount}} tags removed":"{{removedCount}} 個のタグが削除されました","{{scope}} · {{domain}}":"{{scope}} · {{domain}}","{{settled}} of {{total}}":"{{settled}}/{{total}}","{{subject}}. Does not match this signer's {{algorithm}} algorithm.":"{{subject}}。この署名者の {{algorithm}} アルゴリズムと一致しません。","{{tagCount}} tag":"{{tagCount}} 個のタグ","{{tagCount}} tags":"{{tagCount}} 個のタグ","{{templateCount}} template":"{{templateCount}} 件のテンプレート","{{templateCount}} templates":"{{templateCount}} 件のテンプレート","{{templateName}} template failed to create. To try again, <link>add templates</link>. Error details: {{reason}}":"{{templateName}} テンプレートの作成に失敗しました。再試行するには、 <link>テンプレートを追加</link> してください。エラーの詳細: {{reason}}","{{workload}} fact":"{{workload}} ファクト","{defined by template}":"{defined by template}","<term>Support:</term> Amazon EKS, Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Runtime, and Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Gateway.":"<term>サポート:</term> Amazon EKS、Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Runtime、Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Gateway。","1 EKS cluster":"EKS クラスター 1 つ","1 provider and 1 trust domain per EKS cluster. Each namespace and service account in this cluster gets its own identity, trusted only within this cluster.":"EKS クラスターごとにプロバイダーと信頼ドメインが 1 つずつ作成されます。クラスター内の各ネームスペース、サービスアカウントは、当該クラスター内でのみ信頼される固有の ID を取得します。","1 provider and 1 trust domain shared by every EKS cluster in the mesh. A workload with the same namespace and service account in any of these clusters shares one identity.":"メッシュ内のすべての EKS クラスターで共有されるプロバイダー 1 つと信頼ドメイン 1 つ。これらのクラスターのいずれかにおいて、同じネームスペース・サービスアカウントを持つワークロードは同一の ID を共有します。","1 to 48 hours, in whole hours. Publishing is usually much faster, but can take up to 24 hours.":"1～48 時間 (整数時間単位)。通常、発行ははるかに高速ですが、最大 24 時間かかる場合があります。","1. Select all the check boxes to confirm what deleting {{providerName}} will do.":"1. すべてのチェックボックスをオンにして、{{providerName}} を削除するとどうなるかを確認します。","2. Confirm that you want to delete this provider by typing {{providerName}} below.":"2. 以下に {{providerName}} と入力して、このプロバイダーを削除することを確認します。","A declared identity has a fixed path you define. Use one when you need an exact path, for example to match a value another system already expects.":"宣言された ID には、定義した固定パスがあります。別のシステムが既に想定している値と一致させる場合など、正確なパスが必要な場合に使用します。","A deny, and only for delegated administrators":"拒否 (委任管理者のみ)","A fact {{workload}} checks when the workload starts.":"ファクト {{workload}} は、ワークロードの開始時にチェックします。","A fixed label, such as an environment name.":"環境名などの固定ラベル。","A name to identify this identity.":"この ID を識別する名前。","A provider with this name already exists.":"同じ名前のプロバイダーが既に存在します。","A tag is a label you assign to an AWS resource. Each tag has a key and an optional value. Use tags to search and filter this provider, or to track your AWS costs.":"タグとは、AWS リソースに割り当てるラベルのことです。各タグにはキーと、オプションで値が設定されます。タグを使用して、このプロバイダーの検索やフィルタリングを行ったり、AWS のコストを追跡したりできます。","A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts a workload must prove before an identity is issued. Decide how this provider issues identities - starting from the <link>default templates</link> for common use cases, or skipping them. You can add and name identities manually at any time - templates are optional and can be added later.":"テンプレートを使用して、ID に一意の名前を付けるために使用されるパスパターンと、ID が発行される前にワークロードに証明を求める事実を定義します。このプロバイダーで ID をどのように発行するかを決定します。一般的なユースケース向けの <link>デフォルトのテンプレート</link>から開始するか、スキップすることができます。ID はいつでも手動で追加して名前を付けることができます。テンプレートはオプションであり、後で追加することもできます。","A template with this name already exists.":"同じ名前のテンプレートが既に存在します。","A template's path pattern, built from facts like cluster, namespace, and service account, names each workload automatically when it starts. You don't create identities ahead of time.":"クラスター、名前空間、サービスアカウントなどの情報をもとに構築されたテンプレートのパスパターンにより、各ワークロードの起動時に自動的に名前が付けられます。ID を事前に作成する必要はありません。","A workload identity provider issues secure, verifiable identities to your workloads, like Kubernetes pods or AI agents. Workloads use them to access AWS and third-party services without long-lived credentials.":"ワークロード ID プロバイダーは、Kubernetes ポッドや AI エージェントなど、安全で検証可能な ID をワークロードに発行します。ワークロードはそれらを使用して、長期的な認証情報なしで AWS およびサードパーティのサービスにアクセスします。","A workload, including an AI agent or sub-agent created on demand, gets its own identity. No workload shares or inherits another's.":"オンデマンドで作成された AI エージェントまたはサブエージェントを含むワークロードは、それぞれ独自の ID を持ちます。ワークロードが別のワークロードの ID を共有したり継承したりすることはありません。","Access a partner API, a SaaS endpoint, or an OIDC service. No setup needed.":"パートナー API、SaaS エンドポイント、または OIDC サービスにアクセスします。セットアップは不要です。","Access a service mesh, a database, or an on-premises system.":"サービスメッシュ、データベース、またはオンプレミスシステムにアクセスします。","Access denied":"アクセスが拒否されました","Access you granted to these identities will stop working":"これらの ID に付与したアクセスは機能しなくなります","Account scoped":"アカウントスコープ",Actions:LMt,"Activating it":"アクティブ化",Active:PMt,"Active certificate authority ID":"アクティブな認証機関 ID","Active: currently signing":"アクティブ: 現在署名中",Add:"追加","Add {{label}} template":"{{label}} テンプレートを追加","Add a fact or condition key. A path of only custom text would give every workload the same name.":"ファクトまたは条件キーを追加します。カスタムテキストのみのパスでは、すべてのワークロードに同じ名前が付けられます。","Add an {{conditionKey}} condition, so only workloads in these clusters get an identity.":"{{conditionKey}} 条件を追加し、これらのクラスター内のワークロードのみが ID を取得するようにします。","Add at least 1 path segment.":"少なくとも 1 つのパスセグメントを追加してください。","Add at least 1 template to continue.":"続行するには、少なくとも 1 つのテンプレートを追加してください。","Add at least 2 clusters.":"クラスターを 2 つ以上追加してください。","Add attestation rules":"アテステーションルールを追加","Add cluster ARN":"クラスター ARN の追加","Add condition":"条件を追加","Add default templates for Amazon EKS, AgentCore Runtime, and AgentCore Gateway.":"Amazon EKS、AgentCore Runtime、および AgentCore Gateway のデフォルトテンプレートを追加します。","Add new tag":"新しいタグを追加","Add policy":"ポリシーを追加","Add request-context values like account, Region, or organization.":"アカウント、リージョン、組織などのリクエストコンテキスト値を追加します。","Add tags":"タグを追加","Add tags to this provider for cost management and access control.":"コスト管理とアクセスコントロールのために、このプロバイダーにタグを追加してください。","Add tags to this template for cost management and access control.":"コスト管理とアクセスコントロールのために、このテンプレートにタグを追加してください。","Add tags to this workload identity for cost management and access control.":"コスト管理とアクセスコントロールのために、このワークロード ID にタグを追加してください。","Add template":"テンプレートを追加","Add templates":"テンプレートを追加","Add templates after the provider is created, or create and name identities by hand.":"プロバイダーの作成後にテンプレートを追加するか、手動で ID を作成して名前を付けます。","Add to the path pattern":"パスパターンに追加","Added or changed tags were not saved":"追加または変更されたタグは保存されませんでした","Adding permissions to govern who can create templates referring to this provider failed. To try again, <link>add policy</link>. Error details: {{reason}}":"このプロバイダーを参照するテンプレートを作成できるユーザーを管理するアクセス許可の追加に失敗しました。再試行するには、 <link>ポリシーを追加</link> してください。エラーの詳細: {{reason}}","All outbound signers under this provider will be deleted":"このプロバイダーのすべてのアウトバウンド署名者が削除されます","All properties":"すべてのプロパティ","All templates and workload identities under this provider will be deleted":"このプロバイダーのすべてのテンプレートとワークロード ID は削除されます","Allow member accounts to add their own templates, namespaced by account ID":"メンバーアカウントに、アカウント ID で名前空間化された独自のテンプレートの追加を許可する","An identity for agent or workload":"エージェントまたはワークロードの ID",and:"および","Any value":"任意の値",Apply:"適用",ARN:"ARN","ARN copied":"ARN がコピーされました","arn:aws:eks:{Region}:{account ID}:cluster/{cluster name}":"arn:aws:eks:{Region}:{account ID}:cluster/{cluster name}","At runtime the platform attests these facts about the workload. Any workload whose attestation carries them issues an identity from this template.":"ランタイムに、プラットフォームはワークロードに関するこれらの事実を証明します。証明にこれらの事実が含まれているワークロードには、このテンプレートに基づく ID が発行されます。",Attestation:NMt,"Attestation policy":"証明ポリシー","Auto generated identity name":"自動生成された ID 名","Automatically generate from a template":"テンプレートから自動的に生成する","Available to every account in your organization ({{organizationId}})":"組織内のすべてのアカウントで使用可能 ({{organizationId}})","Available to this account ({{accountId}})":"このアカウントで使用可能 ({{accountId}})","AWS account ID":"AWSアカウント ID","AWS API calls in CloudTrail resolve to the specific workload that made them. Scope trust policies, resource policies, and SCPs to it, using the IAM policies you already know.":"CloudTrail の AWS API コールは、それらを実行した特定のワークロードに解決されます。既に把握している IAM ポリシーを使用して、信頼ポリシー、リソースポリシー、および SCP のスコープをそのワークロードに設定できます。","AWS creates a subordinate CA in every region this provider signs in, and returns an ID for it.":"AWS は、このプロバイダーが署名するすべてのリージョンに下位 CA を作成し、その ID を返します。","AWS IAM Workload Identity":"AWS IAM ワークロード ID","AWS IAM Workload Identity (opens in a new tab)":"AWS IAM ワークロード ID (新しいタブで開く)","AWS Private CA couldn't set up this certificate authority. Delete it in the AWS Private CA console and try again.":"AWS Private CA はこの認証機関を設定できませんでした。AWS Private CA コンソールで削除して、もう一度試してください。","By default, each account's templates require an account ID path prefix to avoid name collisions. You can customize this after creating the provider, under provider settings.":"デフォルトでは、名前の競合を避けるため、各アカウントのテンプレートにはアカウント ID パスプレフィックスが必要です。これは、プロバイダーの作成後にプロバイダー設定でカスタマイズできます。","Can't be changed after the provider is created.":"プロバイダーの作成後は変更できません。","Can't be changed later.":"後から変更することはできません。",Cancel:RMt,"Cannot be changed later.":"後から変更することはできません。","Cannot start with aws:":"aws で始めることはできません:","Certificate {{name}} (account {{accountId}}): {{reason}}":"証明書 {{name}} (アカウント {{accountId}}): {{reason}}","Certificate authority":"認証局","Certificate authority created":"認証局が作成されました","Certificate authority ID":"認証機関 ID","Certificate authority name":"認証機関名","Certificate authority updated. The current one keeps signing for about {{hours}} more hour, until the replacement has published everywhere.":"認証機関が更新されました。新しい認証機関がすべての場所で公開されるまで、現在の認証機関はさらに約 {{hours}} 時間署名を続けます。","Certificate authority updated. The current one keeps signing for about {{hours}} more hours, until the replacement has published everywhere.":"認証機関が更新されました。置き換えがすべての場所で公開されるまで、現在の認証機関はあと約 {{hours}} 時間署名し続けます。","Certificate deleted. Its chain had already left the trust bundle, so nothing that was verifying has changed.":"証明書が削除されました。チェーンは既に信頼バンドルから削除されていたため、検証中のものに変更はありません。","Certificate deleted. Its chain has been pulled from the trust bundle, so certificates issued under it no longer verify.":"証明書が削除されました。そのチェーンはトラストバンドルから削除されたため、その証明書のもとで発行された証明書は検証されなくなります。","Certificate signer":"証明書署名者","Certificate signer disabled, and the update in progress was stopped with it. Both authorities stay configured, and Enable resumes signing.":"証明書署名者が無効化され、進行中の更新も停止されました。両方の認証機関は設定されたままとなり、[有効化] によって署名が再開されます。","Certificate signer disabled. It stops signing now, its configuration is kept, and Enable resumes signing.":"証明書署名者が無効化されました。署名は直ちに停止されますが、設定は保持され、[有効化] で署名を再開できます。","Certificate signer enabled. Its certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle again first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hour, after every region has it.":"証明書署名が有効になりました。証明書チェーンはまず信頼バンドルに発行され、すべてのリージョンに反映された後、約 {{hours}} 時間で署名が開始されます。","Certificate signer enabled. Its certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle again first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hours, after every region has it.":"証明書署名が有効になりました。証明書チェーンはまず信頼バンドルに発行され、すべてのリージョンに反映された後、約 {{hours}} 時間で署名が開始されます。","Certificate signer enabled. Its material was still published, so signing resumed immediately.":"証明書署名者が有効になりました。マテリアルはまだ公開されているため、署名はすぐに再開されました。","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hour, once every region has it.":"証明書署名が有効になりました。証明書チェーンはまず信頼バンドルに発行され、すべてのリージョンに反映された後、約 {{hours}} 時間で署名が開始されます。","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hours, once every region has it.":"証明書署名が有効になりました。証明書チェーンは最初に信頼バンドルにパブリッシュされ、すべてのリージョンに反映された後、約 {{hours}} 時間で署名が開始されます。","Certificate verifier information":"証明書検証情報","Certificates ({{total}})":"証明書 ({{total}})","Certificates: {{reason}}":"証明書: {{reason}}","Change the facts a workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.":"このテンプレートに基づいて ID が付与されるためにワークロードが証明する必要がある事実を変更します。このテンプレートが既に生成した ID には影響しません。","Change the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. A workload already holding a session keeps it until the session expires.":"この ID として実行するためにワークロードが証明する必要がある事実を変更します。すでにセッションを保持しているワークロードは、セッションの有効期限が切れるまでそのセッションを保持します。","Check again":"再確認","Checking what is attached to this provider":"このプロバイダーにアタッチされているものの確認","Choose a condition key":"条件キーを選択する","Choose a fact":"ファクトを選択します。","Choose a path and pattern for the names. Start from a default or customize your own.":"名前のパスとパターンを選択します。デフォルトから開始するか、独自の設定をカスタマイズできます。","Choose a specific name up front so you can grant it access or match an existing naming convention before the workload runs.":"ワークロードの実行前にアクセスを許可したり、既存の命名規則と一致させたりできるように、事前に特定の名前を選択してください。","Choose a stable, unique name that identifies one environment or group of workloads, for example prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal.":"prod.acme.com、staging.acme.com、payments.internal など、1 つの環境またはワークロードのグループを識別する、安定した一意の名前を選択します。","Choose a use case above to add a template.":"上記のユースケースを選択して、テンプレートを追加します。","Choose from this account":"このアカウントから選択","Choose templates to add, and customize or keep their defaults":"追加するテンプレートを選択し、デフォルトをカスタマイズするか、そのまま保持する","Choose the certificate authority this signer should sign with instead. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. The current authority keeps signing until the replacement has been published long enough for verifiers to pick it up.":"代わりに、この署名者が署名に使用する認証機関を選択します。署名を行うすべてのリージョンにサブオーディネート CA を持つ<link>認証機関</link>が必要です。現在の認証機関は、検証者が取得するのに十分な期間、置き換えが公開されるまで署名を続けます。","Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for a workload.":"証明の事実として使用する条件キーを選択します。このテンプレートがワークロードの ID を発行する前に、プラットフォームはそれらすべてを証明する必要があります。","Choose the facts a workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.":"このテンプレートから ID が付与されるためにワークロードが証明する必要がある事実を選択してください。選択するまで、このテンプレートからは何も生成されません。","Choose the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. Nothing can be issued for it until you do.":"この ID として実行するためにワークロードが証明する必要がある事実を選択してください。選択するまで、この ID に対して何も発行されません。","Choose the provider to create the identity in":"ID を作成するプロバイダーを選択する","Choose which templates to add by use case, and customize each one or keep its defaults.":"ユースケース別に追加するテンプレートを選択し、それぞれをカスタマイズするか、デフォルトのままにします。",Clear:"クリア","Clear filters":"フィルターをクリア",Close:"閉じる","Close modal":"モーダルを閉じる","Cluster ARN":"クラスター ARN","Cluster ARNs":"クラスター ARN","Code editor":"コードエディタ","Complete the confirmation to delete.":"削除の確認を完了してください。","Condition key":"条件キー","Configure identity templates for your workload use cases. Each template defines a path pattern used to issue identities uniquely and the facts a workload must prove before an identity is issued.":"ワークロードのユースケースに合わせて ID テンプレートを設定します。各テンプレートは、ID を一意に発行するために使用されるパスパターンと、ID が発行される前にワークロードが証明する必要がある情報を定義します。","Configure later":"後で設定する",Configured:MMt,Confirm:"確認",Contains:zMt,"Continue setup":"セットアップを続行する","Copy {{label}}":"{{label}} をコピー","Copy ARN":"ARN をコピー","Copy JSON":"JSON をコピー","Could not check everything attached to this provider":"このプロバイダーにアタッチされているすべてのものを確認できませんでした","Create a provider":"プロバイダーの作成","Create a provider for this account":"このアカウントのプロバイダーを作成","Create a provider for your organization":"組織のプロバイダーを作成","Create a provider to get started":"開始するには、プロバイダーを作成してください","Create a template to automate identity generation":"識別名の生成を自動化するテンプレートを作成する","Create declared identity in {{providerName}}":"{{providerName}} で宣言された ID を作成する","Create identity":"ID を作成","Create new":"新規作成","Create provider":"プロバイダーの作成","Create provider and templates":"プロバイダーとテンプレートを作成する","Create service mesh provider":"サービスメッシュプロバイダーを作成する","Create templates":"テンプレートを作成","Create the certificate authority first.":"最初に認証機関を作成します。","Create workload identities":"ワークロードIDを作成する",Created:OMt,"Created through":"作成元","Created time":"作成時刻","Created values":"作成された値","Creates a workload identity provider and template for workloads running in one or more EKS clusters under a service mesh, such as Istio.":"Istio などのサービスメッシュ配下にある 1 つ以上の EKS クラスターで実行されるワークロード向けの、ワークロード ID プロバイダーとテンプレートを作成します。","Creating certificate authority":"認証機関を作成中","Creating the certificate authority":"認証機関を作成中","Creating this provider sets up these 2 resources.":"このプロバイダーを作成すると、以下 2 つのリソースが作成されます。","Current CA":"現在の CA","Current provider":"現在のプロバイダー","Custom tag key":"カスタムタグキー","Custom tag value":"カスタムタグ値","Custom text":"カスタムテキスト","Custom text can't be a single period (.) or two periods (..).":"カスタムテキストを単一のピリオド (.) または二つのピリオド (..) だけにすることはできません。","Customize templates":"テンプレートをカスタマイズする","Dark themes":"ダークテーマ","Declared identity: {{name}}":"宣言されたアイデンティティ: {{name}}","Default permissions without a policy":"ポリシーのないデフォルトのアクセス許可","Defaults to {provider name}.{account ID}.aws.internal. This must match the trust domain set in your service mesh, or the mesh rejects the identities.":"既定値は {provider name}.{account ID}.aws.internal です。この値はサービスメッシュに設定された信頼ドメインと一致させる必要があります。一致していない場合、メッシュは ID を拒否します。","Define an optional path prefix for identities under this template. Lets you filter by prefix when authoring IAM permissions.":"このテンプレートで ID に対するオプションのパスプレフィックスを定義します。これにより、IAM アクセス許可の作成時に、プレフィックスでフィルタリングできるようになります。","Define an optional path prefix for this identity. You can filter by this prefix when authoring IAM permissions.":"この ID に対するオプションのパスプレフィックスを定義します。IAM アクセス許可の作成時に、このプレフィックスでフィルタリングできます。","Define an optional prefix for identities under this template. You can filter by this prefix when authoring IAM permissions. The path prefixes this account can use are set by the provider's policy, for example your account ID, and they are checked when you choose Create. If you're not sure which are permitted, ask your organization administrator.":"このテンプレートの ID に対するオプションのプレフィックスを定義します。IAM アクセス許可を作成するときに、このプレフィックスでフィルタリングできます。このアカウントで使用できるパスプレフィックスは、アカウント ID など、プロバイダーのポリシーによって設定され、[作成] を選択したときに確認されます。許可されているプレフィックスが不明な場合は、組織の管理者に問い合わせてください。","Define an optional prefix for this identity. You can filter by this prefix when authoring IAM permissions. The path prefixes this account can use are set by the provider's policy, for example your account ID, and they are checked when you choose Create. If you're not sure which are permitted, ask your organization administrator.":"この ID のオプションのプレフィックスを定義します。IAM アクセス許可を作成するときに、このプレフィックスでフィルタリングできます。このアカウントで使用できるパスプレフィックスは、アカウント ID など、プロバイダーのポリシーによって設定され、[作成] を選択したときに確認されます。許可されているプレフィックスが不明な場合は、組織の管理者に問い合わせてください。","Define which workloads are allowed to use this template.":"このテンプレートの使用を許可するワークロードを定義します。",Delete:"削除","Delete certificate?":"証明書を削除しますか?","Delete provider":"プロバイダーを削除する","Delete provider and resources":"プロバイダーとリソースの削除","Delete provider?":"プロバイダーを削除しますか?","Delete template":"テンプレートを削除","Delete template?":"テンプレートを削除しますか?","Delete the templates under <b>{{providerName}}</b> before deleting the provider. Once deleted, workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials and fail on their next request, and access that you granted to these identities will stop working.":"プロバイダーを削除する前に、 <b>{{providerName}}</b> のテンプレートを削除してください。テンプレートを削除すると、これらの ID を使用するワークロードには認証情報が発行されなくなり、次のリクエストで失敗します。また、これらの ID に付与したアクセスも機能しなくなります。","Delete workload identity?":"ワークロード ID を削除しますか?","Deleting <b>{{templateName}}</b> will:":"<b>{{templateName}}</b> を削除すると、次のようになります。","Deleting <b>{{workloadIdentifier}}</b> will:":"<b>{{workloadIdentifier}}</b> を削除すると、次のようになります。","Deleting certificates":"証明書の削除","Deleting provider":"プロバイダーの削除","Deleting templates and workload identities":"テンプレートとワークロード ID の削除","Deleting the provider is taking longer than expected":"プロバイダーの削除に予想以上に時間がかかっています",Description:"説明","Description can't include line breaks or tabs.":"説明に改行やタブを含めることはできません。","Description must be 1,000 characters or less.":"説明は 1,000 文字以下である必要があります。","Description must be 255 characters or less.":"説明は 255 文字以下である必要があります。",Details:"詳細",Disable:"無効化","Disable certificate signer?":"証明書署名者を無効にしますか?","Discovery expiration time":"検出の有効期限",Dismiss:"閉じる","Does not contain":"次を含まない","Does not equal":"次と等しくない","Drag or select to resize":"ドラッグまたは選択してサイズを変更する","Each identity is fully the template path, or whatever string you enter when you create the identity.":"各 ID は、完全なテンプレートパス、または ID の作成時に入力した文字列です。",Edit:"編集","Edit attestation policy":"証明ポリシーの編集","Edit filter":"フィルターを編集","Edit identity format and scope":"ID の形式と範囲の編集","Edit identity path":"ID パスを編集する",Editing:"編集中",Enable:"有効化","Enable certificate signer":"証明書署名者を有効にする","Enable certificate signer?":"証明書署名者を有効にしますか?","End signing time":"署名終了時刻","Enter a 12-digit AWS account ID.":"12 桁の AWS アカウント ID を入力します。","Enter a certificate authority ID.":"認証機関 ID を入力してください。","Enter a cluster ARN.":"クラスター ARN を入力してください。","Enter a name":"名前を入力","Enter a name for the certificate authority.":"認証機関の名前を入力します。","Enter a name.":"名前を入力してください。","Enter a path":"パスを入力してください","Enter a path prefix value":"パスプレフィックス値を入力する","Enter a trust domain.":"信頼ドメインを入力します。","Enter a value":"値を入力","Enter a whole number of hours from 1 to 48.":"1～48 の整数を入力してください。","Enter key":"キーの入力","Enter prefix":"プレフィックスを入力","Enter the ID of a certificate authority or choose from below":"認証機関の ID を入力するか、以下から選択してください。","Enter the policy as valid JSON.":"ポリシーを有効な JSON として入力します。","Enter value":"値の入力",equals:"等しい",Equals:BMt,Error:"エラー","Error fetching the details":"詳細の取得中にエラーが発生しました",Errors:"エラー","Every account in this organization ({{organizationId}})":"この組織内のすべてのアカウント ({{organizationId}})","Every X.509-SVID this provider issues right now is signed by this certificate. It stops in {{hours}} hour, at {{at}}, when the incoming certificate takes over.":"このプロバイダーが現在発行するすべての X.509-SVID は、この証明書によって署名されています。受信証明書が引き継ぐ {{at}} まで、あと {{hours}} 時間で停止します。","Every X.509-SVID this provider issues right now is signed by this certificate. It stops in {{hours}} hours, at {{at}}, when the incoming certificate takes over.":"このプロバイダーが現在発行するすべての X.509-SVID は、この証明書によって署名されています。新しい証明書が引き継ぐ {{hours}} 時間後、{{at}} に署名が停止します。","Every X.509-SVID this provider issues right now is signed by this certificate. No replacement is scheduled, so it keeps signing until you update or disable the signer.":"このプロバイダーが現在発行するすべての X.509-SVID は、この証明書によって署名されています。置き換えはスケジュールされていないため、署名者を更新または無効にするまで署名を続けます。","Failed to copy":"コピーできませんでした","Failed to copy JSON":"JSON をコピーできませんでした","Failed to load attestation policy.":"アテステーションポリシーのロードに失敗しました。","Failed to load templates.":"テンプレートの読み込みに失敗しました。","Failed to remove attestation policy.":"アテステーションポリシーの削除に失敗しました。","Filter providers":"プロバイダーのフィルタリング","Filter templates":"テンプレートをフィルタリング","Filter themes":"テーマをフィルタリング","Find providers":"プロバイダーを検索","Find templates":"テンプレートを検索","Find theme":"テーマの検索","For example, prod":"例: prod","For mutual TLS, attach a certificate authority":"相互 TLS の場合は、認証機関をアタッチします","For token-based services, issue a JWT":"トークンベースのサービスの場合は、JWT を発行します。",Format:FMt,"Generating its key":"キーを生成中","Get started":"使用を開始する","Getting started":"開始方法","Give an agent or workload its own identity - <em>Preview</em>":"エージェントまたはワークロードに独自の ID を付与する – <em>プレビュー</em>","Give each workload a unique identity, so you can grant it access and audit what it did rather than sharing one role.":"各ワークロードに一意の ID を付与することで、一つのロールを共有するのではなく、アクセスを許可し、実行した操作を監査できるようにします。","Give your workloads an identity":"ワークロードに ID を付与する","Go to the providers list":"プロバイダーリストに移動する","Govern who can create resources":"リソースを作成できるユーザーを管理する","Govern who can create templates referring to this provider":"このプロバイダーを参照するテンプレートを作成できるユーザーを管理する","Greater than":"次より大きい","Greater than or equal":"次の値以上","hour(s)":"時間","How it works":"仕組み","IAM roles define what a workload can do. Workload Identity tells you which workload is doing it.":"IAM ロールは、ワークロードが実行できる操作を定義します。ワークロード ID は、それを実行しているワークロードを示します。","Identities are issued at runtime from facts the workload proves, not just from what an admin assigns.":"ID は、管理者が割り当てた情報だけでなく、ワークロード自身が証明した情報に基づいて実行時に発行されます。",'Identity "{{identityId}}" not found.':"ID「{{identityId}}」が見つかりません。","Identity format and scope":"ID の形式と範囲","Identity name":"ID 名","Identity path":"ID パス","Identity selection":"ID の選択","If anything is still attached, deleting the provider fails.":"まだアタッチされているものがある場合、プロバイダーの削除は失敗します。","In transition":"移行中","In transition certificate authority ID":"移行中の認証機関 ID","In transition: incoming, not yet signing":"移行中: 新しい証明書、まだ署名していない",Inactive:$Mt,"Inactive: retired, no longer trusted":"非アクティブ: 廃止済み、信頼されなくなった","Incoming CA":"受信 CA",Info:"情報","Invalid key. Keys can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"キーが無効です。キーには Unicode 文字、数字、空白、および _ . : / = + @ - のいずれかしか使用できません","Invalid provider name. Use alphanumeric and '-_.' characters.":"プロバイダー名が無効です。英数字と -_. 記号を使用してください。","Invalid request":"無効なリクエスト","Invalid template name. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters.":"テンプレート名が無効です。英数字と '-_' 文字を使用してください。","Invalid value. Values can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"値が無効です。値には Unicode 文字、数字、空白、および _ . : / = + @ - のいずれかしか使用できません","Issued after the workload proves itself":"ワークロード自体が証明された後に発行されます","Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. Standard pricing applies to the creation and use of AWS Private CA.":"このプロバイダーのワークロードが AWS 外のシステムへのクライアント証明書として提示する X.509-SVID を発行します。サインインするすべてのリージョンに下位 CA を持つ<link>認証機関</link>が必要です。AWS Private CA の作成と使用には標準料金が適用されます。","Issues X.509-SVIDs, for mTLS peers that verify a client certificate.":"クライアント証明書を検証する mTLS ピアの X.509-SVID を発行します。","Issuing its CA certificate":"CA 証明書の発行","It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. Leave it alone and it becomes inactive on its own, after which deleting it changes nothing.":"署名は停止しましたが、チェーンはまだ公開されているため、ワークロードは以前に発行された認証情報の検証をこのチェーンに依存しています。今すぐ削除するとチェーンが即座に削除され、それらの認証情報が機能しなくなります。そのままにしておくと、チェーンは自動的に非アクティブになり、その後に削除しても何も変わりません。","Item moved from position {{initialPosition}} to position {{finalPosition}} of {{total}}":"項目が、全 {{total}} 個中の{{initialPosition}} 番目から {{finalPosition}} 番目へ移動しました。","JSON copied":"JSON がコピーされました",JWKS:jMt,"JWKS popover":"kid によって選択されたすべてのライブ署名キー。AWS は、署名が切り替わる前に、ここで新しいキーを発行します。","JWT Outbound signers column Signing algorithm":"署名アルゴリズム","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key":"キーアルゴリズム","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key issue time":"以降の現在のキー署名","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key popover":"AWS はキーを生成して独自のスケジュールでローテーションし、署名を開始する前に新しいキーを JWKS に公開します。アルゴリズムはローテーション全体で同じままであるため、JWKS を読み取る検証者はユーザー側で変更する必要はありません。","JWT Outbound signers desc":"署名済みトークンを検証するシステムの JWT-SVID に署名します。","JWT Outbound signers label oidc discovery":"OIDC 検出","JWT Outbound signers label oidc discovery popover":"標準の検出ドキュメント。ほとんどの検証者はこの URL からキーを検索するため、必要な URL はこれだけです。","JWT Outbound signers label oidc issuer":"OIDC 発行者","JWT Outbound signers label oidc issuer popover":"ここで署名されたすべての JWT-SVID の iss クレーム。発行者をピン留めする検証者は、この値をピン留めします。","JWT Outbound signers section title":"トークン検証情報","JWT Outbound signers status":"AWS が提供するデフォルト","JWT Outbound signers title":"JWT 署名者",Key:"キー","Learn about organization providers":"組織プロバイダーの詳細","Learn about organization providers (opens in a new tab)":"組織プロバイダーの詳細 (新しいタブで開く)","Learn more":"詳細はこちら","Learn more about deleting a provider (opens in a new tab)":"プロバイダーの削除の詳細 (新しいタブで開く)","Learn more:":"詳細はこちら:","Less than":"次より小さい","Less than or equal":"次の値以下","Let other accounts or principals in your organization create templates and identities under this provider, within the path prefixes you choose.":"組織内の他のアカウントまたはプリンシパルが、選択したパスプレフィックス内で、このプロバイダーの下にテンプレートと ID を作成できるようにします。","Let workloads reach non-AWS resources":"ワークロードが AWS 以外のリソースに到達できるようにする","Letters, digits, . - _ with a single / between parts. No / at the start or end.":"文字、数字、. - _ を使用し、パート間は 1 つの / で区切ります。先頭および末尾に / は使用できません。","Letters, digits, . - _ with a single / between parts. No / at the start or end. Cannot be changed later.":"文字、数字、. - _ を使用し、パート間は 1 つの / で区切ります。先頭および末尾に / は使用できません。後で変更することはできません。","Light themes":"ライトテーマ","Ln {{row}}, Col {{column}}":"行 {{row}}、列 {{column}}\n        ","Loading certificate authorities":"認証機関をロード中","Loading code editor":"コードエディタのロード中","Loading tag keys":"タグキーをロード中","Loading tag values":"タグ値をロード中","Loading tags that are associated with this resource":"このリソースに関連付けられているタグを読み込んでいます","Loading your organization's providers":"組織のプロバイダーをロード中","Make sure the new certificate authority uses the same algorithm as the current signer, {{algorithm}}. If you choose a different algorithm, you need to disable this signer, delete its certificates, then enable it again with the new authority.":"新しい認証機関が現在の署名者 {{algorithm}} と同じアルゴリズムを使用していることを確認してください。別のアルゴリズムを選択した場合は、この署名者を無効にし、証明書を削除してから、新しい認証機関で再度有効にする必要があります。","Manage CAs and replication in the AWS Private CA console":"AWS Private CA コンソールで CA とレプリケーションを管理する","Manage tags":"タグの管理","Manage the provider":"プロバイダーを管理する","Manual creation":"手動作成","Manually create":"手動作成","Matching workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.":"一致するワークロードは、規模にかかわらず起動時に独自の識別名を取得します。","Maximum 1,000 characters.":"最大 1,000 文字です。","Maximum 255 characters.":"最大 255 文字です。","Member accounts":"メンバーアカウント","Member accounts can add their own templates, namespaced by account ID.":"メンバーアカウントは、アカウント ID で名前空間化された独自のテンプレートを追加できます。","Member accounts cannot add their own templates.":"メンバーアカウントは独自のテンプレートを追加できません。","Minimum signing delay":"最小署名遅延","Moving item to position {{currentPosition}} of {{total}}":"{{currentPosition}}/{{total}} の位置に項目を移動しています","Multiple EKS clusters":"複数の EKS クラスター",Name:"名前","Name must be 128 characters or less.":"名前は 128 文字以下である必要があります。","Name this identity":"この ID に名前を付ける","Name this provider":"このプロバイダーに名前を付ける","Name values":"名前の値","Names identities automatically as workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.":"ワークロードの開始時に ID に自動的に名前を付けるため、ID を 1 つずつ作成または管理する必要はありません。","Naming scheme":"命名スキーム",New:"新規","Next month":"来月","Next page":"次のページ","Next step":"次のステップ","No attestation policy set. Define one so a workload can run as this identity.":"アテステーションポリシーが設定されていません。ワークロードがこの ID として実行できるように定義してください。","No attestation policy. No workload will be issued workload identities from this template until you add one.":"アテステーションポリシーがありません。 ポリシーを追加するまで、このテンプレートからワークロード ID はワークロードに発行されません。","No by default, but can add a policy":"デフォルトではいいえ。ただし、ポリシーを追加できます。","No certificate authorities in this account":"このアカウントには認証機関がありません","no domain":"ドメインなし","No long-lived secrets":"存続期間の長いシークレットなし","No match found":"一致が見つかりません","No matches":"一致なし","No path segments. Add a fact, condition key, or custom text.":"パスセグメントはありません。ファクト、条件キー、またはカスタムテキストを追加します。","No tags associated with the resource.":"リソースに関連付けられたタグはありません。","No templates added yet":"テンプレートはまだ追加されていません","No workload identity providers":"ワークロード ID プロバイダーなし","No workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.":"このテンプレートに一致するワークロードがないため、ID は生成されません。","No, and cannot be granted":"いいえ、付与できません",None:"なし","None – names are defined by templates or declared individually":"なし – 名前はテンプレートで定義されるか、個別に宣言されます","Not saved: {{keys}}.":"保存されていません: {{keys}}。","Not set":"未設定",Notifications:"通知","Once the attestation policy is removed, matching workloads will not be issued workload identities until you add a policy again.":"アテステーションポリシーを削除すると、ポリシーを再度追加するまで、一致するワークロードにワークロード ID は発行されません。","One bundle per provider, and one URL. It carries every authority the provider publishes: both outbound signers, and during an update both the current and incoming certificate authority, which is what lets verifiers accept either one through the handover. Your own AWS workloads get these keys automatically; send this to systems outside AWS.":"プロバイダーごとに一つのバンドルと一つの URL が割り当てられます。このバンドルには、プロバイダーが公開するすべての認証局が含まれます。アウトバウンド署名者の両方、および更新中は現在の認証機関と新しい認証機関の両方が含まれるため、検証者はハンドオーバーを通じていずれかを受け入れることができます。AWS ワークロードはこれらのキーを自動的に取得します。AWS 外のシステムにはこの URL を送信してください。","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level providers.":"組織レベルのプロバイダーを削除できるのは、管理アカウントまたは委任管理者のみです。","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level templates.":"組織レベルのテンプレートを削除できるのは、管理アカウントまたは委任された管理者のみです。","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level workload identities.":"組織レベルのワークロード ID を削除できるのは、管理アカウントまたは委任管理者のみです。","Opens in a new tab":"新しいタブで開く",Operator:"演算子",Operators:"演算子",optional:WMt,or:"または","Organization provider":"組織プロバイダー","Organization scoped":"組織スコープ","Organize the provider and track its cost with tags.":"タグを使用してプロバイダーを整理し、コストを追跡してください。","Other accounts in your organization":"組織内の他のアカウント","Other condition keys":"その他の条件キー","Outbound signer":"アウトバウンド署名者","Outbound signers page desc":"ワークロードが AWS 外のサービスに対して自身のアイデンティティを証明できるようにします。このプロバイダーは、ワークロードが提示するトークンと証明書に署名します。","Outbound signers page title":"アウトバウンド署名者","Owning account":"所有アカウント","Page {{pageNumber}} of all pages":"全ページ中 {{pageNumber}} ページ目",path:"パス",Path:"パス","path from templates":"テンプレートからのパス","Path is the per-workload part of an identity name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts a workload proves.":"パスは、ID 名のワークロードごとの部分です。ワークロードが証明した事実から実行時に入力されます。","Path must be 255 characters or less.":"パスは 255 文字以下である必要があります。","Path pattern":"パスパターン","Path prefix":"パスプレフィックス","Path prefix must be 64 characters or less.":"パスのプレフィックスは 64 文字以下でなければなりません。","Path values":"パスの値","Picked up item at position {{position}} of {{total}}":"全 {{total}} 個中の {{position}} 番目にある項目を選択しました","Policy details":"ポリシーの詳細","Policy: Define how a workload attests to get the identity":"ポリシー: ワークロードが ID を取得するための証明方法を定義する",Preferences:qMt,"Press space or enter to activate drag, use arrow keys to move, then press space or enter to confirm":"[Space] または [Enter] を押してドラッグをアクティブ化し、矢印キーで移動して、[Space] または [Enter] を押して確定します。",Preview:UMt,"Previous CA":"以前の CA","Previous certificates ({{certificateCount}})":"以前の証明書 ({{certificateCount}})","Previous month":"前月","Previous page":"前のページ",Properties:VMt,Property:HMt,Provided:KMt,Provider:GMt,"Provider {{providerName}} deleted.":"プロバイダー {{providerName}} が削除されました。","Provider name":"プロバイダー名","Provider name must be 128 characters or less.":"プロバイダー名は 128 文字以下にする必要があります。","Provider not deleted":"プロバイダーは削除されませんでした","Provider not found":"プロバイダーが見つかりません","Provider overview":"プロバイダーの概要","Provider selection":"プロバイダーの選択","Provider settings":"プロバイダー設定","Provider values":"プロバイダーの値",Providers:YMt,"Providers to issue workload identities":"ワークロード ID を発行するプロバイダー","Quick create":"クイック作成","Quick create makes an RSA 2048 certificate authority in AWS Private CA in your account, which has its own charges. The algorithm is fixed and cannot be changed later without setting the signer up again.":"クイック作成では、アカウントの AWS Private CA に RSA 2048 認証機関が作成されます。これには別途料金がかかります。アルゴリズムは固定されており、署名者を再設定しない限り後から変更することはできません。",Ready:JMt,Recommended:"推奨","Recommended for most workloads":"ほとんどのワークロードに推奨",Refresh:"更新","Refresh certificate authorities":"認証機関を更新","Refresh certificate signer status":"証明書署名者のステータスを更新する",Remove:"削除","Remove {{name}}":"{{name}} を削除","Remove attestation policy":"アテステーションポリシーを削除する","Remove cluster ARN":"クラスター ARN を削除する","Remove condition":"条件を削除","Remove filter {{filter}}":"フィルター {{filter}} を削除","Remove governance policy?":"ガバナンスポリシーを削除しますか?","Remove tag {{key}}":"タグ {{key}} を削除","Removed tags were not saved":"削除されたタグは保存されませんでした","Reorder {{name}}":"{{name}} の並べ替え","Reordering canceled":"並べ替えをキャンセルしました","Required for service mesh providers.":"サービスメッシュプロバイダーに必須です。","Required for service mesh providers. A service mesh provider is scoped to the account that runs the EKS cluster.":"サービスメッシュプロバイダーに必須です。サービスメッシュプロバイダーは、EKS クラスターを実行するアカウントにスコープされます。","Reset to default":"デフォルトにリセット","Resize handle":"サイズ変更ハンドル","Resolved example:":"解決済みの例:","Restricted by":"制限される要因",Retry:"再試行","Review the tags and save again.":"タグを確認して、もう一度保存してください。","Running a service mesh, such as Istio? It needs its own provider, one per cluster.":"Istio などのサービスメッシュを実行していますか。クラスターごとに 1 つ、専用のプロバイダーが必要です。",Save:"保存","Save changes":"変更を保存","Save or cancel your edits before creating templates.":"テンプレートを作成する前に、編集を保存またはキャンセルしてください。","Save or cancel your edits before creating the provider.":"プロバイダーを作成する前に、編集を保存またはキャンセルしてください。","Save or cancel your template edits to change the scope.":"テンプレートの編集を保存またはキャンセルして、スコープを変更します。",scheme:ZMt,Scheme:XMt,"scheme and trust domain":"スキームと信頼ドメイン","Scheme sets the format this provider uses to name identities.":"スキームは、このプロバイダーが ID の命名に使用する形式を設定します。",Scope:QMt,"Scope sets which accounts are allowed to use this provider.":"スコープは、このプロバイダーを使用できるアカウントを設定します。","Scope values":"スコープの値","Search tags":"タグを検索","Segment that partitions identities.":"ID を分割するセグメント。","Select {{name}}":"{{name}} を選択","Select a row to delete.":"削除する行を選択します。",Set:"設定","Set a naming pattern":"命名パターンを設定する","Set an attestation rule":"アテステーションルールを設定する","Set by your provider.":"プロバイダーによって設定されます。","Set the naming format and usage scope that every workload identity from this provider inherits.":"このプロバイダーのすべてのワークロード ID が継承する命名形式と使用範囲を設定します。","Set the unique path pattern that every workload identity generated by this template follows. Cannot be changed later.":"このテンプレートによって生成されるすべてのワークロード ID が従う一意のパスパターンを設定します。後で変更することはできません。","Set up a provider to hold the templates that generate identity names, the identities you declare directly, and the signers that sign credentials for systems outside AWS.":"ID 名を生成するテンプレート、直接宣言する ID、および AWS 外部のシステムの認証情報に署名する署名者を保持するプロバイダーを設定します。","Set up a service mesh provider for this account":"このアカウントのサービスメッシュプロバイダーを設定する","Set up a way to issue workload identities":"ワークロード ID を発行する方法を設定する","Set up for your use cases":"ユースケース用にセットアップする","Sets your trust domain, the start of every identity name.":"すべての ID 名の先頭となる信頼ドメインを設定します。","Setting up the certificate authority stopped. You can continue from where it left off.":"認証機関の設定が停止しました。中断した箇所から続行できます。","Settings from your provider {{providerName}}":"お使いのプロバイダー {{providerName}} の設定","Short-lived credentials renew automatically and follow the SPIFFE standard, so they work with service meshes like Istio and with SaaS applications.":"存続期間の短い認証情報は自動的に更新され、SPIFFE 標準に従っているため、Istio などのサービスメッシュや SaaS アプリケーションと連携できます。","Show all {{errorCount}} errors":"{{errorCount}} 件のエラーをすべて表示","Show fewer":"少なく表示","Show more":"さらに表示","Signing algorithm":"署名アルゴリズム","Signing resumes immediately, because this certificate is still published in the trust bundle.":"この証明書は信頼バンドルに公開されているため、署名はすぐに再開されます。","Signing start time":"署名開始時刻","Some templates could not be loaded":"一部のテンプレートを読み込めませんでした","Something went wrong":"エラーが発生しました","Sortable path segment":"ソート可能なパスセグメント",Status:ezt,"Status bar":"ステータスバー","Stop access you granted to this identity name from working":"この ID 名に付与したアクセスが機能しなくなる","Stop access you granted to those identity names from working":"これらの ID 名に付与したアクセスを無効にする","Stop matching workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request":"一致するワークロードが ID を取得するのを停止し、次のリクエストで失敗するようにします","Stop the identities it generated from resolving":"生成した ID の解決を停止する","Stop the workload running as this identity, so it fails on its next request":"この ID として実行中のワークロードを停止し、次のリクエストで失敗させる","Stopped signing and no longer in the trust bundle, so nothing verifies against them. Deleting one is safe.":"署名が停止し、信頼バンドルに含まれなくなったため、これらに対して検証されるものはありません。削除しても安全です。",Subject:"件名",Success:"成功","Tag keys could not be retrieved":"タグキーを取得できませんでした","Tag values could not be retrieved":"タグ値を取得できませんでした",Tags:"タグ","Tags could not be loaded":"タグをロードできませんでした","Tags for {{name}} have been updated.":"{{name}} のタグが更新されました。","Tags not saved":"タグは保存されていません",Template:tzt,'Template "{{templateId}}" not found.':"テンプレート 「{{templateId}}」が見つかりません。","Template {{name}}: {{reason}}":"テンプレート {{name}}: {{reason}}","Template {{templateName}} deleted.":"テンプレート {{templateName}} が削除されました。","Template {{templateNames}} created.":"テンプレート {{templateNames}} が作成されました。","Template name":"テンプレート名","Template name must be 128 characters or less.":"テンプレート名は 128 文字以下にする必要があります。","Template name values":"テンプレート名の値","Template: {{name}}":"テンプレート: {{name}}",Templates:azt,"Templates ({{total}})":"テンプレート ({{total}})","Templates are being created. Wait for the request to finish.":"テンプレートを作成中です。リクエストが完了するまでお待ちください。","Templates give matching workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.":"テンプレートを使用すると、一致するワークロードに独自の識別名が自動的に付与されます。各ワークロードは、このプロバイダーの名前のプレフィックス、パス、およびパターンを使用します。","Templates that member accounts created under this provider are not visible here and cannot be deleted from this account. If any exist, deleting the provider fails.":"このプロバイダーのもとでメンバーアカウントが作成したテンプレートはここには表示されず、このアカウントから削除することもできません。該当するものが存在する場合、プロバイダーの削除は失敗します。","Templates: {{reason}}":"テンプレート: {{reason}}","The account that owns the certificate authority.":"認証機関を所有するアカウント。","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it.":"証明ポリシーは、このプロバイダーによる ID の発行方法を制御します。ワークロードは、ワークロードをホストするサービスが保証するタイプ、詳細、実行場所など、すべての条件を満たす必要があります。","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.":"証明ポリシーは、このプロバイダーによる ID の発行方法を制御します。ワークロードは、ワークロードをホストするサービスが保証するタイプ、詳細、実行場所など、すべての条件を満たす必要があります。後で編集できます。","The attestation policy controls which workloads get an identity from this provider. A workload must meet every condition, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. It's generated from the EKS clusters you entered. You can edit it later.":"証明ポリシーは、どのワークロードがこのプロバイダーから ID を取得するかを制御します。ワークロードがすべての条件を満たしていることを、そのワークロードをホストするサービスが保証する必要があります。このポリシーは入力した EKS クラスター情報から生成され、後から編集可能です。","The attestation policy lists the facts a workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so a workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.":"アテステーションポリシーには、このプロバイダーが ID を発行する前にワークロードが証明する必要がある事実が列挙されています。コンピューティングプラットフォームがそれらを保証するため、ワークロードは自身のものではない ID を要求できません。","The attester vouches for the workload, and it must match every condition to run as this identity.":"認証者はワークロードを保証するものであり、この ID として実行するには、すべての条件に一致する必要があります。","The certificate authority is still being set up.":"認証機関はまだセットアップ中です。","The ID at the end of the certificate authority's ARN in AWS Private CA.":"AWS Private CA の認証機関の ARN の末尾にある ID。","The identity name is the provider's naming scheme, a path prefix, and a path pattern.":"ID 名は、プロバイダーの命名スキーム、パスプレフィックス、およびパスパターンで構成されます。","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag key is 128.":"タグキーで使用できる最大文字数は 128 です。","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag value is 256.":"タグ値に使用できる最大文字数は 256 です。","The path can be up to {{maxLength}} characters.":"パスは最大 {{maxLength}} 文字まで使用できます。","The path doesn't support these segments: {{segments}}. Remove them, and add what you need from the following cards.":"パスは次のセグメントをサポートしていません: {{segments}}。これらを削除し、次のカードから必要なものを追加します。","The path is already the default.":"パスはすでにデフォルトです。","The path is the per-workload part of each identity's name. Keep the Region in front so names stay unique across accounts and Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.":"パスは、各 ID の名前のワークロード別の部分です。アカウントとリージョン全体にわたって名前が一意になるように、リージョンを先頭に配置するか、チームの命名規則に合わせてセグメントを並べ替えてください。","The path prefixes your policy allows":"ポリシーが許可するパスプレフィックス","The permissions defined in this policy for <b>{{providerName}}</b> stop applying.":"このポリシーで定義されている <b>{{providerName}}</b> のアクセス許可は適用されなくなります。","The provider could not be deleted. Try again.":"プロバイダーを削除できませんでした。もう一度試してください。","The provider is being created. Wait for the request to finish.":"プロバイダーを作成中です。リクエストが完了するまでお待ちください。","The provider might still be deleted. Check the providers list later.":"プロバイダーは削除される可能性があります。後でプロバイダーリストを確認してください。","The resource policy on this provider controls who can associate templates with it.":"このプロバイダーのリソースポリシーは、テンプレートを関連付けることができるユーザーを制御します。","The soonest the new certificate can take over. It publishes to the trust bundle first, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. Signing may start later than this, never sooner.":"新しい証明書が署名を引き継げる最も早い時刻です。最初に信頼バンドルに発行されるため、その証明書で署名される前にすべての検証者が確認できます。署名はこの時刻以降に開始され、それより前に開始されることはありません。","The soonest this certificate can start signing. It publishes to the trust bundle first, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. Signing may start later than this, never sooner.":"この証明書が署名を開始できる最も早い時刻です。最初に信頼バンドルに発行されるため、すべての検証者がその証明書で署名される前に確認できます。署名はこの時刻以降に開始され、それより前に開始されることはありません。",Theme:"テーマ","There was an error loading the code editor.":"コードエディタの読み込み中にエラーが発生しました。","These clusters set the template's <policyLink>attestation policy</policyLink>.":"これらのクラスターによりテンプレートの <policyLink> 証明ポリシー </policyLink> が設定されます。","These resources need to be deleted before deleting the provider.":"これらのリソースは、プロバイダーを削除する前に削除する必要があります。","This account ({{accountId}})":"このアカウント ({{accountId}})","This action deletes the workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.":"このアクションにより、ワークロード ID プロバイダー <b>{{providerName}}</b> が削除されます。","This cannot be undone, and creating a provider with the same name later does not restore anything. To proceed, complete the steps below.":"この操作は元に戻すことができません。後で同じ名前のプロバイダーを作成しても、何も復元されません。続行するには、以下の手順を実行します。","This cannot be undone, and the path this template reserved stays reserved. No future template can generate identities under it.":"これは元に戻すことができません。このテンプレートが予約したパスは予約されたままになります。今後のテンプレートでは、このパス配下で ID を生成することはできません。","This cannot be undone, and this name stays reserved. It is never issued again, so you cannot recreate this identity under the same name.":"これは元に戻すことができません。この名前は予約されたままになります。この名前は二度と発行されないため、同じ名前でこの ID を再作成することはできません。","This certificate authority uses {{caAlgorithm}}. Rotation keeps the signer's {{signerAlgorithm}} algorithm, so choose a {{signerAlgorithm}} certificate authority instead.":"この認証機関は {{caAlgorithm}} を使用します。ローテーションは署名者の {{signerAlgorithm}} アルゴリズムを維持するため、代わりに {{signerAlgorithm}} 認証機関を選択してください。","This certificate has left the trust bundle, so it publishes again first. Signing starts after about {{hours}} hour, once every region has it.":"この証明書は信頼バンドルから削除されたため、最初に再発行されます。すべてのリージョンに配布されてから約 {{hours}} 時間後に署名が開始されます。","This certificate has left the trust bundle, so it publishes again first. Signing starts after about {{hours}} hours, once every region has it.":"この証明書は信頼バンドルから削除されているため、最初に再発行されます。署名は約 {{hours}} 時間後に開始され、すべてのリージョンに配布された後に開始されます。","This certificate is validating, so deleting it stops verification immediately":"この証明書は検証中であるため、削除するとすぐに検証が停止します","This certificate stopped signing and its chain has left the trust bundle, so nothing verifies against it. It stays listed as history until you delete it, and deleting it is safe: no credential depends on it, and the certificate signer keeps signing.":"この証明書は署名を停止し、そのチェーンは信頼バンドルから削除されているため、この証明書に対して検証されるものはありません。削除するまで履歴として一覧表示されますが、削除しても安全です。認証情報はこの証明書に依存しておらず、証明書署名者は引き続き署名を行います。","This cluster is already listed.":"このクラスターは既に一覧に存在します。","This condition key and operator combination already exists":"この条件キーと演算子の組み合わせはすでに存在します。","This doesn't look like a valid EKS cluster ARN. An invalid ARN will leave workloads in that cluster without an identity.":"有効な EKS クラスター ARN ではないようです。ARN が無効な場合、そのクラスター内のワークロードは ID を取得できません。","This management account and delegated administrators":"この管理アカウントと委任管理者","This organization ({{organizationId}})":"この組織 ({{organizationId}})","This policy's cluster ARNs don't match the clusters you entered. Changing the clusters won't update this policy. Continue only if that's intended.":"このポリシーのクラスター ARN が、入力したクラスターと一致していません。クラスターを変更してもこのポリシーは更新されません。意図している場合のみ続行してください。","This provider has no naming scheme, so the path you enter is the full identity name.":"このプロバイダーには命名スキームがないため、入力するパスが完全な ID 名になります。","This provider names every identity using the open standard.":"このプロバイダーは、オープンスタンダードを使用してすべての ID に名前を付けます。","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. Both certificates below stop, including the one still in transition, so the update does not complete. Both stay configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"このプロバイダーはすぐに X.509-SVID の発行を停止し、クライアント証明書を必要とするワークロードは次のリクエストで失敗し始めます。以下の証明書は両方とも停止します。移行中のものも含まれるため、更新は完了しません。両方とも設定されたままになります。すでに発行された証明書は約 12 時間検証を継続し、[有効化] により署名が再開されます。","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"このプロバイダーはすぐに X.509-SVID の発行を停止し、クライアント証明書を必要とするワークロードは次のリクエストで失敗し始めます。以下の証明書は引き続き設定されます。すでに発行された証明書は約 12 時間検証を継続し、[有効化] により署名が再開されます。","This provider's policy doesn't allow this path prefix \"{{pathPrefix}}\" for your account. Ask your organization administrator which path prefixes are permitted.":"このプロバイダーのポリシーでは、アカウントに対してパスプレフィックス「{{pathPrefix}} 」を許可していません。許可されているパスプレフィックスについては、組織の管理者に問い合わせてください。","This removes the certificate from the provider and pulls its chain from the trust bundle immediately. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"これにより、プロバイダーから証明書が削除され、そのチェーンが信頼バンドルから即座に削除されます。認証機関自体は AWS Private CA に残り、変更されません。","This removes the certificate from the provider. Its chain already left the trust bundle, so nothing that is verifying today changes. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"これにより、プロバイダーから証明書が削除されます。そのチェーンはすでに信頼バンドルから削除されているため、現在検証中の内容は変更されません。認証機関自体は AWS Private CA にそのまま残ります。","This tag will be removed upon saving changes":"このタグは、変更を保存すると削除されます","This usually takes a few minutes. Keep this page open until it finishes.":"これには通常数分かかります。完了するまでこのページを開いたままにしてください。",Today:"今日","Too many requests":"リクエストが多すぎます","Trace and control access per workload":"ワークロードごとのアクセスをトレースして制御する","Trust bundle":"トラストバンドル","trust domain":"信頼ドメイン","Trust domain":"信頼ドメイン","Trust domain is the root of trust for the SPIFFE naming scheme. It is a logical name that follows DNS naming style, for example prod.acme.com, but does not need to match a real DNS record.":"信頼ドメインは、SPIFFE 命名スキームの信頼のルートです。これは、prod.acme.com などの DNS 命名スタイルに従う論理名ですが、実際の DNS レコードと一致する必要はありません。","Try again. If the problem continues, contact AWS Support.":"もう一度試してください。問題が解決しない場合は、AWS サポートにお問い合わせください。","Unable to load templates":"テンプレートを読み込めません。",Undo:nzt,"Up to 128 characters. Must be unique per provider.":"最大 128 文字。プロバイダーごとに一意である必要があります。","Up to 128 characters. Use alphanumeric and '-_.' characters. Must be unique in your organization. Can't be changed after the provider is created.":"最大 128 文字です。英数字および -_. 記号を使用してください。組織内で一意の名前にする必要があります。プロバイダーの作成後は変更できません。","Up to 128 characters. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters. Must be unique per provider.":"最大 128 文字です。英数字および '-_' 文字を使用してください。プロバイダーごとに一意である必要があります。",Update:"更新","Update certificate signer":"証明書署名者の更新",'Use "{{key}}"':"「{{key}}」を使用",'Use "{{value}}"':"「{{value}}」を使用","Use case":"ユースケース","Use cases":"ユースケース","Use default templates":"デフォルトのテンプレートを使用する","Use letters, digits, and . - _ characters, with a single / between parts. No / at the start or end, and a part can't be . or ..":"文字、数字、および . - _ を使用し、パート間は 1 つの / で区切ります。先頭および末尾に / は使用できません。また、1 つのパートを . または .. にすることはできません。","Use one from another account":"別のアカウントから使用する","Use only Latin letters, numbers, spaces, tabs, line breaks, and standard keyboard symbols.":"ラテン文字、数字、スペース、タブ、改行、標準キーボード記号のみを使用してください。","Use only letters, digits, - and _ characters.":"英字、数字、- および _ の文字のみを使用してください。","Use only letters, digits, . - and _ characters. The path can't be . or ..":"使用できる文字は、英数字、.、-、_ のみです。パスを . または .. にすることはできません。","Use only letters, digits, periods (.), hyphens (-), and underscores (_).":"英字、数字、ピリオド (.)、ハイフン (-)、アンダースコア (_) のみを使用してください。","Use the workload identity in trust policies, resource policies, or SCPs. Each call is recorded in CloudTrail with the workload's identity.":"信頼ポリシー、リソースポリシー、または SCP でワークロード ID を使用します。各呼び出しは、ワークロードの ID とともに CloudTrail に記録されます。",'Use: "{{text}}"':"{{text}} を使用","Used as the common name in the certificate authority's subject.":"認証機関のサブジェクトのコモンネームとして使用されます。",Validating:"検証中","Validating: stopped signing, still trusted":"検証中: 署名停止、信頼は継続",Value:"値","Value must be 256 characters or less.":"値は 256 文字以下にする必要があります。",Values:"値","View all":"すべて表示","View all notifications":"すべての通知を表示","View JSON":"JSON を表示",Visual:izt,Warning:"警告",Warnings:"警告","What gets created":"作成されるもの","Which EKS clusters is this provider for?":"このプロバイダーはどの EKS クラスター向けですか？",'Wildcard "*" is only allowed with the StringLike, StringNotLike, ArnLike, or ArnNotLike operators.':'ワイルドカード "*" は、StringLike、StringNotLike、ArnLike、または ArnNotLike 演算子でのみ使用できます。',"Without a policy, no other account can create templates under this provider, though delegated administrators can already create both. Add a statement for each account, organizational unit, or IAM principal that should be able to, and limit each one to a path prefix.":"ポリシーがない場合、このプロバイダーの下にテンプレートを作成できる他のアカウントはありませんが、委任された管理者は両方を既に作成できます。実行できるアカウント、組織単位、または IAM プリンシパルごとにステートメントを追加し、それぞれをパスプレフィックスに制限します。","Workload identities ({{total}})":"ワークロード ID ({{total}})","Workload identities in the IAM User Guide":"IAM ユーザーガイドのワークロード ID","Workload identities in the IAM User Guide (opens in a new tab)":"IAM ユーザーガイドのワークロード ID (新しいタブで開く)","Workload identities: {{reason}}":"ワークロード ID: {{reason}}","Workload identity":"ワークロード ID","Workload Identity":"ワークロード ID","Workload identity {{name}}: {{reason}}":"ワークロード ID {{name}}: {{reason}}","Workload identity {{workloadIdentifier}} deleted.":"ワークロード ID {{workloadIdentifier}} が削除されました。","Workloads get named automatically":"ワークロードには自動的に名前が付けられます。","Workloads in these EKS clusters can get an identity from this provider, when all of these are true:":" 以下の条件をすべて満たす場合、これらの EKS クラスター内のワークロードはこのプロバイダーから ID を取得できます。","Workloads running in these clusters can get an identity from this provider. Add 2 or more.":"これらのクラスターで実行するワークロードは、このプロバイダーから ID を取得できます。2 つ以上追加してください。","Workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"このアカウントで実行されているワークロードは、{{workloadLabel}} によって検証された情報を使用して、このテンプレートによって生成された ID を使用できます。","Workloads running in this cluster can get an identity from this provider.":"このクラスター上で実行されるワークロードは、このプロバイダーから ID を取得できます。","Workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"組織で実行されているワークロードは、{{workloadLabel}} によって検証された情報を使用して、このテンプレートによって生成された ID を使用できます。","Workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request":"これらの ID を使用するワークロードは、認証情報の発行が停止され、次のリクエストで失敗します。","Workloads, such as agents, pods, and jobs, are verified at runtime and get a workload identity, one per workload, generated by a template. The identity gets fine-grained access to AWS resources through IAM policies and CloudTrail, and signed JWT and X.509 credentials for meshes and SaaS apps.":"エージェント、ポッド、ジョブなどのワークロードはランタイム時に検証され、ワークロードごとに 1 つ、テンプレートによって生成されたワークロード ID が付与されます。この ID は、IAM ポリシーと CloudTrail を通じて AWS リソースへのきめ細かなアクセスを取得し、メッシュと SaaS アプリ向けの署名済み JWT および X.509 認証情報を取得します。","Wrap lines":"行を折り返す","Write a policy to let another account create templates, or to stop a delegated administrator from part of the name space. Each statement names an organizational unit, specific accounts, or individual IAM principals, allows or denies, and can be limited to a path prefix.":"別のアカウントがテンプレートを作成できるようにするか、委任された管理者が名前空間の一部にアクセスできないようにするポリシーを作成します。各ステートメントでは、組織単位、特定のアカウント、または個々の IAM プリンシパルを指定し、許可または拒否を設定でき、パスプレフィックスで制限することもできます。","Yes by default":"デフォルトでは「はい」","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tag.":"最大 {{availableTags}} 個のタグをさらに追加できます。","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tags.":"最大 {{availableTags}} 個のタグをさらに追加できます。","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"タグの数が上限である {{tagLimit}} 個を超えました。","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"タグの上限数である {{tagLimit}} 個を超えました。","You have more keys than can be displayed":"キーの数が表示可能な数を超えています","You have more values than can be displayed":"値の数が表示可能な数を超えています","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"タグの数が上限である {{tagLimit}} 個に達しました。","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"タグの上限数である {{tagLimit}} 個に達しました。","You have unsaved tag changes. Leave this page and discard them?":"タグの変更が保存されていません。このページを離れて変更を破棄しますか。","You must enter a path":"パスを入力する必要があります","You must specify a condition key":"条件キーを指定する必要があります。","You must specify a tag key":"タグキーを指定する必要があります","You must specify a unique tag key.":"一意のタグキーを指定する必要があります。","You must specify a value":"値を指定する必要があります","Your administrator decides which prefixes this account can use. This is checked when you create.":"管理者は、このアカウントで使用できるプレフィックスを決定します。これは作成時に確認されます。","Your identities will be <code>{{prefix}}<em>{{placeholder}}</em></code>":"アイデンティティは <code>{{prefix}}<em>{{placeholder}}</em></code> のようになります","Your organization already has a workload identity provider. Add templates under it to start issuing identities to your workloads — each named under your account's path prefix.":"組織には既にワークロードアイデンティティプロバイダーがあります。その下にテンプレートを追加して、ワークロードへのアイデンティティの発行を開始します。それぞれに、アカウントのパスプレフィックスの下に名前が付けられます。","Your organization has workload identity providers you can use. Pick one and add templates under it to start issuing identities to your workloads.":"組織には、使用できるワークロードアイデンティティプロバイダーがあります。1 つを選択し、その下にテンプレートを追加して、ワークロードへのアイデンティティの発行を開始します。","YYYY/MM/DD":"YYYY/MM/DD","{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.","A declared identity has a fixed name you define. Use one when you need an exact name, for example to match a name another system already expects.":"A declared identity has a fixed name you define. Use one when you need an exact name, for example to match a name another system already expects.","A fact {{workload}} checks when the agent or workload starts.":"A fact {{workload}} checks when the agent or workload starts.","A provider issues secure, verifiable identities to your agents and workloads, like your Kubernetes pods or AI agents, to access AWS and third-party services without long-lived credentials.":"A provider issues secure, verifiable identities to your agents and workloads, like your Kubernetes pods or AI agents, to access AWS and third-party services without long-lived credentials.","A template automatically generates an identity for each matching agent or workload under {{providerName}}.":"A template automatically generates an identity for each matching agent or workload under {{providerName}}.","A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued.":"A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued.","A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued. Decide how this provider issues identities - starting from the <link>default templates</link> for common use cases, or skipping them. Templates are optional and can be added later.":"A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued. Decide how this provider issues identities - starting from the <link>default templates</link> for common use cases, or skipping them. Templates are optional and can be added later.","A template names identities automatically as matching agents and workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.":"A template names identities automatically as matching agents and workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.","A template with no attestation policy matches no agent or workload, so nothing is ever issued from it. Set a policy to define which agents and workloads qualify.":"A template with no attestation policy matches no agent or workload, so nothing is ever issued from it. Set a policy to define which agents and workloads qualify.","A template's path pattern, built from facts like cluster, namespace, and service account, names each agent or workload automatically when it starts. You don't create identities ahead of time.":"A template's path pattern, built from facts like cluster, namespace, and service account, names each agent or workload automatically when it starts. You don't create identities ahead of time.","Add a fact or condition key. A path of only custom text would give every agent or workload the same name.":"Add a fact or condition key. A path of only custom text would give every agent or workload the same name.","Add an {{conditionKey}} condition, so only agents or workloads in these clusters get an identity.":"Add an {{conditionKey}} condition, so only agents or workloads in these clusters get an identity.","Add attestation policy":"Add attestation policy","Add templates after the provider is created.":"Add templates after the provider is created.","Agent and workload identity":"Agent and workload identity","Agent and workload identity - <em>Preview</em>":"Agent and workload identity - <em>Preview</em>","Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide":"Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide","Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide (opens in a new tab)":"Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide (opens in a new tab)","Agents and workloads get named automatically":"Agents and workloads get named automatically","Agents and workloads get short-lived credentials that renew automatically and follow the SPIFFE standard, so they work with service meshes such as Istio and with business applications.":"Agents and workloads get short-lived credentials that renew automatically and follow the SPIFFE standard, so they work with service meshes such as Istio and with business applications.","Agents and workloads in these EKS clusters can get an identity from this provider, when all of these are true:":"Agents and workloads in these EKS clusters can get an identity from this provider, when all of these are true:","Agents and workloads running in these clusters can get an identity from this provider. Add two or more.":"Agents and workloads running in these clusters can get an identity from this provider. Add two or more.","Agents and workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Agents and workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.","Agents and workloads running in this cluster can get an identity from this provider.":"Agents and workloads running in this cluster can get an identity from this provider.","Agents and workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Agents and workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.","Agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request":"Agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request","Agents and workloads, such as AI agents and pods, are verified at runtime and each gets its own identity, generated by a template. The identity gets fine-grained access to AWS resources through IAM policies and CloudTrail, and signed JWT and X.509 credentials for meshes and apps.":"Agents and workloads, such as AI agents and pods, are verified at runtime and each gets its own identity, generated by a template. The identity gets fine-grained access to AWS resources through IAM policies and CloudTrail, and signed JWT and X.509 credentials for meshes and apps.","All templates and identities under this provider will be deleted":"All templates and identities under this provider will be deleted","An AI agent or workload gets an identity that is unique.":"An AI agent or workload gets an identity that is unique.","An identity with no attestation policy admits no workload, so nothing can run as it. Set a policy to define which workload qualifies.":"An identity with no attestation policy admits no workload, so nothing can run as it. Set a policy to define which workload qualifies.","An identity with this name already exists.":"An identity with this name already exists.","At runtime the platform attests these facts about the agent or workload. Any agent or workload whose attestation carries them gets an identity issued from this template.":"At runtime the platform attests these facts about the agent or workload. Any agent or workload whose attestation carries them gets an identity issued from this template.","Attestation policy for {{name}} has been removed.":"Attestation policy for {{name}} has been removed.","Attestation policy for {{name}} has been updated.":"Attestation policy for {{name}} has been updated.","By continuing, you also enable organization level resource creation, which is needed to create the organization scoped provider. You can disable it later in Settings.":"By continuing, you also enable organization level resource creation, which is needed to create the organization scoped provider. You can disable it later in Settings.","Change the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.":"Change the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.","Choose a stable, unique name that identifies one environment or group of agents and workloads, for example prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal.":"Choose a stable, unique name that identifies one environment or group of agents and workloads, for example prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal.","Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for an agent or workload.":"Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for an agent or workload.","Choose the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.":"Choose the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.","Choose where the workload is hosted":"Choose where the workload is hosted","Choose who can use it":"Choose who can use it","Control what an agent or workload can reach with familiar IAM policies and see its AWS calls in CloudTrail.":"Control what an agent or workload can reach with familiar IAM policies and see its AWS calls in CloudTrail.","Create declared identity":"Create declared identity","Creates an agent and workload identity provider and template for agents and workloads running in one or more EKS clusters under a service mesh, such as Istio.":"Creates an agent and workload identity provider and template for agents and workloads running in one or more EKS clusters under a service mesh, such as Istio.","Creating the identity":"Creating the identity","Declare an identity with the exact name you need":"Declare an identity with the exact name you need","Declared identities":"Declared identities","Declared identity":"Declared identity","Declared identity {{name}} created.":"Declared identity {{name}} created.","Define which agents and workloads are allowed to use this template.":"Define which agents and workloads are allowed to use this template.","Delete the templates under <b>{{providerName}}</b> before deleting the provider. Once deleted, agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials and fail on their next request, and access that you granted to these identities will stop working.":"Delete the templates under <b>{{providerName}}</b> before deleting the provider. Once deleted, agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials and fail on their next request, and access that you granted to these identities will stop working.","Deleting templates and identities":"Deleting templates and identities","Each identity is fully the template path.":"Each identity is fully the template path.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.","Enter a description":"Enter a description","Failed to create the declared identity.":"Failed to create the declared identity.","Failed to save attestation policy.":"Failed to save attestation policy.","Filter declared identities":"Filter declared identities","For example, to match a name another system already expects.":"For example, to match a name another system already expects.","from provider":"from provider","Give AI agents and workloads their own identities. Know which of them made each call. Scope its access with the IAM policies you already use.":"Give AI agents and workloads their own identities. Know which of them made each call. Scope its access with the IAM policies you already use.","Give an agent or workload a unique identity, so you can grant it access and audit what it did rather than sharing one role.":"Give an agent or workload a unique identity, so you can grant it access and audit what it did rather than sharing one role.","Grant access":"Grant access","Grant this name access to resources in IAM policies.":"Grant this name access to resources in IAM policies.","IAM for agents and workloads":"IAM for agents and workloads","IAM for agents and workloads (opens in a new tab)":"IAM for agents and workloads (opens in a new tab)",Identifier:rzt,"Identities ({{total}})":"Identities ({{total}})","Identities are issued at runtime from facts the agent or workload proves, rather than from what an admin assigns.":"Identities are issued at runtime from facts the agent or workload proves, rather than from what an admin assigns.","Identities for agents":"Identities for agents","Identities: {{reason}}":"Identities: {{reason}}","Identity {{name}}: {{reason}}":"Identity {{name}}: {{reason}}","Invalid trust domain. Use lowercase alphanumeric and '-.' characters.":"Invalid trust domain. Use lowercase alphanumeric and '-.' characters.","Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's agents and workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. Standard pricing applies to the creation and use of AWS Private CA.":"Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's agents and workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. Standard pricing applies to the creation and use of AWS Private CA.","It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so agents and workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. To avoid this, wait until it becomes inactive on its own. Deleting it then has no effect on verification.":"It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so agents and workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. To avoid this, wait until it becomes inactive on its own. Deleting it then has no effect on verification.","Let agents and workloads reach non-AWS resources":"Let agents and workloads reach non-AWS resources","Loading declared identities":"Loading declared identities","Matching agents and workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.":"Matching agents and workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.","No agent and workload identity providers":"No agent and workload identity providers","No agent or workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.":"No agent or workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.","No attestation policy attached.":"No attestation policy attached.","No attestation policy. No agent or workload will be issued an identity from this template until you add one.":"No attestation policy. No agent or workload will be issued an identity from this template until you add one.","No conditions. This policy matches every agent or workload of its service.":"No conditions. This policy matches every agent or workload of its service.","No segments yet. Add at least one, or every agent or workload this template matches resolves to the same name.":"No segments yet. Add at least one, or every agent or workload this template matches resolves to the same name.","None – names are defined by templates":"None – names are defined by templates","Nothing can run as this identity":"Nothing can run as this identity","Once the attestation policy is removed, matching agents and workloads will not be issued agent and workload identities until you add a policy again.":"Once the attestation policy is removed, matching agents and workloads will not be issued agent and workload identities until you add a policy again.","One bundle per provider, and one URL. It carries every authority the provider publishes: both outbound signers, and during an update both the current and incoming certificate authority, which is what lets verifiers accept either one through the handover. Your own AWS agents and workloads get these keys automatically; send this to systems outside AWS.":"One bundle per provider, and one URL. It carries every authority the provider publishes: both outbound signers, and during an update both the current and incoming certificate authority, which is what lets verifiers accept either one through the handover. Your own AWS agents and workloads get these keys automatically; send this to systems outside AWS.","One provider and one trust domain shared by every EKS cluster in the mesh. An agent or workload with the same namespace and service account in any of these clusters shares one identity.":"One provider and one trust domain shared by every EKS cluster in the mesh. An agent or workload with the same namespace and service account in any of these clusters shares one identity.","Path is the unique part of each identity's name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts an agent or workload proves.":"Path is the unique part of each identity's name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts an agent or workload proves.","path prefix":"path prefix","Policy: Define how an agent or workload attests to get the identity":"Policy: Define how an agent or workload attests to get the identity","Proven at runtime":"Proven at runtime","Providers to issue agent and workload identities":"Providers to issue agent and workload identities","Scoped, auditable access":"Scoped, auditable access","Search by name":"Search by name","Set the exact name":"Set the exact name","Set the naming format and usage scope that every agent and workload identity from this provider inherits.":"Set the naming format and usage scope that every agent and workload identity from this provider inherits.","Set the unique path pattern that every identity generated by this template follows. Cannot be changed later.":"Set the unique path pattern that every identity generated by this template follows. Cannot be changed later.","Set up a provider to hold the templates that generate identity names and the signers that sign credentials for systems outside AWS.":"Set up a provider to hold the templates that generate identity names and the signers that sign credentials for systems outside AWS.","Set up a way to issue agent and workload identities":"Set up a way to issue agent and workload identities","Set which workloads can use this identity and where they must run.":"Set which workloads can use this identity and where they must run.","Stop matching agents and workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request":"Stop matching agents and workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request","Templates give matching agents and workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.":"Templates give matching agents and workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it.":"The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.":"The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Generated from the EKS clusters above. Can be edited later.":"The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Generated from the EKS clusters above. Can be edited later.","The attestation policy controls how this identity is issued. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.":"The attestation policy controls how this identity is issued. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.","The attestation policy is the set of facts an agent or workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so an agent or workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.":"The attestation policy is the set of facts an agent or workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so an agent or workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.","The certificate chain is distributing to every Region, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. It starts signing at {{at}}. That is the minimum signing delay you set, so signing may start later than this. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.":"The certificate chain is distributing to every Region, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. It starts signing at {{at}}. That is the minimum signing delay you set, so signing may start later than this. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.","The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Account ID and Region in front so names stay unique across accounts and Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.":"The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Account ID and Region in front so names stay unique across accounts and Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.","The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Region in front so names stay unique across Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.":"The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Region in front so names stay unique across Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.","This action deletes the agent and workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.":"This action deletes the agent and workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.","This certificate has stopped signing, but its chain stays in the trust bundle so certificates already issued under it keep verifying. It becomes inactive at {{at}}. Until then, Enable resumes signing with no wait. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.":"This certificate has stopped signing, but its chain stays in the trust bundle so certificates already issued under it keep verifying. It becomes inactive at {{at}}. Until then, Enable resumes signing with no wait. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.","This doesn't look like a valid EKS cluster ARN. An invalid ARN will leave agents or workloads in that cluster without an identity.":"This doesn't look like a valid EKS cluster ARN. An invalid ARN will leave agents or workloads in that cluster without an identity.","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. Both certificates below stop, including the one still in transition, so the update does not complete. Both stay configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. Both certificates below stop, including the one still in transition, so the update does not complete. Both stay configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.","This template issues no identities":"This template issues no identities","Trust domain must be 64 characters or less.":"Trust domain must be 64 characters or less.","Use the agent or workload identity in trust policies, resource policies, or SCPs. CloudTrail records its calls with that identity.":"Use the agent or workload identity in trust policies, resource policies, or SCPs. CloudTrail records its calls with that identity.","What conditions should the agent or workload match?":"What conditions should the agent or workload match?","Where is the agent or workload hosted?":"Where is the agent or workload hosted?","You must enter a name":"You must enter a name","Your organization already has an agent and workload identity provider. Add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads — each named under your account's path prefix.":"Your organization already has an agent and workload identity provider. Add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads — each named under your account's path prefix.","Your organization has agent and workload identity providers you can use. Pick one and add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads.":"Your organization has agent and workload identity providers you can use. Pick one and add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads."},szt=Object.freeze(Object.defineProperty({__proto__:null,ARN:"ARN",Actions:LMt,Active:PMt,Add:"追加",Apply:"適用",Attestation:NMt,Cancel:RMt,Clear:"クリア",Close:"閉じる",Configured:MMt,Confirm:"確認",Contains:zMt,Created:OMt,Delete:"削除",Description:"説明",Details:"詳細",Disable:"無効化",Dismiss:"閉じる",Edit:"編集",Editing:"編集中",Enable:"有効化",Equals:BMt,Errors:"エラー",Format:FMt,Identifier:rzt,Inactive:$Mt,Info:"情報",JWKS:jMt,Key:"キー",Name:"名前",New:"新規",None:"なし",Notifications:"通知",Operator:"演算子",Operators:"演算子",Path:"パス",Preferences:qMt,Preview:UMt,Properties:VMt,Property:HMt,Provided:KMt,Provider:GMt,Providers:YMt,Ready:JMt,Recommended:"推奨",Refresh:"更新",Remove:"削除",Retry:"再試行",Save:"保存",Scheme:XMt,Scope:QMt,Status:ezt,Subject:"件名",Success:"成功",Tags:"タグ",Template:tzt,Templates:azt,Theme:"テーマ",Today:"今日",Undo:nzt,Update:"更新",Validating:"検証中",Value:"値",Values:"値",Visual:izt,Warning:"警告",Warnings:"警告",and:"および",default:ozt,equals:"等しい",optional:WMt,or:"または",path:"パス",scheme:ZMt},Symbol.toStringTag,{value:"Module"})),lzt="세부 정보",czt="비활성화",dzt="편집 중",uzt="JWKS",pzt="선택 사항",hzt="기본 설정",mzt="미리 보기",gzt="제공업체",vzt="새로고침",fzt="실행 취소",yzt="업데이트",bzt="검증 중",wzt="Identifier",kzt={"'{{providerName}}' does not exist in your account":"'{{providerName}}'이(가) 계정에 존재하지 않습니다.","(earliest)":"(가장 이른 시점)","{{addedCount}} tag added or changed":"{{addedCount}}개의 태그 추가 또는 변경됨","{{addedCount}} tags added or changed":"{{addedCount}}개의 태그 추가 또는 변경됨","{{createdCount}} templates created: {{templateNames}}.":"{{createdCount}}개 템플릿이 생성됨: {{templateNames}}.","{{failed}} of {{total}} certificates could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}}/{{total}}개의 인증서를 삭제할 수 없으므로 제공업체가 삭제되지 않았습니다. 오류를 해결한 다음, 다시 시도하세요.","{{failed}} of {{total}} could not be deleted.":"{{failed}}/{{total}}개의 항목을 삭제할 수 없습니다.","{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and workload identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}}/{{total}}개의 템플릿 및 워크로드 ID를 삭제할 수 없어 제공업체가 삭제되지 않았습니다. 오류를 해결한 다음, 다시 시도하세요.","{{failedCount}} template could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.":"{{failedCount}}개 템플릿을 생성할 수 없습니다. 다음 오류를 검토하고 다시 시도하세요.","{{failedCount}} templates could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.":"{{failedCount}}개 템플릿을 생성할 수 없습니다. 다음 오류를 검토하고 다시 시도하세요.","{{identityCount}} identities":"{{identityCount}}개의 ID","{{identityCount}} identity":"{{identityCount}}개의 ID","{{label}} (service mesh)":"{{label}}(서비스 메시)","{{label}} copied":"{{label}} 복사됨","{{label}} failed to copy":"{{label}} 복사 실패","{{label}} template":"{{label}} 템플릿","{{label}} template {{index}}":"{{label}} 템플릿 {{index}}","{{label}}:":"{{label}}:","{{matchCount}} match":"{{matchCount}}개 항목 일치","{{matchCount}} matches":"{{matchCount}}개 항목 일치","{{name}} has been successfully created.":"{{name}}이(가) 생성되었습니다.","{{name}} has been successfully created. However, the following operations failed:":"{{name}}이(가) 성공적으로 생성되었지만. 다음 작업은 실패했습니다.","{{providerName}} still has these resources:":"{{providerName}}에는 여전히 다음과 같은 리소스가 있습니다.","{{removedCount}} tag removed":"{{removedCount}}개의 태그 제거됨","{{removedCount}} tags removed":"{{removedCount}}개의 태그 제거됨","{{scope}} · {{domain}}":"{{scope}} · {{domain}}","{{settled}} of {{total}}":"{{settled}}/{{total}}","{{subject}}. Does not match this signer's {{algorithm}} algorithm.":"{{subject}}. 이 서명자의 {{algorithm}} 알고리즘과 일치하지 않습니다.","{{tagCount}} tag":"{{tagCount}}개의 태그","{{tagCount}} tags":"{{tagCount}}개의 태그","{{templateCount}} template":"{{templateCount}}개 템플릿","{{templateCount}} templates":"{{templateCount}}개의 템플릿","{{templateName}} template failed to create. To try again, <link>add templates</link>. Error details: {{reason}}":"{{templateName}} 템플릿을 생성하지 못했습니다. 다시 시도하려면 <link>템플릿 추가</link>를 클릭하세요. 오류 세부 정보: {{reason}}","{{workload}} fact":"{{workload}} 팩트","{defined by template}":"{defined by template}","<term>Support:</term> Amazon EKS, Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Runtime, and Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Gateway.":"<term>지원:</term> Amazon EKS, Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 런타임 및 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 게이트웨이.","1 EKS cluster":"1개의 EKS 클러스터","1 provider and 1 trust domain per EKS cluster. Each namespace and service account in this cluster gets its own identity, trusted only within this cluster.":"EKS 클러스터당 1개의 제공업체 및 1개의 신뢰 도메인입니다. 이 클러스터의 각 네임스페이스 및 서비스 계정은 이 클러스터 내에서만 신뢰할 수 있는 자체 ID를 가져옵니다.","1 provider and 1 trust domain shared by every EKS cluster in the mesh. A workload with the same namespace and service account in any of these clusters shares one identity.":"메시의 모든 EKS 클러스터에서 공유하는 1개의 제공업체와 1개의 신뢰 도메인입니다. 이러한 클러스터에서 네임스페이스와 서비스 계정이 동일한 워크로드는 하나의 ID를 공유합니다.","1 to 48 hours, in whole hours. Publishing is usually much faster, but can take up to 24 hours.":"1시간~48시간(정수 단위). 게시는 대개 훨씬 빠르지만, 최대 24시간까지 걸릴 수 있습니다.","1. Select all the check boxes to confirm what deleting {{providerName}} will do.":"1. 모든 확인란을 선택하여 {{providerName}}을 삭제하면 어떤 작업이 수행되는지 확인합니다.","2. Confirm that you want to delete this provider by typing {{providerName}} below.":"2. 아래에 {{providerName}}을(를) 입력하여 이 제공업체를 삭제하겠다는 의사를 확인합니다.","A declared identity has a fixed path you define. Use one when you need an exact path, for example to match a value another system already expects.":"선언형 ID는 직접 정의한 고정 경로를 갖습니다. 정확한 경로가 필요한 경우(예: 다른 시스템에서 이미 기대하는 값과 일치시켜야 하는 경우)에 사용하세요.","A deny, and only for delegated administrators":"거부(위임된 관리자만 해당)","A fact {{workload}} checks when the workload starts.":"워크로드가 시작될 때 {{workload}}에서 확인하는 팩트입니다.","A fixed label, such as an environment name.":"환경 이름과 같은 고정 레이블입니다.","A name to identify this identity.":"이 ID를 식별할 이름입니다.","A provider with this name already exists.":"이 이름의 제공업체가 이미 존재합니다.","A tag is a label you assign to an AWS resource. Each tag has a key and an optional value. Use tags to search and filter this provider, or to track your AWS costs.":"태그는 AWS 리소스에 할당하는 레이블입니다. 각 태그는 키와 선택적 값으로 구성됩니다. 태그를 사용하여 이 공급자를 검색 및 필터링하거나 AWS 비용을 추적하세요.","A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts a workload must prove before an identity is issued. Decide how this provider issues identities - starting from the <link>default templates</link> for common use cases, or skipping them. You can add and name identities manually at any time - templates are optional and can be added later.":"템플릿은 ID의 고유한 이름을 지정하는 데 사용되는 경로 패턴과, ID가 발급되기 전에 워크로드가 입증해야 하는 사실을 정의합니다. 이 공급자가 ID를 발급하는 방식을 결정하세요. 일반적인 사용 사례에 맞는 <link>기본 템플릿</link>으로 시작하거나 이를 건너뛸 수 있습니다. ID는 언제든지 수동으로 추가하고 이름을 지정할 수 있습니다. 템플릿은 선택 사항이며 나중에 추가할 수도 있습니다.","A template with this name already exists.":"이 이름의 템플릿이 이미 존재합니다.","A template's path pattern, built from facts like cluster, namespace, and service account, names each workload automatically when it starts. You don't create identities ahead of time.":"클러스터, 네임스페이스, 서비스 계정 등의 정보를 바탕으로 구성된 템플릿의 경로 패턴은 각 워크로드가 시작될 때 자동으로 이름을 지정합니다. 미리 ID를 생성할 필요가 없습니다.","A workload identity provider issues secure, verifiable identities to your workloads, like Kubernetes pods or AI agents. Workloads use them to access AWS and third-party services without long-lived credentials.":"워크로드 ID 제공업체는 Kubernetes 포드나 AI 에이전트와 같은 워크로드에 안전하고 검증 가능한 ID를 발급합니다. 워크로드는 이 ID를 사용하여 장기 유효한 자격 증명 없이도 AWS 및 타사 서비스에 액세스할 수 있습니다.","A workload, including an AI agent or sub-agent created on demand, gets its own identity. No workload shares or inherits another's.":"AI 에이전트나 온디맨드로 생성된 서브 에이전트를 포함한 모든 워크로드는 고유한 ID를 부여받습니다. 어떤 워크로드도 다른 워크로드의 ID를 공유하거나 상속받지 않습니다.","Access a partner API, a SaaS endpoint, or an OIDC service. No setup needed.":"파트너 API, SaaS 엔드포인트 또는 OIDC 서비스에 액세스하세요. 설정은 필요하지 않습니다.","Access a service mesh, a database, or an on-premises system.":"서비스 메시, 데이터베이스 또는 온프레미스 시스템에 액세스하세요.","Access denied":"액세스 거부됨","Access you granted to these identities will stop working":"이 ID에 부여한 액세스 권한이 작동하지 않게 됩니다.","Account scoped":"계정 범위 지정됨",Actions:"작업","Activating it":"활성화",Active:"활성","Active certificate authority ID":"활성 인증 기관 ID","Active: currently signing":"활성: 현재 서명 중",Add:"추가","Add {{label}} template":"{{label}} 템플릿 추가","Add a fact or condition key. A path of only custom text would give every workload the same name.":"팩트 또는 조건 키를 추가하세요. 사용자 지정 텍스트만으로 구성된 경로는 모든 워크로드에 동일한 이름을 지정합니다.","Add an {{conditionKey}} condition, so only workloads in these clusters get an identity.":"{{conditionKey}} 조건을 추가합니다. 이러한 클러스터의 워크로드만 ID를 얻습니다.","Add at least 1 path segment.":"하나 이상의 경로 세그먼트를 추가하세요.","Add at least 1 template to continue.":"계속하려면 하나 이상의 템플릿을 추가하세요.","Add at least 2 clusters.":"2개 이상의 클러스터를 추가하세요.","Add attestation rules":"증명 규칙 추가","Add cluster ARN":"클러스터 ARN 추가","Add condition":"조건 추가","Add default templates for Amazon EKS, AgentCore Runtime, and AgentCore Gateway.":"Amazon EKS, AgentCore Runtime 및 AgentCore Gateway용 기본 템플릿을 추가합니다.","Add new tag":"새 태그 추가","Add policy":"개 정책 추가","Add request-context values like account, Region, or organization.":"계정, 리전 또는 조직과 같은 요청-컨텍스트 값을 추가합니다.","Add tags":"태그 추가","Add tags to this provider for cost management and access control.":"비용 관리 및 액세스 제어를 위해 이 공급자에 태그를 추가하세요.","Add tags to this template for cost management and access control.":"비용 관리 및 액세스 제어를 위해 이 템플릿에 태그를 추가하세요.","Add tags to this workload identity for cost management and access control.":"비용 관리 및 액세스 제어를 위해 이 워크로드 ID에 태그를 추가하세요.","Add template":"템플릿 추가","Add templates":"템플릿 추가","Add templates after the provider is created, or create and name identities by hand.":"공급자 생성 후 템플릿을 추가하거나, 직접 ID를 생성하고 이름을 지정할 수 있습니다.","Add to the path pattern":"경로 패턴에 추가","Added or changed tags were not saved":"추가되거나 변경된 태그가 저장되지 않음","Adding permissions to govern who can create templates referring to this provider failed. To try again, <link>add policy</link>. Error details: {{reason}}":"이 공급자를 참조하는 템플릿을 생성할 수 있는 사용자를 관리하는 권한을 추가하지 못했습니다. 다시 시도하려면 <link>정책 추가</link>를 클릭하세요. 오류 세부 정보: {{reason}}","All outbound signers under this provider will be deleted":"이 제공업체의 모든 아웃바운드 서명자가 삭제됩니다.","All properties":"모든 속성","All templates and workload identities under this provider will be deleted":"이 제공업체의 모든 템플릿 및 워크로드 ID가 삭제됩니다.","Allow member accounts to add their own templates, namespaced by account ID":"멤버 계정이 계정 ID를 네임스페이스로 사용하여 자체 템플릿을 추가할 수 있도록 허용","An identity for agent or workload":"에이전트 또는 워크로드용 ID",and:"및","Any value":"모든 값",Apply:"적용",ARN:"ARN","ARN copied":"ARN 복사됨","arn:aws:eks:{Region}:{account ID}:cluster/{cluster name}":"arn:aws:eks:{Region}:{account ID}:cluster/{cluster name}","At runtime the platform attests these facts about the workload. Any workload whose attestation carries them issues an identity from this template.":"런타임 시 플랫폼은 워크로드에 대한 이러한 사실을 증명합니다. 증명에 이러한 사실이 포함된 모든 워크로드에는 이 템플릿에서 생성한 ID가 발급됩니다.",Attestation:"증명","Attestation policy":"증명 정책","Auto generated identity name":"자동 생성된 ID 이름","Automatically generate from a template":"템플릿에서 자동으로 생성","Available to every account in your organization ({{organizationId}})":"조직({{organizationId}}) 내 모든 계정에서 사용 가능","Available to this account ({{accountId}})":"이 계정({{accountId}})에서 사용 가능","AWS account ID":"AWS 계정 ID","AWS API calls in CloudTrail resolve to the specific workload that made them. Scope trust policies, resource policies, and SCPs to it, using the IAM policies you already know.":"AWS CloudTrail의 AWS API 직접 호출은 해당 호출을 수행한 특정 워크로드로 식별됩니다. 이미 알고 계신 IAM 정책을 사용하여 신뢰 정책, 리소스 정책 및 SCP의 적용 범위를 해당 워크로드로 지정하세요.","AWS creates a subordinate CA in every region this provider signs in, and returns an ID for it.":"AWS는 이 제공자가 서명하는 모든 리전에 하위 CA를 생성하고, 해당 ID를 반환합니다.","AWS IAM Workload Identity":"AWS IAM 워크로드 ID","AWS IAM Workload Identity (opens in a new tab)":"AWS IAM 워크로드 ID(새 탭에서 열림)","AWS Private CA couldn't set up this certificate authority. Delete it in the AWS Private CA console and try again.":"AWS Private CA에서 이 인증 기관을 설정할 수 없습니다. AWS Private CA 콘솔에서 이를 삭제한 후 다시 시도하세요.","By default, each account's templates require an account ID path prefix to avoid name collisions. You can customize this after creating the provider, under provider settings.":"기본적으로 각 계정의 템플릿은 이름 충돌을 방지하기 위해 계정 ID 경로 접두사가 필요합니다. 이 설정은 제공업체 생성 후 제공업체 설정에서 사용자 지정할 수 있습니다.","Can't be changed after the provider is created.":"제공업체 생성 후에는 변경할 수 없습니다.","Can't be changed later.":"나중에 변경할 수 없습니다.",Cancel:"취소","Cannot be changed later.":"나중에 변경할 수 없습니다.","Cannot start with aws:":"aws:로 시작할 수 없음","Certificate {{name}} (account {{accountId}}): {{reason}}":"인증서 {{name}}(계정 {{accountId}}): {{reason}}","Certificate authority":"인증 기관","Certificate authority created":"인증 기관 생성됨","Certificate authority ID":"인증 기관 ID","Certificate authority name":"인증 기관 이름","Certificate authority updated. The current one keeps signing for about {{hours}} more hour, until the replacement has published everywhere.":"인증 기관이 업데이트되었습니다. 대체 인증서가 모든 리전에 게시될 때까지 현재 인증서가 약 {{hours}}시간 더 계속 서명합니다.","Certificate authority updated. The current one keeps signing for about {{hours}} more hours, until the replacement has published everywhere.":"인증 기관이 업데이트되었습니다. 대체 인증서가 모든 리전에 게시될 때까지 현재 인증서가 약 {{hours}}시간 더 계속 서명합니다.","Certificate deleted. Its chain had already left the trust bundle, so nothing that was verifying has changed.":"인증서가 삭제되었습니다. 해당 인증서 체인은 이미 신뢰 번들에서 제거되었으므로 확인 중인 항목에는 아무런 변화가 없습니다.","Certificate deleted. Its chain has been pulled from the trust bundle, so certificates issued under it no longer verify.":"인증서가 삭제되었습니다. 해당 인증서 체인이 신뢰 번들에서 제거되었으므로 해당 인증서로 발급된 인증서는 더 이상 확인되지 않습니다.","Certificate signer":"인증서 서명자","Certificate signer disabled, and the update in progress was stopped with it. Both authorities stay configured, and Enable resumes signing.":"인증서 서명자가 비활성화되었으며 진행 중이던 업데이트도 함께 중단되었습니다. 두 인증 기관의 구성은 모두 유지되며, 활성화를 선택하면 서명이 재개됩니다.","Certificate signer disabled. It stops signing now, its configuration is kept, and Enable resumes signing.":"인증서 서명자가 비활성화되었습니다. 지금 서명을 중단하고, 구성은 유지되며, 활성화를 선택하면 서명이 재개됩니다.","Certificate signer enabled. Its certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle again first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hour, after every region has it.":"인증서 서명자가 활성화되었습니다. 먼저 인증서 체인이 신뢰 번들에 다시 게시되며, 모든 리전에 배포된 후 약 {{hours}}시간 후에 서명이 시작됩니다.","Certificate signer enabled. Its certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle again first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hours, after every region has it.":"인증서 서명자가 활성화되었습니다. 인증서 체인은 먼저 다시 신뢰 번들에 게시되며, 모든 리전에 배포가 완료되고 약 {{hours}}시간 후에 서명이 시작됩니다.","Certificate signer enabled. Its material was still published, so signing resumed immediately.":"인증서 서명자가 활성화되었습니다. 인증서 자료가 계속 게시된 상태였으므로 서명이 즉시 재개되었습니다.","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hour, once every region has it.":"인증서 서명이 활성화되었습니다. 인증서 체인은 먼저 신뢰 번들에 게시되며, 모든 리전에 배포가 완료되면 약 {{hours}}시간 후에 서명이 시작됩니다.","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hours, once every region has it.":"인증서 서명 기능이 활성화되었습니다. 인증서 체인은 먼저 신뢰 번들에 게시되며, 모든 리전에 배포가 완료되면 약 {{hours}}시간 후에 서명이 시작됩니다.","Certificate verifier information":"인증서 검증자 정보","Certificates ({{total}})":"인증서({{total}})","Certificates: {{reason}}":"인증서: {{reason}}","Change the facts a workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.":"워크로드가 이 템플릿에서 ID를 부여받기 위해 증명해야 하는 사실을 변경하세요. 이 템플릿이 이미 생성한 ID는 영향을 받지 않습니다.","Change the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. A workload already holding a session keeps it until the session expires.":"워크로드가 이 자격 증명으로 실행되기 위해 증명해야 하는 사실을 변경합니다. 이미 세션을 보유한 워크로드는 세션이 만료될 때까지 해당 세션을 유지합니다.","Check again":"다시 확인","Checking what is attached to this provider":"이 제공업체에 연결된 항목 확인","Choose a condition key":"조건 키 선택","Choose a fact":"팩트 선택","Choose a path and pattern for the names. Start from a default or customize your own.":"이름의 경로와 패턴을 선택합니다. 기본값에서 시작하거나 직접 사용자 지정할 수 있습니다.","Choose a specific name up front so you can grant it access or match an existing naming convention before the workload runs.":"워크로드가 실행되기 전에 액세스 권한을 부여하거나 기존 명명 규칙을 일치시킬 수 있도록 특정 이름을 미리 선택하세요.","Choose a stable, unique name that identifies one environment or group of workloads, for example prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal.":"하나의 환경 또는 워크로드 그룹을 식별할 수 있는 안정적이고 고유한 이름을 선택하세요(예: prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal).","Choose a use case above to add a template.":"위의 사용 사례를 선택하여 템플릿을 추가하세요.","Choose from this account":"이 계정에서 선택","Choose templates to add, and customize or keep their defaults":"추가할 템플릿을 선택하고, 사용자 지정하거나 기본값을 유지하세요.","Choose the certificate authority this signer should sign with instead. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. The current authority keeps signing until the replacement has been published long enough for verifiers to pick it up.":"이 서명자가 대신 서명할 인증 기관을 선택하세요. 서명하는 모든 리전에 하위 CA가 있는 <link>인증 기관</link>이어야 합니다. 검증자가 대체 인증서를 인식할 수 있도록 충분한 시간 동안 게시될 때까지 현재 인증 기관이 계속 서명합니다.","Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for a workload.":"증명 사실로 사용할 조건 키를 선택하세요. 이 템플릿이 워크로드에 대한 ID를 생성하기 전에 플랫폼은 이러한 모든 사실을 증명해야 합니다.","Choose the facts a workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.":"이 템플릿에서 ID를 부여받기 위해 워크로드가 증명해야 하는 사실을 선택하세요. 그전까지는 아무것도 생성되지 않습니다.","Choose the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. Nothing can be issued for it until you do.":"이 ID로 실행되기 위해 워크로드가 증명해야 하는 사실을 선택하세요. 증명하기 전까지는 아무것도 발급할 수 없습니다.","Choose the provider to create the identity in":"ID를 생성할 제공업체 선택","Choose which templates to add by use case, and customize each one or keep its defaults.":"사용 사례별로 추가할 템플릿을 선택하고, 각 템플릿을 사용자 지정하거나 기본값을 유지하세요.",Clear:"지우기","Clear filters":"필터 지우기",Close:"닫기","Close modal":"모달 닫기","Cluster ARN":"클러스터 ARN","Cluster ARNs":"클러스터 ARN","Code editor":"Code Editor","Complete the confirmation to delete.":"삭제 확인을 완료하세요.","Condition key":"조건 키","Configure identity templates for your workload use cases. Each template defines a path pattern used to issue identities uniquely and the facts a workload must prove before an identity is issued.":"워크로드 사용 사례에 맞게 ID 템플릿을 구성하세요. 각 템플릿은 ID를 고유하게 발급하는 데 사용되는 경로 패턴과 ID가 발급되기 전에 워크로드에서 증명해야 하는 사실을 정의합니다.","Configure later":"나중에 구성",Configured:"구성됨",Confirm:"확인",Contains:"포함","Continue setup":"계속 설정","Copy {{label}}":"{{label}} 복사","Copy ARN":"ARN 복사","Copy JSON":"JSON 복사","Could not check everything attached to this provider":"이 제공업체에 연결된 모든 항목을 확인할 수 없습니다","Create a provider":"제공업체 생성","Create a provider for this account":"이 계정용 제공업체 생성","Create a provider for your organization":"조직에 대한 제공업체 생성","Create a provider to get started":"시작하려면 제공업체를 생성하세요","Create a template to automate identity generation":"ID 생성을 자동화하는 템플릿 생성","Create declared identity in {{providerName}}":"{{providerName}}에서 선언형 ID 생성","Create identity":"ID 생성","Create new":"새로 생성","Create provider":"공급자 생성","Create provider and templates":"공급자 및 템플릿 생성","Create service mesh provider":"서비스 메시 제공업체 생성","Create templates":"템플릿 생성","Create the certificate authority first.":"먼저 인증 기관을 생성하세요.","Create workload identities":"워크로드 ID 생성",Created:"생성됨","Created through":"다음을 통해 생성","Created time":"생성 시간","Created values":"생성된 값","Creates a workload identity provider and template for workloads running in one or more EKS clusters under a service mesh, such as Istio.":"Istio와 같은 서비스 메시 아래에서 하나 이상의 EKS 클러스터에서 실행되는 워크로드에 대한 워크로드 ID 제공업체 및 템플릿을 생성합니다.","Creating certificate authority":"인증 기관 생성 중","Creating the certificate authority":"인증 기관 생성 중","Creating this provider sets up these 2 resources.":"이 제공업체를 생성하면 이 2개의 리소스가 설정됩니다.","Current CA":"현재 CA","Current provider":"현재 공급자","Custom tag key":"사용자 지정 태그 키","Custom tag value":"사용자 지정 태그 값","Custom text":"사용자 지정 텍스트","Custom text can't be a single period (.) or two periods (..).":"사용자 지정 텍스트는 단일 마침표(.) 또는 두 개의 마침표(..)일 수 없습니다.","Customize templates":"템플릿 사용자 지정","Dark themes":"다크 테마","Declared identity: {{name}}":"선언된 ID: {{name}}","Default permissions without a policy":"정책이 없는 기본 권한","Defaults to {provider name}.{account ID}.aws.internal. This must match the trust domain set in your service mesh, or the mesh rejects the identities.":"기본값은 {provider name}.{account ID}.aws.internal입니다. 이는 서비스 메시에 설정된 신뢰 도메인과 일치해야 합니다. 그렇지 않으면 메시가 ID를 거부합니다.","Define an optional path prefix for identities under this template. Lets you filter by prefix when authoring IAM permissions.":"이 템플릿에 속하는 ID의 경로 접두사(선택 사항)를 정의합니다. IAM 권한을 작성할 때 접두사 기준으로 필터링하게 해줍니다.","Define an optional path prefix for this identity. You can filter by this prefix when authoring IAM permissions.":"이 ID에 대한 선택적 경로 접두사를 정의하세요. IAM 권한을 작성할 때 이 접두사를 기준으로 필터링할 수 있습니다.","Define an optional prefix for identities under this template. You can filter by this prefix when authoring IAM permissions. The path prefixes this account can use are set by the provider's policy, for example your account ID, and they are checked when you choose Create. If you're not sure which are permitted, ask your organization administrator.":"이 템플릿 아래의 자격 증명에 대한 선택적 접두사를 정의합니다. IAM 권한을 작성할 때 이 접두사로 필터링할 수 있습니다. 이 계정이 사용할 수 있는 경로 접두사는 공급자 정책(예: 계정 ID)에 의해 설정되며, Create 를 선택할 때 확인됩니다. 어떤 접두사가 허용되는지 확실하지 않으면 조직 관리자에게 문의하십시오.","Define an optional prefix for this identity. You can filter by this prefix when authoring IAM permissions. The path prefixes this account can use are set by the provider's policy, for example your account ID, and they are checked when you choose Create. If you're not sure which are permitted, ask your organization administrator.":"이 자격 증명에 대한 선택적 접두사를 정의합니다. IAM 권한을 작성할 때 이 접두사로 필터링할 수 있습니다. 이 계정이 사용할 수 있는 경로 접두사는 공급자 정책(예: 계정 ID)에 의해 설정되며, Create 를 선택할 때 확인됩니다. 어떤 접두사가 허용되는지 확실하지 않으면 조직 관리자에게 문의하십시오.","Define which workloads are allowed to use this template.":"이 템플릿을 사용할 수 있는 워크로드를 정의합니다.",Delete:"삭제","Delete certificate?":"인증서를 삭제하시겠습니까?","Delete provider":"공급자 삭제","Delete provider and resources":"제공업체 및 리소스 삭제","Delete provider?":"제공업체를 삭제하시겠습니까?","Delete template":"템플릿 삭제","Delete template?":"템플릿을 삭제하시겠습니까?","Delete the templates under <b>{{providerName}}</b> before deleting the provider. Once deleted, workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials and fail on their next request, and access that you granted to these identities will stop working.":"<b>{{providerName}}</b>에 있는 템플릿을 삭제한 후 공급자를 삭제하세요. 삭제하면 이러한 자격 증명을 사용하는 워크로드에 더 이상 자격 증명이 발급되지 않아 다음 요청 시 오류가 발생하며, 이러한 자격 증명에 부여한 액세스 권한도 더 이상 작동하지 않습니다.","Delete workload identity?":"워크로드 ID를 삭제하시겠습니까?","Deleting <b>{{templateName}}</b> will:":"<b>{{templateName}}</b>을(를) 삭제하면 다음과 같은 결과가 발생합니다.","Deleting <b>{{workloadIdentifier}}</b> will:":"<b>{{workloadIdentifier}}</b>을(를) 삭제하면 다음과 같은 결과가 발생합니다.","Deleting certificates":"인증서 삭제 중","Deleting provider":"제공업체 삭제 중","Deleting templates and workload identities":"템플릿 및 워크로드 ID 삭제 중","Deleting the provider is taking longer than expected":"제공업체 삭제가 예상보다 오래 걸림",Description:"설명","Description can't include line breaks or tabs.":"설명에는 줄 바꿈이나 탭이 포함될 수 없습니다.","Description must be 1,000 characters or less.":"설명은 1,000자 이하여야 합니다.","Description must be 255 characters or less.":"설명은 255자 이하여야 합니다.",Details:lzt,Disable:czt,"Disable certificate signer?":"인증서 서명자를 비활성화하시겠습니까?","Discovery expiration time":"탐지 만료 시간",Dismiss:"무시","Does not contain":"포함하지 않음","Does not equal":"같지 않음","Drag or select to resize":"드래그하거나 선택하여 크기 조정","Each identity is fully the template path, or whatever string you enter when you create the identity.":"각 ID는 템플릿 경로 전체이거나, ID 생성 시 입력한 문자열 그대로입니다.",Edit:"편집","Edit attestation policy":"증명 정책 편집","Edit filter":"필터 편집","Edit identity format and scope":"ID 형식 및 범위 편집","Edit identity path":"ID 경로 편집",Editing:dzt,Enable:"활성화","Enable certificate signer":"인증서 서명자 활성화","Enable certificate signer?":"인증서 서명자를 활성화하시겠습니까?","End signing time":"서명 종료 시간","Enter a 12-digit AWS account ID.":"12자리 AWS 계정 ID를 입력하세요.","Enter a certificate authority ID.":"인증 기관 ID를 입력하세요.","Enter a cluster ARN.":"클러스터 ARN을 입력하세요.","Enter a name":"이름 입력","Enter a name for the certificate authority.":"인증 기관 이름을 입력하세요.","Enter a name.":"이름을 입력하세요.","Enter a path":"경로를 입력하세요","Enter a path prefix value":"경로 접두사 값 입력","Enter a trust domain.":"신뢰 도메인을 입력하세요.","Enter a value":"값 입력","Enter a whole number of hours from 1 to 48.":"시간을 1~48 범위의 정수로 입력하세요.","Enter key":"키 입력","Enter prefix":"접두사 입력","Enter the ID of a certificate authority or choose from below":"인증 기관의 ID를 입력하거나 아래에서 선택하세요","Enter the policy as valid JSON.":"정책을 유효한 JSON으로 입력하세요.","Enter value":"값 입력",equals:"같음",Equals:"같음",Error:"오류","Error fetching the details":"세부 정보를 가져오는 동안 오류 발생",Errors:"오류","Every account in this organization ({{organizationId}})":"이 조직({{organizationId}})의 모든 계정","Every X.509-SVID this provider issues right now is signed by this certificate. It stops in {{hours}} hour, at {{at}}, when the incoming certificate takes over.":"이 공급자가 현재 발급하는 모든 X.509-SVID는 이 인증서로 서명됩니다. 유입되는 인증서가 서명을 인계받는 {{at}}에 서명이 중단되며, 그 시점까지 약 {{hours}}시간이 남았습니다.","Every X.509-SVID this provider issues right now is signed by this certificate. It stops in {{hours}} hours, at {{at}}, when the incoming certificate takes over.":"이 공급자가 현재 발급하는 모든 X.509-SVID는 이 인증서로 서명됩니다. 유입되는 인증서가 서명을 인계받는 {{at}}에 서명이 중단되며, 그 시점까지 약 {{hours}}시간이 남았습니다.","Every X.509-SVID this provider issues right now is signed by this certificate. No replacement is scheduled, so it keeps signing until you update or disable the signer.":"이 공급자가 현재 발급하는 모든 X.509-SVID는 이 인증서로 서명됩니다. 대체 인증서가 예정되어 있지 않으므로 서명자를 업데이트하거나 비활성화할 때까지 계속 서명합니다.","Failed to copy":"복사 실패","Failed to copy JSON":"JSON을 복사하지 못함","Failed to load attestation policy.":"증명 정책을 로드하지 못했습니다.","Failed to load templates.":"템플릿을 로드하지 못했습니다.","Failed to remove attestation policy.":"증명 정책 제거에 실패했습니다.","Filter providers":"공급자 필터링","Filter templates":"템플릿 필터링","Filter themes":"테마 필터링","Find providers":"공급자 찾기","Find templates":"템플릿 찾기","Find theme":"테마 찾기","For example, prod":"예: prod","For mutual TLS, attach a certificate authority":"상호 TLS의 경우 인증 기관 연결","For token-based services, issue a JWT":"토큰 기반 서비스의 경우 JWT 발급",Format:"형식","Generating its key":"키 생성","Get started":"시작하기","Getting started":"시작하기","Give an agent or workload its own identity - <em>Preview</em>":"에이전트나 워크로드에 고유한 ID 부여 - <em>미리 보기</em>","Give each workload a unique identity, so you can grant it access and audit what it did rather than sharing one role.":"각 워크로드에 고유 ID를 부여하세요. 하나의 역할을 공유하는 대신 워크로드에 액세스 권한을 부여하고 수행 작업을 감사할 수 있습니다.","Give your workloads an identity":"워크로드에 ID 부여","Go to the providers list":"제공업체 목록으로 이동","Govern who can create resources":"리소스를 생성할 수 있는 사용자 관리","Govern who can create templates referring to this provider":"이 공급자를 참조하는 템플릿을 생성할 수 있는 사용자 관리","Greater than":"보다 큼","Greater than or equal":"보다 크거나 같음","hour(s)":"시간","How it works":"작동 방식","IAM roles define what a workload can do. Workload Identity tells you which workload is doing it.":"IAM 역할은 워크로드가 수행할 수 있는 작업을 정의합니다. 워크로드 ID는 어떤 워크로드가 해당 작업을 수행하고 있는지 알려줍니다.","Identities are issued at runtime from facts the workload proves, not just from what an admin assigns.":"ID는 관리자가 할당하는 내용뿐만 아니라 워크로드가 입증한 사실을 바탕으로 런타임에 발급됩니다.",'Identity "{{identityId}}" not found.':'ID "{{identityId}}"을(를) 찾을 수 없습니다.',"Identity format and scope":"ID 형식 및 범위","Identity name":"ID 이름","Identity path":"ID 경로","Identity selection":"ID 선택","If anything is still attached, deleting the provider fails.":"아직 연결된 항목이 있으면 제공업체 삭제가 실패합니다.","In transition":"전환 중","In transition certificate authority ID":"전환 중인 인증 기관 ID","In transition: incoming, not yet signing":"전환 중: 수신 중, 아직 서명하지 않음",Inactive:"비활성","Inactive: retired, no longer trusted":"비활성: 사용 중지됨, 더 이상 신뢰할 수 없음","Incoming CA":"수신 CA",Info:"정보","Invalid key. Keys can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"잘못된 키입니다. 키에는 유니코드 문자, 숫자, 공백 및 _.:/=+@- 중 하나만 사용할 수 있습니다.","Invalid provider name. Use alphanumeric and '-_.' characters.":"잘못된 제공업체 이름입니다. 영숫자와 '-_.' 문자를 사용하세요.","Invalid request":"잘못된 요청","Invalid template name. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters.":"잘못된 템플릿 이름입니다. 영숫자와 ‘-_’ 문자를 사용하세요.","Invalid value. Values can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"잘못된 값입니다. 값에는 유니코드 문자, 숫자, 공백 및 다음 중 하나만 사용할 수 있습니다. _.:/=+@-","Issued after the workload proves itself":"워크로드가 신뢰성을 입증한 후 발급","Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. Standard pricing applies to the creation and use of AWS Private CA.":"이 제공자의 워크로드가 AWS 외부 시스템에 클라이언트 인증서로 제시하는 X.509-SVID를 발급합니다. 서명하는 모든 리전에 하위 CA를 보유한 <link>인증 기관</link>이 필요합니다. AWS Private CA 생성 및 사용에는 표준 요금이 적용됩니다.","Issues X.509-SVIDs, for mTLS peers that verify a client certificate.":"클라이언트 인증서를 검증하는 mTLS 피어를 위해 X.509-SVID를 발급합니다.","Issuing its CA certificate":"CA 인증서 발급","It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. Leave it alone and it becomes inactive on its own, after which deleting it changes nothing.":"서명 기능은 중지되었지만 인증 체인은 여전히 게시된 상태이므로, 워크로드는 이전에 발급된 자격 증명을 확인하기 위해 이 체인에 의존하고 있습니다. 지금 이를 삭제하면 인증 체인이 즉시 제거되어 해당 자격 증명이 유효하지 않게 됩니다. 그대로 두면 자동으로 비활성화되며, 그 후 삭제하더라도 아무런 변화가 없습니다.","Item moved from position {{initialPosition}} to position {{finalPosition}} of {{total}}":"항목이 {{initialPosition}} 위치에서 {{finalPosition}}/{{total}} 위치로 이동했습니다.","JSON copied":"JSON 복사됨",JWKS:uzt,"JWKS popover":"kid에서 선택한 모든 라이브 서명 키입니다. AWS는 서명이 전환되기 전에 여기에 새 키를 게시합니다.","JWT Outbound signers column Signing algorithm":"서명 알고리즘","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key":"키 알고리즘","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key issue time":"다음 이후 현재 키 서명:","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key popover":"AWS는 자체 일정에 따라 키를 생성하고 교체하며, 서명을 시작하기 전에 각 새 키를 JWKS에 게시합니다. 알고리즘은 교체 후에도 동일하게 유지되므로 JWKS를 읽는 검증기는 사용자 측에서 변경할 필요가 없습니다.","JWT Outbound signers desc":"서명된 토큰을 확인하는 시스템의 경우 JWT-SVID에 서명합니다.","JWT Outbound signers label oidc discovery":"OIDC 검색","JWT Outbound signers label oidc discovery popover":"표준 검색 문서입니다. 대부분의 검증기는 이 URL에서 키를 찾기 때문에 이 URL만 있으면 됩니다.","JWT Outbound signers label oidc issuer":"OIDC 발급자","JWT Outbound signers label oidc issuer popover":"여기에서 서명된 모든 JWT-SVID의 iss 클레임입니다. 발급자를 고정하는 검증기가 이 값을 고정합니다.","JWT Outbound signers section title":"토큰 검증기 정보","JWT Outbound signers status":"AWS에서 제공하는 기본값","JWT Outbound signers title":"JWT 서명자",Key:"키","Learn about organization providers":"조직 제공업체 알아보기","Learn about organization providers (opens in a new tab)":"조직 제공업체 알아보기(새 탭에서 열림)","Learn more":"자세히 알아보기","Learn more about deleting a provider (opens in a new tab)":"공급자 삭제 자세히 알아보기(새 탭에서 열림)","Learn more:":"자세히 알아보기:","Less than":"보다 작음","Less than or equal":"보다 작거나 같음","Let other accounts or principals in your organization create templates and identities under this provider, within the path prefixes you choose.":"조직의 다른 계정 또는 위탁자가 선택한 경로 접두사 내에서 이 공급자로 템플릿과 ID를 생성하게 합니다.","Let workloads reach non-AWS resources":"워크로드가 비AWS 리소스에 도달하도록 허용","Letters, digits, . - _ with a single / between parts. No / at the start or end.":"문자, 숫자, 마침표(.), 하이픈(-), 밑줄(_)을 사용할 수 있으며, 부분 사이에 단일 슬래시(/)만 사용할 수 있습니다. 처음이나 끝에는 슬래시(/)를 사용할 수 없습니다.","Letters, digits, . - _ with a single / between parts. No / at the start or end. Cannot be changed later.":"문자, 숫자, 마침표(.), 하이픈(-), 밑줄(_)을 사용할 수 있으며, 부분 사이에 단일 슬래시(/)만 사용할 수 있습니다. 처음이나 끝에는 슬래시(/)를 사용할 수 없습니다. 나중에 변경할 수 없습니다.","Light themes":"라이트 테마","Ln {{row}}, Col {{column}}":"행 {{row}}, 열 {{column}}        ","Loading certificate authorities":"인증 기관 로드 중","Loading code editor":"Code Editor 로드 중","Loading tag keys":"태그 키 로드 중","Loading tag values":"태그 값 로드 중","Loading tags that are associated with this resource":"이 리소스와 연결된 태그 로드 중","Loading your organization's providers":"조직의 제공업체 로드 중","Make sure the new certificate authority uses the same algorithm as the current signer, {{algorithm}}. If you choose a different algorithm, you need to disable this signer, delete its certificates, then enable it again with the new authority.":"새 인증 기관이 현재 서명자와 동일한 알고리즘인 {{algorithm}}을(를) 사용하는지 확인하세요. 다른 알고리즘을 선택하면 이 서명자를 비활성화하고 해당 인증서를 삭제한 다음 새 인증 기관으로 다시 활성화해야 합니다.","Manage CAs and replication in the AWS Private CA console":"AWS Private CA 콘솔에서 CA 및 복제 관리","Manage tags":"태그 관리","Manage the provider":"공급자 관리","Manual creation":"수동으로 생성","Manually create":"수동으로 생성","Matching workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.":"일치하는 워크로드는 규모에 상관없이 시작되는 즉시 자체 ID 이름을 가져옵니다.","Maximum 1,000 characters.":"최대 1,000자입니다.","Maximum 255 characters.":"최대 255자입니다.","Member accounts":"멤버 계정","Member accounts can add their own templates, namespaced by account ID.":"멤버 계정은 계정 ID를 네임스페이스로 사용하여 자체 템플릿을 추가할 수 있습니다.","Member accounts cannot add their own templates.":"멤버 계정은 자체 템플릿을 추가할 수 없습니다.","Minimum signing delay":"최소 서명 지연 시간","Moving item to position {{currentPosition}} of {{total}}":"항목을 {{currentPosition}}/{{total}}의 위치로 이동 중","Multiple EKS clusters":"여러 EKS 클러스터",Name:"이름","Name must be 128 characters or less.":"이름은 128자 이내여야 합니다.","Name this identity":"이 ID 이름 지정","Name this provider":"이 제공업체의 이름 지정","Name values":"이름 값","Names identities automatically as workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.":"워크로드가 시작될 때 ID의 이름을 자동으로 지정하므로 하나씩 생성하거나 관리하지 않습니다.","Naming scheme":"이름 지정 체계",New:"신규","Next month":"다음 달","Next page":"다음 페이지","Next step":"다음 단계","No attestation policy set. Define one so a workload can run as this identity.":"증명 정책이 설정되지 않았습니다. 워크로드가 이 ID로 실행될 수 있도록 정의하세요.","No attestation policy. No workload will be issued workload identities from this template until you add one.":"증명 정책이 없습니다. 정책을 추가할 때까지 이 템플릿을 기반으로 하는 워크로드에는 워크로드 ID가 발급되지 않습니다.","No by default, but can add a policy":"아니요(기본값, 단, 정책 추가 가능)","No certificate authorities in this account":"이 계정에 인증 기관이 없습니다","no domain":"도메인 없음","No long-lived secrets":"장기간 유지되는 보안 암호 없음","No match found":"일치 항목을 찾을 수 없음","No matches":"일치 항목 없음","No path segments. Add a fact, condition key, or custom text.":"경로 세그먼트가 없습니다. 팩트, 조건 키 또는 사용자 지정 텍스트를 추가하세요.","No tags associated with the resource.":"리소스와 연결된 태그가 없습니다.","No templates added yet":"아직 추가된 템플릿이 없음","No workload identity providers":"워크로드 ID 공급자 없음","No workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.":"이 템플릿과 일치하는 워크로드가 없으므로 ID를 생성하지 않습니다.","No, and cannot be granted":"아니요, 부여할 수 없음",None:"없음","None – names are defined by templates or declared individually":"없음 – 이름이 템플릿으로 정의되거나 개별적으로 선언됩니다.","Not saved: {{keys}}.":"저장되지 않음: {{keys}}.","Not set":"설정되지 않음",Notifications:"알림","Once the attestation policy is removed, matching workloads will not be issued workload identities until you add a policy again.":"증명 정책이 제거되면 정책을 다시 추가할 때까지 해당 워크로드에 워크로드 ID가 발급되지 않습니다.","One bundle per provider, and one URL. It carries every authority the provider publishes: both outbound signers, and during an update both the current and incoming certificate authority, which is what lets verifiers accept either one through the handover. Your own AWS workloads get these keys automatically; send this to systems outside AWS.":"공급자당 번들은 하나이며 URL도 하나입니다. 여기에는 공급자가 게시하는 모든 인증 기관이 포함됩니다. 즉, 두 개의 아웃바운드 서명자와 업데이트 중인 경우 현재 및 유입되는 인증 기관이 모두 포함됩니다. 이를 통해 검증자는 인계 과정에서 두 인증 기관 중 어느 인증 기관으로 서명된 항목이든 허용할 수 있습니다. 자체 AWS 워크로드에는 이러한 키가 자동으로 제공되며, AWS 외부 시스템에는 이 URL을 전달하세요.","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level providers.":"관리 계정 또는 위임된 관리자만 조직 수준 공급자를 삭제할 수 있습니다.","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level templates.":"관리 계정 또는 위임된 관리자만 조직 수준 템플릿을 삭제할 수 있습니다.","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level workload identities.":"관리 계정 또는 위임된 관리자만 조직 수준 워크로드 ID를 삭제할 수 있습니다.","Opens in a new tab":"새 탭에서 열림",Operator:"운영자",Operators:"운영자",optional:pzt,or:"또는","Organization provider":"조직 제공업체","Organization scoped":"조직 범위 지정됨","Organize the provider and track its cost with tags.":"공급자를 구성하고 태그를 사용하여 비용을 추적하세요.","Other accounts in your organization":"조직의 다른 계정","Other condition keys":"기타 조건 키","Outbound signer":"아웃바운드 서명자","Outbound signers page desc":"AWS 외부의 서비스에 워크로드의 신원을 증명하도록 하세요. 이 공급자는 워크로드가 제시하는 토큰과 인증서에 서명합니다.","Outbound signers page title":"아웃바운드 서명자","Owning account":"소유 계정","Page {{pageNumber}} of all pages":"모든 페이지 중 {{pageNumber}} 페이지",path:"경로",Path:"경로","path from templates":"템플릿의 경로","Path is the per-workload part of an identity name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts a workload proves.":"경로는 ID 이름 중 워크로드별 부분을 의미합니다. 이는 런타임 시 워크로드가 증명하는 사실에 따라 채워집니다.","Path must be 255 characters or less.":"경로는 255자 이하여야 합니다.","Path pattern":"경로 패턴","Path prefix":"경로 접두사","Path prefix must be 64 characters or less.":"경로 접두사는 64자 이하여야 합니다.","Path values":"경로 값","Picked up item at position {{position}} of {{total}}":"{{total}}개 중 위치 {{position}}의 항목을 선택했습니다.","Policy details":"정책 세부 정보","Policy: Define how a workload attests to get the identity":"정책: 워크로드가 ID를 얻는 방법을 정의합니다.",Preferences:hzt,"Press space or enter to activate drag, use arrow keys to move, then press space or enter to confirm":"Space 또는 Enter를 눌러 드래그를 활성화하고, 화살표 키로 이동한 후 Space 또는 Enter를 눌러 확인하세요.",Preview:mzt,"Previous CA":"이전 CA","Previous certificates ({{certificateCount}})":"이전 인증서({{certificateCount}})","Previous month":"이전 달","Previous page":"이전 페이지",Properties:"속성",Property:"속성",Provided:"제공됨",Provider:"공급자","Provider {{providerName}} deleted.":"{{providerName}} 제공업체가 삭제되었습니다.","Provider name":"공급자 이름","Provider name must be 128 characters or less.":"제공업체 이름은 128자 이내여야 합니다.","Provider not deleted":"제공업체가 삭제되지 않음","Provider not found":"공급자를 찾을 수 없습니다.","Provider overview":"공급자 개요","Provider selection":"공급자 선택","Provider settings":"공급자 설정","Provider values":"공급자 값",Providers:gzt,"Providers to issue workload identities":"워크로드 ID를 발급하는 공급자","Quick create":"빠른 생성","Quick create makes an RSA 2048 certificate authority in AWS Private CA in your account, which has its own charges. The algorithm is fixed and cannot be changed later without setting the signer up again.":"빠른 생성은 계정의 AWS Private CA에 RSA 2048 인증 기관을 생성하며, 이에 따른 요금이 별도로 부과됩니다. 알고리즘은 고정되어 있으며, 나중에 변경하려면 서명자를 다시 설정해야 합니다.",Ready:"준비됨",Recommended:"권장","Recommended for most workloads":"대부분의 워크로드에 권장됨",Refresh:vzt,"Refresh certificate authorities":"인증 기관 새로고침","Refresh certificate signer status":"인증서 서명자 상태 새로고침",Remove:"제거","Remove {{name}}":"{{name}} 제거","Remove attestation policy":"증명 정책 제거","Remove cluster ARN":"클러스터 ARN 제거","Remove condition":"조건 제거","Remove filter {{filter}}":"{{filter}} 필터 제거","Remove governance policy?":"거버넌스 정책을 제거하시겠습니까?","Remove tag {{key}}":"태그 {{key}} 제거","Removed tags were not saved":"제거된 태그가 저장되지 않음","Reorder {{name}}":"{{name}} 재정렬","Reordering canceled":"재정렬 취소됨","Required for service mesh providers.":"서비스 메시 제공업체에 필요합니다.","Required for service mesh providers. A service mesh provider is scoped to the account that runs the EKS cluster.":"서비스 메시 제공업체에서 필요합니다. 서비스 메시 제공업체는 EKS 클러스터를 실행하는 계정으로 범위가 지정됩니다.","Reset to default":"기본값으로 재설정","Resize handle":"크기 조정 핸들","Resolved example:":"해석된 예제:","Restricted by":"다음에 의해 제한됨",Retry:"재시도","Review the tags and save again.":"태그를 검토하고 다시 저장하세요.","Running a service mesh, such as Istio? It needs its own provider, one per cluster.":"Istio와 같은 서비스 메시를 실행 중이십니까? 해당 메시에는 클러스터당 하나씩 자체 공급자가 필요합니다.",Save:"저장","Save changes":"변경 사항 저장","Save or cancel your edits before creating templates.":"템플릿을 생성하기 전에 편집 내용을 저장하거나 취소하세요.","Save or cancel your edits before creating the provider.":"제공업체를 생성하기 전에 편집 내용을 저장하거나 취소하세요.","Save or cancel your template edits to change the scope.":"범위를 변경하려면 템플릿 편집 내용을 저장하거나 취소하세요.",scheme:"스키마",Scheme:"체계","scheme and trust domain":"스킴 및 신뢰 도메인","Scheme sets the format this provider uses to name identities.":"스키마는 이 제공자가 ID 이름을 지정하는 데 사용하는 형식을 설정합니다.",Scope:"범위","Scope sets which accounts are allowed to use this provider.":"범위는 이 제공업체를 사용할 수 있는 계정을 지정합니다.","Scope values":"범위 값","Search tags":"태그 검색","Segment that partitions identities.":"ID를 분할하는 세그먼트입니다.","Select {{name}}":"{{name}} 선택","Select a row to delete.":"삭제할 행을 선택하세요.",Set:"설정","Set a naming pattern":"이름 지정 패턴 설정","Set an attestation rule":"증명 규칙 설정","Set by your provider.":"제공업체가 설정합니다.","Set the naming format and usage scope that every workload identity from this provider inherits.":"이 제공업체의 모든 워크로드 ID가 상속할 이름 지정 형식과 사용 범위를 설정합니다.","Set the unique path pattern that every workload identity generated by this template follows. Cannot be changed later.":"이 템플릿으로 생성한 모든 워크로드 ID가 따르는 고유한 경로 패턴을 설정합니다. 나중에 변경할 수 없습니다.","Set up a provider to hold the templates that generate identity names, the identities you declare directly, and the signers that sign credentials for systems outside AWS.":"ID 이름을 생성하는 템플릿, 직접 선언하는 ID, AWS 외부 시스템의 자격 증명에 서명하는 서명자를 보유하는 공급자를 설정하세요.","Set up a service mesh provider for this account":"이 계정의 서비스 메시 공급자 설정","Set up a way to issue workload identities":"워크로드 ID를 발급하는 방법 설정","Set up for your use cases":"사용 사례에 맞게 설정","Sets your trust domain, the start of every identity name.":"모든 ID 이름의 시작 부분인 신뢰 도메인을 설정합니다.","Setting up the certificate authority stopped. You can continue from where it left off.":"인증 기관 설정이 중지되었습니다. 중단된 지점부터 계속 진행할 수 있습니다.","Settings from your provider {{providerName}}":"{{providerName}} 제공업체의 설정","Short-lived credentials renew automatically and follow the SPIFFE standard, so they work with service meshes like Istio and with SaaS applications.":"단기 유효 기간의 자격 증명은 자동으로 갱신되며 SPIFFE 표준을 따르므로, Istio와 같은 서비스 메시 및 SaaS 애플리케이션에서 사용할 수 있습니다.","Show all {{errorCount}} errors":"모든 {{errorCount}}개의 오류 표시","Show fewer":"간단히 표시","Show more":"더 표시","Signing algorithm":"서명 알고리즘","Signing resumes immediately, because this certificate is still published in the trust bundle.":"이 인증서는 여전히 신뢰 번들에 게시되어 있으므로 서명이 즉시 재개됩니다.","Signing start time":"서명 시작 시간","Some templates could not be loaded":"일부 템플릿을 로드할 수 없음","Something went wrong":"문제 발생","Sortable path segment":"정렬 가능한 경로 세그먼트",Status:"상태","Status bar":"상태 표시줄","Stop access you granted to this identity name from working":"이 ID 이름에 부여한 액세스 권한의 작동 중지","Stop access you granted to those identity names from working":"해당 ID 이름에 부여한 액세스 권한의 작동 중지","Stop matching workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request":"일치하는 워크로드가 ID를 가져오지 못하도록 중지하여 다음 요청 시 실패하도록 함","Stop the identities it generated from resolving":"이 템플릿이 생성한 ID가 확인되지 않도록 중지","Stop the workload running as this identity, so it fails on its next request":"이 ID로 실행 중인 워크로드를 중지하여 다음 요청 시 실패하도록 설정","Stopped signing and no longer in the trust bundle, so nothing verifies against them. Deleting one is safe.":"서명 기능을 중지했으며 더 이상 신뢰 번들에 포함되어 있지 않으므로, 이를 기준으로 검증되는 항목이 없습니다. 삭제해도 안전합니다.",Subject:"제목",Success:"성공","Tag keys could not be retrieved":"태그 키를 검색할 수 없음","Tag values could not be retrieved":"태그 값을 검색할 수 없음",Tags:"태그","Tags could not be loaded":"태그를 로드할 수 없음","Tags for {{name}} have been updated.":"{{name}}에 대한 태그가 업데이트되었습니다.","Tags not saved":"태그가 저장되지 않음",Template:"템플릿",'Template "{{templateId}}" not found.':"템플릿 '{{templateId}}'을(를) 찾을 수 없습니다.","Template {{name}}: {{reason}}":"템플릿 {{name}}: {{reason}}","Template {{templateName}} deleted.":"템플릿 {{templateName}}을(를) 삭제했습니다.","Template {{templateNames}} created.":"템플릿 ‘{{templateNames}}’을(를) 생성했습니다.","Template name":"템플릿 이름","Template name must be 128 characters or less.":"템플릿 이름은 128자 이하여야 합니다.","Template name values":"템플릿 이름 값","Template: {{name}}":"템플릿: {{name}}",Templates:"템플릿","Templates ({{total}})":"템플릿({{total}})","Templates are being created. Wait for the request to finish.":"템플릿을 생성 중입니다. 요청이 완료될 때까지 기다리세요.","Templates give matching workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.":"템플릿은 일치하는 워크로드에 자체 ID 이름을 자동으로 부여합니다. 각 템플릿은 이 제공업체의 이름 접두사와 경로 및 패턴을 사용합니다.","Templates that member accounts created under this provider are not visible here and cannot be deleted from this account. If any exist, deleting the provider fails.":"이 제공업체에서 멤버 계정이 생성한 템플릿은 여기에 표시되지 않으며 이 계정에서 삭제할 수 없습니다. 있는 경우 제공업체 삭제가 실패합니다.","Templates: {{reason}}":"템플릿: {{reason}}","The account that owns the certificate authority.":"인증 기관을 소유한 계정입니다.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it.":"증명 정책은 이 공급자가 ID를 발급하는 방식을 제어합니다. 워크로드는 유형, 세부 정보, 실행 위치 등 모든 조건을 충족해야 하며, 조건 충족 사실은 워크로드를 호스팅하는 서비스가 보증합니다.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.":"증명 정책은 이 공급자가 ID를 발급하는 방식을 제어합니다. 워크로드는 유형, 세부 정보, 실행 위치 등 모든 조건을 충족해야 하며, 조건 충족 사실은 워크로드를 호스팅하는 서비스가 보증합니다. 나중에 편집할 수 있습니다.","The attestation policy controls which workloads get an identity from this provider. A workload must meet every condition, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. It's generated from the EKS clusters you entered. You can edit it later.":"증명 정책은 어떤 워크로드가 이 제공업체로부터 ID를 받는지 제어합니다. 워크로드는 이를 호스팅하는 서비스에서 보증하는 모든 조건을 충족해야 합니다. 입력한 EKS 클러스터에서 생성됩니다. 나중에 편집할 수 있습니다.","The attestation policy lists the facts a workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so a workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.":"증명 정책은 이 공급자가 워크로드에 ID를 발급하기 전에 워크로드가 증명해야 하는 사실을 나열합니다. 컴퓨팅 플랫폼이 해당 사실을 보증하므로 워크로드가 자신의 것이 아닌 ID를 자신의 것이라고 주장할 수 없습니다.","The attester vouches for the workload, and it must match every condition to run as this identity.":"증명자는 워크로드를 보증하며, 이 ID로 실행되려면 모든 조건과 일치해야 합니다.","The certificate authority is still being set up.":"인증 기관이 아직 설정 중입니다.","The ID at the end of the certificate authority's ARN in AWS Private CA.":"AWS Private CA에서 인증 기관의 ARN 끝에 있는 ID입니다.","The identity name is the provider's naming scheme, a path prefix, and a path pattern.":"ID 이름은 제공업체의 이름 지정 체계, 경로 접두사 및 경로 패턴으로 구성됩니다.","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag key is 128.":"태그 키에 사용할 수 있는 최대 문자 수는 128자입니다.","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag value is 256.":"태그 값에 사용할 수 있는 최대 문자 수는 256자입니다.","The path can be up to {{maxLength}} characters.":"경로는 최대 {{maxLength}}자로 입력할 수 있습니다.","The path doesn't support these segments: {{segments}}. Remove them, and add what you need from the following cards.":"경로는 다음 세그먼트를 지원하지 않습니다. {{segments}}. 이를 제거하고 다음 카드에서 필요한 항목을 추가하세요.","The path is already the default.":"경로는 이미 기본값입니다.","The path is the per-workload part of each identity's name. Keep the Region in front so names stay unique across accounts and Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.":"경로는 각 ID 이름의 워크로드별 부분입니다. 리전을 앞에 유지하면 여러 계정과 리전에서 이름이 고유하게 유지되며, 세그먼트를 다시 정렬하여 팀의 명명 규칙에 맞출 수도 있습니다.","The path prefixes your policy allows":"정책에서 허용하는 경로 접두사","The permissions defined in this policy for <b>{{providerName}}</b> stop applying.":"이 정책에 정의된 <b>{{providerName}}</b>에 대한 권한이 더 이상 적용되지 않습니다.","The provider could not be deleted. Try again.":"제공업체를 삭제할 수 없습니다. 다시 시도하세요.","The provider is being created. Wait for the request to finish.":"제공업체를 생성 중입니다. 요청이 완료될 때까지 기다립니다.","The provider might still be deleted. Check the providers list later.":"제공업체가 여전히 삭제될 수 있습니다. 나중에 제공업체 목록을 확인하세요.","The resource policy on this provider controls who can associate templates with it.":"이 제공업체의 리소스 정책은 누가 해당 제공업체와 템플릿을 연결할 수 있는지를 제어합니다.","The soonest the new certificate can take over. It publishes to the trust bundle first, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. Signing may start later than this, never sooner.":"새 인증서가 인계받을 수 있는 가장 빠른 시점입니다. 이 인증서는 먼저 신뢰 번들에 게시되므로, 해당 인증서로 서명이 이루어지기 전에 모든 검증자가 이를 확인할 수 있습니다. 서명은 이 시점보다 늦게 시작될 수는 있지만, 결코 더 일찍 시작되지는 않습니다.","The soonest this certificate can start signing. It publishes to the trust bundle first, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. Signing may start later than this, never sooner.":"이 인증서가 서명을 시작할 수 있는 가장 빠른 시점입니다. 이 인증서는 먼저 신뢰 번들에 게시되므로, 해당 인증서로 서명이 이루어지기 전에 모든 검증자가 이를 확인할 수 있습니다. 서명은 이 시점보다 늦게 시작될 수는 있지만, 결코 더 일찍 시작되지는 않습니다.",Theme:"테마","There was an error loading the code editor.":"Code Editor를 로드하는 중 오류가 발생했습니다.","These clusters set the template's <policyLink>attestation policy</policyLink>.":"이러한 클러스터는 템플릿의 <policyLink>증명 정책</policyLink>을 설정합니다.","These resources need to be deleted before deleting the provider.":"제공업체를 삭제하기 전에 이러한 리소스를 삭제해야 합니다.","This account ({{accountId}})":"이 계정({{accountId}})","This action deletes the workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.":"이 작업은 워크로드 ID 제공업체 <b>{{providerName}}</b>을(를) 삭제합니다.","This cannot be undone, and creating a provider with the same name later does not restore anything. To proceed, complete the steps below.":"이 작업은 취소할 수 없으며 나중에 같은 이름의 제공업체를 생성해도 복원되지 않습니다. 계속하려면 아래의 단계를 완료하세요.","This cannot be undone, and the path this template reserved stays reserved. No future template can generate identities under it.":"이 작업은 되돌릴 수 없으며, 이 템플릿이 예약한 경로는 계속 예약된 상태로 유지됩니다. 향후 어떤 템플릿도 이 경로 아래에서 ID를 생성할 수 없습니다.","This cannot be undone, and this name stays reserved. It is never issued again, so you cannot recreate this identity under the same name.":"이 작업은 되돌릴 수 없으며, 이 이름은 계속 예약된 상태로 유지됩니다. 이 이름은 다시 발급되지 않으므로, 동일한 이름으로 이 ID를 다시 생성할 수 없습니다.","This certificate authority uses {{caAlgorithm}}. Rotation keeps the signer's {{signerAlgorithm}} algorithm, so choose a {{signerAlgorithm}} certificate authority instead.":"이 인증 기관은 {{caAlgorithm}}을(를) 사용합니다. 교체는 서명자의 {{signerAlgorithm}} 알고리즘을 유지하므로 대신 {{signerAlgorithm}} 인증 기관을 선택하세요.","This certificate has left the trust bundle, so it publishes again first. Signing starts after about {{hours}} hour, once every region has it.":"이 인증서는 신뢰 번들에서 제거되었으므로 먼저 다시 게시됩니다. 모든 리전에 인증서가 배포되면 약 {{hours}}시간 후에 서명이 시작됩니다.","This certificate has left the trust bundle, so it publishes again first. Signing starts after about {{hours}} hours, once every region has it.":"이 인증서는 신뢰 번들에서 제거되었으므로 먼저 다시 게시됩니다. 모든 리전에 인증서가 배포되면 약 {{hours}}시간 후에 서명이 시작됩니다.","This certificate is validating, so deleting it stops verification immediately":"이 인증서는 검증 중이므로 삭제하면 검증이 즉시 중단됩니다","This certificate stopped signing and its chain has left the trust bundle, so nothing verifies against it. It stays listed as history until you delete it, and deleting it is safe: no credential depends on it, and the certificate signer keeps signing.":"이 인증서는 서명을 중단했으며 인증서 체인이 신뢰 번들에서 제거되었으므로 더 이상 이 인증서로 확인되는 항목이 없습니다. 삭제할 때까지 기록으로 목록에 유지됩니다. 이 인증서에 종속된 자격 증명이 없고 인증서 서명자는 계속 서명하므로 안전하게 삭제할 수 있습니다.","This cluster is already listed.":"이 클러스터는 이미 나열되어 있습니다.","This condition key and operator combination already exists":"이 조건 키와 연산자 조합이 이미 존재함","This doesn't look like a valid EKS cluster ARN. An invalid ARN will leave workloads in that cluster without an identity.":"유효한 EKS 클러스터 ARN처럼 보이지 않습니다. 유효하지 않은 ARN은 해당 클러스터의 워크로드를 ID 없이 남겨 둡니다.","This management account and delegated administrators":"이 관리 계정 및 위임된 관리자","This organization ({{organizationId}})":"이 조직({{organizationId}})","This policy's cluster ARNs don't match the clusters you entered. Changing the clusters won't update this policy. Continue only if that's intended.":"이 정책의 클러스터 ARN이 입력한 클러스터와 일치하지 않습니다. 클러스터를 변경해도 이 정책은 업데이트되지 않습니다. 의도한 경우에만 계속하세요.","This provider has no naming scheme, so the path you enter is the full identity name.":"이 제공업체에는 이름 지정 체계가 없으므로 입력한 경로가 전체 ID 이름이 됩니다.","This provider names every identity using the open standard.":"이 제공업체는 개방형 표준을 사용하여 모든 ID의 이름을 지정합니다.","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. Both certificates below stop, including the one still in transition, so the update does not complete. Both stay configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"이 제공자는 즉시 X.509-SVID 발급을 중단하며, 클라이언트 인증서가 필요한 워크로드는 다음 요청 시부터 오류가 발생하기 시작합니다. 아래 두 인증서는 전환 중인 인증서를 포함하여 모두 중단되므로 업데이트가 완료되지 않습니다. 두 인증서 모두 구성된 상태로 유지됩니다. 이미 발급된 인증서는 약 12시간 동안 계속 유효하며, '활성화'를 선택하면 서명이 재개됩니다.","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"이 제공자는 즉시 X.509-SVID 발급을 중단하며, 클라이언트 인증서가 필요한 워크로드는 다음 요청 시부터 오류가 발생하기 시작합니다. 아래 인증서는 계속 구성된 상태로 유지됩니다. 이미 발급된 인증서는 약 12시간 동안 계속 유효하며, ‘활성화’를 선택하면 서명이 재개됩니다.","This provider's policy doesn't allow this path prefix \"{{pathPrefix}}\" for your account. Ask your organization administrator which path prefixes are permitted.":'이 공급자의 정책은 귀하의 계정에 대해 이 경로 접두사 "{{pathPrefix}}"을 허용하지 않습니다. 어떤 경로 접두사가 허용되는지 조직 관리자에게 문의하십시오.',"This removes the certificate from the provider and pulls its chain from the trust bundle immediately. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"이렇게 하면 공급자에서 인증서가 제거되고, 신뢰 번들에서 해당 인증서 체인이 즉시 제거됩니다. 인증 기관 자체는 AWS Private CA에 그대로 유지됩니다.","This removes the certificate from the provider. Its chain already left the trust bundle, so nothing that is verifying today changes. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"이렇게 하면 공급자에서 인증서가 제거됩니다. 해당 인증서 체인은 이미 신뢰 번들에서 제외되었으므로, 현재 수행 중인 인증에는 아무런 변화가 없습니다. 인증 기관 자체는 AWS Private CA에 그대로 남아 변경되지 않습니다.","This tag will be removed upon saving changes":"이 태그는 변경 사항을 저장할 때 제거됩니다","This usually takes a few minutes. Keep this page open until it finishes.":"이 작업은 보통 몇 분 정도 소요됩니다. 작업이 완료될 때까지 이 페이지를 열어 두세요.",Today:"오늘","Too many requests":"요청이 너무 많음","Trace and control access per workload":"워크로드별 액세스 추적 및 제어","Trust bundle":"신뢰 번들","trust domain":"신뢰 도메인","Trust domain":"신뢰 도메인","Trust domain is the root of trust for the SPIFFE naming scheme. It is a logical name that follows DNS naming style, for example prod.acme.com, but does not need to match a real DNS record.":"신뢰 도메인은 SPIFFE 명명 체계의 신뢰 루트입니다. 이는 prod.acme.com과 같이 DNS 명명 방식을 따르는 논리명이지만, 실제 DNS 레코드와 일치할 필요는 없습니다.","Try again. If the problem continues, contact AWS Support.":"다시 시도하세요. 문제가 계속되면 AWS Support에 문의하세요.","Unable to load templates":"템플릿을 로드할 수 없음",Undo:fzt,"Up to 128 characters. Must be unique per provider.":"최대 128자입니다. 제공업체별로 고유해야 합니다.","Up to 128 characters. Use alphanumeric and '-_.' characters. Must be unique in your organization. Can't be changed after the provider is created.":"최대 128자까지 입력할 수 있습니다. 영숫자 및 '-_.' 문자를 사용할 수 있습니다. 조직 내에서 고유해야 합니다. 제공업체 생성 후에는 변경할 수 없습니다.","Up to 128 characters. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters. Must be unique per provider.":"최대 128자이며, 영숫자와 ‘-_’ 문자를 사용하고, 공급자별로 고유해야 합니다.",Update:yzt,"Update certificate signer":"인증서 서명자 업데이트",'Use "{{key}}"':"‘{{key}}’ 사용",'Use "{{value}}"':"‘{{value}}’ 사용","Use case":"사용 사례","Use cases":"사용 사례","Use default templates":"기본 템플릿 사용","Use letters, digits, and . - _ characters, with a single / between parts. No / at the start or end, and a part can't be . or ..":"문자, 숫자, 마침표(.), 하이픈(-), 밑줄(_)을 사용할 수 있으며, 부분 사이에 단일 슬래시(/)만 사용할 수 있습니다. 처음이나 끝에는 슬래시(/)를 사용할 수 없으며, 각 부분은 단일 마침표(.) 또는 이중 마침표(..)로 구성할 수 없습니다.","Use one from another account":"다른 계정의 인증 기관 사용","Use only Latin letters, numbers, spaces, tabs, line breaks, and standard keyboard symbols.":"라틴 문자, 숫자, 공백, 탭, 줄 바꿈 및 표준 키보드 기호만 사용할 수 있습니다.","Use only letters, digits, - and _ characters.":"문자, 숫자, - 및 _만 사용하세요.","Use only letters, digits, . - and _ characters. The path can't be . or ..":"영문자, 숫자, ., -, _ 문자만 사용할 수 있습니다. 경로는 . 또는 ..일 수 없습니다.","Use only letters, digits, periods (.), hyphens (-), and underscores (_).":"문자, 숫자, 마침표(.), 하이픈(-), 밑줄(_)만 사용하세요.","Use the workload identity in trust policies, resource policies, or SCPs. Each call is recorded in CloudTrail with the workload's identity.":"신뢰 정책, 리소스 정책 또는 SCP에서 워크로드 ID를 사용하세요. 각 호출은 워크로드의 ID와 함께 CloudTrail에 기록됩니다.",'Use: "{{text}}"':"사용: ‘{{text}}’","Used as the common name in the certificate authority's subject.":"인증 기관의 주체에 공통 이름으로 사용됩니다.",Validating:bzt,"Validating: stopped signing, still trusted":"검증 중: 서명 중지됨, 여전히 신뢰할 수 있음",Value:"값","Value must be 256 characters or less.":"값은 256자 이하여야 합니다.",Values:"값","View all":"모두 보기","View all notifications":"모든 알림 보기","View JSON":"JSON 보기",Visual:"시각적",Warning:"경고",Warnings:"경고","What gets created":"생성되는 항목","Which EKS clusters is this provider for?":"어떤 EKS 클러스터가 이 제공업체에 대한 클러스터인가요?",'Wildcard "*" is only allowed with the StringLike, StringNotLike, ArnLike, or ArnNotLike operators.':"와일드카드 ‘*’는 StringLike, StringNotLike, ArnLike 또는 ArnNotLike 연산자에서만 허용됩니다.","Without a policy, no other account can create templates under this provider, though delegated administrators can already create both. Add a statement for each account, organizational unit, or IAM principal that should be able to, and limit each one to a path prefix.":"정책이 없으면 위임된 관리자만 두 유형의 템플릿을 모두 생성할 수 있으며, 다른 계정은 이 제공업체 아래에 템플릿을 생성할 수 없습니다. 템플릿을 생성할 수 있어야 하는 각 계정, 조직 단위 또는 IAM 위탁자에 대한 문을 추가하고, 각 항목의 허용 범위를 경로 접두사로 제한하세요.","Workload identities ({{total}})":"워크로드 ID({{total}})","Workload identities in the IAM User Guide":"IAM 사용자 가이드의 워크로드 ID","Workload identities in the IAM User Guide (opens in a new tab)":"IAM 사용자 가이드의 워크로드 ID(새 탭에서 열림)","Workload identities: {{reason}}":"워크로드 ID: {{reason}}","Workload identity":"워크로드 ID","Workload Identity":"워크로드 ID","Workload identity {{name}}: {{reason}}":"워크로드 ID {{name}}: {{reason}}","Workload identity {{workloadIdentifier}} deleted.":"워크로드 ID {{workloadIdentifier}}이(가) 삭제되었습니다.","Workloads get named automatically":"워크로드의 이름이 자동으로 지정됨","Workloads in these EKS clusters can get an identity from this provider, when all of these are true:":"이러한 EKS 클러스터의 워크로드는 다음 조건이 모두 충족될 때 이 제공업체로부터 ID를 가져올 수 있습니다.","Workloads running in these clusters can get an identity from this provider. Add 2 or more.":"이러한 클러스터에서 실행되는 워크로드는 이 제공업체로부터 ID를 가져올 수 있습니다. 2개 이상을 추가하세요.","Workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"이 계정에서 실행되는 워크로드는 {{workloadLabel}}에서 검증한 정보를 사용하여 이 템플릿으로 생성된 ID를 사용할 수 있습니다.","Workloads running in this cluster can get an identity from this provider.":"이 클러스터에서 실행되는 워크로드는 이 제공업체로부터 ID를 가져올 수 있습니다.","Workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"조직 내에서 실행되는 워크로드는 {{workloadLabel}}에서 검증한 정보를 사용하여 이 템플릿으로 생성된 ID를 사용할 수 있습니다.","Workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request":"이 ID를 사용하는 워크로드는 자격 증명 발급이 중지되고 다음 요청 시에 실패합니다.","Workloads, such as agents, pods, and jobs, are verified at runtime and get a workload identity, one per workload, generated by a template. The identity gets fine-grained access to AWS resources through IAM policies and CloudTrail, and signed JWT and X.509 credentials for meshes and SaaS apps.":"에이전트, 포드, 작업과 같은 워크로드는 런타임에 검증되며, 템플릿을 통해 생성된 워크로드별 고유한 워크로드 ID를 부여받습니다. 이 ID는 IAM 정책 및 CloudTrail을 통해 AWS 리소스에 대한 세분화된 액세스 권한과 메시 및 SaaS 앱을 위한 서명된 JWT 및 X.509 자격 증명을 부여받습니다.","Wrap lines":"줄 바꿈","Write a policy to let another account create templates, or to stop a delegated administrator from part of the name space. Each statement names an organizational unit, specific accounts, or individual IAM principals, allows or denies, and can be limited to a path prefix.":"다른 계정이 템플릿을 생성하게 하거나 위임된 관리자가 이름 공간의 일부에서 제외되도록 정책을 작성합니다. 각 명령문은 조직 단위, 특정 계정 또는 개별 IAM 위탁자의 이름을 지정하고, 허용 또는 거부하며, 경로 접두사로 제한될 수 있습니다.","Yes by default":"예(기본값)","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tag.":"태그를 최대 {{availableTags}}개 더 추가할 수 있습니다.","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tags.":"태그를 최대 {{availableTags}}개 더 추가할 수 있습니다.","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"태그 한도({{tagLimit}}개)를 초과했습니다.","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"태그 한도({{tagLimit}}개)를 초과했습니다.","You have more keys than can be displayed":"표시할 수 있는 것보다 많은 키가 있음","You have more values than can be displayed":"표시할 수 있는 값보다 많은 값이 있음","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"태그 한도({{tagLimit}}개)에 도달했습니다.","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"태그 한도({{tagLimit}}개)에 도달했습니다.","You have unsaved tag changes. Leave this page and discard them?":"저장되지 않은 태그 변경 사항이 있습니다. 이 페이지를 벗어나 폐기하시겠어요?","You must enter a path":"경로를 입력해야 합니다","You must specify a condition key":"조건 키를 지정해야 함","You must specify a tag key":"태그 키를 지정해야 함","You must specify a unique tag key.":"고유한 태그 키를 지정해야 합니다.","You must specify a value":"값을 지정해야 함","Your administrator decides which prefixes this account can use. This is checked when you create.":"관리자가 이 계정에서 사용할 수 있는 접두사를 결정합니다. 생성 시 확인됩니다.","Your identities will be <code>{{prefix}}<em>{{placeholder}}</em></code>":"ID는 <code>{{prefix}}<em>{{placeholder}}</em></code>(이)가 됩니다.","Your organization already has a workload identity provider. Add templates under it to start issuing identities to your workloads — each named under your account's path prefix.":"조직에 이미 워크로드 ID 제공업체가 있습니다. 해당 제공업체 아래에 템플릿을 추가하여 워크로드에 ID를 발급하기 시작하세요. 각 ID는 계정의 경로 접두사 아래에 이름이 지정됩니다.","Your organization has workload identity providers you can use. Pick one and add templates under it to start issuing identities to your workloads.":"사용 가능한 워크로드 ID 제공업체가 조직에 있습니다. 그중 하나를 선택하고 해당 제공업체 아래에 템플릿을 추가하여 워크로드에 ID를 발급하기 시작하세요.","YYYY/MM/DD":"YYYY/MM/DD","{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.","A declared identity has a fixed name you define. Use one when you need an exact name, for example to match a name another system already expects.":"A declared identity has a fixed name you define. Use one when you need an exact name, for example to match a name another system already expects.","A fact {{workload}} checks when the agent or workload starts.":"A fact {{workload}} checks when the agent or workload starts.","A provider issues secure, verifiable identities to your agents and workloads, like your Kubernetes pods or AI agents, to access AWS and third-party services without long-lived credentials.":"A provider issues secure, verifiable identities to your agents and workloads, like your Kubernetes pods or AI agents, to access AWS and third-party services without long-lived credentials.","A template automatically generates an identity for each matching agent or workload under {{providerName}}.":"A template automatically generates an identity for each matching agent or workload under {{providerName}}.","A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued.":"A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued.","A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued. Decide how this provider issues identities - starting from the <link>default templates</link> for common use cases, or skipping them. Templates are optional and can be added later.":"A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued. Decide how this provider issues identities - starting from the <link>default templates</link> for common use cases, or skipping them. Templates are optional and can be added later.","A template names identities automatically as matching agents and workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.":"A template names identities automatically as matching agents and workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.","A template with no attestation policy matches no agent or workload, so nothing is ever issued from it. Set a policy to define which agents and workloads qualify.":"A template with no attestation policy matches no agent or workload, so nothing is ever issued from it. Set a policy to define which agents and workloads qualify.","A template's path pattern, built from facts like cluster, namespace, and service account, names each agent or workload automatically when it starts. You don't create identities ahead of time.":"A template's path pattern, built from facts like cluster, namespace, and service account, names each agent or workload automatically when it starts. You don't create identities ahead of time.","Add a fact or condition key. A path of only custom text would give every agent or workload the same name.":"Add a fact or condition key. A path of only custom text would give every agent or workload the same name.","Add an {{conditionKey}} condition, so only agents or workloads in these clusters get an identity.":"Add an {{conditionKey}} condition, so only agents or workloads in these clusters get an identity.","Add attestation policy":"Add attestation policy","Add templates after the provider is created.":"Add templates after the provider is created.","Agent and workload identity":"Agent and workload identity","Agent and workload identity - <em>Preview</em>":"Agent and workload identity - <em>Preview</em>","Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide":"Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide","Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide (opens in a new tab)":"Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide (opens in a new tab)","Agents and workloads get named automatically":"Agents and workloads get named automatically","Agents and workloads get short-lived credentials that renew automatically and follow the SPIFFE standard, so they work with service meshes such as Istio and with business applications.":"Agents and workloads get short-lived credentials that renew automatically and follow the SPIFFE standard, so they work with service meshes such as Istio and with business applications.","Agents and workloads in these EKS clusters can get an identity from this provider, when all of these are true:":"Agents and workloads in these EKS clusters can get an identity from this provider, when all of these are true:","Agents and workloads running in these clusters can get an identity from this provider. Add two or more.":"Agents and workloads running in these clusters can get an identity from this provider. Add two or more.","Agents and workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Agents and workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.","Agents and workloads running in this cluster can get an identity from this provider.":"Agents and workloads running in this cluster can get an identity from this provider.","Agents and workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Agents and workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.","Agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request":"Agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request","Agents and workloads, such as AI agents and pods, are verified at runtime and each gets its own identity, generated by a template. The identity gets fine-grained access to AWS resources through IAM policies and CloudTrail, and signed JWT and X.509 credentials for meshes and apps.":"Agents and workloads, such as AI agents and pods, are verified at runtime and each gets its own identity, generated by a template. The identity gets fine-grained access to AWS resources through IAM policies and CloudTrail, and signed JWT and X.509 credentials for meshes and apps.","All templates and identities under this provider will be deleted":"All templates and identities under this provider will be deleted","An AI agent or workload gets an identity that is unique.":"An AI agent or workload gets an identity that is unique.","An identity with no attestation policy admits no workload, so nothing can run as it. Set a policy to define which workload qualifies.":"An identity with no attestation policy admits no workload, so nothing can run as it. Set a policy to define which workload qualifies.","An identity with this name already exists.":"An identity with this name already exists.","At runtime the platform attests these facts about the agent or workload. Any agent or workload whose attestation carries them gets an identity issued from this template.":"At runtime the platform attests these facts about the agent or workload. Any agent or workload whose attestation carries them gets an identity issued from this template.","Attestation policy for {{name}} has been removed.":"Attestation policy for {{name}} has been removed.","Attestation policy for {{name}} has been updated.":"Attestation policy for {{name}} has been updated.","By continuing, you also enable organization level resource creation, which is needed to create the organization scoped provider. You can disable it later in Settings.":"By continuing, you also enable organization level resource creation, which is needed to create the organization scoped provider. You can disable it later in Settings.","Change the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.":"Change the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.","Choose a stable, unique name that identifies one environment or group of agents and workloads, for example prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal.":"Choose a stable, unique name that identifies one environment or group of agents and workloads, for example prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal.","Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for an agent or workload.":"Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for an agent or workload.","Choose the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.":"Choose the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.","Choose where the workload is hosted":"Choose where the workload is hosted","Choose who can use it":"Choose who can use it","Control what an agent or workload can reach with familiar IAM policies and see its AWS calls in CloudTrail.":"Control what an agent or workload can reach with familiar IAM policies and see its AWS calls in CloudTrail.","Create declared identity":"Create declared identity","Creates an agent and workload identity provider and template for agents and workloads running in one or more EKS clusters under a service mesh, such as Istio.":"Creates an agent and workload identity provider and template for agents and workloads running in one or more EKS clusters under a service mesh, such as Istio.","Creating the identity":"Creating the identity","Declare an identity with the exact name you need":"Declare an identity with the exact name you need","Declared identities":"Declared identities","Declared identity":"Declared identity","Declared identity {{name}} created.":"Declared identity {{name}} created.","Define which agents and workloads are allowed to use this template.":"Define which agents and workloads are allowed to use this template.","Delete the templates under <b>{{providerName}}</b> before deleting the provider. Once deleted, agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials and fail on their next request, and access that you granted to these identities will stop working.":"Delete the templates under <b>{{providerName}}</b> before deleting the provider. Once deleted, agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials and fail on their next request, and access that you granted to these identities will stop working.","Deleting templates and identities":"Deleting templates and identities","Each identity is fully the template path.":"Each identity is fully the template path.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.","Enter a description":"Enter a description","Failed to create the declared identity.":"Failed to create the declared identity.","Failed to save attestation policy.":"Failed to save attestation policy.","Filter declared identities":"Filter declared identities","For example, to match a name another system already expects.":"For example, to match a name another system already expects.","from provider":"from provider","Give AI agents and workloads their own identities. Know which of them made each call. Scope its access with the IAM policies you already use.":"Give AI agents and workloads their own identities. Know which of them made each call. Scope its access with the IAM policies you already use.","Give an agent or workload a unique identity, so you can grant it access and audit what it did rather than sharing one role.":"Give an agent or workload a unique identity, so you can grant it access and audit what it did rather than sharing one role.","Grant access":"Grant access","Grant this name access to resources in IAM policies.":"Grant this name access to resources in IAM policies.","IAM for agents and workloads":"IAM for agents and workloads","IAM for agents and workloads (opens in a new tab)":"IAM for agents and workloads (opens in a new tab)",Identifier:wzt,"Identities ({{total}})":"Identities ({{total}})","Identities are issued at runtime from facts the agent or workload proves, rather than from what an admin assigns.":"Identities are issued at runtime from facts the agent or workload proves, rather than from what an admin assigns.","Identities for agents":"Identities for agents","Identities: {{reason}}":"Identities: {{reason}}","Identity {{name}}: {{reason}}":"Identity {{name}}: {{reason}}","Invalid trust domain. Use lowercase alphanumeric and '-.' characters.":"Invalid trust domain. Use lowercase alphanumeric and '-.' characters.","Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's agents and workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. Standard pricing applies to the creation and use of AWS Private CA.":"Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's agents and workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. Standard pricing applies to the creation and use of AWS Private CA.","It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so agents and workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. To avoid this, wait until it becomes inactive on its own. Deleting it then has no effect on verification.":"It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so agents and workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. To avoid this, wait until it becomes inactive on its own. Deleting it then has no effect on verification.","Let agents and workloads reach non-AWS resources":"Let agents and workloads reach non-AWS resources","Loading declared identities":"Loading declared identities","Matching agents and workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.":"Matching agents and workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.","No agent and workload identity providers":"No agent and workload identity providers","No agent or workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.":"No agent or workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.","No attestation policy attached.":"No attestation policy attached.","No attestation policy. No agent or workload will be issued an identity from this template until you add one.":"No attestation policy. No agent or workload will be issued an identity from this template until you add one.","No conditions. This policy matches every agent or workload of its service.":"No conditions. This policy matches every agent or workload of its service.","No segments yet. Add at least one, or every agent or workload this template matches resolves to the same name.":"No segments yet. Add at least one, or every agent or workload this template matches resolves to the same name.","None – names are defined by templates":"None – names are defined by templates","Nothing can run as this identity":"Nothing can run as this identity","Once the attestation policy is removed, matching agents and workloads will not be issued agent and workload identities until you add a policy again.":"Once the attestation policy is removed, matching agents and workloads will not be issued agent and workload identities until you add a policy again.","One bundle per provider, and one URL. It carries every authority the provider publishes: both outbound signers, and during an update both the current and incoming certificate authority, which is what lets verifiers accept either one through the handover. Your own AWS agents and workloads get these keys automatically; send this to systems outside AWS.":"One bundle per provider, and one URL. It carries every authority the provider publishes: both outbound signers, and during an update both the current and incoming certificate authority, which is what lets verifiers accept either one through the handover. Your own AWS agents and workloads get these keys automatically; send this to systems outside AWS.","One provider and one trust domain shared by every EKS cluster in the mesh. An agent or workload with the same namespace and service account in any of these clusters shares one identity.":"One provider and one trust domain shared by every EKS cluster in the mesh. An agent or workload with the same namespace and service account in any of these clusters shares one identity.","Path is the unique part of each identity's name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts an agent or workload proves.":"Path is the unique part of each identity's name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts an agent or workload proves.","path prefix":"path prefix","Policy: Define how an agent or workload attests to get the identity":"Policy: Define how an agent or workload attests to get the identity","Proven at runtime":"Proven at runtime","Providers to issue agent and workload identities":"Providers to issue agent and workload identities","Scoped, auditable access":"Scoped, auditable access","Search by name":"Search by name","Set the exact name":"Set the exact name","Set the naming format and usage scope that every agent and workload identity from this provider inherits.":"Set the naming format and usage scope that every agent and workload identity from this provider inherits.","Set the unique path pattern that every identity generated by this template follows. Cannot be changed later.":"Set the unique path pattern that every identity generated by this template follows. Cannot be changed later.","Set up a provider to hold the templates that generate identity names and the signers that sign credentials for systems outside AWS.":"Set up a provider to hold the templates that generate identity names and the signers that sign credentials for systems outside AWS.","Set up a way to issue agent and workload identities":"Set up a way to issue agent and workload identities","Set which workloads can use this identity and where they must run.":"Set which workloads can use this identity and where they must run.","Stop matching agents and workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request":"Stop matching agents and workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request","Templates give matching agents and workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.":"Templates give matching agents and workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it.":"The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.":"The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Generated from the EKS clusters above. Can be edited later.":"The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Generated from the EKS clusters above. Can be edited later.","The attestation policy controls how this identity is issued. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.":"The attestation policy controls how this identity is issued. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.","The attestation policy is the set of facts an agent or workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so an agent or workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.":"The attestation policy is the set of facts an agent or workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so an agent or workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.","The certificate chain is distributing to every Region, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. It starts signing at {{at}}. That is the minimum signing delay you set, so signing may start later than this. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.":"The certificate chain is distributing to every Region, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. It starts signing at {{at}}. That is the minimum signing delay you set, so signing may start later than this. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.","The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Account ID and Region in front so names stay unique across accounts and Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.":"The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Account ID and Region in front so names stay unique across accounts and Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.","The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Region in front so names stay unique across Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.":"The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Region in front so names stay unique across Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.","This action deletes the agent and workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.":"This action deletes the agent and workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.","This certificate has stopped signing, but its chain stays in the trust bundle so certificates already issued under it keep verifying. It becomes inactive at {{at}}. Until then, Enable resumes signing with no wait. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.":"This certificate has stopped signing, but its chain stays in the trust bundle so certificates already issued under it keep verifying. It becomes inactive at {{at}}. Until then, Enable resumes signing with no wait. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.","This doesn't look like a valid EKS cluster ARN. An invalid ARN will leave agents or workloads in that cluster without an identity.":"This doesn't look like a valid EKS cluster ARN. An invalid ARN will leave agents or workloads in that cluster without an identity.","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. Both certificates below stop, including the one still in transition, so the update does not complete. Both stay configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. Both certificates below stop, including the one still in transition, so the update does not complete. Both stay configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.","This template issues no identities":"This template issues no identities","Trust domain must be 64 characters or less.":"Trust domain must be 64 characters or less.","Use the agent or workload identity in trust policies, resource policies, or SCPs. CloudTrail records its calls with that identity.":"Use the agent or workload identity in trust policies, resource policies, or SCPs. CloudTrail records its calls with that identity.","What conditions should the agent or workload match?":"What conditions should the agent or workload match?","Where is the agent or workload hosted?":"Where is the agent or workload hosted?","You must enter a name":"You must enter a name","Your organization already has an agent and workload identity provider. Add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads — each named under your account's path prefix.":"Your organization already has an agent and workload identity provider. Add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads — each named under your account's path prefix.","Your organization has agent and workload identity providers you can use. Pick one and add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads.":"Your organization has agent and workload identity providers you can use. Pick one and add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads."},Szt=Object.freeze(Object.defineProperty({__proto__:null,ARN:"ARN",Actions:"작업",Active:"활성",Add:"추가",Apply:"적용",Attestation:"증명",Cancel:"취소",Clear:"지우기",Close:"닫기",Configured:"구성됨",Confirm:"확인",Contains:"포함",Created:"생성됨",Delete:"삭제",Description:"설명",Details:lzt,Disable:czt,Dismiss:"무시",Edit:"편집",Editing:dzt,Enable:"활성화",Equals:"같음",Errors:"오류",Format:"형식",Identifier:wzt,Inactive:"비활성",Info:"정보",JWKS:uzt,Key:"키",Name:"이름",New:"신규",None:"없음",Notifications:"알림",Operator:"운영자",Operators:"운영자",Path:"경로",Preferences:hzt,Preview:mzt,Properties:"속성",Property:"속성",Provided:"제공됨",Provider:"공급자",Providers:gzt,Ready:"준비됨",Recommended:"권장",Refresh:vzt,Remove:"제거",Retry:"재시도",Save:"저장",Scheme:"체계",Scope:"범위",Status:"상태",Subject:"제목",Success:"성공",Tags:"태그",Template:"템플릿",Templates:"템플릿",Theme:"테마",Today:"오늘",Undo:fzt,Update:yzt,Validating:bzt,Value:"값",Values:"값",Visual:"시각적",Warning:"경고",Warnings:"경고",and:"및",default:kzt,equals:"같음",optional:pzt,or:"또는",path:"경로",scheme:"스키마"},Symbol.toStringTag,{value:"Module"})),_zt="Ações",xzt="Ativo",Azt="Adicionar",Ezt="Aplicar",Czt="Atestação",Tzt="Cancelar",Izt="Limpar",Dzt="Fechar",Lzt="Configurado",Pzt="Confirmar",Nzt="Contém",Rzt="Criado",Mzt="Excluir",zzt="Descrição",Ozt="Detalhes",Bzt="Desabilitar",Fzt="Ignorar",$zt="Editar",jzt="Editando",Wzt="Habilitar",qzt="igual a",Uzt="É igual a",Vzt="Erros",Hzt="Formato",Kzt="Inativo",Gzt="Informações",Yzt="JWKS",Jzt="Chave",Zzt="Nome",Xzt="Novo",Qzt="Nenhum",eOt="Notificações",tOt="Operador",aOt="Operadores",nOt="opcional",iOt="caminho",rOt="Caminho",oOt="Preferências",sOt="Prévia",lOt="Propriedades",cOt="Propriedade",dOt="Fornecido",uOt="Provedor",pOt="Provedores",hOt="Pronto",mOt="Recomendado",gOt="Atualizar",vOt="Remover",fOt="Tentar novamente",yOt="Salvar",bOt="esquema",wOt="Esquema",kOt="Escopo",SOt="Status",_Ot="Assunto",xOt="Êxito",AOt="Tags",EOt="Modelo",COt="Modelos",TOt="Tema",IOt="Hoje",DOt="Desfazer",LOt="Atualizar",POt="Validando",NOt="Valor",ROt="Valores",MOt="Visual",zOt="Aviso",OOt="Avisos",BOt="Identifier",FOt={"'{{providerName}}' does not exist in your account":"'{{providerName}}' não existe na sua conta","(earliest)":"(mais antigo)","{{addedCount}} tag added or changed":"{{addedCount}} tag adicionada ou alterada","{{addedCount}} tags added or changed":"{{addedCount}} tags adicionadas ou alteradas","{{createdCount}} templates created: {{templateNames}}.":"{{createdCount}} modelos criados: {{templateNames}}.","{{failed}} of {{total}} certificates could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}} de {{total}} certificados não puderam ser excluídos, portanto, o provedor não foi excluído. Resolva os erros e tente novamente.","{{failed}} of {{total}} could not be deleted.":"{{failed}} de {{total}} não puderam ser excluídos.","{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and workload identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}} de {{total}} modelos e identidades de workload não puderam ser excluídos, portanto, o provedor não foi excluído. Resolva os erros e tente novamente.","{{failedCount}} template could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.":"{{failedCount}} o modelo não pôde ser criado. Analise os erros a seguir e tente novamente.","{{failedCount}} templates could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.":"{{failedCount}} modelos não puderam ser criados. Analise os erros a seguir e tente novamente.","{{identityCount}} identities":"{{identityCount}} identidades","{{identityCount}} identity":"{{identityCount}} identidade","{{label}} (service mesh)":"{{label}} (malha de serviços)","{{label}} copied":"{{label}} copiado","{{label}} failed to copy":"Falha ao copiar {{label}}","{{label}} template":"{{label}} modelo","{{label}} template {{index}}":"Modelo {{label}} {{index}}","{{label}}:":"{{label}}:","{{matchCount}} match":"{{matchCount}} correspondência","{{matchCount}} matches":"{{matchCount}} correspondências","{{name}} has been successfully created.":"{{name}} foi criado com sucesso.","{{name}} has been successfully created. However, the following operations failed:":"{{name}} foi criado com sucesso. No entanto, as seguintes operações falharam:","{{providerName}} still has these resources:":"{{providerName}} ainda tem esses recursos:","{{removedCount}} tag removed":"{{removedCount}} tag removida","{{removedCount}} tags removed":"{{removedCount}} tags removidas","{{scope}} · {{domain}}":"{{scope}} · {{domain}}","{{settled}} of {{total}}":"{{settled}} de {{total}}","{{subject}}. Does not match this signer's {{algorithm}} algorithm.":"{{subject}}. Não corresponde ao algoritmo {{algorithm}} deste signatário.","{{tagCount}} tag":"{{tagCount}} tag","{{tagCount}} tags":"{{tagCount}} tags","{{templateCount}} template":"{{templateCount}} modelo","{{templateCount}} templates":"{{templateCount}} modelos","{{templateName}} template failed to create. To try again, <link>add templates</link>. Error details: {{reason}}":"Falha ao criar o modelo {{templateName}}. Para tentar novamente, <link>adicione modelos</link>. Detalhes do erro: {{reason}}","{{workload}} fact":"Fato da {{workload}}","{defined by template}":"{defined by template}","<term>Support:</term> Amazon EKS, Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Runtime, and Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Gateway.":"<term>Suporte:</term> Amazon EKS, Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Runtime e Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Gateway.","1 EKS cluster":"1 cluster do EKS","1 provider and 1 trust domain per EKS cluster. Each namespace and service account in this cluster gets its own identity, trusted only within this cluster.":"1 provedor e 1 domínio de confiança por cluster do EKS. Cada namespace e conta de serviço nesse cluster obtém sua própria identidade, confiável somente dentro desse cluster.","1 provider and 1 trust domain shared by every EKS cluster in the mesh. A workload with the same namespace and service account in any of these clusters shares one identity.":"1 provedor e 1 domínio de confiança compartilhados por cada cluster do EKS na malha. Uma workload com o mesmo namespace e conta de serviço em qualquer um desses clusters compartilha uma identidade.","1 to 48 hours, in whole hours. Publishing is usually much faster, but can take up to 24 hours.":"1 a 48 horas, em horas inteiras. A publicação geralmente é muito mais rápida, mas pode levar até 24 horas.","1. Select all the check boxes to confirm what deleting {{providerName}} will do.":"1. Marque todas as caixas de seleção para confirmar o que a exclusão de {{providerName}} fará.","2. Confirm that you want to delete this provider by typing {{providerName}} below.":"2. Confirme que você deseja excluir este provedor digitando {{providerName}} abaixo.","A declared identity has a fixed path you define. Use one when you need an exact path, for example to match a value another system already expects.":"Uma identidade declarada tem um caminho fixo que você define. Use uma quando precisar de um caminho exato, por exemplo, para corresponder a um valor que outro sistema já espera.","A deny, and only for delegated administrators":"Negar, e somente para administradores delegados","A fact {{workload}} checks when the workload starts.":"Um fato de {{workload}} verifica quando a workload inicia.","A fixed label, such as an environment name.":"Um rótulo fixo, como um nome de ambiente.","A name to identify this identity.":"Um nome para identificar esta identidade.","A provider with this name already exists.":"Já existe um provedor com esse nome.","A tag is a label you assign to an AWS resource. Each tag has a key and an optional value. Use tags to search and filter this provider, or to track your AWS costs.":"Uma tag é um rótulo que você atribui a um recurso da AWS. Cada tag tem uma chave e um valor opcional. Você pode usar tags para pesquisar e filtrar esse provedor ou acompanhar seus custos da AWS.","A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts a workload must prove before an identity is issued. Decide how this provider issues identities - starting from the <link>default templates</link> for common use cases, or skipping them. You can add and name identities manually at any time - templates are optional and can be added later.":"Um modelo define o padrão de caminho usado para nomear identidades de forma exclusiva e os fatos que uma workload deve comprovar antes que uma identidade seja emitida. Decida como esse provedor emite identidades, começando pelos <link>modelos padrão</link> para casos de uso comuns ou ignorando-os. Você pode adicionar e nomear identidades manualmente a qualquer momento. Os modelos são opcionais e poderão ser adicionados posteriormente.","A template with this name already exists.":"Já existe um modelo com esse nome.","A template's path pattern, built from facts like cluster, namespace, and service account, names each workload automatically when it starts. You don't create identities ahead of time.":"O padrão de caminho de um modelo, definido com base em informações como cluster, namespace e conta de serviço, identifica automaticamente cada workload quando ela é iniciada. Não é necessário criar identidades antecipadamente.","A workload identity provider issues secure, verifiable identities to your workloads, like Kubernetes pods or AI agents. Workloads use them to access AWS and third-party services without long-lived credentials.":"Um provedor de identidade de carga de trabalho emite identidades seguras e verificáveis para suas cargas de trabalho, como pods do Kubernetes ou agentes de IA. As cargas de trabalho os usam para acessar serviços da AWS e de terceiros sem credenciais de longa duração.","A workload, including an AI agent or sub-agent created on demand, gets its own identity. No workload shares or inherits another's.":"Uma workload, incluindo um agente ou subagente de IA criado sob demanda, obtém sua própria identidade. Nenhuma workload compartilha ou herda a identidade de outra.","Access a partner API, a SaaS endpoint, or an OIDC service. No setup needed.":"Acesse uma API de parceiro, um endpoint de SaaS ou um serviço OIDC. Nenhuma configuração é necessária.","Access a service mesh, a database, or an on-premises system.":"Acesse uma malha de serviços, um banco de dados ou um sistema on-premises.","Access denied":"Acesso negado","Access you granted to these identities will stop working":"O acesso que você concedeu a essas identidades deixará de funcionar.","Account scoped":"Escopo da conta",Actions:_zt,"Activating it":"Ativação",Active:xzt,"Active certificate authority ID":"ID da autoridade de certificação ativa","Active: currently signing":"Ativo: atualmente assinando",Add:Azt,"Add {{label}} template":"Adicionar modelo {{label}}","Add a fact or condition key. A path of only custom text would give every workload the same name.":"Adicione uma chave de condição ou fato. Um caminho somente de texto personalizado daria o mesmo nome a cada workload.","Add an {{conditionKey}} condition, so only workloads in these clusters get an identity.":"Adicione uma condição {{conditionKey}}, para que somente as workloads nesses clusters obtenham uma identidade.","Add at least 1 path segment.":"Adicione pelo menos 1 segmento de caminho.","Add at least 1 template to continue.":"Adicione pelo menos 1 modelo para continuar.","Add at least 2 clusters.":"Adicione pelo menos 2 clusters.","Add attestation rules":"Adicionar regras de atestado","Add cluster ARN":"Adicionar ARN do cluster","Add condition":"Adicionar condição","Add default templates for Amazon EKS, AgentCore Runtime, and AgentCore Gateway.":"Adicione modelos padrão para o Amazon EKS, AgentCore Runtime e AgentCore Gateway.","Add new tag":"Adicionar tag","Add policy":"Adicionar  política","Add request-context values like account, Region, or organization.":"Adicione valores de contexto de solicitação, como conta, região ou organização.","Add tags":"Adicionar tags","Add tags to this provider for cost management and access control.":"Adicione tags a esse provedor para gerenciamento de custos e controle de acesso.","Add tags to this template for cost management and access control.":"Adicione tags a esse modelo para gerenciamento de custos e controle de acesso.","Add tags to this workload identity for cost management and access control.":"Adicione tags a essa identidade de workload para gerenciamento de custos e controle de acesso.","Add template":"Adicionar modelo","Add templates":"Adicionar modelos","Add templates after the provider is created, or create and name identities by hand.":"Adicione modelos após a criação do provedor ou crie e nomeie identidades manualmente.","Add to the path pattern":"Adicionar ao padrão do caminho","Added or changed tags were not saved":"As tags adicionadas ou alteradas não foram salvas","Adding permissions to govern who can create templates referring to this provider failed. To try again, <link>add policy</link>. Error details: {{reason}}":"A adição de permissões para controlar quem pode criar modelos referentes a esse provedor falhou. Para tentar novamente, <link>adicione a política</link>. Detalhes do erro: {{reason}}","All outbound signers under this provider will be deleted":"Todos os signatários de saída desse provedor serão excluídos","All properties":"Todas as propriedades","All templates and workload identities under this provider will be deleted":"Todos os modelos e identidades de workloads deste provedor serão excluídos","Allow member accounts to add their own templates, namespaced by account ID":"Permita que as contas dos membros adicionem seus próprios modelos, com namespaces por ID de conta","An identity for agent or workload":"Uma identidade para agente ou workload",and:"e","Any value":"Qualquer valor",Apply:Ezt,ARN:"ARN","ARN copied":"ARN copiado","arn:aws:eks:{Region}:{account ID}:cluster/{cluster name}":"arn:aws:eks:{Region}:{account ID}:cluster/{cluster name}","At runtime the platform attests these facts about the workload. Any workload whose attestation carries them issues an identity from this template.":"No runtime, a plataforma atesta esses fatos sobre a workload. Qualquer workload cujo atestado a inclua emite uma identidade a partir desse modelo.",Attestation:Czt,"Attestation policy":"Política de atestado","Auto generated identity name":"Nome de identidade gerado automaticamente","Automatically generate from a template":"Gere automaticamente de um modelo","Available to every account in your organization ({{organizationId}})":"Disponível para todas as contas da sua organização ({{organizationId}})","Available to this account ({{accountId}})":"Disponível para esta conta ({{accountId}})","AWS account ID":"ID da conta da AWS","AWS API calls in CloudTrail resolve to the specific workload that made them. Scope trust policies, resource policies, and SCPs to it, using the IAM policies you already know.":"As chamadas de API da AWS registradas no CloudTrail são associadas à workload específica que as realizou. Restrinja as políticas de confiança, as políticas de recursos e as SCPs a essa workload, usando as políticas do IAM que você já conhece.","AWS creates a subordinate CA in every region this provider signs in, and returns an ID for it.":"A AWS cria uma CA subordinada em cada região em que esse provedor assina e retorna um ID para ela.","AWS IAM Workload Identity":"Identidade de workload do AWS IAM","AWS IAM Workload Identity (opens in a new tab)":"Identidade de workload do AWS IAM (abre em uma nova guia)","AWS Private CA couldn't set up this certificate authority. Delete it in the AWS Private CA console and try again.":"A CA privada da AWS não conseguiu configurar essa autoridade de certificado. Exclua-a no console da CA privada da AWS e tente novamente.","By default, each account's templates require an account ID path prefix to avoid name collisions. You can customize this after creating the provider, under provider settings.":"Por padrão, os modelos de cada conta exigem um prefixo de caminho de ID da conta para evitar colisões de nomes. Você pode personalizar isso depois de criar o provedor, nas configurações do provedor.","Can't be changed after the provider is created.":"Não pode ser alterado depois que o provedor é criado.","Can't be changed later.":"Não pode ser alterado posteriormente.",Cancel:Tzt,"Cannot be changed later.":"Não poderá ser alterado posteriormente.","Cannot start with aws:":"Não é possível começar com aws:","Certificate {{name}} (account {{accountId}}): {{reason}}":"Certificado {{name}} (conta {{accountId}}): {{reason}}","Certificate authority":"Autoridade certificadora","Certificate authority created":"Autoridade de certificação criada","Certificate authority ID":"ID da autoridade de certificação","Certificate authority name":"Nome da autoridade de certificação","Certificate authority updated. The current one keeps signing for about {{hours}} more hour, until the replacement has published everywhere.":"Autoridade de certificação atualizada. A atual continua assinando por cerca de mais {{hours}} hora, até que a substituta seja publicada em todas as regiões.","Certificate authority updated. The current one keeps signing for about {{hours}} more hours, until the replacement has published everywhere.":"Autoridade de certificação atualizada. A atual continua assinando por cerca de mais {{hours}} horas, até que a substituta seja publicada em todos os lugares.","Certificate deleted. Its chain had already left the trust bundle, so nothing that was verifying has changed.":"Certificado excluído. Sua cadeia já havia saído do pacote de confiança, então nada do que estava sendo verificado mudou.","Certificate deleted. Its chain has been pulled from the trust bundle, so certificates issued under it no longer verify.":"Certificado excluído. Sua cadeia foi removida do pacote de confiança, portanto, os certificados emitidos sob ela não são mais verificados.","Certificate signer":"Signatário do certificado","Certificate signer disabled, and the update in progress was stopped with it. Both authorities stay configured, and Enable resumes signing.":"O signatário do certificado foi desabilitado e a atualização em andamento foi interrompida com ele. Ambas as autoridades permanecem configuradas e a opção Habilitar retomará a assinatura.","Certificate signer disabled. It stops signing now, its configuration is kept, and Enable resumes signing.":"Signatário do certificado desabilitado. Ele interromperá a assinatura agora, sua configuração será mantida e a opção Habilitar retomará a assinatura.","Certificate signer enabled. Its certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle again first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hour, after every region has it.":"Signatário de certificado ativado. A cadeia de certificados é publicada novamente primeiro no pacote de confiança e a assinatura começa em cerca de {{hours}} hora, assim que cada região a receber.","Certificate signer enabled. Its certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle again first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hours, after every region has it.":"Signatário de certificado habilitado. A cadeia de certificados é publicada novamente primeiro no pacote de confiança e a assinatura começa em cerca de {{hours}} horas, assim que cada região a receber.","Certificate signer enabled. Its material was still published, so signing resumed immediately.":"Signatário de certificado habilitado. O material dele ainda estava publicado, então a assinatura foi retomada imediatamente.","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hour, once every region has it.":"Assinatura de certificado ativada. A cadeia de certificados é publicada primeiro no pacote de confiança e a assinatura começa em cerca de {{hours}} hora, quando cada região a tiver.","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hours, once every region has it.":"Assinatura de certificado habilitada. A cadeia de certificados é publicada primeiro no pacote de confiança e a assinatura começa em cerca de {{hours}} horas, assim que cada região a receber.","Certificate verifier information":"Informações do verificador de certificados","Certificates ({{total}})":"Certificados ({{total}})","Certificates: {{reason}}":"Certificados: {{reason}}","Change the facts a workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.":"Altere os fatos que uma workload deve ter atestado para receber uma identidade a partir desse modelo. As identidades que esse modelo já gerou não são afetadas.","Change the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. A workload already holding a session keeps it until the session expires.":"Altere os fatos que uma workload deve ter atestado para ser executada como esta identidade. Uma workload que já mantém uma sessão a mantém até que a sessão expire.","Check again":"Verifique novamente","Checking what is attached to this provider":"Verificando o que está anexado a esse provedor","Choose a condition key":"Escolha uma chave de condição","Choose a fact":"Escolher um fato","Choose a path and pattern for the names. Start from a default or customize your own.":"Escolha um caminho e um padrão para os nomes. Comece com um padrão ou personalize o seu próprio.","Choose a specific name up front so you can grant it access or match an existing naming convention before the workload runs.":"Escolha um nome específico com antecedência para poder conceder acesso a ele ou adequá-lo a uma convenção de nomenclatura existente antes da execução da workload.","Choose a stable, unique name that identifies one environment or group of workloads, for example prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal.":"Escolha um nome estável e exclusivo que identifique um ambiente ou grupo de cargas de trabalho, por exemplo, prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal.","Choose a use case above to add a template.":"Escolha um caso de uso acima para adicionar um modelo.","Choose from this account":"Escolha nesta conta","Choose templates to add, and customize or keep their defaults":"Escolha modelos para adicionar e personalizar ou manter seus padrões","Choose the certificate authority this signer should sign with instead. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. The current authority keeps signing until the replacement has been published long enough for verifiers to pick it up.":"Em vez disso, escolha a autoridade de certificação com a qual esse signatário deve assinar. É necessária uma <link>autoridade de certificação</link> com uma CA subordinada em cada região em que você assinar. A autoridade atual continua assinando até que a substituta tenha sido publicada por tempo suficiente para que os verificadores a obtenham.","Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for a workload.":"Escolha as chaves de condição a serem usadas como fatos de atestado. A plataforma deve atestar todos eles antes que esse modelo emita uma identidade para uma workload.","Choose the facts a workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.":"Escolha os fatos que uma workload deve ter atestado para receber uma identidade a partir desse modelo. Nada é gerado a partir dele até que você o faça.","Choose the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. Nothing can be issued for it until you do.":"Escolha os fatos que uma workload deve ter atestado para ser executada como esta identidade. Nada pode ser emitido para ela até que você o faça.","Choose the provider to create the identity in":"Escolher o provedor no qual criar a identidade","Choose which templates to add by use case, and customize each one or keep its defaults.":"Escolha quais modelos adicionar por caso de uso e personalize cada um deles ou mantenha seus padrões.",Clear:Izt,"Clear filters":"Limpar filtros",Close:Dzt,"Close modal":"Fechar modal","Cluster ARN":"ARN do cluster","Cluster ARNs":"ARNs de clusters","Code editor":"Editor de Código","Complete the confirmation to delete.":"Conclua a confirmação para excluir.","Condition key":"Chave de condição","Configure identity templates for your workload use cases. Each template defines a path pattern used to issue identities uniquely and the facts a workload must prove before an identity is issued.":"Configure modelos de identidade para seus casos de uso de workload. Cada modelo define um padrão de caminho usado para emitir identidades de forma exclusiva e os fatos que uma workload deve provar antes que uma identidade seja emitida.","Configure later":"Configurar equipe",Configured:Lzt,Confirm:Pzt,Contains:Nzt,"Continue setup":"Continuar a configuração","Copy {{label}}":"Copiar {{label}}","Copy ARN":"Copiar ARN","Copy JSON":"Copiar JSON","Could not check everything attached to this provider":"Não foi possível verificar tudo anexado a este provedor","Create a provider":"Crie um provedor","Create a provider for this account":"Crie um provedor para esta conta","Create a provider for your organization":"Crie um provedor para a sua organização","Create a provider to get started":"Crie um provedor para começar","Create a template to automate identity generation":"Crie um modelo para automatizar a geração de identidade","Create declared identity in {{providerName}}":"Crie uma identidade declarada no {{providerName}}","Create identity":"Criar identidade","Create new":"Criar novo","Create provider":"Criar provedor","Create provider and templates":"Criar provedor e modelos","Create service mesh provider":"Criar provedor de malha de serviços","Create templates":"Criar modelos","Create the certificate authority first.":"Crie primeiro a autoridade de certificação.","Create workload identities":"Criar identidades de workloads",Created:Rzt,"Created through":"Criado por meio de","Created time":"Hora de criação","Created values":"Valores criados","Creates a workload identity provider and template for workloads running in one or more EKS clusters under a service mesh, such as Istio.":"Cria um provedor de identidade de workload e um modelo para workloads em execução em um ou mais clusters do EKS em uma malha de serviços, como o Istio.","Creating certificate authority":"Criando autoridade de certificação","Creating the certificate authority":"Criação da autoridade de certificado","Creating this provider sets up these 2 resources.":"A criação desse provedor configura esses 2 recursos.","Current CA":"CA atual","Current provider":"Provedor atual","Custom tag key":"Chave de tag personalizada","Custom tag value":"Valor da tag personalizado","Custom text":"Texto personalizado","Custom text can't be a single period (.) or two periods (..).":"O texto personalizado não pode ser um único ponto (.) ou dois pontos (..).","Customize templates":"Personalizar modelos","Dark themes":"Temas escuros","Declared identity: {{name}}":"Identidade declarada: {{name}}","Default permissions without a policy":"Permissões padrão sem uma política","Defaults to {provider name}.{account ID}.aws.internal. This must match the trust domain set in your service mesh, or the mesh rejects the identities.":"O padrão é {provider name}.{account ID}.aws.internal. Isso deve corresponder ao domínio de confiança definido em sua malha de serviços, ou a malha rejeitará as identidades.","Define an optional path prefix for identities under this template. Lets you filter by prefix when authoring IAM permissions.":"Defina um prefixo de caminho opcional para identidades sob esse modelo. Permite filtrar por prefixo ao criar permissões do IAM.","Define an optional path prefix for this identity. You can filter by this prefix when authoring IAM permissions.":"Defina um prefixo de caminho opcional para esta identidade. Você pode filtrar por esse prefixo ao criar permissões do IAM.","Define an optional prefix for identities under this template. You can filter by this prefix when authoring IAM permissions. The path prefixes this account can use are set by the provider's policy, for example your account ID, and they are checked when you choose Create. If you're not sure which are permitted, ask your organization administrator.":"Defina um prefixo opcional para as identidades sob esse modelo. Você pode filtrar por esse prefixo ao criar permissões do IAM. Os prefixos de caminho que essa conta pode usar são definidos pela política do provedor, como, por exemplo, o ID da sua conta, e são verificados quando você seleciona a opção Criar. Se você não tiver certeza de quais prefixos são permitidos, pergunte ao administrador da sua organização.","Define an optional prefix for this identity. You can filter by this prefix when authoring IAM permissions. The path prefixes this account can use are set by the provider's policy, for example your account ID, and they are checked when you choose Create. If you're not sure which are permitted, ask your organization administrator.":"Defina um prefixo opcional para essa identidade. Você pode filtrar por esse prefixo ao criar permissões do IAM. Os prefixos de caminho que essa conta pode usar são definidos pela política do provedor, como, por exemplo, o ID da sua conta, e são verificados quando você seleciona a opção Criar. Se você não tiver certeza de quais prefixos são permitidos, pergunte ao administrador da sua organização.","Define which workloads are allowed to use this template.":"Defina quais workloads podem usar este modelo.",Delete:Mzt,"Delete certificate?":"Excluir certificado?","Delete provider":"Excluir provedor","Delete provider and resources":"Excluir provedor e recursos","Delete provider?":"Excluir provedor?","Delete template":"Excluir modelo","Delete template?":"Excluir modelo?","Delete the templates under <b>{{providerName}}</b> before deleting the provider. Once deleted, workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials and fail on their next request, and access that you granted to these identities will stop working.":"Exclua os modelos em <b>{{providerName}}</b> antes de excluir o provedor. Depois de excluídos, as workloads que usam essas identidades deixarão de receber credenciais e falharão na próxima solicitação, e o acesso que você concedeu a essas identidades deixará de funcionar.","Delete workload identity?":"Excluir a identidade da workload?","Deleting <b>{{templateName}}</b> will:":"A exclusão de <b>{{templateName}}</b> vai:","Deleting <b>{{workloadIdentifier}}</b> will:":"A exclusão de <b>{{workloadIdentifier}}</b> vai:","Deleting certificates":"Excluindo certificados","Deleting provider":"Excluindo provedor","Deleting templates and workload identities":"Excluindo modelos e identidades de workload","Deleting the provider is taking longer than expected":"A exclusão do provedor está demorando mais do que o esperado",Description:zzt,"Description can't include line breaks or tabs.":"A descrição não pode incluir quebras de linha ou tabulações.","Description must be 1,000 characters or less.":"A descrição deve ter 1.000 caracteres ou menos.","Description must be 255 characters or less.":"A descrição deve ter 255 caracteres ou menos.",Details:Ozt,Disable:Bzt,"Disable certificate signer?":"Desativar o signatário do certificado?","Discovery expiration time":"Tempo de expiração da descoberta",Dismiss:Fzt,"Does not contain":"Não contém","Does not equal":"Não é igual a","Drag or select to resize":"Arraste ou selecione para redimensionar","Each identity is fully the template path, or whatever string you enter when you create the identity.":"Cada identidade é totalmente o caminho do modelo ou qualquer string inserida ao criar a identidade.",Edit:$zt,"Edit attestation policy":"Editar política de atestado","Edit filter":"Editar filtro","Edit identity format and scope":"Editar o formato e o escopo da identidade","Edit identity path":"Editar caminho de identidade",Editing:jzt,Enable:Wzt,"Enable certificate signer":"Habilitar signatário do certificado","Enable certificate signer?":"Habilitar o signatário do certificado?","End signing time":"Horário de término da assinatura","Enter a 12-digit AWS account ID.":"Insira um ID de conta da AWS de 12 dígitos.","Enter a certificate authority ID.":"Insira um ID de autoridade de certificação.","Enter a cluster ARN.":"Insira o ARN do cluster.","Enter a name":"Insira um nome","Enter a name for the certificate authority.":"Insira um nome para a autoridade de certificação.","Enter a name.":"Insira um nome.","Enter a path":"Inserir um caminho","Enter a path prefix value":"Insira um valor de prefixo de caminho","Enter a trust domain.":"Insira um domínio de confiança.","Enter a value":"Insira um valor","Enter a whole number of hours from 1 to 48.":"Insira um número inteiro de horas de 1 a 48.","Enter key":"Inserir chave","Enter prefix":"Inserir prefixo","Enter the ID of a certificate authority or choose from below":"Insira o ID de uma autoridade de certificação ou escolha uma das opções abaixo","Enter the policy as valid JSON.":"Insira a política como JSON válido.","Enter value":"Inserir valor",equals:qzt,Equals:Uzt,Error:"Erro","Error fetching the details":"Erro ao obter os detalhes",Errors:Vzt,"Every account in this organization ({{organizationId}})":"Todas as contas dessa organização ({{organizationId}})","Every X.509-SVID this provider issues right now is signed by this certificate. It stops in {{hours}} hour, at {{at}}, when the incoming certificate takes over.":"Cada X.509-SVID que esse provedor emite agora é assinado por esse certificado. Ele será interrompido em {{hours}} hora, às {{at}}, quando o certificado de entrada assumir.","Every X.509-SVID this provider issues right now is signed by this certificate. It stops in {{hours}} hours, at {{at}}, when the incoming certificate takes over.":"Cada X.509-SVID que esse provedor emite agora é assinado por esse certificado. Ele será interrompido em {{hours}} horas, às {{at}}, quando o certificado de entrada assumir.","Every X.509-SVID this provider issues right now is signed by this certificate. No replacement is scheduled, so it keeps signing until you update or disable the signer.":"Cada X.509-SVID que esse provedor emite agora é assinado por este certificado. Nenhuma substituição está agendada, portanto, ele continuará assinando até que você atualize ou desabilite o signatário.","Failed to copy":"Falha ao copiar","Failed to copy JSON":"Falha ao copiar JSON","Failed to load attestation policy.":"Falha ao carregar a política de atestado.","Failed to load templates.":"Falha ao carregar modelos.","Failed to remove attestation policy.":"Falha ao remover a política de atestado.","Filter providers":"Filtrar provedores","Filter templates":"Filtrar modelos","Filter themes":"Filtrar temas","Find providers":"Encontrar provedores","Find templates":"Encontrar modelos","Find theme":"Encontrar tema","For example, prod":"Por exemplo, prod","For mutual TLS, attach a certificate authority":"Para TLS mútuo, anexe uma autoridade de certificação","For token-based services, issue a JWT":"Para serviços baseados em tokens, emita um JWT",Format:Hzt,"Generating its key":"Geração da sua chave","Get started":"Conceitos básicos","Getting started":"Primeiros passos","Give an agent or workload its own identity - <em>Preview</em>":"Dê a um agente ou workload sua própria identidade - <em>Prévia</em>","Give each workload a unique identity, so you can grant it access and audit what it did rather than sharing one role.":"Dê a cada workload uma identidade exclusiva, para que você possa conceder acesso e auditar o que ela fez em vez de compartilhar um perfil.","Give your workloads an identity":"Forneça uma identidade às suas workloads","Go to the providers list":"Ir para a lista de provedores","Govern who can create resources":"Controle quem pode criar recursos","Govern who can create templates referring to this provider":"Controle quem pode criar modelos referentes a este provedor","Greater than":"Maior que","Greater than or equal":"Maior que ou igual a","hour(s)":"hora(s)","How it works":"Como funciona","IAM roles define what a workload can do. Workload Identity tells you which workload is doing it.":"Os perfis do IAM definem o que uma workload pode fazer. O Workload Identity informa qual workload está realizando a ação.","Identities are issued at runtime from facts the workload proves, not just from what an admin assigns.":"As identidades são emitidas em runtime com base nas informações que a workload comprova, e não apenas naquelas atribuídas por um administrador.",'Identity "{{identityId}}" not found.':"Identidade “{{identityId}}” não encontrada.","Identity format and scope":"Formato e escopo da identidade","Identity name":"Nome de identidade","Identity path":"Caminho de identidade","Identity selection":"Seleção de identidade","If anything is still attached, deleting the provider fails.":"Se alguma coisa ainda estiver anexada, a exclusão do provedor falhará.","In transition":"Em transição","In transition certificate authority ID":"ID da autoridade de certificação em transição","In transition: incoming, not yet signing":"Em transição: de entrada, ainda não está assinando",Inactive:Kzt,"Inactive: retired, no longer trusted":"Inativo: descontinuado, não é mais confiável","Incoming CA":"CA de entrada",Info:Gzt,"Invalid key. Keys can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"Chave inválida. As chaves só podem conter letras Unicode, dígitos, espaços em branco e qualquer um dos seguintes itens: _.:/=+@-","Invalid provider name. Use alphanumeric and '-_.' characters.":"Nome de provedor inválido. Use caracteres alfanuméricos e '-_.'","Invalid request":"Solicitação inválida","Invalid template name. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters.":"Nome de modelo inválido. Use caracteres alfanuméricos e '-_'.","Invalid value. Values can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"Valor inválido. Os valores só podem conter letras Unicode, dígitos, espaços em branco e qualquer um dos seguintes itens: _.:/=+@-","Issued after the workload proves itself":"Emitida após a workload comprovar sua identidade","Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. Standard pricing applies to the creation and use of AWS Private CA.":"Emite os X.509-SVIDs que as workloads desse provedor apresentam como certificados de cliente para sistemas fora da AWS. Ele precisa de uma <link>autoridade de certificação</link> com uma CA subordinada em cada região em que você fizer login. O preço padrão se aplica à criação e ao uso da CA Privada da AWS.","Issues X.509-SVIDs, for mTLS peers that verify a client certificate.":"Emite X.509-SVIDs, para pares mTLS que verificam um certificado de cliente.","Issuing its CA certificate":"Emitindo seu certificado CA","It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. Leave it alone and it becomes inactive on its own, after which deleting it changes nothing.":"Ele parou de assinar, mas sua cadeia ainda está publicada, então as workloads dependem dele para verificar as credenciais emitidas anteriormente. Excluí-lo agora remove a cadeia de uma vez e essas credenciais começam a falhar. Ele ficará inativo por si só caso não seja usado, após o qual excluí-lo não mudará nada.","Item moved from position {{initialPosition}} to position {{finalPosition}} of {{total}}":"Item movido da posição {{initialPosition}} para a posição {{finalPosition}} de {{total}}.","JSON copied":"JSON copiado",JWKS:Yzt,"JWKS popover":"Cada chave de assinatura ativa, selecionada por kid. A AWS publica uma nova chave aqui antes de alternar a assinatura para ela.","JWT Outbound signers column Signing algorithm":"Algoritmo de assinatura","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key":"Algoritmos de chave","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key issue time":"Assinatura de chave atual desde","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key popover":"A AWS gera as chaves e as alterna de acordo com sua própria programação, publicando cada nova chave no JWKS antes de começar a assinar. Os algoritmos permanecem os mesmos em uma rotação, portanto, um verificador que lê o JWKS não precisa de nenhuma alteração da sua parte.","JWT Outbound signers desc":"Assina JWT-SVIDs, para sistemas que verificam um token assinado.","JWT Outbound signers label oidc discovery":"Descoberta do OIDC","JWT Outbound signers label oidc discovery popover":"O documento de descoberta padrão. A maioria dos verificadores precisa somente desse URL, pois eles encontram as chaves a partir dele.","JWT Outbound signers label oidc issuer":"Emissor do OIDC","JWT Outbound signers label oidc issuer popover":"A declaração iss de cada JWT-SVID assinada aqui. Um verificador que fixa um emissor fixa esse valor.","JWT Outbound signers section title":"Informações do verificador de token","JWT Outbound signers status":"Padrão fornecido pela AWS","JWT Outbound signers title":"Signatário do JWT",Key:Jzt,"Learn about organization providers":"Saiba mais sobre os provedores da organização","Learn about organization providers (opens in a new tab)":"Saiba mais sobre os provedores da organização (abre em uma nova guia)","Learn more":"Saiba mais","Learn more about deleting a provider (opens in a new tab)":"Saiba mais sobre como excluir um provedor (abre em uma nova guia)","Learn more:":"Saiba mais:","Less than":"Menos que","Less than or equal":"Menor que ou igual a","Let other accounts or principals in your organization create templates and identities under this provider, within the path prefixes you choose.":"Permita que outras contas ou entidades principais em sua organização criem modelos e identidades sob esse provedor nos prefixos de caminho que você escolher.","Let workloads reach non-AWS resources":"Permita que as workloads alcancem recursos fora da AWS","Letters, digits, . - _ with a single / between parts. No / at the start or end.":"Letras, dígitos, . - _ com um único / entre as partes. Sem / no início ou no final.","Letters, digits, . - _ with a single / between parts. No / at the start or end. Cannot be changed later.":"Letras, dígitos, . - _ com um único / entre as partes. Sem / no início ou no final. Não poderá ser alterado posteriormente.","Light themes":"Temas claros","Ln {{row}}, Col {{column}}":"Ln {{row}}, Col {{column}}","Loading certificate authorities":"Carregando autoridades de certificação","Loading code editor":"Carregando editor de código","Loading tag keys":"Carregando chaves de tag","Loading tag values":"Carregando valores de tag","Loading tags that are associated with this resource":"Carregar tags associadas a esse recurso","Loading your organization's providers":"Carregamento dos provedores da sua organização","Make sure the new certificate authority uses the same algorithm as the current signer, {{algorithm}}. If you choose a different algorithm, you need to disable this signer, delete its certificates, then enable it again with the new authority.":"Certifique-se de que a nova autoridade de certificação use o mesmo algoritmo do assinante atual, {{algorithm}}. Se você escolher outro algoritmo, precisará desabilitar esse signatário, excluir seus certificados e habilitá-lo novamente com a nova autoridade.","Manage CAs and replication in the AWS Private CA console":"Gerencie CAs e replicação no console da CA Privada da AWS","Manage tags":"Gerenciar tags","Manage the provider":"Gerenciar o provedor","Manual creation":"Criação manual","Manually create":"Criar manualmente","Matching workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.":"As workloads correspondentes recebem seu próprio nome de identidade no momento em que são iniciadas, em qualquer escala.","Maximum 1,000 characters.":"Máximo de mil caracteres.","Maximum 255 characters.":"Máximo de 255 caracteres.","Member accounts":"Contas de membros","Member accounts can add their own templates, namespaced by account ID.":"As contas dos membros podem adicionar seus próprios modelos, com namespaces por ID de conta.","Member accounts cannot add their own templates.":"As contas dos membros não podem adicionar seus próprios modelos.","Minimum signing delay":"Atraso mínimo de assinatura","Moving item to position {{currentPosition}} of {{total}}":"Movendo o item para a posição {{currentPosition}} de {{total}}","Multiple EKS clusters":"Vários clusters do EKS",Name:Zzt,"Name must be 128 characters or less.":"O nome deve ter até 128 caracteres.","Name this identity":"Nomear essa identidade","Name this provider":"Nomeie este provedor","Name values":"Valores de nome","Names identities automatically as workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.":"Nomeia identidades automaticamente quando as workloads são iniciadas para que você não as crie ou gerencie uma por uma.","Naming scheme":"Esquema de nomeação",New:Xzt,"Next month":"Próximo mês","Next page":"Próxima página","Next step":"Próxima etapa","No attestation policy set. Define one so a workload can run as this identity.":"Nenhuma política de atestado definida. Defina uma para que uma workload possa ser executada com essa identidade.","No attestation policy. No workload will be issued workload identities from this template until you add one.":"Sem política de atestado. Nenhuma workload receberá identidades de workload deste modelo até que você adicione uma.","No by default, but can add a policy":"Não por padrão, mas pode adicionar uma política","No certificate authorities in this account":"Nenhuma autoridade de certificação nesta conta","no domain":"nenhum domínio","No long-lived secrets":"Sem segredos duradouros","No match found":"Nenhuma correspondência encontrada","No matches":"Nenhuma correspondência","No path segments. Add a fact, condition key, or custom text.":"Nenhum segmento de caminho. Adicione um fato, uma chave de condição ou um texto personalizado.","No tags associated with the resource.":"Nenhuma tag associada ao recurso.","No templates added yet":"Ainda não foram adicionados modelos","No workload identity providers":"Sem provedores de identidade de workload","No workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.":"Nenhuma workload corresponde a esse modelo, portanto, ele não gera identidades.","No, and cannot be granted":"Não, e não pode ser concedido",None:Qzt,"None – names are defined by templates or declared individually":"Nenhum: os nomes são definidos por modelos ou declarados individualmente","Not saved: {{keys}}.":"Não salvo: {{keys}}.","Not set":"Não definido",Notifications:eOt,"Once the attestation policy is removed, matching workloads will not be issued workload identities until you add a policy again.":"Depois que a política de atestado for removida, as workloads correspondentes não receberão identidades de workload até que você adicione uma política novamente.","One bundle per provider, and one URL. It carries every authority the provider publishes: both outbound signers, and during an update both the current and incoming certificate authority, which is what lets verifiers accept either one through the handover. Your own AWS workloads get these keys automatically; send this to systems outside AWS.":"Um pacote por provedor e um URL. Ele carrega todas as autoridades que o provedor publica: ambos os assinantes externos e, durante uma atualização, tanto a autoridade de certificação atual quanto a de entrada, que é o que permite que os verificadores aceitem qualquer uma delas durante a transferência. Suas próprias workloads da AWS recebem essas chaves automaticamente; envie este pacote para sistemas fora da AWS.","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level providers.":"Somente a conta gerencial ou um administrador delegado pode excluir provedores no nível da organização.","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level templates.":"Somente a conta gerencial ou um administrador delegado pode excluir modelos no nível da organização.","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level workload identities.":"Somente a conta gerencial ou um administrador delegado pode excluir identidades de workload no nível da organização.","Opens in a new tab":"Abre em uma nova guia",Operator:tOt,Operators:aOt,optional:nOt,or:"ou","Organization provider":"Provedor da organização","Organization scoped":"Escopo da organização","Organize the provider and track its cost with tags.":"Organize o provedor e monitore seus custos com tags.","Other accounts in your organization":"Outras contas em sua organização","Other condition keys":"Outras chaves de condição","Outbound signer":"Signatário de saída","Outbound signers page desc":"Permita que suas workloads comprovem sua identidade para serviços fora da AWS. Esse provedor assina os tokens e certificados que elas apresentam.","Outbound signers page title":"Signatário de saída","Owning account":"Conta proprietária","Page {{pageNumber}} of all pages":"Página {{pageNumber}} de todas as páginas",path:iOt,Path:rOt,"path from templates":"caminho dos modelos","Path is the per-workload part of an identity name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts a workload proves.":"O caminho é a parte por workload de um nome de identidade. Ele é preenchido no runtime com base nos fatos comprovados por uma workload.","Path must be 255 characters or less.":"O caminho deve ter até 255 caracteres.","Path pattern":"Padrão de caminho","Path prefix":"Prefixo do caminho","Path prefix must be 64 characters or less.":"O prefixo do caminho deve ter 64 caracteres ou menos.","Path values":"Valores de caminho","Picked up item at position {{position}} of {{total}}":"Item retirado da posição {{position}} de {{total}}","Policy details":"Detalhes da política","Policy: Define how a workload attests to get the identity":"Política: definir como uma workload atesta a obtenção da identidade",Preferences:oOt,"Press space or enter to activate drag, use arrow keys to move, then press space or enter to confirm":"Pressione Espaço ou Enter para ativar o arrastar, depois use as teclas de seta para mover e Espaço ou Enter para confirmar",Preview:sOt,"Previous CA":"CA anterior","Previous certificates ({{certificateCount}})":"Certificados anteriores ({{certificateCount}})","Previous month":"Mês anterior","Previous page":"Página anterior",Properties:lOt,Property:cOt,Provided:dOt,Provider:uOt,"Provider {{providerName}} deleted.":"Provedor {{providerName}} excluído.","Provider name":"Nome do provedor","Provider name must be 128 characters or less.":"O nome do provedor deve ter 128 caracteres ou menos.","Provider not deleted":"Provedor não excluído","Provider not found":"Provedor não encontrado.","Provider overview":"Visão geral do provedor","Provider selection":"Seleção do provedor","Provider settings":"Configurações do provedor","Provider values":"Valores do provedor",Providers:pOt,"Providers to issue workload identities":"Provedores para emitir identidades de workloads","Quick create":"Criação rápida","Quick create makes an RSA 2048 certificate authority in AWS Private CA in your account, which has its own charges. The algorithm is fixed and cannot be changed later without setting the signer up again.":"O Quick Create gera uma autoridade de certificação RSA 2048 na CA Privada da AWS em sua conta, o que acarreta cobranças próprias. O algoritmo é fixo e não poderá ser alterado posteriormente sem configurar o signatário novamente.",Ready:hOt,Recommended:mOt,"Recommended for most workloads":"Recomendado para a maioria das workloads",Refresh:gOt,"Refresh certificate authorities":"Atualizar autoridades de certificação","Refresh certificate signer status":"Atualizar o status do signatário do certificado",Remove:vOt,"Remove {{name}}":"Remover {{name}}","Remove attestation policy":"Remover política de atestado","Remove cluster ARN":"Remover o ARN do cluster","Remove condition":"Remover condição","Remove filter {{filter}}":"Remover filtro {{filter}}","Remove governance policy?":"Remover a política de governança?","Remove tag {{key}}":"Remover a tag {{key}}","Removed tags were not saved":"As tags removidas não foram salvas","Reorder {{name}}":"Reordenar {{name}}","Reordering canceled":"A reordenação foi cancelada.","Required for service mesh providers.":"Obrigatório para provedores de malha de serviços.","Required for service mesh providers. A service mesh provider is scoped to the account that runs the EKS cluster.":"Obrigatório para provedores de malha de serviços. Um provedor de malha de serviços tem como escopo a conta que executa o cluster EKS.","Reset to default":"Redefinir para padrão","Resize handle":"Alça de redimensionamento","Resolved example:":"Exemplo resolvido:","Restricted by":"Restringido por",Retry:fOt,"Review the tags and save again.":"Revise as tags e salve novamente.","Running a service mesh, such as Istio? It needs its own provider, one per cluster.":"Executando uma malha de serviços, como o Istio? Ele precisa de seu próprio provedor, um por cluster.",Save:yOt,"Save changes":"Salvar alterações","Save or cancel your edits before creating templates.":"Salve ou cancele suas edições antes de criar modelos.","Save or cancel your edits before creating the provider.":"Salve ou cancele as edições antes de criar o provedor.","Save or cancel your template edits to change the scope.":"Salve ou cancele as edições do modelo para alterar o escopo.",scheme:bOt,Scheme:wOt,"scheme and trust domain":"esquema e domínio de confiança","Scheme sets the format this provider uses to name identities.":"O esquema define o formato que esse provedor usa para nomear identidades.",Scope:kOt,"Scope sets which accounts are allowed to use this provider.":"O escopo define quais contas podem usar esse provedor.","Scope values":"Valores de escopo","Search tags":"Pesquisar tags","Segment that partitions identities.":"Segmento que particiona as identidades.","Select {{name}}":"Selecionar {{name}}","Select a row to delete.":"Selecione uma linha para excluir.",Set:"Definir","Set a naming pattern":"Definir um padrão de nomenclatura","Set an attestation rule":"Definir uma regra de atestado","Set by your provider.":"Definido pelo seu provedor.","Set the naming format and usage scope that every workload identity from this provider inherits.":"Defina o formato de nomenclatura e o escopo de uso que cada identidade de carga de trabalho desse provedor herda.","Set the unique path pattern that every workload identity generated by this template follows. Cannot be changed later.":"Defina o padrão de caminho exclusivo seguido por todas as identidades de workload geradas por este modelo. Não será possível alterá-lo posteriormente.","Set up a provider to hold the templates that generate identity names, the identities you declare directly, and the signers that sign credentials for systems outside AWS.":"Configure um provedor para armazenar os modelos que geram nomes de identidade, as identidades que você declara diretamente e os signatários que assinam credenciais para sistemas fora da AWS.","Set up a service mesh provider for this account":"Configure um provedor de malha de serviços para esta conta","Set up a way to issue workload identities":"Configure uma forma de emitir identidades de workloads","Set up for your use cases":"Configure para seus casos de uso","Sets your trust domain, the start of every identity name.":"Define seu domínio de confiança, o início de cada nome de identidade.","Setting up the certificate authority stopped. You can continue from where it left off.":"A configuração da autoridade de certificado foi interrompida. Você pode continuar do ponto em que parou.","Settings from your provider {{providerName}}":"Configurações do seu provedor {{providerName}}","Short-lived credentials renew automatically and follow the SPIFFE standard, so they work with service meshes like Istio and with SaaS applications.":"As credenciais de curta duração são renovadas automaticamente e seguem o padrão SPIFFE, garantindo compatibilidade com malhas de serviços, como o Istio, e aplicações SaaS.","Show all {{errorCount}} errors":"Mostrar todos os {{errorCount}} erros","Show fewer":"Mostrar menos","Show more":"Mostrar mais","Signing algorithm":"Algoritmo de assinatura","Signing resumes immediately, because this certificate is still published in the trust bundle.":"A assinatura é retomada imediatamente, pois esse certificado ainda está publicado no pacote de confiança.","Signing start time":"Hora de início da assinatura","Some templates could not be loaded":"Alguns modelos não puderam ser carregados","Something went wrong":"Ocorreu um erro","Sortable path segment":"Segmento de caminho classificável",Status:SOt,"Status bar":"Barra de status","Stop access you granted to this identity name from working":"Impeça que o acesso que você concedeu a esse nome de identidade funcione","Stop access you granted to those identity names from working":"Impeça que o acesso que você concedeu a esses nomes de identidade funcione","Stop matching workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request":"Impeça que as workloads correspondentes obtenham uma identidade, fazendo com que falhem na próxima solicitação","Stop the identities it generated from resolving":"Impedir que as identidades geradas por ele sejam resolvidas","Stop the workload running as this identity, so it fails on its next request":"Interrompa a execução da workload com esta identidade, para que ela falhe na próxima solicitação","Stopped signing and no longer in the trust bundle, so nothing verifies against them. Deleting one is safe.":"Pararam de assinar e não estão mais no pacote de confiança, portanto nada é verificado em relação a eles. Excluir um é seguro.",Subject:_Ot,Success:xOt,"Tag keys could not be retrieved":"Não foi possível recuperar as chaves de tag","Tag values could not be retrieved":"Não foi possível recuperar valores de tag",Tags:AOt,"Tags could not be loaded":"As tags não puderam ser carregadas","Tags for {{name}} have been updated.":"Tags para {{name}} foram atualizadas.","Tags not saved":"Tags não salvas",Template:EOt,'Template "{{templateId}}" not found.':"Modelo “{{templateId}}” não encontrado.","Template {{name}}: {{reason}}":"Modelo {{name}}: {{reason}}","Template {{templateName}} deleted.":"Modelo {{templateName}} excluído.","Template {{templateNames}} created.":"Modelo {{templateNames}} criado.","Template name":"Nome do modelo","Template name must be 128 characters or less.":"O nome do modelo deve ter 128 caracteres ou menos.","Template name values":"Valores do nome do modelo","Template: {{name}}":"Modelo: {{name}}",Templates:COt,"Templates ({{total}})":"Modelos ({{total}})","Templates are being created. Wait for the request to finish.":"Os modelos estão sendo criados. Aguarde a conclusão da solicitação.","Templates give matching workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.":"Os modelos atribuem automaticamente um nome de identidade próprio às workloads correspondentes. Cada um usa o prefixo do nome desse provedor, além de um caminho e um padrão.","Templates that member accounts created under this provider are not visible here and cannot be deleted from this account. If any exist, deleting the provider fails.":"Os modelos que as contas de membros criaram sob esse provedor não estão visíveis aqui e não podem ser excluídos dessa conta. Se houver algum, a exclusão do provedor falhará.","Templates: {{reason}}":"Modelos: {{reason}}","The account that owns the certificate authority.":"A conta que possui a autoridade de certificação.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it.":"A política de atestado controla como as identidades são emitidas por esse provedor. Uma workload deve atender a todas as condições, como seu tipo, detalhes e onde ela é executada, conforme atestado pelo serviço que a hospeda.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.":"A política de atestado controla como as identidades são emitidas por esse provedor. Uma workload deve atender a todas as condições, como seu tipo, detalhes e onde ela é executada, conforme atestado pelo serviço que a hospeda. Pode ser editada posteriormente.","The attestation policy controls which workloads get an identity from this provider. A workload must meet every condition, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. It's generated from the EKS clusters you entered. You can edit it later.":"A política de atestado controla quais workloads obtêm uma identidade desse provedor. Uma workload precisa atender a todas as condições, conforme atestado pelo serviço que a hospeda. Ela é gerada a partir dos clusters do EKS que você inseriu. Você poderá editá-la mais tarde.","The attestation policy lists the facts a workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so a workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.":"A política de atestação lista os fatos que uma workload deve provar antes que esse provedor emita uma identidade para ela. A plataforma de computação os atesta, portanto, uma workload não pode reivindicar uma identidade que não seja sua.","The attester vouches for the workload, and it must match every condition to run as this identity.":"O atestador atesta a workload, e ela deve atender a todas as condições para ser executada como esta identidade.","The certificate authority is still being set up.":"A autoridade de certificado ainda está sendo configurada.","The ID at the end of the certificate authority's ARN in AWS Private CA.":"O ID no final do ARN da autoridade de certificação na CA privada da AWS.","The identity name is the provider's naming scheme, a path prefix, and a path pattern.":"O nome da identidade é o esquema de nomenclatura do provedor, um prefixo de caminho e um padrão de caminho.","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag key is 128.":"O número máximo de caracteres que você pode usar em uma chave de tag é 128.","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag value is 256.":"O número máximo de caracteres que você pode usar em um valor de tag é 256.","The path can be up to {{maxLength}} characters.":"O caminho pode ter até {{maxLength}} caracteres.","The path doesn't support these segments: {{segments}}. Remove them, and add what you need from the following cards.":"O caminho não é compatível com estes segmentos: {{segments}}. Remova-os e adicione o que você precisa dos cartões a seguir.","The path is already the default.":"O caminho já é o padrão.","The path is the per-workload part of each identity's name. Keep the Region in front so names stay unique across accounts and Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.":"O caminho é a parte relacionada a cada workload do nome de cada identidade. Mantenha a Região na frente para que os nomes permaneçam exclusivos em todas as contas e Regiões ou reorganize os segmentos para que correspondam à convenção de nomenclatura da sua equipe.","The path prefixes your policy allows":"Os prefixos de caminho que sua política permite","The permissions defined in this policy for <b>{{providerName}}</b> stop applying.":"As permissões definidas nesta política para <b>{{providerName}}</b> deixam de ser aplicadas.","The provider could not be deleted. Try again.":"O provedor não pôde ser excluído. Tente novamente.","The provider is being created. Wait for the request to finish.":"O provedor está sendo criado. Aguarde a conclusão da solicitação.","The provider might still be deleted. Check the providers list later.":"O provedor ainda pode ser excluído. Verifique a lista de provedores mais tarde.","The resource policy on this provider controls who can associate templates with it.":"A política de recursos desse provedor controla quem pode associar modelos a ele.","The soonest the new certificate can take over. It publishes to the trust bundle first, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. Signing may start later than this, never sooner.":"O momento mais cedo em que o novo certificado pode assumir. Ele é publicado primeiro no pacote de confiança para que cada verificador possa validá-lo antes que qualquer item seja assinado com ele. A assinatura pode começar depois desse horário, mas nunca antes.","The soonest this certificate can start signing. It publishes to the trust bundle first, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. Signing may start later than this, never sooner.":"O mais cedo possível para que esse certificado comece a assinar. Ele é publicado primeiro no pacote de confiança, para que cada verificador possa verificá-lo antes que qualquer coisa seja assinada com ele. A assinatura pode começar mais tarde do que isso, nunca antes.",Theme:TOt,"There was an error loading the code editor.":"Ocorreu um erro ao carregar o editor de código.","These clusters set the template's <policyLink>attestation policy</policyLink>.":"Esses clusters definem a <policyLink>política de atestação</policyLink> do modelo.","These resources need to be deleted before deleting the provider.":"Esses recursos precisam ser excluídos antes de excluir o provedor.","This account ({{accountId}})":"Esta conta ({{accountId}})","This action deletes the workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.":"Essa ação exclui o provedor de identidade da workload <b>{{providerName}}</b>.","This cannot be undone, and creating a provider with the same name later does not restore anything. To proceed, complete the steps below.":"Isso não poderá ser desfeito, e criar um provedor com o mesmo nome posteriormente não restaurará nada. Para continuar, conclua as etapas abaixo.","This cannot be undone, and the path this template reserved stays reserved. No future template can generate identities under it.":"Isto não pode ser desfeito e o caminho reservado por esse modelo permanece reservado. Nenhum modelo futuro pode gerar identidades sob ele.","This cannot be undone, and this name stays reserved. It is never issued again, so you cannot recreate this identity under the same name.":"Isso não pode ser desfeito e esse nome permanece reservado. Ela nunca é emitida novamente, portanto você não pode recriar essa identidade com o mesmo nome.","This certificate authority uses {{caAlgorithm}}. Rotation keeps the signer's {{signerAlgorithm}} algorithm, so choose a {{signerAlgorithm}} certificate authority instead.":"Essa autoridade de certificação usa {{caAlgorithm}}. A rotação mantém o algoritmo {{signerAlgorithm}} do signatário, então escolha uma autoridade de certificação {{signerAlgorithm}} em vez disso.","This certificate has left the trust bundle, so it publishes again first. Signing starts after about {{hours}} hour, once every region has it.":"Esse certificado saiu do pacote de confiança, portanto, será publicado novamente primeiro. A assinatura começa após cerca de {{hours}} hora, uma vez que cada região o tenha.","This certificate has left the trust bundle, so it publishes again first. Signing starts after about {{hours}} hours, once every region has it.":"Esse certificado saiu do pacote de confiança, então ele é publicado novamente primeiro. A assinatura começa após cerca de {{hours}} horas, assim que cada região o tiver.","This certificate is validating, so deleting it stops verification immediately":"Este certificado está sendo validado, portanto, excluí-lo interrompe a verificação imediatamente","This certificate stopped signing and its chain has left the trust bundle, so nothing verifies against it. It stays listed as history until you delete it, and deleting it is safe: no credential depends on it, and the certificate signer keeps signing.":"Esse certificado parou de assinar e sua cadeia saiu do pacote de confiança, portanto, nada pode ser validado com ele. Ele permanece listado como histórico até que você o exclua, e excluí-lo é seguro: nenhuma credencial depende dele e o signatário do certificado continua assinando.","This cluster is already listed.":"Esse cluster já está listado.","This condition key and operator combination already exists":"Já existe uma combinação de chave e operador de condição.","This doesn't look like a valid EKS cluster ARN. An invalid ARN will leave workloads in that cluster without an identity.":"Isso não parece um ARN válido do cluster do EKS. Um ARN inválido deixará as workloads nesse cluster sem uma identidade.","This management account and delegated administrators":"Esta conta gerencial e administradores delegados","This organization ({{organizationId}})":"Esta organização ({{organizationId}})","This policy's cluster ARNs don't match the clusters you entered. Changing the clusters won't update this policy. Continue only if that's intended.":"Os ARNs de cluster dessa política não correspondem aos clusters que você inseriu. Alterar os clusters não atualizará essa política. Continue somente se for esse o objetivo.","This provider has no naming scheme, so the path you enter is the full identity name.":"Esse provedor não tem esquema de nomenclatura, portanto, o caminho inserido é o nome completo da identidade.","This provider names every identity using the open standard.":"Esse provedor nomeia cada identidade usando o padrão aberto.","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. Both certificates below stop, including the one still in transition, so the update does not complete. Both stay configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"Esse provedor para de emitir X.509-SVIDs imediatamente, e as workloads que precisam de um certificado de cliente começarão a falhar na próxima solicitação. Os dois certificados abaixo param, incluindo o que ainda está em transição, portanto, a atualização não é concluída. Ambos permanecem configurados. Os certificados já emitidos continuam sendo verificados por cerca de 12 horas e a opção Habilitar retomará a assinatura.","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"Esse provedor para de emitir X.509-SVIDs imediatamente, e as cargas de trabalho que precisam de um certificado de cliente começarão a falhar na próxima solicitação. O certificado abaixo permanece configurado. Os certificados já emitidos continuam sendo verificados por cerca de 12 horas e a opção Ativar retoma a assinatura.","This provider's policy doesn't allow this path prefix \"{{pathPrefix}}\" for your account. Ask your organization administrator which path prefixes are permitted.":"A política desse provedor não permite esse prefixo de caminho “{{pathPrefix}}” para sua conta. Pergunte ao administrador da sua organização quais prefixos de caminho são permitidos.","This removes the certificate from the provider and pulls its chain from the trust bundle immediately. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"Isso remove o certificado do provedor e retira sua cadeia do pacote de confiança imediatamente. A própria autoridade de certificação permanece na CA privada da AWS, inalterada.","This removes the certificate from the provider. Its chain already left the trust bundle, so nothing that is verifying today changes. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"Isso remove o certificado do provedor. Sua cadeia já saiu do pacote de confiança, portanto nada do que está sendo verificado hoje muda. A própria autoridade de certificação permanece na CA privada da AWS, inalterada.","This tag will be removed upon saving changes":"Esta tag será removida após salvar as alterações","This usually takes a few minutes. Keep this page open until it finishes.":"Isso geralmente leva alguns minutos. Mantenha essa página aberta até que a operação termine.",Today:IOt,"Too many requests":"Excesso de solicitações","Trace and control access per workload":"Rastreie e controle o acesso por workload","Trust bundle":"Pacote de confiança","trust domain":"domínio de confiança","Trust domain":"Domínio de confiança","Trust domain is the root of trust for the SPIFFE naming scheme. It is a logical name that follows DNS naming style, for example prod.acme.com, but does not need to match a real DNS record.":"O domínio de confiança é a raiz da confiança para o esquema de nomenclatura SPIFFE. É um nome lógico que segue o estilo de nomenclatura de DNS, por exemplo, prod.acme.com, mas não precisa corresponder a um registro DNS real.","Try again. If the problem continues, contact AWS Support.":"Tente novamente. Se o problema persistir, entre em contato com o AWS Support.","Unable to load templates":"Não é possível carregar modelos",Undo:DOt,"Up to 128 characters. Must be unique per provider.":"Até 128 caracteres. Deve ser exclusivo por provedor.","Up to 128 characters. Use alphanumeric and '-_.' characters. Must be unique in your organization. Can't be changed after the provider is created.":"Até 128 caracteres. Use caracteres alfanuméricos e '-_.' Deve ser exclusivo em sua organização. Não pode ser alterado após a criação do provedor.","Up to 128 characters. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters. Must be unique per provider.":"Até 128 caracteres. Use caracteres alfanuméricos e '-_'. Deve ser exclusivo por provedor.",Update:LOt,"Update certificate signer":"Atualizar signatário do certificado",'Use "{{key}}"':"Use “{{key}}”",'Use "{{value}}"':"Usar “{{value}}”","Use case":"Caso de uso","Use cases":"Casos de uso","Use default templates":"Usar modelos padrão","Use letters, digits, and . - _ characters, with a single / between parts. No / at the start or end, and a part can't be . or ..":"Use letras, dígitos e caracteres . - _, com uma única / entre as partes. Sem / no início ou no final, e uma parte não pode ser . ou ..","Use one from another account":"Use um de outra conta","Use only Latin letters, numbers, spaces, tabs, line breaks, and standard keyboard symbols.":"Use somente letras latinas, números, espaços, tabulações, quebras de linha e símbolos padrão do teclado.","Use only letters, digits, - and _ characters.":"Use apenas letras, dígitos e os caracteres - e _.","Use only letters, digits, . - and _ characters. The path can't be . or ..":"Use somente letras, dígitos e os caracteres . - e _. O caminho não pode ser . ou ..","Use only letters, digits, periods (.), hyphens (-), and underscores (_).":"Use somente letras, dígitos, pontos (.), hifens (-) e sublinhados (_).","Use the workload identity in trust policies, resource policies, or SCPs. Each call is recorded in CloudTrail with the workload's identity.":"Use a identidade de workload em políticas de confiança, políticas de recursos ou SCPs. Cada chamada é registrada no CloudTrail com a identidade da workload.",'Use: "{{text}}"':"Usar: “{{text}}”","Used as the common name in the certificate authority's subject.":"Usado como nome comum no assunto da autoridade de certificação.",Validating:POt,"Validating: stopped signing, still trusted":"Validação: interrompeu a assinatura, ainda é confiável",Value:NOt,"Value must be 256 characters or less.":"O valor deve ter 256 caracteres ou menos.",Values:ROt,"View all":"Visualizar tudo","View all notifications":"Visualizar todas as notificações","View JSON":"Exibir JSON",Visual:MOt,Warning:zOt,Warnings:OOt,"What gets created":"O que é criado","Which EKS clusters is this provider for?":"Para quais clusters do EKS esse provedor é destinado?",'Wildcard "*" is only allowed with the StringLike, StringNotLike, ArnLike, or ArnNotLike operators.':'O curinga "*" só é permitido com os operadores StringLike, StringNotLike, ArnLike ou ArnNotLike.',"Without a policy, no other account can create templates under this provider, though delegated administrators can already create both. Add a statement for each account, organizational unit, or IAM principal that should be able to, and limit each one to a path prefix.":"Sem uma política, nenhuma outra conta pode criar modelos nesse provedor, embora os administradores delegados já possam criar os dois. Adicione uma instrução para cada conta, unidade organizacional ou entidade principal do IAM que deve ser capaz de fazer isso e limite cada uma delas a um prefixo de caminho.","Workload identities ({{total}})":"Identidades da workload ({{total}})","Workload identities in the IAM User Guide":"Identidades de workloads no Guia do usuário do IAM","Workload identities in the IAM User Guide (opens in a new tab)":"Identidades de workloads no Guia do usuário do IAM (abre em uma nova guia)","Workload identities: {{reason}}":"Identidades da workload: {{reason}}","Workload identity":"Identidade da workload","Workload Identity":"Identidade da workload","Workload identity {{name}}: {{reason}}":"Identidade da workload {{name}}: {{reason}}","Workload identity {{workloadIdentifier}} deleted.":"Identidade da workload {{workloadIdentifier}} excluída.","Workloads get named automatically":"As workloads são nomeadas automaticamente","Workloads in these EKS clusters can get an identity from this provider, when all of these are true:":"As workloads nesses clusters do EKS podem obter uma identidade desse provedor, quando tudo isto for verdadeiro:","Workloads running in these clusters can get an identity from this provider. Add 2 or more.":"As workloads em execução nesses clusters podem obter uma identidade desse provedor. Adicione 2 ou mais.","Workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"As workloads executadas nesta conta podem usar identidades geradas por esse modelo usando informações verificadas por {{workloadLabel}}.","Workloads running in this cluster can get an identity from this provider.":"As workloads em execução nesse cluster podem obter uma identidade desse provedor.","Workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"As workloads em execução em sua organização podem usar identidades geradas por esse modelo usando informações verificadas por {{workloadLabel}}.","Workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request":"As workloads que usam essas identidades deixarão de receber credenciais e falharão na próxima solicitação","Workloads, such as agents, pods, and jobs, are verified at runtime and get a workload identity, one per workload, generated by a template. The identity gets fine-grained access to AWS resources through IAM policies and CloudTrail, and signed JWT and X.509 credentials for meshes and SaaS apps.":"As workloads, como os agentes, os pods e os trabalhos, são verificadas em runtime e recebem uma identidade de workload exclusiva gerada por um modelo. Essa identidade recebe acesso granular aos recursos da AWS por meio de políticas do IAM e do CloudTrail, além de credenciais JWT assinadas e X.509 para uso em malhas de serviços e aplicações SaaS.","Wrap lines":"Quebrar linhas","Write a policy to let another account create templates, or to stop a delegated administrator from part of the name space. Each statement names an organizational unit, specific accounts, or individual IAM principals, allows or denies, and can be limited to a path prefix.":"Crie uma política para permitir que outra conta crie modelos ou para impedir que um administrador delegado atue em parte do namespace. Cada instrução nomeia uma unidade organizacional, contas específicas ou entidades principais individuais do IAM, permite ou nega e pode ser limitada a um prefixo de caminho.","Yes by default":"Sim por padrão","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tag.":"Você pode adicionar até {{availableTags}} tag adicional.","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tags.":"Você pode adicionar até {{availableTags}} tags.","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"Você excedeu o limite de {{tagLimit}} tag.","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"Você excedeu o limite de {{tagLimit}} tags.","You have more keys than can be displayed":"Você tem mais chaves do que podem ser exibidas","You have more values than can be displayed":"Você tem mais valores do que podem ser exibidos","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"Você atingiu o limite de {{tagLimit}} tags.","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"Você atingiu o limite de {{tagLimit}} tags.","You have unsaved tag changes. Leave this page and discard them?":"Você tem alterações de tag não salvas. Sair desta página e descartá-las?","You must enter a path":"Você deve inserir um caminho","You must specify a condition key":"Você deve especificar uma chave de condição","You must specify a tag key":"Você deve especificar uma chave de tag","You must specify a unique tag key.":"Você deve especificar uma chave de tag exclusiva.","You must specify a value":"Você deve especificar um valor.","Your administrator decides which prefixes this account can use. This is checked when you create.":"Seu administrador decide quais prefixos esta conta pode usar. Isso é verificado durante a criação.","Your identities will be <code>{{prefix}}<em>{{placeholder}}</em></code>":"Suas identidades serão <code>{{prefix}}<em>{{placeholder}}</em></code>","Your organization already has a workload identity provider. Add templates under it to start issuing identities to your workloads — each named under your account's path prefix.":"Sua organização já tem um provedor de identidade de workload. Adicione modelos abaixo dele para começar a emitir identidades para suas workloads, cada uma com o prefixo de caminho da sua conta.","Your organization has workload identity providers you can use. Pick one and add templates under it to start issuing identities to your workloads.":"Sua organização tem provedores de identidade de workload que você pode usar. Escolha um e adicione modelos abaixo dele para começar a emitir identidades para suas workloads.","YYYY/MM/DD":"AAAA/MM/DD","{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.","A declared identity has a fixed name you define. Use one when you need an exact name, for example to match a name another system already expects.":"A declared identity has a fixed name you define. Use one when you need an exact name, for example to match a name another system already expects.","A fact {{workload}} checks when the agent or workload starts.":"A fact {{workload}} checks when the agent or workload starts.","A provider issues secure, verifiable identities to your agents and workloads, like your Kubernetes pods or AI agents, to access AWS and third-party services without long-lived credentials.":"A provider issues secure, verifiable identities to your agents and workloads, like your Kubernetes pods or AI agents, to access AWS and third-party services without long-lived credentials.","A template automatically generates an identity for each matching agent or workload under {{providerName}}.":"A template automatically generates an identity for each matching agent or workload under {{providerName}}.","A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued.":"A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued.","A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued. Decide how this provider issues identities - starting from the <link>default templates</link> for common use cases, or skipping them. Templates are optional and can be added later.":"A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued. Decide how this provider issues identities - starting from the <link>default templates</link> for common use cases, or skipping them. Templates are optional and can be added later.","A template names identities automatically as matching agents and workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.":"A template names identities automatically as matching agents and workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.","A template with no attestation policy matches no agent or workload, so nothing is ever issued from it. Set a policy to define which agents and workloads qualify.":"A template with no attestation policy matches no agent or workload, so nothing is ever issued from it. Set a policy to define which agents and workloads qualify.","A template's path pattern, built from facts like cluster, namespace, and service account, names each agent or workload automatically when it starts. You don't create identities ahead of time.":"A template's path pattern, built from facts like cluster, namespace, and service account, names each agent or workload automatically when it starts. You don't create identities ahead of time.","Add a fact or condition key. A path of only custom text would give every agent or workload the same name.":"Add a fact or condition key. A path of only custom text would give every agent or workload the same name.","Add an {{conditionKey}} condition, so only agents or workloads in these clusters get an identity.":"Add an {{conditionKey}} condition, so only agents or workloads in these clusters get an identity.","Add attestation policy":"Add attestation policy","Add templates after the provider is created.":"Add templates after the provider is created.","Agent and workload identity":"Agent and workload identity","Agent and workload identity - <em>Preview</em>":"Agent and workload identity - <em>Preview</em>","Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide":"Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide","Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide (opens in a new tab)":"Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide (opens in a new tab)","Agents and workloads get named automatically":"Agents and workloads get named automatically","Agents and workloads get short-lived credentials that renew automatically and follow the SPIFFE standard, so they work with service meshes such as Istio and with business applications.":"Agents and workloads get short-lived credentials that renew automatically and follow the SPIFFE standard, so they work with service meshes such as Istio and with business applications.","Agents and workloads in these EKS clusters can get an identity from this provider, when all of these are true:":"Agents and workloads in these EKS clusters can get an identity from this provider, when all of these are true:","Agents and workloads running in these clusters can get an identity from this provider. Add two or more.":"Agents and workloads running in these clusters can get an identity from this provider. Add two or more.","Agents and workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Agents and workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.","Agents and workloads running in this cluster can get an identity from this provider.":"Agents and workloads running in this cluster can get an identity from this provider.","Agents and workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Agents and workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.","Agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request":"Agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request","Agents and workloads, such as AI agents and pods, are verified at runtime and each gets its own identity, generated by a template. The identity gets fine-grained access to AWS resources through IAM policies and CloudTrail, and signed JWT and X.509 credentials for meshes and apps.":"Agents and workloads, such as AI agents and pods, are verified at runtime and each gets its own identity, generated by a template. The identity gets fine-grained access to AWS resources through IAM policies and CloudTrail, and signed JWT and X.509 credentials for meshes and apps.","All templates and identities under this provider will be deleted":"All templates and identities under this provider will be deleted","An AI agent or workload gets an identity that is unique.":"An AI agent or workload gets an identity that is unique.","An identity with no attestation policy admits no workload, so nothing can run as it. Set a policy to define which workload qualifies.":"An identity with no attestation policy admits no workload, so nothing can run as it. Set a policy to define which workload qualifies.","An identity with this name already exists.":"An identity with this name already exists.","At runtime the platform attests these facts about the agent or workload. Any agent or workload whose attestation carries them gets an identity issued from this template.":"At runtime the platform attests these facts about the agent or workload. Any agent or workload whose attestation carries them gets an identity issued from this template.","Attestation policy for {{name}} has been removed.":"Attestation policy for {{name}} has been removed.","Attestation policy for {{name}} has been updated.":"Attestation policy for {{name}} has been updated.","By continuing, you also enable organization level resource creation, which is needed to create the organization scoped provider. You can disable it later in Settings.":"By continuing, you also enable organization level resource creation, which is needed to create the organization scoped provider. You can disable it later in Settings.","Change the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.":"Change the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.","Choose a stable, unique name that identifies one environment or group of agents and workloads, for example prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal.":"Choose a stable, unique name that identifies one environment or group of agents and workloads, for example prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal.","Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for an agent or workload.":"Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for an agent or workload.","Choose the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.":"Choose the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.","Choose where the workload is hosted":"Choose where the workload is hosted","Choose who can use it":"Choose who can use it","Control what an agent or workload can reach with familiar IAM policies and see its AWS calls in CloudTrail.":"Control what an agent or workload can reach with familiar IAM policies and see its AWS calls in CloudTrail.","Create declared identity":"Create declared identity","Creates an agent and workload identity provider and template for agents and workloads running in one or more EKS clusters under a service mesh, such as Istio.":"Creates an agent and workload identity provider and template for agents and workloads running in one or more EKS clusters under a service mesh, such as Istio.","Creating the identity":"Creating the identity","Declare an identity with the exact name you need":"Declare an identity with the exact name you need","Declared identities":"Declared identities","Declared identity":"Declared identity","Declared identity {{name}} created.":"Declared identity {{name}} created.","Define which agents and workloads are allowed to use this template.":"Define which agents and workloads are allowed to use this template.","Delete the templates under <b>{{providerName}}</b> before deleting the provider. Once deleted, agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials and fail on their next request, and access that you granted to these identities will stop working.":"Delete the templates under <b>{{providerName}}</b> before deleting the provider. Once deleted, agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials and fail on their next request, and access that you granted to these identities will stop working.","Deleting templates and identities":"Deleting templates and identities","Each identity is fully the template path.":"Each identity is fully the template path.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.","Enter a description":"Enter a description","Failed to create the declared identity.":"Failed to create the declared identity.","Failed to save attestation policy.":"Failed to save attestation policy.","Filter declared identities":"Filter declared identities","For example, to match a name another system already expects.":"For example, to match a name another system already expects.","from provider":"from provider","Give AI agents and workloads their own identities. Know which of them made each call. Scope its access with the IAM policies you already use.":"Give AI agents and workloads their own identities. Know which of them made each call. Scope its access with the IAM policies you already use.","Give an agent or workload a unique identity, so you can grant it access and audit what it did rather than sharing one role.":"Give an agent or workload a unique identity, so you can grant it access and audit what it did rather than sharing one role.","Grant access":"Grant access","Grant this name access to resources in IAM policies.":"Grant this name access to resources in IAM policies.","IAM for agents and workloads":"IAM for agents and workloads","IAM for agents and workloads (opens in a new tab)":"IAM for agents and workloads (opens in a new tab)",Identifier:BOt,"Identities ({{total}})":"Identities ({{total}})","Identities are issued at runtime from facts the agent or workload proves, rather than from what an admin assigns.":"Identities are issued at runtime from facts the agent or workload proves, rather than from what an admin assigns.","Identities for agents":"Identities for agents","Identities: {{reason}}":"Identities: {{reason}}","Identity {{name}}: {{reason}}":"Identity {{name}}: {{reason}}","Invalid trust domain. Use lowercase alphanumeric and '-.' characters.":"Invalid trust domain. Use lowercase alphanumeric and '-.' characters.","Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's agents and workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. Standard pricing applies to the creation and use of AWS Private CA.":"Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's agents and workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. Standard pricing applies to the creation and use of AWS Private CA.","It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so agents and workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. To avoid this, wait until it becomes inactive on its own. Deleting it then has no effect on verification.":"It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so agents and workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. To avoid this, wait until it becomes inactive on its own. Deleting it then has no effect on verification.","Let agents and workloads reach non-AWS resources":"Let agents and workloads reach non-AWS resources","Loading declared identities":"Loading declared identities","Matching agents and workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.":"Matching agents and workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.","No agent and workload identity providers":"No agent and workload identity providers","No agent or workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.":"No agent or workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.","No attestation policy attached.":"No attestation policy attached.","No attestation policy. No agent or workload will be issued an identity from this template until you add one.":"No attestation policy. No agent or workload will be issued an identity from this template until you add one.","No conditions. This policy matches every agent or workload of its service.":"No conditions. This policy matches every agent or workload of its service.","No segments yet. Add at least one, or every agent or workload this template matches resolves to the same name.":"No segments yet. Add at least one, or every agent or workload this template matches resolves to the same name.","None – names are defined by templates":"None – names are defined by templates","Nothing can run as this identity":"Nothing can run as this identity","Once the attestation policy is removed, matching agents and workloads will not be issued agent and workload identities until you add a policy again.":"Once the attestation policy is removed, matching agents and workloads will not be issued agent and workload identities until you add a policy again.","One bundle per provider, and one URL. It carries every authority the provider publishes: both outbound signers, and during an update both the current and incoming certificate authority, which is what lets verifiers accept either one through the handover. Your own AWS agents and workloads get these keys automatically; send this to systems outside AWS.":"One bundle per provider, and one URL. It carries every authority the provider publishes: both outbound signers, and during an update both the current and incoming certificate authority, which is what lets verifiers accept either one through the handover. Your own AWS agents and workloads get these keys automatically; send this to systems outside AWS.","One provider and one trust domain shared by every EKS cluster in the mesh. An agent or workload with the same namespace and service account in any of these clusters shares one identity.":"One provider and one trust domain shared by every EKS cluster in the mesh. An agent or workload with the same namespace and service account in any of these clusters shares one identity.","Path is the unique part of each identity's name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts an agent or workload proves.":"Path is the unique part of each identity's name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts an agent or workload proves.","path prefix":"path prefix","Policy: Define how an agent or workload attests to get the identity":"Policy: Define how an agent or workload attests to get the identity","Proven at runtime":"Proven at runtime","Providers to issue agent and workload identities":"Providers to issue agent and workload identities","Scoped, auditable access":"Scoped, auditable access","Search by name":"Search by name","Set the exact name":"Set the exact name","Set the naming format and usage scope that every agent and workload identity from this provider inherits.":"Set the naming format and usage scope that every agent and workload identity from this provider inherits.","Set the unique path pattern that every identity generated by this template follows. Cannot be changed later.":"Set the unique path pattern that every identity generated by this template follows. Cannot be changed later.","Set up a provider to hold the templates that generate identity names and the signers that sign credentials for systems outside AWS.":"Set up a provider to hold the templates that generate identity names and the signers that sign credentials for systems outside AWS.","Set up a way to issue agent and workload identities":"Set up a way to issue agent and workload identities","Set which workloads can use this identity and where they must run.":"Set which workloads can use this identity and where they must run.","Stop matching agents and workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request":"Stop matching agents and workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request","Templates give matching agents and workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.":"Templates give matching agents and workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it.":"The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.":"The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Generated from the EKS clusters above. Can be edited later.":"The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Generated from the EKS clusters above. Can be edited later.","The attestation policy controls how this identity is issued. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.":"The attestation policy controls how this identity is issued. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.","The attestation policy is the set of facts an agent or workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so an agent or workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.":"The attestation policy is the set of facts an agent or workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so an agent or workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.","The certificate chain is distributing to every Region, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. It starts signing at {{at}}. That is the minimum signing delay you set, so signing may start later than this. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.":"The certificate chain is distributing to every Region, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. It starts signing at {{at}}. That is the minimum signing delay you set, so signing may start later than this. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.","The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Account ID and Region in front so names stay unique across accounts and Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.":"The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Account ID and Region in front so names stay unique across accounts and Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.","The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Region in front so names stay unique across Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.":"The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Region in front so names stay unique across Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.","This action deletes the agent and workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.":"This action deletes the agent and workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.","This certificate has stopped signing, but its chain stays in the trust bundle so certificates already issued under it keep verifying. It becomes inactive at {{at}}. Until then, Enable resumes signing with no wait. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.":"This certificate has stopped signing, but its chain stays in the trust bundle so certificates already issued under it keep verifying. It becomes inactive at {{at}}. Until then, Enable resumes signing with no wait. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.","This doesn't look like a valid EKS cluster ARN. An invalid ARN will leave agents or workloads in that cluster without an identity.":"This doesn't look like a valid EKS cluster ARN. An invalid ARN will leave agents or workloads in that cluster without an identity.","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. Both certificates below stop, including the one still in transition, so the update does not complete. Both stay configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. Both certificates below stop, including the one still in transition, so the update does not complete. Both stay configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.","This template issues no identities":"This template issues no identities","Trust domain must be 64 characters or less.":"Trust domain must be 64 characters or less.","Use the agent or workload identity in trust policies, resource policies, or SCPs. CloudTrail records its calls with that identity.":"Use the agent or workload identity in trust policies, resource policies, or SCPs. CloudTrail records its calls with that identity.","What conditions should the agent or workload match?":"What conditions should the agent or workload match?","Where is the agent or workload hosted?":"Where is the agent or workload hosted?","You must enter a name":"You must enter a name","Your organization already has an agent and workload identity provider. Add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads — each named under your account's path prefix.":"Your organization already has an agent and workload identity provider. Add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads — each named under your account's path prefix.","Your organization has agent and workload identity providers you can use. Pick one and add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads.":"Your organization has agent and workload identity providers you can use. Pick one and add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads."},$Ot=Object.freeze(Object.defineProperty({__proto__:null,ARN:"ARN",Actions:_zt,Active:xzt,Add:Azt,Apply:Ezt,Attestation:Czt,Cancel:Tzt,Clear:Izt,Close:Dzt,Configured:Lzt,Confirm:Pzt,Contains:Nzt,Created:Rzt,Delete:Mzt,Description:zzt,Details:Ozt,Disable:Bzt,Dismiss:Fzt,Edit:$zt,Editing:jzt,Enable:Wzt,Equals:Uzt,Errors:Vzt,Format:Hzt,Identifier:BOt,Inactive:Kzt,Info:Gzt,JWKS:Yzt,Key:Jzt,Name:Zzt,New:Xzt,None:Qzt,Notifications:eOt,Operator:tOt,Operators:aOt,Path:rOt,Preferences:oOt,Preview:sOt,Properties:lOt,Property:cOt,Provided:dOt,Provider:uOt,Providers:pOt,Ready:hOt,Recommended:mOt,Refresh:gOt,Remove:vOt,Retry:fOt,Save:yOt,Scheme:wOt,Scope:kOt,Status:SOt,Subject:_Ot,Success:xOt,Tags:AOt,Template:EOt,Templates:COt,Theme:TOt,Today:IOt,Undo:DOt,Update:LOt,Validating:POt,Value:NOt,Values:ROt,Visual:MOt,Warning:zOt,Warnings:OOt,and:"e",default:FOt,equals:qzt,optional:nOt,or:"ou",path:iOt,scheme:bOt},Symbol.toStringTag,{value:"Module"})),jOt="Eylemler",WOt="Etkin",qOt="Ekle",UOt="Uygula",VOt="Onay",HOt="İptal et",KOt="Temizle",GOt="Kapat",YOt="Yapılandırıldı",JOt="Onayla",ZOt="İçerir",XOt="Oluşturuldu",QOt="Açıklama",eBt="Ayrıntılar",tBt="Devre dışı bırak",aBt="Kapat",nBt="Düzenle",iBt="Düzenleme",rBt="Etkinleştir",oBt="şuna eşittir:",sBt="Eşittir",lBt="Hatalar",cBt="Biçim",dBt="Etkin değil",uBt="Bilgi",pBt="JWKS",hBt="Anahtar",mBt="Yeni",gBt="Bildirimler",vBt="İşleç",fBt="İşleçler",yBt="isteğe bağlı",bBt="veya",wBt="Tercihler",kBt="Önizleme",SBt="Özellikler",_Bt="Özellik",xBt="Sağlandı",ABt="Sağlayıcı",EBt="Sağlayıcılar",CBt="Hazır",TBt="Önerilen",IBt="Yenile",DBt="Kaldır",LBt="Yeniden dene",PBt="Kaydet",NBt="şema",RBt="Şema",MBt="Kapsam",zBt="Durum",OBt="Konu",BBt="Başarılı",FBt="Etiketler",$Bt="Şablon",jBt="Şablonlar",WBt="Tema",qBt="Bugün",UBt="Geri al",VBt="Güncelle",HBt="Doğrulanıyor",KBt="Değer",GBt="Değerler",YBt="Görsel",JBt="Uyarı",ZBt="Uyarılar",XBt="Identifier",QBt={"'{{providerName}}' does not exist in your account":'"{{providerName}}" hesabınızda mevcut değil',"(earliest)":"(en erken)","{{addedCount}} tag added or changed":"{{addedCount}} etiket eklendi veya değiştirildi","{{addedCount}} tags added or changed":"{{addedCount}} etiket eklendi veya değiştirildi","{{createdCount}} templates created: {{templateNames}}.":"{{createdCount}} şablon oluşturuldu: {{templateNames}}.","{{failed}} of {{total}} certificates could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}}/{{total}} sertifika silinemedi, bu nedenle sağlayıcı silinmedi. Hataları çözün, sonra tekrar deneyin.","{{failed}} of {{total}} could not be deleted.":"{{failed}}/{{total}} tanesi silinemedi.","{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and workload identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}}/{{total}} şablon ve iş yükü kimliği silinemedi, bu nedenle sağlayıcı silinmedi. Hataları çözün, sonra tekrar deneyin.","{{failedCount}} template could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.":"{{failedCount}} şablon oluşturulamadı. Aşağıdaki hataları inceleyip tekrar deneyin.","{{failedCount}} templates could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.":"{{failedCount}} şablon oluşturulamadı. Aşağıdaki hataları inceleyip tekrar deneyin.","{{identityCount}} identities":"{{identityCount}} kimlik","{{identityCount}} identity":"{{identityCount}} kimlik","{{label}} (service mesh)":"{{label}} (hizmet ağı)","{{label}} copied":"{{label}} kopyalandı","{{label}} failed to copy":"{{label}} kopyalanamadı","{{label}} template":"{{label}} şablon","{{label}} template {{index}}":"{{label}} şablonu {{index}}","{{label}}:":"{{label}}:","{{matchCount}} match":"{{matchCount}} eşleşme","{{matchCount}} matches":"{{matchCount}} eşleşme","{{name}} has been successfully created.":"{{name}} başarıyla oluşturuldu.","{{name}} has been successfully created. However, the following operations failed:":"{{name}} başarıyla oluşturuldu. Ancak aşağıdaki işlemler başarısız oldu:","{{providerName}} still has these resources:":"{{providerName}} hâlâ şu kaynaklara sahip:","{{removedCount}} tag removed":"{{removedCount}} etiket kaldırıldı","{{removedCount}} tags removed":"{{removedCount}} etiket kaldırıldı","{{scope}} · {{domain}}":"{{scope}} · {{domain}}","{{settled}} of {{total}}":"{{settled}}/{{total}}","{{subject}}. Does not match this signer's {{algorithm}} algorithm.":"{{subject}}. Bu imzalayıcının {{algorithm}} algoritmasıyla eşleşmiyor.","{{tagCount}} tag":"{{tagCount}} etiket","{{tagCount}} tags":"{{tagCount}} etiket","{{templateCount}} template":"{{templateCount}} şablon","{{templateCount}} templates":"{{templateCount}} şablon","{{templateName}} template failed to create. To try again, <link>add templates</link>. Error details: {{reason}}":"{{templateName}} şablonu oluşturulamadı. Yeniden denemek için <link>şablon ekleyin</link>. Hata ayrıntıları: {{reason}}","{{workload}} fact":"{{workload}} olgu","{defined by template}":"{defined by template}","<term>Support:</term> Amazon EKS, Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Runtime, and Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Gateway.":"<term>Destek:</term> Amazon EKS, Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Çalışma Zamanı ve Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Ağ Geçidi.","1 EKS cluster":"1 EKS kümesi","1 provider and 1 trust domain per EKS cluster. Each namespace and service account in this cluster gets its own identity, trusted only within this cluster.":"EKS kümesi başına 1 sağlayıcı ve 1 güven etki alanı. Bu kümedeki her ad alanı ve hizmet hesabı, yalnızca bu kümede güvenilen kendi kimliğini alır.","1 provider and 1 trust domain shared by every EKS cluster in the mesh. A workload with the same namespace and service account in any of these clusters shares one identity.":"Ağdaki her EKS kümesi tarafından paylaşılan 1 sağlayıcı ve 1 güven etki alanı. Bu kümelerin herhangi birinde aynı ad alanı ve hizmet hesabına sahip bir iş yükü tek bir kimliği paylaşır.","1 to 48 hours, in whole hours. Publishing is usually much faster, but can take up to 24 hours.":"Tam saat cinsinden 1 ila 48 saat. Yayınlama genellikle çok daha hızlı gerçekleşir ancak 24 saate kadar sürebilir.","1. Select all the check boxes to confirm what deleting {{providerName}} will do.":"1. {{providerName}} sağlayıcısının silinmesi durumunda ne olacağını onaylamak için tüm onay kutularını seçin.","2. Confirm that you want to delete this provider by typing {{providerName}} below.":"2. Aşağıya {{providerName}} yazarak bu sağlayıcıyı silmek istediğinizi onaylayın.","A declared identity has a fixed path you define. Use one when you need an exact path, for example to match a value another system already expects.":"Bildirilen bir kimliğin tanımladığınız sabit bir yolu vardır. Tam bir yola ihtiyacınız olduğunda (ör. başka bir sistemin zaten beklediği bir değerle eşleştirmek için) bunlardan birini kullanın.","A deny, and only for delegated administrators":"Reddetme; yalnızca yetkilendirilmiş yöneticiler için","A fact {{workload}} checks when the workload starts.":"İş yükü başladığında {{workload}} tarafından kontrol edilen bir olgu.","A fixed label, such as an environment name.":"Ortam adı gibi sabit bir etiket.","A name to identify this identity.":"Bu kimliği tanımlamak için bir ad.","A provider with this name already exists.":"Bu ada sahip bir sağlayıcı zaten mevcut.","A tag is a label you assign to an AWS resource. Each tag has a key and an optional value. Use tags to search and filter this provider, or to track your AWS costs.":"Etiket, bir AWS kaynağına atadığınız bir tanımlayıcıdır. Her etiket, bir anahtar ve isteğe bağlı bir değer içerir. Bu sağlayıcıyı aramak ve filtrelemek veya AWS maliyetlerinizi izlemek için etiketleri kullanın.","A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts a workload must prove before an identity is issued. Decide how this provider issues identities - starting from the <link>default templates</link> for common use cases, or skipping them. You can add and name identities manually at any time - templates are optional and can be added later.":"Bir şablon, kimlikleri benzersiz şekilde adlandırmak için kullanılan yol modelini ve bir kimlik verilmeden önce iş yükünün kanıtlaması gereken bilgileri tanımlar. Bu sağlayıcının kimlikleri nasıl vereceğine karar verin: yaygın kullanım senaryoları için <link>varsayılan şablonlardan</link> başlayabilir veya şablonları atlayabilirsiniz. Kimlikleri istediğiniz zaman manuel olarak ekleyip adlandırabilirsiniz. Şablonlar isteğe bağlıdır ve daha sonra eklenebilir.","A template with this name already exists.":"Bu adda bir şablon zaten var.","A template's path pattern, built from facts like cluster, namespace, and service account, names each workload automatically when it starts. You don't create identities ahead of time.":"Küme, ad alanı ve hizmet hesabı gibi bilgilerden oluşturulan bir şablonun yol kalıbı, her iş yükü başlatıldığında otomatik olarak adlandırılmasını sağlar. Kimlikleri önceden oluşturmanız gerekmez.","A workload identity provider issues secure, verifiable identities to your workloads, like Kubernetes pods or AI agents. Workloads use them to access AWS and third-party services without long-lived credentials.":"Bir iş yükü kimlik sağlayıcısı, Kubernetes pod'ları veya yapay zeka temsilcileri gibi iş yüklerinize güvenli ve doğrulanabilir kimlikler verir. İş yükleri, uzun ömürlü kimlik bilgileri olmadan AWS'ye ve üçüncü taraf hizmetlere erişmek için bu kimlikleri kullanır.","A workload, including an AI agent or sub-agent created on demand, gets its own identity. No workload shares or inherits another's.":"İsteğe bağlı olarak oluşturulan bir YZ temsilcisi veya alt temsilci de dâhil olmak üzere her iş yükü kendi kimliğini alır. Hiçbir iş yükü başka bir iş yükünün kimliğini paylaşmaz veya devralmaz.","Access a partner API, a SaaS endpoint, or an OIDC service. No setup needed.":"Bir çözüm ortağı API'sine, bir SaaS uç noktasına veya bir OIDC hizmetine erişin. Kurulum gerekmez.","Access a service mesh, a database, or an on-premises system.":"Bir hizmet ağına, veri tabanına veya şirket içi bir sisteme erişin.","Access denied":"Erişim reddedildi","Access you granted to these identities will stop working":"Bu kimliklere verdiğiniz erişim çalışmayı durduracak","Account scoped":"Hesap kapsamında",Actions:jOt,"Activating it":"Etkinleştiriliyor",Active:WOt,"Active certificate authority ID":"Etkin sertifika yetkilisi ID'si","Active: currently signing":"Etkin: Şu anda imzalıyor",Add:qOt,"Add {{label}} template":"{{label}} şablonu ekle","Add a fact or condition key. A path of only custom text would give every workload the same name.":"Bir olgu veya koşul anahtarı ekleyin. Yalnızca özel metinden oluşan bir yol, tüm iş yüklerine aynı adı verir.","Add an {{conditionKey}} condition, so only workloads in these clusters get an identity.":"Bir {{conditionKey}} koşulu ekleyin; böylece yalnızca bu kümelerdeki iş yükleri bir kimlik alır.","Add at least 1 path segment.":"En az 1 yol segmenti ekleyin.","Add at least 1 template to continue.":"Devam etmek için en az 1 şablon ekleyin.","Add at least 2 clusters.":"En az 2 küme ekleyin.","Add attestation rules":"Onay kuralı ekle","Add cluster ARN":"Küme ARN'si ekleyin","Add condition":"Koşul ekle","Add default templates for Amazon EKS, AgentCore Runtime, and AgentCore Gateway.":"Amazon EKS, AgentCore Runtime ve AgentCore Gateway için varsayılan şablonlar ekleyin.","Add new tag":"Yeni etiket ekle","Add policy":"Politika ekle","Add request-context values like account, Region, or organization.":"Hesap, Bölge veya kuruluş gibi talep bağlamı değerleri ekleyin.","Add tags":"Etiket ekle","Add tags to this provider for cost management and access control.":"Maliyet yönetimi ve erişim denetimi için bu sağlayıcıya etiketler ekleyin.","Add tags to this template for cost management and access control.":"Maliyet yönetimi ve erişim denetimi için bu şablona etiketler ekleyin.","Add tags to this workload identity for cost management and access control.":"Maliyet yönetimi ve erişim denetimi için bu iş yükü kimliğine etiketler ekleyin.","Add template":"Şablon ekle","Add templates":"Şablon ekle","Add templates after the provider is created, or create and name identities by hand.":"Sağlayıcı oluşturulduktan sonra şablonlar ekleyin veya kimlikleri manuel olarak oluşturup adlandırın.","Add to the path pattern":"Yol örüntüsüne ekle","Added or changed tags were not saved":"Eklenen veya değiştirilen etiketler kaydedilmedi","Adding permissions to govern who can create templates referring to this provider failed. To try again, <link>add policy</link>. Error details: {{reason}}":"Bu sağlayıcıya atıfta bulunan şablonları kimlerin oluşturabileceğini belirleyen izinler eklenemedi. Yeniden denemek için <link>politika ekleyin</link>. Hata ayrıntıları: {{reason}}","All outbound signers under this provider will be deleted":"Bu sağlayıcı altındaki tüm giden imzalayanlar silinecek","All properties":"Tüm özellikler","All templates and workload identities under this provider will be deleted":"Bu sağlayıcı altındaki tüm şablonlar ve iş yükü kimlikleri silinecektir","Allow member accounts to add their own templates, namespaced by account ID":"Üye hesaplarının, hesap ID'sine göre ayrılmış ad alanlarında kendi şablonlarını eklemesine izin ver","An identity for agent or workload":"Temsilci veya iş yükü için kimlik",and:"ve","Any value":"Herhangi bir değer",Apply:UOt,ARN:"ARN","ARN copied":"ARN kopyalandı","arn:aws:eks:{Region}:{account ID}:cluster/{cluster name}":"arn:aws:eks:{Region}:{account ID}:cluster/{cluster name}","At runtime the platform attests these facts about the workload. Any workload whose attestation carries them issues an identity from this template.":"Çalışma zamanında platform, iş yükü hakkındaki bu bilgileri doğrular. Onayı bu bilgileri içeren her iş yüküne bu şablondan bir kimlik verilir.",Attestation:VOt,"Attestation policy":"Onaylama politikası","Auto generated identity name":"Otomatik oluşturulan kimlik adı","Automatically generate from a template":"Bir şablondan otomatik olarak oluşturun","Available to every account in your organization ({{organizationId}})":"Kuruluşunuzdaki ({{organizationId}}) tüm hesaplar tarafından kullanılabilir","Available to this account ({{accountId}})":"Bu hesap tarafından kullanılabilir ({{accountId}})","AWS account ID":"AWS hesabı ID'si","AWS API calls in CloudTrail resolve to the specific workload that made them. Scope trust policies, resource policies, and SCPs to it, using the IAM policies you already know.":"CloudTrail'deki AWS API çağruları, bunları yapan belirli iş yüküyle ilişkilendirilir. Bildiğiniz IAM politikalarını kullanarak güven politikalarını, kaynak politikalarını ve SCP'leri bu iş yüküyle sınırlandırın.","AWS creates a subordinate CA in every region this provider signs in, and returns an ID for it.":"AWS, bu sağlayıcının sertifika imzaladığı her bölgede bir alt CA oluşturur ve bu yetkilinin ID'sini döndürür.","AWS IAM Workload Identity":"AWS IAM İş Yükü Kimliği","AWS IAM Workload Identity (opens in a new tab)":"AWS IAM İş Yükü Kimliği (yeni sekmede açılır)","AWS Private CA couldn't set up this certificate authority. Delete it in the AWS Private CA console and try again.":"AWS Özel CA bu sertifika yetkilisini kuramadı. AWS Özel CA konsolunda sertifika yetkilisini silip yeniden deneyin.","By default, each account's templates require an account ID path prefix to avoid name collisions. You can customize this after creating the provider, under provider settings.":"Varsayılan olarak, ad çakışmalarını önlemek için her hesabın şablonlarında hesap ID'si yol ön eki bulunması gerekir. Sağlayıcıyı oluşturduktan sonra bunu sağlayıcı ayarlarından özelleştirebilirsiniz.","Can't be changed after the provider is created.":"Sağlayıcı oluşturulduktan sonra değiştirilemez.","Can't be changed later.":"Daha sonra değiştirilemez.",Cancel:HOt,"Cannot be changed later.":"Daha sonra değiştirilemez.","Cannot start with aws:":"aws: ile başlayamaz","Certificate {{name}} (account {{accountId}}): {{reason}}":"Sertifika {{name}} (hesap {{accountId}}): {{reason}}","Certificate authority":"Sertifika yetkilisi","Certificate authority created":"Sertifika yetkilisi oluşturuldu","Certificate authority ID":"Sertifika yetkilisi ID'si","Certificate authority name":"Sertifika yetkilisi adı","Certificate authority updated. The current one keeps signing for about {{hours}} more hour, until the replacement has published everywhere.":"Sertifika yetkilisi güncellendi. Mevcut olan, yerine geçecek sertifika yetkilisi her yerde yayınlanana kadar yaklaşık {{hours}} saat daha imzalamaya devam ediyor.","Certificate authority updated. The current one keeps signing for about {{hours}} more hours, until the replacement has published everywhere.":"Sertifika yetkilisi güncellendi. Mevcut olan, yerine geçecek sertifika yetkilisi her yerde yayınlanana kadar yaklaşık {{hours}} saat daha imzalamaya devam ediyor.","Certificate deleted. Its chain had already left the trust bundle, so nothing that was verifying has changed.":"Sertifika silindi. Zinciri güven paketinden çoktan ayrılmıştı. Dolayısıyla doğrulanmakta olan hiçbir şey değişmedi.","Certificate deleted. Its chain has been pulled from the trust bundle, so certificates issued under it no longer verify.":"Sertifika silindi. Zinciri güven paketinden kaldırıldı. Bu nedenle, onun altında verilen sertifikalar artık doğrulanamıyor.","Certificate signer":"Sertifika imzalayıcısı","Certificate signer disabled, and the update in progress was stopped with it. Both authorities stay configured, and Enable resumes signing.":"Sertifika imzalayıcı devre dışı bırakıldı ve devam eden güncelleme bununla birlikte durduruldu. Her iki yetkili de yapılandırılmış olarak kalır ve Etkinleştir seçeneği imzalamayı sürdürür.","Certificate signer disabled. It stops signing now, its configuration is kept, and Enable resumes signing.":"Sertifika imzalayıcı devre dışı bırakıldı. İmzalama şimdi durur, yapılandırma korunur ve Etkinleştir seçeneği imzalamayı sürdürür.","Certificate signer enabled. Its certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle again first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hour, after every region has it.":"Sertifika imzalayıcı etkinleştirildi. Sertifika zinciri önce güven paketinde yeniden yayınlanır ve tüm bölgelere ulaştığında imzalama yaklaşık {{hours}} saat içinde başlar.","Certificate signer enabled. Its certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle again first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hours, after every region has it.":"Sertifika imzalayıcı etkinleştirildi. Sertifika zinciri önce güven paketinde yeniden yayınlanır ve tüm bölgelere ulaştığında imzalama yaklaşık {{hours}} saat içinde başlar.","Certificate signer enabled. Its material was still published, so signing resumed immediately.":"Sertifika imzalayıcı etkinleştirildi. Materyali hâlâ yayınlanmış durumdaydı, dolayısıyla imzalama hemen devam etti.","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hour, once every region has it.":"Sertifika imzalama etkinleştirildi. Sertifika zinciri önce güven paketinde yayınlanır ve tüm bölgelere ulaştığında imzalama yaklaşık {{hours}} saat içinde başlar.","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hours, once every region has it.":"Sertifika imzalama etkinleştirildi. Sertifika zinciri önce güven paketinde yayınlanır ve tüm bölgelere ulaştığında imzalama yaklaşık {{hours}} saat içinde başlar.","Certificate verifier information":"Sertifika doğrulayıcı bilgileri","Certificates ({{total}})":"Sertifikalar ({{total}})","Certificates: {{reason}}":"Sertifikalar: {{reason}}","Change the facts a workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.":"Bu şablondan kimlik verilebilmesi için bir iş yükünün onaylamış olması gereken bilgileri değiştirin. Bu şablonun daha önce oluşturduğu kimlikler etkilenmez.","Change the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. A workload already holding a session keeps it until the session expires.":"Bir iş yükünün bu kimlikle çalışabilmesi için onaylaması gereken bilgileri değiştirin. Zaten bir oturumu bulunan iş yükü, oturumun süresi dolana kadar bu oturumu korur.","Check again":"Tekrar kontrol et","Checking what is attached to this provider":"Bu sağlayıcıya neyin eklendiği kontrol ediliyor","Choose a condition key":"Bir koşul anahtarı seçin","Choose a fact":"Bir olgu seçin","Choose a path and pattern for the names. Start from a default or customize your own.":"Adlar için bir yol ve kalıp seçin. Varsayılandan başlayın veya kendinizinkini özelleştirin.","Choose a specific name up front so you can grant it access or match an existing naming convention before the workload runs.":"İş yükü çalışmaya başlamadan önce erişim izni vermek veya mevcut bir adlandırma kuralına uymak için en baştan belirli bir ad seçin.","Choose a stable, unique name that identifies one environment or group of workloads, for example prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal.":"Tek bir ortamı veya iş yükü grubunu tanımlayan, sabit ve benzersiz bir ad seçin. Örneğin prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal.","Choose a use case above to add a template.":"Bir şablon eklemek için yukarıdaki kullanım örneklerinden birini seçin.","Choose from this account":"Bu hesaptan seç","Choose templates to add, and customize or keep their defaults":"Eklenecek şablonları seçin ve bunları özelleştirin veya varsayılan ayarlarını koruyun","Choose the certificate authority this signer should sign with instead. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. The current authority keeps signing until the replacement has been published long enough for verifiers to pick it up.":"Bunun yerine, bu imzalayıcının imzalama için kullanması gereken sertifika yetkilisini seçin. İmzaladığınız her bölgede alt CA bulunan bir <link>sertifika yetkilisi</link> gereklidir. Mevcut sertifika yetkilisi, yerine geçecek yetkilinin doğrulayıcılar tarafından algılanabilecek kadar uzun bir süre yayınlanmasına kadar imzalamaya devam eder.","Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for a workload.":"Onay bilgileri olarak kullanılacak koşul anahtarlarını seçin. Bu şablon bir iş yüküne kimlik vermeden önce platformun bunların tümünü onaylaması gerekir.","Choose the facts a workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.":"Bu şablondan kimlik verilebilmesi için bir iş yükünün onaylamış olması gereken bilgileri seçin. Siz seçene kadar bu şablondan hiçbir kimlik oluşturulmaz.","Choose the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. Nothing can be issued for it until you do.":"Bir iş yükünün bu kimlikle çalışabilmesi için onaylaması gereken bilgileri seçin. Bunu yapana kadar bu kimlik için hiçbir şey düzenlenemez.","Choose the provider to create the identity in":"Kimliği oluşturmak için sağlayıcıyı seçin","Choose which templates to add by use case, and customize each one or keep its defaults.":"Kullanım senaryosuna göre eklenecek şablonları seçin ve her birini özelleştirin veya varsayılan ayarlarını koruyun.",Clear:KOt,"Clear filters":"Filtreleri temizle",Close:GOt,"Close modal":"İletişim kutusunu kapat","Cluster ARN":"Küme ARN'si","Cluster ARNs":"Küme ARN'leri","Code editor":"Kod düzenleyici","Complete the confirmation to delete.":"Silmek için onayı tamamlayın.","Condition key":"Koşul anahtarı","Configure identity templates for your workload use cases. Each template defines a path pattern used to issue identities uniquely and the facts a workload must prove before an identity is issued.":"İş yükü kullanım örnekleriniz için kimlik şablonlarını yapılandırın. Her şablon, kimliklerin benzersiz şekilde verilmesi için kullanılan bir yol örüntüsünü ve bir kimlik verilmeden önce iş yükünün kanıtlaması gereken bilgileri tanımlar.","Configure later":"Daha sonra yapılandır",Configured:YOt,Confirm:JOt,Contains:ZOt,"Continue setup":"Kuruluma devam et","Copy {{label}}":"{{label}} öğesini kopyala","Copy ARN":"ARN'yi kopyala","Copy JSON":"JSON'u kopyala","Could not check everything attached to this provider":"Bu sağlayıcıya bağlı her şey kontrol edilemedi","Create a provider":"Bir sağlayıcı oluşturun","Create a provider for this account":"Bu hesap için bir sağlayıcı oluşturun","Create a provider for your organization":"Kuruluşunuz için bir sağlayıcı oluşturun","Create a provider to get started":"Kullanmaya başlamak için bir sağlayıcı oluşturun","Create a template to automate identity generation":"Kimlik oluşturmayı otomatikleştirmek için şablon oluşturun","Create declared identity in {{providerName}}":"{{providerName}} sağlayıcısında bildirilen kimlik oluşturun ","Create identity":"Kimlik oluştur","Create new":"Yeni oluştur","Create provider":"Sağlayıcı oluştur","Create provider and templates":"Sağlayıcı ve şablonları oluşturun","Create service mesh provider":"Hizmet ağı sağlayıcısı oluştur","Create templates":"Şablonlar oluşturun","Create the certificate authority first.":"Önce sertifika yetkilisini oluşturun.","Create workload identities":"İş yükü kimlikleri oluşturun",Created:XOt,"Created through":"Şunun aracılığıyla oluşturuldu:","Created time":"Oluşturulma zamanı","Created values":"Oluşturulan değerler","Creates a workload identity provider and template for workloads running in one or more EKS clusters under a service mesh, such as Istio.":"Istio gibi bir hizmet ağı altında bir veya daha fazla EKS kümesinde çalışan iş yükleri için bir iş yükü kimliği sağlayıcısı ve şablonu oluşturur.","Creating certificate authority":"Sertifika yetkilisi oluşturuluyor","Creating the certificate authority":"Sertifika yetkilisi oluşturuluyor","Creating this provider sets up these 2 resources.":"Bu sağlayıcıyı oluşturmak bu 2 kaynağı ayarlar.","Current CA":"Mevcut CA","Current provider":"Mevcut sağlayıcı","Custom tag key":"Özel etiket anahtarı","Custom tag value":"Özel etiket değeri","Custom text":"Özel metin","Custom text can't be a single period (.) or two periods (..).":"Özel metin yalnızca bir noktadan (.) veya art arda iki noktadan (..) oluşamaz.","Customize templates":"Şablonları özelleştir","Dark themes":"Koyu renkli temalar","Declared identity: {{name}}":"Bildirilen kimlik: {{name}}","Default permissions without a policy":"Politika olmadan varsayılan izinler","Defaults to {provider name}.{account ID}.aws.internal. This must match the trust domain set in your service mesh, or the mesh rejects the identities.":"Varsayılan olarak {provider name}.{account ID}.aws.internal. Bu, hizmet ağınızda ayarlanan güven etki alanıyla eşleşmelidir, aksi takdirde ağ kimlikleri reddedilir.","Define an optional path prefix for identities under this template. Lets you filter by prefix when authoring IAM permissions.":"Bu şablon altındaki kimlikler için isteğe bağlı bir yol ön eki tanımlayın. IAM izinlerini yazarken ön eke göre filtreleme yapmanızı sağlar.","Define an optional path prefix for this identity. You can filter by this prefix when authoring IAM permissions.":"Bu kimlik için isteğe bağlı bir yol ön eki tanımlayın. IAM izinlerini yazarken bu ön eke göre filtreleme yapabilirsiniz.","Define an optional prefix for identities under this template. You can filter by this prefix when authoring IAM permissions. The path prefixes this account can use are set by the provider's policy, for example your account ID, and they are checked when you choose Create. If you're not sure which are permitted, ask your organization administrator.":"Bu şablon kapsamındaki kimlikler için isteğe bağlı bir önek tanımlayın. IAM izinlerini oluştururken bu öneke göre filtreleme yapabilirsiniz. Bu hesabın kullanabileceği yol önekleri, örneğin hesap kimliğiniz, sağlayıcının politikası tarafından belirlenir ve Oluştur’u seçtiğinizde kontrol edilir. Hangilerine izin verildiğinden emin değilseniz kuruluş yöneticinize danışın.","Define an optional prefix for this identity. You can filter by this prefix when authoring IAM permissions. The path prefixes this account can use are set by the provider's policy, for example your account ID, and they are checked when you choose Create. If you're not sure which are permitted, ask your organization administrator.":"Bu kimlik için isteğe bağlı bir önek tanımlayın. IAM izinlerini oluştururken bu öneke göre filtreleme yapabilirsiniz. Bu hesabın kullanabileceği yol önekleri, örneğin hesap kimliğiniz, sağlayıcının politikası tarafından belirlenir ve Oluştur’u seçtiğinizde kontrol edilir. Hangilerine izin verildiğinden emin değilseniz kuruluş yöneticinize danışın.","Define which workloads are allowed to use this template.":"Hangi iş yüklerinin bu şablonu kullanmasına izin verildiğini tanımlayın.",Delete:"Sil","Delete certificate?":"Sertifika silinsin mi?","Delete provider":"Sağlayıcıyı sil","Delete provider and resources":"Sağlayıcı ve kaynakları sil","Delete provider?":"Sağlayıcı silinsin mi?","Delete template":"Şablonu sil","Delete template?":"Şablon silinsin mi?","Delete the templates under <b>{{providerName}}</b> before deleting the provider. Once deleted, workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials and fail on their next request, and access that you granted to these identities will stop working.":"Sağlayıcıyı silmeden önce <b>{{providerName}}</b> altındaki şablonları silin. Silindikten sonra, bu kimlikleri kullanan iş yüklerine kimlik bilgileri verilmeyecek ve bir sonraki isteklerinde başarısız olacaklar. Bu kimliklere verdiğiniz erişim de çalışmayı durduracak.","Delete workload identity?":"İş yükü kimliği silinsin mi?","Deleting <b>{{templateName}}</b> will:":"<b>{{templateName}}</b> silindiğinde:","Deleting <b>{{workloadIdentifier}}</b> will:":"<b>{{workloadIdentifier}}</b> silindiğinde:","Deleting certificates":"Sertifikalar siliniyor","Deleting provider":"Sağlayıcı siliniyor","Deleting templates and workload identities":"Şablonlar ve iş yükü kimlikleri siliniyor","Deleting the provider is taking longer than expected":"Sağlayıcıyı silmek beklenenden daha uzun sürüyor",Description:QOt,"Description can't include line breaks or tabs.":"Açıklama satır sonu veya sekme içeremez.","Description must be 1,000 characters or less.":"Açıklama en fazla 1.000 karakter olmalıdır.","Description must be 255 characters or less.":"Açıklama en fazla 255 karakter olmalıdır.",Details:eBt,Disable:tBt,"Disable certificate signer?":"Sertifika imzalayıcısı devre dışı bırakılsın mı?","Discovery expiration time":"Keşfin sona erme zamanı",Dismiss:aBt,"Does not contain":"İçermez","Does not equal":"Eşit değildir","Drag or select to resize":"Yeniden boyutlandırmak için sürükleyin veya seçin","Each identity is fully the template path, or whatever string you enter when you create the identity.":"Her kimlik, şablon yolunun tamamına veya kimliği oluştururken girdiğiniz dizeye eşittir.",Edit:nBt,"Edit attestation policy":"Onaylama politikasını düzenleme","Edit filter":"Filtreyi düzenle","Edit identity format and scope":"Kimlik biçimini ve kapsamını düzenle","Edit identity path":"Kimlik yolunu düzenle",Editing:iBt,Enable:rBt,"Enable certificate signer":"Sertifika imzalayıcısını etkinleştir","Enable certificate signer?":"Sertifika imzalayıcısı etkinleştirilsin mi?","End signing time":"İmzalamanın bitiş zamanı","Enter a 12-digit AWS account ID.":"12 haneli bir AWS hesabı ID'si girin.","Enter a certificate authority ID.":"Bir sertifika yetkilisi ID'si girin.","Enter a cluster ARN.":"Küme ARN'sini girin.","Enter a name":"Bir ad girin","Enter a name for the certificate authority.":"Sertifika yetkilisi için bir ad girin.","Enter a name.":"Bir ad girin.","Enter a path":"Bir yol girin.","Enter a path prefix value":"Bir yol ön eki değeri girin","Enter a trust domain.":"Bir güven etki alanı girin.","Enter a value":"Bir değer girin","Enter a whole number of hours from 1 to 48.":"Saat cinsinden 1 ile 48 arasında bir tam sayı girin.","Enter key":"Anahtarı girin","Enter prefix":"Ön ek girin","Enter the ID of a certificate authority or choose from below":"Bir sertifika yetkilisinin ID'sini girin veya aşağıdan seçin","Enter the policy as valid JSON.":"Politikayı geçerli JSON olarak girin.","Enter value":"Değeri girin",equals:oBt,Equals:sBt,Error:"Hata","Error fetching the details":"Ayrıntılar getirilirken hata oluştu",Errors:lBt,"Every account in this organization ({{organizationId}})":"Bu kuruluştaki her hesap ({{organizationId}})","Every X.509-SVID this provider issues right now is signed by this certificate. It stops in {{hours}} hour, at {{at}}, when the incoming certificate takes over.":"Bu sağlayıcının şu anda verdiği her X.509-SVID bu sertifika tarafından imzalanır. Gelen sertifika devraldığında {{hours}} saat içinde, {{at}} itibarıyla bu sertifikanın imzalaması sona erecek.","Every X.509-SVID this provider issues right now is signed by this certificate. It stops in {{hours}} hours, at {{at}}, when the incoming certificate takes over.":"Bu sağlayıcının şu anda verdiği her X.509-SVID bu sertifika tarafından imzalanır. Gelen sertifika devraldığında {{hours}} saat içinde, {{at}} itibarıyla bu sertifikanın imzalaması sona erecek.","Every X.509-SVID this provider issues right now is signed by this certificate. No replacement is scheduled, so it keeps signing until you update or disable the signer.":"Bu sağlayıcının şu anda verdiği her X.509-SVID, bu sertifika tarafından imzalanır. Değişim planlanmamıştır. Bu nedenle, imzalayıcıyı güncelleyene veya devre dışı bırakana kadar imzalamaya devam eder.","Failed to copy":"Kopyalanamadı","Failed to copy JSON":"JSON kopyalanamadı","Failed to load attestation policy.":"Onay politikası yüklenemedi.","Failed to load templates.":"Şablonlar yüklenemedi.","Failed to remove attestation policy.":"Tasdik politikası kaldırılamadı.","Filter providers":"Sağlayıcıları filtrele","Filter templates":"Şablonları filtrele","Filter themes":"Temaları filtrele","Find providers":"Sağlayıcıları bul","Find templates":"Şablon bul","Find theme":"Tema ara","For example, prod":"Örneğin, prod","For mutual TLS, attach a certificate authority":"Karşılıklı TLS için bir sertifika yetkilisi ekleyin","For token-based services, issue a JWT":"Belirteç tabanlı hizmetler için bir JWT oluşturun.",Format:cBt,"Generating its key":"Anahtarı oluşturuluyor","Get started":"Kullanmaya başlayın","Getting started":"Kullanmaya başlama","Give an agent or workload its own identity - <em>Preview</em>":"Bir temsilciye veya iş yüküne kendi kimliğini verin - <em>Ön izleme</em>","Give each workload a unique identity, so you can grant it access and audit what it did rather than sharing one role.":"Her iş yüküne benzersiz bir kimlik verin; böylece tek bir rolü paylaşmak yerine erişim izni verebilir ve yaptıklarını denetleyebilirsiniz.","Give your workloads an identity":"İş yüklerinize bir kimlik verin","Go to the providers list":"Sağlayıcılar listesine git","Govern who can create resources":"Kaynakları kimlerin oluşturabileceğini yönetin","Govern who can create templates referring to this provider":"Bu sağlayıcıya başvuran şablonları kimlerin oluşturabileceğini yönetin","Greater than":"Büyüktür","Greater than or equal":"Büyüktür veya eşittir","hour(s)":"saat","How it works":"Nasıl çalışır?","IAM roles define what a workload can do. Workload Identity tells you which workload is doing it.":"IAM rolleri, bir iş yükünün neler yapabileceğini tanımlar. İş Yükü Kimliği ise bunları hangi iş yükünün yaptığını belirtir.","Identities are issued at runtime from facts the workload proves, not just from what an admin assigns.":"Kimlikler, yalnızca bir yöneticinin atadığı bilgilere göre değil, iş yükünün doğruladığı bilgilere göre çalışma zamanında verilir.",'Identity "{{identityId}}" not found.':"“{{identityId}}“ varlığı bulunamadı.","Identity format and scope":"Kimlik biçimi ve kapsamı","Identity name":"Kimlik adı","Identity path":"Kimlik yolu","Identity selection":"Kimlik seçimi","If anything is still attached, deleting the provider fails.":"Hâlâ ekli bir şey varsa sağlayıcıyı silme işlemi başarısız olur.","In transition":"Geçiş sürecinde","In transition certificate authority ID":"Geçişteki sertifika yetkilisi ID'si","In transition: incoming, not yet signing":"Geçişte: Geliyor, henüz imzalamıyor",Inactive:dBt,"Inactive: retired, no longer trusted":"Etkin değil: kullanımdan kaldırıldı, artık güvenilmiyor","Incoming CA":"Devralacak CA",Info:uBt,"Invalid key. Keys can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"Geçersiz anahtar. Anahtarlar yalnızca Unicode harflerini, rakamları, boşlukları ve şu karakterleri içerebilir: _.:/=+@-","Invalid provider name. Use alphanumeric and '-_.' characters.":'Geçersiz sağlayıcı adı. Harf, rakam ve "-_." karakterlerini kullanın.',"Invalid request":"Geçersiz istek","Invalid template name. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters.":"Geçersiz şablon adı. Harf, rakam ve ‘-_’ karakterlerini kullanın.","Invalid value. Values can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"Geçersiz değer. Değerler yalnızca Unicode harflerini, rakamları, boşlukları ve şu karakterleri içerebilir: _.:/=+@-","Issued after the workload proves itself":"İş yükü kimliğini doğruladıktan sonra verilir","Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. Standard pricing applies to the creation and use of AWS Private CA.":"Bu sağlayıcının iş yüklerinin AWS dışındaki sistemlere istemci sertifikası olarak sunduğu X.509-SVID'leri düzenler. Bunun için, sertifika imzaladığınız her bölgede alt CA bulunan bir <link>sertifika yetkilisi</link> gerekir. AWS Özel CA'nın oluşturulması ve kullanımı için standart fiyatlandırma geçerlidir.","Issues X.509-SVIDs, for mTLS peers that verify a client certificate.":"İstemci sertifikasını doğrulayan mTLS eşleri için X.509-SVID'ler düzenler.","Issuing its CA certificate":"CA sertifikası düzenleniyor","It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. Leave it alone and it becomes inactive on its own, after which deleting it changes nothing.":"İmzalama işlemi durmuş olsa da zinciri hâlâ yayınlanıyor. Bu nedenle iş yükleri, daha önce verilen kimlik bilgilerini doğrulamak için bu zincire güveniyor. Şu anda silinmesi durumunda zincir anında kaldırılır ve söz konusu kimlik bilgileri geçersiz hale gelir. Dokunulmazsa kendi kendine devre dışı kalır; bu durumda silinmesi hiçbir şeyi değiştirmez.","Item moved from position {{initialPosition}} to position {{finalPosition}} of {{total}}":"Öğe, {{initialPosition}}. konumdan {{finalPosition}}/{{total}} konumuna taşındı","JSON copied":"JSON kopyalandı",JWKS:pBt,"JWKS popover":"kid değerine göre seçilen her etkin imzalama anahtarları. AWS, imzalama bu anahtara geçmeden önce burada yeni bir anahtar yayınlar.","JWT Outbound signers column Signing algorithm":"İmzalama algoritması","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key":"Anahtar algoritmaları","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key issue time":"Geçerli anahtarla imzalama başlangıcı","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key popover":"AWS anahtarları oluşturur ve kendi zamanlamasına göre döndürür; her yeni anahtarla imzalamaya başlamadan önce anahtarı JWKS'de yayınlar. Algoritmalar rotasyon boyunca aynı kalır; bu nedenle JWKS'yi okuyan bir doğrulayıcı için sizin tarafınızda herhangi bir değişiklik gerekmez.","JWT Outbound signers desc":"İmzalı bir belirteci doğrulayan sistemler için JWT-SVID'leri imzalar.","JWT Outbound signers label oidc discovery":"OIDC keşfi","JWT Outbound signers label oidc discovery popover":"Standart keşif belgesi. Çoğu doğrulayıcı yalnızca bu URL'ye ihtiyaç duyar çünkü anahtarları buradan bulur.","JWT Outbound signers label oidc issuer":"OIDC yayıncısı","JWT Outbound signers label oidc issuer popover":"Burada imzalanan her JWT-SVID'nin iss talebi. Yayıncıyı sabitleyen bir doğrulayıcı bu değeri sabitler.","JWT Outbound signers section title":"Belirteç doğrulayıcı bilgileri","JWT Outbound signers status":"AWS tarafından sağlanan varsayılan","JWT Outbound signers title":"JWT imzalayıcı",Key:hBt,"Learn about organization providers":"Kuruluş sağlayıcıları hakkında bilgi edin","Learn about organization providers (opens in a new tab)":"Kuruluş sağlayıcıları hakkında bilgi edin (yeni bir sekmede açılır)","Learn more":"Daha fazla bilgi","Learn more about deleting a provider (opens in a new tab)":"Sağlayıcıyı silme hakkında daha fazla bilgi (yeni bir sekmede açılır)","Learn more:":"Daha fazla bilgi edinin:","Less than":"Küçüktür","Less than or equal":"Küçüktür veya eşittir","Let other accounts or principals in your organization create templates and identities under this provider, within the path prefixes you choose.":"Kuruluşunuzdaki diğer hesapların veya sorumluların, seçtiğiniz yol ön ekleri dahilinde bu sağlayıcı altında şablonlar ve kimlikler oluşturmasına izin verin.","Let workloads reach non-AWS resources":"İş yüklerinin AWS dışı kaynaklara erişmesini sağlayın","Letters, digits, . - _ with a single / between parts. No / at the start or end.":"Harf, rakam, . - _ ve parçalar arasında tek bir /. Başta veya sonda / bulunmamalıdır.","Letters, digits, . - _ with a single / between parts. No / at the start or end. Cannot be changed later.":"Harf, rakam, . - _ ve parçalar arasında tek bir /. Başta veya sonda / bulunmamalıdır. Daha sonra değiştirilemez.","Light themes":"Açık renkli temalar","Ln {{row}}, Col {{column}}":"Satır {{row}}, Sütun {{column}}","Loading certificate authorities":"Sertifika yetkilileri yükleniyor","Loading code editor":"Kod düzenleyici yükleniyor","Loading tag keys":"Etiket anahtarları yükleniyor","Loading tag values":"Etiket değerleri yükleniyor","Loading tags that are associated with this resource":"Bu kaynakla ilişkili etiketleri yükleme","Loading your organization's providers":"Kuruluşunuzun sağlayıcıları yükleniyor","Make sure the new certificate authority uses the same algorithm as the current signer, {{algorithm}}. If you choose a different algorithm, you need to disable this signer, delete its certificates, then enable it again with the new authority.":"Yeni sertifika yetkilisinin geçerli imzalayıcıyla aynı algoritmayı kullandığından emin olun: {{algorithm}}. Farklı bir algoritma seçerseniz bu imzalayıcıyı devre dışı bırakmanız, sertifikalarını silmeniz ve ardından yeni yetkiyle yeniden etkinleştirmeniz gerekir.","Manage CAs and replication in the AWS Private CA console":"AWS Özel CA konsolunda CA'ları ve çoğaltmayı yönetin","Manage tags":"Etiketleri yönet","Manage the provider":"Sağlayıcıyı yönet","Manual creation":"Manuel oluşturma","Manually create":"Manuel olarak oluşturun","Matching workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.":"Eşleşen iş yükleri, hangi ölçekte olurlarsa olsunlar, başladıkları anda kendilerine ait bir kimlik adı alır.","Maximum 1,000 characters.":"Maksimum 1.000 karakter.","Maximum 255 characters.":"Maksimum 255 karakter.","Member accounts":"Üye hesapları","Member accounts can add their own templates, namespaced by account ID.":"Üye hesapları kendi şablonlarını hesap ID'sine göre ayrılmış ad alanlarında ekleyebilir.","Member accounts cannot add their own templates.":"Üye hesapları kendi şablonlarını ekleyemez.","Minimum signing delay":"Minimum imzalama gecikmesi","Moving item to position {{currentPosition}} of {{total}}":"Öğe {{currentPosition}}/{{total}} konumuna taşınıyor","Multiple EKS clusters":"Çoklu EKS kümeleri",Name:"Ad","Name must be 128 characters or less.":"Ad 128 karakter veya daha az olmalıdır.","Name this identity":"Bu kimliği adlandırın","Name this provider":"Bu sağlayıcıyı adlandırın","Name values":"Ad değerleri","Names identities automatically as workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.":"İş yükleri başlatıldığında kimlikleri otomatik olarak adlandırır, böylece bunları tek tek oluşturmanız veya yönetmeniz gerekmez.","Naming scheme":"Adlandırma şeması",New:mBt,"Next month":"Sonraki ay","Next page":"Sonraki sayfa","Next step":"Sonraki adım","No attestation policy set. Define one so a workload can run as this identity.":"Herhangi bir onay politikası ayarlanmamış. Bir iş yükünün bu kimlikle çalışabilmesi için bir onay politikası tanımlayın.","No attestation policy. No workload will be issued workload identities from this template until you add one.":"Tasdik politikası yok. Bir politika ekleyene kadar bu şablondan hiçbir iş yüküne iş yükü kimliği verilmez.","No by default, but can add a policy":"Varsayılan olarak hayır ancak politika ekleyebilir","No certificate authorities in this account":"Bu hesapta sertifika yetkilisi yok","no domain":"etki alanı yok","No long-lived secrets":"Uzun ömürlü gizli bilgiler yok","No match found":"Eşleşme bulunamadı","No matches":"Eşleşme yok","No path segments. Add a fact, condition key, or custom text.":"Yol segmenti yok. Bir olgu, koşul anahtarı veya özel metin ekleyin.","No tags associated with the resource.":"Kaynakla ilişkili etiket yok.","No templates added yet":"Henüz şablon eklenmedi","No workload identity providers":"İş yükü kimlik sağlayıcısı yok","No workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.":"Bu şablonla eşleşen iş yükü bulunmadığından kimlik oluşturulmaz.","No, and cannot be granted":"Hayır ve verilemez",None:"Yok","None – names are defined by templates or declared individually":"Yok: Adlar şablonlarla tanımlanır veya tek tek belirtilir.","Not saved: {{keys}}.":"Kaydedilmedi: {{keys}}.","Not set":"Ayarlanmadı",Notifications:gBt,"Once the attestation policy is removed, matching workloads will not be issued workload identities until you add a policy again.":"Tasdik politikası kaldırıldıktan sonra, yeniden bir politika ekleyene kadar eşleşen iş yüklerine iş yükü kimliği verilmez.","One bundle per provider, and one URL. It carries every authority the provider publishes: both outbound signers, and during an update both the current and incoming certificate authority, which is what lets verifiers accept either one through the handover. Your own AWS workloads get these keys automatically; send this to systems outside AWS.":"Her sağlayıcı için bir paket ve bir URL bulunur. Bu paket, sağlayıcının yayınladığı tüm yetkilileri içerir: her iki giden imzalayıcıyı ve bir güncelleme sırasında hem mevcut hem de gelen sertifika yetkilisini; bu sayede doğrulayıcılar, devir sürecinde her ikisini de kabul edebilir. Kendi AWS iş yükleriniz bu anahtarları otomatik olarak alır; AWS dışındaki sistemlere bunu gönderin.","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level providers.":"Kuruluş düzeyindeki sağlayıcıları yalnızca yönetim hesabı veya yetkilendirilmiş bir yönetici silebilir.","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level templates.":"Kuruluş düzeyindeki şablonları yalnızca yönetim hesabı veya yetkilendirilmiş bir yönetici silebilir.","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level workload identities.":"Kuruluş düzeyindeki iş yükü kimliklerini yalnızca yönetim hesabı veya yetkilendirilmiş bir yönetici silebilir.","Opens in a new tab":"Yeni bir sekmede açılır",Operator:vBt,Operators:fBt,optional:yBt,or:bBt,"Organization provider":"Kuruluş sağlayıcısı","Organization scoped":"Kuruluş kapsamında","Organize the provider and track its cost with tags.":"Sağlayıcıyı düzenlemek ve maliyetini izlemek için etiketleri kullanın.","Other accounts in your organization":"Kuruluşunuzdaki diğer hesaplar","Other condition keys":"Diğer koşul anahtarları","Outbound signer":"Giden imzalayıcı","Outbound signers page desc":"İş yüklerinizin AWS dışındaki hizmetlere kimliklerini kanıtlamasına olanak tanıyın. Bu sağlayıcı, iş yüklerinin sunduğu belirteçleri ve sertifikaları imzalar.","Outbound signers page title":"Giden imzalayıcı","Owning account":"Sahibi olan hesap","Page {{pageNumber}} of all pages":"Tüm sayfaların {{pageNumber}}. sayfası",path:"yol",Path:"Yol","path from templates":"şablonlardan alınan yol","Path is the per-workload part of an identity name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts a workload proves.":"Yol, kimlik adının her iş yüküne özgü bölümüdür. Çalışma zamanında, iş yükünün kanıtladığı bilgiler kullanılarak doldurulur.","Path must be 255 characters or less.":"Yol, 255 veya daha az karakter içermelidir.","Path pattern":"Yol örüntüsü","Path prefix":"Yol ön eki","Path prefix must be 64 characters or less.":"Yol ön eki 64 karakter veya daha kısa olmalıdır.","Path values":"Yol değerleri","Picked up item at position {{position}} of {{total}}":"{{position}}/{{total}} konumundaki öğe alındı","Policy details":"Politika ayrıntıları","Policy: Define how a workload attests to get the identity":"Politika: Bir iş yükünün kimliği almak için nasıl onay verdiğini tanımlayın",Preferences:wBt,"Press space or enter to activate drag, use arrow keys to move, then press space or enter to confirm":"Sürüklemeyi etkinleştirmek için Boşluk veya Enter tuşuna basın, hareket ettirmek için ok tuşlarını kullanın, ardından onaylamak için Boşluk veya Enter tuşuna basın.",Preview:kBt,"Previous CA":"Önceki CA","Previous certificates ({{certificateCount}})":"Önceki sertifikalar ({{certificateCount}})","Previous month":"Önceki ay","Previous page":"Önceki sayfa",Properties:SBt,Property:_Bt,Provided:xBt,Provider:ABt,"Provider {{providerName}} deleted.":"Sağlayıcı {{providerName}} silindi.","Provider name":"Sağlayıcı adı","Provider name must be 128 characters or less.":"Sağlayıcı adı 128 karakter veya daha az olmalıdır.","Provider not deleted":"Sağlayıcı silinmedi","Provider not found":"Sağlayıcı bulunamadı","Provider overview":"Sağlayıcıya genel bakış","Provider selection":"Sağlayıcı seçimi","Provider settings":"Sağlayıcı ayarları","Provider values":"Sağlayıcı değerleri",Providers:EBt,"Providers to issue workload identities":"İş yükü kimlikleri sağlayacak sağlayıcılar","Quick create":"Hızlı oluştur","Quick create makes an RSA 2048 certificate authority in AWS Private CA in your account, which has its own charges. The algorithm is fixed and cannot be changed later without setting the signer up again.":"Hızlı oluşturma özelliği, hesabınızdaki AWS Özel CA'da bir RSA 2048 sertifika yetkilisi oluşturur; bunun kendi ücretleri vardır. Algoritma sabittir ve daha sonra imzalayıcıyı yeniden ayarlamadan değiştirilemez.",Ready:CBt,Recommended:TBt,"Recommended for most workloads":"Çoğu iş yükü için önerilir",Refresh:IBt,"Refresh certificate authorities":"Sertifika yetkililerini yenile","Refresh certificate signer status":"Sertifika imzalayıcısının durumunu yenileyin",Remove:DBt,"Remove {{name}}":"{{name}} öğesini kaldır","Remove attestation policy":"Tasdik politikasını kaldırın.","Remove cluster ARN":"Küme ARN'sini kaldırın","Remove condition":"Koşulu kaldır","Remove filter {{filter}}":"{{filter}} filtresini kaldır","Remove governance policy?":"Yönetişim politikası kaldırılsın mı?","Remove tag {{key}}":"{{key}} etiketini kaldır","Removed tags were not saved":"Kaldırılan etiketler kaydedilmedi","Reorder {{name}}":"{{name}} öğesinin sırasını değiştir","Reordering canceled":"Yeniden sıralama iptal edildi","Required for service mesh providers.":"Hizmet ağı sağlayıcıları için gereklidir.","Required for service mesh providers. A service mesh provider is scoped to the account that runs the EKS cluster.":"Hizmet ağı sağlayıcıları için gereklidir. Bir hizmet ağı sağlayıcısı, EKS kümesini çalıştıran hesap kapsamıyla sınırlıdır.","Reset to default":"Varsayılanlara sıfırla","Resize handle":"Yeniden boyutlandırma tutamacı","Resolved example:":"Çözümlenmiş örnek:","Restricted by":"Kısıtlayan:",Retry:LBt,"Review the tags and save again.":"Etiketleri gözden geçirin ve tekrar kaydedin.","Running a service mesh, such as Istio? It needs its own provider, one per cluster.":"Istio gibi bir hizmet ağı mı çalıştırıyorsunuz? Ağın, küme başına bir tane olmak üzere kendi sağlayıcısına ihtiyacı var.",Save:PBt,"Save changes":"Değişiklikleri kaydet","Save or cancel your edits before creating templates.":"Şablon oluşturmadan önce düzenlemelerinizi kaydedin veya iptal edin.","Save or cancel your edits before creating the provider.":"Sağlayıcı oluşturmadan önce düzenlemelerinizi kaydedin veya iptal edin.","Save or cancel your template edits to change the scope.":"Kapsamı değiştirmek için şablon düzenlemelerinizi kaydedin veya iptal edin.",scheme:NBt,Scheme:RBt,"scheme and trust domain":"şema ve güven etki alanı","Scheme sets the format this provider uses to name identities.":"Şema, bu sağlayıcının kimlikleri adlandırmak için kullandığı biçimi belirler.",Scope:MBt,"Scope sets which accounts are allowed to use this provider.":"Kapsam, bu sağlayıcıyı kullanabilecek hesapları belirler.","Scope values":"Kapsam değerleri","Search tags":"Etiketleri ara","Segment that partitions identities.":"Kimlikleri bölümlere ayıran segment.","Select {{name}}":"{{name}} öğesini seç","Select a row to delete.":"Silmek için bir satır seçin.",Set:"Ayarlandı","Set a naming pattern":"Adlandırma kalıbı ayarla","Set an attestation rule":"Onay kuralı belirleyin","Set by your provider.":"Sağlayıcınız tarafından ayarlanır.","Set the naming format and usage scope that every workload identity from this provider inherits.":"Bu sağlayıcıdan gelen her iş yükü kimliğinin devralacağı adlandırma biçimini ve kullanım kapsamını ayarlayın.","Set the unique path pattern that every workload identity generated by this template follows. Cannot be changed later.":"Bu şablon tarafından oluşturulan her iş yükü kimliğinin izlediği benzersiz yol desenini ayarlayın. Daha sonra değiştirilemez.","Set up a provider to hold the templates that generate identity names, the identities you declare directly, and the signers that sign credentials for systems outside AWS.":"Kimlik adları oluşturan şablonları, doğrudan tanımladığınız kimlikleri ve AWS dışındaki sistemler için kimlik bilgilerini imzalayan imzalayıcıları barındıracak bir sağlayıcı ayarlayın.","Set up a service mesh provider for this account":"Bu hesap için bir hizmet ağı sağlayıcısı ayarlayın","Set up a way to issue workload identities":"İş yükü kimlikleri vermek için bir yöntem yapılandırın","Set up for your use cases":"Kullanım senaryolarınıza göre ayarlayın","Sets your trust domain, the start of every identity name.":"Her kimlik adının başlangıcını oluşturan güven etki alanınızı belirler.","Setting up the certificate authority stopped. You can continue from where it left off.":"Sertifika yetkilisinin kurulumu durduruldu. Kaldığınız yerden devam edebilirsiniz.","Settings from your provider {{providerName}}":"{{providerName}} sağlayıcınızdan gelen ayarlar","Short-lived credentials renew automatically and follow the SPIFFE standard, so they work with service meshes like Istio and with SaaS applications.":"Kısa ömürlü kimlik bilgileri otomatik olarak yenilenir ve SPIFFE standardına uyar. Böylece Istio gibi hizmet ağları ve SaaS uygulamalarıyla çalışabilirler.","Show all {{errorCount}} errors":"Tüm {{errorCount}} hatayı göster","Show fewer":"Daha az göster","Show more":"Daha fazla göster","Signing algorithm":"İmzalama algoritması","Signing resumes immediately, because this certificate is still published in the trust bundle.":"Bu sertifika hala güven paketinde yayınlandığı için imzalama hemen yeniden başlar.","Signing start time":"İmzalama başlangıç zamanı","Some templates could not be loaded":"Bazı şablonlar yüklenemedi","Something went wrong":"Bir sorun oluştu","Sortable path segment":"Sırası değiştirilebilir yol segmenti",Status:zBt,"Status bar":"Durum çubuğu","Stop access you granted to this identity name from working":"Bu kimlik adına verdiğiniz erişimin çalışmasını durdurun","Stop access you granted to those identity names from working":"Bu kimlik adlarına verdiğiniz erişimin çalışmasını durdurun","Stop matching workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request":"Eşleşen iş yüklerinin kimlik almasını durdurun, böylece bir sonraki isteklerinde başarısız olurlar","Stop the identities it generated from resolving":"Oluşturduğu kimliklerin çözümlenmesini durdurun","Stop the workload running as this identity, so it fails on its next request":"İş yükünü bu kimlik olarak çalıştırmayı durdurun; böylece bir sonraki isteğinde başarısız olur","Stopped signing and no longer in the trust bundle, so nothing verifies against them. Deleting one is safe.":"Bunlar artık imzalama yapmıyor ve güven paketinde yer almıyor. Bu nedenle bunlarla hiçbir sertifika doğrulanamaz. Bunlardan birini güvenle silebilirsiniz.",Subject:OBt,Success:BBt,"Tag keys could not be retrieved":"Etiket anahtarları alınamadı","Tag values could not be retrieved":"Etiket değerleri alınamadı",Tags:FBt,"Tags could not be loaded":"Etiketler yüklenemedi","Tags for {{name}} have been updated.":"{{name}} için etiketler güncellendi.","Tags not saved":"Etiketler kaydedilmedi",Template:$Bt,'Template "{{templateId}}" not found.':'"{{templateId}}" şablonu bulunamadı.',"Template {{name}}: {{reason}}":"Şablon {{name}}: {{reason}}","Template {{templateName}} deleted.":"{{templateName}} şablonu silindi.","Template {{templateNames}} created.":"{{templateNames}} şablonu oluşturuldu.","Template name":"Şablon adı","Template name must be 128 characters or less.":"Şablon adı 128 karakter veya daha az olmalıdır.","Template name values":"Şablon adı değerleri","Template: {{name}}":"Şablon: {{name}}",Templates:jBt,"Templates ({{total}})":"Şablonlar ({{total}})","Templates are being created. Wait for the request to finish.":"Şablonlar oluşturuluyor. İsteğin tamamlanmasını bekleyin.","Templates give matching workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.":"Şablonlar, eşleşen iş yüklerine otomatik olarak kendi kimlik adlarını verir. Her biri bu sağlayıcının ad ön ekinin yanı sıra bir yol ve kalıp kullanır.","Templates that member accounts created under this provider are not visible here and cannot be deleted from this account. If any exist, deleting the provider fails.":"Bu sağlayıcı altındaki üye hesapların oluşturduğu şablonlar burada görünmez ve bu hesaptan silinemez. Mevcutsa sağlayıcıyı silme işlemi başarısız olur.","Templates: {{reason}}":"Şablonlar: {{reason}}","The account that owns the certificate authority.":"Sertifika yetkilisinin sahibi olan hesap.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it.":"Onaylama politikası, bu sağlayıcı tarafından kimliklerin nasıl verileceğini denetler. Bir iş yükünün; türü, ayrıntıları ve çalıştığı konum gibi tüm koşulları, kendisini barındıran hizmetin teyit ettiği şekilde karşılaması gerekir.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.":"Onaylama politikası, bu sağlayıcı tarafından kimliklerin nasıl verileceğini denetler. Bir iş yükünün; türü, ayrıntıları ve çalıştığı konum gibi tüm koşulları, kendisini barındıran hizmetin teyit ettiği şekilde karşılaması gerekir. Bu politikayı daha sonra düzenleyebilirsiniz.","The attestation policy controls which workloads get an identity from this provider. A workload must meet every condition, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. It's generated from the EKS clusters you entered. You can edit it later.":"Onaylama politikası, hangi iş yüklerinin bu sağlayıcıdan kimlik aldığını kontrol eder. Bir iş yükü, onu barındıran hizmet tarafından kefil olunduğu şekilde her koşulu karşılamalıdır. Girdiğiniz EKS kümelerinden oluşturulur. Daha sonra düzenleyebilirsiniz.","The attestation policy lists the facts a workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so a workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.":"Onaylama politikası, bu sağlayıcının bir iş yüküne kimlik vermesinden önce iş yükünün kanıtlaması gereken bilgileri listeler. İşlem platformu bu bilgilerin doğruluğunu onayladığından bir iş yükü kendisine ait olmayan bir kimlik talep edemez.","The attester vouches for the workload, and it must match every condition to run as this identity.":"Onaylayıcı, iş yükünün doğruluğunu teyit eder ve iş yükünün bu kimlikle çalışabilmesi için tüm koşulları karşılaması gerekir.","The certificate authority is still being set up.":"Sertifika yetkilisi kurulumu devam ediyor.","The ID at the end of the certificate authority's ARN in AWS Private CA.":"AWS Özel CA'daki sertifika yetkilisinin ARN'sinin sonundaki ID.","The identity name is the provider's naming scheme, a path prefix, and a path pattern.":"Kimlik adı; sağlayıcının adlandırma şeması, yol ön eki ve yol örüntüsünden oluşur.","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag key is 128.":"Bir etiket anahtarında kullanabileceğiniz maksimum karakter sayısı 128'dir.","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag value is 256.":"Bir etiket değerinde kullanabileceğiniz maksimum karakter sayısı 256'dır.","The path can be up to {{maxLength}} characters.":"Yol en fazla {{maxLength}} karakter uzunluğunda olabilir.","The path doesn't support these segments: {{segments}}. Remove them, and add what you need from the following cards.":"Yol şu segmentleri desteklemiyor: {{segments}}. Bunları kaldırın ve aşağıdaki kartlardan ihtiyacınız olanı ekleyin.","The path is already the default.":"Yol zaten varsayılan değerinde.","The path is the per-workload part of each identity's name. Keep the Region in front so names stay unique across accounts and Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.":"Yol, her kimliğin adındaki iş yüküne özgü bölümdür. Adların hesaplar ve Bölgeler arasında benzersiz kalmasını sağlamak için Bölgeyi başta tutun veya segmentleri ekibinizin adlandırma kurallarına uyacak şekilde yeniden düzenleyin.","The path prefixes your policy allows":"Politikanızın izin verdiği yol ön ekleri","The permissions defined in this policy for <b>{{providerName}}</b> stop applying.":"Bu politikada <b>{{providerName}}</b> için tanımlanan izinler artık geçerli olmayacak.","The provider could not be deleted. Try again.":"Sağlayıcı silinemedi. Tekrar deneyin.","The provider is being created. Wait for the request to finish.":"Sağlayıcı oluşturuluyor. İstek tamamlanana kadar bekleyin.","The provider might still be deleted. Check the providers list later.":"Sağlayıcı yine de silinebilir. Sağlayıcılar listesini daha sonra kontrol edin.","The resource policy on this provider controls who can associate templates with it.":"Bu sağlayıcının kaynak politikası, şablonları bu sağlayıcıyla kimlerin ilişkilendirebileceğini denetler.","The soonest the new certificate can take over. It publishes to the trust bundle first, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. Signing may start later than this, never sooner.":"Yeni sertifikanın imzalamayı devralabileceği en erken zaman. Sertifika önce güven paketinde yayınlanır. Böylece bu sertifikayla herhangi bir şey imzalanmadan önce tüm doğrulayıcılar sertifikayı kontrol edebilir. İmzalama belirtilen zamandan daha geç başlayabilir ancak daha erken başlayamaz.","The soonest this certificate can start signing. It publishes to the trust bundle first, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. Signing may start later than this, never sooner.":"Bu sertifikanın imzalamaya başlayabileceği en erken zaman. Sertifika önce güven paketinde yayınlanır. Böylece bu sertifikayla herhangi bir şey imzalanmadan önce tüm doğrulayıcılar sertifikayı kontrol edebilir. İmzalama belirtilen zamandan daha geç başlayabilir ancak daha erken başlayamaz.",Theme:WBt,"There was an error loading the code editor.":"Kod düzenleyici yüklenirken bir hata oluştu.","These clusters set the template's <policyLink>attestation policy</policyLink>.":"Bu kümeler şablonun <policyLink>onaylama politikasını</policyLink> ayarlar.","These resources need to be deleted before deleting the provider.":"Sağlayıcıyı silmeden önce bu kaynakların silinmesi gerekir.","This account ({{accountId}})":"Bu hesap ({{accountId}})","This action deletes the workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.":"Bu eylem, <b>{{providerName}}</b> adlı iş yükü kimlik sağlayıcısını siler.","This cannot be undone, and creating a provider with the same name later does not restore anything. To proceed, complete the steps below.":"Bu işlem geri alınamaz ve daha sonra aynı ada sahip bir sağlayıcı oluşturmak hiçbir öğeyi geri yüklemez. Devam etmek için aşağıdaki adımları tamamlayın.","This cannot be undone, and the path this template reserved stays reserved. No future template can generate identities under it.":"Bu işlem geri alınamaz ve bu şablonun rezerve ettiği yol, rezerve edilmiş olarak kalır. Gelecekteki hiçbir şablon onun altında kimlik oluşturamaz.","This cannot be undone, and this name stays reserved. It is never issued again, so you cannot recreate this identity under the same name.":"Bu işlem geri alınamaz ve bu ad, rezerve edilmiş olarak kalır. Bir daha asla verilmez, bu nedenle bu kimliği aynı adla yeniden oluşturamazsınız.","This certificate authority uses {{caAlgorithm}}. Rotation keeps the signer's {{signerAlgorithm}} algorithm, so choose a {{signerAlgorithm}} certificate authority instead.":"Bu sertifika yetkilisi {{caAlgorithm}} kullanır. Döndürme işlemi, imzalayıcının {{signerAlgorithm}} algoritmasını korur. Bu nedenle, bunun yerine bir {{signerAlgorithm}} sertifika yetkilisi seçin.","This certificate has left the trust bundle, so it publishes again first. Signing starts after about {{hours}} hour, once every region has it.":"Bu sertifika güven paketinden ayrıldı. Dolayısıyla önce yeniden yayınlanır. İmzalama yaklaşık {{hours}} saat sonra, her bölge sertifikaya sahip olduğunda başlar.","This certificate has left the trust bundle, so it publishes again first. Signing starts after about {{hours}} hours, once every region has it.":"Bu sertifika güven paketinden ayrıldı. Dolayısıyla önce yeniden yayınlanır. İmzalama yaklaşık {{hours}} saat sonra, her bölge sertifikaya sahip olduğunda başlar.","This certificate is validating, so deleting it stops verification immediately":"Bu sertifika doğrulanıyor; bu nedenle sertifikanın silinmesi, doğrulama işlemini hemen durdurur","This certificate stopped signing and its chain has left the trust bundle, so nothing verifies against it. It stays listed as history until you delete it, and deleting it is safe: no credential depends on it, and the certificate signer keeps signing.":"Bu sertifika imzalamayı durdurdu ve zinciri güven paketinden ayrıldı. Bu nedenle artık hiçbir şey bu sertifikaya göre doğrulanamaz. Siz silinceye kadar geçmiş olarak listelenir ve silmek güvenlidir: Hiçbir kimlik bilgisi buna bağlı değildir ve sertifika imzalayıcı, imzalamaya devam eder.","This cluster is already listed.":"Bu küme zaten listeleniyor.","This condition key and operator combination already exists":"Bu koşul anahtarı ve işleç birleşimi zaten mevcut.","This doesn't look like a valid EKS cluster ARN. An invalid ARN will leave workloads in that cluster without an identity.":"Bu geçerli bir EKS kümesi ARN'si gibi görünmüyor. Geçersiz bir ARN, iş yüklerini bu kümede kimliksiz bırakır.","This management account and delegated administrators":"Bu yönetim hesabı ve yetkilendirilmiş yöneticiler","This organization ({{organizationId}})":"Bu kuruluş ({{organizationId}})","This policy's cluster ARNs don't match the clusters you entered. Changing the clusters won't update this policy. Continue only if that's intended.":"Bu politikanın küme ARN'leri girdiğiniz kümelerle eşleşmiyor. Kümeleri değiştirmek bu politikayı güncellemez. Yalnızca amacınız buysa devam edin.","This provider has no naming scheme, so the path you enter is the full identity name.":"Bu sağlayıcının adlandırma şeması yoktur. Bu nedenle, girdiğiniz yol tam kimlik adıdır.","This provider names every identity using the open standard.":"Bu sağlayıcı, her kimliği açık standardı kullanarak adlandırır.","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. Both certificates below stop, including the one still in transition, so the update does not complete. Both stay configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"Bu sağlayıcı X.509-SVID düzenlemeyi hemen durdurur ve istemci sertifikasına ihtiyaç duyan iş yüklerinin sonraki istekleri başarısız olur. Aşağıdaki sertifikaların her ikisi de durur. Geçiş aşamasındaki sertifika dahildir. Bu nedenle, güncelleme tamamlanamaz. Her ikisi de yapılandırılmış olarak kalır. Daha önce düzenlenen sertifikalar yaklaşık 12 saat boyunca doğrulanmaya devam eder ve Etkinleştir seçeneğiyle imzalama yeniden başlatılır.","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"Bu sağlayıcı X.509-SVID düzenlemeyi hemen durdurur ve istemci sertifikasına ihtiyaç duyan iş yüklerinin sonraki istekleri başarısız olur. Aşağıdaki sertifika yapılandırılmış olarak kalır. Daha önce düzenlenen sertifikalar yaklaşık 12 saat boyunca doğrulanmaya devam eder. Etkinleştir seçeneğiyle imzalama yeniden başlatılır.","This provider's policy doesn't allow this path prefix \"{{pathPrefix}}\" for your account. Ask your organization administrator which path prefixes are permitted.":"Bu sağlayıcının politikası, hesabınız için yol önekine “{{pathPrefix}}” izin vermiyor. Kuruluş yöneticinize hangi yol öneklerine izin verildiğini danışın.","This removes the certificate from the provider and pulls its chain from the trust bundle immediately. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"Bu işlem, sertifikayı sağlayıcıdan kaldırır ve zincirini derhal güven paketinden çeker. Sertifika yetkilisi AWS Özel CA'da değişmeden kalır.","This removes the certificate from the provider. Its chain already left the trust bundle, so nothing that is verifying today changes. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"Bu işlem, sertifikayı sağlayıcıdan kaldırır. Sertifika zinciri zaten güven paketinden çıkarılmış olduğundan, şu anda doğrulama sürecinde herhangi bir değişiklik olmaz. Sertifika yetkilisi ise AWS Özel CA'da değişmeden kalır.","This tag will be removed upon saving changes":"Değişiklikler kaydedildikten sonra bu etiket kaldırılacaktır","This usually takes a few minutes. Keep this page open until it finishes.":"Bu işlem genellikle birkaç dakika sürer. Tamamlanana kadar bu sayfayı açık tutun.",Today:qBt,"Too many requests":"Çok fazla istek","Trace and control access per workload":"İş yükü başına erişimi izleyin ve denetleyin","Trust bundle":"Güven paketi","trust domain":"güven etki alanı","Trust domain":"Güven etki alanı","Trust domain is the root of trust for the SPIFFE naming scheme. It is a logical name that follows DNS naming style, for example prod.acme.com, but does not need to match a real DNS record.":"Güven etki alanı, SPIFFE adlandırma şemasının güven köküdür. DNS adlandırma biçimine uygun mantıksal bir addır. Örneğin, prod.acme.com olabilir ancak gerçek bir DNS kaydıyla eşleşmesi gerekmez.","Try again. If the problem continues, contact AWS Support.":"Yeniden deneyin. Sorun devam ederse AWS Destek ile iletişime geçin.","Unable to load templates":"Şablonlar yüklenemiyor",Undo:UBt,"Up to 128 characters. Must be unique per provider.":"En fazla 128 karakter. Her sağlayıcı için benzersiz olmalıdır.","Up to 128 characters. Use alphanumeric and '-_.' characters. Must be unique in your organization. Can't be changed after the provider is created.":'En fazla 128 karakter. Harf, rakam ve "-_." karakterlerini kullanın. Kuruluşunuzda benzersiz olmalıdır. Sağlayıcı oluşturulduktan sonra değiştirilemez.',"Up to 128 characters. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters. Must be unique per provider.":"En fazla 128 karakter. Alfasayısal karakterler ve '-_' karakterlerini kullanın. Her sağlayıcı için benzersiz olmalıdır.",Update:VBt,"Update certificate signer":"Sertifika imzalayıcısını güncelle",'Use "{{key}}"':'Şunu kullan: "{{key}}"','Use "{{value}}"':'Şunu kullan: "{{value}}"',"Use case":"Kullanım örneği","Use cases":"Kullanım örnekleri","Use default templates":"Varsayılan şablonları kullan","Use letters, digits, and . - _ characters, with a single / between parts. No / at the start or end, and a part can't be . or ..":"Parçalar arasında tek bir / olacak şekilde harf, rakam ve . - _ karakterlerini kullanın. Başta veya sonda / bulunmamalıdır ve bir parça . ya da .. olamaz.","Use one from another account":"Başka bir hesaptan birini kullan","Use only Latin letters, numbers, spaces, tabs, line breaks, and standard keyboard symbols.":"Yalnızca Latin harfleri, rakamlar, boşluklar, sekmeler, satır sonları ve standart klavye simgeleri kullanın.","Use only letters, digits, - and _ characters.":"Yalnızca harf, rakam, - ve _ karakterleri kullanın.","Use only letters, digits, . - and _ characters. The path can't be . or ..":"Yalnızca harf, rakam, . - ve _ karakterlerini kullanın. Yol . veya .. olamaz.","Use only letters, digits, periods (.), hyphens (-), and underscores (_).":"Yalnızca harf, rakam, nokta (.), kısa çizgi (-) ve alt çizgi (_) kullanın.","Use the workload identity in trust policies, resource policies, or SCPs. Each call is recorded in CloudTrail with the workload's identity.":"İş yükü kimliğini güven politikalarında, kaynak politikalarında veya SCP'lerde kullanın. Her çağrı, iş yükünün kimliğiyle birlikte CloudTrail'e kaydedilir.",'Use: "{{text}}"':'Şunu kullan: "{{text}}"',"Used as the common name in the certificate authority's subject.":"Sertifika yetkilisinin konusunda ortak ad olarak kullanılır.",Validating:HBt,"Validating: stopped signing, still trusted":"Doğrulanıyor: İmzalama durdu, hâlâ güvenilir",Value:KBt,"Value must be 256 characters or less.":"Değer en fazla 256 karakter olmalıdır.",Values:GBt,"View all":"Tümünü görüntüle","View all notifications":"Tüm bildirimleri görüntüle","View JSON":"JSON'u görüntüle",Visual:YBt,Warning:JBt,Warnings:ZBt,"What gets created":"Ne oluşturulur?","Which EKS clusters is this provider for?":"Bu sağlayıcı hangi EKS kümeleri içindir?",'Wildcard "*" is only allowed with the StringLike, StringNotLike, ArnLike, or ArnNotLike operators.':'"*" joker karakteri yalnızca StringLike, StringNotLike, ArnLike veya ArnNotLike operatörleriyle kullanılabilir.',"Without a policy, no other account can create templates under this provider, though delegated administrators can already create both. Add a statement for each account, organizational unit, or IAM principal that should be able to, and limit each one to a path prefix.":"Bir politika olmadan, yetkilendirilmiş yöneticiler hem şablon hem de iş yükü kimliği oluşturabilse de başka hiçbir hesap bu sağlayıcı altında şablon oluşturamaz. Bu yetkiye sahip olması gereken her hesap, kuruluş birimi veya IAM sorumlusu için bir ifade ekleyin ve her birini bir yol ön ekiyle sınırlandırın.","Workload identities ({{total}})":"İş yükü kimlikleri ({{total}})","Workload identities in the IAM User Guide":"IAM Kullanıcı Kılavuzu'nda iş yükü kimlikleri","Workload identities in the IAM User Guide (opens in a new tab)":"IAM Kullanıcı Kılavuzu'nda iş yükü kimlikleri (yeni sekmede açılır)","Workload identities: {{reason}}":"İş yükü kimlikleri: {{reason}}","Workload identity":"İş yükü kimliği","Workload Identity":"İş yükü kimliği","Workload identity {{name}}: {{reason}}":"İş yükü kimliği {{name}}: {{reason}}","Workload identity {{workloadIdentifier}} deleted.":"{{workloadIdentifier}} iş yükü kimliği silindi.","Workloads get named automatically":"İş yükleri otomatik olarak adlandırılır","Workloads in these EKS clusters can get an identity from this provider, when all of these are true:":"Bu EKS kümelerindeki iş yükleri, aşağıdakilerin tümü doğru olduğunda bu sağlayıcıdan bir kimlik alabilir:","Workloads running in these clusters can get an identity from this provider. Add 2 or more.":"Bu kümelerde çalışan iş yükleri bu sağlayıcıdan bir kimlik alabilir. 2 veya daha fazla ekleyin.","Workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Bu hesapta çalışan iş yükleri, bu şablonun {{workloadLabel}} tarafından doğrulanan bilgilerle oluşturduğu kimlikleri kullanabilir.","Workloads running in this cluster can get an identity from this provider.":"Bu kümede çalışan iş yükleri bu sağlayıcıdan bir kimlik alabilir.","Workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Kuruluşunuzda çalışan iş yükleri, bu şablonun {{workloadLabel}} tarafından doğrulanan bilgilerle oluşturduğu kimlikleri kullanabilir.","Workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request":"Bu kimlikleri kullanan iş yüklerine kimlik bilgisi verilmesi durur ve bu iş yükleri bir sonraki isteklerinde başarısız olur","Workloads, such as agents, pods, and jobs, are verified at runtime and get a workload identity, one per workload, generated by a template. The identity gets fine-grained access to AWS resources through IAM policies and CloudTrail, and signed JWT and X.509 credentials for meshes and SaaS apps.":"Temsilciler, pod'lar ve işler gibi iş yükleri, çalışma zamanında doğrulanır ve her biri bir şablon tarafından oluşturulan kendi iş yükü kimliğini alır. Kimlik, IAM politikaları ve CloudTrail aracılığıyla AWS kaynaklarına ayrıntılı erişim, hizmet ağları ve SaaS uygulamaları için de imzalı JWT ve X.509 kimlik bilgileri sağlar.","Wrap lines":"Satırları kaydır","Write a policy to let another account create templates, or to stop a delegated administrator from part of the name space. Each statement names an organizational unit, specific accounts, or individual IAM principals, allows or denies, and can be limited to a path prefix.":"Başka bir hesabın şablon oluşturmasına izin vermek veya yetkilendirilmiş bir yöneticinin ad alanının bir bölümünden men etmek için bir politika yazın. Her ifade bir kuruluş birimini, belirli hesapları veya bireysel IAM sorumlularını adlandırır, bunlara izin verir veya bunları reddeder ve bir yol ön eki ile sınırlandırılabilir.","Yes by default":"Varsayılan olarak evet","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tag.":"En fazla {{availableTags}} etiket daha ekleyebilirsiniz.","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tags.":"En fazla {{availableTags}} etiket daha ekleyebilirsiniz.","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"{{tagLimit}} etiket sınırını aştınız.","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"{{tagLimit}} etiket sınırını aştınız.","You have more keys than can be displayed":"Görüntülenebileceğinden daha fazla anahtarınız var","You have more values than can be displayed":"Görüntülenebileceğinden daha fazla değeriniz var","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"{{tagLimit}} etiket sınırına ulaştınız.","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"{{tagLimit}} etiket sınırına ulaştınız.","You have unsaved tag changes. Leave this page and discard them?":"Kaydedilmemiş etiket değişiklikleriniz var. Bu sayfadan ayrılmak ve değişiklikleri iptal etmek istiyor musunuz?","You must enter a path":"Bir yol girmelisiniz.","You must specify a condition key":"Bir koşul anahtarı belirtmelisiniz.","You must specify a tag key":"Bir etiket anahtarı belirtmelisiniz","You must specify a unique tag key.":"Benzersiz bir etiket anahtarı belirtmelisiniz.","You must specify a value":"Bir değer belirtmelisiniz","Your administrator decides which prefixes this account can use. This is checked when you create.":"Yöneticiniz bu hesabın hangi ön ekleri kullanabileceğine karar verir. Bu, oluşturma sırasında kontrol edilir.","Your identities will be <code>{{prefix}}<em>{{placeholder}}</em></code>":"Kimlikleriniz <code>{{prefix}}<em>{{placeholder}}</em></code>","Your organization already has a workload identity provider. Add templates under it to start issuing identities to your workloads — each named under your account's path prefix.":"Kuruluşunuzda zaten bir iş yükü kimlik sağlayıcısı var. İş yüklerinize kimlik vermeye başlamak için bu sağlayıcının altında şablonlar ekleyin. Her kimlik, hesabınızın yol ön eki altında adlandırılır.","Your organization has workload identity providers you can use. Pick one and add templates under it to start issuing identities to your workloads.":"Kuruluşunuzda kullanabileceğiniz iş yükü kimlik sağlayıcıları var. İş yüklerinize kimlik vermeye başlamak için birini seçip altında şablonlar ekleyin.","YYYY/MM/DD":"YYYY/AA/GG","{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.","A declared identity has a fixed name you define. Use one when you need an exact name, for example to match a name another system already expects.":"A declared identity has a fixed name you define. Use one when you need an exact name, for example to match a name another system already expects.","A fact {{workload}} checks when the agent or workload starts.":"A fact {{workload}} checks when the agent or workload starts.","A provider issues secure, verifiable identities to your agents and workloads, like your Kubernetes pods or AI agents, to access AWS and third-party services without long-lived credentials.":"A provider issues secure, verifiable identities to your agents and workloads, like your Kubernetes pods or AI agents, to access AWS and third-party services without long-lived credentials.","A template automatically generates an identity for each matching agent or workload under {{providerName}}.":"A template automatically generates an identity for each matching agent or workload under {{providerName}}.","A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued.":"A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued.","A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued. Decide how this provider issues identities - starting from the <link>default templates</link> for common use cases, or skipping them. Templates are optional and can be added later.":"A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued. Decide how this provider issues identities - starting from the <link>default templates</link> for common use cases, or skipping them. Templates are optional and can be added later.","A template names identities automatically as matching agents and workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.":"A template names identities automatically as matching agents and workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.","A template with no attestation policy matches no agent or workload, so nothing is ever issued from it. Set a policy to define which agents and workloads qualify.":"A template with no attestation policy matches no agent or workload, so nothing is ever issued from it. Set a policy to define which agents and workloads qualify.","A template's path pattern, built from facts like cluster, namespace, and service account, names each agent or workload automatically when it starts. You don't create identities ahead of time.":"A template's path pattern, built from facts like cluster, namespace, and service account, names each agent or workload automatically when it starts. You don't create identities ahead of time.","Add a fact or condition key. A path of only custom text would give every agent or workload the same name.":"Add a fact or condition key. A path of only custom text would give every agent or workload the same name.","Add an {{conditionKey}} condition, so only agents or workloads in these clusters get an identity.":"Add an {{conditionKey}} condition, so only agents or workloads in these clusters get an identity.","Add attestation policy":"Add attestation policy","Add templates after the provider is created.":"Add templates after the provider is created.","Agent and workload identity":"Agent and workload identity","Agent and workload identity - <em>Preview</em>":"Agent and workload identity - <em>Preview</em>","Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide":"Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide","Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide (opens in a new tab)":"Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide (opens in a new tab)","Agents and workloads get named automatically":"Agents and workloads get named automatically","Agents and workloads get short-lived credentials that renew automatically and follow the SPIFFE standard, so they work with service meshes such as Istio and with business applications.":"Agents and workloads get short-lived credentials that renew automatically and follow the SPIFFE standard, so they work with service meshes such as Istio and with business applications.","Agents and workloads in these EKS clusters can get an identity from this provider, when all of these are true:":"Agents and workloads in these EKS clusters can get an identity from this provider, when all of these are true:","Agents and workloads running in these clusters can get an identity from this provider. Add two or more.":"Agents and workloads running in these clusters can get an identity from this provider. Add two or more.","Agents and workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Agents and workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.","Agents and workloads running in this cluster can get an identity from this provider.":"Agents and workloads running in this cluster can get an identity from this provider.","Agents and workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Agents and workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.","Agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request":"Agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request","Agents and workloads, such as AI agents and pods, are verified at runtime and each gets its own identity, generated by a template. The identity gets fine-grained access to AWS resources through IAM policies and CloudTrail, and signed JWT and X.509 credentials for meshes and apps.":"Agents and workloads, such as AI agents and pods, are verified at runtime and each gets its own identity, generated by a template. The identity gets fine-grained access to AWS resources through IAM policies and CloudTrail, and signed JWT and X.509 credentials for meshes and apps.","All templates and identities under this provider will be deleted":"All templates and identities under this provider will be deleted","An AI agent or workload gets an identity that is unique.":"An AI agent or workload gets an identity that is unique.","An identity with no attestation policy admits no workload, so nothing can run as it. Set a policy to define which workload qualifies.":"An identity with no attestation policy admits no workload, so nothing can run as it. Set a policy to define which workload qualifies.","An identity with this name already exists.":"An identity with this name already exists.","At runtime the platform attests these facts about the agent or workload. Any agent or workload whose attestation carries them gets an identity issued from this template.":"At runtime the platform attests these facts about the agent or workload. Any agent or workload whose attestation carries them gets an identity issued from this template.","Attestation policy for {{name}} has been removed.":"Attestation policy for {{name}} has been removed.","Attestation policy for {{name}} has been updated.":"Attestation policy for {{name}} has been updated.","By continuing, you also enable organization level resource creation, which is needed to create the organization scoped provider. You can disable it later in Settings.":"By continuing, you also enable organization level resource creation, which is needed to create the organization scoped provider. You can disable it later in Settings.","Change the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.":"Change the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.","Choose a stable, unique name that identifies one environment or group of agents and workloads, for example prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal.":"Choose a stable, unique name that identifies one environment or group of agents and workloads, for example prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal.","Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for an agent or workload.":"Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for an agent or workload.","Choose the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.":"Choose the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.","Choose where the workload is hosted":"Choose where the workload is hosted","Choose who can use it":"Choose who can use it","Control what an agent or workload can reach with familiar IAM policies and see its AWS calls in CloudTrail.":"Control what an agent or workload can reach with familiar IAM policies and see its AWS calls in CloudTrail.","Create declared identity":"Create declared identity","Creates an agent and workload identity provider and template for agents and workloads running in one or more EKS clusters under a service mesh, such as Istio.":"Creates an agent and workload identity provider and template for agents and workloads running in one or more EKS clusters under a service mesh, such as Istio.","Creating the identity":"Creating the identity","Declare an identity with the exact name you need":"Declare an identity with the exact name you need","Declared identities":"Declared identities","Declared identity":"Declared identity","Declared identity {{name}} created.":"Declared identity {{name}} created.","Define which agents and workloads are allowed to use this template.":"Define which agents and workloads are allowed to use this template.","Delete the templates under <b>{{providerName}}</b> before deleting the provider. Once deleted, agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials and fail on their next request, and access that you granted to these identities will stop working.":"Delete the templates under <b>{{providerName}}</b> before deleting the provider. Once deleted, agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials and fail on their next request, and access that you granted to these identities will stop working.","Deleting templates and identities":"Deleting templates and identities","Each identity is fully the template path.":"Each identity is fully the template path.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.","Enter a description":"Enter a description","Failed to create the declared identity.":"Failed to create the declared identity.","Failed to save attestation policy.":"Failed to save attestation policy.","Filter declared identities":"Filter declared identities","For example, to match a name another system already expects.":"For example, to match a name another system already expects.","from provider":"from provider","Give AI agents and workloads their own identities. Know which of them made each call. Scope its access with the IAM policies you already use.":"Give AI agents and workloads their own identities. Know which of them made each call. Scope its access with the IAM policies you already use.","Give an agent or workload a unique identity, so you can grant it access and audit what it did rather than sharing one role.":"Give an agent or workload a unique identity, so you can grant it access and audit what it did rather than sharing one role.","Grant access":"Grant access","Grant this name access to resources in IAM policies.":"Grant this name access to resources in IAM policies.","IAM for agents and workloads":"IAM for agents and workloads","IAM for agents and workloads (opens in a new tab)":"IAM for agents and workloads (opens in a new tab)",Identifier:XBt,"Identities ({{total}})":"Identities ({{total}})","Identities are issued at runtime from facts the agent or workload proves, rather than from what an admin assigns.":"Identities are issued at runtime from facts the agent or workload proves, rather than from what an admin assigns.","Identities for agents":"Identities for agents","Identities: {{reason}}":"Identities: {{reason}}","Identity {{name}}: {{reason}}":"Identity {{name}}: {{reason}}","Invalid trust domain. Use lowercase alphanumeric and '-.' characters.":"Invalid trust domain. Use lowercase alphanumeric and '-.' characters.","Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's agents and workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. Standard pricing applies to the creation and use of AWS Private CA.":"Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's agents and workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. Standard pricing applies to the creation and use of AWS Private CA.","It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so agents and workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. To avoid this, wait until it becomes inactive on its own. Deleting it then has no effect on verification.":"It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so agents and workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. To avoid this, wait until it becomes inactive on its own. Deleting it then has no effect on verification.","Let agents and workloads reach non-AWS resources":"Let agents and workloads reach non-AWS resources","Loading declared identities":"Loading declared identities","Matching agents and workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.":"Matching agents and workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.","No agent and workload identity providers":"No agent and workload identity providers","No agent or workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.":"No agent or workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.","No attestation policy attached.":"No attestation policy attached.","No attestation policy. No agent or workload will be issued an identity from this template until you add one.":"No attestation policy. No agent or workload will be issued an identity from this template until you add one.","No conditions. This policy matches every agent or workload of its service.":"No conditions. This policy matches every agent or workload of its service.","No segments yet. Add at least one, or every agent or workload this template matches resolves to the same name.":"No segments yet. Add at least one, or every agent or workload this template matches resolves to the same name.","None – names are defined by templates":"None – names are defined by templates","Nothing can run as this identity":"Nothing can run as this identity","Once the attestation policy is removed, matching agents and workloads will not be issued agent and workload identities until you add a policy again.":"Once the attestation policy is removed, matching agents and workloads will not be issued agent and workload identities until you add a policy again.","One bundle per provider, and one URL. It carries every authority the provider publishes: both outbound signers, and during an update both the current and incoming certificate authority, which is what lets verifiers accept either one through the handover. Your own AWS agents and workloads get these keys automatically; send this to systems outside AWS.":"One bundle per provider, and one URL. It carries every authority the provider publishes: both outbound signers, and during an update both the current and incoming certificate authority, which is what lets verifiers accept either one through the handover. Your own AWS agents and workloads get these keys automatically; send this to systems outside AWS.","One provider and one trust domain shared by every EKS cluster in the mesh. An agent or workload with the same namespace and service account in any of these clusters shares one identity.":"One provider and one trust domain shared by every EKS cluster in the mesh. An agent or workload with the same namespace and service account in any of these clusters shares one identity.","Path is the unique part of each identity's name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts an agent or workload proves.":"Path is the unique part of each identity's name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts an agent or workload proves.","path prefix":"path prefix","Policy: Define how an agent or workload attests to get the identity":"Policy: Define how an agent or workload attests to get the identity","Proven at runtime":"Proven at runtime","Providers to issue agent and workload identities":"Providers to issue agent and workload identities","Scoped, auditable access":"Scoped, auditable access","Search by name":"Search by name","Set the exact name":"Set the exact name","Set the naming format and usage scope that every agent and workload identity from this provider inherits.":"Set the naming format and usage scope that every agent and workload identity from this provider inherits.","Set the unique path pattern that every identity generated by this template follows. Cannot be changed later.":"Set the unique path pattern that every identity generated by this template follows. Cannot be changed later.","Set up a provider to hold the templates that generate identity names and the signers that sign credentials for systems outside AWS.":"Set up a provider to hold the templates that generate identity names and the signers that sign credentials for systems outside AWS.","Set up a way to issue agent and workload identities":"Set up a way to issue agent and workload identities","Set which workloads can use this identity and where they must run.":"Set which workloads can use this identity and where they must run.","Stop matching agents and workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request":"Stop matching agents and workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request","Templates give matching agents and workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.":"Templates give matching agents and workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it.":"The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.":"The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Generated from the EKS clusters above. Can be edited later.":"The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Generated from the EKS clusters above. Can be edited later.","The attestation policy controls how this identity is issued. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.":"The attestation policy controls how this identity is issued. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.","The attestation policy is the set of facts an agent or workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so an agent or workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.":"The attestation policy is the set of facts an agent or workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so an agent or workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.","The certificate chain is distributing to every Region, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. It starts signing at {{at}}. That is the minimum signing delay you set, so signing may start later than this. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.":"The certificate chain is distributing to every Region, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. It starts signing at {{at}}. That is the minimum signing delay you set, so signing may start later than this. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.","The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Account ID and Region in front so names stay unique across accounts and Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.":"The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Account ID and Region in front so names stay unique across accounts and Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.","The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Region in front so names stay unique across Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.":"The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Region in front so names stay unique across Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.","This action deletes the agent and workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.":"This action deletes the agent and workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.","This certificate has stopped signing, but its chain stays in the trust bundle so certificates already issued under it keep verifying. It becomes inactive at {{at}}. Until then, Enable resumes signing with no wait. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.":"This certificate has stopped signing, but its chain stays in the trust bundle so certificates already issued under it keep verifying. It becomes inactive at {{at}}. Until then, Enable resumes signing with no wait. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.","This doesn't look like a valid EKS cluster ARN. An invalid ARN will leave agents or workloads in that cluster without an identity.":"This doesn't look like a valid EKS cluster ARN. An invalid ARN will leave agents or workloads in that cluster without an identity.","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. Both certificates below stop, including the one still in transition, so the update does not complete. Both stay configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. Both certificates below stop, including the one still in transition, so the update does not complete. Both stay configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.","This template issues no identities":"This template issues no identities","Trust domain must be 64 characters or less.":"Trust domain must be 64 characters or less.","Use the agent or workload identity in trust policies, resource policies, or SCPs. CloudTrail records its calls with that identity.":"Use the agent or workload identity in trust policies, resource policies, or SCPs. CloudTrail records its calls with that identity.","What conditions should the agent or workload match?":"What conditions should the agent or workload match?","Where is the agent or workload hosted?":"Where is the agent or workload hosted?","You must enter a name":"You must enter a name","Your organization already has an agent and workload identity provider. Add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads — each named under your account's path prefix.":"Your organization already has an agent and workload identity provider. Add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads — each named under your account's path prefix.","Your organization has agent and workload identity providers you can use. Pick one and add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads.":"Your organization has agent and workload identity providers you can use. Pick one and add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads."},eFt=Object.freeze(Object.defineProperty({__proto__:null,ARN:"ARN",Actions:jOt,Active:WOt,Add:qOt,Apply:UOt,Attestation:VOt,Cancel:HOt,Clear:KOt,Close:GOt,Configured:YOt,Confirm:JOt,Contains:ZOt,Created:XOt,Delete:"Sil",Description:QOt,Details:eBt,Disable:tBt,Dismiss:aBt,Edit:nBt,Editing:iBt,Enable:rBt,Equals:sBt,Errors:lBt,Format:cBt,Identifier:XBt,Inactive:dBt,Info:uBt,JWKS:pBt,Key:hBt,Name:"Ad",New:mBt,None:"Yok",Notifications:gBt,Operator:vBt,Operators:fBt,Path:"Yol",Preferences:wBt,Preview:kBt,Properties:SBt,Property:_Bt,Provided:xBt,Provider:ABt,Providers:EBt,Ready:CBt,Recommended:TBt,Refresh:IBt,Remove:DBt,Retry:LBt,Save:PBt,Scheme:RBt,Scope:MBt,Status:zBt,Subject:OBt,Success:BBt,Tags:FBt,Template:$Bt,Templates:jBt,Theme:WBt,Today:qBt,Undo:UBt,Update:VBt,Validating:HBt,Value:KBt,Values:GBt,Visual:YBt,Warning:JBt,Warnings:ZBt,and:"ve",default:QBt,equals:oBt,optional:yBt,or:bBt,path:"yol",scheme:NBt},Symbol.toStringTag,{value:"Module"})),tFt="创建时间",aFt="详细信息",nFt="正在编辑",iFt="JWKS",rFt="准备就绪",oFt="正在验证",sFt="Identifier",lFt={"'{{providerName}}' does not exist in your account":"“{{providerName}}”在您的账户中不存在","(earliest)":"（最早）","{{addedCount}} tag added or changed":"已添加或更改 {{addedCount}} 个标签","{{addedCount}} tags added or changed":"已添加或更改 {{addedCount}} 个标签","{{createdCount}} templates created: {{templateNames}}.":"{{createdCount}} 个模板已创建：{{templateNames}}。","{{failed}} of {{total}} certificates could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"无法删除 {{failed}} 个证书（共 {{total}} 个），因此提供商未删除。解决错误，然后重试。","{{failed}} of {{total}} could not be deleted.":"无法删除 {{failed}} 个（共 {{total}} 个）。","{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and workload identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"无法删除 {{failed}} 个模板和工作负载身份（共 {{total}} 个），因此提供商未删除。解决错误，然后重试。","{{failedCount}} template could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.":"无法创建 {{failedCount}} 个模板。查看以下错误，然后重试。","{{failedCount}} templates could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.":"无法创建 {{failedCount}} 个模板。查看以下错误，然后重试。","{{identityCount}} identities":"{{identityCount}} 个身份","{{identityCount}} identity":"{{identityCount}} 个身份","{{label}} (service mesh)":"{{label}}（服务网格）","{{label}} copied":"{{label}} 已复制","{{label}} failed to copy":"{{label}} 复制失败","{{label}} template":"{{label}} 模板","{{label}} template {{index}}":"{{label}} 模板 {{index}}","{{label}}:":"{{label}}:","{{matchCount}} match":"{{matchCount}} 个匹配项","{{matchCount}} matches":"{{matchCount}} 个匹配项","{{name}} has been successfully created.":"{{name}} 已成功创建。","{{name}} has been successfully created. However, the following operations failed:":"{{name}} 已成功创建。但是，以下操作失败：","{{providerName}} still has these resources:":"{{providerName}} 还有这些资源：","{{removedCount}} tag removed":"已移除 {{removedCount}} 个标签","{{removedCount}} tags removed":"已移除 {{removedCount}} 个标签","{{scope}} · {{domain}}":"{{scope}} · {{domain}}","{{settled}} of {{total}}":"{{settled}}/{{total}}","{{subject}}. Does not match this signer's {{algorithm}} algorithm.":"{{subject}}.与该签名者的 {{algorithm}} 算法不匹配。","{{tagCount}} tag":"{{tagCount}} 个标签","{{tagCount}} tags":"{{tagCount}} 个标签","{{templateCount}} template":"{{templateCount}} 个模板","{{templateCount}} templates":"{{templateCount}} 个模板","{{templateName}} template failed to create. To try again, <link>add templates</link>. Error details: {{reason}}":"{{templateName}} 模板创建失败。如需重试，请<link>添加模板</link>。错误详细信息：{{reason}}","{{workload}} fact":"{{workload}} 事实","{defined by template}":"{defined by template}","<term>Support:</term> Amazon EKS, Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Runtime, and Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Gateway.":"<term>支持：</term>Amazon EKS、Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Runtime 和 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Gateway。","1 EKS cluster":"1 个 EKS 集群","1 provider and 1 trust domain per EKS cluster. Each namespace and service account in this cluster gets its own identity, trusted only within this cluster.":"每个 EKS 集群 1 个提供商和 1 个信任域。此集群中的每个命名空间和服务账户都有自己的身份，仅在此集群内可信。","1 provider and 1 trust domain shared by every EKS cluster in the mesh. A workload with the same namespace and service account in any of these clusters shares one identity.":"网格中的每个 EKS 集群共享 1 个提供商和 1 个信任域。在这些集群中具有相同命名空间和服务账户的工作负载共享一个身份。","1 to 48 hours, in whole hours. Publishing is usually much faster, but can take up to 24 hours.":"1 到 48 小时，以整小时为单位。发布通常快得多，但最长可能需要 24 小时。","1. Select all the check boxes to confirm what deleting {{providerName}} will do.":"1. 选中所有复选框以确认删除 {{providerName}} 将执行的操作。","2. Confirm that you want to delete this provider by typing {{providerName}} below.":"2. 在下方输入 {{providerName}} 以确认您要删除此提供者。","A declared identity has a fixed path you define. Use one when you need an exact path, for example to match a value another system already expects.":"声明的身份具有您定义的固定路径。当您需要精确路径时（例如匹配另一个系统已预期的值），请使用此身份。","A deny, and only for delegated administrators":"拒绝权限，且仅适用于委派管理员","A fact {{workload}} checks when the workload starts.":"工作负载启动时 {{workload}} 会检查的事实。","A fixed label, such as an environment name.":"固定标签，例如环境名称。","A name to identify this identity.":"用于标识此身份的名称。","A provider with this name already exists.":"已存在同名的提供商。","A tag is a label you assign to an AWS resource. Each tag has a key and an optional value. Use tags to search and filter this provider, or to track your AWS costs.":"标签是您分配给 AWS 资源的标记。每个标签由一个键和一个可选值组成。使用标签搜索和筛选此提供商，或跟踪您的 AWS 成本。","A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts a workload must prove before an identity is issued. Decide how this provider issues identities - starting from the <link>default templates</link> for common use cases, or skipping them. You can add and name identities manually at any time - templates are optional and can be added later.":"模板定义了用于唯一命名身份的路径模式，以及工作负载在颁发身份之前必须证明的事实。请决定此提供商如何颁发身份：从适用于常见使用案例的<link>默认模板</link>入手，或跳过此步骤。您可以随时手动添加和命名身份：模板为可选，可在之后添加。","A template with this name already exists.":"同名模板已存在。","A template's path pattern, built from facts like cluster, namespace, and service account, names each workload automatically when it starts. You don't create identities ahead of time.":"模板路径规则基于集群、命名空间、服务账号等信息构建，在工作负载启动时自动命名。无需提前创建身份。","A workload identity provider issues secure, verifiable identities to your workloads, like Kubernetes pods or AI agents. Workloads use them to access AWS and third-party services without long-lived credentials.":"工作负载身份提供商会向您的工作负载（例如 Kubernetes 容器组（pod）或智能体）颁发安全、可验证的身份。工作负载使用这些身份访问 AWS 和第三方服务，而无需长期凭证。","A workload, including an AI agent or sub-agent created on demand, gets its own identity. No workload shares or inherits another's.":"工作负载（包括按需创建的 AI 智能体或子智能体）拥有独立身份。各工作负载不共享、不继承其他工作负载的身份。","Access a partner API, a SaaS endpoint, or an OIDC service. No setup needed.":"访问合作伙伴 API、SaaS 端点或 OIDC 服务。无需进行任何配置。","Access a service mesh, a database, or an on-premises system.":"访问服务网格、数据库或本地系统。","Access denied":"访问被拒绝","Access you granted to these identities will stop working":"您授予这些身份的访问权限将停止生效","Account scoped":"账户范围内",Actions:"操作","Activating it":"正在激活它",Active:"活动","Active certificate authority ID":"活跃证书颁发机构 ID","Active: currently signing":"活跃：当前正在签名",Add:"添加","Add {{label}} template":"添加 {{label}} 模板","Add a fact or condition key. A path of only custom text would give every workload the same name.":"添加事实或条件键。仅包含自定义文本的路径会为每个工作负载指定相同的名称。","Add an {{conditionKey}} condition, so only workloads in these clusters get an identity.":"添加一个 {{conditionKey}} 条件，这样只有这些集群中的工作负载才能获得身份。","Add at least 1 path segment.":"添加至少 1 个路径段。","Add at least 1 template to continue.":"至少添加 1 个模板以继续。","Add at least 2 clusters.":"添加至少 2 个集群。","Add attestation rules":"添加证明规则","Add cluster ARN":"添加集群 ARN","Add condition":"添加条件","Add default templates for Amazon EKS, AgentCore Runtime, and AgentCore Gateway.":"为 Amazon EKS、AgentCore 运行时和 AgentCore Gateway 添加默认模板。","Add new tag":"添加新标签","Add policy":"添加  项策略","Add request-context values like account, Region, or organization.":"添加请求上下文值，例如账户、区域或组织。","Add tags":"添加标签","Add tags to this provider for cost management and access control.":"请向该提供商添加标签，用于成本管理和访问控制。","Add tags to this template for cost management and access control.":"请向该模板添加标签，用于成本管理和访问控制。","Add tags to this workload identity for cost management and access control.":"请向该工作负载标识添加标签，用于成本管理和访问控制。","Add template":"添加模板","Add templates":"添加模板","Add templates after the provider is created, or create and name identities by hand.":"在创建提供商后添加模板，或者手动创建和命名身份。","Add to the path pattern":"添加到路径模式","Added or changed tags were not saved":"添加或更改的标签未保存","Adding permissions to govern who can create templates referring to this provider failed. To try again, <link>add policy</link>. Error details: {{reason}}":"添加用于管理谁可以创建引用此提供商的模板的权限失败。如需重试，请<link>添加策略</link>。错误详细信息：{{reason}}","All outbound signers under this provider will be deleted":"该提供者下的所有出站签名者都将被删除","All properties":"所有属性","All templates and workload identities under this provider will be deleted":"该提供者下的所有模板和工作负载身份都将被删除","Allow member accounts to add their own templates, namespaced by account ID":"允许成员账户添加自己的模板，并按账户 ID 划分命名空间","An identity for agent or workload":"为智能体或工作负载分配身份",and:"与","Any value":"任何值",Apply:"应用",ARN:"ARN","ARN copied":"ARN 已复制","arn:aws:eks:{Region}:{account ID}:cluster/{cluster name}":"arn:aws:eks:{Region}:{account ID}:cluster/{cluster name}","At runtime the platform attests these facts about the workload. Any workload whose attestation carries them issues an identity from this template.":"在运行时，平台会证明有关工作负载的这些事实。任何其证明包含这些事实的工作负载，都会基于此模板签发一个身份。",Attestation:"证明","Attestation policy":"证明策略","Auto generated identity name":"自动生成的身份名称","Automatically generate from a template":"从模板自动生成","Available to every account in your organization ({{organizationId}})":"对您组织中的每个账户可用（{{organizationId}}）","Available to this account ({{accountId}})":"对此账户可用（{{accountId}}）","AWS account ID":"AWS 账户 ID","AWS API calls in CloudTrail resolve to the specific workload that made them. Scope trust policies, resource policies, and SCPs to it, using the IAM policies you already know.":"CloudTrail 中的 AWS API 调用可以定位到发起调用的具体工作负载。可使用熟悉的 IAM 策略，将信任策略、资源策略与服务控制策略（SCP）的适用范围限定到该工作负载。","AWS creates a subordinate CA in every region this provider signs in, and returns an ID for it.":"AWS 在此提供程序登录的每个区域创建一个下级 CA，并返回其 ID。","AWS IAM Workload Identity":"AWS IAM 工作负载身份","AWS IAM Workload Identity (opens in a new tab)":"AWS IAM 工作负载身份（在新标签页打开)","AWS Private CA couldn't set up this certificate authority. Delete it in the AWS Private CA console and try again.":"AWS Private CA 无法设置此证书颁发机构。请在 AWS Private CA 控制台中将其删除，然后重试。","By default, each account's templates require an account ID path prefix to avoid name collisions. You can customize this after creating the provider, under provider settings.":"默认情况下，每个账户的模板都需要账户 ID 路径前缀以避免名称冲突。您可以在创建提供商后，在提供商设置下自定义此设置。","Can't be changed after the provider is created.":"创建提供商后无法更改。","Can't be changed later.":"以后无法更改。",Cancel:"取消","Cannot be changed later.":"以后无法更改。","Cannot start with aws:":"不能以 aws: 开头","Certificate {{name}} (account {{accountId}}): {{reason}}":"证书 {{name}}（账户 {{accountId}}）：{{reason}}","Certificate authority":"证书颁发机构","Certificate authority created":"证书颁发机构已创建。","Certificate authority ID":"证书颁发机构 ID","Certificate authority name":"证书颁发机构名称","Certificate authority updated. The current one keeps signing for about {{hours}} more hour, until the replacement has published everywhere.":"证书颁发机构已更新。当前证书颁发机构将继续签名约 {{hours}} 小时，直到替换证书在所有区域发布完毕。","Certificate authority updated. The current one keeps signing for about {{hours}} more hours, until the replacement has published everywhere.":"证书颁发机构已更新。当前证书颁发机构将继续签名约 {{hours}} 小时，直到替换证书在所有区域发布完毕。","Certificate deleted. Its chain had already left the trust bundle, so nothing that was verifying has changed.":"证书已删除。其证书链已从信任包中移除，因此所有正在进行的验证均未受到影响。","Certificate deleted. Its chain has been pulled from the trust bundle, so certificates issued under it no longer verify.":"证书已删除。其证书链已从信任包中移除，因此基于此证书颁发的证书将不再通过验证。","Certificate signer":"证书签名者","Certificate signer disabled, and the update in progress was stopped with it. Both authorities stay configured, and Enable resumes signing.":"证书签名者已禁用，进行中的更新也随之停止。两个证书颁发机构都保持已配置状态，启用后会恢复签名。","Certificate signer disabled. It stops signing now, its configuration is kept, and Enable resumes signing.":"证书签名者已禁用。它将立即停止签名，其配置会保留，启用后会恢复签名。","Certificate signer enabled. Its certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle again first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hour, after every region has it.":"证书签名者已启用。证书链将首先重新发布到信任包，待每个区域均获取该证书链后，大约 {{hours}} 小时后开始签名。","Certificate signer enabled. Its certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle again first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hours, after every region has it.":"证书签名者已启用。其证书链将首先重新发布到信任包，待每个区域均获取该证书链后，大约 {{hours}} 小时后开始签名。","Certificate signer enabled. Its material was still published, so signing resumed immediately.":"证书签名者已启用。其材料仍处于已发布状态，因此签名立即恢复。","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hour, once every region has it.":"证书签名已启用。证书链首先发布到信任包，然后在每个区域都拥有它后，大约 {{hours}} 小时后开始签名。","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hours, once every region has it.":"证书签名已启用。证书链先发布到信任包，签名将在每个区域都拥有该证书链后大约 {{hours}} 小时开始。","Certificate verifier information":"证书验证程序信息","Certificates ({{total}})":"证书（{{total}}）","Certificates: {{reason}}":"证书：{{reason}}","Change the facts a workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.":"更改工作负载必须通过证明的事实，才能从此模板获得身份。此模板已生成的身份不受影响。","Change the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. A workload already holding a session keeps it until the session expires.":"更改工作负载必须证明其满足的条件，以便以此身份运行。已获得会话的工作负载可继续使用该会话，直至会话过期。","Check again":"重新检查","Checking what is attached to this provider":"检查此提供商的附加内容","Choose a condition key":"选择条件键","Choose a fact":"选择事实","Choose a path and pattern for the names. Start from a default or customize your own.":"为名称选择路径和模式。可从默认设置开始，也可自定义。","Choose a specific name up front so you can grant it access or match an existing naming convention before the workload runs.":"请预先指定一个名称，以便在工作负载运行之前为其授予访问权限，或使其符合现有的命名规范。","Choose a stable, unique name that identifies one environment or group of workloads, for example prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal.":"选择一个稳定且唯一的名称来标识一个环境或一组工作负载，例如 prod.acme.com、staging.acme.com、payments.internal。","Choose a use case above to add a template.":"选择上面的使用案例来添加模板。","Choose from this account":"从此账户中选择","Choose templates to add, and customize or keep their defaults":"选择要添加的模板，然后自定义或保留其默认值","Choose the certificate authority this signer should sign with instead. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. The current authority keeps signing until the replacement has been published long enough for verifiers to pick it up.":"请选择此签名者应改用的证书颁发机构。该证书颁发机构需要是一个<link>证书颁发机构</link>，并且在您进行签名的每个区域均具有从属 CA。当前证书颁发机构会继续签名，直到替换证书已发布足够长时间，使验证者能够获取它。","Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for a workload.":"选择要用作证明事实的条件键。在此模板为工作负载签发身份之前，平台必须对所有这些事实完成证明。","Choose the facts a workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.":"选择工作负载必须通过证明的事实，才能从此模板获得身份。在您完成此操作之前，不会基于此模板生成任何内容。","Choose the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. Nothing can be issued for it until you do.":"选择工作负载必须通过证明满足的条件，以便以此身份运行。在完成此设置之前，无法为该工作负载签发任何内容。","Choose the provider to create the identity in":"选择要在其中创建身份的提供商","Choose which templates to add by use case, and customize each one or keep its defaults.":"按使用案例选择要添加的模板，然后自定义每个模板或保留其默认值。",Clear:"清除","Clear filters":"清除筛选条件",Close:"关闭","Close modal":"关闭强制对话框","Cluster ARN":"集群 ARN","Cluster ARNs":"集群 ARN","Code editor":"代码编辑器","Complete the confirmation to delete.":"完成确认以进行删除。","Condition key":"条件键","Configure identity templates for your workload use cases. Each template defines a path pattern used to issue identities uniquely and the facts a workload must prove before an identity is issued.":"为您的工作负载使用案例配置身份模板。每个模板都定义了用于唯一颁发身份的路径模式以及工作负载在颁发身份之前必须证明的事实。","Configure later":"稍后配置",Configured:"已配置",Confirm:"确认",Contains:"包含","Continue setup":"继续设置","Copy {{label}}":"复制 {{label}}","Copy ARN":"复制 ARN","Copy JSON":"复制 JSON","Could not check everything attached to this provider":"无法检查连接到该提供商的所有内容","Create a provider":"创建提供商","Create a provider for this account":"为此账户创建提供商","Create a provider for your organization":"为您的组织创建提供商","Create a provider to get started":"创建提供商即可开始","Create a template to automate identity generation":"创建模板以自动生成身份","Create declared identity in {{providerName}}":"在{{providerName}}中创建声明的身份","Create identity":"创建身份","Create new":"新建","Create provider":"创建提供商","Create provider and templates":"创建提供商和模板","Create service mesh provider":"创建服务网格提供商","Create templates":"创建模板","Create the certificate authority first.":"请先创建证书颁发机构。","Create workload identities":"创建工作负载身份",Created:tFt,"Created through":"创建方式","Created time":"创建时间","Created values":"已创建的值","Creates a workload identity provider and template for workloads running in one or more EKS clusters under a service mesh, such as Istio.":"为在服务网格（例如 Istio）下的一个或多个 EKS 集群中运行的工作负载创建工作负载身份提供商和模板。","Creating certificate authority":"正在创建证书颁发机构","Creating the certificate authority":"正在创建证书颁发机构","Creating this provider sets up these 2 resources.":"创建此提供商将设置这 2 个资源。","Current CA":"当前 CA","Current provider":"当前提供商","Custom tag key":"自定义标签键","Custom tag value":"自定义标签值","Custom text":"自定义文本","Custom text can't be a single period (.) or two periods (..).":"自定义文本不能是单个句点（.）或两个句点（..）。","Customize templates":"自定义模板","Dark themes":"深色主题","Declared identity: {{name}}":"已声明的身份：{{name}}","Default permissions without a policy":"没有策略的默认权限","Defaults to {provider name}.{account ID}.aws.internal. This must match the trust domain set in your service mesh, or the mesh rejects the identities.":"默认为 {provider name}.{account ID}.aws.internal。这必须与服务网格中设置的信任域相匹配，否则网格会拒绝这些身份。","Define an optional path prefix for identities under this template. Lets you filter by prefix when authoring IAM permissions.":"为此模板下的身份定义可选的路径前缀，以便在编写 IAM 权限时按前缀进行筛选。","Define an optional path prefix for this identity. You can filter by this prefix when authoring IAM permissions.":"为此身份定义一个可选的路径前缀。在编写 IAM 权限时，您可以按此前缀进行筛选。","Define an optional prefix for identities under this template. You can filter by this prefix when authoring IAM permissions. The path prefixes this account can use are set by the provider's policy, for example your account ID, and they are checked when you choose Create. If you're not sure which are permitted, ask your organization administrator.":"为此模板下的身份定义可选前缀。在编写 IAM 权限时，您可以按此前缀进行筛选。此账户可使用的路径前缀由提供者的策略设定，例如您的账户 ID；当您选择”创建“时，系统会检查这些前缀。如果您不确定哪些前缀是允许的，请询问您的组织管理员。","Define an optional prefix for this identity. You can filter by this prefix when authoring IAM permissions. The path prefixes this account can use are set by the provider's policy, for example your account ID, and they are checked when you choose Create. If you're not sure which are permitted, ask your organization administrator.":"为此身份定义可选前缀。在编写 IAM 权限时，您可以按此前缀进行筛选。此账户可使用的路径前缀由提供者的策略设定，例如您的账户 ID；当您选择“创建”时，系统会检查这些前缀。如果您不确定哪些前缀是允许的，请询问您的组织管理员。","Define which workloads are allowed to use this template.":"定义允许哪些工作负载使用此模板。",Delete:"删除","Delete certificate?":"删除证书？","Delete provider":"删除提供商","Delete provider and resources":"删除提供商和资源","Delete provider?":"删除提供者？","Delete template":"删除模板","Delete template?":"删除模板？","Delete the templates under <b>{{providerName}}</b> before deleting the provider. Once deleted, workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials and fail on their next request, and access that you granted to these identities will stop working.":"在删除提供商之前，请先删除 <b>{{providerName}}</b> 下的模板。删除后，使用这些身份的工作负载将停止获得凭证，并在下一次请求时失败，您授予这些身份的访问权限也将停止运行。","Delete workload identity?":"删除工作负载身份？","Deleting <b>{{templateName}}</b> will:":"删除 <b>{{templateName}}</b> 将：","Deleting <b>{{workloadIdentifier}}</b> will:":"删除 <b>{{workloadIdentifier}}</b> 将：","Deleting certificates":"正在删除证书","Deleting provider":"正在删除提供商","Deleting templates and workload identities":"正在删除模板和工作负载身份","Deleting the provider is taking longer than expected":"删除提供商所花费的时间比预期的要长",Description:"描述","Description can't include line breaks or tabs.":"描述不能包含换行符或制表符。","Description must be 1,000 characters or less.":"描述不得超过 1,000 个字符。","Description must be 255 characters or less.":"描述不得超过 255 个字符。",Details:aFt,Disable:"禁用","Disable certificate signer?":"禁用证书签名者？","Discovery expiration time":"发现过期时间",Dismiss:"关闭","Does not contain":"不包含","Does not equal":"不等于","Drag or select to resize":"拖动或选择以调整大小","Each identity is fully the template path, or whatever string you enter when you create the identity.":"每个身份都是完整的模板路径，或者您在创建身份时输入的任何字符串。",Edit:"编辑","Edit attestation policy":"编辑证明策略","Edit filter":"编辑筛选条件","Edit identity format and scope":"编辑身份格式和范围","Edit identity path":"编辑身份路径",Editing:nFt,Enable:"启用","Enable certificate signer":"启用证书签名者","Enable certificate signer?":"启用证书签名者？","End signing time":"签名结束时间","Enter a 12-digit AWS account ID.":"输入 12 位数的 AWS 账户 ID。","Enter a certificate authority ID.":"输入证书颁发机构 ID。","Enter a cluster ARN.":"输入集群 ARN。","Enter a name":"输入名称","Enter a name for the certificate authority.":"输入证书颁发机构的名称。","Enter a name.":"输入名称。","Enter a path":"请输入一个路径","Enter a path prefix value":"输入路径前缀值","Enter a trust domain.":"输入信任域。","Enter a value":"输入值","Enter a whole number of hours from 1 to 48.":"输入 1 到 48 之间的整数小时数。","Enter key":"输入键","Enter prefix":"输入前缀","Enter the ID of a certificate authority or choose from below":"输入证书颁发机构的 ID，或从下方选择。","Enter the policy as valid JSON.":"以有效的 JSON 输入策略。","Enter value":"输入值",equals:"等于",Equals:"等于",Error:"错误","Error fetching the details":"获取详细信息时出错",Errors:"错误","Every account in this organization ({{organizationId}})":"此组织中的每个账户（{{organizationId}}）","Every X.509-SVID this provider issues right now is signed by this certificate. It stops in {{hours}} hour, at {{at}}, when the incoming certificate takes over.":"此提供程序当前颁发的每个 X.509-SVID 都由此证书签名。此证书将在 {{hours}} 小时后（即 {{at}}）停止签名，届时将由传入证书接管。","Every X.509-SVID this provider issues right now is signed by this certificate. It stops in {{hours}} hours, at {{at}}, when the incoming certificate takes over.":"该提供程序当前颁发的每个 X.509-SVID 均由此证书签名。该证书将在 {{hours}} 小时后（即 {{at}}）停止签名，届时传入证书将接管。","Every X.509-SVID this provider issues right now is signed by this certificate. No replacement is scheduled, so it keeps signing until you update or disable the signer.":"此提供程序当前颁发的每个 X.509-SVID 都由该证书签名。没有安排替换，因此它会持续签名，直到您更新或禁用签名者。","Failed to copy":"未能复制","Failed to copy JSON":"无法复制 JSON","Failed to load attestation policy.":"无法加载证明策略。","Failed to load templates.":"无法加载模板。","Failed to remove attestation policy.":"移除证明策略失败。","Filter providers":"筛选提供程序","Filter templates":"筛选模板","Filter themes":"筛选主题","Find providers":"查找提供程序","Find templates":"查找模板","Find theme":"查找主题","For example, prod":"例如，prod","For mutual TLS, attach a certificate authority":"对于双向 TLS，请关联一个证书颁发机构 (CA)。","For token-based services, issue a JWT":"对于基于令牌的服务，请签发 JWT。",Format:"格式","Generating its key":"正在生成其密钥","Get started":"开始使用","Getting started":"入门","Give an agent or workload its own identity - <em>Preview</em>":"为智能体或工作负载配置独立身份——<em>预览</em>","Give each workload a unique identity, so you can grant it access and audit what it did rather than sharing one role.":"为每个工作负载赋予唯一身份，以便您可以授予其访问权限并审计其操作，而不是共用同一个角色。","Give your workloads an identity":"为您的工作负载赋予身份","Go to the providers list":"转到提供商列表","Govern who can create resources":"管理资源创建权限","Govern who can create templates referring to this provider":"管理谁可以创建引用该提供商的模板","Greater than":"大于","Greater than or equal":"大于或等于","hour(s)":"小时","How it works":"工作原理","IAM roles define what a workload can do. Workload Identity tells you which workload is doing it.":"IAM 角色定义工作负载能够执行哪些操作；而工作负载身份用于识别是哪个工作负载在执行操作。","Identities are issued at runtime from facts the workload proves, not just from what an admin assigns.":"身份在运行时根据工作负载提供的校验信息颁发，而非仅由管理员预先分配。",'Identity "{{identityId}}" not found.':"未找到身份“{{identityId}}”。","Identity format and scope":"身份格式和范围","Identity name":"身份名称","Identity path":"身份路径","Identity selection":"身份选择","If anything is still attached, deleting the provider fails.":"如果仍然附加了任何内容，则删除提供商失败。","In transition":"正在转换中","In transition certificate authority ID":"过渡中证书颁发机构 ID","In transition: incoming, not yet signing":"过渡中：传入，尚未签名",Inactive:"非活动","Inactive: retired, no longer trusted":"非活跃：已停用，不再受信任","Incoming CA":"传入 CA",Info:"信息","Invalid key. Keys can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"键无效。键只能包含 Unicode 字母、数字、空格和以下任何内容：_.:/=+@-","Invalid provider name. Use alphanumeric and '-_.' characters.":"提供商名称无效。请使用字母数字和“-_.”字符。","Invalid request":"无效请求","Invalid template name. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters.":"模板名称无效。请使用字母数字和 '-_' 字符。","Invalid value. Values can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"值无效。值只能包含 Unicode 字母、数字、空格和以下任何内容：_.:/=+@-","Issued after the workload proves itself":"在工作负载完成自证后颁发身份","Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. Standard pricing applies to the creation and use of AWS Private CA.":"该签名者颁发 X.509-SVID，供该提供程序的工作负载作为客户端证书提供给 AWS 以外的系统。它需要在您进行签名的每个区域都配备一个包含从属 CA 的<link>证书颁发机构</link>。AWS Private CA 的创建和使用适用标准定价。","Issues X.509-SVIDs, for mTLS peers that verify a client certificate.":"颁发 X.509-SVID，供验证客户端证书的 mTLS 对等方使用。","Issuing its CA certificate":"正在签发其 CA 证书","It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. Leave it alone and it becomes inactive on its own, after which deleting it changes nothing.":"它已停止签名，但其链仍在发布，因此工作负载依赖它来验证先前颁发的凭证。现在删除它会立即拉取该链，那些凭证将开始失败。不理会它，它会自行变为不活跃，之后删除它不会产生任何变化。","Item moved from position {{initialPosition}} to position {{finalPosition}} of {{total}}":"项目已从第 {{initialPosition}} 个位置移动到第 {{finalPosition}} 个位置（共 {{total}} 个位置）。","JSON copied":"已复制 JSON",JWKS:iFt,"JWKS popover":"每个有效的签名密钥都由 kid 选择。AWS 会在签名切换到新密钥之前在此处发布新密钥。","JWT Outbound signers column Signing algorithm":"签名算法","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key":"密钥算法","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key issue time":"当前密钥自何时起用于签名","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key popover":"AWS 生成密钥并按自己的计划轮换它们，在开始签名之前将每个新密钥发布到 JWKS。算法在轮换期间保持不变，因此读取 JWKS 的验证者无需在您这边做任何更改。","JWT Outbound signers desc":"为需要验证签名令牌的系统对 JWT-SVID 进行签名。","JWT Outbound signers label oidc discovery":"OIDC 发现","JWT Outbound signers label oidc discovery popover":"标准发现文档。大多数验证者只需要此 URL 即可，因为他们可从中找到密钥。","JWT Outbound signers label oidc issuer":"OIDC 颁发者","JWT Outbound signers label oidc issuer popover":"此处签名的每个 JWT-SVID 的 iss 声明。固定颁发者的验证者会固定此值。","JWT Outbound signers section title":"令牌验证信息","JWT Outbound signers status":"由 AWS 提供的默认值","JWT Outbound signers title":"JWT 签名者",Key:"键","Learn about organization providers":"了解组织提供商","Learn about organization providers (opens in a new tab)":"了解组织提供商（在新标签页中打开）","Learn more":"了解更多","Learn more about deleting a provider (opens in a new tab)":"了解有关删除提供者的更多信息（在新选项卡中打开）","Learn more:":"了解更多:","Less than":"小于","Less than or equal":"小于或等于","Let other accounts or principals in your organization create templates and identities under this provider, within the path prefixes you choose.":"让组织中的其他账户或主体可以在此提供商下创建模板和身份，并将其限制在您指定的路径前缀范围内。","Let workloads reach non-AWS resources":"使工作负载能够访问非 AWS 资源","Letters, digits, . - _ with a single / between parts. No / at the start or end.":"字母、数字、. - _，各部分之间用单个 / 分隔。开头或结尾不能为 /。","Letters, digits, . - _ with a single / between parts. No / at the start or end. Cannot be changed later.":"字母、数字、. - _，各部分之间用单个 / 分隔。开头或结尾不能为 /。此后无法更改。","Light themes":"浅色主题","Ln {{row}}, Col {{column}}":"行 {{row}}，列 {{column}}","Loading certificate authorities":"正在加载证书颁发机构","Loading code editor":"正在加载代码编辑器","Loading tag keys":"正在加载标签键","Loading tag values":"正在加载标签值","Loading tags that are associated with this resource":"正在加载与此资源关联的标签","Loading your organization's providers":"正在加载您所在组织的提供商","Make sure the new certificate authority uses the same algorithm as the current signer, {{algorithm}}. If you choose a different algorithm, you need to disable this signer, delete its certificates, then enable it again with the new authority.":"请确保新的证书颁发机构与当前签名者使用相同的算法（{{algorithm}}）。如果选择其他算法，则需要先禁用该签名者并删除其证书，然后使用新的证书颁发机构重新启用该签名者。","Manage CAs and replication in the AWS Private CA console":"在 AWS Private CA 控制台中管理 CA 和复制","Manage tags":"管理标签","Manage the provider":"管理提供商","Manual creation":"手动创建","Manually create":"手动创建","Matching workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.":"匹配的工作负载自启动时起即可获得各自的身份名称，且不受规模限制。","Maximum 1,000 characters.":"最多 1,000 个字符。","Maximum 255 characters.":"最多 255 个字符。","Member accounts":"成员账户","Member accounts can add their own templates, namespaced by account ID.":"成员账户可以添加自己的模板，并按账户 ID 划分命名空间。","Member accounts cannot add their own templates.":"成员账户无法添加自己的模板。","Minimum signing delay":"最小签名延迟","Moving item to position {{currentPosition}} of {{total}}":"正在将项目移至第 {{currentPosition}}/{{total}} 个位置","Multiple EKS clusters":"多个 EKS 集群",Name:"名称","Name must be 128 characters or less.":"名称不能超过 128 个字符。","Name this identity":"命名此身份","Name this provider":"命名此提供商","Name values":"名称值","Names identities automatically as workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.":"在工作负载启动时自动为其命名身份，无需逐一创建或管理这些身份。","Naming scheme":"命名方案",New:"新","Next month":"下个月","Next page":"下一页","Next step":"下一步","No attestation policy set. Define one so a workload can run as this identity.":"尚未设置证明策略。请定义证明策略，以允许工作负载以此身份运行。","No attestation policy. No workload will be issued workload identities from this template until you add one.":"无证明策略。在您添加证明策略之前，任何工作负载都不会从此模板获取工作负载身份。","No by default, but can add a policy":"默认情况下为否，但可以添加策略","No certificate authorities in this account":"此账户中没有证书颁发机构","no domain":"无域名","No long-lived secrets":"无长期密钥","No match found":"未找到匹配项","No matches":"没有匹配项","No path segments. Add a fact, condition key, or custom text.":"没有路径段。添加事实、条件键或自定义文本。","No tags associated with the resource.":"没有与资源关联的标签。","No templates added yet":"尚未添加任何模板","No workload identity providers":"无工作负载身份提供程序","No workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.":"没有与此模板匹配的工作负载，因此不会生成任何身份。","No, and cannot be granted":"否，且无法授予",None:"无","None – names are defined by templates or declared individually":"无 — 名称由模板定义或单独声明","Not saved: {{keys}}.":"未保存：{{keys}}。","Not set":"未设置",Notifications:"通知","Once the attestation policy is removed, matching workloads will not be issued workload identities until you add a policy again.":"移除证明策略后，匹配的工作负载将无法获取工作负载身份，除非您再次添加策略。","One bundle per provider, and one URL. It carries every authority the provider publishes: both outbound signers, and during an update both the current and incoming certificate authority, which is what lets verifiers accept either one through the handover. Your own AWS workloads get these keys automatically; send this to systems outside AWS.":"每个提供程序一个捆绑包，一个 URL。它包含该提供程序发布的所有证书颁发机构：两个出站签名者，以及在更新期间同时包含当前证书颁发机构和传入证书颁发机构，这正是让验证者在交接过程中接受任一证书的原因。您自己的 AWS 工作负载将自动获取这些密钥；请将此 URL 发送给 AWS 以外的系统。","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level providers.":"只有管理账户或委派管理员可以删除组织级提供者。","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level templates.":"只有管理账户或委派管理员可以删除组织级模板。","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level workload identities.":"只有管理账户或委派管理员可以删除组织级工作负载身份。","Opens in a new tab":"在新选项卡中打开",Operator:"运算符",Operators:"运算符",optional:"可选",or:"或","Organization provider":"组织提供商","Organization scoped":"组织范围内","Organize the provider and track its cost with tags.":"通过添加标签对提供商进行分类，并跟踪相关成本。","Other accounts in your organization":"组织中的其他账户","Other condition keys":"其他条件键","Outbound signer":"出站签名者","Outbound signers page desc":"让您的工作负载向 AWS 以外的服务证明自身身份。此提供程序会为其呈现的令牌和证书签名。","Outbound signers page title":"出站签名者","Owning account":"拥有账户","Page {{pageNumber}} of all pages":"所有页面中的第 {{pageNumber}} 页",path:"路径",Path:"路径","path from templates":"从模板获取路径","Path is the per-workload part of an identity name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts a workload proves.":"路径是身份名称中每个工作负载特有的部分。它在运行时根据工作负载证明的事实填写。","Path must be 255 characters or less.":"路径必须为 255 个字符或更少","Path pattern":"路径模式","Path prefix":"路径前缀","Path prefix must be 64 characters or less.":"路径前缀不得超过 64 个字符。","Path values":"路径值","Picked up item at position {{position}} of {{total}}":"在位置 {{position}}（共 {{total}} 个）上拾起项目","Policy details":"策略详细信息","Policy: Define how a workload attests to get the identity":"策略：定义工作负载如何通过证明来获得身份",Preferences:"首选项","Press space or enter to activate drag, use arrow keys to move, then press space or enter to confirm":"按空格键或 Enter 键激活拖动，使用箭头键移动，然后再次按空格键或 Enter 键确认",Preview:"预览","Previous CA":"上一个 CA","Previous certificates ({{certificateCount}})":"之前的证书（{{certificateCount}}）","Previous month":"上个月","Previous page":"上一页",Properties:"属性",Property:"属性",Provided:"已提供",Provider:"提供商","Provider {{providerName}} deleted.":"提供商 {{providerName}} 已删除。","Provider name":"提供商名称","Provider name must be 128 characters or less.":"提供商名称不能超过 128 个字符。","Provider not deleted":"提供商未删除。","Provider not found":"未找到提供商","Provider overview":"提供商概述","Provider selection":"提供程序选择","Provider settings":"提供商设置","Provider values":"提供程序值",Providers:"提供商","Providers to issue workload identities":"用于颁发工作负载身份的提供商","Quick create":"快速创建","Quick create makes an RSA 2048 certificate authority in AWS Private CA in your account, which has its own charges. The algorithm is fixed and cannot be changed later without setting the signer up again.":"快速创建将在您的账户中的 AWS Private CA 内创建一个 RSA 2048 证书颁发机构，该操作将产生相应费用。该算法固定不变，如需更改，必须重新设置签名者。",Ready:rFt,Recommended:"已建议","Recommended for most workloads":"推荐用于大多数工作负载",Refresh:"刷新","Refresh certificate authorities":"刷新证书颁发机构","Refresh certificate signer status":"刷新证书签名者状态",Remove:"移除","Remove {{name}}":"移除 {{name}}","Remove attestation policy":"移除证明策略","Remove cluster ARN":"移除集群 ARN","Remove condition":"移除条件","Remove filter {{filter}}":"移除筛选条件 {{filter}}","Remove governance policy?":"移除治理策略？","Remove tag {{key}}":"移除标签 {{key}}","Removed tags were not saved":"已移除的标签未保存","Reorder {{name}}":"重新排序 {{name}}","Reordering canceled":"重新排序已取消","Required for service mesh providers.":"服务网格提供商所需。","Required for service mesh providers. A service mesh provider is scoped to the account that runs the EKS cluster.":"服务网格提供商所需。服务网格提供商的范围限定为运行 EKS 集群的账户。","Reset to default":"重置为默认值","Resize handle":"调整手柄大小","Resolved example:":"已解决的示例：","Restricted by":"受限于",Retry:"重试","Review the tags and save again.":"请检查标签后重新保存。","Running a service mesh, such as Istio? It needs its own provider, one per cluster.":"是否运行服务网格（如 Istio）？它需要自己的提供商，每个集群一个。",Save:"保存","Save changes":"保存更改","Save or cancel your edits before creating templates.":"在创建模板之前保存或取消您的编辑。","Save or cancel your edits before creating the provider.":"在创建提供商之前，请保存或取消您的编辑。","Save or cancel your template edits to change the scope.":"保存或取消您的模板编辑以更改范围。",scheme:"方案",Scheme:"方案","scheme and trust domain":"方案和信任域","Scheme sets the format this provider uses to name identities.":"方案设置了此提供商用于命名身份的格式。",Scope:"范围","Scope sets which accounts are allowed to use this provider.":"范围设置允许哪些账户使用此提供商。","Scope values":"范围值","Search tags":"搜索标签","Segment that partitions identities.":"对身份进行分区的段。","Select {{name}}":"选择 {{name}}","Select a row to delete.":"选择要删除的行。",Set:"设置","Set a naming pattern":"设置命名模式","Set an attestation rule":"设置证明规则","Set by your provider.":"由您的提供商设置。","Set the naming format and usage scope that every workload identity from this provider inherits.":"设置此提供商颁发的每个工作负载身份所继承的命名格式和使用范围。","Set the unique path pattern that every workload identity generated by this template follows. Cannot be changed later.":"设置此模板生成的每个工作负载标识都遵循的唯一路径模式。以后无法更改。","Set up a provider to hold the templates that generate identity names, the identities you declare directly, and the signers that sign credentials for systems outside AWS.":"设置提供商，以保存用于生成身份名称的模板、您直接声明的身份，以及为 AWS 外部系统签署凭证的签名者。","Set up a service mesh provider for this account":"为此账户设置服务网格提供商","Set up a way to issue workload identities":"设置工作负载身份的签发方式","Set up for your use cases":"根据您的使用案例进行配置","Sets your trust domain, the start of every identity name.":"设置信任域，作为所有身份名称的前缀。","Setting up the certificate authority stopped. You can continue from where it left off.":"证书颁发机构的设置已停止。您可以从上次中断的位置继续。","Settings from your provider {{providerName}}":"来自您的提供商 {{providerName}} 的设置","Short-lived credentials renew automatically and follow the SPIFFE standard, so they work with service meshes like Istio and with SaaS applications.":"临时凭证自动续期，遵循 SPIFFE 标准，可与 Istio 等服务网格以及 SaaS 应用配合使用。","Show all {{errorCount}} errors":"显示所有 {{errorCount}} 个错误","Show fewer":"显示更少","Show more":"显示更多","Signing algorithm":"签名算法","Signing resumes immediately, because this certificate is still published in the trust bundle.":"签名立即恢复，因为该证书仍发布在信任包中。","Signing start time":"签名开始时间","Some templates could not be loaded":"某些模板无法加载","Something went wrong":"出错了","Sortable path segment":"可排序的路径段",Status:"状态","Status bar":"状态栏","Stop access you granted to this identity name from working":"让您授予此身份名称的访问权限停止生效","Stop access you granted to those identity names from working":"让您授予这些身份名称的访问权限停止生效","Stop matching workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request":"停止匹配的工作负载获得身份，使其在下次请求时失败","Stop the identities it generated from resolving":"停止解析它生成的身份","Stop the workload running as this identity, so it fails on its next request":"停止以该身份运行的工作负载，使其在下次请求时失败","Stopped signing and no longer in the trust bundle, so nothing verifies against them. Deleting one is safe.":"已停止签名，并且不再在信任包中，因此不会针对它们进行任何验证。删除其中一个是安全的。",Subject:"主题",Success:"成功","Tag keys could not be retrieved":"无法检索标签键","Tag values could not be retrieved":"无法检索标签值",Tags:"标签","Tags could not be loaded":"无法加载标签","Tags for {{name}} have been updated.":"{{name}} 的标签已更新。","Tags not saved":"标签未保存",Template:"模板",'Template "{{templateId}}" not found.':"未找到模板“{{templateId}}”。","Template {{name}}: {{reason}}":"模板 {{name}}：{{reason}}","Template {{templateName}} deleted.":"模板 {{templateName}} 已删除。","Template {{templateNames}} created.":"已创建模板“{{templateNames}}”。","Template name":"模板名称","Template name must be 128 characters or less.":"模板名称必须不超过 128 个字符。","Template name values":"模板名称值","Template: {{name}}":"模板：{{name}}",Templates:"模板","Templates ({{total}})":"模板（{{total}}）","Templates are being created. Wait for the request to finish.":"正在创建模板。等待请求完成。","Templates give matching workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.":"模板会自动为匹配的工作负载分配各自的身份名称。每个模板均使用该提供商的名称前缀以及路径和模式。","Templates that member accounts created under this provider are not visible here and cannot be deleted from this account. If any exist, deleting the provider fails.":"成员账户在此提供商下创建的模板在此处不可见，也无法从该账户中删除。如果存在，则删除提供商失败。","Templates: {{reason}}":"模板：{{reason}}","The account that owns the certificate authority.":"拥有该证书颁发机构的账户。","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it.":"该证明策略控制了该提供商如何颁发身份。工作负载必须满足所有条件，例如其类型、详细信息以及运行位置，这些条件均由托管该工作负载的服务所担保。","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.":"该证明策略控制了该提供商如何颁发身份。工作负载必须满足所有条件，例如其类型、详细信息以及运行位置，这些条件均由托管该工作负载的服务所担保。该策略稍后可进行编辑。","The attestation policy controls which workloads get an identity from this provider. A workload must meet every condition, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. It's generated from the EKS clusters you entered. You can edit it later.":"证明策略控制哪些工作负载从该提供商获得身份。正如托管工作负载的服务所保证的那样，工作负载必须满足所有条件。它是根据您输入的 EKS 集群生成的。您可以稍后对其进行编辑。","The attestation policy lists the facts a workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so a workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.":"证明策略列出了工作负载在此提供商为其颁发身份之前必须证明的事实。计算平台为这些事实提供担保，因此工作负载无法声明不属于自己的身份。","The attester vouches for the workload, and it must match every condition to run as this identity.":"证明者负责验证工作负载的真实性，工作负载必须满足所有条件，才能以此身份运行。","The certificate authority is still being set up.":"证书颁发机构仍在设置中。","The ID at the end of the certificate authority's ARN in AWS Private CA.":"AWS Private CA 中证书颁发机构 ARN 末尾的 ID。","The identity name is the provider's naming scheme, a path prefix, and a path pattern.":"身份名称由提供商的命名方案、路径前缀和路径模式组成。","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag key is 128.":"标签键中最多可以使用 128 个字符。","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag value is 256.":"标签值中最多可以使用 256 个字符。","The path can be up to {{maxLength}} characters.":"路径最多可包含 {{maxLength}} 个字符。","The path doesn't support these segments: {{segments}}. Remove them, and add what you need from the following cards.":"该路径不支持以下段：{{segments}}。移除它们，然后从以下卡片中添加您需要的段。","The path is already the default.":"该路径已经是默认路径。","The path is the per-workload part of each identity's name. Keep the Region in front so names stay unique across accounts and Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.":"路径是每个身份名称中针对工作负载的部分。将区域置于前面，使名称在各账户和区域间保持唯一性；也可以重新排列各区段，以符合团队的命名规范。","The path prefixes your policy allows":"您的策略允许的路径前缀","The permissions defined in this policy for <b>{{providerName}}</b> stop applying.":"此策略中为 <b>{{providerName}}</b> 定义的权限将停止应用。","The provider could not be deleted. Try again.":"无法删除提供商。请重试。","The provider is being created. Wait for the request to finish.":"正在创建提供商。请等待请求完成。","The provider might still be deleted. Check the providers list later.":"该提供商可能仍会被删除。稍后查看提供商列表。","The resource policy on this provider controls who can associate templates with it.":"此提供商上的资源策略控制着谁可以将模板与其关联。","The soonest the new certificate can take over. It publishes to the trust bundle first, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. Signing may start later than this, never sooner.":"新证书可以开始签名的最早时间。它会先发布到信任包，以便每个验证程序都能在其下签署任何内容之前进行检查。签名可能晚于该时间开始，绝不会早于该时间。","The soonest this certificate can start signing. It publishes to the trust bundle first, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. Signing may start later than this, never sooner.":"此证书可以开始签名的最早时间。它会先发布到信任包，以便每个验证程序都能在其下签署任何内容之前进行检查。签名可能晚于该时间开始，绝不会早于该时间。",Theme:"主题","There was an error loading the code editor.":"加载代码编辑器时出错。","These clusters set the template's <policyLink>attestation policy</policyLink>.":"这些集群设置了模板的<policyLink>证明策略</policyLink>。","These resources need to be deleted before deleting the provider.":"在删除提供商之前，需要删除这些资源。","This account ({{accountId}})":"该账户 ({{accountId}})","This action deletes the workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.":"此操作会删除工作负载身份提供商 <b>{{providerName}}</b>。","This cannot be undone, and creating a provider with the same name later does not restore anything. To proceed, complete the steps below.":"此操作无法撤销，之后创建同名提供者也不会恢复任何内容。要继续，请完成以下步骤。","This cannot be undone, and the path this template reserved stays reserved. No future template can generate identities under it.":"此操作无法撤销，此模板预留的路径将保持预留状态。未来的任何模板都无法在其下生成身份。","This cannot be undone, and this name stays reserved. It is never issued again, so you cannot recreate this identity under the same name.":"此操作无法撤销，此名称将保持预留状态。它永远不会再被颁发，因此您无法以相同名称重新创建此身份。","This certificate authority uses {{caAlgorithm}}. Rotation keeps the signer's {{signerAlgorithm}} algorithm, so choose a {{signerAlgorithm}} certificate authority instead.":"该证书颁发机构使用 {{caAlgorithm}}。轮换将保留签名者的 {{signerAlgorithm}} 算法，因此请改为选择 {{signerAlgorithm}} 证书颁发机构。","This certificate has left the trust bundle, so it publishes again first. Signing starts after about {{hours}} hour, once every region has it.":"此证书已从信任包中移除，因此会优先重新发布。签名将在约 {{hours}} 小时后开始，届时每个区域都已获得该证书。","This certificate has left the trust bundle, so it publishes again first. Signing starts after about {{hours}} hours, once every region has it.":"此证书已从信任包中移除，因此会优先重新发布。签名将在约 {{hours}} 小时后开始，届时每个区域都已获得该证书。","This certificate is validating, so deleting it stops verification immediately":"此证书正在验证，因此删除它会立即停止验证","This certificate stopped signing and its chain has left the trust bundle, so nothing verifies against it. It stays listed as history until you delete it, and deleting it is safe: no credential depends on it, and the certificate signer keeps signing.":"该证书已停止签名，其证书链已从信任包中移除，因此没有任何内容可针对该证书进行验证。在您将其删除之前，它将一直作为历史记录保留。删除操作是安全的：没有任何凭证依赖于它，且证书签名者将继续签名。","This cluster is already listed.":"此集群已列出。","This condition key and operator combination already exists":"此条件键和运算符组合已存在。","This doesn't look like a valid EKS cluster ARN. An invalid ARN will leave workloads in that cluster without an identity.":"这看起来不像有效的 EKS 集群 ARN。无效的 ARN 将使该集群中的工作负载没有身份。","This management account and delegated administrators":"此管理账户和委派管理员","This organization ({{organizationId}})":"该组织 ({{organizationId}})","This policy's cluster ARNs don't match the clusters you entered. Changing the clusters won't update this policy. Continue only if that's intended.":"此策略的集群 ARN 与您输入的集群不匹配。更改集群不会更新此策略。只有在这是您有意为之的情况下才继续。","This provider has no naming scheme, so the path you enter is the full identity name.":"该提供商没有命名方案，因此您输入的路径即为完整的身份名称。","This provider names every identity using the open standard.":"此提供商使用开放标准为每个身份命名。","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. Both certificates below stop, including the one still in transition, so the update does not complete. Both stay configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"此提供程序会立即停止颁发 X.509-SVID，需要客户端证书的工作负载将在下一次请求时开始失败。下方两个证书都会停止，包括仍处于过渡中的那个，因此更新不会完成。两者都保持已配置状态。已颁发的证书在约 12 小时内仍可验证，启用后会恢复签名。","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"该提供程序会立即停止颁发 X.509-SVID，需要客户端证书的工作负载将在下一次请求时开始失败。下面的证书保持配置状态。已颁发的证书会继续验证约 12 小时，启用后可恢复签名。","This provider's policy doesn't allow this path prefix \"{{pathPrefix}}\" for your account. Ask your organization administrator which path prefixes are permitted.":"该提供者的策略不允许为您的账户使用此路径前缀“{{pathPrefix}}”。请询问您的组织管理员哪些路径前缀是允许使用的。","This removes the certificate from the provider and pulls its chain from the trust bundle immediately. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"这会从提供者中移除证书，并立即将其链从信任捆绑包中拉取出来。证书颁发机构本身保留在 AWS 私有 CA 中，保持不变。","This removes the certificate from the provider. Its chain already left the trust bundle, so nothing that is verifying today changes. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"这会从提供者中移除证书。其链已离开信任捆绑包，因此当前正在验证的任何内容都不会改变。证书颁发机构本身保留在 AWS 私有 CA 中，保持不变。","This tag will be removed upon saving changes":"保存更改后，此标签将移除","This usually takes a few minutes. Keep this page open until it finishes.":"这通常需要几分钟。请保持此页面打开，直至完成。",Today:"今天","Too many requests":"请求太多","Trace and control access per workload":"按工作负载追踪并管控访问权限","Trust bundle":"信任包","trust domain":"信任域","Trust domain":"信任域","Trust domain is the root of trust for the SPIFFE naming scheme. It is a logical name that follows DNS naming style, for example prod.acme.com, but does not need to match a real DNS record.":"信任域是 SPIFFE 命名方案的信任根。它是一个遵循 DNS 命名风格的逻辑名称，例如 prod.acme.com，但无需与真实的 DNS 记录匹配。","Try again. If the problem continues, contact AWS Support.":"请重试。如果问题仍然存在，请联系 AWS Support。","Unable to load templates":"无法加载模板",Undo:"撤销","Up to 128 characters. Must be unique per provider.":"最多 128 个字符。在每个提供商中必须是唯一的。","Up to 128 characters. Use alphanumeric and '-_.' characters. Must be unique in your organization. Can't be changed after the provider is created.":"最多 128 个字符。使用字母数字和“-_.”字符。必须在您的组织中唯一。创建提供商后无法更改。","Up to 128 characters. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters. Must be unique per provider.":"最多 128 个字符。使用字母数字和 '-_' 字符。每个提供商必须唯一。",Update:"更新","Update certificate signer":"更新证书签名者",'Use "{{key}}"':"使用“{{key}}”",'Use "{{value}}"':"使用“{{value}}”","Use case":"使用案例","Use cases":"使用案例","Use default templates":"使用默认模板","Use letters, digits, and . - _ characters, with a single / between parts. No / at the start or end, and a part can't be . or ..":"使用字母、数字和 . - _ 字符，各部分之间使用一个 /。开头和结尾不能为 /，且各部分不能为 . 或 ..","Use one from another account":"使用另一个账户中的一个","Use only Latin letters, numbers, spaces, tabs, line breaks, and standard keyboard symbols.":"仅使用拉丁字母、数字、空格、制表符、换行符和标准键盘符号。","Use only letters, digits, - and _ characters.":"仅使用字母、数字、- 和 _ 字符。","Use only letters, digits, . - and _ characters. The path can't be . or ..":"仅使用字母、数字、. -和_字符。路径不能为.或..","Use only letters, digits, periods (.), hyphens (-), and underscores (_).":"仅使用字母、数字、句点（.）、连字符（-）和下划线（_）。","Use the workload identity in trust policies, resource policies, or SCPs. Each call is recorded in CloudTrail with the workload's identity.":"可在信任策略、资源策略或服务控制策略（SCP）中使用工作负载身份。所有调用都会在 CloudTrail 中记录对应的工作负载身份。",'Use: "{{text}}"':"使用：“{{text}}”","Used as the common name in the certificate authority's subject.":"用作证书颁发机构主题中的公用名。",Validating:oFt,"Validating: stopped signing, still trusted":"正在验证：已停止签名，仍然可信",Value:"值","Value must be 256 characters or less.":"值必须为 256 个字符或更少。",Values:"值","View all":"查看全部","View all notifications":"查看所有通知","View JSON":"查看 JSON",Visual:"可视化",Warning:"警告",Warnings:"警告","What gets created":"创建了什么","Which EKS clusters is this provider for?":"该提供商适用于哪些 EKS 集群？",'Wildcard "*" is only allowed with the StringLike, StringNotLike, ArnLike, or ArnNotLike operators.':"通配符“*”只能与 StringLike、StringNotLike、ArnLike 或 ArnNotLike 运算符配合使用。","Without a policy, no other account can create templates under this provider, though delegated administrators can already create both. Add a statement for each account, organizational unit, or IAM principal that should be able to, and limit each one to a path prefix.":"如果没有策略，其他账户无法在此提供者下创建模板，尽管委派管理员仍然可以创建两者。为每个应能够执行的账户、组织单位或 IAM 主体添加语句，并将每个限制为路径前缀。","Workload identities ({{total}})":"工作负载身份（{{total}}）","Workload identities in the IAM User Guide":"《IAM 用户指南》中的工作负载身份章节","Workload identities in the IAM User Guide (opens in a new tab)":"《IAM 用户指南》中的工作负载身份章节（在新标签页打开）","Workload identities: {{reason}}":"工作负载身份：{{reason}}","Workload identity":"工作负载身份","Workload Identity":"工作负载身份","Workload identity {{name}}: {{reason}}":"工作负载身份 {{name}}：{{reason}}","Workload identity {{workloadIdentifier}} deleted.":"工作负载身份 {{workloadIdentifier}} 已删除。","Workloads get named automatically":"工作负载会自动命名","Workloads in these EKS clusters can get an identity from this provider, when all of these are true:":"当所有这些都为真时，这些 EKS 集群中的工作负载可以从此提供商处获得一个身份：","Workloads running in these clusters can get an identity from this provider. Add 2 or more.":"在这些集群中运行的工作负载可以从该提供商处获得身份。添加 2 个或更多。","Workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"在此账户中运行的工作负载可以使用此模板基于 {{workloadLabel}} 验证的信息生成的身份。","Workloads running in this cluster can get an identity from this provider.":"在此集群中运行的工作负载可以从该提供商处获得身份。","Workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"在您的组织中运行的工作负载可以使用此模板基于 {{workloadLabel}} 验证的信息生成的身份。","Workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request":"使用这些身份的工作负载将不在获得凭证，并在下次请求时失败","Workloads, such as agents, pods, and jobs, are verified at runtime and get a workload identity, one per workload, generated by a template. The identity gets fine-grained access to AWS resources through IAM policies and CloudTrail, and signed JWT and X.509 credentials for meshes and SaaS apps.":"智能体、Pod、任务等工作负载在运行时完成校验后，将获得由模板生成的专属工作负载身份。该身份通过 IAM 策略和 CloudTrail 实现对 AWS 资源的细粒度访问，并获得适用于服务网格与 SaaS 应用的签名 JWT 和 X.509 凭证。","Wrap lines":"换行","Write a policy to let another account create templates, or to stop a delegated administrator from part of the name space. Each statement names an organizational unit, specific accounts, or individual IAM principals, allows or denies, and can be limited to a path prefix.":"编写策略，以允许其他账户创建模板，或阻止委派管理员使用部分名称空间。每个语句指定一个组织单位、特定账户或单个 IAM 主体、允许或拒绝，并且可以限制为一个路径前缀。","Yes by default":"默认情况下为是","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tag.":"您最多还可以添加 {{availableTags}} 个标签。","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tags.":"您最多还可以添加 {{availableTags}} 个标签。","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"您已超过 {{tagLimit}} 个标签的限制。","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"您已超出 {{tagLimit}} 个标签的数量上限。","You have more keys than can be displayed":"您拥有的键超出可显示的数量","You have more values than can be displayed":"您拥有的值超出可显示的数量","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"您已达到 {{tagLimit}} 个标签的限制。","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"您已达到 {{tagLimit}} 个标签的数量上限。","You have unsaved tag changes. Leave this page and discard them?":"您对标签所做的更改尚未保存。是否要离开此页面并放弃更改？","You must enter a path":"您必须输入一个路径","You must specify a condition key":"必须指定条件键","You must specify a tag key":"您必须指定标签键","You must specify a unique tag key.":"必须指定唯一的标签键。","You must specify a value":"必须指定一个值","Your administrator decides which prefixes this account can use. This is checked when you create.":"您的管理员决定此账户可以使用哪些前缀。创建时将对此进行检查。","Your identities will be <code>{{prefix}}<em>{{placeholder}}</em></code>":"您的身份将为 {{prefix}}{{placeholder}}","Your organization already has a workload identity provider. Add templates under it to start issuing identities to your workloads — each named under your account's path prefix.":"您的组织已有一个工作负载身份提供商。在其下添加模板，即可开始为您的工作负载签发身份 – 每个身份均以您账户的路径前缀命名。","Your organization has workload identity providers you can use. Pick one and add templates under it to start issuing identities to your workloads.":"您的组织已有可用的工作负载身份提供商。选择一个，并在其下添加模板，即可开始为您的工作负载签发身份。","YYYY/MM/DD":"YYYY/MM/DD","{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.","A declared identity has a fixed name you define. Use one when you need an exact name, for example to match a name another system already expects.":"A declared identity has a fixed name you define. Use one when you need an exact name, for example to match a name another system already expects.","A fact {{workload}} checks when the agent or workload starts.":"A fact {{workload}} checks when the agent or workload starts.","A provider issues secure, verifiable identities to your agents and workloads, like your Kubernetes pods or AI agents, to access AWS and third-party services without long-lived credentials.":"A provider issues secure, verifiable identities to your agents and workloads, like your Kubernetes pods or AI agents, to access AWS and third-party services without long-lived credentials.","A template automatically generates an identity for each matching agent or workload under {{providerName}}.":"A template automatically generates an identity for each matching agent or workload under {{providerName}}.","A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued.":"A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued.","A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued. Decide how this provider issues identities - starting from the <link>default templates</link> for common use cases, or skipping them. Templates are optional and can be added later.":"A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued. Decide how this provider issues identities - starting from the <link>default templates</link> for common use cases, or skipping them. Templates are optional and can be added later.","A template names identities automatically as matching agents and workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.":"A template names identities automatically as matching agents and workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.","A template with no attestation policy matches no agent or workload, so nothing is ever issued from it. Set a policy to define which agents and workloads qualify.":"A template with no attestation policy matches no agent or workload, so nothing is ever issued from it. Set a policy to define which agents and workloads qualify.","A template's path pattern, built from facts like cluster, namespace, and service account, names each agent or workload automatically when it starts. You don't create identities ahead of time.":"A template's path pattern, built from facts like cluster, namespace, and service account, names each agent or workload automatically when it starts. You don't create identities ahead of time.","Add a fact or condition key. A path of only custom text would give every agent or workload the same name.":"Add a fact or condition key. A path of only custom text would give every agent or workload the same name.","Add an {{conditionKey}} condition, so only agents or workloads in these clusters get an identity.":"Add an {{conditionKey}} condition, so only agents or workloads in these clusters get an identity.","Add attestation policy":"Add attestation policy","Add templates after the provider is created.":"Add templates after the provider is created.","Agent and workload identity":"Agent and workload identity","Agent and workload identity - <em>Preview</em>":"Agent and workload identity - <em>Preview</em>","Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide":"Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide","Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide (opens in a new tab)":"Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide (opens in a new tab)","Agents and workloads get named automatically":"Agents and workloads get named automatically","Agents and workloads get short-lived credentials that renew automatically and follow the SPIFFE standard, so they work with service meshes such as Istio and with business applications.":"Agents and workloads get short-lived credentials that renew automatically and follow the SPIFFE standard, so they work with service meshes such as Istio and with business applications.","Agents and workloads in these EKS clusters can get an identity from this provider, when all of these are true:":"Agents and workloads in these EKS clusters can get an identity from this provider, when all of these are true:","Agents and workloads running in these clusters can get an identity from this provider. Add two or more.":"Agents and workloads running in these clusters can get an identity from this provider. Add two or more.","Agents and workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Agents and workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.","Agents and workloads running in this cluster can get an identity from this provider.":"Agents and workloads running in this cluster can get an identity from this provider.","Agents and workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Agents and workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.","Agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request":"Agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request","Agents and workloads, such as AI agents and pods, are verified at runtime and each gets its own identity, generated by a template. The identity gets fine-grained access to AWS resources through IAM policies and CloudTrail, and signed JWT and X.509 credentials for meshes and apps.":"Agents and workloads, such as AI agents and pods, are verified at runtime and each gets its own identity, generated by a template. The identity gets fine-grained access to AWS resources through IAM policies and CloudTrail, and signed JWT and X.509 credentials for meshes and apps.","All templates and identities under this provider will be deleted":"All templates and identities under this provider will be deleted","An AI agent or workload gets an identity that is unique.":"An AI agent or workload gets an identity that is unique.","An identity with no attestation policy admits no workload, so nothing can run as it. Set a policy to define which workload qualifies.":"An identity with no attestation policy admits no workload, so nothing can run as it. Set a policy to define which workload qualifies.","An identity with this name already exists.":"An identity with this name already exists.","At runtime the platform attests these facts about the agent or workload. Any agent or workload whose attestation carries them gets an identity issued from this template.":"At runtime the platform attests these facts about the agent or workload. Any agent or workload whose attestation carries them gets an identity issued from this template.","Attestation policy for {{name}} has been removed.":"Attestation policy for {{name}} has been removed.","Attestation policy for {{name}} has been updated.":"Attestation policy for {{name}} has been updated.","By continuing, you also enable organization level resource creation, which is needed to create the organization scoped provider. You can disable it later in Settings.":"By continuing, you also enable organization level resource creation, which is needed to create the organization scoped provider. You can disable it later in Settings.","Change the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.":"Change the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.","Choose a stable, unique name that identifies one environment or group of agents and workloads, for example prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal.":"Choose a stable, unique name that identifies one environment or group of agents and workloads, for example prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal.","Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for an agent or workload.":"Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for an agent or workload.","Choose the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.":"Choose the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.","Choose where the workload is hosted":"Choose where the workload is hosted","Choose who can use it":"Choose who can use it","Control what an agent or workload can reach with familiar IAM policies and see its AWS calls in CloudTrail.":"Control what an agent or workload can reach with familiar IAM policies and see its AWS calls in CloudTrail.","Create declared identity":"Create declared identity","Creates an agent and workload identity provider and template for agents and workloads running in one or more EKS clusters under a service mesh, such as Istio.":"Creates an agent and workload identity provider and template for agents and workloads running in one or more EKS clusters under a service mesh, such as Istio.","Creating the identity":"Creating the identity","Declare an identity with the exact name you need":"Declare an identity with the exact name you need","Declared identities":"Declared identities","Declared identity":"Declared identity","Declared identity {{name}} created.":"Declared identity {{name}} created.","Define which agents and workloads are allowed to use this template.":"Define which agents and workloads are allowed to use this template.","Delete the templates under <b>{{providerName}}</b> before deleting the provider. Once deleted, agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials and fail on their next request, and access that you granted to these identities will stop working.":"Delete the templates under <b>{{providerName}}</b> before deleting the provider. Once deleted, agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials and fail on their next request, and access that you granted to these identities will stop working.","Deleting templates and identities":"Deleting templates and identities","Each identity is fully the template path.":"Each identity is fully the template path.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.","Enter a description":"Enter a description","Failed to create the declared identity.":"Failed to create the declared identity.","Failed to save attestation policy.":"Failed to save attestation policy.","Filter declared identities":"Filter declared identities","For example, to match a name another system already expects.":"For example, to match a name another system already expects.","from provider":"from provider","Give AI agents and workloads their own identities. Know which of them made each call. Scope its access with the IAM policies you already use.":"Give AI agents and workloads their own identities. Know which of them made each call. Scope its access with the IAM policies you already use.","Give an agent or workload a unique identity, so you can grant it access and audit what it did rather than sharing one role.":"Give an agent or workload a unique identity, so you can grant it access and audit what it did rather than sharing one role.","Grant access":"Grant access","Grant this name access to resources in IAM policies.":"Grant this name access to resources in IAM policies.","IAM for agents and workloads":"IAM for agents and workloads","IAM for agents and workloads (opens in a new tab)":"IAM for agents and workloads (opens in a new tab)",Identifier:sFt,"Identities ({{total}})":"Identities ({{total}})","Identities are issued at runtime from facts the agent or workload proves, rather than from what an admin assigns.":"Identities are issued at runtime from facts the agent or workload proves, rather than from what an admin assigns.","Identities for agents":"Identities for agents","Identities: {{reason}}":"Identities: {{reason}}","Identity {{name}}: {{reason}}":"Identity {{name}}: {{reason}}","Invalid trust domain. Use lowercase alphanumeric and '-.' characters.":"Invalid trust domain. Use lowercase alphanumeric and '-.' characters.","Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's agents and workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. Standard pricing applies to the creation and use of AWS Private CA.":"Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's agents and workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. Standard pricing applies to the creation and use of AWS Private CA.","It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so agents and workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. To avoid this, wait until it becomes inactive on its own. Deleting it then has no effect on verification.":"It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so agents and workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. To avoid this, wait until it becomes inactive on its own. Deleting it then has no effect on verification.","Let agents and workloads reach non-AWS resources":"Let agents and workloads reach non-AWS resources","Loading declared identities":"Loading declared identities","Matching agents and workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.":"Matching agents and workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.","No agent and workload identity providers":"No agent and workload identity providers","No agent or workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.":"No agent or workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.","No attestation policy attached.":"No attestation policy attached.","No attestation policy. No agent or workload will be issued an identity from this template until you add one.":"No attestation policy. No agent or workload will be issued an identity from this template until you add one.","No conditions. This policy matches every agent or workload of its service.":"No conditions. This policy matches every agent or workload of its service.","No segments yet. Add at least one, or every agent or workload this template matches resolves to the same name.":"No segments yet. Add at least one, or every agent or workload this template matches resolves to the same name.","None – names are defined by templates":"None – names are defined by templates","Nothing can run as this identity":"Nothing can run as this identity","Once the attestation policy is removed, matching agents and workloads will not be issued agent and workload identities until you add a policy again.":"Once the attestation policy is removed, matching agents and workloads will not be issued agent and workload identities until you add a policy again.","One bundle per provider, and one URL. It carries every authority the provider publishes: both outbound signers, and during an update both the current and incoming certificate authority, which is what lets verifiers accept either one through the handover. Your own AWS agents and workloads get these keys automatically; send this to systems outside AWS.":"One bundle per provider, and one URL. It carries every authority the provider publishes: both outbound signers, and during an update both the current and incoming certificate authority, which is what lets verifiers accept either one through the handover. Your own AWS agents and workloads get these keys automatically; send this to systems outside AWS.","One provider and one trust domain shared by every EKS cluster in the mesh. An agent or workload with the same namespace and service account in any of these clusters shares one identity.":"One provider and one trust domain shared by every EKS cluster in the mesh. An agent or workload with the same namespace and service account in any of these clusters shares one identity.","Path is the unique part of each identity's name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts an agent or workload proves.":"Path is the unique part of each identity's name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts an agent or workload proves.","path prefix":"path prefix","Policy: Define how an agent or workload attests to get the identity":"Policy: Define how an agent or workload attests to get the identity","Proven at runtime":"Proven at runtime","Providers to issue agent and workload identities":"Providers to issue agent and workload identities","Scoped, auditable access":"Scoped, auditable access","Search by name":"Search by name","Set the exact name":"Set the exact name","Set the naming format and usage scope that every agent and workload identity from this provider inherits.":"Set the naming format and usage scope that every agent and workload identity from this provider inherits.","Set the unique path pattern that every identity generated by this template follows. Cannot be changed later.":"Set the unique path pattern that every identity generated by this template follows. Cannot be changed later.","Set up a provider to hold the templates that generate identity names and the signers that sign credentials for systems outside AWS.":"Set up a provider to hold the templates that generate identity names and the signers that sign credentials for systems outside AWS.","Set up a way to issue agent and workload identities":"Set up a way to issue agent and workload identities","Set which workloads can use this identity and where they must run.":"Set which workloads can use this identity and where they must run.","Stop matching agents and workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request":"Stop matching agents and workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request","Templates give matching agents and workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.":"Templates give matching agents and workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it.":"The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.":"The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Generated from the EKS clusters above. Can be edited later.":"The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Generated from the EKS clusters above. Can be edited later.","The attestation policy controls how this identity is issued. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.":"The attestation policy controls how this identity is issued. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.","The attestation policy is the set of facts an agent or workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so an agent or workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.":"The attestation policy is the set of facts an agent or workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so an agent or workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.","The certificate chain is distributing to every Region, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. It starts signing at {{at}}. That is the minimum signing delay you set, so signing may start later than this. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.":"The certificate chain is distributing to every Region, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. It starts signing at {{at}}. That is the minimum signing delay you set, so signing may start later than this. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.","The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Account ID and Region in front so names stay unique across accounts and Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.":"The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Account ID and Region in front so names stay unique across accounts and Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.","The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Region in front so names stay unique across Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.":"The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Region in front so names stay unique across Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.","This action deletes the agent and workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.":"This action deletes the agent and workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.","This certificate has stopped signing, but its chain stays in the trust bundle so certificates already issued under it keep verifying. It becomes inactive at {{at}}. Until then, Enable resumes signing with no wait. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.":"This certificate has stopped signing, but its chain stays in the trust bundle so certificates already issued under it keep verifying. It becomes inactive at {{at}}. Until then, Enable resumes signing with no wait. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.","This doesn't look like a valid EKS cluster ARN. An invalid ARN will leave agents or workloads in that cluster without an identity.":"This doesn't look like a valid EKS cluster ARN. An invalid ARN will leave agents or workloads in that cluster without an identity.","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. Both certificates below stop, including the one still in transition, so the update does not complete. Both stay configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. Both certificates below stop, including the one still in transition, so the update does not complete. Both stay configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.","This template issues no identities":"This template issues no identities","Trust domain must be 64 characters or less.":"Trust domain must be 64 characters or less.","Use the agent or workload identity in trust policies, resource policies, or SCPs. CloudTrail records its calls with that identity.":"Use the agent or workload identity in trust policies, resource policies, or SCPs. CloudTrail records its calls with that identity.","What conditions should the agent or workload match?":"What conditions should the agent or workload match?","Where is the agent or workload hosted?":"Where is the agent or workload hosted?","You must enter a name":"You must enter a name","Your organization already has an agent and workload identity provider. Add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads — each named under your account's path prefix.":"Your organization already has an agent and workload identity provider. Add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads — each named under your account's path prefix.","Your organization has agent and workload identity providers you can use. Pick one and add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads.":"Your organization has agent and workload identity providers you can use. Pick one and add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads."},cFt=Object.freeze(Object.defineProperty({__proto__:null,ARN:"ARN",Actions:"操作",Active:"活动",Add:"添加",Apply:"应用",Attestation:"证明",Cancel:"取消",Clear:"清除",Close:"关闭",Configured:"已配置",Confirm:"确认",Contains:"包含",Created:tFt,Delete:"删除",Description:"描述",Details:aFt,Disable:"禁用",Dismiss:"关闭",Edit:"编辑",Editing:nFt,Enable:"启用",Equals:"等于",Errors:"错误",Format:"格式",Identifier:sFt,Inactive:"非活动",Info:"信息",JWKS:iFt,Key:"键",Name:"名称",New:"新",None:"无",Notifications:"通知",Operator:"运算符",Operators:"运算符",Path:"路径",Preferences:"首选项",Preview:"预览",Properties:"属性",Property:"属性",Provided:"已提供",Provider:"提供商",Providers:"提供商",Ready:rFt,Recommended:"已建议",Refresh:"刷新",Remove:"移除",Retry:"重试",Save:"保存",Scheme:"方案",Scope:"范围",Status:"状态",Subject:"主题",Success:"成功",Tags:"标签",Template:"模板",Templates:"模板",Theme:"主题",Today:"今天",Undo:"撤销",Update:"更新",Validating:oFt,Value:"值",Values:"值",Visual:"可视化",Warning:"警告",Warnings:"警告",and:"与",default:lFt,equals:"等于",optional:"可选",or:"或",path:"路径",scheme:"方案"},Symbol.toStringTag,{value:"Module"})),dFt="詳細資訊",uFt="正在編輯",pFt="非作用中",hFt="JWKS",mFt="偏好設定",gFt="重新整理",vFt="正在驗證",fFt="視覺效果",yFt="Identifier",bFt={"'{{providerName}}' does not exist in your account":"您的帳戶中不存在 '{{providerName}}'","(earliest)":"(最早)","{{addedCount}} tag added or changed":"{{addedCount}} 個標籤已新增或變更","{{addedCount}} tags added or changed":"{{addedCount}} 個標籤已新增或變更","{{createdCount}} templates created: {{templateNames}}.":"{{createdCount}} 個範本已建立：{{templateNames}}。","{{failed}} of {{total}} certificates could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{total}} 個憑證中有 {{failed}} 個無法刪除，因此提供者未刪除。解決錯誤後再試一次。","{{failed}} of {{total}} could not be deleted.":"{{total}} 個中有 {{failed}} 個無法刪除。","{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and workload identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{total}} 個範本和工作負載身分中有 {{failed}} 個無法刪除，因此提供者未刪除。解決錯誤後再試一次。","{{failedCount}} template could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.":"{{failedCount}} 個範本無法建立。檢閱以下錯誤，然後再試一次。","{{failedCount}} templates could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.":"{{failedCount}} 個範本無法建立。檢閱以下錯誤，然後再試一次。","{{identityCount}} identities":"{{identityCount}} 個身分","{{identityCount}} identity":"{{identityCount}} 個身分","{{label}} (service mesh)":"{{label}} (服務網格)","{{label}} copied":"{{label}} 已複製","{{label}} failed to copy":"{{label}} 複製失敗","{{label}} template":"{{label}} 個範本","{{label}} template {{index}}":"{{label}} 範本 {{index}}","{{label}}:":"{{label}}:","{{matchCount}} match":"{{matchCount}} 個相符項目","{{matchCount}} matches":"{{matchCount}} 個相符項目","{{name}} has been successfully created.":"{{name}} 已成功建立。","{{name}} has been successfully created. However, the following operations failed:":"已成功建立 {{name}}，但下列操作失敗：","{{providerName}} still has these resources:":"{{providerName}} 仍有這些資源：","{{removedCount}} tag removed":"{{removedCount}} 個標籤已移除","{{removedCount}} tags removed":"{{removedCount}} 個標籤已移除","{{scope}} · {{domain}}":"{{scope}} · {{domain}}","{{settled}} of {{total}}":"{{settled}}/{{total}}","{{subject}}. Does not match this signer's {{algorithm}} algorithm.":"{{subject}}。不符合此簽署者的 {{algorithm}} 演算法。","{{tagCount}} tag":"{{tagCount}} 個標籤","{{tagCount}} tags":"{{tagCount}} 個標籤","{{templateCount}} template":"{{templateCount}} 個範本","{{templateCount}} templates":"{{templateCount}} 個範本","{{templateName}} template failed to create. To try again, <link>add templates</link>. Error details: {{reason}}":"無法建立 {{templateName}} 範本。若要再試一次，請<link>新增範本</link>。錯誤詳細資訊：{{reason}}","{{workload}} fact":"{{workload}} 事實","{defined by template}":"{defined by template}","<term>Support:</term> Amazon EKS, Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Runtime, and Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Gateway.":"<term>支援：</term>Amazon EKS、Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Runtime 和 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Gateway。","1 EKS cluster":"1 個 EKS 叢集","1 provider and 1 trust domain per EKS cluster. Each namespace and service account in this cluster gets its own identity, trusted only within this cluster.":"每個 EKS 叢集有 1 個提供者和 1 個信任網域。此叢集中的每個命名空間和服務帳戶都會取得自己的身分，且僅在此叢集內受信任。","1 provider and 1 trust domain shared by every EKS cluster in the mesh. A workload with the same namespace and service account in any of these clusters shares one identity.":"網格中每個 EKS 叢集共用 1 個提供者和 1 個信任網域。在任何這些叢集中具有相同命名空間和服務帳戶的工作負載會共用一個身分。","1 to 48 hours, in whole hours. Publishing is usually much faster, but can take up to 24 hours.":"1 到 48 小時，以整數小時為單位。發佈通常快得多，但最多可能需要 24 小時。","1. Select all the check boxes to confirm what deleting {{providerName}} will do.":"1. 選取所有核取方塊以確認刪除 {{providerName}} 將執行的動作。","2. Confirm that you want to delete this provider by typing {{providerName}} below.":"2. 在下方輸入 {{providerName}}，確認您想要刪除此提供者。","A declared identity has a fixed path you define. Use one when you need an exact path, for example to match a value another system already expects.":"宣告式身分具有您定義的固定路徑。當您需要確切路徑時，例如要比對其他系統已預期的值，請使用宣告式身分。","A deny, and only for delegated administrators":"拒絕，且僅適用於委派管理員","A fact {{workload}} checks when the workload starts.":"{{workload}} 會在工作負載啟動時檢查事實。","A fixed label, such as an environment name.":"固定標籤，例如環境名稱。","A name to identify this identity.":"用來識別此身分的名稱。","A provider with this name already exists.":"使用此名稱的提供者已存在。","A tag is a label you assign to an AWS resource. Each tag has a key and an optional value. Use tags to search and filter this provider, or to track your AWS costs.":"標籤是您指派給 AWS 資源的標記。每個標籤皆包含一個索引鍵和一個選用的值。使用標籤來搜尋和篩選此提供者，或追蹤 AWS 成本。","A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts a workload must prove before an identity is issued. Decide how this provider issues identities - starting from the <link>default templates</link> for common use cases, or skipping them. You can add and name identities manually at any time - templates are optional and can be added later.":"範本會定義用於唯一命名身分的路徑模式，以及工作負載在發出身分之前必須證明的事實。決定此提供者如何發出身分 – 從常見使用案例的<link>預設範本</link>開始，或略過這些範本。您可以隨時手動新增和命名身分 – 範本為選用項目，稍後可以新增。","A template with this name already exists.":"此名稱的範本已存在。","A template's path pattern, built from facts like cluster, namespace, and service account, names each workload automatically when it starts. You don't create identities ahead of time.":"範本的路徑模式由叢集、命名空間與服務帳戶等資訊建構而成，會在工作負載啟動時自動為其命名。您無需事先建立身分。","A workload identity provider issues secure, verifiable identities to your workloads, like Kubernetes pods or AI agents. Workloads use them to access AWS and third-party services without long-lived credentials.":"工作負載身分提供者將向您的工作負載簽發安全、可驗證的身分，例如 Kubernetes Pod 或 AI 代理程式。工作負載可使用這些身分來存取 AWS 與第三方服務，無需長期憑證。","A workload, including an AI agent or sub-agent created on demand, gets its own identity. No workload shares or inherits another's.":"工作負載 (包括隨需建立的 AI 代理程式或子代理程式) 都會取得自己的身分。沒有工作負載會共用或繼承另一個工作負載的身分。","Access a partner API, a SaaS endpoint, or an OIDC service. No setup needed.":"存取合作夥伴 API、SaaS 端點或 OIDC 服務。無需任何設定。","Access a service mesh, a database, or an on-premises system.":"存取服務網格、資料庫或內部部署系統。","Access denied":"存取遭拒","Access you granted to these identities will stop working":"您授予這些身分的存取權將停止運作","Account scoped":"帳戶範圍",Actions:"動作","Activating it":"啟用它",Active:"作用中","Active certificate authority ID":"作用中憑證授權機構 ID","Active: currently signing":"作用中：目前正在簽署",Add:"新增","Add {{label}} template":"新增 {{label}} 範本","Add a fact or condition key. A path of only custom text would give every workload the same name.":"新增事實或條件索引鍵。僅包含自訂文字的路徑會為每個工作負載提供相同的名稱。","Add an {{conditionKey}} condition, so only workloads in these clusters get an identity.":"新增 {{conditionKey}} 條件，讓只有這些叢集中的工作負載可以取得身分。","Add at least 1 path segment.":"至少新增 1 個路徑區段。","Add at least 1 template to continue.":"新增至少 1 個範本以繼續。","Add at least 2 clusters.":"新增至少 2 個叢集。","Add attestation rules":"新增證明規則","Add cluster ARN":"新增叢集 ARN","Add condition":"新增條件","Add default templates for Amazon EKS, AgentCore Runtime, and AgentCore Gateway.":"新增 Amazon EKS、AgentCore 執行時期和 AgentCore 閘道的預設範本。","Add new tag":"新增標籤","Add policy":"新增政策","Add request-context values like account, Region, or organization.":"新增請求上下文值，例如帳戶、區域或組織。","Add tags":"新增標籤","Add tags to this provider for cost management and access control.":"將標籤新增至此提供者以進行成本管理和存取控制。","Add tags to this template for cost management and access control.":"將標籤新增至此範本以進行成本管理和存取控制。","Add tags to this workload identity for cost management and access control.":"將標籤新增至此工作負載身分以進行成本管理和存取控制。","Add template":"新增範本","Add templates":"新增範本","Add templates after the provider is created, or create and name identities by hand.":"在建立提供者後新增範本，或手動建立和命名身分。","Add to the path pattern":"新增至路徑模式","Added or changed tags were not saved":"新增或變更的標籤未儲存","Adding permissions to govern who can create templates referring to this provider failed. To try again, <link>add policy</link>. Error details: {{reason}}":"新增管理哪些人員可以建立參照此提供者之範本的許可時失敗。若要再試一次，請<link>新增政策</link>。錯誤詳細資訊：{{reason}}","All outbound signers under this provider will be deleted":"此提供者下的所有輸出簽署者都將被刪除","All properties":"所有屬性","All templates and workload identities under this provider will be deleted":"此提供者下的所有範本和工作負載身分都將刪除","Allow member accounts to add their own templates, namespaced by account ID":"允許會員帳戶新增自己的範本，且依帳戶 ID 設置命名空間","An identity for agent or workload":"代理程式或工作負載的身分",and:"且","Any value":"任何值",Apply:"套用",ARN:"ARN","ARN copied":"ARN 已複製","arn:aws:eks:{Region}:{account ID}:cluster/{cluster name}":"arn:aws:eks:{Region}:{account ID}:cluster/{cluster name}","At runtime the platform attests these facts about the workload. Any workload whose attestation carries them issues an identity from this template.":"在執行時期，平台會對工作負載證明這些事實。任何其證明帶有這些事實的工作負載，都會從此範本發出身分。",Attestation:"證明","Attestation policy":"證明政策","Auto generated identity name":"自動產生的身分名稱","Automatically generate from a template":"從範本自動產生","Available to every account in your organization ({{organizationId}})":"可供您組織中的每個帳戶使用 ({{organizationId}})","Available to this account ({{accountId}})":"可供此帳戶使用 ({{accountId}})","AWS account ID":"AWS 帳戶 ID","AWS API calls in CloudTrail resolve to the specific workload that made them. Scope trust policies, resource policies, and SCPs to it, using the IAM policies you already know.":"CloudTrail 中的 AWS API 呼叫會解析至發出這些呼叫的特定工作負載。使用您熟悉的 IAM 政策，將信任政策、資源政策和 SCP 的範圍限定至該工作負載。","AWS creates a subordinate CA in every region this provider signs in, and returns an ID for it.":"AWS 會在此提供者簽署的每個區域中建立從屬 CA，並傳回其 ID。","AWS IAM Workload Identity":"AWS IAM 工作負載身分","AWS IAM Workload Identity (opens in a new tab)":"AWS IAM 工作負載身分 (在新索引標籤中開啟)","AWS Private CA couldn't set up this certificate authority. Delete it in the AWS Private CA console and try again.":"AWS Private CA 無法設定此憑證授權機構。請在 AWS Private CA 主控台中將其刪除，然後再試一次。","By default, each account's templates require an account ID path prefix to avoid name collisions. You can customize this after creating the provider, under provider settings.":"依預設，每個帳戶的範本需要帳戶 ID 路徑字首，以避免名稱衝突。您可在建立提供者之後，在提供者設定下自訂此設定。","Can't be changed after the provider is created.":"建立提供者之後無法變更。","Can't be changed later.":"稍後無法變更。",Cancel:"取消","Cannot be changed later.":"之後無法變更。","Cannot start with aws:":"開頭不能為 aws:","Certificate {{name}} (account {{accountId}}): {{reason}}":"憑證 {{name}} (帳戶 {{accountId}})：{{reason}}","Certificate authority":"憑證授權機構","Certificate authority created":"憑證授權機構已建立","Certificate authority ID":"憑證認證機構 ID","Certificate authority name":"憑證授權機構名稱","Certificate authority updated. The current one keeps signing for about {{hours}} more hour, until the replacement has published everywhere.":"已更新憑證認證機構。取代憑證發布至所有區域之前，目前的憑證認證機構會繼續簽署約 {{hours}} 小時。","Certificate authority updated. The current one keeps signing for about {{hours}} more hours, until the replacement has published everywhere.":"已更新憑證認證機構。取代憑證發布至所有位置之前，目前的憑證認證機構會再保留簽署約 {{hours}} 小時。","Certificate deleted. Its chain had already left the trust bundle, so nothing that was verifying has changed.":"已刪除憑證。由於其憑證鏈已離開信任套件，因此，所有驗證內容均不受影響。","Certificate deleted. Its chain has been pulled from the trust bundle, so certificates issued under it no longer verify.":"已刪除憑證。其憑證鏈已從信任套件中移除，因此，在其下簽發的憑證無法再通過驗證。","Certificate signer":"憑證簽署者","Certificate signer disabled, and the update in progress was stopped with it. Both authorities stay configured, and Enable resumes signing.":"已停用憑證簽署者，進行中的更新亦會隨之停止。兩個授權認證機構均保持已設定狀態，並透過啟用來恢復簽署。","Certificate signer disabled. It stops signing now, its configuration is kept, and Enable resumes signing.":"已停用憑證簽署者。其會立即停止簽署，其組態會保留，並且可透過啟用來恢復簽署。","Certificate signer enabled. Its certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle again first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hour, after every region has it.":"已啟用憑證簽署者。其憑證鏈會先重新發佈到信任套件，並在每個區域都取得後約 {{hours}} 小時開始簽署。","Certificate signer enabled. Its certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle again first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hours, after every region has it.":"已啟用憑證簽署者。其憑證鏈會先重新發佈到信任套件，並在每個區域都取得後約 {{hours}} 小時開始簽署。","Certificate signer enabled. Its material was still published, so signing resumed immediately.":"已啟用憑證簽署者。其資料仍為已發布，因此簽署會立即恢復。","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hour, once every region has it.":"已啟用憑證簽署。憑證鏈會先發佈到信任套件，並在每個區域都取得後約 {{hours}} 小時開始簽署。","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hours, once every region has it.":"已啟用憑證簽署。憑證鏈會先發佈到信任套件，並在每個區域都取得後約 {{hours}} 小時開始簽署。","Certificate verifier information":"憑證驗證者資訊","Certificates ({{total}})":"憑證 ({{total}})","Certificates: {{reason}}":"憑證：{{reason}}","Change the facts a workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.":"變更工作負載若要從此範本取得身分，所必須完成證明的事項。此範本已產生的身分不會受到影響。","Change the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. A workload already holding a session keeps it until the session expires.":"變更工作負載必須證明具備哪些事實，才能以此身分執行。已取得工作階段的工作負載會保留該工作階段，直到工作階段到期為止。","Check again":"再次檢查","Checking what is attached to this provider":"正在檢查附加到此提供者的內容","Choose a condition key":"選擇條件索引鍵","Choose a fact":"選擇事實","Choose a path and pattern for the names. Start from a default or customize your own.":"選取名稱的路徑與模式。可使用預設值，或是自訂專屬模式。","Choose a specific name up front so you can grant it access or match an existing naming convention before the workload runs.":"預先選擇特定名稱，以便在工作負載執行之前授予其存取權或符合現有的命名慣例。","Choose a stable, unique name that identifies one environment or group of workloads, for example prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal.":"選擇可識別一個環境或一組工作負載的穩定、不重複的名稱，例如 prod.acme.com、staging.acme.com、payments.internal。","Choose a use case above to add a template.":"請在上方選擇使用案例以新增範本。","Choose from this account":"從此帳戶選擇","Choose templates to add, and customize or keep their defaults":"選擇要新增的範本，以及自訂或保留其預設值","Choose the certificate authority this signer should sign with instead. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. The current authority keeps signing until the replacement has been published long enough for verifiers to pick it up.":"請選擇此簽署者應改用的憑證認證機構。在您進行簽署的每個區域中，都需要一個在該區域具有次級 CA 的<link>憑證授權機構</link>。目前的授權機構將持續簽署，直到替換憑證已發佈足夠長的時間，讓驗證者得以取得為止。","Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for a workload.":"選擇要用來做為證明事實的條件索引鍵。平台必須先證明所有這些事實，此範本才會為工作負載發出身分。","Choose the facts a workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.":"選取工作負載若要從此範本取得身分，所必須完成證明的事項。完成設定前，此範本不會產生任何身分。","Choose the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. Nothing can be issued for it until you do.":"選擇工作負載必須證明具備哪些事實，才能以此身分執行。在完成這項設定之前，無法為其核發任何項目。","Choose the provider to create the identity in":"選擇要在哪個提供者中建立身分","Choose which templates to add by use case, and customize each one or keep its defaults.":"依使用案例選擇要新增的範本，並自訂每個範本或保留其預設值。",Clear:"清除","Clear filters":"清除篩選條件",Close:"關閉","Close modal":"關閉強制回應視窗","Cluster ARN":"叢集 ARN","Cluster ARNs":"叢集 ARN","Code editor":"程式碼編輯器","Complete the confirmation to delete.":"完成確認以刪除。","Condition key":"條件鍵","Configure identity templates for your workload use cases. Each template defines a path pattern used to issue identities uniquely and the facts a workload must prove before an identity is issued.":"為您的工作負載使用案例設定身分範本。每個範本會定義用於唯一核發身分的路徑模式，以及工作負載在核發身分前必須證明的事實。","Configure later":"稍後設定",Configured:"已設定",Confirm:"確認",Contains:"包含","Continue setup":"繼續設定","Copy {{label}}":"複製 {{label}}","Copy ARN":"複製 ARN","Copy JSON":"複製 JSON","Could not check everything attached to this provider":"無法檢查附加到此提供者的所有內容","Create a provider":"建立提供者","Create a provider for this account":"針對此帳戶建立提供者","Create a provider for your organization":"針對您的組織建立提供者","Create a provider to get started":"建立提供者以開始使用。","Create a template to automate identity generation":"建立範本以自動化身分產生","Create declared identity in {{providerName}}":"在 {{providerName}} 中建立宣告式身分","Create identity":"建立身分","Create new":"建立新的","Create provider":"建立提供者","Create provider and templates":"建立提供者和範本","Create service mesh provider":"建立服務網格提供者","Create templates":"建立範本","Create the certificate authority first.":"請先建立憑證授權機構。","Create workload identities":"建立工作負載身分",Created:"已建立","Created through":"建立方式","Created time":"建立時間","Created values":"已建立的值","Creates a workload identity provider and template for workloads running in one or more EKS clusters under a service mesh, such as Istio.":"為在一或多個 EKS 叢集上、於服務網格 (例如 Istio) 下執行的工作負載建立工作負載身分提供者和範本。","Creating certificate authority":"正在建立憑證授權機構","Creating the certificate authority":"建立憑證授權機構","Creating this provider sets up these 2 resources.":"建立此提供者會設定這 2 個資源。","Current CA":"目前的 CA","Current provider":"目前的提供者","Custom tag key":"自訂標籤索引鍵","Custom tag value":"自訂標籤值","Custom text":"自訂文字","Custom text can't be a single period (.) or two periods (..).":"自訂文字不能是單一句點 (.) 或兩個句點 (..)。","Customize templates":"自訂範本","Dark themes":"暗色主題","Declared identity: {{name}}":"宣告的身分：{{name}}","Default permissions without a policy":"沒有政策時的預設許可","Defaults to {provider name}.{account ID}.aws.internal. This must match the trust domain set in your service mesh, or the mesh rejects the identities.":"預設為 {provider name}.{account ID}.aws.internal。這必須與您服務網格中設定的信任網域相符，否則該網格會拒絕身分。","Define an optional path prefix for identities under this template. Lets you filter by prefix when authoring IAM permissions.":"為此範本下的身分定義選用路徑前綴。可讓您在撰寫 IAM 許可時依前綴進行篩選。","Define an optional path prefix for this identity. You can filter by this prefix when authoring IAM permissions.":"為此身分定義選填的路徑前綴。撰寫 IAM 權限時，您可以依此前綴篩選。","Define an optional prefix for identities under this template. You can filter by this prefix when authoring IAM permissions. The path prefixes this account can use are set by the provider's policy, for example your account ID, and they are checked when you choose Create. If you're not sure which are permitted, ask your organization administrator.":"在此範本中定義身分的選用字首。您可以在撰寫 IAM 許可時，依此字首篩選。此帳戶可使用的路徑字首由身分提供者的政策設定 (例如您的帳戶 ID)，您選擇「建立」時，系統會加以檢查。如果您不確定允許哪些字首，請洽詢您的組織管理員。","Define an optional prefix for this identity. You can filter by this prefix when authoring IAM permissions. The path prefixes this account can use are set by the provider's policy, for example your account ID, and they are checked when you choose Create. If you're not sure which are permitted, ask your organization administrator.":"定義此身分的選用字首。您可以在撰寫 IAM 許可時，依此字首篩選。此帳戶可使用的路徑字首由身分提供者的政策設定 (例如您的帳戶 ID)，您選擇「建立」時，系統會加以檢查。如果您不確定允許哪些字首，請洽詢您的組織管理員。","Define which workloads are allowed to use this template.":"定義哪些工作負載可使用此範本。",Delete:"刪除","Delete certificate?":"刪除憑證？","Delete provider":"刪除提供者","Delete provider and resources":"刪除提供者和資源","Delete provider?":"刪除提供者？","Delete template":"刪除範本","Delete template?":"刪除範本？","Delete the templates under <b>{{providerName}}</b> before deleting the provider. Once deleted, workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials and fail on their next request, and access that you granted to these identities will stop working.":"在刪除提供者之前，請先刪除 <b>{{providerName}}</b> 下的範本。刪除後，使用這些身分的工作負載將不再取得憑證，並在下次請求時失敗，而您授予這些身分的存取權也將停止運作。","Delete workload identity?":"刪除工作負載身分？","Deleting <b>{{templateName}}</b> will:":"刪除 <b>{{templateName}}</b> 將：","Deleting <b>{{workloadIdentifier}}</b> will:":"刪除 <b>{{workloadIdentifier}}</b> 將：","Deleting certificates":"正在刪除憑證","Deleting provider":"正在刪除提供者","Deleting templates and workload identities":"正在刪除範本和工作負載身分","Deleting the provider is taking longer than expected":"刪除提供者花費的時間比預期長",Description:"描述","Description can't include line breaks or tabs.":"描述不能包含換行符號或定位字元。","Description must be 1,000 characters or less.":"描述不得超過 1,000 個字元。","Description must be 255 characters or less.":"描述不得超過 255 個字元。",Details:dFt,Disable:"停用","Disable certificate signer?":"要停用憑證簽署者嗎？","Discovery expiration time":"探索到期時間",Dismiss:"關閉","Does not contain":"不包含","Does not equal":"不等於","Drag or select to resize":"拖曳或選取以調整大小","Each identity is fully the template path, or whatever string you enter when you create the identity.":"每個身分為完整的範本路徑，或者是您建立身分時輸入的任何字串。",Edit:"編輯","Edit attestation policy":"編輯證明政策","Edit filter":"編輯篩選條件","Edit identity format and scope":"編輯身分格式與範圍","Edit identity path":"編輯身分路徑",Editing:uFt,Enable:"啟用","Enable certificate signer":"啟用憑證簽署者","Enable certificate signer?":"要啟用憑證簽署者嗎？","End signing time":"結束簽署時間","Enter a 12-digit AWS account ID.":"輸入 12 位數的 AWS 帳戶 ID。","Enter a certificate authority ID.":"請輸入憑證授權機構 ID。","Enter a cluster ARN.":"輸入叢集 ARN。","Enter a name":"輸入名稱","Enter a name for the certificate authority.":"輸入憑證授權機構的名稱。","Enter a name.":"輸入名稱。","Enter a path":"請輸入路徑","Enter a path prefix value":"輸入路徑前綴值","Enter a trust domain.":"請輸入一個信任網域。","Enter a value":"輸入值","Enter a whole number of hours from 1 to 48.":"輸入 1 到 48 的整數小時。","Enter key":"輸入索引鍵","Enter prefix":"輸入字首","Enter the ID of a certificate authority or choose from below":"輸入憑證授權機構的 ID，或從下方選擇","Enter the policy as valid JSON.":"以有效的 JSON 輸入政策。","Enter value":"輸入值",equals:"等於",Equals:"等於",Error:"錯誤","Error fetching the details":"擷取詳細資訊時發生錯誤",Errors:"錯誤","Every account in this organization ({{organizationId}})":"在此組織的每一個帳戶 ({{organizationId}})","Every X.509-SVID this provider issues right now is signed by this certificate. It stops in {{hours}} hour, at {{at}}, when the incoming certificate takes over.":"此提供者目前發布的每一個 X.509-SVID 均由此憑證簽署。此憑證將在 {{hours}} 小時後的 {{at}} 停止簽署，屆時將由傳入憑證接管。","Every X.509-SVID this provider issues right now is signed by this certificate. It stops in {{hours}} hours, at {{at}}, when the incoming certificate takes over.":"此提供者目前簽發的每一個 X.509-SVID 均由此憑證簽署。即將到來的憑證接管後，此憑證將於 {{hours}} 小時後的 {{at}} 停止簽署。","Every X.509-SVID this provider issues right now is signed by this certificate. No replacement is scheduled, so it keeps signing until you update or disable the signer.":"此提供者目前簽發的每個 X.509-SVID 均由此憑證簽署。未排程任何取代，因此，該憑證會持續簽署，直至您更新或停用簽署者為止。","Failed to copy":"複製失敗","Failed to copy JSON":"複製 JSON 失敗","Failed to load attestation policy.":"證明政策載入失敗。","Failed to load templates.":"範本載入失敗。","Failed to remove attestation policy.":"無法移除驗證政策。","Filter providers":"篩選供應商","Filter templates":"篩選範本","Filter themes":"篩選主題","Find providers":"尋找供應商","Find templates":"尋找範本","Find theme":"尋找主題","For example, prod":"例如，prod","For mutual TLS, attach a certificate authority":"若要使用雙向 TLS，請連接憑證授權機構","For token-based services, issue a JWT":"對於權杖型服務，發出 JWT",Format:"格式","Generating its key":"產生其金鑰","Get started":"開始使用","Getting started":"入門","Give an agent or workload its own identity - <em>Preview</em>":"為代理程式或工作負載提供自己的身分 - <em>預覽</em>","Give each workload a unique identity, so you can grant it access and audit what it did rather than sharing one role.":"為每個工作負載提供唯一的身分，以便您可以授予其存取權並稽核其所執行的操作，而非共用同一個角色。","Give your workloads an identity":"為您的工作負載提供身分","Go to the providers list":"前往提供者清單","Govern who can create resources":"管理誰可以建立資源","Govern who can create templates referring to this provider":"治理誰可以建立參照此提供者的範本","Greater than":"大於","Greater than or equal":"大於或等於","hour(s)":"小時","How it works":"運作方式","IAM roles define what a workload can do. Workload Identity tells you which workload is doing it.":"IAM 角色定義工作負載可執行的操作；工作負載身分則告知您是哪個工作負載在執行該操作。","Identities are issued at runtime from facts the workload proves, not just from what an admin assigns.":"身分是在執行階段根據工作負載所證明的事實發出，而不僅僅是根據管理員指派的內容發出。",'Identity "{{identityId}}" not found.':"找不到身分「{{identityId}}」。","Identity format and scope":"身分格式與範圍","Identity name":"身分名稱","Identity path":"身分路徑","Identity selection":"身分選取","If anything is still attached, deleting the provider fails.":"如果有任何項目仍附加，刪除提供者會失敗。","In transition":"轉換中","In transition certificate authority ID":"轉換中憑證認證機構 ID","In transition: incoming, not yet signing":"轉換中：傳入、尚未簽署",Inactive:pFt,"Inactive: retired, no longer trusted":"非作用中：已淘汰、不再受信任","Incoming CA":"傳入 CA",Info:"資訊","Invalid key. Keys can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"無效的索引鍵。索引鍵只能包含 Unicode 字母、數字、空格和以下任何一項：_.:/=+@-","Invalid provider name. Use alphanumeric and '-_.' characters.":"無效的提供者名稱。使用英數字元及 '-_.' 字元。","Invalid request":"請求無效","Invalid template name. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters.":"無效的範本名稱。使用英數字元和 '-_' 字元。","Invalid value. Values can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"無效的值。值只能包含 Unicode 字母、數字、空格和以下任何一項：_.:/=+@-","Issued after the workload proves itself":"在工作負載完成自我驗證後發出","Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. Standard pricing applies to the creation and use of AWS Private CA.":"簽發此提供者的工作負載呈現給 AWS 外部系統作為用戶端憑證的 X.509-SVID。您登入的每個區域都需要有一個具有從屬 CA 的<link>憑證授權機構</link>。AWS Private CA 的建立與使用適用標準定價。","Issues X.509-SVIDs, for mTLS peers that verify a client certificate.":"為驗證用戶端憑證的 mTLS 對等端簽發 X.509-SVID。","Issuing its CA certificate":"簽發其 CA 憑證","It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. Leave it alone and it becomes inactive on its own, after which deleting it changes nothing.":"它已停止簽署，但其鏈仍在發布，因此工作負載依賴它來驗證先前核發的登入憑證。現在刪除它會立即提取該鏈，那些憑證將開始失敗。不予理會，它會自行變為非作用中，之後刪除它不會產生任何變化。","Item moved from position {{initialPosition}} to position {{finalPosition}} of {{total}}":"項目已從位置 {{initialPosition}} 移至位置 {{finalPosition}} (共 {{total}} 個)","JSON copied":"JSON 已複製",JWKS:hFt,"JWKS popover":"各個作用中簽署金鑰由 kid 選定。AWS 在切換使用新金鑰簽署前，會先於此處發布該金鑰。","JWT Outbound signers column Signing algorithm":"簽署演算法","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key":"金鑰演算法","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key issue time":"目前金鑰開始簽署時間","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key popover":"AWS 會產生金鑰，並依自身排程執行金鑰輪換；開始使用新金鑰簽署前，會先將新金鑰發布到 JWKS。金鑰輪換時演算法維持不變，因此讀取 JWKS 的驗證器無需您這端做任何調整。","JWT Outbound signers desc":"為驗證已簽署權杖的系統簽署 JWT-SVID。","JWT Outbound signers label oidc discovery":"OIDC 探索","JWT Outbound signers label oidc discovery popover":"標準探索文件。多數驗證器僅需此 URL，即可從中取得金鑰。","JWT Outbound signers label oidc issuer":"OIDC 發行者","JWT Outbound signers label oidc issuer popover":"此處簽署的每一筆 JWT-SVID 的 iss 宣告。鎖定發行者的驗證器會固定使用此值。","JWT Outbound signers section title":"權杖驗證器資訊","JWT Outbound signers status":"AWS 預設提供","JWT Outbound signers title":"JWT 簽署者",Key:"金鑰","Learn about organization providers":"了解組織提供者","Learn about organization providers (opens in a new tab)":"了解組織提供者 (在新索引標籤中開啟)","Learn more":"進一步了解","Learn more about deleting a provider (opens in a new tab)":"進一步了解如何刪除提供者 (在新分頁中開啟)","Learn more:":"進一步了解：","Less than":"小於","Less than or equal":"小於或等於","Let other accounts or principals in your organization create templates and identities under this provider, within the path prefixes you choose.":"讓組織中的其他帳戶或主體在您選擇的路徑字首內，於此供應商下建立範本和身分。","Let workloads reach non-AWS resources":"讓工作負載存取非 AWS 資源","Letters, digits, . - _ with a single / between parts. No / at the start or end.":"字母、數字、. - _，各部分之間以單個 / 分隔。開頭或結尾不可有 /。","Letters, digits, . - _ with a single / between parts. No / at the start or end. Cannot be changed later.":"字母、數字、. - _，各部分之間以單個 / 分隔。開頭或結尾不可有 /。設定後無法變更。","Light themes":"亮色主題","Ln {{row}}, Col {{column}}":"行 {{row}}，欄 {{column}}","Loading certificate authorities":"正在載入憑證授權機構","Loading code editor":"正在載入程式碼編輯器","Loading tag keys":"正在載入標籤索引鍵","Loading tag values":"正在載入標籤值","Loading tags that are associated with this resource":"正在載入與此資源相關聯的標籤","Loading your organization's providers":"正在載入組織的提供者","Make sure the new certificate authority uses the same algorithm as the current signer, {{algorithm}}. If you choose a different algorithm, you need to disable this signer, delete its certificates, then enable it again with the new authority.":"請確認新的憑證授權機構使用與目前簽署者相同的演算法 {{algorithm}}。若您選擇不同的演算法，則需要停用此簽署者、刪除其憑證，然後以新的授權機構重新啟用。","Manage CAs and replication in the AWS Private CA console":"在 AWS Private CA 主控台管理 CA 與複寫","Manage tags":"管理標籤","Manage the provider":"管理供應商","Manual creation":"手動建立","Manually create":"手動建立","Matching workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.":"相符的工作負載於啟動時即取得專屬身分名稱，不受規模限制。","Maximum 1,000 characters.":"最多 1,000 個字元。","Maximum 255 characters.":"最多 255 個字元。","Member accounts":"會員帳戶","Member accounts can add their own templates, namespaced by account ID.":"會員帳戶可新增自己的範本，依帳戶 ID 設置命名空間。","Member accounts cannot add their own templates.":"會員帳戶不能新增自己的範本。","Minimum signing delay":"最小簽署延遲","Moving item to position {{currentPosition}} of {{total}}":"正在將項目移至第 {{currentPosition}} 個位置 (共 {{total}} 個)","Multiple EKS clusters":"多個 EKS 叢集",Name:"名稱","Name must be 128 characters or less.":"名稱必須為 128 個字元或以下。","Name this identity":"為此身分命名","Name this provider":"為此提供者命名","Name values":"名稱值","Names identities automatically as workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.":"在工作負載啟動時自動命名身分，讓您無需逐一建立或管理它們。","Naming scheme":"命名方案",New:"新增","Next month":"下個月","Next page":"下一頁","Next step":"下一步","No attestation policy set. Define one so a workload can run as this identity.":"尚未設定證明原則。請定義一項原則，讓工作負載能以此身分執行。","No attestation policy. No workload will be issued workload identities from this template until you add one.":"沒有驗證政策。在您新增驗證政策之前，系統不會透過此範本為任何工作負載核發工作負載身分。","No by default, but can add a policy":"預設為否，但可以新增政策","No certificate authorities in this account":"此帳戶中沒有憑證授權機構","no domain":"沒有網域","No long-lived secrets":"無長期有效機密","No match found":"找不到相符項目","No matches":"找不到相符項目","No path segments. Add a fact, condition key, or custom text.":"沒有路徑區段。新增事實、條件索引鍵或自訂文字。","No tags associated with the resource.":"該資源未關聯任何標籤。","No templates added yet":"尚未新增任何範本","No workload identity providers":"無工作負載身分供應商","No workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.":"沒有工作負載符合此範本，故不會產生任何身分。","No, and cannot be granted":"否，且無法授與",None:"無","None – names are defined by templates or declared individually":"無 – 名稱由範本定義或個別宣告","Not saved: {{keys}}.":"未儲存：{{keys}}。","Not set":"未設定",Notifications:"通知","Once the attestation policy is removed, matching workloads will not be issued workload identities until you add a policy again.":"移除驗證政策後，在您重新新增政策之前，系統不會為相符的工作負載核發工作負載身分。","One bundle per provider, and one URL. It carries every authority the provider publishes: both outbound signers, and during an update both the current and incoming certificate authority, which is what lets verifiers accept either one through the handover. Your own AWS workloads get these keys automatically; send this to systems outside AWS.":"每位提供者對應一個套件，以及一個 URL。其載有提供者發布的每個授權認證機構：兩個傳出簽署者，以及在更新期間目前及即將到來的憑證認證機構，這讓驗證者能在交接過程中接受其中任一方。您自己的 AWS 工作負載自動取得這些金鑰；請將此傳送至 AWS 外部系統。","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level providers.":"只有管理帳戶或委派管理員可以刪除組織層級提供者。","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level templates.":"只有管理帳戶或委派管理員可以刪除組織層級範本。","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level workload identities.":"只有管理帳戶或委派管理員可以刪除組織層級工作負載身分。","Opens in a new tab":"在新索引標籤中開啟",Operator:"運算子",Operators:"運算子",optional:"選用",or:"或","Organization provider":"組織提供者","Organization scoped":"組織範圍","Organize the provider and track its cost with tags.":"組織供應商並使用標籤追蹤其成本。","Other accounts in your organization":"您組織中的其他帳戶","Other condition keys":"其他條件索引鍵","Outbound signer":"傳出簽署者","Outbound signers page desc":"讓您的工作負載向 AWS 外部服務證明其身分。此提供者會簽署工作負載呈現的權杖與憑證。","Outbound signers page title":"傳出簽署者","Owning account":"擁有帳戶","Page {{pageNumber}} of all pages":"所有頁面中的第 {{pageNumber}} 頁",path:"路徑",Path:"路徑","path from templates":"來自範本的路徑","Path is the per-workload part of an identity name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts a workload proves.":"路徑是身分名稱中每個工作負載的部分。它會在執行階段根據工作負載證明的事實填入。","Path must be 255 characters or less.":"路徑長度不得超過 255 個字元。","Path pattern":"路徑模式","Path prefix":"路徑前綴","Path prefix must be 64 characters or less.":"路徑字首不得超過 64 個字元。","Path values":"路徑值","Picked up item at position {{position}} of {{total}}":"已選取第 {{position}} 個位置 (共 {{total}} 個) 的項目","Policy details":"政策詳細資訊","Policy: Define how a workload attests to get the identity":"政策：定義工作負載取得身分所需的證明方式",Preferences:mFt,"Press space or enter to activate drag, use arrow keys to move, then press space or enter to confirm":"按空白鍵或 Enter 啟用拖曳，以方向鍵移動項目，再按空白鍵或 Enter 確認放置",Preview:"預覽","Previous CA":"先前的 CA","Previous certificates ({{certificateCount}})":"先前的憑證 ({{certificateCount}})","Previous month":"上個月","Previous page":"上一頁",Properties:"屬性",Property:"屬性",Provided:"已提供",Provider:"提供者","Provider {{providerName}} deleted.":"提供者 {{providerName}} 已刪除。","Provider name":"提供者名稱","Provider name must be 128 characters or less.":"提供者名稱不得超過 128 個字元。","Provider not deleted":"提供者未刪除","Provider not found":"找不到提供者","Provider overview":"提供者概觀","Provider selection":"供應商選取項","Provider settings":"提供者設定","Provider values":"供應商值",Providers:"提供者","Providers to issue workload identities":"發出工作負載身分的提供者","Quick create":"快速建立","Quick create makes an RSA 2048 certificate authority in AWS Private CA in your account, which has its own charges. The algorithm is fixed and cannot be changed later without setting the signer up again.":"快速建立會在您的帳戶中的 AWS Private CA 建立 RSA 2048 憑證授權機構，這會產生額外費用。演算法為固定，若未重新設定簽署者，則稍後無法變更。",Ready:"就緒",Recommended:"建議","Recommended for most workloads":"建議大多數工作負載使用",Refresh:gFt,"Refresh certificate authorities":"重新整理憑證授權機構","Refresh certificate signer status":"重新整理憑證簽署者狀態",Remove:"移除","Remove {{name}}":"移除 {{name}}","Remove attestation policy":"移除驗證政策","Remove cluster ARN":"移除叢集 ARN","Remove condition":"移除條件","Remove filter {{filter}}":"移除篩選條件 {{filter}}","Remove governance policy?":"移除治理政策？","Remove tag {{key}}":"移除標籤 {{key}}","Removed tags were not saved":"移除的標籤未儲存","Reorder {{name}}":"重新排序 {{name}}","Reordering canceled":"重新排序已取消","Required for service mesh providers.":"服務網格提供者需要此項。","Required for service mesh providers. A service mesh provider is scoped to the account that runs the EKS cluster.":"服務網格提供者需要此項。服務網格提供者會限定在執行 EKS 叢集的帳戶範圍內。","Reset to default":"重設為預設值","Resize handle":"調整大小控點","Resolved example:":"已解析的範例：","Restricted by":"受下列限制",Retry:"重試","Review the tags and save again.":"檢閱標籤並再次儲存。","Running a service mesh, such as Istio? It needs its own provider, one per cluster.":"是否正在執行服務網格 (例如 Istio)？它需要自己的提供者，每個叢集一個。",Save:"儲存","Save changes":"儲存變更","Save or cancel your edits before creating templates.":"建立範本之前，應先儲存或取消編輯。","Save or cancel your edits before creating the provider.":"建立提供者之前，請先儲存或取消編輯。","Save or cancel your template edits to change the scope.":"儲存或取消您的範本編輯，以變更範圍。",scheme:"方案",Scheme:"方案","scheme and trust domain":"配置和信任網域","Scheme sets the format this provider uses to name identities.":"方案會設定此提供者用來命名身分的格式。",Scope:"範圍","Scope sets which accounts are allowed to use this provider.":"範圍會設定允許使用此提供者的帳戶。","Scope values":"範圍值","Search tags":"搜尋標籤","Segment that partitions identities.":"用以劃分身分的區段。","Select {{name}}":"選取 {{name}}","Select a row to delete.":"選取要刪除的資料列。",Set:"集合","Set a naming pattern":"設定命名模式","Set an attestation rule":"設定證明規則","Set by your provider.":"由您的提供者設定。","Set the naming format and usage scope that every workload identity from this provider inherits.":"設定此提供者每個工作負載身分繼承的命名格式與使用範圍。","Set the unique path pattern that every workload identity generated by this template follows. Cannot be changed later.":"設定此範本所產生的每個工作負載身分都會遵循的唯一路徑模式。範本建立後即無法變更。","Set up a provider to hold the templates that generate identity names, the identities you declare directly, and the signers that sign credentials for systems outside AWS.":"設定提供者以保留產生身分名稱的範本、您直接宣告的身分，以及為 AWS 外部系統的憑證進行簽署的簽署者。","Set up a service mesh provider for this account":"為此帳戶設定服務網格提供者","Set up a way to issue workload identities":"設定發出工作負載身分的方法","Set up for your use cases":"針對您的使用案例進行設定","Sets your trust domain, the start of every identity name.":"設定您的信任網域，作為每個身分名稱的開頭。","Setting up the certificate authority stopped. You can continue from where it left off.":"設定憑證授權機構已停止。您可以從中斷處繼續。","Settings from your provider {{providerName}}":"來自您提供者 {{providerName}} 的設定","Short-lived credentials renew automatically and follow the SPIFFE standard, so they work with service meshes like Istio and with SaaS applications.":"短期憑證會自動續約並遵循 SPIFFE 標準，因此可與 Istio 等服務網格及 SaaS 應用程式搭配使用。","Show all {{errorCount}} errors":"顯示所有 {{errorCount}} 個錯誤","Show fewer":"顯示更少","Show more":"顯示更多","Signing algorithm":"簽署演算法","Signing resumes immediately, because this certificate is still published in the trust bundle.":"簽署會立即恢復，因為此憑證仍發佈於信任套件中。","Signing start time":"簽署開始時間","Some templates could not be loaded":"有些範本無法載入","Something went wrong":"發生錯誤","Sortable path segment":"可排序路徑區段",Status:"狀態","Status bar":"狀態列","Stop access you granted to this identity name from working":"讓您授予此身分名稱的存取權限停止運作","Stop access you granted to those identity names from working":"讓您授予這些身分名稱的存取權限停止運作","Stop matching workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request":"停止相符的工作負載取得身分，使其在下次請求時失敗","Stop the identities it generated from resolving":"停止解析其所產生的身分","Stop the workload running as this identity, so it fails on its next request":"停止以此身分執行的工作負載，使其在下次請求時失敗","Stopped signing and no longer in the trust bundle, so nothing verifies against them. Deleting one is safe.":"已停止簽署且不再位於信任套件中，因此沒有任何東西會依據它們進行驗證。刪除其中一個是安全的。",Subject:"主題",Success:"成功","Tag keys could not be retrieved":"無法擷取標籤索引鍵","Tag values could not be retrieved":"無法擷取標籤值",Tags:"標籤","Tags could not be loaded":"無法載入標籤","Tags for {{name}} have been updated.":"已更新 {{name}} 的標籤。","Tags not saved":"標籤未儲存",Template:"範本",'Template "{{templateId}}" not found.':'找不到範本 "{{templateId}}"。',"Template {{name}}: {{reason}}":"範本 {{name}}：{{reason}}","Template {{templateName}} deleted.":"範本 {{templateName}} 已刪除。","Template {{templateNames}} created.":"範本 {{templateNames}} 已建立。","Template name":"範本名稱","Template name must be 128 characters or less.":"範本名稱不得超過 128 個字元。","Template name values":"範本名稱值","Template: {{name}}":"範本：{{name}}",Templates:"範本","Templates ({{total}})":"範本 ({{total}})","Templates are being created. Wait for the request to finish.":"正在建立範本。等待請求完成。","Templates give matching workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.":"範本會自動為相符的工作負載指派專屬身分名稱。各範本皆會使用此提供者的名稱前綴，搭配路徑與模式。","Templates that member accounts created under this provider are not visible here and cannot be deleted from this account. If any exist, deleting the provider fails.":"會員帳戶在此提供者下建立的範本不會顯示在這裡，也無法從此帳戶刪除。如果有任何範本存在，刪除提供者會失敗。","Templates: {{reason}}":"範本：{{reason}}","The account that owns the certificate authority.":"擁有憑證授權機構的帳號。","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it.":"證明政策控制此提供者核發身分的方式。工作負載必須符合每個條件，例如其類型、詳細資訊及執行位置，並由託管該工作負載的服務提供擔保。","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.":"證明政策控制此提供者核發身分的方式。工作負載必須符合每個條件，例如其類型、詳細資訊及執行位置，並由託管該工作負載的服務提供擔保。可稍後編輯。","The attestation policy controls which workloads get an identity from this provider. A workload must meet every condition, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. It's generated from the EKS clusters you entered. You can edit it later.":"證明政策控制哪些工作負載可從此提供者取得身分。工作負載必須符合每個條件，並由代管它的服務提供擔保。該政策是根據您輸入的 EKS 叢集產生。您可以稍後編輯。","The attestation policy lists the facts a workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so a workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.":"驗證政策列出了工作負載在此提供者核發身分之前必須證明的事實。運算平台會為這些事實背書，因此工作負載無法宣稱不屬於自己的身分。","The attester vouches for the workload, and it must match every condition to run as this identity.":"證明者會為工作負載背書，而工作負載必須符合所有條件，才能以此身分執行。","The certificate authority is still being set up.":"憑證授權機構仍在設定中。","The ID at the end of the certificate authority's ARN in AWS Private CA.":"AWS Private CA 中憑證授權機構 ARN 結尾的 ID。","The identity name is the provider's naming scheme, a path prefix, and a path pattern.":"身分名稱由提供者的命名方案、路徑前綴與路徑模式組成。","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag key is 128.":"可在標籤索引鍵中使用的字元數量上限為 128 個。","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag value is 256.":"可在標籤值中使用的字元數量上限為 256 個。","The path can be up to {{maxLength}} characters.":"路徑長度不超過 {{maxLength}} 個字元。","The path doesn't support these segments: {{segments}}. Remove them, and add what you need from the following cards.":"路徑不支援這些區段：{{segments}}。請移除它們，並從下列卡片新增您需要的區段。","The path is already the default.":"路徑已經是預設值。","The path is the per-workload part of each identity's name. Keep the Region in front so names stay unique across accounts and Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.":"路徑是每個身分名稱中屬於各工作負載的部分。將區域保留在前面，以確保名稱在不同帳戶和區域間保持唯一性，或重新排列區段以符合團隊的命名慣例。","The path prefixes your policy allows":"您的政策允許的路徑字首","The permissions defined in this policy for <b>{{providerName}}</b> stop applying.":"此政策中為 {{providerName}} 定義的許可停止適用。","The provider could not be deleted. Try again.":"提供者無法刪除。請再試一次。","The provider is being created. Wait for the request to finish.":"正在建立提供者，請等候請求完成。","The provider might still be deleted. Check the providers list later.":"提供者可能仍會被刪除。稍後查看提供者清單。","The resource policy on this provider controls who can associate templates with it.":"此提供者的資源政策可控制能夠關聯範本與該資源的人員。","The soonest the new certificate can take over. It publishes to the trust bundle first, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. Signing may start later than this, never sooner.":"此為新憑證最早可以接管的時間。它會先發佈到信任套件，讓每個驗證者都能在其底下簽署任何內容之前先行檢查。簽署開始的時間可能晚於此時間，但絕不會更早。","The soonest this certificate can start signing. It publishes to the trust bundle first, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. Signing may start later than this, never sooner.":"此憑證最早可以開始簽署的時間。它會先發佈到信任套件，因此每個驗證者都能在其底下簽署任何內容之前檢查它。簽署可能比此時間晚開始，絕不會更早。",Theme:"主題","There was an error loading the code editor.":"載入程式碼編輯器時發生錯誤。","These clusters set the template's <policyLink>attestation policy</policyLink>.":"這些叢集會設定範本的<policyLink>證明政策</policyLink>。","These resources need to be deleted before deleting the provider.":"刪除提供者之前需要刪除這些資源。","This account ({{accountId}})":"此帳戶 ({{accountId}})","This action deletes the workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.":"此動作會刪除工作負載身分提供者 <b>{{providerName}}</b>。","This cannot be undone, and creating a provider with the same name later does not restore anything. To proceed, complete the steps below.":"此動作無法復原，之後建立同名提供者也無法還原任何內容。若要繼續，請完成下列步驟。","This cannot be undone, and the path this template reserved stays reserved. No future template can generate identities under it.":"此動作無法復原，此範本保留的路徑將保持保留狀態。未來的任何範本都無法在其下產生身分。","This cannot be undone, and this name stays reserved. It is never issued again, so you cannot recreate this identity under the same name.":"此動作無法復原，此名稱將保持保留狀態。它永遠不會再被核發，因此您無法以相同名稱重新建立此身分。","This certificate authority uses {{caAlgorithm}}. Rotation keeps the signer's {{signerAlgorithm}} algorithm, so choose a {{signerAlgorithm}} certificate authority instead.":"此憑證認證機構使用 {{caAlgorithm}}。輪替會保留簽署者的 {{signerAlgorithm}} 演算法，因此，請改為選擇一個 {{signerAlgorithm}} 憑證認證機構。","This certificate has left the trust bundle, so it publishes again first. Signing starts after about {{hours}} hour, once every region has it.":"此憑證已離開信任套件，因此其會先再次發布。簽署將在約 {{hours}} 小時後開始，屆時每個區域均會擁有該憑證。","This certificate has left the trust bundle, so it publishes again first. Signing starts after about {{hours}} hours, once every region has it.":"此憑證已離開信任套件，因此其會先再次發布。簽署將在約 {{hours}} 小時後開始，屆時每個區域均會擁有該憑證。","This certificate is validating, so deleting it stops verification immediately":"此憑證正在驗證，因此刪除它會立即停止驗證","This certificate stopped signing and its chain has left the trust bundle, so nothing verifies against it. It stays listed as history until you delete it, and deleting it is safe: no credential depends on it, and the certificate signer keeps signing.":"已停止簽署此憑證，並且其憑證鏈已離開信任套件，因此，不會依據該憑證鏈驗證任何內容。在您刪除該憑證鏈之前，其仍會列為歷史記錄，且將其刪除是安全的：沒有依賴該憑證鏈的任何憑證，且憑證簽署者會持續簽署。","This cluster is already listed.":"此叢集已列出。","This condition key and operator combination already exists":"此條件索引鍵與運算子的組合已存在","This doesn't look like a valid EKS cluster ARN. An invalid ARN will leave workloads in that cluster without an identity.":"這看起來不是有效的 EKS 叢集 ARN。無效的 ARN 會讓該叢集中的工作負載沒有身分。","This management account and delegated administrators":"此管理帳戶與委派管理員","This organization ({{organizationId}})":"此組織 ({{organizationId}})","This policy's cluster ARNs don't match the clusters you entered. Changing the clusters won't update this policy. Continue only if that's intended.":"此政策的叢集 ARN 與您輸入的叢集不符。變更叢集不會更新此政策。僅在有意如此時才繼續。","This provider has no naming scheme, so the path you enter is the full identity name.":"此提供者沒有命名配置，因此您輸入的路徑就是完整的身分名稱。","This provider names every identity using the open standard.":"此提供者使用開放標準對每個身分命名。","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. Both certificates below stop, including the one still in transition, so the update does not complete. Both stay configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"此提供者會立即停止簽發 X.509-SVID，需要用戶端憑證的工作負載會在下一次請求時開始失敗。下方兩個憑證均會停止，包括仍在轉換中的憑證，因此更新無法完成。兩者均保持已設定狀態。已簽發的憑證會繼續驗證約 12 小時，啟用後會恢復簽署。","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"此提供者會立即停止簽發 X.509-SVID，需要用戶端憑證的工作負載會在下一次請求時開始失敗。下方的憑證仍保持設定。已簽發的憑證會繼續驗證約 12 小時，啟用後會恢復簽署。","This provider's policy doesn't allow this path prefix \"{{pathPrefix}}\" for your account. Ask your organization administrator which path prefixes are permitted.":'此身分提供者的政策不允許為您的帳戶使用此路徑字首 "{{pathPrefix}}"。請洽詢您的組織管理員，確認允許哪些路徑字首。',"This removes the certificate from the provider and pulls its chain from the trust bundle immediately. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"這會從提供者中移除憑證，並立即將其鏈從信任套件組合中移除。憑證授權單位本身保留在 AWS Private CA 中，維持不變。","This removes the certificate from the provider. Its chain already left the trust bundle, so nothing that is verifying today changes. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"這會從提供者中移除憑證。其鏈已離開信任套件組合，因此目前正在驗證的任何內容都不會改變。憑證授權單位本身保留在 AWS Private CA 中，維持不變。","This tag will be removed upon saving changes":"此標籤會在儲存變更後移除","This usually takes a few minutes. Keep this page open until it finishes.":"這通常需要幾分鐘。請保持此頁面開啟直到完成。",Today:"今天","Too many requests":"請求過多","Trace and control access per workload":"追蹤和控制每個工作負載的存取","Trust bundle":"信任套件","trust domain":"信任網域","Trust domain":"信任網域","Trust domain is the root of trust for the SPIFFE naming scheme. It is a logical name that follows DNS naming style, for example prod.acme.com, but does not need to match a real DNS record.":"信任網域是 SPIFFE 命名方案的信任根。它是一個遵循 DNS 命名風格的邏輯名稱，例如 prod.acme.com，但不需要符合真實的 DNS 記錄。","Try again. If the problem continues, contact AWS Support.":"請重試。若問題持續發生，請聯絡 AWS Support。","Unable to load templates":"無法載入範本",Undo:"復原","Up to 128 characters. Must be unique per provider.":"最多 128 個字元。每個提供者必須唯一。","Up to 128 characters. Use alphanumeric and '-_.' characters. Must be unique in your organization. Can't be changed after the provider is created.":"最多 128 個字元。使用英數字元及 '-_.' 字元。在您的組織中必須是唯一的。建立提供者之後不可變更。","Up to 128 characters. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters. Must be unique per provider.":"最多 128 個字元。使用英數字元和 '-_' 字元。每個提供者的名稱必須是唯一的。",Update:"更新","Update certificate signer":"更新憑證簽署者",'Use "{{key}}"':'使用 "{{key}}"','Use "{{value}}"':'使用 "{{value}}"',"Use case":"使用案例","Use cases":"使用案例","Use default templates":"使用預設範本","Use letters, digits, and . - _ characters, with a single / between parts. No / at the start or end, and a part can't be . or ..":"使用字母、數字和 . - _ 字元，各部分之間以單個 / 分隔。開頭和結尾不可有 /，且各部分不能為 . 或 ..","Use one from another account":"使用另一個帳戶的項目","Use only Latin letters, numbers, spaces, tabs, line breaks, and standard keyboard symbols.":"僅使用拉丁字母、數字、空格、定位字元、換行符號和標準鍵盤符號。","Use only letters, digits, - and _ characters.":"僅使用字母、數字、- 和 _ 字元。","Use only letters, digits, . - and _ characters. The path can't be . or ..":"僅可使用字母、數字、.、- 和 _ 字元。路徑不能是 . 或 ..","Use only letters, digits, periods (.), hyphens (-), and underscores (_).":"僅可使用字母、數字、句點 (.)、連字號 (-) 和底線 (_)。","Use the workload identity in trust policies, resource policies, or SCPs. Each call is recorded in CloudTrail with the workload's identity.":"在信任政策、資源政策或 SCP 中使用工作負載身分。每個呼叫都會連同工作負載的身分一併記錄在 CloudTrail 中。",'Use: "{{text}}"':'使用："{{text}}"',"Used as the common name in the certificate authority's subject.":"用作憑證授權機構主體中的一般名稱。",Validating:vFt,"Validating: stopped signing, still trusted":"正在驗證：已停止簽署，仍信任",Value:"值","Value must be 256 characters or less.":"值不得超過 256 個字元。",Values:"值","View all":"檢視全部","View all notifications":"檢視所有通知","View JSON":"檢視 JSON",Visual:fFt,Warning:"警告",Warnings:"警告","What gets created":"建立了哪些內容？","Which EKS clusters is this provider for?":"此提供者適用於哪些 EKS 叢集？",'Wildcard "*" is only allowed with the StringLike, StringNotLike, ArnLike, or ArnNotLike operators.':'萬用字元 "*" 僅適用於 StringLike、StringNotLike、ArnLike 或 ArnNotLike 運算子。',"Without a policy, no other account can create templates under this provider, though delegated administrators can already create both. Add a statement for each account, organizational unit, or IAM principal that should be able to, and limit each one to a path prefix.":"如果沒有政策，其他帳戶無法在此提供者下建立範本，儘管委派管理員仍然可以建立兩者。為每個應能夠執行的帳戶、組織單位或 IAM 主體新增陳述式，並將每個限制為路徑字首。","Workload identities ({{total}})":"工作負載身分 ({{total}})","Workload identities in the IAM User Guide":"IAM 使用者指南中的工作負載身分","Workload identities in the IAM User Guide (opens in a new tab)":"IAM 使用者指南中的工作負載身分 (在新索引標籤中開啟)","Workload identities: {{reason}}":"工作負載身分：{{reason}}","Workload identity":"工作負載身分","Workload Identity":"工作負載身分","Workload identity {{name}}: {{reason}}":"工作負載身分 {{name}}：{{reason}}","Workload identity {{workloadIdentifier}} deleted.":"工作負載身分 {{workloadIdentifier}} 已刪除。","Workloads get named automatically":"工作負載會自動命名","Workloads in these EKS clusters can get an identity from this provider, when all of these are true:":"當以下所有條件均成立時，這些 EKS 叢集中的工作負載可以從此提供者取得身分:","Workloads running in these clusters can get an identity from this provider. Add 2 or more.":"在這些叢集中執行的工作負載可以從此提供者取得身分。請新增 2 個或更多。","Workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"在此帳戶中執行的工作負載可以使用此範本根據經 {{workloadLabel}} 驗證之資訊所產生的身分。","Workloads running in this cluster can get an identity from this provider.":"在此叢集中執行的工作負載可以從此提供者取得身分。","Workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"在您組織中執行的工作負載可以使用此範本根據經 {{workloadLabel}} 驗證之資訊所產生的身分。","Workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request":"使用這些身分的工作負載將停止獲得憑證，並在下次請求時失敗","Workloads, such as agents, pods, and jobs, are verified at runtime and get a workload identity, one per workload, generated by a template. The identity gets fine-grained access to AWS resources through IAM policies and CloudTrail, and signed JWT and X.509 credentials for meshes and SaaS apps.":"代理程式、Pod 和任務等工作負載會在執行時間進行驗證，並取得由範本產生的工作負載身分，每個工作負載各一個。該身分可透過 IAM 政策和 CloudTrail 精細存取 AWS 資源，並可使用已簽署的 JWT 和 X.509 憑證與網格及 SaaS 應用程式整合。","Wrap lines":"換行","Write a policy to let another account create templates, or to stop a delegated administrator from part of the name space. Each statement names an organizational unit, specific accounts, or individual IAM principals, allows or denies, and can be limited to a path prefix.":"撰寫政策以讓另一個帳戶建立範本，或阻止委派管理員使用部分命名空間。每個陳述式會指名組織單位、特定帳戶或個別 IAM 主體，允許或拒絕，並可限制於路徑字首。","Yes by default":"預設為是","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tag.":"您最多可以再新增 {{availableTags}} 個標籤。","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tags.":"您最多可以再新增 {{availableTags}} 個標籤。","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"您已超過 {{tagLimit}} 個標籤的限制。","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"您已超過 {{tagLimit}} 個標籤的限制。","You have more keys than can be displayed":"您的索引鍵個數超過可顯示的數量","You have more values than can be displayed":"您的值個數超過可顯示的數量","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"您已達到 {{tagLimit}} 個標籤的上限。","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"您已達到 {{tagLimit}} 個標籤的限制。","You have unsaved tag changes. Leave this page and discard them?":"您有未儲存的標籤變更。要離開此頁面並捨棄變更嗎？","You must enter a path":"您必須輸入路徑","You must specify a condition key":"必須指定條件索引鍵","You must specify a tag key":"您必須指定標籤索引鍵","You must specify a unique tag key.":"您必須指定唯一的標籤索引鍵。","You must specify a value":"必須指定值","Your administrator decides which prefixes this account can use. This is checked when you create.":"由管理員決定此帳戶可使用哪些前綴。建立時會執行檢查。","Your identities will be <code>{{prefix}}<em>{{placeholder}}</em></code>":"您的身分將為 <code>{{prefix}}<em>{{placeholder}}</em></code>","Your organization already has a workload identity provider. Add templates under it to start issuing identities to your workloads — each named under your account's path prefix.":"您的組織已經有一個工作負載身分提供者。在其下新增範本，以開始向工作負載簽發身分，每個身分均以您的帳戶的路徑字首命名。","Your organization has workload identity providers you can use. Pick one and add templates under it to start issuing identities to your workloads.":"您的組織有供您使用的工作負載身分提供者。請選擇一個，然後在其下新增範本，以便開始向工作負載簽發身分。","YYYY/MM/DD":"YYYY/MM/DD","{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.","A declared identity has a fixed name you define. Use one when you need an exact name, for example to match a name another system already expects.":"A declared identity has a fixed name you define. Use one when you need an exact name, for example to match a name another system already expects.","A fact {{workload}} checks when the agent or workload starts.":"A fact {{workload}} checks when the agent or workload starts.","A provider issues secure, verifiable identities to your agents and workloads, like your Kubernetes pods or AI agents, to access AWS and third-party services without long-lived credentials.":"A provider issues secure, verifiable identities to your agents and workloads, like your Kubernetes pods or AI agents, to access AWS and third-party services without long-lived credentials.","A template automatically generates an identity for each matching agent or workload under {{providerName}}.":"A template automatically generates an identity for each matching agent or workload under {{providerName}}.","A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued.":"A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued.","A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued. Decide how this provider issues identities - starting from the <link>default templates</link> for common use cases, or skipping them. Templates are optional and can be added later.":"A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued. Decide how this provider issues identities - starting from the <link>default templates</link> for common use cases, or skipping them. Templates are optional and can be added later.","A template names identities automatically as matching agents and workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.":"A template names identities automatically as matching agents and workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.","A template with no attestation policy matches no agent or workload, so nothing is ever issued from it. Set a policy to define which agents and workloads qualify.":"A template with no attestation policy matches no agent or workload, so nothing is ever issued from it. Set a policy to define which agents and workloads qualify.","A template's path pattern, built from facts like cluster, namespace, and service account, names each agent or workload automatically when it starts. You don't create identities ahead of time.":"A template's path pattern, built from facts like cluster, namespace, and service account, names each agent or workload automatically when it starts. You don't create identities ahead of time.","Add a fact or condition key. A path of only custom text would give every agent or workload the same name.":"Add a fact or condition key. A path of only custom text would give every agent or workload the same name.","Add an {{conditionKey}} condition, so only agents or workloads in these clusters get an identity.":"Add an {{conditionKey}} condition, so only agents or workloads in these clusters get an identity.","Add attestation policy":"Add attestation policy","Add templates after the provider is created.":"Add templates after the provider is created.","Agent and workload identity":"Agent and workload identity","Agent and workload identity - <em>Preview</em>":"Agent and workload identity - <em>Preview</em>","Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide":"Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide","Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide (opens in a new tab)":"Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide (opens in a new tab)","Agents and workloads get named automatically":"Agents and workloads get named automatically","Agents and workloads get short-lived credentials that renew automatically and follow the SPIFFE standard, so they work with service meshes such as Istio and with business applications.":"Agents and workloads get short-lived credentials that renew automatically and follow the SPIFFE standard, so they work with service meshes such as Istio and with business applications.","Agents and workloads in these EKS clusters can get an identity from this provider, when all of these are true:":"Agents and workloads in these EKS clusters can get an identity from this provider, when all of these are true:","Agents and workloads running in these clusters can get an identity from this provider. Add two or more.":"Agents and workloads running in these clusters can get an identity from this provider. Add two or more.","Agents and workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Agents and workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.","Agents and workloads running in this cluster can get an identity from this provider.":"Agents and workloads running in this cluster can get an identity from this provider.","Agents and workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Agents and workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.","Agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request":"Agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request","Agents and workloads, such as AI agents and pods, are verified at runtime and each gets its own identity, generated by a template. The identity gets fine-grained access to AWS resources through IAM policies and CloudTrail, and signed JWT and X.509 credentials for meshes and apps.":"Agents and workloads, such as AI agents and pods, are verified at runtime and each gets its own identity, generated by a template. The identity gets fine-grained access to AWS resources through IAM policies and CloudTrail, and signed JWT and X.509 credentials for meshes and apps.","All templates and identities under this provider will be deleted":"All templates and identities under this provider will be deleted","An AI agent or workload gets an identity that is unique.":"An AI agent or workload gets an identity that is unique.","An identity with no attestation policy admits no workload, so nothing can run as it. Set a policy to define which workload qualifies.":"An identity with no attestation policy admits no workload, so nothing can run as it. Set a policy to define which workload qualifies.","An identity with this name already exists.":"An identity with this name already exists.","At runtime the platform attests these facts about the agent or workload. Any agent or workload whose attestation carries them gets an identity issued from this template.":"At runtime the platform attests these facts about the agent or workload. Any agent or workload whose attestation carries them gets an identity issued from this template.","Attestation policy for {{name}} has been removed.":"Attestation policy for {{name}} has been removed.","Attestation policy for {{name}} has been updated.":"Attestation policy for {{name}} has been updated.","By continuing, you also enable organization level resource creation, which is needed to create the organization scoped provider. You can disable it later in Settings.":"By continuing, you also enable organization level resource creation, which is needed to create the organization scoped provider. You can disable it later in Settings.","Change the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.":"Change the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.","Choose a stable, unique name that identifies one environment or group of agents and workloads, for example prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal.":"Choose a stable, unique name that identifies one environment or group of agents and workloads, for example prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal.","Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for an agent or workload.":"Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for an agent or workload.","Choose the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.":"Choose the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.","Choose where the workload is hosted":"Choose where the workload is hosted","Choose who can use it":"Choose who can use it","Control what an agent or workload can reach with familiar IAM policies and see its AWS calls in CloudTrail.":"Control what an agent or workload can reach with familiar IAM policies and see its AWS calls in CloudTrail.","Create declared identity":"Create declared identity","Creates an agent and workload identity provider and template for agents and workloads running in one or more EKS clusters under a service mesh, such as Istio.":"Creates an agent and workload identity provider and template for agents and workloads running in one or more EKS clusters under a service mesh, such as Istio.","Creating the identity":"Creating the identity","Declare an identity with the exact name you need":"Declare an identity with the exact name you need","Declared identities":"Declared identities","Declared identity":"Declared identity","Declared identity {{name}} created.":"Declared identity {{name}} created.","Define which agents and workloads are allowed to use this template.":"Define which agents and workloads are allowed to use this template.","Delete the templates under <b>{{providerName}}</b> before deleting the provider. Once deleted, agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials and fail on their next request, and access that you granted to these identities will stop working.":"Delete the templates under <b>{{providerName}}</b> before deleting the provider. Once deleted, agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials and fail on their next request, and access that you granted to these identities will stop working.","Deleting templates and identities":"Deleting templates and identities","Each identity is fully the template path.":"Each identity is fully the template path.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.","Enter a description":"Enter a description","Failed to create the declared identity.":"Failed to create the declared identity.","Failed to save attestation policy.":"Failed to save attestation policy.","Filter declared identities":"Filter declared identities","For example, to match a name another system already expects.":"For example, to match a name another system already expects.","from provider":"from provider","Give AI agents and workloads their own identities. Know which of them made each call. Scope its access with the IAM policies you already use.":"Give AI agents and workloads their own identities. Know which of them made each call. Scope its access with the IAM policies you already use.","Give an agent or workload a unique identity, so you can grant it access and audit what it did rather than sharing one role.":"Give an agent or workload a unique identity, so you can grant it access and audit what it did rather than sharing one role.","Grant access":"Grant access","Grant this name access to resources in IAM policies.":"Grant this name access to resources in IAM policies.","IAM for agents and workloads":"IAM for agents and workloads","IAM for agents and workloads (opens in a new tab)":"IAM for agents and workloads (opens in a new tab)",Identifier:yFt,"Identities ({{total}})":"Identities ({{total}})","Identities are issued at runtime from facts the agent or workload proves, rather than from what an admin assigns.":"Identities are issued at runtime from facts the agent or workload proves, rather than from what an admin assigns.","Identities for agents":"Identities for agents","Identities: {{reason}}":"Identities: {{reason}}","Identity {{name}}: {{reason}}":"Identity {{name}}: {{reason}}","Invalid trust domain. Use lowercase alphanumeric and '-.' characters.":"Invalid trust domain. Use lowercase alphanumeric and '-.' characters.","Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's agents and workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. Standard pricing applies to the creation and use of AWS Private CA.":"Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's agents and workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. Standard pricing applies to the creation and use of AWS Private CA.","It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so agents and workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. To avoid this, wait until it becomes inactive on its own. Deleting it then has no effect on verification.":"It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so agents and workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. To avoid this, wait until it becomes inactive on its own. Deleting it then has no effect on verification.","Let agents and workloads reach non-AWS resources":"Let agents and workloads reach non-AWS resources","Loading declared identities":"Loading declared identities","Matching agents and workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.":"Matching agents and workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.","No agent and workload identity providers":"No agent and workload identity providers","No agent or workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.":"No agent or workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.","No attestation policy attached.":"No attestation policy attached.","No attestation policy. No agent or workload will be issued an identity from this template until you add one.":"No attestation policy. No agent or workload will be issued an identity from this template until you add one.","No conditions. This policy matches every agent or workload of its service.":"No conditions. This policy matches every agent or workload of its service.","No segments yet. Add at least one, or every agent or workload this template matches resolves to the same name.":"No segments yet. Add at least one, or every agent or workload this template matches resolves to the same name.","None – names are defined by templates":"None – names are defined by templates","Nothing can run as this identity":"Nothing can run as this identity","Once the attestation policy is removed, matching agents and workloads will not be issued agent and workload identities until you add a policy again.":"Once the attestation policy is removed, matching agents and workloads will not be issued agent and workload identities until you add a policy again.","One bundle per provider, and one URL. It carries every authority the provider publishes: both outbound signers, and during an update both the current and incoming certificate authority, which is what lets verifiers accept either one through the handover. Your own AWS agents and workloads get these keys automatically; send this to systems outside AWS.":"One bundle per provider, and one URL. It carries every authority the provider publishes: both outbound signers, and during an update both the current and incoming certificate authority, which is what lets verifiers accept either one through the handover. Your own AWS agents and workloads get these keys automatically; send this to systems outside AWS.","One provider and one trust domain shared by every EKS cluster in the mesh. An agent or workload with the same namespace and service account in any of these clusters shares one identity.":"One provider and one trust domain shared by every EKS cluster in the mesh. An agent or workload with the same namespace and service account in any of these clusters shares one identity.","Path is the unique part of each identity's name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts an agent or workload proves.":"Path is the unique part of each identity's name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts an agent or workload proves.","path prefix":"path prefix","Policy: Define how an agent or workload attests to get the identity":"Policy: Define how an agent or workload attests to get the identity","Proven at runtime":"Proven at runtime","Providers to issue agent and workload identities":"Providers to issue agent and workload identities","Scoped, auditable access":"Scoped, auditable access","Search by name":"Search by name","Set the exact name":"Set the exact name","Set the naming format and usage scope that every agent and workload identity from this provider inherits.":"Set the naming format and usage scope that every agent and workload identity from this provider inherits.","Set the unique path pattern that every identity generated by this template follows. Cannot be changed later.":"Set the unique path pattern that every identity generated by this template follows. Cannot be changed later.","Set up a provider to hold the templates that generate identity names and the signers that sign credentials for systems outside AWS.":"Set up a provider to hold the templates that generate identity names and the signers that sign credentials for systems outside AWS.","Set up a way to issue agent and workload identities":"Set up a way to issue agent and workload identities","Set which workloads can use this identity and where they must run.":"Set which workloads can use this identity and where they must run.","Stop matching agents and workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request":"Stop matching agents and workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request","Templates give matching agents and workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.":"Templates give matching agents and workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it.":"The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.":"The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Generated from the EKS clusters above. Can be edited later.":"The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Generated from the EKS clusters above. Can be edited later.","The attestation policy controls how this identity is issued. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.":"The attestation policy controls how this identity is issued. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.","The attestation policy is the set of facts an agent or workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so an agent or workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.":"The attestation policy is the set of facts an agent or workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so an agent or workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.","The certificate chain is distributing to every Region, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. It starts signing at {{at}}. That is the minimum signing delay you set, so signing may start later than this. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.":"The certificate chain is distributing to every Region, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. It starts signing at {{at}}. That is the minimum signing delay you set, so signing may start later than this. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.","The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Account ID and Region in front so names stay unique across accounts and Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.":"The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Account ID and Region in front so names stay unique across accounts and Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.","The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Region in front so names stay unique across Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.":"The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Region in front so names stay unique across Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.","This action deletes the agent and workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.":"This action deletes the agent and workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.","This certificate has stopped signing, but its chain stays in the trust bundle so certificates already issued under it keep verifying. It becomes inactive at {{at}}. Until then, Enable resumes signing with no wait. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.":"This certificate has stopped signing, but its chain stays in the trust bundle so certificates already issued under it keep verifying. It becomes inactive at {{at}}. Until then, Enable resumes signing with no wait. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.","This doesn't look like a valid EKS cluster ARN. An invalid ARN will leave agents or workloads in that cluster without an identity.":"This doesn't look like a valid EKS cluster ARN. An invalid ARN will leave agents or workloads in that cluster without an identity.","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. Both certificates below stop, including the one still in transition, so the update does not complete. Both stay configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. Both certificates below stop, including the one still in transition, so the update does not complete. Both stay configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.","This template issues no identities":"This template issues no identities","Trust domain must be 64 characters or less.":"Trust domain must be 64 characters or less.","Use the agent or workload identity in trust policies, resource policies, or SCPs. CloudTrail records its calls with that identity.":"Use the agent or workload identity in trust policies, resource policies, or SCPs. CloudTrail records its calls with that identity.","What conditions should the agent or workload match?":"What conditions should the agent or workload match?","Where is the agent or workload hosted?":"Where is the agent or workload hosted?","You must enter a name":"You must enter a name","Your organization already has an agent and workload identity provider. Add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads — each named under your account's path prefix.":"Your organization already has an agent and workload identity provider. Add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads — each named under your account's path prefix.","Your organization has agent and workload identity providers you can use. Pick one and add templates under it to start issuing identitie