n take up to 24 hours.","1. Select all the check boxes to confirm what deleting {{providerName}} will do.":"1. Select all the check boxes to confirm what deleting {{providerName}} will do.","2. Confirm that you want to delete this provider by typing {{providerName}} below.":"2. Confirm that you want to delete this provider by typing {{providerName}} below.","A declared identity has a fixed name you define. Use one when you need an exact name, for example to match a name another system already expects.":"A declared identity has a fixed name you define. Use one when you need an exact name, for example to match a name another system already expects.","A declared identity has a fixed path you define. Use one when you need an exact path, for example to match a value another system already expects.":"A declared identity has a fixed path you define. Use one when you need an exact path, for example to match a value another system already expects.","A deny, and only for delegated administrators":"A deny, and only for delegated administrators","A fact {{workload}} checks when the agent or workload starts.":"A fact {{workload}} checks when the agent or workload starts.","A fixed label, such as an environment name.":"A fixed label, such as an environment name.","A name to identify this identity.":"A name to identify this identity.","A provider issues secure, verifiable identities to your agents and workloads, like your Kubernetes pods or AI agents, to access AWS and third-party services without long-lived credentials.":"A provider issues secure, verifiable identities to your agents and workloads, like your Kubernetes pods or AI agents, to access Amazon Web Services and third-party services without long-lived credentials.","A provider with this name already exists.":"A provider with this name already exists.","A tag is a label you assign to an AWS resource. Each tag has a key and an optional value. Use tags to search and filter this provider, or to track your AWS costs.":"A tag 