ic and '-_' characters.":"Invalid template name. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters.","Invalid trust domain. Use lowercase alphanumeric and '-.' characters.":"Invalid trust domain. Use lowercase alphanumeric and '-.' characters.","Invalid value. Values can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"Invalid value. Values can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-","Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's agents and workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. Standard pricing applies to the creation and use of AWS Private CA.":"Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's agents and workloads present as client certificates to systems outside Amazon Web Services. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. Standard pricing applies to the creation and use of Amazon Private CA.","Issues X.509-SVIDs, for mTLS peers that verify a client certificate.":"Issues X.509-SVIDs, for mTLS peers that verify a client certificate.","Issuing its CA certificate":"Issuing its CA certificate","It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so agents and workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. To avoid this, wait until it becomes inactive on its own. Deleting it then has no effect on verification.":"It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so agents and workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. To avoid this, wait until it becomes inactive on its own. Deleting it then has no effect on verification.","Item moved from position {{initialPosition}} to position {{finalPosition}} of {{total}}":"Item moved from positi