 it must match every condition to run as this identity.","The certificate authority is still being set up.":"The certificate authority is still being set up.","The certificate chain is distributing to every Region, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. It starts signing at {{at}}. That is the minimum signing delay you set, so signing may start later than this. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.":"The certificate chain is distributing to every Region, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. It starts signing at {{at}}. That is the minimum signing delay you set, so signing may start later than this. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.","The ID at the end of the certificate authority's ARN in AWS Private CA.":"The ID at the end of the certificate authority's ARN in Amazon Private CA.","The identity name is the provider's naming scheme, a path prefix, and a path pattern.":"The identity name is the provider's naming scheme, a path prefix, and a path pattern.","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag key is 128.":"The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag key is 128.","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag value is 256.":"The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag value is 256.","The path can be up to {{maxLength}} characters.":"The path can be up to {{maxLength}} characters.","The path doesn't support these segments: {{segments}}. Remove them, and add what you need from the following cards.":"The path doesn't support these segments: {{segments}}. Remove them, and add what you need from the following cards.","The path is already the default.":"The path is already the default.","The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Account ID and Region in front so names stay unique across accounts and Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.":"The path is the unique p