 or IAM principal that should be able to, and limit each one to a path prefix.","Workload identity {{workloadIdentifier}} deleted.":"Workload identity {{workloadIdentifier}} deleted.","Wrap lines":"Wrap lines","Write a policy to let another account create templates, or to stop a delegated administrator from part of the name space. Each statement names an organizational unit, specific accounts, or individual IAM principals, allows or denies, and can be limited to a path prefix.":"Write a policy to let another account create templates, or to stop a delegated administrator from part of the name space. Each statement names an organizational unit, specific accounts, or individual IAM principals, allows or denies, and can be limited to a path prefix.","Yes by default":"Yes by default","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tag.":"You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tag.","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tags.":"You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tags.","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.","You have more keys than can be displayed":"You have more keys than can be displayed","You have more values than can be displayed":"You have more values than can be displayed","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.","You have unsaved tag changes. Leave this page and discard them?":"You have unsaved tag changes. Leave this page and discard them?","You must enter a name":"You must enter a name","You must enter a path":"You must enter a path","You must specify a condition key":"You must specify a condition key","You must specify a tag key":"You must specify a tag key","You must specify a unique tag key.":"You must specify a unique tag key.","You must specify a value":"You must specify a value","Your administrator decides which prefixes this account can use. This is checked when you create.":"Your administrator decides which prefixes this account can use. This is checked when you create.","Your identities will be <code>{{prefix}}<em>{{placeholder}}</em></code>":"Your identities will be <code>{{prefix}}<em>{{placeholder}}</em></code>","Your organization already has an agent and workload identity provider. Add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads — each named under your account's path prefix.":"Your organization already has an agent and workload identity provider. Add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads — each named under your account's path prefix.","Your organization has agent and workload identity providers you can use. Pick one and add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads.":"Your organization has agent and workload identity providers you can use. Pick one and add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads.","YYYY/MM/DD":"YYYY/MM/DD"},M$t=Object.freeze(Object.defineProperty({__proto__:null,ARN:"ARN",Actions:kFt,Active:SFt,Add:"Add",Apply:_Ft,Attestation:xFt,Cancel:AFt,Clear:EFt,Close:CFt,Configured:TFt,Confirm:IFt,Contains:DFt,Created:LFt,Delete:PFt,Description:NFt,Details:RFt,Disable:MFt,Dismiss:zFt,Edit:OFt,Editing:BFt,Enable:FFt,Equals:jFt,Errors:WFt,Format:qFt,Identifier:UFt,Inactive:VFt,Info:HFt,JWKS:KFt,Key:"Key",Name:GFt,New:"New",None:YFt,Notifications:JFt,Operator:ZFt,Operators:XFt,Path:t$t,Preferences:a$t,Preview:n$t,Properties:i$t,Property:r$t,Provided:o$t,Provider:s$t,Providers:l$t,Ready:c$t,Recommended:d$t,Refresh:u$t,Remove:p$t,Retry:h$t,Save:m$t,Scheme:v$t,Scope:f$t,Status:y$t,Subject:b$t,Success:w$t,Tags:k$t,Template:S$t,Templates:_$t,Theme:x$t,Today:A$t,Undo:E$t,Update:C$t,Validating:T$t,Value:I$t,Values:D$t,Visual:L$t,Warning:P$t,Warnings:N$t,and:"and",default:R$t,equals:$Ft,optional:QFt,or:"or",path:e$t,scheme:g$t},Symbol.toStringTag,{value:"Module"})),z$t="创建时间",O$t="详细信息",B$t="正在编辑",F$t="JWKS",$$t="准备就绪",j$t="正在验证",W$t="Identifier",q$t={"'{{providerName}}' does not exist in your account":"“{{providerName}}”在您的账户中不存在","(earliest)":"（最早）","{{addedCount}} tag added or changed":"已添加或更改 {{addedCount}} 个标签","{{addedCount}} tags added or changed":"已添加或更改 {{addedCount}} 个标签","{{createdCount}} templates created: {{templateNames}}.":"{{createdCount}} 个模板已创建：{{templateNames}}。","{{failed}} of {{total}} certificates could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"无法删除 {{failed}} 个证书（共 {{total}} 个），因此提供商未删除。解决错误，然后重试。","{{failed}} of {{total}} could not be deleted.":"无法删除 {{failed}} 个（共 {{total}} 个）。","{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and workload identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"无法删除 {{failed}} 个模板和工作负载身份（共 {{total}} 个），因此提供商未删除。解决错误，然后重试。","{{failedCount}} template could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.":"无法创建 {{failedCount}} 个模板。查看以下错误，然后重试。","{{failedCount}} templates could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.":"无法创建 {{failedCount}} 个模板。查看以下错误，然后重试。","{{identityCount}} identities":"{{identityCount}} 个身份","{{identityCount}} identity":"{{identityCount}} 个身份","{{label}} (service mesh)":"{{label}}（服务网格）","{{label}} copied":"{{label}} 已复制","{{label}} failed to copy":"{{label}} 复制失败","{{label}} template":"{{label}} 模板","{{label}} template {{index}}":"{{label}} 模板 {{index}}","{{label}}:":"{{label}}:","{{matchCount}} match":"{{matchCount}} 个匹配项","{{matchCount}} matches":"{{matchCount}} 个匹配项","{{name}} has been successfully created.":"{{name}} 已成功创建。","{{name}} has been successfully created. However, the following operations failed:":"{{name}} 已成功创建。但是，以下操作失败：","{{providerName}} still has these resources:":"{{providerName}} 还有这些资源：","{{removedCount}} tag removed":"已移除 {{removedCount}} 个标签","{{removedCount}} tags removed":"已移除 {{removedCount}} 个标签","{{scope}} · {{domain}}":"{{scope}} · {{domain}}","{{settled}} of {{total}}":"{{settled}}/{{total}}","{{subject}}. Does not match this signer's {{algorithm}} algorithm.":"{{subject}}.与该签名者的 {{algorithm}} 算法不匹配。","{{tagCount}} tag":"{{tagCount}} 个标签","{{tagCount}} tags":"{{tagCount}} 个标签","{{templateCount}} template":"{{templateCount}} 个模板","{{templateCount}} templates":"{{templateCount}} 个模板","{{templateName}} template failed to create. To try again, <link>add templates</link>. Error details: {{reason}}":"{{templateName}} 模板创建失败。如需重试，请<link>添加模板</link>。错误详细信息：{{reason}}","{{workload}} fact":"{{workload}} 事实","{defined by template}":"{defined by template}","<term>Support:</term> Amazon EKS, Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Runtime, and Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Gateway.":"<term>支持：</term>Amazon EKS、Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Runtime 和 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Gateway。","1 EKS cluster":"1 个 EKS 集群","1 provider and 1 trust domain per EKS cluster. Each namespace and service account in this cluster gets its own identity, trusted only within this cluster.":"每个 EKS 集群 1 个提供商和 1 个信任域。此集群中的每个命名空间和服务账户都有自己的身份，仅在此集群内可信。","1 provider and 1 trust domain shared by every EKS cluster in the mesh. A workload with the same namespace and service account in any of these clusters shares one identity.":"网格中的每个 EKS 集群共享 1 个提供商和 1 个信任域。在这些集群中具有相同命名空间和服务账户的工作负载共享一个身份。","1 to 48 hours, in whole hours. Publishing is usually much faster, but can take up to 24 hours.":"1 到 48 小时，以整小时为单位。发布通常快得多，但最长可能需要 24 小时。","1. Select all the check boxes to confirm what deleting {{providerName}} will do.":"1. 选中所有复选框以确认删除 {{providerName}} 将执行的操作。","2. Confirm that you want to delete this provider by typing {{providerName}} below.":"2. 在下方输入 {{providerName}} 以确认您要删除此提供者。","A declared identity has a fixed path you define. Use one when you need an exact path, for example to match a value another system already expects.":"声明的身份具有您定义的固定路径。当您需要精确路径时（例如匹配另一个系统已预期的值），请使用此身份。","A deny, and only for delegated administrators":"拒绝权限，且仅适用于委派管理员","A fact {{workload}} checks when the workload starts.":"工作负载启动时 {{workload}} 会检查的事实。","A fixed label, such as an environment name.":"固定标签，例如环境名称。","A name to identify this identity.":"用于标识此身份的名称。","A provider with this name already exists.":"已存在同名的提供商。","A tag is a label you assign to an AWS resource. Each tag has a key and an optional value. Use tags to search and filter this provider, or to track your AWS costs.":"标签是您分配给 亚马逊云科技 资源的标记。每个标签由一个键和一个可选值组成。使用标签搜索和筛选此提供商，或跟踪您的 亚马逊云科技 成本。","A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts a workload must prove before an identity is issued. Decide how this provider issues identities - starting from the <link>default templates</link> for common use cases, or skipping them. You can add and name identities manually at any time - templates are optional and can be added later.":"模板定义了用于唯一命名身份的路径模式，以及工作负载在颁发身份之前必须证明的事实。请决定此提供商如何颁发身份：从适用于常见使用案例的<link>默认模板</link>入手，或跳过此步骤。您可以随时手动添加和命名身份：模板为可选，可在之后添加。","A template with this name already exists.":"同名模板已存在。","A template's path pattern, built from facts like cluster, namespace, and service account, names each workload automatically when it starts. You don't create identities ahead of time.":"模板路径规则基于集群、命名空间、服务账号等信息构建，在工作负载启动时自动命名。无需提前创建身份。","A workload identity provider issues secure, verifiable identities to your workloads, like Kubernetes pods or AI agents. Workloads use them to access AWS and third-party services without long-lived credentials.":"工作负载身份提供商会向您的工作负载（例如 Kubernetes 容器组（pod）或智能体）颁发安全、可验证的身份。工作负载使用这些身份访问 亚马逊云科技 和第三方服务，而无需长期凭证。","A workload, including an AI agent or sub-agent created on demand, gets its own identity. No workload shares or inherits another's.":"工作负载（包括按需创建的 AI 智能体或子智能体）拥有独立身份。各工作负载不共享、不继承其他工作负载的身份。","Access a partner API, a SaaS endpoint, or an OIDC service. No setup needed.":"访问合作伙伴 API、SaaS 端点或 OIDC 服务。无需进行任何配置。","Access a service mesh, a database, or an on-premises system.":"访问服务网格、数据库或本地系统。","Access denied":"访问被拒绝","Access you granted to these identities will stop working":"您授予这些身份的访问权限将停止生效","Account scoped":"账户范围内",Actions:"操作","Activating it":"正在激活它",Active:"活动","Active certificate authority ID":"活跃证书颁发机构 ID","Active: currently signing":"活跃：当前正在签名",Add:"添加","Add {{label}} template":"添加 {{label}} 模板","Add a fact or condition key. A path of only custom text would give every workload the same name.":"添加事实或条件键。仅包含自定义文本的路径会为每个工作负载指定相同的名称。","Add an {{conditionKey}} condition, so only workloads in these clusters get an identity.":"添加一个 {{conditionKey}} 条件，这样只有这些集群中的工作负载才能获得身份。","Add at least 1 path segment.":"添加至少 1 个路径段。","Add at least 1 template to continue.":"至少添加 1 个模板以继续。","Add at least 2 clusters.":"添加至少 2 个集群。","Add attestation rules":"添加证明规则","Add cluster ARN":"添加集群 ARN","Add condition":"添加条件","Add default templates for Amazon EKS, AgentCore Runtime, and AgentCore Gateway.":"为 Amazon EKS、AgentCore 运行时和 AgentCore Gateway 添加默认模板。","Add new tag":"添加新标签","Add policy":"添加  项策略","Add request-context values like account, Region, or organization.":"添加请求上下文值，例如账户、区域或组织。","Add tags":"添加标签","Add tags to this provider for cost management and access control.":"请向该提供商添加标签，用于成本管理和访问控制。","Add tags to this template for cost management and access control.":"请向该模板添加标签，用于成本管理和访问控制。","Add tags to this workload identity for cost management and access control.":"请向该工作负载标识添加标签，用于成本管理和访问控制。","Add template":"添加模板","Add templates":"添加模板","Add templates after the provider is created, or create and name identities by hand.":"在创建提供商后添加模板，或者手动创建和命名身份。","Add to the path pattern":"添加到路径模式","Added or changed tags were not saved":"添加或更改的标签未保存","Adding permissions to govern who can create templates referring to this provider failed. To try again, <link>add policy</link>. Error details: {{reason}}":"添加用于管理谁可以创建引用此提供商的模板的权限失败。如需重试，请<link>添加策略</link>。错误详细信息：{{reason}}","All outbound signers under this provider will be deleted":"该提供者下的所有出站签名者都将被删除","All properties":"所有属性","All templates and workload identities under this provider will be deleted":"该提供者下的所有模板和工作负载身份都将被删除","Allow member accounts to add their own templates, namespaced by account ID":"允许成员账户添加自己的模板，并按账户 ID 划分命名空间","An identity for agent or workload":"为智能体或工作负载分配身份",and:"与","Any value":"任何值",Apply:"应用",ARN:"ARN","ARN copied":"ARN 已复制","arn:aws:eks:{Region}:{account ID}:cluster/{cluster name}":"arn:aws:eks:{Region}:{account ID}:cluster/{cluster name}","At runtime the platform attests these facts about the workload. Any workload whose attestation carries them issues an identity from this template.":"在运行时，平台会证明有关工作负载的这些事实。任何其证明包含这些事实的工作负载，都会基于此模板签发一个身份。",Attestation:"证明","Attestation policy":"证明策略","Auto generated identity name":"自动生成的身份名称","Automatically generate from a template":"从模板自动生成","Available to every account in your organization ({{organizationId}})":"对您组织中的每个账户可用（{{organizationId}}）","Available to this account ({{accountId}})":"对此账户可用（{{accountId}}）","AWS account ID":"亚马逊云科技 账户 ID","AWS API calls in CloudTrail resolve to the specific workload that made them. Scope trust policies, resource policies, and SCPs to it, using the IAM policies you already know.":"CloudTrail 中的 亚马逊云科技 API 调用可以定位到发起调用的具体工作负载。可使用熟悉的 IAM 策略，将信任策略、资源策略与服务控制策略（SCP）的适用范围限定到该工作负载。","AWS creates a subordinate CA in every region this provider signs in, and returns an ID for it.":"亚马逊云科技 在此提供程序登录的每个区域创建一个下级 CA，并返回其 ID。","AWS IAM Workload Identity":"Amazon IAM 工作负载身份","AWS IAM Workload Identity (opens in a new tab)":"Amazon IAM 工作负载身份（在新标签页打开)","AWS Private CA couldn't set up this certificate authority. Delete it in the AWS Private CA console and try again.":"Amazon Private CA 无法设置此证书颁发机构。请在 Amazon Private CA 控制台中将其删除，然后重试。","By default, each account's templates require an account ID path prefix to avoid name collisions. You can customize this after creating the provider, under provider settings.":"默认情况下，每个账户的模板都需要账户 ID 路径前缀以避免名称冲突。您可以在创建提供商后，在提供商设置下自定义此设置。","Can't be changed after the provider is created.":"创建提供商后无法更改。","Can't be changed later.":"以后无法更改。",Cancel:"取消","Cannot be changed later.":"以后无法更改。","Cannot start with aws:":"不能以 aws: 开头","Certificate {{name}} (account {{accountId}}): {{reason}}":"证书 {{name}}（账户 {{accountId}}）：{{reason}}","Certificate authority":"证书颁发机构","Certificate authority created":"证书颁发机构已创建。","Certificate authority ID":"证书颁发机构 ID","Certificate authority name":"证书颁发机构名称","Certificate authority updated. The current one keeps signing for about {{hours}} more hour, until the replacement has published everywhere.":"证书颁发机构已更新。当前证书颁发机构将继续签名约 {{hours}} 小时，直到替换证书在所有区域发布完毕。","Certificate authority updated. The current one keeps signing for about {{hours}} more hours, until the replacement has published everywhere.":"证书颁发机构已更新。当前证书颁发机构将继续签名约 {{hours}} 小时，直到替换证书在所有区域发布完毕。","Certificate deleted. Its chain had already left the trust bundle, so nothing that was verifying has changed.":"证书已删除。其证书链已从信任包中移除，因此所有正在进行的验证均未受到影响。","Certificate deleted. Its chain has been pulled from the trust bundle, so certificates issued under it no longer verify.":"证书已删除。其证书链已从信任包中移除，因此基于此证书颁发的证书将不再通过验证。","Certificate signer":"证书签名者","Certificate signer disabled, and the update in progress was stopped with it. Both authorities stay configured, and Enable resumes signing.":"证书签名者已禁用，进行中的更新也随之停止。两个证书颁发机构都保持已配置状态，启用后会恢复签名。","Certificate signer disabled. It stops signing now, its configuration is kept, and Enable resumes signing.":"证书签名者已禁用。它将立即停止签名，其配置会保留，启用后会恢复签名。","Certificate signer enabled. Its certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle again first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hour, after every region has it.":"证书签名者已启用。证书链将首先重新发布到信任包，待每个区域均获取该证书链后，大约 {{hours}} 小时后开始签名。","Certificate signer enabled. Its certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle again first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hours, after every region has it.":"证书签名者已启用。其证书链将首先重新发布到信任包，待每个区域均获取该证书链后，大约 {{hours}} 小时后开始签名。","Certificate signer enabled. Its material was still published, so signing resumed immediately.":"证书签名者已启用。其材料仍处于已发布状态，因此签名立即恢复。","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hour, once every region has it.":"证书签名已启用。证书链首先发布到信任包，然后在每个区域都拥有它后，大约 {{hours}} 小时后开始签名。","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hours, once every region has it.":"证书签名已启用。证书链先发布到信任包，签名将在每个区域都拥有该证书链后大约 {{hours}} 小时开始。","Certificate verifier information":"证书验证程序信息","Certificates ({{total}})":"证书（{{total}}）","Certificates: {{reason}}":"证书：{{reason}}","Change the facts a workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.":"更改工作负载必须通过证明的事实，才能从此模板获得身份。此模板已生成的身份不受影响。","Change the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. A workload already holding a session keeps it until the session expires.":"更改工作负载必须证明其满足的条件，以便以此身份运行。已获得会话的工作负载可继续使用该会话，直至会话过期。","Check again":"重新检查","Checking what is attached to this provider":"检查此提供商的附加内容","Choose a condition key":"选择条件键","Choose a fact":"选择事实","Choose a path and pattern for the names. Start from a default or customize your own.":"为名称选择路径和模式。可从默认设置开始，也可自定义。","Choose a specific name up front so you can grant it access or match an existing naming convention before the workload runs.":"请预先指定一个名称，以便在工作负载运行之前为其授予访问权限，或使其符合现有的命名规范。","Choose a stable, unique name that identifies one environment or group of workloads, for example prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal.":"选择一个稳定且唯一的名称来标识一个环境或一组工作负载，例如 prod.acme.com、staging.acme.com、payments.internal。","Choose a use case above to add a template.":"选择上面的使用案例来添加模板。","Choose from this account":"从此账户中选择","Choose templates to add, and customize or keep their defaults":"选择要添加的模板，然后自定义或保留其默认值","Choose the certificate authority this signer should sign with instead. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. The current authority keeps signing until the replacement has been published long enough for verifiers to pick it up.":"请选择此签名者应改用的证书颁发机构。该证书颁发机构需要是一个<link>证书颁发机构</link>，并且在您进行签名的每个区域均具有从属 CA。当前证书颁发机构会继续签名，直到替换证书已发布足够长时间，使验证者能够获取它。","Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for a workload.":"选择要用作证明事实的条件键。在此模板为工作负载签发身份之前，平台必须对所有这些事实完成证明。","Choose the facts a workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.":"选择工作负载必须通过证明的事实，才能从此模板获得身份。在您完成此操作之前，不会基于此模板生成任何内容。","Choose the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. Nothing can be issued for it until you do.":"选择工作负载必须通过证明满足的条件，以便以此身份运行。在完成此设置之前，无法为该工作负载签发任何内容。","Choose the provider to create the identity in":"选择要在其中创建身份的提供商","Choose which templates to add by use case, and customize each one or keep its defaults.":"按使用案例选择要添加的模板，然后自定义每个模板或保留其默认值。",Clear:"清除","Clear filters":"清除筛选条件",Close:"关闭","Close modal":"关闭强制对话框","Cluster ARN":"集群 ARN","Cluster ARNs":"集群 ARN","Code editor":"代码编辑器","Complete the confirmation to delete.":"完成确认以进行删除。","Condition key":"条件键","Configure identity templates for your workload use cases. Each template defines a path pattern used to issue identities uniquely and the facts a workload must prove before an identity is issued.":"为您的工作负载使用案例配置身份模板。每个模板都定义了用于唯一颁发身份的路径模式以及工作负载在颁发身份之前必须证明的事实。","Configure later":"稍后配置",Configured:"已配置",Confirm:"确认",Contains:"包含","Continue setup":"继续设置","Copy {{label}}":"复制 {{label}}","Copy ARN":"复制 ARN","Copy JSON":"复制 JSON","Could not check everything attached to this provider":"无法检查连接到该提供商的所有内容","Create a provider":"创建提供商","Create a provider for this account":"为此账户创建提供商","Create a provider for your organization":"为您的组织创建提供商","Create a provider to get started":"创建提供商即可开始","Create a template to automate identity generation":"创建模板以自动生成身份","Create declared identity in {{providerName}}":"在{{providerName}}中创建声明的身份","Create identity":"创建身份","Create new":"新建","Create provider":"创建提供商","Create provider and templates":"创建提供商和模板","Create service mesh provider":"创建服务网格提供商","Create templates":"创建模板","Create the certificate authority first.":"请先创建证书颁发机构。","Create workload identities":"创建工作负载身份",Created:z$t,"Created through":"创建方式","Created time":"创建时间","Created values":"已创建的值","Creates a workload identity provider and template for workloads running in one or more EKS clusters under a service mesh, such as Istio.":"为在服务网格（例如 Istio）下的一个或多个 EKS 集群中运行的工作负载创建工作负载身份提供商和模板。","Creating certificate authority":"正在创建证书颁发机构","Creating the certificate authority":"正在创建证书颁发机构","Creating this provider sets up these 2 resources.":"创建此提供商将设置这 2 个资源。","Current CA":"当前 CA","Current provider":"当前提供商","Custom tag key":"自定义标签键","Custom tag value":"自定义标签值","Custom text":"自定义文本","Custom text can't be a single period (.) or two periods (..).":"自定义文本不能是单个句点（.）或两个句点（..）。","Customize templates":"自定义模板","Dark themes":"深色主题","Declared identity: {{name}}":"已声明的身份：{{name}}","Default permissions without a policy":"没有策略的默认权限","Defaults to {provider name}.{account ID}.aws.internal. This must match the trust domain set in your service mesh, or the mesh rejects the identities.":"默认为 {provider name}.{account ID}.aws.internal。这必须与服务网格中设置的信任域相匹配，否则网格会拒绝这些身份。","Define an optional path prefix for identities under this template. Lets you filter by prefix when authoring IAM permissions.":"为此模板下的身份定义可选的路径前缀，以便在编写 IAM 权限时按前缀进行筛选。","Define an optional path prefix for this identity. You can filter by this prefix when authoring IAM permissions.":"为此身份定义一个可选的路径前缀。在编写 IAM 权限时，您可以按此前缀进行筛选。","Define an optional prefix for identities under this template. You can filter by this prefix when authoring IAM permissions. The path prefixes this account can use are set by the provider's policy, for example your account ID, and they are checked when you choose Create. If you're not sure which are permitted, ask your organization administrator.":"为此模板下的身份定义可选前缀。在编写 IAM 权限时，您可以按此前缀进行筛选。此账户可使用的路径前缀由提供者的策略设定，例如您的账户 ID；当您选择”创建“时，系统会检查这些前缀。如果您不确定哪些前缀是允许的，请询问您的组织管理员。","Define an optional prefix for this identity. You can filter by this prefix when authoring IAM permissions. The path prefixes this account can use are set by the provider's policy, for example your account ID, and they are checked when you choose Create. If you're not sure which are permitted, ask your organization administrator.":"为此身份定义可选前缀。在编写 IAM 权限时，您可以按此前缀进行筛选。此账户可使用的路径前缀由提供者的策略设定，例如您的账户 ID；当您选择“创建”时，系统会检查这些前缀。如果您不确定哪些前缀是允许的，请询问您的组织管理员。","Define which workloads are allowed to use this template.":"定义允许哪些工作负载使用此模板。",Delete:"删除","Delete certificate?":"删除证书？","Delete provider":"删除提供商","Delete provider and resources":"删除提供商和资源","Delete provider?":"删除提供者？","Delete template":"删除模板","Delete template?":"删除模板？","Delete the templates under <b>{{providerName}}</b> before deleting the provider. Once deleted, workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials and fail on their next request, and access that you granted to these identities will stop working.":"在删除提供商之前，请先删除 <b>{{providerName}}</b> 下的模板。删除后，使用这些身份的工作负载将停止获得凭证，并在下一次请求时失败，您授予这些身份的访问权限也将停止运行。","Delete workload identity?":"删除工作负载身份？","Deleting <b>{{templateName}}</b> will:":"删除 <b>{{templateName}}</b> 将：","Deleting <b>{{workloadIdentifier}}</b> will:":"删除 <b>{{workloadIdentifier}}</b> 将：","Deleting certificates":"正在删除证书","Deleting provider":"正在删除提供商","Deleting templates and workload identities":"正在删除模板和工作负载身份","Deleting the provider is taking longer than expected":"删除提供商所花费的时间比预期的要长",Description:"描述","Description can't include line breaks or tabs.":"描述不能包含换行符或制表符。","Description must be 1,000 characters or less.":"描述不得超过 1,000 个字符。","Description must be 255 characters or less.":"描述不得超过 255 个字符。",Details:O$t,Disable:"禁用","Disable certificate signer?":"禁用证书签名者？","Discovery expiration time":"发现过期时间",Dismiss:"关闭","Does not contain":"不包含","Does not equal":"不等于","Drag or select to resize":"拖动或选择以调整大小","Each identity is fully the template path, or whatever string you enter when you create the identity.":"每个身份都是完整的模板路径，或者您在创建身份时输入的任何字符串。",Edit:"编辑","Edit attestation policy":"编辑证明策略","Edit filter":"编辑筛选条件","Edit identity format and scope":"编辑身份格式和范围","Edit identity path":"编辑身份路径",Editing:B$t,Enable:"启用","Enable certificate signer":"启用证书签名者","Enable certificate signer?":"启用证书签名者？","End signing time":"签名结束时间","Enter a 12-digit AWS account ID.":"输入 12 位数的 亚马逊云科技 账户 ID。","Enter a certificate authority ID.":"输入证书颁发机构 ID。","Enter a cluster ARN.":"输入集群 ARN。","Enter a name":"输入名称","Enter a name for the certificate authority.":"输入证书颁发机构的名称。","Enter a name.":"输入名称。","Enter a path":"请输入一个路径","Enter a path prefix value":"输入路径前缀值","Enter a trust domain.":"输入信任域。","Enter a value":"输入值","Enter a whole number of hours from 1 to 48.":"输入 1 到 48 之间的整数小时数。","Enter key":"输入键","Enter prefix":"输入前缀","Enter the ID of a certificate authority or choose from below":"输入证书颁发机构的 ID，或从下方选择。","Enter the policy as valid JSON.":"以有效的 JSON 输入策略。","Enter value":"输入值",equals:"等于",Equals:"等于",Error:"错误","Error fetching the details":"获取详细信息时出错",Errors:"错误","Every account in this organization ({{organizationId}})":"此组织中的每个账户（{{organizationId}}）","Every X.509-SVID this provider issues right now is signed by this certificate. It stops in {{hours}} hour, at {{at}}, when the incoming certificate takes over.":"此提供程序当前颁发的每个 X.509-SVID 都由此证书签名。此证书将在 {{hours}} 小时后（即 {{at}}）停止签名，届时将由传入证书接管。","Every X.509-SVID this provider issues right now is signed by this certificate. It stops in {{hours}} hours, at {{at}}, when the incoming certificate takes over.":"该提供程序当前颁发的每个 X.509-SVID 均由此证书签名。该证书将在 {{hours}} 小时后（即 {{at}}）停止签名，届时传入证书将接管。","Every X.509-SVID this provider issues right now is signed by this certificate. No replacement is scheduled, so it keeps signing until you update or disable the signer.":"此提供程序当前颁发的每个 X.509-SVID 都由该证书签名。没有安排替换，因此它会持续签名，直到您更新或禁用签名者。","Failed to copy":"未能复制","Failed to copy JSON":"无法复制 JSON","Failed to load attestation policy.":"无法加载证明策略。","Failed to load templates.":"无法加载模板。","Failed to remove attestation policy.":"移除证明策略失败。","Filter providers":"筛选提供程序","Filter templates":"筛选模板","Filter themes":"筛选主题","Find providers":"查找提供程序","Find templates":"查找模板","Find theme":"查找主题","For example, prod":"例如，prod","For mutual TLS, attach a certificate authority":"对于双向 TLS，请关联一个证书颁发机构 (CA)。","For token-based services, issue a JWT":"对于基于令牌的服务，请签发 JWT。",Format:"格式","Generating its key":"正在生成其密钥","Get started":"开始使用","Getting started":"入门","Give an agent or workload its own identity - <em>Preview</em>":"为智能体或工作负载配置独立身份——<em>预览</em>","Give each workload a unique identity, so you can grant it access and audit what it did rather than sharing one role.":"为每个工作负载赋予唯一身份，以便您可以授予其访问权限并审计其操作，而不是共用同一个角色。","Give your workloads an identity":"为您的工作负载赋予身份","Go to the providers list":"转到提供商列表","Govern who can create resources":"管理资源创建权限","Govern who can create templates referring to this provider":"管理谁可以创建引用该提供商的模板","Greater than":"大于","Greater than or equal":"大于或等于","hour(s)":"小时","How it works":"工作原理","IAM roles define what a workload can do. Workload Identity tells you which workload is doing it.":"IAM 角色定义工作负载能够执行哪些操作；而工作负载身份用于识别是哪个工作负载在执行操作。","Identities are issued at runtime from facts the workload proves, not just from what an admin assigns.":"身份在运行时根据工作负载提供的校验信息颁发，而非仅由管理员预先分配。",'Identity "{{identityId}}" not found.':"未找到身份“{{identityId}}”。","Identity format and scope":"身份格式和范围","Identity name":"身份名称","Identity path":"身份路径","Identity selection":"身份选择","If anything is still attached, deleting the provider fails.":"如果仍然附加了任何内容，则删除提供商失败。","In transition":"正在转换中","In transition certificate authority ID":"过渡中证书颁发机构 ID","In transition: incoming, not yet signing":"过渡中：传入，尚未签名",Inactive:"非活动","Inactive: retired, no longer trusted":"非活跃：已停用，不再受信任","Incoming CA":"传入 CA",Info:"信息","Invalid key. Keys can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"键无效。键只能包含 Unicode 字母、数字、空格和以下任何内容：_.:/=+@-","Invalid provider name. Use alphanumeric and '-_.' characters.":"提供商名称无效。请使用字母数字和“-_.”字符。","Invalid request":"无效请求","Invalid template name. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters.":"模板名称无效。请使用字母数字和 '-_' 字符。","Invalid value. Values can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"值无效。值只能包含 Unicode 字母、数字、空格和以下任何内容：_.:/=+@-","Issued after the workload proves itself":"在工作负载完成自证后颁发身份","Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. Standard pricing applies to the creation and use of AWS Private CA.":"该签名者颁发 X.509-SVID，供该提供程序的工作负载作为客户端证书提供给 亚马逊云科技 以外的系统。它需要在您进行签名的每个区域都配备一个包含从属 CA 的<link>证书颁发机构</link>。Amazon Private CA 的创建和使用适用标准定价。","Issues X.509-SVIDs, for mTLS peers that verify a client certificate.":"颁发 X.509-SVID，供验证客户端证书的 mTLS 对等方使用。","Issuing its CA certificate":"正在签发其 CA 证书","It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. Leave it alone and it becomes inactive on its own, after which deleting it changes nothing.":"它已停止签名，但其链仍在发布，因此工作负载依赖它来验证先前颁发的凭证。现在删除它会立即拉取该链，那些凭证将开始失败。不理会它，它会自行变为不活跃，之后删除它不会产生任何变化。","Item moved from position {{initialPosition}} to position {{finalPosition}} of {{total}}":"项目已从第 {{initialPosition}} 个位置移动到第 {{finalPosition}} 个位置（共 {{total}} 个位置）。","JSON copied":"已复制 JSON",JWKS:F$t,"JWKS popover":"每个有效的签名密钥都由 kid 选择。亚马逊云科技 会在签名切换到新密钥之前在此处发布新密钥。","JWT Outbound signers column Signing algorithm":"签名算法","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key":"密钥算法","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key issue time":"当前密钥自何时起用于签名","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key popover":"亚马逊云科技 生成密钥并按自己的计划轮换它们，在开始签名之前将每个新密钥发布到 JWKS。算法在轮换期间保持不变，因此读取 JWKS 的验证者无需在您这边做任何更改。","JWT Outbound signers desc":"为需要验证签名令牌的系统对 JWT-SVID 进行签名。","JWT Outbound signers label oidc discovery":"OIDC 发现","JWT Outbound signers label oidc discovery popover":"标准发现文档。大多数验证者只需要此 URL 即可，因为他们可从中找到密钥。","JWT Outbound signers label oidc issuer":"OIDC 颁发者","JWT Outbound signers label oidc issuer popover":"此处签名的每个 JWT-SVID 的 iss 声明。固定颁发者的验证者会固定此值。","JWT Outbound signers section title":"令牌验证信息","JWT Outbound signers status":"由 亚马逊云科技 提供的默认值","JWT Outbound signers title":"JWT 签名者",Key:"键","Learn about organization providers":"了解组织提供商","Learn about organization providers (opens in a new tab)":"了解组织提供商（在新标签页中打开）","Learn more":"了解更多","Learn more about deleting a provider (opens in a new tab)":"了解有关删除提供者的更多信息（在新选项卡中打开）","Learn more:":"了解更多:","Less than":"小于","Less than or equal":"小于或等于","Let other accounts or principals in your organization create templates and identities under this provider, within the path prefixes you choose.":"让组织中的其他账户或主体可以在此提供商下创建模板和身份，并将其限制在您指定的路径前缀范围内。","Let workloads reach non-AWS resources":"使工作负载能够访问非 亚马逊云科技 资源","Letters, digits, . - _ with a single / between parts. No / at the start or end.":"字母、数字、. - _，各部分之间用单个 / 分隔。开头或结尾不能为 /。","Letters, digits, . - _ with a single / between parts. No / at the start or end. Cannot be changed later.":"字母、数字、. - _，各部分之间用单个 / 分隔。开头或结尾不能为 /。此后无法更改。","Light themes":"浅色主题","Ln {{row}}, Col {{column}}":"行 {{row}}，列 {{column}}","Loading certificate authorities":"正在加载证书颁发机构","Loading code editor":"正在加载代码编辑器","Loading tag keys":"正在加载标签键","Loading tag values":"正在加载标签值","Loading tags that are associated with this resource":"正在加载与此资源关联的标签","Loading your organization's providers":"正在加载您所在组织的提供商","Make sure the new certificate authority uses the same algorithm as the current signer, {{algorithm}}. If you choose a different algorithm, you need to disable this signer, delete its certificates, then enable it again with the new authority.":"请确保新的证书颁发机构与当前签名者使用相同的算法（{{algorithm}}）。如果选择其他算法，则需要先禁用该签名者并删除其证书，然后使用新的证书颁发机构重新启用该签名者。","Manage CAs and replication in the AWS Private CA console":"在 Amazon Private CA 控制台中管理 CA 和复制","Manage tags":"管理标签","Manage the provider":"管理提供商","Manual creation":"手动创建","Manually create":"手动创建","Matching workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.":"匹配的工作负载自启动时起即可获得各自的身份名称，且不受规模限制。","Maximum 1,000 characters.":"最多 1,000 个字符。","Maximum 255 characters.":"最多 255 个字符。","Member accounts":"成员账户","Member accounts can add their own templates, namespaced by account ID.":"成员账户可以添加自己的模板，并按账户 ID 划分命名空间。","Member accounts cannot add their own templates.":"成员账户无法添加自己的模板。","Minimum signing delay":"最小签名延迟","Moving item to position {{currentPosition}} of {{total}}":"正在将项目移至第 {{currentPosition}}/{{total}} 个位置","Multiple EKS clusters":"多个 EKS 集群",Name:"名称","Name must be 128 characters or less.":"名称不能超过 128 个字符。","Name this identity":"命名此身份","Name this provider":"命名此提供商","Name values":"名称值","Names identities automatically as workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.":"在工作负载启动时自动为其命名身份，无需逐一创建或管理这些身份。","Naming scheme":"命名方案",New:"新","Next month":"下个月","Next page":"下一页","Next step":"下一步","No attestation policy set. Define one so a workload can run as this identity.":"尚未设置证明策略。请定义证明策略，以允许工作负载以此身份运行。","No attestation policy. No workload will be issued workload identities from this template until you add one.":"无证明策略。在您添加证明策略之前，任何工作负载都不会从此模板获取工作负载身份。","No by default, but can add a policy":"默认情况下为否，但可以添加策略","No certificate authorities in this account":"此账户中没有证书颁发机构","no domain":"无域名","No long-lived secrets":"无长期密钥","No match found":"未找到匹配项","No matches":"没有匹配项","No path segments. Add a fact, condition key, or custom text.":"没有路径段。添加事实、条件键或自定义文本。","No tags associated with the resource.":"没有与资源关联的标签。","No templates added yet":"尚未添加任何模板","No workload identity providers":"无工作负载身份提供程序","No workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.":"没有与此模板匹配的工作负载，因此不会生成任何身份。","No, and cannot be granted":"否，且无法授予",None:"无","None – names are defined by templates or declared individually":"无 — 名称由模板定义或单独声明","Not saved: {{keys}}.":"未保存：{{keys}}。","Not set":"未设置",Notifications:"通知","Once the attestation policy is removed, matching workloads will not be issued workload identities until you add a policy again.":"移除证明策略后，匹配的工作负载将无法获取工作负载身份，除非您再次添加策略。","One bundle per provider, and one URL. It carries every authority the provider publishes: both outbound signers, and during an update both the current and incoming certificate authority, which is what lets verifiers accept either one through the handover. Your own AWS workloads get these keys automatically; send this to systems outside AWS.":"每个提供程序一个捆绑包，一个 URL。它包含该提供程序发布的所有证书颁发机构：两个出站签名者，以及在更新期间同时包含当前证书颁发机构和传入证书颁发机构，这正是让验证者在交接过程中接受任一证书的原因。您自己的 亚马逊云科技 工作负载将自动获取这些密钥；请将此 URL 发送给 亚马逊云科技 以外的系统。","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level providers.":"只有管理账户或委派管理员可以删除组织级提供者。","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level templates.":"只有管理账户或委派管理员可以删除组织级模板。","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level workload identities.":"只有管理账户或委派管理员可以删除组织级工作负载身份。","Opens in a new tab":"在新选项卡中打开",Operator:"运算符",Operators:"运算符",optional:"可选",or:"或","Organization provider":"组织提供商","Organization scoped":"组织范围内","Organize the provider and track its cost with tags.":"通过添加标签对提供商进行分类，并跟踪相关成本。","Other accounts in your organization":"组织中的其他账户","Other condition keys":"其他条件键","Outbound signer":"出站签名者","Outbound signers page desc":"让您的工作负载向 亚马逊云科技 以外的服务证明自身身份。此提供程序会为其呈现的令牌和证书签名。","Outbound signers page title":"出站签名者","Owning account":"拥有账户","Page {{pageNumber}} of all pages":"所有页面中的第 {{pageNumber}} 页",path:"路径",Path:"路径","path from templates":"从模板获取路径","Path is the per-workload part of an identity name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts a workload proves.":"路径是身份名称中每个工作负载特有的部分。它在运行时根据工作负载证明的事实填写。","Path must be 255 characters or less.":"路径必须为 255 个字符或更少","Path pattern":"路径模式","Path prefix":"路径前缀","Path prefix must be 64 characters or less.":"路径前缀不得超过 64 个字符。","Path values":"路径值","Picked up item at position {{position}} of {{total}}":"在位置 {{position}}（共 {{total}} 个）上拾起项目","Policy details":"策略详细信息","Policy: Define how a workload attests to get the identity":"策略：定义工作负载如何通过证明来获得身份",Preferences:"首选项","Press space or enter to activate drag, use arrow keys to move, then press space or enter to confirm":"按空格键或 Enter 键激活拖动，使用箭头键移动，然后再次按空格键或 Enter 键确认",Preview:"预览","Previous CA":"上一个 CA","Previous certificates ({{certificateCount}})":"之前的证书（{{certificateCount}}）","Previous month":"上个月","Previous page":"上一页",Properties:"属性",Property:"属性",Provided:"已提供",Provider:"提供商","Provider {{providerName}} deleted.":"提供商 {{providerName}} 已删除。","Provider name":"提供商名称","Provider name must be 128 characters or less.":"提供商名称不能超过 128 个字符。","Provider not deleted":"提供商未删除。","Provider not found":"未找到提供商","Provider overview":"提供商概述","Provider selection":"提供程序选择","Provider settings":"提供商设置","Provider values":"提供程序值",Providers:"提供商","Providers to issue workload identities":"用于颁发工作负载身份的提供商","Quick create":"快速创建","Quick create makes an RSA 2048 certificate authority in AWS Private CA in your account, which has its own charges. The algorithm is fixed and cannot be changed later without setting the signer up again.":"快速创建将在您的账户中的 Amazon Private CA 内创建一个 RSA 2048 证书颁发机构，该操作将产生相应费用。该算法固定不变，如需更改，必须重新设置签名者。",Ready:$$t,Recommended:"已建议","Recommended for most workloads":"推荐用于大多数工作负载",Refresh:"刷新","Refresh certificate authorities":"刷新证书颁发机构","Refresh certificate signer status":"刷新证书签名者状态",Remove:"移除","Remove {{name}}":"移除 {{name}}","Remove attestation policy":"移除证明策略","Remove cluster ARN":"移除集群 ARN","Remove condition":"移除条件","Remove filter {{filter}}":"移除筛选条件 {{filter}}","Remove governance policy?":"移除治理策略？","Remove tag {{key}}":"移除标签 {{key}}","Removed tags were not saved":"已移除的标签未保存","Reorder {{name}}":"重新排序 {{name}}","Reordering canceled":"重新排序已取消","Required for service mesh providers.":"服务网格提供商所需。","Required for service mesh providers. A service mesh provider is scoped to the account that runs the EKS cluster.":"服务网格提供商所需。服务网格提供商的范围限定为运行 EKS 集群的账户。","Reset to default":"重置为默认值","Resize handle":"调整手柄大小","Resolved example:":"已解决的示例：","Restricted by":"受限于",Retry:"重试","Review the tags and save again.":"请检查标签后重新保存。","Running a service mesh, such as Istio? It needs its own provider, one per cluster.":"是否运行服务网格（如 Istio）？它需要自己的提供商，每个集群一个。",Save:"保存","Save changes":"保存更改","Save or cancel your edits before creating templates.":"在创建模板之前保存或取消您的编辑。","Save or cancel your edits before creating the provider.":"在创建提供商之前，请保存或取消您的编辑。","Save or cancel your template edits to change the scope.":"保存或取消您的模板编辑以更改范围。",scheme:"方案",Scheme:"方案","scheme and trust domain":"方案和信任域","Scheme sets the format this provider uses to name identities.":"方案设置了此提供商用于命名身份的格式。",Scope:"范围","Scope sets which accounts are allowed to use this provider.":"范围设置允许哪些账户使用此提供商。","Scope values":"范围值","Search tags":"搜索标签","Segment that partitions identities.":"对身份进行分区的段。","Select {{name}}":"选择 {{name}}","Select a row to delete.":"选择要删除的行。",Set:"设置","Set a naming pattern":"设置命名模式","Set an attestation rule":"设置证明规则","Set by your provider.":"由您的提供商设置。","Set the naming format and usage scope that every workload identity from this provider inherits.":"设置此提供商颁发的每个工作负载身份所继承的命名格式和使用范围。","Set the unique path pattern that every workload identity generated by this template follows. Cannot be changed later.":"设置此模板生成的每个工作负载标识都遵循的唯一路径模式。以后无法更改。","Set up a provider to hold the templates that generate identity names, the identities you declare directly, and the signers that sign credentials for systems outside AWS.":"设置提供商，以保存用于生成身份名称的模板、您直接声明的身份，以及为 亚马逊云科技 外部系统签署凭证的签名者。","Set up a service mesh provider for this account":"为此账户设置服务网格提供商","Set up a way to issue workload identities":"设置工作负载身份的签发方式","Set up for your use cases":"根据您的使用案例进行配置","Sets your trust domain, the start of every identity name.":"设置信任域，作为所有身份名称的前缀。","Setting up the certificate authority stopped. You can continue from where it left off.":"证书颁发机构的设置已停止。您可以从上次中断的位置继续。","Settings from your provider {{providerName}}":"来自您的提供商 {{providerName}} 的设置","Short-lived credentials renew automatically and follow the SPIFFE standard, so they work with service meshes like Istio and with SaaS applications.":"临时凭证自动续期，遵循 SPIFFE 标准，可与 Istio 等服务网格以及 SaaS 应用配合使用。","Show all {{errorCount}} errors":"显示所有 {{errorCount}} 个错误","Show fewer":"显示更少","Show more":"显示更多","Signing algorithm":"签名算法","Signing resumes immediately, because this certificate is still published in the trust bundle.":"签名立即恢复，因为该证书仍发布在信任包中。","Signing start time":"签名开始时间","Some templates could not be loaded":"某些模板无法加载","Something went wrong":"出错了","Sortable path segment":"可排序的路径段",Status:"状态","Status bar":"状态栏","Stop access you granted to this identity name from working":"让您授予此身份名称的访问权限停止生效","Stop access you granted to those identity names from working":"让您授予这些身份名称的访问权限停止生效","Stop matching workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request":"停止匹配的工作负载获得身份，使其在下次请求时失败","Stop the identities it generated from resolving":"停止解析它生成的身份","Stop the workload running as this identity, so it fails on its next request":"停止以该身份运行的工作负载，使其在下次请求时失败","Stopped signing and no longer in the trust bundle, so nothing verifies against them. Deleting one is safe.":"已停止签名，并且不再在信任包中，因此不会针对它们进行任何验证。删除其中一个是安全的。",Subject:"主题",Success:"成功","Tag keys could not be retrieved":"无法检索标签键","Tag values could not be retrieved":"无法检索标签值",Tags:"标签","Tags could not be loaded":"无法加载标签","Tags for {{name}} have been updated.":"{{name}} 的标签已更新。","Tags not saved":"标签未保存",Template:"模板",'Template "{{templateId}}" not found.':"未找到模板“{{templateId}}”。","Template {{name}}: {{reason}}":"模板 {{name}}：{{reason}}","Template {{templateName}} deleted.":"模板 {{templateName}} 已删除。","Template {{templateNames}} created.":"已创建模板“{{templateNames}}”。","Template name":"模板名称","Template name must be 128 characters or less.":"模板名称必须不超过 128 个字符。","Template name values":"模板名称值","Template: {{name}}":"模板：{{name}}",Templates:"模板","Templates ({{total}})":"模板（{{total}}）","Templates are being created. Wait for the request to finish.":"正在创建模板。等待请求完成。","Templates give matching workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.":"模板会自动为匹配的工作负载分配各自的身份名称。每个模板均使用该提供商的名称前缀以及路径和模式。","Templates that member accounts created under this provider are not visible here and cannot be deleted from this account. If any exist, deleting the provider fails.":"成员账户在此提供商下创建的模板在此处不可见，也无法从该账户中删除。如果存在，则删除提供商失败。","Templates: {{reason}}":"模板：{{reason}}","The account that owns the certificate authority.":"拥有该证书颁发机构的账户。","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it.":"该证明策略控制了该提供商如何颁发身份。工作负载必须满足所有条件，例如其类型、详细信息以及运行位置，这些条件均由托管该工作负载的服务所担保。","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.":"该证明策略控制了该提供商如何颁发身份。工作负载必须满足所有条件，例如其类型、详细信息以及运行位置，这些条件均由托管该工作负载的服务所担保。该策略稍后可进行编辑。","The attestation policy controls which workloads get an identity from this provider. A workload must meet every condition, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. It's generated from the EKS clusters you entered. You can edit it later.":"证明策略控制哪些工作负载从该提供商获得身份。正如托管工作负载的服务所保证的那样，工作负载必须满足所有条件。它是根据您输入的 EKS 集群生成的。您可以稍后对其进行编辑。","The attestation policy lists the facts a workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so a workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.":"证明策略列出了工作负载在此提供商为其颁发身份之前必须证明的事实。计算平台为这些事实提供担保，因此工作负载无法声明不属于自己的身份。","The attester vouches for the workload, and it must match every condition to run as this identity.":"证明者负责验证工作负载的真实性，工作负载必须满足所有条件，才能以此身份运行。","The certificate authority is still being set up.":"证书颁发机构仍在设置中。","The ID at the end of the certificate authority's ARN in AWS Private CA.":"Amazon Private CA 中证书颁发机构 ARN 末尾的 ID。","The identity name is the provider's naming scheme, a path prefix, and a path pattern.":"身份名称由提供商的命名方案、路径前缀和路径模式组成。","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag key is 128.":"标签键中最多可以使用 128 个字符。","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag value is 256.":"标签值中最多可以使用 256 个字符。","The path can be up to {{maxLength}} characters.":"路径最多可包含 {{maxLength}} 个字符。","The path doesn't support these segments: {{segments}}. Remove them, and add what you need from the following cards.":"该路径不支持以下段：{{segments}}。移除它们，然后从以下卡片中添加您需要的段。","The path is already the default.":"该路径已经是默认路径。","The path is the per-workload part of each identity's name. Keep the Region in front so names stay unique across accounts and Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.":"路径是每个身份名称中针对工作负载的部分。将区域置于前面，使名称在各账户和区域间保持唯一性；也可以重新排列各区段，以符合团队的命名规范。","The path prefixes your policy allows":"您的策略允许的路径前缀","The permissions defined in this policy for <b>{{providerName}}</b> stop applying.":"此策略中为 <b>{{providerName}}</b> 定义的权限将停止应用。","The provider could not be deleted. Try again.":"无法删除提供商。请重试。","The provider is being created. Wait for the request to finish.":"正在创建提供商。请等待请求完成。","The provider might still be deleted. Check the providers list later.":"该提供商可能仍会被删除。稍后查看提供商列表。","The resource policy on this provider controls who can associate templates with it.":"此提供商上的资源策略控制着谁可以将模板与其关联。","The soonest the new certificate can take over. It publishes to the trust bundle first, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. Signing may start later than this, never sooner.":"新证书可以开始签名的最早时间。它会先发布到信任包，以便每个验证程序都能在其下签署任何内容之前进行检查。签名可能晚于该时间开始，绝不会早于该时间。","The soonest this certificate can start signing. It publishes to the trust bundle first, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. Signing may start later than this, never sooner.":"此证书可以开始签名的最早时间。它会先发布到信任包，以便每个验证程序都能在其下签署任何内容之前进行检查。签名可能晚于该时间开始，绝不会早于该时间。",Theme:"主题","There was an error loading the code editor.":"加载代码编辑器时出错。","These clusters set the template's <policyLink>attestation policy</policyLink>.":"这些集群设置了模板的<policyLink>证明策略</policyLink>。","These resources need to be deleted before deleting the provider.":"在删除提供商之前，需要删除这些资源。","This account ({{accountId}})":"该账户 ({{accountId}})","This action deletes the workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.":"此操作会删除工作负载身份提供商 <b>{{providerName}}</b>。","This cannot be undone, and creating a provider with the same name later does not restore anything. To proceed, complete the steps below.":"此操作无法撤销，之后创建同名提供者也不会恢复任何内容。要继续，请完成以下步骤。","This cannot be undone, and the path this template reserved stays reserved. No future template can generate identities under it.":"此操作无法撤销，此模板预留的路径将保持预留状态。未来的任何模板都无法在其下生成身份。","This cannot be undone, and this name stays reserved. It is never issued again, so you cannot recreate this identity under the same name.":"此操作无法撤销，此名称将保持预留状态。它永远不会再被颁发，因此您无法以相同名称重新创建此身份。","This certificate authority uses {{caAlgorithm}}. Rotation keeps the signer's {{signerAlgorithm}} algorithm, so choose a {{signerAlgorithm}} certificate authority instead.":"该证书颁发机构使用 {{caAlgorithm}}。轮换将保留签名者的 {{signerAlgorithm}} 算法，因此请改为选择 {{signerAlgorithm}} 证书颁发机构。","This certificate has left the trust bundle, so it publishes again first. Signing starts after about {{hours}} hour, once every region has it.":"此证书已从信任包中移除，因此会优先重新发布。签名将在约 {{hours}} 小时后开始，届时每个区域都已获得该证书。","This certificate has left the trust bundle, so it publishes again first. Signing starts after about {{hours}} hours, once every region has it.":"此证书已从信任包中移除，因此会优先重新发布。签名将在约 {{hours}} 小时后开始，届时每个区域都已获得该证书。","This certificate is validating, so deleting it stops verification immediately":"此证书正在验证，因此删除它会立即停止验证","This certificate stopped signing and its chain has left the trust bundle, so nothing verifies against it. It stays listed as history until you delete it, and deleting it is safe: no credential depends on it, and the certificate signer keeps signing.":"该证书已停止签名，其证书链已从信任包中移除，因此没有任何内容可针对该证书进行验证。在您将其删除之前，它将一直作为历史记录保留。删除操作是安全的：没有任何凭证依赖于它，且证书签名者将继续签名。","This cluster is already listed.":"此集群已列出。","This condition key and operator combination already exists":"此条件键和运算符组合已存在。","This doesn't look like a valid EKS cluster ARN. An invalid ARN will leave workloads in that cluster without an identity.":"这看起来不像有效的 EKS 集群 ARN。无效的 ARN 将使该集群中的工作负载没有身份。","This management account and delegated administrators":"此管理账户和委派管理员","This organization ({{organizationId}})":"该组织 ({{organizationId}})","This policy's cluster ARNs don't match the clusters you entered. Changing the clusters won't update this policy. Continue only if that's intended.":"此策略的集群 ARN 与您输入的集群不匹配。更改集群不会更新此策略。只有在这是您有意为之的情况下才继续。","This provider has no naming scheme, so the path you enter is the full identity name.":"该提供商没有命名方案，因此您输入的路径即为完整的身份名称。","This provider names every identity using the open standard.":"此提供商使用开放标准为每个身份命名。","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. Both certificates below stop, including the one still in transition, so the update does not complete. Both stay configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"此提供程序会立即停止颁发 X.509-SVID，需要客户端证书的工作负载将在下一次请求时开始失败。下方两个证书都会停止，包括仍处于过渡中的那个，因此更新不会完成。两者都保持已配置状态。已颁发的证书在约 12 小时内仍可验证，启用后会恢复签名。","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"该提供程序会立即停止颁发 X.509-SVID，需要客户端证书的工作负载将在下一次请求时开始失败。下面的证书保持配置状态。已颁发的证书会继续验证约 12 小时，启用后可恢复签名。","This provider's policy doesn't allow this path prefix \"{{pathPrefix}}\" for your account. Ask your organization administrator which path prefixes are permitted.":"该提供者的策略不允许为您的账户使用此路径前缀“{{pathPrefix}}”。请询问您的组织管理员哪些路径前缀是允许使用的。","This removes the certificate from the provider and pulls its chain from the trust bundle immediately. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"这会从提供者中移除证书，并立即将其链从信任捆绑包中拉取出来。证书颁发机构本身保留在 亚马逊云科技 私有 CA 中，保持不变。","This removes the certificate from the provider. Its chain already left the trust bundle, so nothing that is verifying today changes. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"这会从提供者中移除证书。其链已离开信任捆绑包，因此当前正在验证的任何内容都不会改变。证书颁发机构本身保留在 亚马逊云科技 私有 CA 中，保持不变。","This tag will be removed upon saving changes":"保存更改后，此标签将移除","This usually takes a few minutes. Keep this page open until it finishes.":"这通常需要几分钟。请保持此页面打开，直至完成。",Today:"今天","Too many requests":"请求太多","Trace and control access per workload":"按工作负载追踪并管控访问权限","Trust bundle":"信任包","trust domain":"信任域","Trust domain":"信任域","Trust domain is the root of trust for the SPIFFE naming scheme. It is a logical name that follows DNS naming style, for example prod.acme.com, but does not need to match a real DNS record.":"信任域是 SPIFFE 命名方案的信任根。它是一个遵循 DNS 命名风格的逻辑名称，例如 prod.acme.com，但无需与真实的 DNS 记录匹配。","Try again. If the problem continues, contact AWS Support.":"请重试。如果问题仍然存在，请联系 亚马逊云科技 Support。","Unable to load templates":"无法加载模板",Undo:"撤销","Up to 128 characters. Must be unique per provider.":"最多 128 个字符。在每个提供商中必须是唯一的。","Up to 128 characters. Use alphanumeric and '-_.' characters. Must be unique in your organization. Can't be changed after the provider is created.":"最多 128 个字符。使用字母数字和“-_.”字符。必须在您的组织中唯一。创建提供商后无法更改。","Up to 128 characters. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters. Must be unique per provider.":"最多 128 个字符。使用字母数字和 '-_' 字符。每个提供商必须唯一。",Update:"更新","Update certificate signer":"更新证书签名者",'Use "{{key}}"':"使用“{{key}}”",'Use "{{value}}"':"使用“{{value}}”","Use case":"使用案例","Use cases":"使用案例","Use default templates":"使用默认模板","Use letters, digits, and . - _ characters, with a single / between parts. No / at the start or end, and a part can't be . or ..":"使用字母、数字和 . - _ 字符，各部分之间使用一个 /。开头和结尾不能为 /，且各部分不能为 . 或 ..","Use one from another account":"使用另一个账户中的一个","Use only Latin letters, numbers, spaces, tabs, line breaks, and standard keyboard symbols.":"仅使用拉丁字母、数字、空格、制表符、换行符和标准键盘符号。","Use only letters, digits, - and _ characters.":"仅使用字母、数字、- 和 _ 字符。","Use only letters, digits, . - and _ characters. The path can't be . or ..":"仅使用字母、数字、. -和_字符。路径不能为.或..","Use only letters, digits, periods (.), hyphens (-), and underscores (_).":"仅使用字母、数字、句点（.）、连字符（-）和下划线（_）。","Use the workload identity in trust policies, resource policies, or SCPs. Each call is recorded in CloudTrail with the workload's identity.":"可在信任策略、资源策略或服务控制策略（SCP）中使用工作负载身份。所有调用都会在 CloudTrail 中记录对应的工作负载身份。",'Use: "{{text}}"':"使用：“{{text}}”","Used as the common name in the certificate authority's subject.":"用作证书颁发机构主题中的公用名。",Validating:j$t,"Validating: stopped signing, still trusted":"正在验证：已停止签名，仍然可信",Value:"值","Value must be 256 characters or less.":"值必须为 256 个字符或更少。",Values:"值","View all":"查看全部","View all notifications":"查看所有通知","View JSON":"查看 JSON",Visual:"可视化",Warning:"警告",Warnings:"警告","What gets created":"创建了什么","Which EKS clusters is this provider for?":"该提供商适用于哪些 EKS 集群？",'Wildcard "*" is only allowed with the StringLike, StringNotLike, ArnLike, or ArnNotLike operators.':"通配符“*”只能与 StringLike、StringNotLike、ArnLike 或 ArnNotLike 运算符配合使用。","Without a policy, no other account can create templates under this provider, though delegated administrators can already create both. Add a statement for each account, organizational unit, or IAM principal that should be able to, and limit each one to a path prefix.":"如果没有策略，其他账户无法在此提供者下创建模板，尽管委派管理员仍然可以创建两者。为每个应能够执行的账户、组织单位或 IAM 主体添加语句，并将每个限制为路径前缀。","Workload identities ({{total}})":"工作负载身份（{{total}}）","Workload identities in the IAM User Guide":"《IAM 用户指南》中的工作负载身份章节","Workload identities in the IAM User Guide (opens in a new tab)":"《IAM 用户指南》中的工作负载身份章节（在新标签页打开）","Workload identities: {{reason}}":"工作负载身份：{{reason}}","Workload identity":"工作负载身份","Workload Identity":"工作负载身份","Workload identity {{name}}: {{reason}}":"工作负载身份 {{name}}：{{reason}}","Workload identity {{workloadIdentifier}} deleted.":"工作负载身份 {{workloadIdentifier}} 已删除。","Workloads get named automatically":"工作负载会自动命名","Workloads in these EKS clusters can get an identity from this provider, when all of these are true:":"当所有这些都为真时，这些 EKS 集群中的工作负载可以从此提供商处获得一个身份：","Workloads running in these clusters can get an identity from this provider. Add 2 or more.":"在这些集群中运行的工作负载可以从该提供商处获得身份。添加 2 个或更多。","Workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"在此账户中运行的工作负载可以使用此模板基于 {{workloadLabel}} 验证的信息生成的身份。","Workloads running in this cluster can get an identity from this provider.":"在此集群中运行的工作负载可以从该提供商处获得身份。","Workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"在您的组织中运行的工作负载可以使用此模板基于 {{workloadLabel}} 验证的信息生成的身份。","Workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request":"使用这些身份的工作负载将不在获得凭证，并在下次请求时失败","Workloads, such as agents, pods, and jobs, are verified at runtime and get a workload identity, one per workload, generated by a template. The identity gets fine-grained access to AWS resources through IAM policies and CloudTrail, and signed JWT and X.509 credentials for meshes and SaaS apps.":"智能体、Pod、任务等工作负载在运行时完成校验后，将获得由模板生成的专属工作负载身份。该身份通过 IAM 策略和 CloudTrail 实现对 亚马逊云科技 资源的细粒度访问，并获得适用于服务网格与 SaaS 应用的签名 JWT 和 X.509 凭证。","Wrap lines":"换行","Write a policy to let another account create templates, or to stop a delegated administrator from part of the name space. Each statement names an organizational unit, specific accounts, or individual IAM principals, allows or denies, and can be limited to a path prefix.":"编写策略，以允许其他账户创建模板，或阻止委派管理员使用部分名称空间。每个语句指定一个组织单位、特定账户或单个 IAM 主体、允许或拒绝，并且可以限制为一个路径前缀。","Yes by default":"默认情况下为是","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tag.":"您最多还可以添加 {{availableTags}} 个标签。","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tags.":"您最多还可以添加 {{availableTags}} 个标签。","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"您已超过 {{tagLimit}} 个标签的限制。","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"您已超出 {{tagLimit}} 个标签的数量上限。","You have more keys than can be displayed":"您拥有的键超出可显示的数量","You have more values than can be displayed":"您拥有的值超出可显示的数量","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"您已达到 {{tagLimit}} 个标签的限制。","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"您已达到 {{tagLimit}} 个标签的数量上限。","You have unsaved tag changes. Leave this page and discard them?":"您对标签所做的更改尚未保存。是否要离开此页面并放弃更改？","You must enter a path":"您必须输入一个路径","You must specify a condition key":"必须指定条件键","You must specify a tag key":"您必须指定标签键","You must specify a unique tag key.":"必须指定唯一的标签键。","You must specify a value":"必须指定一个值","Your administrator decides which prefixes this account can use. This is checked when you create.":"您的管理员决定此账户可以使用哪些前缀。创建时将对此进行检查。","Your identities will be <code>{{prefix}}<em>{{placeholder}}</em></code>":"您的身份将为 {{prefix}}{{placeholder}}","Your organization already has a workload identity provider. Add templates under it to start issuing identities to your workloads — each named under your account's path prefix.":"您的组织已有一个工作负载身份提供商。在其下添加模板，即可开始为您的工作负载签发身份 – 每个身份均以您账户的路径前缀命名。","Your organization has workload identity providers you can use. Pick one and add templates under it to start issuing identities to your workloads.":"您的组织已有可用的工作负载身份提供商。选择一个，并在其下添加模板，即可开始为您的工作负载签发身份。","YYYY/MM/DD":"YYYY/MM/DD","{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.","A declared identity has a fixed name you define. Use one when you need an exact name, for example to match a name another system already expects.":"A declared identity has a fixed name you define. Use one when you need an exact name, for example to match a name another system already expects.","A fact {{workload}} checks when the agent or workload starts.":"A fact {{workload}} checks when the agent or workload starts.","A provider issues secure, verifiable identities to your agents and workloads, like your Kubernetes pods or AI agents, to access AWS and third-party services without long-lived credentials.":"A provider issues secure, verifiable identities to your agents and workloads, like your Kubernetes pods or AI agents, to access 亚马逊云科技 and third-party services without long-lived credentials.","A template automatically generates an identity for each matching agent or workload under {{providerName}}.":"A template automatically generates an identity for each matching agent or workload under {{providerName}}.","A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued.":"A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued.","A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued. Decide how this provider issues identities - starting from the <link>default templates</link> for common use cases, or skipping them. Templates are optional and can be added later.":"A template defines the path pattern used to name identities uniquely and the facts an agent or workload must prove before an identity is issued. Decide how this provider issues identities - starting from the <link>default templates</link> for common use cases, or skipping them. Templates are optional and can be added later.","A template names identities automatically as matching agents and workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.":"A template names identities automatically as matching agents and workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.","A template with no attestation policy matches no agent or workload, so nothing is ever issued from it. Set a policy to define which agents and workloads qualify.":"A template with no attestation policy matches no agent or workload, so nothing is ever issued from it. Set a policy to define which agents and workloads qualify.","A template's path pattern, built from facts like cluster, namespace, and service account, names each agent or workload automatically when it starts. You don't create identities ahead of time.":"A template's path pattern, built from facts like cluster, namespace, and service account, names each agent or workload automatically when it starts. You don't create identities ahead of time.","Add a fact or condition key. A path of only custom text would give every agent or workload the same name.":"Add a fact or condition key. A path of only custom text would give every agent or workload the same name.","Add an {{conditionKey}} condition, so only agents or workloads in these clusters get an identity.":"Add an {{conditionKey}} condition, so only agents or workloads in these clusters get an identity.","Add attestation policy":"Add attestation policy","Add templates after the provider is created.":"Add templates after the provider is created.","Agent and workload identity":"Agent and workload identity","Agent and workload identity - <em>Preview</em>":"Agent and workload identity - <em>Preview</em>","Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide":"Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide","Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide (opens in a new tab)":"Agent and workload identity in the IAM User Guide (opens in a new tab)","Agents and workloads get named automatically":"Agents and workloads get named automatically","Agents and workloads get short-lived credentials that renew automatically and follow the SPIFFE standard, so they work with service meshes such as Istio and with business applications.":"Agents and workloads get short-lived credentials that renew automatically and follow the SPIFFE standard, so they work with service meshes such as Istio and with business applications.","Agents and workloads in these EKS clusters can get an identity from this provider, when all of these are true:":"Agents and workloads in these EKS clusters can get an identity from this provider, when all of these are true:","Agents and workloads running in these clusters can get an identity from this provider. Add two or more.":"Agents and workloads running in these clusters can get an identity from this provider. Add two or more.","Agents and workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Agents and workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.","Agents and workloads running in this cluster can get an identity from this provider.":"Agents and workloads running in this cluster can get an identity from this provider.","Agents and workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Agents and workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.","Agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request":"Agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request","Agents and workloads, such as AI agents and pods, are verified at runtime and each gets its own identity, generated by a template. The identity gets fine-grained access to AWS resources through IAM policies and CloudTrail, and signed JWT and X.509 credentials for meshes and apps.":"Agents and workloads, such as AI agents and pods, are verified at runtime and each gets its own identity, generated by a template. The identity gets fine-grained access to 亚马逊云科技 resources through IAM policies and CloudTrail, and signed JWT and X.509 credentials for meshes and apps.","All templates and identities under this provider will be deleted":"All templates and identities under this provider will be deleted","An AI agent or workload gets an identity that is unique.":"An AI agent or workload gets an identity that is unique.","An identity with no attestation policy admits no workload, so nothing can run as it. Set a policy to define which workload qualifies.":"An identity with no attestation policy admits no workload, so nothing can run as it. Set a policy to define which workload qualifies.","An identity with this name already exists.":"An identity with this name already exists.","At runtime the platform attests these facts about the agent or workload. Any agent or workload whose attestation carries them gets an identity issued from this template.":"At runtime the platform attests these facts about the agent or workload. Any agent or workload whose attestation carries them gets an identity issued from this template.","Attestation policy for {{name}} has been removed.":"Attestation policy for {{name}} has been removed.","Attestation policy for {{name}} has been updated.":"Attestation policy for {{name}} has been updated.","By continuing, you also enable organization level resource creation, which is needed to create the organization scoped provider. You can disable it later in Settings.":"By continuing, you also enable organization level resource creation, which is needed to create the organization scoped provider. You can disable it later in Settings.","Change the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.":"Change the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.","Choose a stable, unique name that identifies one environment or group of agents and workloads, for example prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal.":"Choose a stable, unique name that identifies one environment or group of agents and workloads, for example prod.acme.com, staging.acme.com, payments.internal.","Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for an agent or workload.":"Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for an agent or workload.","Choose the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.":"Choose the facts an agent or workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.","Choose where the workload is hosted":"Choose where the workload is hosted","Choose who can use it":"Choose who can use it","Control what an agent or workload can reach with familiar IAM policies and see its AWS calls in CloudTrail.":"Control what an agent or workload can reach with familiar IAM policies and see its 亚马逊云科技 calls in CloudTrail.","Create declared identity":"Create declared identity","Creates an agent and workload identity provider and template for agents and workloads running in one or more EKS clusters under a service mesh, such as Istio.":"Creates an agent and workload identity provider and template for agents and workloads running in one or more EKS clusters under a service mesh, such as Istio.","Creating the identity":"Creating the identity","Declare an identity with the exact name you need":"Declare an identity with the exact name you need","Declared identities":"Declared identities","Declared identity":"Declared identity","Declared identity {{name}} created.":"Declared identity {{name}} created.","Define which agents and workloads are allowed to use this template.":"Define which agents and workloads are allowed to use this template.","Delete the templates under <b>{{providerName}}</b> before deleting the provider. Once deleted, agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials and fail on their next request, and access that you granted to these identities will stop working.":"Delete the templates under <b>{{providerName}}</b> before deleting the provider. Once deleted, agents and workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials and fail on their next request, and access that you granted to these identities will stop working.","Deleting templates and identities":"Deleting templates and identities","Each identity is fully the template path.":"Each identity is fully the template path.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This default trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in this account.","Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.":"Each provider needs a unique trust domain. This trust domain is already used by another provider in your organization.","Enter a description":"Enter a description","Failed to create the declared identity.":"Failed to create the declared identity.","Failed to save attestation policy.":"Failed to save attestation policy.","Filter declared identities":"Filter declared identities","For example, to match a name another system already expects.":"For example, to match a name another system already expects.","from provider":"from provider","Give AI agents and workloads their own identities. Know which of them made each call. Scope its access with the IAM policies you already use.":"Give AI agents and workloads their own identities. Know which of them made each call. Scope its access with the IAM policies you already use.","Give an agent or workload a unique identity, so you can grant it access and audit what it did rather than sharing one role.":"Give an agent or workload a unique identity, so you can grant it access and audit what it did rather than sharing one role.","Grant access":"Grant access","Grant this name access to resources in IAM policies.":"Grant this name access to resources in IAM policies.","IAM for agents and workloads":"IAM for agents and workloads","IAM for agents and workloads (opens in a new tab)":"IAM for agents and workloads (opens in a new tab)",Identifier:W$t,"Identities ({{total}})":"Identities ({{total}})","Identities are issued at runtime from facts the agent or workload proves, rather than from what an admin assigns.":"Identities are issued at runtime from facts the agent or workload proves, rather than from what an admin assigns.","Identities for agents":"Identities for agents","Identities: {{reason}}":"Identities: {{reason}}","Identity {{name}}: {{reason}}":"Identity {{name}}: {{reason}}","Invalid trust domain. Use lowercase alphanumeric and '-.' characters.":"Invalid trust domain. Use lowercase alphanumeric and '-.' characters.","Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's agents and workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. Standard pricing applies to the creation and use of AWS Private CA.":"Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's agents and workloads present as client certificates to systems outside 亚马逊云科技. It needs a <link>certificate authority</link> with a subordinate CA in every region you sign in. Standard pricing applies to the creation and use of Amazon Private CA.","It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so agents and workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. To avoid this, wait until it becomes inactive on its own. Deleting it then has no effect on verification.":"It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so agents and workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. To avoid this, wait until it becomes inactive on its own. Deleting it then has no effect on verification.","Let agents and workloads reach non-AWS resources":"Let agents and workloads reach non-亚马逊云科技 resources","Loading declared identities":"Loading declared identities","Matching agents and workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.":"Matching agents and workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.","No agent and workload identity providers":"No agent and workload identity providers","No agent or workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.":"No agent or workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.","No attestation policy attached.":"No attestation policy attached.","No attestation policy. No agent or workload will be issued an identity from this template until you add one.":"No attestation policy. No agent or workload will be issued an identity from this template until you add one.","No conditions. This policy matches every agent or workload of its service.":"No conditions. This policy matches every agent or workload of its service.","No segments yet. Add at least one, or every agent or workload this template matches resolves to the same name.":"No segments yet. Add at least one, or every agent or workload this template matches resolves to the same name.","None – names are defined by templates":"None – names are defined by templates","Nothing can run as this identity":"Nothing can run as this identity","Once the attestation policy is removed, matching agents and workloads will not be issued agent and workload identities until you add a policy again.":"Once the attestation policy is removed, matching agents and workloads will not be issued agent and workload identities until you add a policy again.","One bundle per provider, and one URL. It carries every authority the provider publishes: both outbound signers, and during an update both the current and incoming certificate authority, which is what lets verifiers accept either one through the handover. Your own AWS agents and workloads get these keys automatically; send this to systems outside AWS.":"One bundle per provider, and one URL. It carries every authority the provider publishes: both outbound signers, and during an update both the current and incoming certificate authority, which is what lets verifiers accept either one through the handover. Your own 亚马逊云科技 agents and workloads get these keys automatically; send this to systems outside 亚马逊云科技.","One provider and one trust domain shared by every EKS cluster in the mesh. An agent or workload with the same namespace and service account in any of these clusters shares one identity.":"One provider and one trust domain shared by every EKS cluster in the mesh. An agent or workload with the same namespace and service account in any of these clusters shares one identity.","Path is the unique part of each identity's name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts an agent or workload proves.":"Path is the unique part of each identity's name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts an agent or workload proves.","path prefix":"path prefix","Policy: Define how an agent or workload attests to get the identity":"Policy: Define how an agent or workload attests to get the identity","Proven at runtime":"Proven at runtime","Providers to issue agent and workload identities":"Providers to issue agent and workload identities","Scoped, auditable access":"Scoped, auditable access","Search by name":"Search by name","Set the exact name":"Set the exact name","Set the naming format and usage scope that every agent and workload identity from this provider inherits.":"Set the naming format and usage scope that every agent and workload identity from this provider inherits.","Set the unique path pattern that every identity generated by this template follows. Cannot be changed later.":"Set the unique path pattern that every identity generated by this template follows. Cannot be changed later.","Set up a provider to hold the templates that generate identity names and the signers that sign credentials for systems outside AWS.":"Set up a provider to hold the templates that generate identity names and the signers that sign credentials for systems outside 亚马逊云科技.","Set up a way to issue agent and workload identities":"Set up a way to issue agent and workload identities","Set which workloads can use this identity and where they must run.":"Set which workloads can use this identity and where they must run.","Stop matching agents and workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request":"Stop matching agents and workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request","Templates give matching agents and workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.":"Templates give matching agents and workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it.":"The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.":"The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.","The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Generated from the EKS clusters above. Can be edited later.":"The attestation policy controls how identities are issued by this provider. An agent or workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Generated from the EKS clusters above. Can be edited later.","The attestation policy controls how this identity is issued. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.":"The attestation policy controls how this identity is issued. A workload must meet every condition, such as its type, details, and where it runs, as vouched for by the service that hosts it. Can be edited later.","The attestation policy is the set of facts an agent or workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so an agent or workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.":"The attestation policy is the set of facts an agent or workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so an agent or workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.","The certificate chain is distributing to every Region, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. It starts signing at {{at}}. That is the minimum signing delay you set, so signing may start later than this. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.":"The certificate chain is distributing to every Region, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. It starts signing at {{at}}. That is the minimum signing delay you set, so signing may start later than this. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.","The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Account ID and Region in front so names stay unique across accounts and Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.":"The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Account ID and Region in front so names stay unique across accounts and Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.","The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Region in front so names stay unique across Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.":"The path is the unique part of each identity's name. Keep the Region in front so names stay unique across Regions, or rearrange the segments to match your team's naming convention.","This action deletes the agent and workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.":"This action deletes the agent and workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.","This certificate has stopped signing, but its chain stays in the trust bundle so certificates already issued under it keep verifying. It becomes inactive at {{at}}. Until then, Enable resumes signing with no wait. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.":"This certificate has stopped signing, but its chain stays in the trust bundle so certificates already issued under it keep verifying. It becomes inactive at {{at}}. Until then, Enable resumes signing with no wait. You can choose Refresh to check whether the status has changed.","This doesn't look like a valid EKS cluster ARN. An invalid ARN will leave agents or workloads in that cluster without an identity.":"This doesn't look like a valid EKS cluster ARN. An invalid ARN will leave agents or workloads in that cluster without an identity.","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. Both certificates below stop, including the one still in transition, so the update does not complete. Both stay configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. Both certificates below stop, including the one still in transition, so the update does not complete. Both stay configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and agents and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.","This template issues no identities":"This template issues no identities","Trust domain must be 64 characters or less.":"Trust domain must be 64 characters or less.","Use the agent or workload identity in trust policies, resource policies, or SCPs. CloudTrail records its calls with that identity.":"Use the agent or workload identity in trust policies, resource policies, or SCPs. CloudTrail records its calls with that identity.","What conditions should the agent or workload match?":"What conditions should the agent or workload match?","Where is the agent or workload hosted?":"Where is the agent or workload hosted?","You must enter a name":"You must enter a name","Your organization already has an agent and workload identity provider. Add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads — each named under your account's path prefix.":"Your organization already has an agent and workload identity provider. Add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads — each named under your account's path prefix.","Your organization has agent and workload identity providers you can use. Pick one and add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads.":"Your organization has agent and workload identity providers you can use. Pick one and add templates under it to start issuing identities to your agents and workloads."},U$t=Object.freeze(Object.defineProperty({__proto__:null,ARN:"ARN",Actions:"操作",Active:"活动",Add:"添加",Apply:"应用",Attestation:"证明",Cancel:"取消",Clear:"清除",Close:"关闭",Configured:"已配置",Confirm:"确认",Contains:"包含",Created:z$t,Dele